	["Additional Runecloth takes 20 Runecloth per turn-in and repeats as often as you like. Bring Runecloth in multiples of 20 and hand them all in at once, one turn-in after another. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "更多的符文布接收20符文布每交任务与可重复可无限次重复。携带符文布按20个一组与上交它们全部在一次性，一次接一次连续交任务。符文布：黑暗教徒与暗影法师（58-60级）在东瘟疫之地，或拍卖行。",
