	["Agent of Hydraxis needs Honored. At Honored, Duke Hydraxis hands out Aqual Quintessence, used to douse the runes in the Molten Core that summon Majordomo Executus; at Revered, the reusable Eternal Quintessence."] = "海达克西斯的使者需要尊敬。在尊敬，海达克西斯公爵发放水之精萃，用于前往熄灭前往在熔火之心该召唤管理者埃克索图斯；在崇敬，可重复使用的永恒精萃。",
