	["Alchemy runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 68s in all."] = "炼金术可随升级同步练习升级。无限服传承系统奖励制作专业在技能等级150，225与300（中级，高级与大师级上限），因此以上每个阶段节点均计入进度。1-75阶段所需材料总计约需花费68银。",
