	["Alliance town: Horde characters only need to touch its edge (guards)"] = "联盟城镇：部落角色只需靠近其边缘触发即可（注意卫兵）",
	["Alliance town: Horde characters only need to touch its edge (guards); any one of these names counts"] = "联盟城镇：部落角色只需靠近其边缘触发即可（注意卫兵）；触发其中任意一个名称即可",
	["Alodan the Hopeful teaches Paladins in Thunder Bluff. You have no flight path there yet: fly to Camp Taurajo, ride west through Mulgore and up a lift, and take the flight path from Tal on the central rise."] = "怀抱希望的阿洛丹传授圣骑士在雷霆崖。你有无飞行点那里尚：飞往前往陶拉祖营地，骑行西穿过莫高雷与上一个升降梯，与接取飞行点来自塔尔在中央高地。",
	["Alonso"] = "阿隆索",
	["Alonso, a Forever addition, stands on the west shore of Mystral Lake with three quick Dragonslayer quests."] = "阿隆索，一个无限服新增内容，位于密斯特拉湖的西岸与3快速屠龙者任务。",
	["Alpha Strike: one hour from now"] = "突然袭击：一小时后",
	["Alterac Signet Ring"] = "奥特兰克徽记之戒",
	["Alterac Valley"] = "奥特兰克山谷",
	["Alterac Valley (level 51+) raises Frostwolf Clan: win, capture towers and graveyards, and hand in the battleground's turn-ins. Jekyll Flandring waits at the Horde end of Alterac Mountains outside the battleground; Grunnda Wolfheart inside Alterac Valley sells the same mount."] = "奥特兰克山谷（51级+）提升霜狼氏族：获胜，占领哨塔与墓地，与上交战场的交任务。耶克里·弗兰迪等候于部落尽头的奥特兰克山脉在战场外；格伦达·狼心在奥特兰克山谷内出售相同坐骑。",
	["Alterac Valley (level 51+) raises Stormpike Guard: win, capture towers and graveyards, and hand in the battleground's turn-ins. Thanthaldis Snowgleam waits outside the battleground on the Alterac Mountains border above Hillsbrad; Gaelden Hammersmith inside Alterac Valley sells the same mount."] = "奥特兰克山谷（51级+）提升雷矛卫队：获胜，占领哨塔与墓地，与上交战场的交任务。塔萨迪斯·雪光等候在战场在外奥特兰克山脉边界在希尔斯布莱德上方；盖尔丁在奥特兰克山谷内出售相同坐骑。",
	["Alternate Deadwood feathers (Nafien) and Winterfall beads (Salfa), whichever camp is less crowded."] = "交替刷死木羽毛（纳菲恩）与寒冬串珠（萨尔法），任选其一：营地是更少拥挤的。",
	["Alvarion Windfield"] = "阿尔瓦里奥·风野",
	["Amaryllis Webb gives you an Entomology Starter Kit: use its items to catch an Arbor Tarantula, a Hay Weevil Specimen and a Flesh Picker. This quest is named as the weevil's source but gives only money as its reward; the pet may come from the Hay Weevil you catch. If you lose the kit, she sells another."] = "阿玛莉莉丝·韦伯给你一个昆虫学入门工具包：使用它的物品前往捕获一个树栖捕鸟蛛，一个干草象鼻虫样本与一个啄肉鸟。此任务是名为作为象鼻虫的来源但给予仅金钱作为它的奖励；宠物可能来自干草象鼻虫你捕获。如果你丢失工具包，她出售另一个。",
	["Ambermill"] = "安伯米尔",
	["Ambermill comes later, on the southern loop"] = "安伯米尔来自稍后，在南部环线",
	["Amberstill Ranch is east of Kharanos on the road to Loch Modan; Ultham Ironhorn stands beside Veron Amberstill's rams. At 40 Ultham Ironhorn teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Alliance race ride these."] = "冻石农场是在卡拉诺斯以东在路上前往洛克莫丹；奥萨姆·铁角位于维隆·冻石的旁边山羊。在40奥萨姆·铁角传授骑术（100金每暴雪的设计师），与学习它给你一个坐骑。无限服客户端允许每个联盟种族骑行这些。",
	["Amberstill Ranch is east of Kharanos on the road to Loch Modan; Ultham Ironhorn stands beside Veron Amberstill's rams. At 60 Ultham Ironhorn teaches Journeyman Riding (1,000g per Blizzard's designers); Blizzard says learning riding grants a mount. The Forever client sells each swift ram for 200g at level 60."] = "冻石农场是在卡拉诺斯以东在路上前往洛克莫丹；奥萨姆·铁角位于维隆·冻石的旁边山羊。在60奥萨姆·铁角传授中级骑术（1,000金每暴雪的设计师）；暴雪说学习骑行奖励一匹坐骑。无限服客户端出售每个迅捷山羊给200金在60级。",
	["An Old History Book: a rare drop from Duskwood's mobs"] = "一本破旧的历史书：由暮色森林的怪物稀有掉落",
	["Anaya's Pendant"] = "安娜雅的坠饰",
	["Ancient Moonstone Seal: Deth'ryll Satyrs"] = "远古月亮石封印：戴瑟雷萨特",
	["Ancient Statuette, in the ruins on the shore"] = "古代雕像，在废墟中在岸边",
