	["Angelas Moonbreeze"] = "安吉拉斯·月风",
	["Angelas Moonbreeze: keep it for Tanaris"] = "安吉拉斯·月风：留到塔纳利斯再做",
	["Angerclaw bears and Felpaw wolves"] = "怒爪熊与魔爪狼",
	["Angus Stern"] = "安古斯·斯特恩",
	["Angus Stern cooks in the Blue Recluse; Brohann Caskbelly is in the Dwarven District."] = "安古斯·斯特恩烹饪在蓝隐士旅店；布罗哈恩·铁桶是在矮人区。",
	["Angus Stern, Stormwind Harbor road"] = "安古斯·斯特恩，暴风城港口道路",
	["Annals of Darrowshire"] = "达隆郡的历史",
	["Annora teaches Artisan Enchanting inside the Uldaman dungeon (Badlands); bring a group"] = "安诺拉传授大师级附魔内部奥达曼地下城（荒芜之地）；请组队前往",
	["Antur stands at the west end of the camp."] = "安图尔·荒野位于营地的西端。",
	["Any Cooking trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice Cooking (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest."] = "任意烹饪训练师的你的阵营传授初级烹饪（角色等级5）；箭头会自动指向最近的一位。",
	["Any First Aid trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice First Aid (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest."] = "任意急救训练师的你的阵营传授初级急救（角色等级5）；箭头会自动指向最近的一位。",
	["Any Fishing trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice Fishing (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a Fishing Pole from a trade goods or fishing vendor and equip it."] = "任意钓鱼训练师的你的阵营传授初级钓鱼（角色等级5）；箭头会自动指向最近的一位。购买一个鱼竿来自一个商业技能或钓鱼供应商与装备它。",
	["Any Herbalism trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice Herbalism (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest."] = "任意草药学训练师的你的阵营传授初级草药学（角色等级5）；箭头会自动指向最近的一位。",
	["Any Mining trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice Mining (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a Mining Pick from a trade goods or general vendor: keep it in your bags, you cannot mine without it."] = "任意采矿训练师的你的阵营传授初级采矿（角色等级5）；箭头会自动指向最近的一位。购买一个矿工锄来自一个商业技能或杂货商：请留在背包中，没有它无法采矿。",
	["Any Skinning trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice Skinning (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a Skinning Knife from a trade goods or general vendor: keep it in your bags, you cannot skin without it."] = "任意剥皮训练师的你的阵营传授初级剥皮（角色等级5）；箭头会自动指向最近的一位。购买一个剥皮小刀来自一个商业技能或杂货商：请留在背包中，没有它无法剥皮。",
	["Any Winterfall furbolg can carry the beads; the camps just south of Salfa are the closest."] = "任意寒冬熊怪可以携带串珠；扎营就在萨尔法以南是最近的。",
