	["Arnok, Orgrimmar"] = "阿诺克，奥格瑞玛",
	["Artisan Cooking"] = "大师级烹饪",
	["Artisan Cooking comes from Dirge Quikcleave in Gadgetzan (Tanaris). The cooking trainer in Ironforge sends you; it needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "大师级烹饪来自迪尔格·奎克里弗在加基森（塔纳利斯）。烹饪训练师在铁炉堡派往你；它需要技能等级225与35级。",
	["Artisan Cooking comes from Dirge Quikcleave in Gadgetzan (Tanaris). The cooking trainer in Orgrimmar sends you; it needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "大师级烹饪来自迪尔格·奎克里弗在加基森（塔纳利斯）。烹饪训练师在奥格瑞玛派往你；它需要技能等级225与35级。",
	["Artisan First Aid"] = "大师级急救",
	["Artisan First Aid comes from the Triage quest. It needs skill 225 and level 40; the First Aid trainer in Ironforge sends you to the doctor in Theramore."] = "大师级急救来自救死扶伤任务。它需要技能等级225与40级；急救训练师在铁炉堡派你前往医生在塞拉摩。",
	["Artisan First Aid comes from the Triage quest. It needs skill 225 and level 40; the First Aid trainer in Orgrimmar sends you to the doctor in Hammerfall."] = "大师级急救来自救死扶伤任务。它需要技能等级225与40级；急救训练师在奥格瑞玛派你前往医生在落锤镇。",
	["Artisan Fishing"] = "大师级钓鱼",
	["Artisan Fishing (cap 300) comes from Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh. The fishing trainer in Ironforge sends you to him; the quest needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "大师级钓鱼（上限300）来自纳特·帕格在尘泥沼泽。钓鱼训练师在铁炉堡派你前往他；任务需要技能等级225与35级。",
	["Artisan Fishing (cap 300) comes from Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh. The fishing trainer in Orgrimmar sends you to him; the quest needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "大师级钓鱼（上限300）来自纳特·帕格在尘泥沼泽。钓鱼训练师在奥格瑞玛派你前往他；任务需要技能等级225与35级。",
	["Artisan Herbalism raises the cap to 300; it needs skill 200 and character level 35. The arrow picks the nearest Herbalism trainer of your faction."] = "大师级草药学将技能上限提升至300；它需要技能等级200与角色等级35。箭头会自动指向最近的一位草药学训练师的你的阵营。",
	["Artisan Mining raises the cap to 300; it needs skill 200 and character level 35. The arrow picks the nearest Mining trainer of your faction."] = "大师级采矿将技能上限提升至300；它需要技能等级200与角色等级35。箭头会自动指向最近的一位采矿训练师的你的阵营。",
	["Artisan Skinning raises the cap to 300; it needs skill 200 and character level 35. The arrow picks the nearest Skinning trainer of your faction."] = "大师级剥皮将技能上限提升至300；它需要技能等级200与角色等级35。箭头会自动指向最近的一位剥皮训练师的你的阵营。",
	["Artisan needs character level 35 and Alchemy 200; it raises the cap to 300. Materials for 225-300 are worth about 9g 73s in all."] = "大师级需要角色等级35与炼金术200；它将技能上限提升至300。225-300阶段所需材料总计约需花费9金73银。",
	["Artisan needs character level 35 and Blacksmithing 200; it raises the cap to 300. Materials for 225-300 are worth about 563g in all."] = "大师级需要角色等级35与锻造200；它将技能上限提升至300。225-300阶段所需材料总计约需花费563金。",
	["Artisan needs character level 35 and Enchanting 200; it raises the cap to 300. Materials for 225-300 are worth about 283g in all."] = "大师级需要角色等级35与附魔200；它将技能上限提升至300。225-300阶段所需材料总计约需花费283金。",
	["Artisan needs character level 35 and Engineering 200; it raises the cap to 300. Materials for 225-300 are worth about 67g in all."] = "大师级需要角色等级35与工程学200；它将技能上限提升至300。225-300阶段所需材料总计约需花费67金。",
	["Artisan needs character level 35 and Leatherworking 200; it raises the cap to 300. Materials for 225-300 are worth about 182g in all."] = "大师级需要角色等级35与制皮200；它将技能上限提升至300。225-300阶段所需材料总计约需花费182金。",
	["Artisan needs character level 35 and Tailoring 200; it raises the cap to 300. Materials for 225-300 are worth about 240g in all."] = "大师级需要角色等级35与裁缝200；它将技能上限提升至300。225-300阶段所需材料总计约需花费240金。",
	["Arvensus Shadowsong"] = "阿文苏斯影歌",
	["Ask Deathguard Dillinger for his report"] = "要求亡灵卫兵迪林格尔给他的报告",
	["Ask Deathguard Kristof for his report"] = "要求死亡卫兵克里斯托夫给他的报告",
	["Ask Gordo for his report"] = "要求葛尔多给他的报告",
	["Assist Walton: stay by him when Terry Longdrink and the Kul Tiras marines come up the ridge"] = "协助沃尔顿：留在旁他当特里杜加尔·朗德瑞克与库尔提拉斯水兵来到上山脊",
	["Asterion"] = "阿斯特利安",
	["At 40 Brandur Ironhammer in the Mystic Ward sends you to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind's Cathedral of Light. Take the tram from Ironforge to Stormwind."] = "在40布兰度尔·铁锤在秘法区派你前往达索瑞恩·拉尔在暴风城的圣光大教堂。搭乘地铁来自铁炉堡前往暴风城。",
	["At 40 Briarthorn in Ironforge sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet."] = "在40石南草在铁炉堡派你前往斯坦哈德·法尔杉在棘齿城。",
	["At 40 Demisette Cloyce in the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet."] = "在40德米赛特·克劳斯在已宰的羔羊旅店，在法师区，派你前往斯坦哈德·法尔杉在棘齿城。",
	["At 40 Kaal Soulreaper in the Magic Quarter sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. The zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades flies to Durotar."] = "在40卡尔·噬灵在魔法区派你前往斯坦哈德·法尔杉在棘齿城。飞艇来自提瑞斯法林地飞往前往杜隆塔尔。",
	["At 40 Zevrost in the Cleft of Shadow sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet."] = "在40泽弗洛斯特在暗影裂口派你前往斯坦哈德·法尔杉在棘齿城。",
	["At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Binjy Featherwhistle teaches Gnomes at Steelgrill's Depot, just east of Kharanos, beside Milli Featherwhistle's mechanostriders. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (unconfirmed). Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists every colour."] = "在40与100金币你可以学习前往骑行，与学习它给你一个坐骑。宾吉·羽哨传授侏儒在钢架补给站，就在卡拉诺斯以东，在米利·羽哨的旁边机械陆行鸟。无限服可能允许任意种族学习来自任意骑术训练师（待确认）。藏品收集，坐骑 · 40级列出每个颜色。",
	["At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Jartsam teaches Night Elves in Darnassus, beside Lelanai's sabers: the boat from Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine, then the flight to Rut'theran Village. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (unconfirmed), such as Randal Hunter at Eastvale Logging Camp in Elwynn Forest. Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists every colour."] = "在40与100金币你可以学习前往骑行，与学习它给你一个坐骑。贾萨姆传授暗夜精灵在达纳苏斯，在莱拉奈的旁边刃豹：船来自暴风城港口前往奥伯丁，然后飞行前往鲁瑟兰村。无限服可能允许任意种族学习来自任意骑术训练师（待确认），此类作为兰达尔·亨特在东谷伐木场在艾尔文森林。藏品收集，坐骑 · 40级列出每个颜色。",
	["At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. No Skyborne riding trainer is known; the Forever client files Galestrider Riding under the one Riding skill, so Randal Hunter at Eastvale Logging Camp in eastern Elwynn Forest, the nearest trainer to Stormwind, should teach it (unconfirmed). The Galestriders are sold by Genn Fairweather in Valanaar on Zephras Isle; Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists them."] = "在40与100金币你可以学习前往骑行，与学习它给你一个坐骑。无天裔骑术训练师是已知；无限服客户端归类为疾风陆行鸟骑术在下方1骑术技能，因此兰达尔·亨特在东谷伐木场在东部艾尔文森林，最近的训练师前往暴风城，应当传授它（待确认）。疾风陆行鸟是出售在旁吉恩·费尔韦瑟在瓦拉纳尔在泽弗拉斯岛；藏品收集，坐骑 · 40级列出它们。",
	["At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Randal Hunter teaches Humans at Eastvale Logging Camp in eastern Elwynn Forest, beside Katie Hunter's horses. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (unconfirmed). Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists every colour."] = "在40与100金币你可以学习前往骑行，与学习它给你一个坐骑。兰达尔·亨特传授人类在东谷伐木场在东部艾尔文森林，在凯蒂·亨特的旁边马。无限服可能允许任意种族学习来自任意骑术训练师（待确认）。藏品收集，坐骑 · 40级列出每个颜色。",
	["At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Ultham Ironhorn teaches Dwarves at Amberstill Ranch, east of Kharanos on the road to Loch Modan, beside Veron Amberstill's rams. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (unconfirmed). Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists every colour."] = "在40与100金币你可以学习前往骑行，与学习它给你一个坐骑。奥萨姆·铁角传授矮人在冻石农场，在卡拉诺斯以东在路上前往洛克莫丹，在维隆·冻石的旁边山羊。无限服可能允许任意种族学习来自任意骑术训练师（待确认）。藏品收集，坐骑 · 40级列出每个颜色。",
	["At 60 Brandur Ironhammer in the Mystic Ward sends you to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral of Light."] = "在60布兰度尔·铁锤在秘法区派你前往格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵在暴风城的圣光大教堂。",
	["At 60 Jubahl Corpseseeker in Ironforge sends you to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes."] = "在60寻尸者祖贝尔在铁炉堡派你前往莫苏尔·召血者在燃烧平原。",
	["At 60 Kurgul in the Cleft of Shadow sends you to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes."] = "在60库古尔在暗影裂口派你前往莫苏尔·召血者在燃烧平原。",
	["At 60 Martha Strain in the Magic Quarter sends you to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes."] = "在60马尔萨·斯坦恩在魔法区派你前往莫苏尔·召血者在燃烧平原。",
	["At 60 Spackle Thornberry in the Slaughtered Lamb sends you to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes."] = "在60斯巴克尔在已宰的羔羊旅店派你前往莫苏尔·召血者在燃烧平原。",
	["At the Shrine of Remulos"] = "在雷姆洛斯神殿",
	["At the south end of Silverpine the road turns east into Hillsbrad Foothills by Southpoint Tower. Tarren Mill in the north-east is the Horde town; Southshore is Alliance."] = "在银松森林的南端道路交还东进入希尔斯布莱德丘陵在旁南点哨塔。塔伦米尔在东北面是部落城镇；南海镇是联盟。",
	["Atal'ai Exile"] = "阿塔莱流放者",
	["Athridas Bearmantle"] = "阿斯瑞达斯·熊皮",
	["Auntie Marlene, in the Western Plaguelands: keep it"] = "玛莱恩姑妈，在西瘟疫之地：请保留该任务/物品",
	["Avala's Core is by the frozen lake, among the ice elementals."] = "阿瓦拉的核心是在旁冰冻的湖，在其中：冰元素。",
	["Avatar of Saeyleenan"] = "赛琳南的化身",
	["Ayessa Dawnsinger"] = "阿耶莎·晨歌",
	["Azore Aldamort"] = "阿佐尔·奥达蒙特",
	["Azore Aldamort waits in the ruined tower of Ethel Rethor, inland to the south-east."] = "阿佐尔·奥达蒙特等候于毁坏的哨塔的艾瑟雷索，内陆向东南。",
	["Azore's tower stands on the hill east of the wreck."] = "亚佐尔的哨塔位于山丘在残骸以东。",
	["Azore's tower stands on the hill west of Thunder Axe Fortress: take his quest first, the sceptre he wants is in the fortress."] = "亚佐尔的哨塔位于山丘在雷斧堡垒以西：接取他的任务第一，节杖他需要是在要塞。",
	["Back at Camp Mojache."] = "返回在莫沙彻营地。",
	["Back at Falaath Village: Stormcallers and Living Lightning fill the village, the Supply Caches stand among the houses and Commander Cyclas waits at its south-east end."] = "返回在法拉斯村：唤风者与活体闪电装满村庄，补给箱位于其中：房屋与指挥官赛克拉斯等候于它的东南尽头。",
	["Back at Felpaw Village, the Deadwood furbolgs (53-54) are close to the tunnel and every kill raises your Timbermaw reputation."] = "返回在魔爪村，死木熊怪（53-54）是靠近前往隧道与每个击杀提升你的木喉声望。",
	["Back at Grelin's camp"] = "返回在格雷林的营地",
	["Back at Kolkar Village, every Kolkar can drop an ear."] = "返回在科尔卡村，每个科卡尔可以掉落一个耳朵。",
	["Back down the beach, past the pirate camp: the crate of boots and the fragile crate with the lens sit at its south end."] = "返回下海滩，经过海盗营地：木箱的靴子与易碎的木箱与透镜坐在它的南尽头。",
	["Back east past Stonard: the Atal'ai artifacts lie in the water and on the banks of the Pool of Tears."] = "返回东经过斯通纳德：阿塔莱流放者神器位于水与在河岸的泪水之池。",
	["Back east to Brambleblade Ravine: the Bristleback Shamans stand among the quilboar there."] = "返回东前往刺刃峡谷：刺背萨满祭司位于其中：野猪人那里。",
	["Back east to the naga on the coast: Naga Spinefins drop from them."] = "返回东前往纳迦在海岸边：纳迦脊鳍掉落来自它们。",
	["Back east to the shore north of Heglan. Spitelash Scouts and Attendants hold the beach below Drygulch Ravine. Hunters: tame a Surf Crawler on the beach."] = "返回东前往岸边在赫格兰·影眼以北。怨鞭斥候与侍从要塞海滩在枯水谷下方。猎人：驯服一个海浪蟹在海滩上。",
	["Back in Falaath Village: Stormcallers and Living Lightning fill the village, the Stormcallers carry the stolen supplies, and Commander Cyclas stands at its south end."] = "返回在法拉斯村：唤风者与活体闪电装满村庄，唤风者携带被盗的补给品，与指挥官赛克拉斯位于它的南尽头。",
	["Back in Theramore: Tervosh waits with Lady Jaina in the tower of Foothold Citadel."] = "返回在塞拉摩：大法师特沃什等候与雷蒂吉安娜·普罗德摩尔在哨塔内的塞拉摩堡垒。",
	["Back into Shadow Hold: Moora and Salia guard Shadow Lord Fel'dan in its deepest chamber."] = "返回进入暗影堡：米莱恩与萨莉亚守卫暗影领主费尔丹在它的最深处密室。",
	["Back into the Timbermaw tunnel and take the Winterspring exit; Donova camps by the hot springs just outside."] = "返回进入木喉隧道与接取冬泉谷出口；多诺瓦扎营在旁热温泉就在外部。",
	["Back north to Jaedenar. Fill Greta's canteen at the corrupted moonwell in the middle of the southern camp."] = "返回北前往加德纳尔。装满格雷塔·苔蹄的水壶在腐化的月亮井在南部营地的中央。",
	["Back north to the Writhing Haunt: the cauldron offers its own task now. The ghouls nearby drop Somatic Intensifiers."] = "返回北前往蠕行之祸：大锅提供它的自己的任务现在。食尸鬼附近掉落细胞增强剂。",
	["Back north to the camp."] = "返回北前往营地。",
	["Back north-east into the mountains to the crystal."] = "返回东北进入山脉前往水晶。",
	["Back north-east to Flame Crest."] = "返回东北前往烈焰峰。",
	["Back north-east to Kim'jael."] = "返回东北前往基姆加尔。",
	["Back south past Nesingwary: Panthers and Stranglethorn Raptors run in the clearings west of the camp toward the coast; the elder tigers hold the hills south-west."] = "返回南方经过赫米特·奈辛瓦里二世：豹与荆棘谷迅猛龙前往在空地在营地朝向海岸以西；长者/老年虎要塞丘陵西南。",
	["Back south to Razor Hill."] = "返回南方前往剃刀岭。",
	["Back south to the Sanctuary, a short ride."] = "返回南方前往圣地，一个不足骑行。",
	["Back south-east to the Winterhoof Water Well."] = "返回南方-东前往冰蹄水井。",
	["Back south-west to Mystral Lake. Befouled Water Elementals drift around its shores; the gazebo stands on the island, overlooking the Alliance outpost."] = "返回南方-西前往密斯特拉湖。污浊的水元素漂浮周围它的海岸；凉亭位于岛屿，俯瞰联盟前哨站。",
	["Back through the tunnel and take the Winterspring exit, then ride south to Frostfire Hot Springs."] = "返回穿过隧道与接取冬泉谷出口，然后骑行南前往霜火温泉。",
	["Back through the tunnel to Bruegs' cave above the farm."] = "返回穿过隧道前往布鲁格斯·火生的洞穴在农场上方。",
	["Back to Brill."] = "返回前往布瑞尔。",
	["Back to Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven, then fly to Rut'theran Village (by way of Auberdine)."] = "回到丹德里特德迪利特·星焰在永夜港，然后飞往前往鲁瑟兰村（在旁路的奥伯丁）。",
	["Back to Gakin. Use the Bloodstone Choker at the summoning circle in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar and defeat the voidwalker it calls."] = "返回前往黑暗缚灵者加科因。使用血石颈环在召唤法阵在已宰的羔羊旅店的地窖与击败虚空行者它召唤。",
	["Back to Gakin. Use the Bloodstone Choker at the summoning circle in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar and defeat the voidwalker it calls. Westfall is next, west of Goldshire."] = "返回前往黑暗缚灵者加科因。使用血石颈环在召唤法阵在已宰的羔羊旅店的地窖与击败虚空行者它召唤。西部荒野是下一个，在闪金镇以西。",
	["Back to Gan'rul in the Cleft of Shadow. Use the Glyphs of Summoning on the summoning circle there and defeat the voidwalker to bind it."] = "返回前往甘鲁尔·血眼在暗影裂口。使用召唤铭文在召唤法阵那里与击败虚空行者前往绑定它。",
	["Back to Grom'gol."] = "返回前往格罗姆高。",
	["Back to Loh'atu at the shrine; stay west of the Talrendis Point guards."] = "返回前往罗哈图在神龛；留在西的塔伦迪斯营地卫兵。",
	["Back to Olariaan, then west into the Shen'dar Highlands: Kuramaa's home is in the hills south of the Windsong Crawlers' lakes."] = "返回前往奥拉里安·疾燃，然后西进入申达尔高地：库拉玛的炉石是在丘陵南的风歌爬行者的湖泊。",
	["Back to Olariaan. Wait for him to light the Brazier of Offering, then carry the flame straight to the Brazier of Eternal Flame beside Sessaria in Valanaar before the timer runs out."] = "返回前往奥拉里安·疾燃。等待给他前往圣光祭品火盆，然后携带烈焰直走前往永恒火盆加拉克烈焰守卫在塞萨莉亚·天行旁边在瓦拉纳尔之前计时器通往出。",
	["Back to Razor Hill."] = "返回前往剃刀岭。",
	["Back to Seer Ravenfeather in the camp. The Minor Manifestation of Earth waits on the mesa east of the camp: drink the Earth Sapta there to see it, then take the Rough Quartz back to the Seer."] = "返回前往鸦羽先知在营地里。大地之魂等候于台地在营地以东：饮用大地萨普塔那里前往查看它，然后接取粗石英返回前往先知。",
	["Back to Shen'dar Village with what you found."] = "回到申达尔村庄与所你找到。",
	["Back to Southwind and climb the tower. Stirring the hive at the top brings out Hive'Ashi Ambushers; one carries the Encrusted Silithid Object."] = "返回前往南风村与爬上哨塔。搅动虫巢在顶部携带出亚什伏击者；1携带异种蝎粘液包裹的物体。",
	["Back to Teo Hammerstorm in Anvilmar. He gives you the Earth Sapta: take the rubble-marked path that climbs west from the south of the valley to the Spirit Stone on the ridge, drink the Sapta beside it and speak to the Minor Manifestation of Earth, then bring its Rough Quartz back to Teo."] = "返回前往提奥·锤暴在安威玛尔。他给你大地萨普塔：接取碎石-标记的小径该爬上西来自在山谷前往以南灵魂石在山脊，饮用萨普塔旁边它与对话前往大地之魂，然后携带它的粗石英返回前往提奥。",
	["Back to Urs'endris by the falls north-east of Valanaar, on the way north to the shrine."] = "返回前往乌尔森德里斯在旁坠落在瓦拉纳尔以东北，在途中北前往神龛。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Big Black Mace is taught from Blacksmithing 255."] = "返回前往一个锻造训练师：巨型黑色锤是传授来自锻造255。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Dense Grinding Stone is taught from Blacksmithing 255."] = "返回前往一个锻造训练师：致密砂轮是传授来自锻造255。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Dense Sharpening Stone is taught from Blacksmithing 255."] = "返回前往一个锻造训练师：致密磨刀石是传授来自锻造255。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Golden Scale Bracers is taught from Blacksmithing 210."] = "返回前往一个锻造训练师：金鳞护腕是传授来自锻造210。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Green Iron Bracers is taught from Blacksmithing 190."] = "返回前往一个锻造训练师：绿铁护腕是传授来自锻造190。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Heavy Mithril Boots is taught from Blacksmithing 255."] = "返回前往一个锻造训练师：秘银重靴是传授来自锻造255。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Heavy Sharpening Stone is taught from Blacksmithing 125."] = "返回前往一个锻造训练师：重磨刀石是传授来自锻造125。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Rough Bronze Leggings is taught from Blacksmithing 95."] = "返回前往一个锻造训练师：劣质青铜护腿是传授来自锻造95。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Rough Grinding Stone is taught from Blacksmithing 45."] = "返回前往一个锻造训练师：劣质砂轮是传授来自锻造45。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Runed Copper Belt is taught from Blacksmithing 80."] = "返回前往一个锻造训练师：铜质符文腰带是传授来自锻造80。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Silvered Bronze Gauntlets is taught from Blacksmithing 165."] = "返回前往一个锻造训练师：镀银青铜护手是传授来自锻造165。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Solid Sharpening Stone is taught from Blacksmithing 200."] = "返回前往一个锻造训练师：坚固的磨刀石是传授来自锻造200。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Steel Plate Helm is taught from Blacksmithing 235."] = "返回前往一个锻造训练师：钢质头盔是传授来自锻造235。",
	["Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Barbaric Shoulders is taught from Leatherworking 195."] = "返回前往一个制皮训练师：野人护肩是传授来自制皮195。",
	["Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Cured Heavy Hide, Green Leather Belt are taught from Leatherworking 180."] = "返回前往一个制皮训练师：熟化重毛皮，绿色皮带是传授来自制皮180。",
	["Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Embossed Leather Gloves is taught from Leatherworking 85."] = "返回前往一个制皮训练师：雕花皮手套是传授来自制皮85。",
	["Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Fine Leather Belt is taught from Leatherworking 110."] = "返回前往一个制皮训练师：优质皮带是传授来自制皮110。",
	["Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Green Leather Bracers is taught from Leatherworking 200."] = "返回前往一个制皮训练师：绿色皮护腕是传授来自制皮200。",
	["Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Guardian Gloves is taught from Leatherworking 210."] = "返回前往一个制皮训练师：守护手套是传授来自制皮210。",
	["Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Hillman's Leather Gloves is taught from Leatherworking 170."] = "返回前往一个制皮训练师：山地皮手套是传授来自制皮170。",
	["Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Hillman's Shoulders is taught from Leatherworking 155."] = "返回前往一个制皮训练师：山地护肩是传授来自制皮155。",
	["Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Light Leather Pants is taught from Leatherworking 125."] = "返回前往一个制皮训练师：轻皮短裤是传授来自制皮125。",
	["Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Nimble Leather Gloves is taught from Leatherworking 145."] = "返回前往一个制皮训练师：轻巧的皮手套是传授来自制皮145。",
	["Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Rugged Armor Kit is taught from Leatherworking 250."] = "返回前往一个制皮训练师：毛皮护甲片是传授来自制皮250。",
	["Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Small Leather Ammo Pouch is taught from Leatherworking 60."] = "返回前往一个制皮训练师：皮质小弹药包是传授来自制皮60。",
	["Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Thick Leather Ammo Pouch is taught from Leatherworking 245."] = "返回前往一个制皮训练师：厚皮弹药包是传授来自制皮245。",
	["Back to a Leatherworking trainer: Turtle Scale Breastplate is taught from Leatherworking 230."] = "返回前往一个制皮训练师：龟壳胸甲是传授来自制皮230。",
	["Back to a Tailoring trainer: Black Mageweave Gloves is taught from Tailoring 230."] = "返回前往一个裁缝训练师：黑色魔纹手套是传授来自裁缝230。",
	["Back to a Tailoring trainer: Black Mageweave Headband is taught from Tailoring 245."] = "返回前往一个裁缝训练师：黑色魔纹头带是传授来自裁缝245。",
	["Back to a Tailoring trainer: Bolt of Runecloth is taught from Tailoring 255."] = "返回前往一个裁缝训练师：符文布卷是传授来自裁缝255。",
	["Back to a Tailoring trainer: Bolt of Woolen Cloth, Woolen Cape are taught from Tailoring 100."] = "返回前往一个裁缝训练师：毛布卷，毛纺斗篷是传授来自裁缝100。",
	["Back to a Tailoring trainer: Crimson Silk Pantaloons is taught from Tailoring 215."] = "返回前往一个裁缝训练师：深红丝质马裤是传授来自裁缝215。",
	["Back to a Tailoring trainer: Linen Belt is taught from Tailoring 50."] = "返回前往一个裁缝训练师：亚麻腰带是传授来自裁缝50。",
	["Back to a Tailoring trainer: Reinforced Linen Cape is taught from Tailoring 85."] = "返回前往一个裁缝训练师：强化亚麻斗篷是传授来自裁缝85。",
	["Back to an Alchemy trainer: Elixir of Detect Undead is taught from Alchemy 245."] = "返回前往一个炼金术训练师：侦测亡灵药剂是传授来自炼金术245。",
	["Back to an Alchemy trainer: Elixir of Firepower is taught from Alchemy 165."] = "返回前往一个炼金术训练师：火力药剂是传授来自炼金术165。",
	["Back to an Alchemy trainer: Lesser Healing Potion is taught from Alchemy 80."] = "返回前往一个炼金术训练师：次级治疗药水是传授来自炼金术80。",
	["Back to an Alchemy trainer: Stonescale Oil is taught from Alchemy 250."] = "返回前往一个炼金术训练师：石鳞鱼油是传授来自炼金术250。",
	["Back to an Enchanting trainer: Enchant Bracer - Minor Stamina is taught from Enchanting 100."] = "返回前往一个附魔训练师：附魔护腕 - 初级耐力是传授来自附魔100。",
	["Back to an Enchanting trainer: Enchant Bracer - Strength is taught from Enchanting 200."] = "返回前往一个附魔训练师：附魔护腕 - 力量是传授来自附魔200。",
	["Back to an Enchanting trainer: Runed Golden Rod, Enchant Chest - Greater Health are taught from Enchanting 180."] = "返回前往一个附魔训练师：符文金棒，附魔胸甲 - 强效生命是传授来自附魔180。",
	["Back to an Enchanting trainer: Runed Silver Rod is taught from Enchanting 130."] = "返回前往一个附魔训练师：符文银棒是传授来自附魔130。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Coarse Blasting Powder is taught from Engineering 85."] = "返回前往一个工程学训练师：粗制火药粉是传授来自工程学85。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Copper Modulator is taught from Engineering 95."] = "返回前往一个工程学训练师：铜质调节器是传授来自工程学95。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Copper Tube is taught from Engineering 80."] = "返回前往一个工程学训练师：铜管是传授来自工程学80。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Gyromatic Micro-Adjustor is taught from Engineering 175."] = "返回前往一个工程学训练师：侏儒微调器是传授来自工程学175。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Handful of Copper Bolts is taught from Engineering 45."] = "返回前往一个工程学训练师：一把螺栓是传授来自工程学45。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Heavy Blasting Powder is taught from Engineering 125."] = "返回前往一个工程学训练师：烈性火药是传授来自工程学125。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Mithril Gyro-Shot is taught from Engineering 245."] = "返回前往一个工程学训练师：秘银螺旋弹是传授来自工程学245。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Practice Lock is taught from Engineering 115."] = "返回前往一个工程学训练师：练习锁是传授来自工程学115。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Rough Copper Bomb is taught from Engineering 60."] = "返回前往一个工程学训练师：劣质铜壳炸弹是传授来自工程学60。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Solid Blasting Powder, Hi-Impact Mithril Slugs are taught from Engineering 210."] = "返回前往一个工程学训练师：实心炸药，高速秘银弹头是传授来自工程学210。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Whirring Bronze Gizmo is taught from Engineering 125."] = "返回前往一个工程学训练师：高速青铜齿轮是传授来自工程学125。",
	["Back to the Cathedral of Light."] = "返回前往圣光大教堂。",
	["Back to the Cathedral of Light: Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker stands inside."] = "返回前往圣光大教堂：格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵位于内部。",
	["Back to the Crossroads; the next guide starts here."] = "回到十字路口；下一个指南始于此处。",
	["Back to the Razormane camp. Geomancers and Defenders hold its eastern half; Kreenig Snarlsnout walks among them."] = "返回前往刺鬃营地。坑道鼠地卜师与防御者要塞它的东部一半；克里尼格·糟鼻步行在其中：它们。",
	["Back to the Ruins of Solarsal. Every Hatecrest naga there can drop scales."] = "返回前往索兰萨尔废墟。每个恨鳞纳迦那里可以掉落鳞片。",
	["Back to the hills: only the Ice Thistle Matriarchs and Patriarchs carry the horns. Keep killing yetis until level 54: Harlo's wildkin quests are red before that."] = "返回前往丘陵：仅冰蓟雪人女王与族长携带角。保留击杀雪人直到54级：哈鲁·维格索斯的野性枭兽任务是红色之前该。",
	["Back to the moonwell."] = "返回前往月亮井。",
	["Back to the pirate camp: the boots are in the crate marked Drizzlik's Emporium at the camp's south end, the lens in the Fragile crate just east of it."] = "返回前往海盗营地：靴子是在木箱标记的崔斯里克的货物在营地的南尽头，透镜在易碎的木箱就在它东面。",
	["Back to the same murlocs; not every one drops a head."] = "返回前往相同鱼人；不每个1掉落一个前往。",
	["Back to the top of Aldrassil. The Lost Journal lies beside him."] = "返回前往顶部的奥达希尔。遗失的日志位于旁边他。",
	["Back up the road to Brill."] = "返回顺着道路往上前往布瑞尔。",
	["Back west along the road."] = "返回西沿着道路。",
	["Back west through Deadwind Pass to Darkshire."] = "返回西穿过逆风小径前往夜色镇。",
	["Back west to Quel'Danil Lodge; rangers and marksmen stay near the lodge, scouts and outrunners on the slopes south of it."] = "返回西前往奎尔丹尼小屋；游侠与神射手留在旅舍附近，斥候与斥候在山坡在它南面。",
	["Back west to Razor Hill."] = "返回西前往剃刀岭。",
	["Back west to Zoram'gar before heading east for good."] = "返回西前往佐拉姆加之前前往东给好。",
	["Back west to the camp."] = "返回西前往营地。",
