	["Barnil Stonepot"] = "巴尼尔·石罐",
	["Barnil collects the Green Hills of Stranglethorn: the pages drop from almost every humanoid in the jungle. Turn the pages into chapters as you go."] = "巴尼尔·石罐收集荆棘谷的青山的荆棘谷：书页掉落来自几乎每个人形生物在丛林。交还书页进入章节沿途顺路。",
