	["Bartolo Ginsetti"] = "巴图罗·吉塞提",
	["Bartolo also wants a Hillman's Cloak, a Bolt of Woolen Cloth and Fine Thread: crafted or bought; the cloak is turned in when you are back in Southshore later."] = "巴图罗·吉塞提也需要一个山地披风，一个毛布卷与细线：制作的或购买的；披风是交还当你是返回在南海镇稍后。",
	["Bashana buys Morrowgrain grown from your Un'Goro Soil."] = "巴珊娜·符文图腾可兑换晨光麦种植的来自你的安戈洛的泥土。",
