	["Belia Thundergranite in Ironforge takes it"] = "贝莉亚·雷岩在铁炉堡接收该任务",
	["Belia Thundergranite is in the Hall of Arms, High Priestess Mims in the Hall of Mysteries, Lago Blackwrench in the Forlorn Cavern."] = "贝莉亚·雷岩是在武器大厅，高阶祭司米姆斯在秘法大厅，拉戈·黑钳在荒弃的洞穴。",
	["Belia Thundergranite: Beast Training"] = "贝莉亚·雷岩：训练野兽",
	["Bellygrub (level 24) roots around the pen just west of Lakeshire. Pull him away from the other boars and fight at full health."] = "贝利格拉布（24级）根茎在围栏周围就在湖畔镇以西。拉怪他离开来自其他野猪与迎战在完整生命值。",
