	["Bishop DeLavey"] = "德拉维主教",
	["Bishop Farthing"] = "主教法席恩",
	["Black Broodlings nest in the hills just east of Flame Crest. Use Tinkee's Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on a broodling when it is almost dead to capture its essence."] = "黑色雏龙巢在丘陵就在烈焰峰以东。使用丁奇·斯迪波尔的龙灵采集器900型在一个幼龙当它是几乎死亡的前往占领它的精华。",
	["Black Drake's Heart"] = "黑色幼龙之心",
	["Black Kingsnake, 50s"] = "黑色王蛇，50银",
	["Black Oozes creep through the marsh north of the Green Belt road, west of Einar's camp. Any ooze may hold Sida's bag."] = "黑色软泥怪潜行穿过沼泽北的绿带草地道路，在埃纳尔·石钳的以西营地。任意软泥怪可能要塞塞达的背包。",
	["Black Skeletal Horse is a new Forever horse (level 40) whose source is not known yet."] = "黑色骷髅马是一个新无限服马（40级）其获取来源尚不明确。",
	["Black Stallion Bridle is in the client, but no vendor is confirmed to sell it in Forever."] = "黑马缰绳是在客户端，但无商人是已确认前往出售它在无限服。",
