	["Blackrock Medallion"] = "黑石奖章",
	["Blacksmith Hammer: a tool, keep it in your bags"] = "铁匠之锤：工具：请留在背包中",
	["Blacksmithing runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 17s in all."] = "锻造可随升级同步练习升级。无限服传承系统奖励制作专业在技能等级150，225与300（中级，高级与大师级上限），因此以上每个阶段节点均计入进度。1-75阶段所需材料总计约需花费17银。",
	["Blacksmithing: Golden Rod (or the Auction House)"] = "锻造：金棒（或从拍卖行购买）",
	["Blacksmithing: Iron Buckle (or the Auction House)"] = "锻造：铁扣环（或从拍卖行购买）",
	["Blacksmithing: Silver Rod (or the Auction House)"] = "锻造：银棒（或从拍卖行购买）",
	["Blacksmithing: Truesilver Rod (or the Auction House)"] = "锻造：真银棒（或从拍卖行购买）",
	["Blackwood Pathfinders and Windtalkers hold the camp south-east of Auberdine."] = "黑木探路者与黑木风语者要塞营地在奥伯丁以东南。",
	["Blasted Boar Lung"] = "诅咒之地的野猪肺",
	["Blixie Fitzwink"] = "布里克西·菲兹温克",
	["Blizzard counts four battleground reputations, but our faction data has three per side (Warsong Gulch, Arathi Basin, Alterac Valley). The fourth is likely tied to Forever's new PvP content; check the in-game Legacy panel."] = "暴雪计入4战场声望，但我们的阵营数据有3每一侧（战歌峡谷，阿拉希盆地，奥特兰克山谷）。第四是可能关联前往无限服的新 PvP 内容；查看游戏内传承面板。",
	["Blood Red Key, a rare drop"] = "血红钥匙，稀有掉落",
	["Bloodfeather Belt"] = "血羽腰带",
