	["Bluegill Murloc"] = "蓝腮鱼人",
	["Boat to the Forgotten Coast and ride east across Feralas to the Grimtotem camp north of the road. Kindal Moonweaver waits outside it; free the Sprite Darters from the pen in the middle and keep Kindal and at least six of them alive."] = "船前往被遗忘的海岸与骑行东穿过菲拉斯前往恐怖图腾营地在道路以北。辛达尔·月纹在外面等候：它；解救小精灵射手来自围栏在中间与保留辛达尔·月纹与至少6的它们存活。",
	["Boat to the Forgotten Coast and ride east into Feral Scar Vale. Zorbin's quests on the coast need level 45."] = "船前往被遗忘的海岸与骑行东进入深痕谷。佐尔宾的任务在海岸边需要45级。",
