	["Borstan"] = "博斯坦",
	["Both Runecloth donations are handed in later in the route: start saving Runecloth."] = "两个符文布捐献是上交在路线稍后阶段：开始留存符文布。",
	["Both elementals roam north-western Silithus; the Rumblers cluster a little further north."] = "两个元素游荡北-西部希利苏斯；沙漠奔行者簇一个小更远处北。",
	["Both quests lead to Silithus: keep them."] = "两个任务通往希利苏斯：请保留它们。",
	["Both roam the grass around the camp and along the road north."] = "两个游荡于草在营地与沿着道路北周围。",
	["Bottle of Disease"] = "一瓶病菌",
	["Bracers of Rock Binding"] = "石缚护腕",
	["Braelyn Firehand"] = "布莱林·火拳",
	["Braelyn Firehand, outside the gate"] = "布莱林·火拳，在大门外",
	["Braelyn's next quest, Ordanus, is on the Alliance side of Ashenvale. Skip it."] = "布莱林·火拳的下一个任务，奥达努斯，是在联盟一侧的灰谷。跳过即可。",
	["Bragok"] = "布拉高克",
	["Brakk"] = "布拉克",
	["Brakk camps just south of Razor Hill. Sit by his campfire (/sit) until the Boosted Rest buff appears."] = "布拉克扎营就在剃刀岭以南。坐在旁他的营火（/坐）直到强化休息增益出现。",
	["Braldir Ashmantle"] = "布拉尔迪尔·灰袍",
	["Braldir gives you the Fire Sapta. Climb to the peak above his camp, drink the Sapta beside the Spirit Stone and defeat the Minor Manifestation of Fire, then place its Glowing Ember in the Brazier of the Dormant Flame, atop the Shrine of Eternal Flame."] = "布拉尔迪尔·灰袍给你火焰萨普塔。爬上前往山峰上方他的营地，饮用萨普塔旁边灵魂石与击败火焰之魂，然后放置它的余烬在眠炎火盆，在顶部：永恒神殿加拉克烈焰守卫。",
	["Branch of Cenarius"] = "塞纳留斯的树枝",
	["Brandur Ironhammer"] = "布兰度尔·铁锤",
	["Brass Collar: Princess"] = "黄铜项圈：公主",
	["Brave Moonhorn, at the top of the lift"] = "卫兵穆赫·月角，在升降梯的顶部",
