	["Brewmaster Drohn"] = "酿酒师德罗恩",
	["Brewnall Village sits on the lake north-west of Frostmane Hold."] = "烈酒村位于湖在霜鬃巨魔要塞以西北。",
	["Breyk"] = "布雷依克",
	["Brilliant Smallfish is orange from 1 (yellow at 45, grey at 85): about 50 crafts to 50. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking. Raw Brilliant Smallfish is the common catch in Teldrassil's waters."] = "美味小鱼是橙色来自1（黄色在45，灰色在85）：约50制作前往50。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。新鲜的美味小鱼是普通捕获在泰达希尔的水域。",
	["Brine"] = "布瑞恩",
	["Brine's hut stands on the ridge above the quilboar watering hole, south of Camp Taurajo, on the way to Bael Modan."] = "布瑞恩的小屋位于山脊在野猪人水洞上方，在陶拉祖营地以南，在途中前往巴尔莫丹。",
	["Brine, just west of Gann"] = "布瑞恩，就在加恩·石塔以西",
	["Brine: the blue waterskin is filled in Ashenvale, next guide"] = "布瑞恩：蓝色水袋是装满的在灰谷，下一个指南",
	["Brine: the red waterskin from Tarren Mill"] = "布瑞恩：红色水袋来自塔伦米尔",
	["Bring the Hands of Lucifron, Gehennas, Shazzrah and Sulfuron from the Molten Core."] = "携带汉兹·跳链的鲁西弗隆，基赫纳斯，沙斯拉尔与萨弗隆来自熔火之心。",
	["Brohann Caskbelly"] = "布罗哈恩·铁桶",
	["Bronze Tube, from Herble Baubbletump: limited stock. Sold out? Neal Allen in Menethil Harbor sells it too."] = "青铜管，来自赫尔伯：限量库存。出售出? 尼尔·奥雷在米奈希尔港出售它也。",
	["Brother Anton"] = "安东修士",
	["Brother Carlin goes to Light's Hope Chapel: keep it for later."] = "卡林·雷德帕斯前往/交给圣光之愿礼拜堂：留着稍后做。",
