	["Brown Snake, 50s"] = "棕蛇，50银",
	["Bruegs Kindleborn"] = "布鲁格斯·火生",
	["Bruegs Kindleborn: Searing Totem and your Fire Totem"] = "布鲁格斯·火生：灼热图腾与你的火焰图腾",
	["Bruegs waits in a cave above the farm north-west of the South Gate Outpost; the path up starts behind the farm."] = "布鲁格斯·火生等候于一个洞穴在农场北上方-西的南门哨岗；小径上始于在农场后面。",
	["Bruuz swims in the harbour just off Ratchet's docks. Bruuz is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "布鲁兹游动在港口就在偏离/关闭棘齿城的码头。布鲁兹为精英：建议组队前往。",
	["Bubulo Acerbus"] = "巴巴罗·阿克巴斯",
	["Bubulo Acerbus takes cloth for Gnomeregan Exiles in Tinker Town, Ironforge. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "巴巴罗·阿克巴斯接收布料给诺莫瑞根流亡者在工匠区，铁炉堡。第一捐献的毛料，丝绸，魔纹布与符文布（60布料每个）已完成一次与交给大多数声望每布料；之后它们，更多的符文布可重复直到崇拜。崇拜与另一个种族的主城允许你购买该种族的坐骑。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["Bulkrek Ragefist"] = "布科雷克·怒拳",
	["Bundle of Wood"] = "一捆木柴",
	["Bunthen Plainswind in Nighthaven flies druids there"] = "布瑟恩·草风在永夜港飞往德鲁伊那里",
	["Bunthen Plainswind in Nighthaven flies druids there; then fly on to Orgrimmar for the zeppelin"] = "布瑟恩·草风在永夜港飞往德鲁伊那里；然后飞往在前往奥格瑞玛给飞艇",
	["Burly Rockjaw Trogg"] = "壮实的石腭怪",
	["Burning Blade Cultists hold Dustwind Gulch in northern Durotar, by Drygulch Ravine; they drop the Reagent Pouch."] = "火刃祭司要塞尘风峡谷在北部杜隆塔尔，在旁枯水谷；它们掉落试剂袋。",
	["Burning Blade Cultists hold Dustwind Gulch in northern Durotar; they drop the Reagent Pouch. The Fire Tar comes from the Razormane on your next visit to their camp."] = "火刃祭司要塞尘风峡谷在北部杜隆塔尔；它们掉落试剂袋。火焰焦油来自钢鬃在下次来访时前往它们的营地。",
	["Burning Blade cultists hold the caves of Skull Rock to the north; any of them drops a Searing Collar. Gazz'uz, a level 14 warlock, stands deep inside and drops the Eye of Burning Shadow."] = "火刃邪教徒要塞洞穴的骷髅石向北；任意的它们掉落一个灼热项圈。加祖兹，一个14级术士，位于深处内部与掉落燃影之眼。",
	["Burning Key"] = "烈焰钥匙",
