	["Camp Mojache in the east is the Horde town."] = "莫沙彻营地在东面是部落城镇。",
	["Canaga Earthcaller"] = "坎纳甘·地鸣",
	["Canaga Earthcaller: Stoneskin Totem and your Earth Totem"] = "坎纳甘·地鸣：石肤图腾与你的大地图腾",
