	["Canaga stands outside the Den. Spirit Rock is the hill just south of it: drink the Earth Sapta there to see the Minor Manifestation of Earth, then take the Rough Quartz back to Canaga."] = "坎纳甘·地鸣位于外部兽穴。灵魂石是山丘就在它南面：饮用大地萨普塔那里前往查看大地之魂，然后接取粗石英返回前往坎纳甘·地鸣。",
