	["Captain Shatterskull takes Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor for Quell the Silverwing Usurpers, once per level bracket (data); check them live."] = "沙塔尔·碎颅接收战歌峡谷荣誉奖章给镇压银翼篡权者，每个等级段一次（数据）；请在游戏内实测确认。",
