	["Carved Stone Urn"] = "雕纹石罐",
	["Cast Teleport: Moonglade and take Bunthen Plainswind's flight to Thunder Bluff; Turak Runetotem trains you on Elder Rise. Then fly to Orgrimmar and take the Undercity zeppelin from the tower outside the main gate."] = "施放传送：月光林地与接取布瑟恩·草风的飞行前往雷霆崖；图拉克·符文图腾训练你在长者高地。然后飞往前往奥格瑞玛与接取幽暗城飞艇来自哨塔在主大门外。",
	["Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven. Shrine Baubles lie in the containers on the floor of Lake Elune'ara, below Nighthaven: take one to the Shrine of Remulos in the north-west, use it there and speak to Tajarri. Then fly back to Auberdine from Nighthaven."] = "施放传送：月光林地。德迪利特·星焰是在永夜港。神殿灵珠位于容器在楼层的月神湖，在永夜港下方：接取1前往雷姆洛斯神殿在西北面，使用它那里与对话前往塔加里。然后飞往返回前往奥伯丁来自永夜港。",
	["Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven; learn the flight path there if you do not have it."] = "施放传送：月光林地。德迪利特·星焰是在永夜港；学习飞行点那里如果你做不有它。",
	["Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven; the Great Bear Spirit sits in the north-western woods."] = "施放传送：月光林地。德迪利特·星焰是在永夜港；巨熊之灵位于北面-西部树林。",
	["Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Tauren: join the two pendant halves at the Shrine of Remulos, on the north-west shore of the lake, before you see Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven."] = "施放传送：月光林地。牛头人：加入2挂坠两半在雷姆洛斯神殿，在西北岸边的湖，之前你查看德迪利特·星焰在永夜港。",
	["Cast Teleport: Moonglade; Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven. The Shrine Baubles lie on the bed of Lake Elune'ara and fade within minutes: swim one straight to the Shrine of Remulos on the north-west shore, use it there and speak to Tajarri."] = "施放传送：月光林地；德迪利特·星焰是在永夜港。神殿灵珠位于床的月神湖与消失内部分钟：游泳1直走前往雷姆洛斯神殿在西北岸边，使用它那里与对话前往塔加里。",
	["Cat Carrier (Bombay), 40s"] = "猫笼（孟买猫），40银",
