	["Catch about 50 Raw Brilliant Smallfish here by fishing (see the Fishing guide)."] = "在此处捕获约50条新鲜的美味小鱼通过钓鱼（查看钓鱼指南）。",
	["Catch about 68 Raw Rainbow Fin Albacore here by fishing (see the Fishing guide)."] = "在此处捕获约68条新鲜的彩鳍鱼通过钓鱼（查看钓鱼指南）。",
