	["Cenarion Emissary Jademoon"] = "塞纳里奥使者安亚·碧月",
	["Cenarion Hold is the walled town in north-central Silithus. Bor and Huum Wildmane stand together inside. The Cenarion Circle starts out Neutral. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "塞纳里奥要塞是有围墙的城镇在北-中央希利苏斯。博尔与霍姆·蛮鬃位于一起内部。塞纳里奥议会始于出中立。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["Cenarion Lunardust"] = "赛纳里奥银尘",
	["Cenarion Moondust"] = "塞纳里奥月尘",
	["Centaur Ear"] = "半人马的耳朵",
	["Centipaar Insect Parts"] = "森提帕尔昆虫肢体",
	["Cerellean Whiteclaw"] = "塞瑞利恩·白爪",
	["Cerellean Whiteclaw, on the pier"] = "塞瑞利恩·白爪，在栈桥上",
	["Chakuyak, a lone wolf, prowls the plains west of the village. Prairie Stalkers and Flatland Cougars roam the plains north and west of it."] = "查库亚克，一个单独的狼，潜行游荡平原在村庄以西。草原捕食者与平原狮游荡于平原北与在它西面。",
	["Chapter I"] = "荆棘谷的青山 - 第一章",
	["Chapter II"] = "荆棘谷的青山 - 第二章",
	["Chapter III"] = "荆棘谷的青山 - 第三章",
	["Chapter IV"] = "荆棘谷的青山 - 第四章",
	["Charred Wolf Meat is orange from 1 (yellow at 45, grey at 85): about 50 crafts to 50. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "烧烤狼肉是橙色来自1（黄色在45，灰色在85）：约50制作前往50。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
