	["Chilled Basilisk Haunch"] = "冷蜥蜴肉",
	["Chromie"] = "克罗米",
	["Chromie in Andorhal: keep it"] = "克罗米在安多哈尔：请保留该任务/物品",
	["Chromie waits in the ruined inn on the west side of Andorhal, the ruined city north of the camp. Araj the Summoner guards his phylactery in the middle of the town."] = "克罗米等候于毁坏的旅店在安多哈尔的西侧，毁坏的主城在营地以北。召唤者阿拉基卫兵他的命匣在城镇的中央。",
	["Chromie waits in the ruined inn on the west side of Andorhal."] = "克罗米等候于毁坏的旅店在安多哈尔的西侧。",
	["Chromie's Battle of Darrowshire ends against elites. Skip it."] = "克罗米的战斗的达隆郡最后需要面对精英。跳过即可。",
	["Chucky's Huge Ring"] = "苏克的巨型戒指",
	["Chunks of Boar Meat"] = "肉块的野猪肉",
	["Circle of Imprisonment"] = "禁锢法阵",
	["Clamlette Surprise asks for 20 Alterac Swiss (check the quest log); innkeepers and food vendors sell it, and the arrow picks the nearest."] = "蚌肉大餐需要20奥特兰克冷酪（查看任务原木）；旅店老板与食物商人出售它，与箭头会自动指向最近的一位。",
	["Classes give 27 points: every class reaching 25, 45 and 60. They count once per class across your account, so a second character of a class you already raised adds nothing; a new class does. The first character to reach 25 usually unlocks the Legacy System itself."] = "职业交给27点数：每个职业抵达25，45与60。它们计入一次每职业穿过你的账号，因此一个第二角色的一个职业你已经提升新增无奖励；一个新职业会。第一角色前往抵达25通常解锁传承系统其本身。",
	["Clavicus Knavingham"] = "克拉维斯·纳文哈姆",
	["Clavicus Knavingham takes cloth for Stormwind in Stormwind City. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "克拉维斯·纳文哈姆接收布料给暴风城在暴风城。第一捐献的毛料，丝绸，魔纹布与符文布（60布料每个）已完成一次与交给大多数声望每布料；之后它们，更多的符文布可重复直到崇拜。崇拜与另一个种族的主城允许你购买该种族的坐骑。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["Clavicus Knavingham, in the Trade District"] = "克拉维斯·纳文哈姆，在贸易区",
	["Cleansed Water goes to the Emerald Sanctuary in Felwood: keep it for later."] = "净化的水前往/交给翡翠圣地在费伍德森林：留着稍后做。",
	["Clerk Daltry, in the town hall"] = "书记员达尔塔，在市政厅内",
	["Clerk Lendry"] = "书记员伦德瑞",
	["Cliffspring River Sample, at the waterfall"] = "壁泉河水样，在瀑布处",
	["Cliffwatcher Longhorn"] = "峭壁卫兵图林·长角",
	["Climb Fire Plume Ridge in the middle of the crater and use the Skeleton Key Mold by the lava lake at the top, with two Thorium Bars in your bags. Fill Laris's Empty Pure Sample Jars on the Primal Oozes in the pools around the ridge."] = "爬上火羽山在环形山与使用的中央骷髅钥匙模具在旁熔岩湖在顶部，与2瑟银锭在你的背包。装满拉里斯·空轮的纯净样本瓶在原生软泥怪在水池在山脊周围。",
	["Climb the eastern mountains east of Ameth'Aran; the Mysterious Red Crystal sits on a ledge."] = "爬上东部山脉在亚米萨兰以东；神秘的红色水晶位于一个岩架。",
	["Climb the hill west of Hearthglen to look down on the town."] = "爬上山丘在壁炉谷以西前往查看下在城镇。",
	["Climb the path to the top of Darkcloud Pinnacle. Lakota Windsong is held captive beside Arnak Grimtotem (29): clear the guards and Arnak first, then free her and protect her on the walk down; Grimtotem ambushers come at you on the way."] = "爬上小径前往顶部的黑云峰。拉克塔·风歌是持有俘虏在阿纳克·恐怖图腾旁边（29）：清理卫兵与阿纳克第一，然后解救她的与保护她的在步行下；恐怖图腾伏击者来到在你在途中。",
	["Climb the watchtower in the village, jump off the top and use Walk on Air to float down."] = "爬上哨塔在村子里，跳下偏离/关闭顶部与使用步行在空气前往漂浮下。",
	["Climb to the top of Dreadmaul Rock and plant the head in the soft dirt mound."] = "爬上前往顶部的巨槌石与植物前往在软泥土土堆。",
	["Coarse Stone comes from Tin Vein nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "粗糙的石头来自锡矿脉采集点（采矿）；此是最密集的簇在数据。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Coarse Thread from Abigail Shiel, for Gretchen"] = "粗线来自阿比盖尔·沙伊尔，给格莉丝·戴玛",
	["Cockroach, 50s"] = "蟑螂，50银",
	["Coleman Farthing"] = "库勒曼·法席恩",
	["Coleman Farthing, in the inn"] = "库勒曼·法席恩，在旅店内",
	["Collect Cactus Apples and kill Scorpid Workers on the way north. The Vile Familiars swarm the slope by the cave on the valley's north side; Thazz'ril's Pick lies just inside the cave mouth."] = "收集仙人掌果与击杀蝎子在途中北。邪灵劣魔虫群山坡在旁洞穴在山谷的北一侧；塔兹利尔的镐位于就在洞穴入口/河口内。",
	["Collin Mauren"] = "科林·玛伦",
	["Commander Aggro'gosh"] = "指挥官阿格罗戈什",
	["Commander Althea Ebonlocke"] = "指挥官阿尔泰娅·埃伯洛克",
	["Commander Althea Ebonlocke, in the town hall"] = "指挥官阿尔泰娅·埃伯洛克，在市政厅内",
	["Commander Ashlam Valorfist"] = "指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特",
	["Commander Belguilos"] = "指挥官贝尔吉洛斯",
	["Commander Cyclas's Head"] = "指挥官赛克拉斯的头颅",
	["Commander Haalien's Severed Head"] = "指挥官哈利恩的首级",
	["Commander Haalien, Jorel Windsinger and Naaleos Leafwhisper are in the cult camp east of Elegael. Vayn Moongaze stands at its edge. Haalien also drops a Ripped Missive: read it to start the next quest."] = "指挥官哈利恩，乔雷尔·风歌与纳里奥斯·叶语是在教派营地在艾蕾盖尔·棘爪以东。薇恩·月凝位于它的边缘。哈利恩也掉落一个撕裂的密信：阅读它前往开始下一个任务。",
	["Commander Mar'alith"] = "指挥官玛尔利斯",
	["Commander Samaul"] = "指挥官萨穆尔",
	["Connor Rivers"] = "科诺尔·瑞沃斯",
	["Conservator Ilthalaine"] = "管理员伊尔萨莱恩",
	["Constable Aonda"] = "治安官奥恩达",
	["Continue south to Booty Bay. Oglethorpe Obnoticus has his workshop on the upper ring of the bay."] = "继续南前往藏宝海湾。奥格索普·奥布诺提斯有他的工坊在上层戒指的海湾。",
	["Continue west into Duskwood, north to Redridge Mountains and take the pass north out of Redridge into the Burning Steppes; Morgan's Vigil (Alliance) is near the top."] = "继续西进入暮色森林，北前往赤脊山与穿过山道北离开赤脊山进入燃烧平原；摩根的岗哨（联盟）是在顶部附近。",
	["Continue west to Raven Hill. The Memory of Valor glows by the ruined house south of the road."] = "继续西前往乌鸦岭。英勇的记忆发光在旁毁坏的房屋在道路以南。",
	["Cook Torka"] = "厨师托尔卡",
	["Cookie"] = "曲奇",
	["Coriella Calmbreeze"] = "科瑞拉·静风",
	["Corithras Moonrage"] = "科瑞萨斯·月怒",
	["Corithras Moonrage, south of the inn"] = "科瑞萨斯·月怒，在旅店以南",
	["Cork Gizelton"] = "考克·基泽尔顿",
	["Cornelius is missing in the Grizzled Den: find him inside, then go back to Gretchen."] = "科内留斯是失踪的在灰白兽穴：寻找他内部，然后返回格莉丝·戴玛。",
	["Corporal Adamore and his marines hold the wrecked caravan south of Walton. Savannah Patriarchs roam the plains east of the hills, and the Sprung Traps lie among them. Serena Bloodfeather leads the Witchwing harpies in the hills to the west."] = "亚达莫尔下士与他的水兵要塞失事的商队在沃尔顿以南。草原狮王游荡于平原在丘陵以东，与触发的陷阱位于其中：它们。塞瑞娜·血羽通往巫翼鹰身女妖在丘陵向西。",
	["Corporal Kaleb"] = "卡雷布下士",
	["Corporal Kaleb: for Krazek in Booty Bay"] = "卡雷布下士：给克拉兹克在藏宝海湾",
	["Corporal Keeshan"] = "基沙恩下士",
	["Corporal Melkins"] = "麦尔金斯下士",
	["Corporal Sethman"] = "塞斯曼下士",
	["Cortello's Riddle"] = "科泰罗的谜题",
	["Crag Boars and Young Black Bears roam the fields around Kharanos and the depot. Buy the Rhapsody Malt from the innkeeper in the distillery."] = "峭壁野猪与黑熊幼崽游荡于农田在卡拉诺斯与仓库周围。购买狂想麦酒来自旅店老板在酿酒厂。",
	["Crag Coyote Fang"] = "峭壁山狗的牙齿",
	["Crank Fizzlebub"] = "克兰克·菲兹巴布",
	["Crank's next Zanzil errand starts in Thousand Needles: skip it."] = "克兰克·菲兹巴布的下一个赞吉尔差事始于千针石林：跳过即可。",
	["Crate of Foodstuffs"] = "食物箱",
	["Craven Drok"] = "克拉文·德洛克",
	["Craven Drok waits in the Drag; Keldran stands in the Valley of Spirits on the west side of the city."] = "克拉文·德洛克等候于暗巷区；科尔丹位于精神谷在主城的西侧。",
	["Crawler Legs"] = "蟹腿",
	["Cresting Key"] = "海浪钥匙",
	["Crimson Snake, 50s"] = "赤练蛇，50银",
	["Crisp Spider Meat"] = "香脆蜘蛛肉",
	["Crispy Lizard Tail is orange from 100 (yellow at 140, grey at 180): about 25 crafts to 125. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "脆炸蜥蜴尾是橙色来自100（黄色在140，灰色在180）：约25制作前往125。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
	["Crispy Lizard Tail is orange from 125 (yellow at 140, grey at 180): about 15 crafts to 140. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "脆炸蜥蜴尾是橙色来自125（黄色在140，灰色在180）：约15制作前往140。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
	["Crocolisk Steak is orange from 100 (yellow at 120, grey at 160): about 26 crafts to 125. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "鳄鱼肉排是橙色来自100（黄色在120，灰色在160）：约26制作前往125。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
	["Crocolisk Steak is yellow from 125 (yellow at 120, grey at 160): about 7 crafts to 130. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "鳄鱼肉排是黄色来自125（黄色在120，灰色在160）：约7制作前往130。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
	["Cross Blackrock Mountain from the western Burning Steppes into the Searing Gorge: stay on the chain path inside, past the dungeon entrances."] = "穿过黑石山来自西部燃烧平原进入灼热峡谷：留在任务链小径内部，经过地下城入口。",
	["Cross north-west past Thunder Bluff to the Wildmane Water Well in the far north of Mulgore."] = "穿过西北经过雷霆崖前往蛮鬃水井在远处在莫高雷以北。",
	["Cross the Southfury River bridges west out of Durotar into the Barrens. Northwatch Hold in the east is an Alliance fort."] = "穿过怒水河桥西离开杜隆塔尔进入贫瘠之地。北方城堡在东面是一个联盟堡垒。",
	["Cross the Southfury River east from the northern Barrens into Durotar: Horde country, with guards at Razor Hill, Sen'jin Village and Orgrimmar."] = "穿过怒水河东来自北部贫瘠之地进入杜隆塔尔：部落领地，与卫兵在剃刀岭，森金村与奥格瑞玛。",
	["Cross the Thandol Span in northern Wetlands into the Arathi Highlands (level 30+ creatures off the road), follow the road west past Refuge Pointe and on into Hillsbrad Foothills."] = "穿过萨多尔大桥在北部湿地进入阿拉希高地（30级+ 生物道路两侧），沿着道路前往西经过避难谷地与在进入希尔斯布莱德丘陵。",
	["Cross the Thandol Span south into the Wetlands, go through the Dun Algaz pass into Loch Modan and take the road south out of Loch Modan into the Badlands."] = "穿过萨多尔大桥南进入湿地，前往穿过丹奥加兹穿过进入洛克莫丹与沿着道路走南离开洛克莫丹进入荒芜之地。",
	["Cross the bridge into Durotar and follow the road east to Razor Hill."] = "穿过桥进入杜隆塔尔与沿着道路前往东前往剃刀岭。",
	["Cross the long bridge north into town. Foreman Oslow and Marshal Marris stand at the north end of the bridge, Dockmaster Baren on the docks, Chef Breanna at the inn, Bailiff Conacher in the town hall, Martie Jainrose in her garden at the west end."] = "穿过长桥北进入城镇。工头奥斯洛与治安官马瑞斯位于桥的北端，码头管理员巴伦在码头上，厨师布雷纳在旅店，拜里弗·科纳彻尔在市政厅内，玛蒂·詹罗斯在她的花园在西尽头。",
	["Cross the river east of Tirion into Terrordale. The Terrordale Spirits haunt the woods there."] = "穿过河流在提里奥以东进入恐惧谷。恐惧谷的灵魂出没树林那里。",
	["Cross the river east to the Undercroft, the crypt in the south-west of the zone. The Torn Scroll lies inside: its key is on Infiltrator Hameya in the far north-east, done in the next guide."] = "穿过河流东前往地下墓穴，地穴在区域以西南。破损的卷轴位于内部：它的钥匙是在渗透者哈米亚在远处东北，完成在下一份指南中。",
	["Cross the river west to Tirion's hut."] = "穿过河流西前往提里奥的小屋。",
	["Cross the south of the crater to Torwa by the ramp."] = "穿过在环形山前往以南托尔瓦在旁坡道。",
	["Cross the south of the crater to the pylon on the western cliffs."] = "穿过在环形山前往水晶塔在西部悬崖以南。",
	["Crumpled Map"] = "弄皱的地图",
	["Crystal Kelp Fronds"] = "水晶藻叶",
	["Curator Thorius"] = "索里奥斯馆长",
	["Curgle Cranklehop: his crate goes to Rut'theran Village, later"] = "克格尔·曲藤：他的木箱前往/交给鲁瑟兰村，稍后",
	["Curiously Tasty Omelet is orange from 130 (yellow at 170, grey at 210): about 46 crafts to 175. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "美味煎蛋卷是橙色来自130（黄色在170，灰色在210）：约46制作前往175。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
	["Curiously Tasty Omelet is orange from 150 (yellow at 170, grey at 210): about 26 crafts to 175. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "美味煎蛋卷是橙色来自150（黄色在170，灰色在210）：约26制作前往175。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
	["Cursed Marine"] = "被诅咒的水兵",
	["Cursed Sailor"] = "被诅咒的水手",
	["Daelyshia"] = "黛琳希亚",
