	["Daggerspine Sorceress"] = "刺脊巫师",
	["Dal Bloodclaw (25) leads the Thistlefur gnolls at the camp north of Astranaar. Clear his guards first, one at a time."] = "达尔·血爪（25）通往蓟皮豺狼人在营地在阿斯特兰纳以北。清理他的卫兵第一，1在一个时间。",
	["Dal Bloodclaw's Skull"] = "达尔·血爪的颅骨",
	["Dalar Dawnweaver"] = "达拉尔·道恩维沃尔",
	["Dalar Dawnweaver: take it if he offers it; it may follow his Arugal's Folly series, which the route does not run"] = "达拉尔·道恩维沃尔：接取它如果他提供该任务；它可能沿着他的阿鲁高的愚行系列，其中路线会不前往",
	["Dalia the Collector"] = "收集者达莉亚",
	["Dalinda Malem"] = "黛琳达·玛雷姆",
