	["Dar"] = "达尔",
	["Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) drop Invader's Scourgestones here, along with Minion's stones and Runecloth. Hand Invader's in 10 at a time and Minion's 20 at a time to Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff at Light's Hope Chapel. In Classic both stop giving reputation at Honored."] = "黑暗教徒与暗影法师（58-60级）掉落侵略者的天灾石此处，沿着与爪牙的石头与符文布。上交雷霆入侵者的在10在一个时间与爪牙的20在一个时间前往尼古拉斯·瑟伦霍夫公爵在圣光之愿礼拜堂。在经典旧世两个停靠给予声望在尊敬。",
	["Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) drop it here; every Scourge kill here also counts toward the Argent Dawn (see that guide). The Auction House works too."] = "黑暗教徒与暗影法师（58-60级）掉落它此处；每个天灾军团击杀此处也计入朝向银色黎明（查看该指南）。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Dark Iron Geologist"] = "黑铁地质学家",
	["Dark Iron Map"] = "黑铁地图",
	["Dark Iron Ore: Favor Amongst the Brotherhood, Dark Iron Ore at Lokhtos, repeatable."] = "黑铁矿石：兄弟会的好感 - 黑铁矿石在洛克图斯，可重复。",
	["Dark Iron Script: Dark Iron Spies"] = "黑铁手稿：黑铁间谍",
	["Dark Iron Slaver"] = "黑铁奴隶贩子",
	["Dark Iron Spy"] = "黑铁间谍",
	["Dark Iron Taskmaster"] = "黑铁工头",
	["Darkshore Grouper: fish from the pier"] = "黑海岸石斑鱼：钓鱼在栈桥上",
	["Darla Harris"] = "达尔拉·哈瑞斯",
	["Darla Harris, Southshore"] = "达尔拉·哈瑞斯，南海镇",
	["Darren Malvew"] = "达伦·玛尔维",
	["Darren Malvew: the lions come later"] = "达伦·玛尔维：狮子来到稍后",
	["Darrowshire Spirit"] = "达隆郡居民的灵魂",
	["Darsok Swiftdagger"] = "达索克·快刀",
	["Darsok Swiftdagger, on the tower platform: needs level 12"] = "达索克·快刀，在哨塔平台上：需要12级",
	["Darsok Swiftdagger: the harpies come later, in the Dry Hills"] = "达索克·快刀：鹰身人来到稍后，在枯水谷",
	["Daryl Riknussun, Ironforge"] = "达瑞尔·瑞克努索，铁炉堡",
	["Daryn Lightwind"] = "达蕾恩·轻风",
	["Daryn's next errand goes to Tanaris: skip it."] = "达蕾恩·轻风的下一个差事前往/交给塔纳利斯：跳过即可。",
	["Dashel waits in the Pig and Whistle tavern in Old Town; he and his two thugs fight you, but stop once beaten."] = "达舍尔·石拳等候于猪和哨声旅店酒馆在旧城区；他与他的2暴徒迎战你，但停靠一次被殴打的。",
	["Davil's Libram"] = "达维的圣契",
	["Davil's Libram lies in the town hall of Hearthglen, west of Tirion: the Scarlet guards stand close together."] = "达维的圣契位于市政厅内的壁炉谷，在提里奥以西：血色卫兵位于靠近一起。",
	["Dazalar"] = "达扎拉",
	["Dead Cultist"] = "死去的教徒",
	["Deadwood Avenger"] = "死木复仇者",
	["Deadwood Cauldron, if you found the Firewater flask in Winterspring"] = "死木大锅，如果你找到火酒烧瓶在冬泉谷",
	["Deadwood Den Watcher"] = "死木守卫",
	["Deadwood Gardener"] = "死木园丁",
	["Deadwood Pathfinder"] = "死木探险者",
	["Deadwood Ritual Totem, a rare drop"] = "死木仪祭图腾，稀有掉落",
	["Deadwood Shaman"] = "死木萨满祭司",
	["Deadwood Warrior"] = "死木战士",
	["Deadwood furbolgs (level 48-50) camp at the southern end of Felwood. Keep every Deadwood Headdress Feather they drop: Grazle and Nafien take them later."] = "死木熊怪（48-50级）营地在费伍德森林的南端。保留每个死木头饰羽毛它们掉落：格拉兹与纳菲恩接取它们稍后。",
	["Death Cap"] = "毒帽蘑菇",
	["Deathcharger's Reins needs level 60 and Journeyman Riding to ride (Forever client). Train it at your race's riding trainer; see the Level 60 mount guides."] = "死亡军马的缰绳需要60级与中级骑术前往骑行（无限服客户端）。训练它在你的种族的骑术训练师；查看等级60坐骑指南。",
	["Deathguard Bartholomew"] = "亡灵卫兵巴塞洛缪",
	["Deathguard Burgess"] = "亡灵卫兵伯吉斯",
	["Deathguard Dillinger"] = "亡灵卫兵迪林格尔",
	["Deathguard Dillinger stands in Brill. Ulag waits in the mausoleum on the hill just north of town: open the gate and fight him."] = "亡灵卫兵迪林格尔位于布瑞尔。乌拉格等候于陵墓在山丘就在城镇北面：打开/开启大门与迎战他。",
	["Deathguard Dillinger: Defensive Stance"] = "亡灵卫兵迪林格尔：防御姿态",
	["Deathguard Linnea"] = "亡灵卫兵林奈",
	["Deathguard Saltain"] = "亡灵卫兵萨尔坦",
	["Deathguard Samsa"] = "亡灵卫兵沙穆萨",
	["Deathknell opens onto Tirisfal Glades; Brill is east along the road. Orcs, trolls and tauren arrive at the zeppelin tower by the Undercity."] = "丧钟镇通向提瑞斯法林地；布瑞尔是东沿着道路。兽人，巨魔与牛头人抵达在飞艇哨塔在旁幽暗城。",
	["Deathmaster Dwire's The Battle for Arathi Basin! (assault every base) and Take Four Bases / Take Five Bases are one-time quests; Deathstalker Mortis beside him takes Arathi Resource Crates."] = "屠杀者杜维尔的阿拉希盆地之战！（突袭每个基地）与占领四个基地 / 占领五个基地是一次性任务；亡灵哨兵莫提斯旁边他接收阿拉希资源箱。",
	["Deathmaster Dwire, Hammerfall"] = "屠杀者杜维尔，落锤镇",
	["Deathstalker Erland"] = "亡灵哨兵埃兰德",
	["Deathstalker Erland waits north-east of the house. Escort him back to Rane; worgs attack on the way."] = "亡灵哨兵埃兰德等候在房屋以东北。护送他返回前往兰妮·尤瑞克；座狼攻击在途中。",
	["Deathstalker Lesh: Darthalia in Tarren Mill"] = "亡灵哨兵莱什：高级执行官达萨利亚在塔伦米尔",
	["Deathstalker Masoj"] = "死亡猎手马索吉",
	["Deeg"] = "迪格",
	["Deep Cover: Taskmaster Fizzule, by the Sludge Fen"] = "卧底密探：工头费苏勒，在旁淤泥沼泽",
	["Defeat the challengers and Big Will"] = "击败挑战者与比格维尔",
	["Defias Docket"] = "迪菲亚记事本",
	["Defias Pathstalkers and Knuckledusters walk Moonbrook; Highwaymen (level 17) patrol the hills south and east of it in pairs: pull them apart. The Deadmines entrance in the smithy is a group dungeon."] = "迪菲亚巡路者与指虎步行月溪镇；拦路强盗（17级）巡逻于丘陵南与在它东面在成对：拉怪它们相隔。死亡矿井入口在铁匠铺是一个队伍地下城。",
	["Defias Pillagers and Looters hold the farms west of Sentinel Hill, between the coast road and Moonbrook."] = "迪菲亚抢劫者与掠夺者要塞农场在哨兵岭以西，在海岸道路与月溪镇之间。",
	["Defias Pirates"] = "迪菲亚海盗",
	["Defias Rogue Wizard"] = "迪菲亚流浪巫师",
	["Defias Rogue Wizards camp on the shores of Stone Cairn Lake; they drop the Red Linen Bandanas too. Rolf's corpse lies in the murloc village on the north-east shore."] = "迪菲亚流浪巫师营地在海岸的石碑湖；它们掉落红色亚麻面罩也。罗尔夫的尸体位于鱼人村庄在东北岸边。",
	["Defias Script: Defias Rogue Wizards"] = "迪菲亚手稿：迪菲亚流浪巫师",
	["Defias Thugs camp in the clearing east of the Abbey and along the valley's east side."] = "迪菲亚暴徒扎营于空地在修道院与沿着山谷以东的东一侧。",
	["Defias Tower Key: Malformed Defias Drone"] = "迪菲亚塔楼钥匙：丑陋的迪菲亚懒汉",
	["Delgren the Purifier"] = "净化者德尔格伦",
	["Deliana then offers your class's Saving the Best for Last, the final upgrade of the dungeon set."] = "德莉亚娜然后提供你的职业的把最好的留到最后，最终升级的地下城设置。",
	["Deliana, Ironforge"] = "德莉亚娜，铁炉堡",
	["Demisette Cloyce, in the Slaughtered Lamb: Strahad Farsan in Ratchet takes it at the end of the next guide"] = "德米赛特·克劳斯，在已宰的羔羊旅店：斯坦哈德·法尔杉在棘齿城接收该任务在下一份指南末尾",
	["Den Mother"] = "雌蓟熊",
	["Denaaris Stargale"] = "德纳里斯·星风",
	["Denaaris stands beside the Skyborne Portal where the zeppelin lands. The portal takes you to Stormwind."] = "德纳里斯·星风站在旁边：天裔传送门在飞艇之地。传送门接收你前往暴风城。",
	["Denalan"] = "德纳兰",
	["Dendrite Starblaze"] = "德迪利特·星焰",
	["Dendrite Starblaze, Nighthaven"] = "德迪利特·星焰，永夜港",
	["Dendrite Starblaze: the welcome from Turak"] = "德迪利特·星焰：欢迎信来自图拉克·符文图腾",
	["Dense Stone comes from Small Thorium Vein nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "厚重的石头来自软泥覆盖的瑟银矿脉采集点（采矿）；此是最密集的簇在数据。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Deputy Feldon"] = "菲尔顿副队长",
	["Deputy Rainer"] = "瑞尼尔副队长",
	["Deputy Willem"] = "维里副队长",
	["Deputy Willem, back at the Abbey steps"] = "维里副队长，返回在修道院台阶",
	["Dermot"] = "德莫特",
	["Derrington's watchtowers, Vandis' cauldron and Mickey's barrel are done on a later visit: keep them."] = "高级执行官德灵顿的哨塔，暗影牧师范蒂丝的大锅与米克·莱文的木桶已完成在后续再来时：请保留它们。",
	["Desperate Prayer"] = "绝望祷言",
	["Devlin Agamand"] = "代弗林·阿加曼德",
	["Devrak"] = "迪弗拉克",
	["Devrak, the wind rider master"] = "迪弗拉克，双足飞龙管理员",
	["Dewy Lasher Frond"] = "带露的鞭笞者叶",
	["Dinosaur Bone"] = "恐龙骨头",
	["Dinosaur Bones lie on the ground in the south-west, among the stegodons: those are elite, pick the bones up around them and take the rest from Diemetradons. The expedition's Research Equipment lies in the south-west jungle."] = "恐龙骨头位于领地在西南面，在其中：剑龙：那些为精英，拾取骨头上周围它们与接取其余来自双帆龙。远征队的研究设备位于西南面丛林。",
	["Dirania Silvershine"] = "迪兰妮亚·月光",
	["Dirania Silvershine, east of the tree"] = "迪兰妮亚·月光，在树以东",
	["Dire Maul East"] = "厄运之槌东",
	["Dire Maul North"] = "厄运之槌北",
	["Dire Maul West"] = "厄运之槌西",
	["Dire Maul fits levels 55 to 60; the Rabid Shardtooth grind below gets you to 59 alone."] = "厄运之槌适合55至60级；疯狂的碎齿熊刷怪下方使你达到你前往59独自。",
	["Dire Mottled Boar (99%), Elder Mottled Boar (74%) in Durotar, or wherever the arrow points"] = "可怕的杂斑野猪（99%），老杂斑野猪（74%）在杜隆塔尔，或跟随箭头指示位置",
	["Dirty Knucklebones"] = "肮脏的指节骨",
	["Discovering an area gives experience scaled to its level, so this runs alongside leveling. Alliance starts in Elwynn Forest; dwarves and gnomes can begin at the Dun Morogh step. 12 areas to discover here, levels 5-10."] = "探索发现一个区域给予经验值覆鳞的前往它的等级，因此此可随升级同步练习升级。联盟始于艾尔文森林；矮人与侏儒可以开始在丹莫罗步骤。12区域前往探索发现此处，5-10级。",
	["Discovering an area gives experience scaled to its level, so this runs alongside leveling. Alliance starts on Teldrassil; humans, dwarves and gnomes arrive by boat at Auberdine and can begin at the Darkshore step. 11 areas to discover here, levels 5-11."] = "探索发现一个区域给予经验值覆鳞的前往它的等级，因此此可随升级同步练习升级。联盟始于在泰达希尔；人类，矮人与侏儒抵达在旁船在奥伯丁与可以开始在黑海岸步骤。11区域前往探索发现此处，5-11级。",
	["Discovering an area gives experience scaled to its level, so this runs alongside leveling. Horde starts in Durotar; tauren can begin at the Mulgore step, undead arrive by zeppelin at Orgrimmar. 11 areas to discover here, levels 5-10."] = "探索发现一个区域给予经验值覆鳞的前往它的等级，因此此可随升级同步练习升级。部落始于杜隆塔尔；牛头人可以开始在莫高雷步骤，亡灵抵达在旁飞艇在奥格瑞玛。11区域前往探索发现此处，5-10级。",
	["Discovering an area gives experience scaled to its level, so this runs alongside leveling. Horde starts in Tirisfal Glades; orcs, trolls and tauren arrive by zeppelin from Orgrimmar. 17 areas to discover here, levels 5-10."] = "探索发现一个区域给予经验值覆鳞的前往它的等级，因此此可随升级同步练习升级。部落始于提瑞斯法林地；兽人，巨魔与牛头人抵达在旁飞艇来自奥格瑞玛。17区域前往探索发现此处，5-10级。",
	["Diseased Grizzly"] = "生病的灰熊",
	["Diseased Wolf"] = "生病的狼",
	["Disgusting Oozeling"] = "恶心的软泥怪",
	["Dithers offers Skeletal Fragments (Scholomance). Skip it."] = "药剂师迪瑟斯提供骸骨碎片（通灵学院）。跳过即可。",
	["Divine Grace"] = "神圣恩典",
	["Dizzy One-Eye"] = "独眼迪兹",
	["Dizzy's Eye"] = "迪兹的眼睛",
	["Do your shopping in the Undercity first, then fly to the Sepulcher. The Brazier of Everfount stands on the hill just south-west of it: beat the Corrupt Manifestation of Water beside it, place its bracers in the brazier, speak to the Minor Manifestation of Water and keep the Shard of Water for Islen. Fly on to Tarren Mill from the Sepulcher."] = "做你的采购在幽暗城第一，然后飞往前往瑟伯切尔。永泉火盆位于山丘就在它西南面：击败腐化的大地之魂的水旁边它，放置它的护腕在火盆，对话前往水之魂与保留水灵碎片给水之先知伊斯伦。飞往在前往塔伦米尔来自瑟伯切尔。",
	["Do'gol"] = "杜高尔",
	["Dockmaster Baren"] = "码头管理员巴伦",
	["Doctor Draxlegauge"] = "德拉克里格博士",
	["Doctor Gregory Victor, Hammerfall"] = "格里高利·维克托医生，落锤镇",
	["Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen, Theramore Isle"] = "古斯塔夫·范沃森医生，塞拉摩岛",
	["Doctor Martin Felben, in the Apothecarium"] = "马丁·费尔本，在炼金房",
	["Document Chest, north-west camp"] = "文件箱，西北营地",
	["Document Chest, south-east camp"] = "文件箱，东南营地",
	["Document Chest, south-west camp"] = "文件箱，西南营地",
	["Dogran is chained up in the quilboar camp west of the road."] = "步兵多格兰是被锁住的上在野猪人营地在道路以西。",
	["Dogran's Pendant"] = "多格兰的坠饰",
	["Dokimi stands in the Crossroads. Open each crate she hands you and bring back what is inside."] = "多基米位于十字路口。打开/开启每个木箱她发放你与携带返回所是内部。",
	["Dondallion Whisperwind"] = "唐达里奥·语风",
	["Donni Anthania"] = "冬妮·安萨妮娅",
	["Donni Anthania has a farmhouse north of Goldshire. Each cat carrier costs 40s. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "冬妮·安萨妮娅有一个农舍在闪金镇以北。每个猫笼子花费40银。每个宠物物品传授它的伙伴当你使用它；目标留在勾选随后。",
	["Donova Snowden"] = "多诺瓦·雪山",
	["Donova camps among the steaming pools of Frostfire Hot Springs, in the west of the valley."] = "多诺瓦扎营在其中：冒热气的水池的霜火温泉，在山谷以西。",
	["Donova next sends you after High Chief Winterfall, an elite in his cave. Skip it."] = "多诺瓦下一个派你去讨伐冬泉酋长，一个精英在他的洞穴。跳过即可。",
	["Doomwarder Blood"] = "末日看守之血",
	["Doras"] = "多拉斯",
	["Doras, the wind rider master, stands on the tower in the Valley of Strength."] = "多拉斯，双足飞龙管理员，位于哨塔在力量谷。",
	["Dorn Plainstalker"] = "多恩·平原行者",
	["Dorn Plainstalker stands on a mesa top east of the Galak camps. For the Test of Faith, walk off the end of the planks beside him: you land safely."] = "多恩·平原行者位于一个台地顶部东的加拉克扎营。给信仰的试炼，步行偏离/关闭尽头的木板旁边他：你陆地安全地。",
	["Down the Gold Road to Camp Taurajo again."] = "下金币道路前往陶拉祖营地再次。",
	["Draenethyst Crystal"] = "德莱尼水晶",
	["Dragonmaw Catapult"] = "龙喉投石车",
	["Dragonmaw War Banner"] = "龙喉战旗",
	["Dran Droffers"] = "德兰·杜佛斯",
	["Dran Droffers, the Drag"] = "德兰·杜佛斯，暗巷区",
	["Draz'Zilb"] = "德拉兹辛比",
	["Dreaming Whelps"] = "梦游雏龙",
	["Dredge Crusher"] = "掘泥摧毁者",
	["Dredge Crushers dig further west; Stonelash Pincers, Flayers and Rock Stalkers hunt the same sands."] = "掘泥摧毁者挖掘更远处西；石鞭巨钳蝎，剥皮者与岩石潜伏者狩猎相同沙地。",
	["Dredge Crushers roam the dunes between Hive'Zora and Cenarion Hold, on your way back. Commander Mar'alith only offers Dearest Natalia from level 58."] = "掘泥摧毁者游荡于沙丘在佐拉虫巢与塞纳里奥要塞之间，在你的路返回。指挥官玛尔利斯仅提供亲爱的纳塔莉亚来自58级。",
	["Dredge Striker"] = "掘泥打击者",
	["Dredge Strikers dig in the dunes north-west of the hold; Stonelash Scorpids and Sand Skitterers roam all around."] = "掘泥打击者挖掘在沙丘在要塞以西北；石鞭蝎与掠沙蜘蛛游荡全部周围。",
	["Dredge Strikers, Stonelash Scorpids and Sand Skitterers share the sands just north of the hold."] = "掘泥打击者，石鞭蝎与掠沙蜘蛛共享沙地就在要塞以北。",
	["Dreka'Sur"] = "德雷卡苏",
	["Drizzlik"] = "崔斯里克",
	["Drizzlik, by the bank"] = "崔斯里克，在银行旁",
	["Drizzlik: the Snapjaw skins gathered earlier"] = "崔斯里克：钳嘴龟兽皮收集的此前",
	["Drull and Tog'thar are chained inside Durnholde Keep's courtyard buildings; open both locks."] = "德鲁尔与托格萨是被锁住的在敦霍尔德城堡的内庭院建筑；打开/开启两个锁。",
	["Drull's ball and chain"] = "德鲁尔的铁球与任务链",
	["Drulzegar Skraghook"] = "杜泽加尔",
	["Drum Fel"] = "杜拉姆法尔",
	["Drum Fel's next Call to Arms is against Boulderfist elites: leave it."] = "杜拉姆法尔的下一个短兵相接是迎战石拳精英：可先放着不做。",
	["Drusilla La Salle, outside the Abbey"] = "杜希拉·拉萨雷，在修道院外",
	["Drusilla La Salle: Summon Imp"] = "杜希拉·拉萨雷：召唤小鬼",
	["Duke Hydraxis stands on a small island off the eastern coast of Azshara; swim or walk the shallows out to him. The Hydraxian Waterlords start out Neutral. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "海达克西斯公爵位于一个小型岛屿偏离/关闭东部海岸的艾萨拉；游泳或步行浅滩出前往他。海达希亚水元素开始出中立。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff"] = "尼古拉斯·瑟伦霍夫公爵",
	["Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff, Light's Hope Chapel"] = "尼古拉斯·瑟伦霍夫公爵，圣光之愿礼拜堂",
	["Dunemaul Brute"] = "砂槌蛮兵",
	["Dunemaul Enforcer"] = "砂槌执行者",
	["Dunemaul ogres (level 45-48) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "砂槌食人魔（45-48级）掉落它此处。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Dungar Longdrink"] = "杜加尔·朗德瑞克",
	["Dungar Longdrink, Trade District; Gryth Thurden, Ironforge"] = "杜加尔·朗德瑞克，贸易区；格莱斯·瑟登，铁炉堡",
	["Durnan Furcutter, inside Anvilmar"] = "德南·弗卡特，在安威玛尔内",
	["Durotar Supply and Logistics is the Horde's tradeskill faction in Forever. Its camp is just outside the Crossroads in the Barrens. From level 10 mobs drop Waylaid Crates: fill each with the goods its label asks for and hand the Sealed Crate to Dokimi at the camp for reputation and Merchant's Favor. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "杜隆塔尔补给与后勤部是部落的商业技能阵营在无限服。它的营地是就在外部十字路口在贫瘠之地。来自10级怪物掉落被劫的货箱：装满每个与商品它的标签需要与上交密封的箱子前往多基米在营地给声望与商人的青睐。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["Duskbats and Darkhounds roam all along the road back west; finish the wings and hides on the way."] = "夜行蝙蝠与饥饿的黑暗犬游荡全部沿着道路返回西；完成翅膀与藏身在途中。",
	["Duskweed Petal"] = "暮色草花瓣",
	["Duskwood is east of Westfall and south of Elwynn Forest. Its road runs east to Darkshire."] = "暮色森林是在西部荒野以东与在艾尔文森林以南。它的道路通往东前往夜色镇。",
	["Duskwood is next: follow the road west to Three Corners, then south to Darkshire."] = "暮色森林是下一个：沿着道路前往西前往三角路口，然后南前往夜色镇。",
	["Dustwallow Marsh is east of the southern Barrens; Brackenwall Village in the north-west is the Horde town."] = "尘泥沼泽是在南部以东贫瘠之地；蕨墙村在西北面是部落城镇。",
	["Dusty Reliquary"] = "积灰的圣物箱",
	["Dusty Shelf, inside the keep"] = "布满灰尘的书架，在保留内",
	["Duthorian Rall"] = "达索瑞恩·拉尔",
	["Duthorian Rall stands in the Cathedral of Light. Turning in the Tome of Nobility teaches Summon Warhorse; Paladins do not buy a mount."] = "达索瑞恩·拉尔位于圣光大教堂。交还在贵族之书传授召唤军马；圣骑士做不购买一个坐骑。",
	["Duthorian Rall, Cathedral of Light"] = "达索瑞恩·拉尔，圣光大教堂",
	["Duthorian Rall, in the Cathedral of Light"] = "达索瑞恩·拉尔，在圣光大教堂",
	["Duthorian Rall: Redemption"] = "达索瑞恩·拉尔：救赎",
	["Dying Kodo (55%), Ancient Kodo (54%), Aged Kodo (40%) in Desolace, or wherever the arrow points"] = "濒死的科多兽（55%），远古科多兽（54%），老迈的科多兽（40%）在凄凉之地，或跟随箭头指示位置",
	["Each Circle of Binding is a ring of standing stones; the key sits on the stone at its heart. The eastern circle is on the hills north-west of Hammerfall."] = "每个束缚法阵是一个戒指的声望等级石头；钥匙位于石头在它的心脏。东部法阵是在丘陵在落锤镇以西北。",
	["Each crafting profession gives 3 points, at 150, 225 and 300. Ranks count once per profession across your account. Follow the Polestar guide \"Alchemy 1-300\" (Professions). A crafting profession at 150 also unlocks the Legacy System."] = "每个制作专业给予3点数，在150，225与300。军阶计入一次每专业穿过你的账号。沿着 Polestar 指南 \"炼金术1-300\"（专业技能）。一个制作专业在150也解锁传承系统。",
	["Each key lies at one of the Highlands' standing-stone circles: east of the shards, near Refuge Pointe and in the west. The Stone of Inner Binding stands west of Refuge Pointe."] = "每个钥匙位于1的高地猎兽龙的声望等级-石头法阵：在碎片以东，在避难谷地附近与在西面。内束缚之石位于避难谷地以西。",
	["Each of Dazalar's quests hands you a Taming Rod: use it on the beast he names, then bring the rod back to him in Dolanaar. Webwood Lurkers creep around the village, Nightsaber Stalkers and Strigid Screechers roam the woods south of it."] = "每个的达扎拉的任务发放你一个驯兽棒：使用它在野兽他名称，然后携带魔杖返回前往他在多兰纳尔。树林潜伏者潜行在村庄周围，夜刃捕食者与巨翼恶枭游荡于树林在它南面。",
	["Each of Grif Wildheart's quests hands you a Taming Rod: use it on the beast he names, then bring the rod back to him at the Kharanos smithy. Large Crag Boars, Snow Leopards and Ice Claw Bears all roam the fields just south and east of Kharanos."] = "每个的格瑞夫的任务发放你一个驯兽棒：使用它在野兽他名称，然后携带魔杖返回前往他在卡拉诺斯铁匠铺。大峭壁野猪，雪豹与冰爪熊全部游荡于农田就在南与在卡拉诺斯以东。",
	["Each of Quel'ana's quests hands you a Taming Rod: use it on the beast she names, then bring the rod back to her in Valanaar. Windsong Crawlers line the shore west of town; Vuldren Alphas and Ornery Galestriders roam the Gustberry Lowlands around the Windfield farm. Her sister Quel'dora stands beside her."] = "每个的奎尔安娜·疾风的任务发放你一个驯兽棒：使用它在野兽她名称，然后携带魔杖返回前往她的在瓦拉纳尔。风歌爬行者路线岸边在城镇西面；瓦德伦首领与暴躁的疾风陆行鸟游荡于风莓低地周围阿尔瓦里奥·风野农场。她的修女奎尔多拉·疾风站在旁边：她的。",
	["Each robot starts with a distress beacon that mobs in its zone drop (about 1-2.5% per kill in our data). Start in Feralas."] = "每个机器人始于一个求救信标该怪物在它的区域掉落（约1-2.5%每击杀在我们的数据）。开始在菲拉斯。",
	["Eagan Peltskinner"] = "伊根·派特斯金纳",
	["Ealaane Nimbuswalker"] = "伊拉妮·云行者",
	["Earth Sapta, beside the Spirit Stone"] = "大地萨普塔，旁边灵魂石",
	["East across the plains toward the coast: the stolen silver lies in a raptor nest north-west of Northwatch Hold."] = "东穿过平原朝海岸方向：被盗的银色位于一个迅猛龙巢在北方城堡以西北。",
	["East along the road to the Fallow Sanctuary. The Lost One mobs drop the crystals; Noboru walks the ruins and drops his cudgel."] = "东沿着道路前往农田避难所。迷失者塞尔杜林1怪物掉落水晶；诺博鲁步行废墟与掉落他的木槌。",
	["East along the road, Cauldron Lord Malvinious guards the cauldron at Dalson's Tears."] = "东沿着道路，护锅者玛维诺斯卫兵大锅在达尔松之泪。",
	["East of Bloodvenom Post, the cratered vale where the Entropic Beasts and Horrors roam. Kill two of each, then walk to each of the three fel-water craters."] = "在血毒岗哨以东，环形山山谷在热能野兽与可怕的血僵尸游荡。击杀2的每个，然后步行前往每个的3邪能-水环形山。",
	["East of Ziz, the Venture Company is clear-cutting Windshear Crag; one of the Operators carries the blueprints. Piznik mines in the small mine on the east side: stay with him while he mines, Venture Co. thugs come for him."] = "在吉兹以东，风险投资公司雇员公司是清理-切割狂风峭壁；1的操作员鲁格伦克携带蓝图。匹兹尼克矿洞在小型采矿在东一侧：留在与他当他矿洞，风险投资公司暴徒来到给他。",
	["East of Zoram'gar, the Thistlefur furbolgs fill the village and the hills around their hold."] = "在佐拉姆加以东，蓟皮熊怪装满村庄与丘陵周围它们的要塞。",
	["East of the ogres, Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) stalk unseen until they strike; the Stranglethorn Tigresses roam the same ground and now and then drop a pristine fang. Snapjaw Crocolisks line the river just west of the jungle; keep their skins for Drizzlik."] = "在食人魔以东，深喉猎豹（37-38）潜伏隐形的直到它们打击；荆棘谷母虎游荡于相同领地与现在与然后掉落一个完好的獠牙。钳嘴鳄鱼路线河流就在丛林以西；保留它们的兽皮给崔斯里克。",
	["East of the road the Ashmane boars and Grunters root on the slopes beside the Redstone basilisks. Stay away from the level 52 Helboars further south."] = "在道路灰鬃野猪与哼叫野猪根在山坡在红石旁边石化蜥蜴以东。留在离开来自52级地狱野猪更远处南。",
	["East of the village, the violet flower grows in the hills."] = "在村庄以东，紫色花生长在丘陵。",
	["East past the mill and across the river. Shadowhide gnolls fill the valley; Lieutenant Fangore (26, well above you) leads them at its north end: clear his escort first and fight him at full health. Stay out of Stonewatch Keep to the south: its orcs are elite."] = "东经过磨坊与穿过河流。暗皮战士豺狼人装满山谷；范高雷中尉（26，水井上方你）通往它们在它的北尽头：清理他的护送第一与迎战他在完整生命值。留在离开石堡保留向南：它的兽人为精英。",
	["East to Ratchet, on the coast."] = "东前往棘齿城，在海岸边。",
	["East to the Mor'shan Rampart; Wenikee stands at the camp just south of it."] = "东前往莫尔杉农场；维妮·布特巴克位于营地就在它南面。",
	["East to the Sludge Fen. Wizzlecrank's Shredder stands inside the Venture Co. camp; Supervisor Lugwizzle carries the key."] = "东前往淤泥沼泽。维兹克兰克的伐木机位于内部风险投资公司营地；鲁格维兹主管携带钥匙。",
	["Eastern Plaguelands lie east of Western Plaguelands, across the Thondroril River. Light's Hope Chapel in the east has flight masters for both factions."] = "东瘟疫之地位于西瘟疫之地以东，穿过索多里尔河。圣光之愿礼拜堂在东面有双方阵营的飞行管理员。",
	["Ebenezer Rustlocke's Corpse"] = "伊本瑟的尸体",
	["Echeyakee's lair lies south of the Sludge Fen, north-east of the Crossroads. Use the horn Sergra gave you there to call the white lion out. Then hearth to Ratchet."] = "埃其亚基的巢穴位于南的淤泥沼泽，东北的十字路口。使用角瑟格拉·黑棘给的你那里前往召唤白色狮子出。然后炉石返回前往棘齿城。",
	["Echeyakee, a white lion, prowls the plains north of the Razormane camp."] = "埃其亚基，一个白色狮子，潜行游荡平原北的刺鬃营地。",
	["Egan stands by Augustus' hut in Terrordale."] = "埃根站在旁边：被感动的奥古斯图斯的小屋在恐惧谷。",
	["Egan the ghost stands by a hut in Terrordale, in the north-west corner."] = "埃根幽灵站在旁边：一个小屋在恐惧谷，在西北面角落。",
	["Einar Stonegrip"] = "埃纳尔·石钳",
	["Einar Stonegrip camps by the road; Rethiel the Greenwarden stands farther east, by the river."] = "埃纳尔·石钳扎营在路边；绿色守卫者雷希耶尔位于更远处东，在旁河流。",
	["Elaadrin Evengale"] = "艾拉德琳·暮风",
	["Elaadrin Evengale: Denaaris Stargale waits by the Skyborne portal"] = "艾拉德琳·暮风：德纳里斯·星风等候于天裔传送门",
	["Elaine Carevin, at the south end of town"] = "艾莱尼·卡尔文，在南尽头的城镇",
	["Elatrell Featherlight"] = "艾拉特蕾尔·轻羽",
	["Elder Crag Boar"] = "老峭壁野猪",
	["Elder Shadowhorn Stag (53%) in Ashenvale, or wherever the arrow points"] = "老黑角鹿（53%）在灰谷，或跟随箭头指示位置",
	["Elder Stranglethorn Tiger"] = "老年荆棘谷猛虎",
	["Elder Torntusk, at the top of Jintha'Alor"] = "断齿长者，在辛萨罗的顶部",
	["Eleanor camps just south-west of town."] = "埃莉诺·沙克尔顿扎营就在城镇西南面。",
	["Elegael Thornpaw"] = "艾蕾盖尔·棘爪",
	["Elixir of Agony needs a Strong Troll's Blood Potion, an Alchemy item: buy one at the auction house here if you can (or ask an alchemist). No potion: skip the Elixir steps in Hillsbrad."] = "苦楚药剂需要一个强力巨魔之血药水，一个炼金术物品：购买1在拍卖房屋此处如果你可以（或要求一个炼金师）。无药水：跳过药剂台阶在希尔斯布莱德。",
	["Elling Trias, the cheese shop in the Trade District"] = "埃林·提亚斯，奶酪商店在贸易区",
	["Elu"] = "艾鲁",
	["Elu, by the wind rider master"] = "艾鲁，在旁双足飞龙管理员",
	["Elven Gem"] = "精灵宝石",
	["Elwynn Forest is north of Westfall and Duskwood. Goldshire, Northshire Valley and Stormwind's gates are Alliance ground with guards."] = "艾尔文森林是在西部荒野以北与暮色森林。闪金镇，北郡山谷与暴风城的大门是联盟领地与卫兵。",
	["Emissary Jacques"] = "特使雅克",
	["Empty Firewater Flask, a rare drop"] = "空的火酒瓶，稀有掉落",
	["Empty Firewater Flask, a rare drop from the Winterfall furbolgs"] = "空的火酒瓶，由寒冬熊怪稀有掉落",
	["Empty Powder Keg"] = "空火药桶",
	["Enchanting runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 5g 94s in all."] = "附魔可随升级同步练习升级。无限服传承系统奖励制作专业在技能等级150，225与300（中级，高级与大师级上限），因此以上每个阶段节点均计入进度。1-75阶段所需材料总计约需花费5金94银。",
	["Enchanting: disenchant uncommon (green) gear (or the Auction House)"] = "附魔：分解优秀（绿色）装备（或从拍卖行购买）",
	["Encrusted Silithid Object"] = "异种蝎粘液包裹的物体",
	["Encrypted Twilight Texts repeats: Bor Wildmane takes more texts again and again. The cultist camps are the place to farm them."] = "加密的暮光文本可重复：鲍尔·蛮鬃接收更多文本再次与再次。邪教徒扎营是放置前往农场它们。",
	["Endaria Mistgaze"] = "恩达莉亚·雾凝",
	["Ends in the Barrens: keep it"] = "终结于贫瘠之地：请保留该任务/物品",
	["Ends with Donova Snowden in Winterspring: keep it"] = "终结于多诺瓦·雪山在冬泉谷：请保留该任务/物品",
	["Ends with Felnok Steelspring in Everlook, Winterspring: keep it"] = "终结于菲诺克在永望镇，冬泉谷：请保留该任务/物品",
	["Engineering runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 62s in all."] = "工程学可随升级同步练习升级。无限服传承系统奖励制作专业在技能等级150，225与300（中级，高级与大师级上限），因此以上每个阶段节点均计入进度。1-75阶段所需材料总计约需花费62银。",
	["Entropic Beast"] = "热能野兽",
	["Entropic Horror"] = "热能恐兽",
	["Ephram Barbaro"] = "伊弗拉姆·巴巴罗",
	["Era let only Dwarves and Gnomes ride mechanostriders; the Forever client allows every Alliance race."] = "旧世允许仅矮人与侏儒骑行机械陆行鸟；无限服客户端允许每个联盟种族。",
	["Erelas Ambersky"] = "艾瑞拉斯·琥珀",
	["Erelas Ambersky: keep it, the feathers come at the end of the Burning Steppes guide"] = "艾瑞拉斯·琥珀：请保留该任务/物品，羽毛来到在尽头的燃烧平原指南",
	["Eric Brighthammer"] = "埃里克·明锤",
	["Eridan Bluewind"] = "艾瑞丹·蓝风",
	["Eridan's Silver Heart needs an Irontree Heart from northern Felwood and a ride back here. Skip it."] = "艾瑞丹·蓝风的银爪铁心需要一个铁树之心来自北部费伍德森林与一个骑行返回此处。跳过即可。",
	["Ertog Ragetusk"] = "埃尔托格·怒齿",
	["Escort Bareth out of the outpost"] = "护送巴雷斯·晨石离开前哨站",
	["Escort Kerlonian to Maestra's Post in Ashenvale."] = "护送克罗尼亚·恒影前往迈斯特拉岗哨在灰谷。",
	["Escort OOX-09/HL"] = "护送 OOX-09/HL型定位器",
	["Escort OOX-17/TN"] = "护送 OOX-17/TN型定位器",
	["Escort OOX-22/FE"] = "护送自动导航机器人OOX-22/FE",
	["Escort Sentinel Lynessa Duskblossom out of the barrow; Sentinel Kyra Starsong in Dolanaar takes the report."] = "护送哨兵莉妮莎·暮花离开兽穴；哨兵凯拉·星歌在多兰纳尔接收报告。",
	["Escort her out of the glaive; Therysil takes the turn-in in Ashenvale"] = "护送她的离开之剑；瑟瑞希尔负责交接该任务在灰谷",
	["Escort the professor down to the shore. Two Daggerspine naga ambush him on the way: stay close."] = "护送教授下前往岸边。2匕首沼纳迦伏击他在途中：留在靠近。",
	["Escort the professor to the beach north of the cove and guard him while he works; naga attack in waves."] = "护送教授前往海滩在小湾与守卫他当他有效以北；纳迦攻击在波次。",
	["Everlook is the goblin town on the east side of the valley."] = "永望镇是地精城镇在山谷的东侧。",
	["Every Bloodsail drops Snuff and one of them carries Dizzy's eye; the Swashbucklers walk the shore just north of town. The charts and orders lie in the pirate camp on the Wild Shore, south of Booty Bay."] = "每个血帆掉落鼻烟与1的它们携带独眼迪兹的眼睛；南海流氓步行岸边就在城镇北面。海图与命令位于海盗营地在狂野海岸，在藏宝海湾以南。",
	["Every Bloodsail pirate on the southern Stranglethorn coast can drop it, but only about once in 2,500-5,000 kills in our data. Expect a very long grind. The waypoint is the Bloodsail camp north of Booty Bay, among the Swashbucklers and Raiders."] = "每个血帆海盗在南部荆棘谷海岸可以掉落它，但仅约一次在2,500-5,000击杀在我们的数据。预计一个非常长刷怪。路径点是血帆营地在藏宝海湾以北，在其中：南海流氓与狼骑兵波尔克。",
	["Every Wrathtail naga along the strand north of the outpost drops heads."] = "每个怒尾海巫纳迦沿着海滩在前哨站掉落头颅以北。",
	["Every Zanzil follower can drop the mixture; Chucky \"Ten Thumbs\" walks the south of the camp."] = "每个赞吉尔追随者可以掉落混合物；“笨手”查基步行在营地以南。",
	["Every ghoul of the Raven Hill Cemetery's northern half can drop a rib: Flesh Eaters, Bone Chewers, Plague Spreaders and Brain Eaters."] = "每个食尸鬼的乌鸦岭墓地的北部一半可以掉落一个肋骨：食腐者，噬骨者，瘟疫传播者与食脑者。",
	["Exalted with The Defilers earns a Legacy Point."] = "崇拜与污染者获得一个传承点数。",
	["Exalted with each battleground faction is worth a point (4 in all; this page shows three, see the note). Follow the Polestar Reputation guides Warsong Gulch Reputation, Arathi Basin Reputation and Alterac Valley Reputation. The Diplomat Legacy perk increases reputation gains."] = "崇拜与每个战场阵营是价值一个点（4在全部；此书页显示3，查看说明）。沿着 Polestar 声望指南战歌峡谷声望，阿拉希盆地声望与奥特兰克山谷声望。外交家传承特权提高声望提升。",
	["Exalted with the Frostwolf Clan earns a Legacy Point."] = "崇拜与霜狼氏族获得一个传承点数。",
	["Exalted with the League of Arathor earns a Legacy Point."] = "崇拜与阿拉索联军获得一个传承点数。",
	["Exalted with the Silverwing Sentinels earns a Legacy Point."] = "崇拜与银翼哨兵获得一个传承点数。",
	["Exalted with the Stormpike Guard earns a Legacy Point."] = "崇拜与雷矛卫队获得一个传承点数。",
	["Exalted with the Warsong Outriders earns a Legacy Point."] = "崇拜与战歌氏族获得一个传承点数。",
	["Executor Arren"] = "执行官阿伦",
	["Executor Arren, in the church"] = "执行官阿伦，在教堂内",
	["Executor Zygand"] = "执行官塞加德",
	["Expert Cooking raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20: it is a book, Expert Cookbook; the arrow picks its nearest seller for your faction. Buy it and read it."] = "高级烹饪将技能上限提升至225；它需要技能等级125与角色等级20：它是一个书，高级烹饪教材；箭头指向它的最近的商人给你的阵营。购买它与阅读它。",
	["Expert First Aid raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20: it is a book, Expert First Aid - Under Wraps; the arrow picks its nearest seller for your faction. Buy it and read it. The same vendor sells the Heavy Silk and Mageweave Bandage manuals: buy both now, you read them at 180 and 210."] = "高级急救将技能上限提升至225；它需要技能等级125与角色等级20：它是一个书，高级急救教材 - 绷带缚体；箭头指向它的最近的商人给你的阵营。购买它与阅读它。相同商人出售重型作战傀儡丝绸与魔纹绷带手册：购买两个现在，你阅读它们在180与210。",
	["Expert Fishing (cap 225) is a book, not a trainer rank: Old Man Heming sells Expert Fishing - The Bass and You in Booty Bay, at the south tip of Stranglethorn Vale, to both factions. Buy it and read it; it needs skill 125 and level 20."] = "高级钓鱼（上限225）是一个书，不一个训练师等级：老人海明威出售高级钓鱼教材 - 鲈鱼与你在藏宝海湾，在最南端的荆棘谷，前往两个阵营。购买它与阅读它；它需要技能等级125与20级。",
	["Expert Herbalism raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20. The arrow picks the nearest Herbalism trainer of your faction."] = "高级草药学将技能上限提升至225；它需要技能等级125与角色等级20。箭头会自动指向最近的一位草药学训练师的你的阵营。",
	["Expert Mining raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20. The arrow picks the nearest Mining trainer of your faction."] = "高级采矿将技能上限提升至225；它需要技能等级125与角色等级20。箭头会自动指向最近的一位采矿训练师的你的阵营。",
	["Expert Skinning raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20. The arrow picks the nearest Skinning trainer of your faction."] = "高级剥皮将技能上限提升至225；它需要技能等级125与角色等级20。箭头会自动指向最近的一位剥皮训练师的你的阵营。",
	["Expert needs character level 20 and Alchemy 125; it raises the cap to 225. Materials for 150-225 are worth about 4g 19s in all."] = "高级需要角色等级20与炼金术125；它将技能上限提升至225。150-225阶段所需材料总计约需花费4金19银。",
	["Expert needs character level 20 and Blacksmithing 125; it raises the cap to 225. Materials for 150-225 are worth about 31g in all."] = "高级需要角色等级20与锻造125；它将技能上限提升至225。150-225阶段所需材料总计约需花费31金。",
	["Expert needs character level 20 and Enchanting 125; it raises the cap to 225. Materials for 150-225 are worth about 51g in all."] = "高级需要角色等级20与附魔125；它将技能上限提升至225。150-225阶段所需材料总计约需花费51金。",
	["Expert needs character level 20 and Engineering 125; it raises the cap to 225. Materials for 150-225 are worth about 15g in all."] = "高级需要角色等级20与工程学125；它将技能上限提升至225。150-225阶段所需材料总计约需花费15金。",
	["Expert needs character level 20 and Leatherworking 125; it raises the cap to 225. Materials for 150-225 are worth about 40g in all."] = "高级需要角色等级20与制皮125；它将技能上限提升至225。150-225阶段所需材料总计约需花费40金。",
	["Expert needs character level 20 and Tailoring 125; it raises the cap to 225. Materials for 150-225 are worth about 65g in all."] = "高级需要角色等级20与裁缝125；它将技能上限提升至225。150-225阶段所需材料总计约需花费65金。",
	["Exploring the entire world map on one character is a Forever Legacy Challenge (1 account-wide Legacy Point)."] = "探索整个世界地图在1角色是一个无限服传承挑战（1账号通用传承点数）。",
	["Exploring the entire world map on one character is a point, and it can also unlock the Legacy System. It must all be on the same character."] = "探索整个世界地图在1角色是一个点，与它可以也解锁传承系统。它必须全部为在相同角色。",
	["Falaath Village lies south of Shen'dar. Missionary Jasaan meets you at its edge; search the wardrobe in the house behind him."] = "法拉斯村位于辛达尔以南。传教士贾萨恩交汇你在它的边缘；搜索衣柜在房屋后面他。",
	["Faladiel stands on the hill west of the falls, north of Valanaar."] = "法拉迪尔位于山丘在坠落以西，在瓦拉纳尔以北。",
	["Falfindel Waywarder"] = "法芬德尔",
	["Falkhaan Isenstrider, by the stables south of the Abbey"] = "法尔坎·伊森斯泰德，在旁兽栏在修道院以南",
	["Fallen Moonstone"] = "陨落的月亮石",
	["Falling to Corruption is turned in at the Deadwood Cauldron in Felwood, on a later trip."] = "堕落熊怪是交还在死木大锅在费伍德森林，在后续行程中。",
	["Falorne Fallwind"] = "法洛恩·落风",
	["Falstad Wildhammer"] = "弗斯塔德·蛮锤",
	["Fang of Githyiss"] = "吉丝伊斯之牙",
	["Far Seer Mok'thardin"] = "先知摩克萨尔丁",
	["Farmer Dalson"] = "农夫达尔松",
	["Farmer Furlbrow"] = "农夫法布隆",
	["Farmer Saldean"] = "农夫萨丁",
	["Farsen camps on the ridge overlooking the Gol'Bolar Quarry from the west. Talk to him for his farsight."] = "大地先知法森扎营在山脊俯瞰古博拉采掘场来自西。与…交谈他给他的远视。",
	["Faster: fly to Thelsamar in Loch Modan."] = "更快：飞往前往塞尔萨玛在洛克莫丹。",
	["Father Gavin"] = "伽文神父",
	["Feather Charms, from the Frostmane Novices"] = "羽毛咒符，来自霜鬃巨魔新兵",
	["Feather of Jai'vhanel"] = "贾瓦内尔之羽",
	["Feathermoon Stronghold on Sardor Isle is the Alliance town (boat from the Forgotten Coast)."] = "羽月要塞在萨多尔岛是联盟城镇（船来自被遗忘的海岸）。",
	["Feathers for Grazle and Feathers for Nafien (Deadwood Headdress Feathers) and Beads for Salfa (Winterfall Spirit Beads) repeat as often as you like; every Deadwood or Winterfall kill counts as well. Winterfall Village is the densest bead spot."] = "给格拉兹的羽毛与给纳菲恩的羽毛（死木头饰羽毛）与给萨尔法的珠串（冬泉灵魂珠串）重复可无限次重复；每个死木或寒冬击杀计入作为水井。寒水村是最密集的串珠地点。",
	["Feegly the Exiled"] = "被流放的费格雷",
	["Fel Cones lie under the trees all around Dolanaar and Zenn. Nightsabers and Webwood Lurkers keep roaming the road east. Tallonkai's Dresser is in the house on the hill at the east end of the village."] = "魔锥果位于下方树木全部在多兰纳尔周围与赛恩·腐蹄。夜刃豹与树林潜伏者保留游荡的道路东。塔隆凯的衣柜是在房屋在山丘在村庄的东端。",
	["Fel'zerul"] = "费泽鲁尔",
	["Felgur Twocuts"] = "费古尔·双刃",
	["Felgur stands in the post; Takata Steelblade and Maurin Bonesplitter wait on the rise west of it, above the Kodo Graveyard."] = "费古尔·双刃位于岗哨；塔卡塔·钢刃与玛乌林·碎骨等待在高地在它西面，上方科多兽坟场。",
	["Felhound Brain"] = "地狱犬的脑子",
