	["Felnok Steelspring"] = "菲诺克",
	["Felstalkers roam the slope below the cave, on the valley's north side."] = "地狱捕猎者游荡于山坡在洞穴下方，在山谷的北一侧。",
	["Felstone Field Cauldron Key"] = "费尔斯通农场的瘟疫之锅钥匙",
	["Felwood is north of Ashenvale."] = "费伍德森林是在灰谷以北。",
	["Fen Creepers hide in the marsh pools north-west of the Green Belt."] = "沼泽爬行者兽皮在沼泽水池西北的绿带草地。",
	["Fendaal Windstone"] = "芬达尔·风石",
	["Feral Mountain Lion (56%) in Hillsbrad Foothills, or wherever the arrow points"] = "野生山地狮（56%）在希尔斯布莱德丘陵，或跟随箭头指示位置",
	["Field Marshal Oslight's The Battle for Arathi Basin! (assault every base) and Control Four Bases / Control Five Bases are one-time quests; Sergeant Maclear beside him takes Arathi Resource Crates."] = "奥斯莱特元帅的阿拉希盆地之战！（突袭每个基地）与控制四个基地 / 控制五个基地是一次性任务；玛克里尔中士旁边他接收阿拉希资源箱。",
	["Field Marshal Oslight, Refuge Pointe"] = "奥斯莱特元帅，避难谷地",
	["Fight north to the Shrine of Akir. Guardians, Spiritcallers and Blademasters hold the approach; Hyusaa Quickbreeze waits at the shrine's door, Valennia inside the inner sanctum."] = "迎战北前往阿基尔神龛。鸦爪守护者，唤灵师与剑圣仁要塞靠近；休萨·疾风等候于神龛的门，瓦伦妮娅·风暴之拳在内侧圣殿内。",
	["Fill the Empty Brown Waterskin at the quilboar watering hole"] = "装满空的棕色水囊在野猪人水洞",
	["Fill the Empty Red Waterskin at the Spring Well beside the inn"] = "装满空的红色水囊在灵魂之井在旅店旁边",
	["Fill the tube at the moonwell in the village"] = "装满管子在月亮井处在村子里",
	["Fill the vial at the farm's well"] = "装满小瓶在农场水井处",
	["Fill the vial at the well"] = "装满小瓶在水井处",
	["Filled Cursed Ooze Jar"] = "被诅咒的软泥怪样本",
	["Filled Tainted Ooze Jar"] = "被污染的软泥怪样本",
	["Fillion Flamebreeze"] = "菲利奥·焰风",
	["Fin Fizracket"] = "芬·菲兹拉克",
	["Find Fillion and his bedroll"] = "寻找菲利奥·焰风与他的铺盖卷",
	["Find a chicken at Farmer Saldean's farm and type /chicken at it until it offers CLUCK!. Buy Special Chicken Feed from Farmer Saldean, go back, /cheer at the same chicken, then hand in the feed. The chicken lays an egg: loot it for your Chicken Egg pet."] = "寻找一个小鸡在农夫萨丁的农场与类型 /小鸡在它直到它提供咕咕嘎！。购买特殊的鸡饲料来自农夫萨丁，前往返回，/欢呼在相同小鸡，然后上交喂食。小鸡位于一个蛋：拾取它给你的鸡蛋宠物。",
	["Find the Excitable Slime, a critter in the Undercity canals, and /dance with it until it offers WRIGGLE. Buy Nutritious Slime Sludge from a vendor in the canals and bring it back; if the slime seems tired, dance with it again."] = "寻找躁动软泥怪，一个小动物在幽暗城运河，与 /跳舞与它直到它提供蠕动。购买营养丰富的软泥怪淤泥来自一个商人在运河与携带它返回；如果软泥怪看似疲惫的，跳舞与它再次。",
	["Fine Crab Chunks"] = "优质蟹肉",
	["Fine Moonstalker Pelts"] = "优质月夜猛虎毛皮",
	["Finish the wolf heart, cougar femur, plainstrider scale and swoop gizzard on the plains around the village."] = "完成狼心脏，美洲狮股骨，平原陆行鸟鳞片与猛禽砂囊在平原在村庄周围。",
