	["Fish Firefin Snapper School; this is where the data has most of them. The Auction House works too."] = "钓鱼火鳞鳝鱼群；此是在数据有大多数的它们。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Fish Stonescale Eel Swarm; this is where the data has most of them. The Auction House works too."] = "钓鱼石鳞鳗群；此是在数据有大多数的它们。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Fish here until skill 50. Click the bobber when it splashes; every catch can raise the skill."] = "钓鱼此处直到技能等级50。点击鱼漂当它溅起水花；每个捕获可以提升技能。",
	["Fish in Sar'theris Strand, the north-west coast of Desolace (Slitherblade naga shore) until you catch a Sar'theris Striker; it only bites there."] = "钓鱼在萨瑟里斯海岸，西北海岸的凄凉之地（滑刃纳迦岸边）直到你捕获一个萨瑟里斯虎鱼；它仅咬那里。",
	["Fish in the Misty Reed Strand, the south-east shore of Swamp of Sorrows until you catch a Misty Reed Mahi Mahi; it only bites there."] = "钓鱼在芦苇海滩，东南岸边的悲伤沼泽直到你捕获一个芦苇海岸大马哈鱼；它仅咬那里。",
	["Fish in the Savage Coast, the north-west shore of Stranglethorn Vale until you catch a Savage Coast Blue Sailfin; it only bites there."] = "钓鱼在野蛮海岸，西北岸边的荆棘谷直到你捕获一个野人海岸蓝色叉牙鱼；它仅咬那里。",
	["Fish in the Verdantis River in Feralas until you catch a Feralas Ahi; it only bites there."] = "钓鱼在沃丹提斯河在菲拉斯直到你捕获一个菲拉斯草鱼；它仅咬那里。",
	["Fish the pools along the coast here (eels, snappers, wreckage) until skill 300. Booty Bay sells bait and Nightcrawlers for a small fishing bonus."] = "钓鱼水池沿着海岸此处（鳗鱼，咬龟，残骸）直到技能等级300。藏宝海湾出售鱼饵与夜色虫给一个小型钓鱼额外奖励。",
	["Fish the pools and open water here until skill 125. Pools (floating debris, schools of fish) also drop extra loot."] = "钓鱼水池与打开/开启水此处直到技能等级125。水池（漂浮的残骸，鱼群的钓鱼）也掉落额外拾取。",
	["Fish the pools here until skill 225. If fish keep getting away, fish easier water until your skill catches up."] = "钓鱼水池此处直到技能等级225。如果钓鱼保留获取离开，钓鱼更容易水直到你的技能捕获上。",
	["Five feathers buy a little Timbermaw reputation"] = "5羽毛购买一个小木喉声望",
	["Fizzle Brassbolts"] = "菲兹尔·铜栓",
