	["Fizzle Brassbolts: his letter goes to Martek in the Badlands, around level 38"] = "菲兹尔·铜栓：他的信件前往/交给流放者马特克在荒芜之地，周围38级",
	["Fizzle holds the Burning Blade camp on Thunder Ridge, north-west of Razor Hill. Hunters: tame a Dire Mottled Boar with the Taming Rod on the way."] = "菲兹尔·铜栓持有火刃营地在雷霆山，在剃刀岭以西北。猎人：驯服一个可怕的杂斑野猪与驯兽棒在途中。",
	["Fizzule runs the Venture Co. camp at the east end of the Sludge Fen. He attacks strangers: target him and /salute before he does."] = "工头费苏勒通往风险投资公司营地在东尽头的淤泥沼泽。他攻击陌生人：目标他与 /敬礼之前他会。",
