	["Flight paths here: Thalanaar (Thyssiana), Feathermoon (Fyldren Moonfeather)."] = "此处飞行点：萨兰纳尔（赛希亚娜），羽月要塞（菲尔迪恩·月羽）。",
	["Flight paths here: Zoram'gar Outpost (Andruk), Splintertree Post (Vhulgra)."] = "此处飞行点：佐拉姆加前哨站（安德鲁克），碎木岗哨（乌尔格拉）。",
	["Flik"] = "弗里克",
	["Flik sells two frogs (1g each) while the Darkmoon Faire is in town. In Era the Faire sets up south of Goldshire in Elwynn Forest one month and near Thunder Bluff in Mulgore the next; go to whichever is up. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "弗里克出售2青蛙（1金每个）当暗月马戏团是在城镇。在旧世马戏团设置上在闪金镇以南在艾尔文森林1月与在雷霆崖附近在莫高雷下一个；前往任选其一：是上。每个宠物物品传授它的伙伴当你使用它；目标留在勾选随后。",
	["Flint Shadowmore"] = "弗林特·沙多摩尔",
	["Flint Shadowmore at Chillwind Camp: keep it"] = "弗林特·沙多摩尔在冰风岗：请保留该任务/物品",
	["Flute of Xavaric"] = "萨瓦里克长笛",
	["Fly back to the Crossroads. The next guide starts here and takes the road north to the Mor'shan Rampart and Ashenvale."] = "飞往返回前往十字路口。下一个指南始于此处与接收道路北前往莫尔杉农场与灰谷。",
	["Fly from Aerie Peak to Darkshire."] = "飞往来自鹰巢山前往夜色镇。",
	["Fly from Auberdine to Rut'theran Village and take the portal up to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave."] = "飞往来自奥伯丁前往鲁瑟兰村与接取传送门上前往玛斯雷·驭熊者在塞纳里奥区。",
	["Fly from Gadgetzan to Marshal's Refuge. Linken's hut stands at the Lakkari Tar Pits, west of the refuge; J.D. Collie is up the hill behind it."] = "飞往来自加基森前往马绍尔营地。林克的小屋位于拉卡利油沼，在营地以西；科琳是上山丘后面它。",
	["Fly from Gadgetzan to Theramore, take the boat to Menethil Harbor and fly to Ironforge. Train."] = "飞往来自加基森前往塞拉摩，乘船前往米奈希尔港与飞往前往铁炉堡。训练。",
	["Fly from Ironforge to Lakeshire."] = "飞往来自铁炉堡前往湖畔镇。",
	["Fly from Ironforge to Menethil Harbor and take the boat to Auberdine."] = "飞往来自铁炉堡前往米奈希尔港与乘船前往奥伯丁。",
	["Fly from Menethil Harbor to Ironforge and train."] = "飞往来自米奈希尔港前往铁炉堡与训练。",
	["Fly from Nethergarde Keep to Thelsamar."] = "飞往来自守望堡前往塞尔萨玛。",
	["Fly from Ratchet to Zoram'gar Outpost on the Ashenvale coast."] = "飞往来自棘齿城前往佐拉姆加前哨站在灰谷海岸。",
	["Fly from Talonbranch Glade to the Sanctuary's end of the road, or ride south along it."] = "飞往来自刺枝林地前往圣地的尽头的道路，或骑行南沿着它。",
	["Fly from Thelsamar to Ironforge."] = "飞往来自塞尔萨玛前往铁炉堡。",
	["Fly from Thelsamar to Menethil Harbor, take the boat to Auberdine and fly to Rut'theran Village."] = "飞往来自塞尔萨玛前往米奈希尔港，乘船前往奥伯丁与飞往前往鲁瑟兰村。",
	["Fly from Valormok to Orgrimmar, walk out of the main gate to the zeppelin towers and take the zeppelin to Grom'gol."] = "飞往来自瓦罗莫克前往奥格瑞玛，步行离开主大门前往飞艇哨塔与搭乘飞艇前往格罗姆高。",
	["Fly or ride to Stormwind. High Priestess Laurena is in the Cathedral of Light."] = "飞往或骑行前往暴风城。高阶牧师劳瑞娜是在圣光大教堂。",
	["Fly or ride to Stormwind. Ilsa Corbin trains warriors in Old Town; Harry Burlguard and Bartleby stand together by the Pig and Whistle Tavern there. Bartleby fights you for his mug."] = "飞往或骑行前往暴风城。伊尔萨·考宾训练战士在旧城区；哈里·伯加德与巴特莱比位于一起在旁猪和哨声旅店那里。巴特莱比战斗你给他的酒杯。",
	["Fly or ride to Stormwind. Trainers: Old Town (Warriors, Rogues), the Cathedral (Paladins, Priests), the Mage Quarter (Mages, Warlocks), the Park (Druids). Sprite Jumpsprocket works in the Dwarven District."] = "飞往或骑行前往暴风城。训练师：旧城区（战士，潜行者），大教堂（圣骑士，牧师），法师区（法师，术士），公园（德鲁伊）。斯普莱特有效在矮人区。",
	["Fly to Aerie Peak if you have it; otherwise fly to Southshore and walk north-east from Hillsbrad Foothills into the Hinterlands."] = "飞往鹰巢山如果你已解锁/拥有它；否则飞往前往南海镇与步行东北来自希尔斯布莱德丘陵进入辛特兰。",
	["Fly to Aerie Peak. The Hinterlands guide starts here."] = "飞往鹰巢山。辛特兰指南始于此处。",
	["Fly to Camp Mojache. The hippogryph nests are in the south of Feralas; each holds an egg for the Egg-O-Matic."] = "飞往莫沙彻营地。角鹰兽巢是在菲拉斯以南；每个持有一个蛋给自动验蛋器。",
	["Fly to Camp Taurajo and take the road south to the Great Lift at the bottom of the Barrens."] = "飞往陶拉祖营地与沿着道路走南前往升降梯在底部的贫瘠之地。",
	["Fly to Camp Taurajo and walk south through the Barrens to the Great Lift down into Thousand Needles."] = "飞往陶拉祖营地与步行南穿过贫瘠之地前往升降梯下进入千针石林。",
	["Fly to Camp Taurajo. Brine's hut stands on the ridge above the quilboar watering hole south of the camp, on the road to the Great Lift."] = "飞往陶拉祖营地。布瑞恩的小屋位于山脊在野猪人水洞上方在营地以南，在路上前往升降梯。",
	["Fly to Darkshire (or Stormwind) and take the road south out of Duskwood into northern Stranglethorn Vale."] = "飞往夜色镇（或暴风城）与沿着道路走南离开暮色森林进入北部荆棘谷。",
	["Fly to Darkshire and ride east through Deadwind Pass into the Swamp of Sorrows; Watcher Biggs stands by the road just past the border."] = "飞往夜色镇与骑行东穿过逆风小径进入悲伤沼泽；卫兵比格斯位于路边就在经过边界。",
	["Fly to Darkshire: Gryth Thurden in Ironforge's Great Forge, or Dungar Longdrink in Stormwind's Trade District."] = "飞往夜色镇：格莱斯·瑟登在铁炉堡的大锻炉，或杜加尔·朗德瑞克在暴风城的贸易区。",
	["Fly to Freewind Post, ride down the lift east of the post and across the salt flats, then south into Tanaris."] = "飞往乱风岗，骑行下升降梯在岗哨与穿过盐平原以东，然后南进入塔纳利斯。",
	["Fly to Freewind Post, then ride west through the canyons past Whitereach Post; the road climbs into the Feralas jungle and on to Camp Mojache."] = "飞往乱风岗，然后骑行西穿过峡谷经过白沙岗哨；道路爬上进入菲拉斯丛林与在前往莫沙彻营地。",
	["Fly to Freewind Post. Prate Cloudseer hides in a small cave in the canyon wall north-east of the post."] = "飞往乱风岗。普拉特·白云藏身在一个小型洞穴在峡谷城墙在岗哨以东北。",
	["Fly to Gadgetzan."] = "飞往加基森。",
	["Fly to Gadgetzan. The Egg-O-Matic stands in the middle of town."] = "飞往加基森。自动验蛋器位于中间的城镇。",
	["Fly to Marshal's Refuge, then ride south-west through Un'Goro to the pass into Silithus. The next guide opens at Valor's Rest, where the pass comes out."] = "飞往马绍尔营地，然后骑行西南穿过安戈洛环形山前往穿过进入希利苏斯。下一个指南开启在勇气之眠，在穿过来自出。",
	["Fly to Menethil Harbor and take the boat to Auberdine, then the boat on to Rut'theran Village."] = "飞往米奈希尔港与乘船前往奥伯丁，然后船在前往鲁瑟兰村。",
	["Fly to Nethergarde Keep."] = "飞往守望堡。",
	["Fly to Nijel's Point, ride south through Desolace into Feralas and follow the road to the dock on the Forgotten Coast; the boat crosses to Feathermoon Stronghold, where the next guide starts."] = "飞往尼耶尔前哨站，骑行南穿过凄凉之地进入菲拉斯与沿着道路前往前往码头在被遗忘的海岸；船穿过前往羽月要塞，在下一个指南始于。",
	["Fly to Orgrimmar and train before the Grom'gol zeppelin: the Undercity stop later in this guide has no Hunter or Shaman trainer."] = "飞往奥格瑞玛与训练之前格罗姆高飞艇：幽暗城停靠在本指南稍后阶段有无猎人或萨满祭司训练师。",
	["Fly to Orgrimmar and train."] = "飞往奥格瑞玛与训练。",
	["Fly to Orgrimmar and train: the next guide's training stop is the Undercity, which has no Hunter or Shaman trainer. Then fly to Ratchet."] = "飞往奥格瑞玛与训练：下一个指南的训练停靠是幽暗城，其中有无猎人或萨满祭司训练师。然后飞往前往棘齿城。",
	["Fly to Orgrimmar to train your level 20 ranks. Sorek is in the Valley of Honor, Searn Firewarder in the Valley of Wisdom."] = "飞往奥格瑞玛前往训练你的20级军阶。索瑞克是在荣誉谷，希尔恩·火结在智慧谷。",
	["Fly to Orgrimmar to train."] = "飞往奥格瑞玛前往训练。",
	["Fly to Orgrimmar, take the zeppelin to Grom'gol and fly from there to Kargath, built into the cliffs on the Badlands' west edge."] = "飞往奥格瑞玛，搭乘飞艇前往格罗姆高与飞往来自那里前往卡加斯，建于进入悬崖在荒芜之地的西边缘。",
	["Fly to Orgrimmar. The Droffers brothers run their shop in the Drag."] = "飞往奥格瑞玛。德兰·杜佛斯兄弟前往它们的商店在暗巷区。",
	["Fly to Orgrimmar; Belgrom is in the Valley of Honor."] = "飞往奥格瑞玛；贝尔戈洛姆·石槌是在荣誉谷。",
	["Fly to Ratchet."] = "飞往棘齿城。",
	["Fly to Ratchet. Strahad Farsan stands on the hill in town; Islen Waterseer camps on the coast a short ride south of it."] = "飞往棘齿城。斯坦哈德·法尔杉位于山丘在城镇；水之先知伊斯伦扎营在海岸边一个不足骑行在它南面。",
	["Fly to Ratchet; Strahad Farsan teaches in the house by the bank. Fly back to Theramore afterwards."] = "飞往棘齿城；斯坦哈德·法尔杉传授在房屋在银行旁。飞往返回前往塞拉摩随后。",
	["Fly to Revantusk Village if you have it; otherwise fly to Tarren Mill and walk east from Hillsbrad Foothills into the Hinterlands."] = "飞往恶齿村如果你已解锁/拥有它；否则飞往前往塔伦米尔与步行东来自希尔斯布莱德丘陵进入辛特兰。",
	["Fly to Rut'theran Village once more and take the portal up to Mathrengyl, then fly back to Auberdine for the boat."] = "飞往鲁瑟兰村一次更多与接取传送门上前往玛斯雷·驭熊者，然后飞往返回前往奥伯丁给船。",
	["Fly to Sentinel Hill and ride north-west to the coast: the Strange Lockbox lies on the sea floor off the shore. Then ride east along the road through Elwynn to Redridge."] = "飞往哨兵岭与骑行西北前往海岸：奇怪的保险箱位于大海楼层偏离/关闭岸边。然后骑行东沿着道路穿过艾尔文森林前往赤脊山。",
	["Fly to Southshore and ride north up the road toward Alterac: Haggerdin camps at Darrow Hill beside it."] = "飞往南海镇与骑行北顺着道路往上朝奥特兰克方向：哈格丁中尉扎营于达隆山旁边它。",
	["Fly to Southshore in Hillsbrad Foothills and walk north into the Alterac Mountains."] = "飞往南海镇在希尔斯布莱德丘陵与步行北进入奥特兰克山脉。",
	["Fly to Splintertree Post and ride north-west along the road out of Ashenvale into Felwood. The Emerald Sanctuary is the druids' camp just past the border."] = "飞往碎木岗哨与骑行西北沿着道路离开灰谷进入费伍德森林。翡翠圣地是德鲁伊的营地就在经过边界。",
	["Fly to Splintertree Post and ride south down the road to the Mor'shan Rampart."] = "飞往碎木岗哨与骑行南顺着道路前往莫尔杉农场。",
	["Fly to Sun Rock Retreat and take the road south-west into Desolace; Shadowprey Village on the west coast is the Horde town."] = "飞往烈日石居与沿着道路走西南进入凄凉之地；葬影村在西海岸是部落城镇。",
	["Fly to Talrendis Point if you have it, otherwise to Astranaar, and walk east out of Ashenvale into Azshara."] = "飞往塔伦迪斯营地如果你已解锁/拥有它，否则前往阿斯特兰纳，与步行东离开灰谷进入艾萨拉。",
	["Fly to Talrendis Point in Azshara and ride west along the road to Forest Song, just over the Ashenvale border."] = "飞往塔伦迪斯营地在艾萨拉与骑行西沿着道路前往林歌神殿，就在越过灰谷边界。",
	["Fly to Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad Foothills and walk north into the Alterac Mountains."] = "飞往塔伦米尔在希尔斯布莱德丘陵与步行北进入奥特兰克山脉。",
	["Fly to Theramore (or take the boat from Menethil Harbor); Theramore Isle is the Alliance town."] = "飞往塞拉摩（或乘船来自米奈希尔港）；塞拉摩岛是联盟城镇。",
	["Fly to Thunder Bluff and train with Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise, then fly to Orgrimmar for the Grom'gol zeppelin."] = "飞往雷霆崖与训练与图拉克·符文图腾在长者高地，然后飞往前往奥格瑞玛给格罗姆高飞艇。",
	["Fly to Thunder Bluff and train with Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise, then fly to Ratchet."] = "飞往雷霆崖与训练与图拉克·符文图腾在长者高地，然后飞往前往棘齿城。",
	["Fly to Thunder Bluff and train your level 20 ranks: Turak Runetotem is on Elder Rise."] = "飞往雷霆崖与训练你的20级军阶：图拉克·符文图腾是在长者高地。",
	["Fly to Thunder Bluff from Shadowprey and train with Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise, then fly on to Orgrimmar."] = "飞往雷霆崖来自葬影村与训练与图拉克·符文图腾在长者高地，然后飞往在前往奥格瑞玛。",
	["Fly to Thunder Bluff to train: Turak Runetotem is on Elder Rise."] = "飞往雷霆崖前往训练：图拉克·符文图腾是在长者高地。",
	["Fly to Thunder Bluff: Turak Runetotem trains you on Elder Rise. Skyborne: fly back to Orgrimmar for the zeppelin afterwards."] = "飞往雷霆崖：图拉克·符文图腾训练你在长者高地。天裔：飞往返回前往奥格瑞玛给飞艇随后。",
	["Fly to Thunder Bluff; it is on the way to Camp Mojache. No flight path there yet? Fly to Camp Taurajo and ride west through Mulgore. Hamuul and Magatha are on the Elder Rise; Druids and Paladins train here (Turak Runetotem, Alodan the Hopeful)."] = "飞往雷霆崖；它是在途中前往莫沙彻营地。无飞行点那里尚? 飞往陶拉祖营地与骑行西穿过莫高雷。大德鲁伊哈缪尔·符文图腾与玛加萨·野性图腾是在长者高地；德鲁伊与圣骑士训练此处（图拉克·符文图腾，怀抱希望的阿洛丹）。",
	["Fly to Valormok if you have it, otherwise to Splintertree Post, and walk east out of Ashenvale into Azshara."] = "飞往瓦罗莫克如果你已解锁/拥有它，否则前往碎木岗哨，与步行东离开灰谷进入艾萨拉。",
	["Fly to the Undercity, take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar and fly on to Thunder Bluff."] = "飞往幽暗城，搭乘飞艇前往奥格瑞玛与飞往在前往雷霆崖。",
	["Follow Ashenvale's road north-west to the coast and into Darkshore, Alliance country with guards at Auberdine."] = "沿着灰谷的道路西北前往海岸与进入黑海岸，联盟领地与卫兵在奥伯丁。",
	["Follow Darkshore's coast road south into Ashenvale. Astranaar is the Alliance town."] = "沿着黑海岸的海岸道路南进入灰谷。阿斯特兰纳是联盟城镇。",
	["Follow Donova's directions to the mouth of Darkwhisper Gorge, past the Frostmaul giants: pass them one at a time."] = "沿着多诺瓦的方向指引前往入口/河口的暗语峡谷，经过霜槌巨人：穿过它们1在一个时间。",
	["Follow the Gold Road south to Camp Taurajo."] = "沿着金币道路南前往陶拉祖营地。",
	["Follow the Polestar Exploration guides: Exploration: Eastern Kingdoms 1-30, 30-45 and 45-60, and Exploration: Kalimdor 1-30, 30-45 and 45-60. They track every area as you discover it."] = "沿着 Polestar 地图探索指南：地图探索：东部王国1-30，30-45与45-60，与地图探索：卡利姆多1-30，30-45与45-60。它们追踪每个区域作为你探索发现它。",
	["Follow the Polestar guide \"Blacksmithing 1-300\" (Professions)."] = "沿着 Polestar 指南 \"锻造1-300\"（专业技能）。",
	["Follow the Polestar guide \"Enchanting 1-300\" (Professions)."] = "沿着 Polestar 指南 \"附魔1-300\"（专业技能）。",
	["Follow the Polestar guide \"Engineering 1-300\" (Professions)."] = "沿着 Polestar 指南 \"工程学1-300\"（专业技能）。",
	["Follow the Polestar guide \"Leatherworking 1-300\" (Professions)."] = "沿着 Polestar 指南 \"制皮1-300\"（专业技能）。",
	["Follow the Polestar guide \"Tailoring 1-300\" (Professions)."] = "沿着 Polestar 指南 \"裁缝1-300\"（专业技能）。",
	["Follow the canyon east out of the mesas onto the salt flats. The goblins and gnomes of the Mirage Raceway are neutral and give quests to both factions."] = "沿着峡谷东离开台地登上盐平原。地精与侏儒的沙漠赛道是中立与交给任务前往两个阵营。",
	["Follow the canyon west to Whitereach Post."] = "沿着峡谷西前往白沙岗哨。",
	["Follow the canyons east to the salt flats. The goblins and gnomes of the Mirage Raceway are neutral and give quests to both factions."] = "沿着峡谷东前往盐平原。地精与侏儒的沙漠赛道是中立与交给任务前往两个阵营。",
	["Follow the cliffs south to Dreadmaul Rock, the Firegut ogres' hill. Sha'ni Proudtusk's remains lie at its foot."] = "沿着悬崖南前往巨槌石，火腹食人魔的山丘。沙妮·长齿的遗骸位于它的山脚。",
	["Follow the coast north out of Menethil. Bluegill Murlocs fill the marsh; Gobbler walks with a pack in the middle of it."] = "沿着海岸北离开米奈希尔。蓝腮鱼人装满沼泽；高布勒尔步行与一个包在中间的它。",
	["Follow the coast north to the Zoram Strand. Talen camps on the beach; Wrathtail nagas fill the shore."] = "沿着海岸北前往佐拉姆暗滩唤魔师。塔尔伦扎营在海滩上；怒尾海巫纳迦装满岸边。",
	["Follow the coast north to the wrecked ship. Cursed Sailors walk the beach, Cursed Marines the deck; First Mate Snellig stands on the beach by the bow. Giant Wetlands Crocolisks lurk on the coast just north of it."] = "沿着海岸北前往失事的船。被诅咒的水手步行海滩，被诅咒的水兵甲板；大副斯涅利格位于海滩上在旁弓。巨型湿地鳄鱼潜伏在海岸边就在它北面。",
	["Follow the coast north-east past the wreck: the Bluegill Raiders hold the marsh beyond the Giant Crocolisks."] = "沿着海岸东北经过残骸：蓝鳃掠夺者要塞沼泽越过巨型鳄鱼。",
	["Follow the coast north-east to the Ruins of Mathystra. Mathystra Relics lie among the ruins; Stormscale Myrmidons, Sorceresses and Warriors hold them."] = "沿着海岸东北前往玛塞斯特拉废墟。玛塞斯特拉遗物位于其中：废墟；雷鳞侍从，女巫与战士要塞它们。",
	["Follow the coast south past Ameth'Aran: one Beached Sea Creature lies on the shore west of the Grove, another further south near Remtravel's Excavation."] = "沿着海岸南经过亚米萨兰：1搁浅的海洋生物位于岸边在树林以西，另一个更远处南在雷姆塔维尔挖掘场附近。",
	["Follow the coast south to the pirate cove. Southsea pirates crowd the beach and the boats: work along the edge and pull one at a time. Andre Firebeard stands on the far side; Stoley's stolen cargo lies in the camp."] = "沿着海岸南前往海盗小湾。南海流氓海盗怪群海滩与船：有效沿着边缘与拉怪1在一个时间。安德雷·费尔比德位于远处一侧；斯杜雷的被盗的货物位于营地里。",
	["Follow the coast south. The naga explorers wade along the shore and carry the reed bundles; the Holy Spring bubbles in the hills just east of them."] = "沿着海岸南。纳迦探险家涉水沿着岸边与携带芦苇捆；神圣泉水冒泡在丘陵就在它们东面。",
	["Follow the hills north to the Cliffspring River and up to the falls. Three more beached remains lie on the north shore: near the Ruins of Mathystra, north of Bashal'Aran and west of Bashal'Aran."] = "沿着丘陵北前往壁泉河与上前往坠落。3更多搁浅的遗骸位于北岸边：附近玛塞斯特拉废墟，在巴莎兰以北与在巴莎兰以西。",
	["Follow the hills south to the tower, on the road west."] = "沿着丘陵南前往哨塔，在路上西。",
	["Follow the hills south to the tower."] = "沿着丘陵南前往哨塔。",
	["Follow the lake shore south-east and swim out to Fenris Isle. Rot Hide gnolls cover the island; every type drops ichor. Stay out of Fenris Keep on its north side unless you go for the optional niche: the gnolls there are level 18-22."] = "沿着湖岸边东南与游泳出前往芬里斯岛。腐烂兽皮豺狼人掩护岛屿；每个类型掉落脓液。留在离开芬里斯城堡在它的北一侧除非你前往给可选壁龛：豺狼人那里是18-22级。",
	["Follow the main road east past Astranaar (Alliance: keep to the road). Ursangous, a big grizzly, roams the Ruins of Stardust south of the road, west of Mystral Lake. His paw starts the next hunt quest."] = "沿着主道路东经过阿斯特兰纳（联盟：保留前往道路）。乌萨苟斯，一个大灰熊，游荡于星尘废墟在道路以南，在密斯特拉湖以西。他的爪始于下一个狩猎任务。",
	["Follow the main road south the length of the jungle, past the Grom'gol turn-off, to Booty Bay on the southern cape."] = "沿着主道路南长度的丛林，经过格罗姆高交还-偏离/关闭，前往藏宝海湾在南部海角。",
	["Follow the path north into Deathknell; Sarvis stands in front of the church."] = "沿路线前进北进入丧钟镇；暗影牧师萨维斯位于教堂前面。",
	["Follow the path north to the mine. Kobold Workers swarm outside it; every kobold in the valley can drop the Stolen Books."] = "沿路线前进北前往采矿。狗头人劳工虫群外部它；每个狗头人在山谷可以掉落被盗的书籍。",
	["Follow the path south out of camp to the Seer's tent at the foot of the hills."] = "沿路线前进南出的营地前往先知的帐篷在丘陵的底部。",
	["Follow the river north-west to the Westbrook Garrison, by the road to Westfall. Deputy Rainer stands outside the barracks."] = "沿着河流西北前往西泉要塞，在路边前往西部荒野。瑞尼尔副队长位于兵营外。",
	["Follow the road all the way east to the South Gate Outpost at the Loch Modan tunnel."] = "沿着道路前往全部路东前往南门哨岗在洛克莫丹隧道。",
	["Follow the road along the south shore of Lake Everstill to the gryphon master. Deputy Feldon and Guard Howe stand by the road next to her."] = "沿着道路前往沿着南岸边的止水湖前往狮鹫管理员。菲尔顿副队长与卫兵豪维位于路边下一个前往她的。",
	["Follow the road east across the zone to the chapel."] = "沿着道路前往东穿过区域前往礼拜堂。",
	["Follow the road east along the river, then north-east up into the hills to Tarren Mill."] = "沿着道路前往东沿着河流，然后东北上进入丘陵前往塔伦米尔。",
	["Follow the road east back to Theramore. Tervosh, Lady Jaina and the officers are in the tower and Foothold Citadel."] = "沿着道路前往东返回前往塞拉摩。大法师特沃什，雷蒂吉安娜·普罗德摩尔与军官是在哨塔内与塞拉摩堡垒。",
	["Follow the road east out of Hillsbrad over Thoradin's Wall to Refuge Pointe."] = "沿着道路前往东离开希尔斯布莱德越过索拉丁之墙前往避难谷地。",
	["Follow the road east out of the valley to Sen'jin Village on the coast."] = "沿着道路前往东离开山谷前往森金村在海岸边。",
	["Follow the road east past the Tower of Azora to the bridge."] = "沿着道路前往东经过阿祖拉之塔前往桥。",
	["Follow the road east past the depot to Misty Pine Refuge."] = "沿着道路前往东经过补给站前往雾松避难所。",
	["Follow the road east through the Western Plaguelands and across the river into the Eastern Plaguelands; leave it north for Terrordale, the ruined town in the north-west. Augustus sits in a hut at its edge."] = "沿着道路前往东穿过西瘟疫之地与穿过河流进入东瘟疫之地；可先放着不做北给恐惧谷，毁坏的城镇在西北面。被感动的奥古斯图斯位于一个小屋在它的边缘。",
	["Follow the road east to Brill. Junior Apothecary Holland stands at the north-west edge of town; the Gallows' End Tavern is the big inn in the middle, with Executor Zygand in front of it."] = "沿着道路前往东前往布瑞尔。初级药剂师霍兰德位于西北边缘的城镇；Gallows的尽头酒馆是大旅店在中间，与执行官塞加德在前方的它。",
	["Follow the road east to the Howling Vale; Shael'dryn stands by the moonwell."] = "沿着道路前往东前往狼嚎谷；莎尔蒂恩站在旁边：月亮井。",
	["Follow the road east to the excavation site."] = "沿着道路前往东前往挖掘场地点。",
	["Follow the road east to the outpost above the Southfury River. Crossroads Conscription follows Conscript of the Horde from Razor Hill, so only Orcs, Trolls and Tauren are sent here."] = "沿着道路前往东前往前哨站上方怒水河。十字路口征兵接续部落的新兵来自剃刀岭，因此仅兽人，巨魔与牛头人是派往此处。",
	["Follow the road east to the satyr camps of Xavian; Anilia hides at their edge."] = "沿着道路前往东前往萨特扎营的萨维亚；安妮莉亚藏身在它们的边缘。",
	["Follow the road east. Bleeding Horrors and Wandering Spirits haunt the graves on the east side of the farmstead, where the Tomb Weed grows."] = "沿着道路前往东。可怕的血僵尸与游荡的幽灵出没坟墓在农庄的东侧，在墓地苔生长。",
	["Follow the road east. Young Wetlands Crocolisks lurk in the pools north of the excavation site."] = "沿着道路前往东。湿地鳄鱼幼崽潜伏在水池在挖掘场地点以北。",
	["Follow the road north from Goldshire into Stormwind. Duthorian Rall and Gazin Tenorm are in the Cathedral of Light; Stephanie Turner stands in Old Town and asks for ten Linen Cloth (humanoids drop it; the Auction House sells it)."] = "沿着道路前往北来自闪金镇进入暴风城。达索瑞恩·拉尔与贾森·坦诺姆是在圣光大教堂；斯蒂芬妮·特纳位于旧城区与需要10亚麻布（人形生物掉落它；拍卖行出售它）。",
	["Follow the road north from Goldshire into Stormwind. Gakin the Darkbinder waits in the cellar of the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter."] = "沿着道路前往北来自闪金镇进入暴风城。黑暗缚灵者加科因等候于地窖的已宰的羔羊旅店，在法师区。",
	["Follow the road north out of Grom'gol; Nesingwary's hunting camp sits on the hill north-east of the river. From here on, keep every page of The Green Hills of Stranglethorn you loot: Barnil asks for them later."] = "沿着道路前往北离开格罗姆高；赫米特·奈辛瓦里二世的狩猎营地位于山丘在河流以东北。来自此处在，保留每个书页的荆棘谷的青山你拾取：巴尼尔·石罐需要它们稍后。",
	["Follow the road north out of Red Cloud Mesa. Kaga Wildhoof waits on the road just south of Bloodhoof Village; build the campfire next to her."] = "沿着道路前往北离开红云台地。卡加·狂蹄等候在路上就在血蹄村以南；建造营火下一个前往她的。",
	["Follow the road north out of Silverpine into Tirisfal Glades and east to the zeppelin towers outside the Ruins of Lordaeron. Take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar."] = "沿着道路前往北离开银松森林进入提瑞斯法林地与东前往飞艇哨塔外部洛丹伦废墟。搭乘飞艇前往奥格瑞玛。",
	["Follow the road north out of Silverpine into Tirisfal Glades and on to Brill: Shari Stilwell trains Paladins there. The zeppelin towers are a short walk south down the road."] = "沿着道路前往北离开银松森林进入提瑞斯法林地与在前往布瑞尔：莎莉·斯蒂尔维尔训练圣骑士那里。飞艇哨塔是一个不足步行南顺着道路。",
	["Follow the road north out of Southshore into the mountains. Mountain lions roam the slopes; the Syndicate in Strahnbrad wear the signet rings, and Baron Vardus walks the manor grounds on the north side of town."] = "沿着道路前往北离开南海镇进入山脉。山脉狮子游荡于山坡；辛迪加在斯坦恩布莱德佩戴印戒戒指，与巴隆·瓦杜斯步行庄园领地在北一侧的城镇。",
	["Follow the road north out of Tarren Mill into the Alterac foothills. Valik waits by the Syndicate camp; hand him the stout."] = "沿着道路前往北离开塔伦米尔进入奥特兰克丘陵。仆从瓦里克等候于辛迪加营地；上交他强壮的。",
	["Follow the road north to Dun Modr, at the foot of the Thandol Span. Longbraid the Grim stands in the dwarves' camp."] = "沿着道路前往北前往丹莫德，在山脚的萨多尔大桥。布莱德·长须位于矮人的营地。",
	["Follow the road north to Irontree Woods. The Irontree Stompers carry the heart; finish the claws on the Angerclaw Grizzlies and Felpaw Ravagers of the north."] = "沿着道路前往北前往铁木森林。铁木践踏者携带心脏；完成爪在怒爪灰熊与魔爪掠夺者的北。",
	["Follow the road north to Nijel's Point."] = "沿着道路前往北前往尼耶尔前哨站。",
	["Follow the road north to Razor Hill."] = "沿着道路前往北前往剃刀岭。",
	["Follow the road north to Valormok, the Horde camp."] = "沿着道路前往北前往瓦罗莫克，部落营地。",
	["Follow the road north to the Mor'shan Rampart; Wenikee stands just south of it."] = "沿着道路前往北前往莫尔杉农场；维妮·布特巴克位于就在它南面。",
	["Follow the road north to the camp."] = "沿着道路前往北前往营地。",
	["Follow the road north to the cave mouth of Timbermaw Hold; Nafien guards it."] = "沿着道路前往北前往洞穴入口/河口的木喉要塞；纳菲恩卫兵它。",
	["Follow the road north to the cratered vale and walk to each crater, killing the Entropic Beasts and Horrors between them."] = "沿着道路前往北前往环形山山谷与步行前往每个环形山，击杀热能野兽与可怕的血僵尸之间它们。",
	["Follow the road north to the draenei of the Harborage."] = "沿着道路前往北前往德莱尼的庇护所。",
	["Follow the road north toward Orgrimmar. Rezlak camps beside it; the stolen sacks lie along the road south of him."] = "沿着道路前往北朝奥格瑞玛方向。雷兹拉克扎营旁边它；被盗的麻袋位于沿着道路在他南面。",
	["Follow the road north toward Stonetalon Peak. Antlered Coursers graze along the way; the Sap Beasts, Twilight Runners and Fey Dragons roam the woods below the Peak, and the Cenarion druids hold the grove there."] = "沿着道路前往北朝石爪峰方向。巨角鹿吃草沿途；腐蚀兽，夜行虎与灵龙游荡于树林在山峰下方，与塞纳里奥使者安亚·碧月德鲁伊要塞树林那里。",
	["Follow the road north-east from Brill past Brightwater Lake. Captain Melrache and his two Scarlet Bodyguards hold the Scarlet watchtower on the north-east coast, north of the Scarlet Watch Post: pull the bodyguards first."] = "沿着道路前往东北来自布瑞尔经过明镜湖。麦拉其队长与他的2血色保镖要塞血色哨塔在东北海岸，北的血色十字军哨岗：拉怪保镖第一。",
	["Follow the road north-east from Kharanos to the depot below the Ironforge road."] = "沿着道路前往东北来自卡拉诺斯前往补给站下方铁炉堡道路。",
	["Follow the road north-east to Irontree Woods. The Warpwood Moss Flayers and Shredders on the east side of the woods each carry a Blood Amber; Angerclaw Grizzlies and Felpaw Ravagers roam the same woods for Talo."] = "沿着道路前往东北前往铁木森林。曲木食苔者与维兹克兰克的伐木机在树林每个携带一个的东侧血琥珀；怒爪灰熊与魔爪掠夺者游荡于相同树林给塔罗·刺蹄。",
	["Follow the road north-east to the Venture Co. camp at the Crystalvein Mine; the miners, surveyors and foremen drop the crystals."] = "沿着道路前往东北前往风险投资公司营地在水晶矿洞；矿工，勘测员与工头掉落水晶。",
	["Follow the road north-east to the Yoricks' house at Malden's Orchard."] = "沿着道路前往东北前往奎恩·尤瑞克的房屋在玛尔丁果园。",
	["Follow the road north-west out of Theramore to the watchtower at Sentry Point. Mudrock Burrowers roam the marsh around it."] = "沿着道路前往西北离开塞拉摩前往哨塔在警戒哨岗。泥石穴居龟游荡于沼泽周围它。",
	["Follow the road north-west past the cemetery to Sven's camp on the far west edge of the forest. Lars stands beside Sven."] = "沿着道路前往西北经过墓园前往斯温·约根的营地在远处西边缘的森林。拉尔斯位于斯温·约根旁边。",
	["Follow the road north-west to Agamand Mills. Devlin Agamand walks the graveyard south of the mills; Nissa, Gregor and Thurman Agamand haunt the mills themselves. Rattlecage and Cracked Skull Soldiers drop the ribs, Darkeye Bonecasters the skulls, and any of them may drop A Letter to Yvette. From here on, kill the Duskbats and Darkhounds you pass: Shelene wants their wings and hides."] = "沿着道路前往西北前往阿加曼德磨坊。代弗林·阿加曼德步行墓地在磨坊以南；尼莎·火石，格雷戈·格雷斯通与萨尔曼·阿加曼德出没磨坊它们自己。脆骨与碎颅士兵掉落肋骨，暗眼骷髅法师头颅，与任意的它们可能掉落给伊维特的信。来自此处在，击杀夜行蝙蝠与饥饿的黑暗犬你穿过：舍伦尼·洛巴尔特需要它们的翅膀与藏身。",
	["Follow the road north-west. The south of Jaedenar, around its corrupted moonwell, is held by Shadow Council cultists, adepts, guardsmen and their hounds."] = "沿着道路前往西北。在加德纳尔以南，周围它的腐化的月亮井，是持有在旁暗影议会邪教徒，教徒，卫兵与它们的猎犬。",
	["Follow the road north."] = "沿着道路前往北。",
	["Follow the road north. Farmer Saldean stands outside, Salma in the house, Ozwin Ironsprocket in the barn to the west."] = "沿着道路前往北。农夫萨丁位于外部，萨尔玛·萨丁在房屋，奥兹温·铁齿轮在谷仓向西。",
	["Follow the road north; Martek's camp is on the way."] = "沿着道路前往北；流放者马特克的营地是在途中。",
	["Follow the road on south into Booty Bay."] = "沿着道路前往在南进入藏宝海湾。",
	["Follow the road south back to Brill."] = "沿着道路前往南返回前往布瑞尔。",
	["Follow the road south from Three Corners into Duskwood; Darkshire lies on the east side of the forest."] = "沿着道路前往南来自三角路口进入暮色森林；夜色镇位于森林的东侧。",
	["Follow the road south out of Goldshire to the Maclure Vineyards. Maybell waits by the house."] = "沿着道路前往南离开闪金镇前往马科伦农场。梅贝尔·马科伦等候于房屋。",
	["Follow the road south out of the valley to Goldshire. Innkeeper Farley is in the Lion's Pride Inn; Marshal Dughan stands outside the smithy across the road, William Pestle at the inn's front and Remy \"Two Times\" by the road south of it."] = "沿着道路前往南离开山谷前往闪金镇。旅店老板法雷是在狮子的狮群旅店；治安官杜汉位于铁匠铺穿过道路外，威廉·匹斯特在旅店的前方与雷米在路边在它南面。",
	["Follow the road south over the bridge to Dun Modr at the Wetlands end, where Rhag Garmason waits."] = "沿着道路前往南越过桥前往丹莫德在湿地尽头，在拉格·加玛森等候。",
	["Follow the road south to Booty Bay at the southern tip of the vale and enter through the tunnel in the cliffs. Stay on the road: the jungle beside it is well above your level. Gringer, the Horde flight master, waits on the upper deck."] = "沿着道路前往南前往藏宝海湾在最南端的山谷与进入穿过隧道在悬崖。留在路上：丛林旁边它是水井上方你的等级。格林戈，部落飞行管理员，等候于上层甲板。",
	["Follow the road south to Grom'gol."] = "沿着道路前往南前往格罗姆高。",
	["Follow the road south to Kormek's Hut."] = "沿着道路前往南前往考米克小屋。",
	["Follow the road south to Shen'dar Village, in the middle of the isle."] = "沿着道路前往南前往申达尔村，在岛的中央。",
	["Follow the road south to Shen'dar Village. Raan Wildwind camps by the fire west of the village; Constable Aonda and Rathiril Sunlance stand in its middle."] = "沿着道路前往南前往申达尔村。拉恩·狂风扎营在旁营火在村庄以西；治安官奥恩达与拉希瑞尔·日枪位于它的中间。",
	["Follow the road south to the dwarf dig site at Bael Modan. Feegly the Exiled hides at the south edge of the dig; General Twinbraid's Strongbox sits at the bottom of the excavation."] = "沿着道路前往南前往矮人挖掘地点在巴尔莫丹。被流放的费格雷藏身在挖掘的南边缘；塔文布莱德将军的保险箱位于挖掘场的底部。",
	["Follow the road south-east from Brill past the zeppelin towers. Linnea, Kristof and Shelene Rhobart camp by the road."] = "沿着道路前往东南来自布瑞尔经过飞艇哨塔。亡灵卫兵林奈，克里斯托夫与舍伦尼·洛巴尔特营地在路边。",
	["Follow the road south-east to Astranaar, on the island in the lake."] = "沿着道路前往东南前往阿斯特兰纳，在岛屿在湖。",
	["Follow the road south-east to Ratchet on the coast."] = "沿着道路前往东南前往棘齿城在海岸边。",
	["Follow the road south-west from Brill to the Scarlet Crusade camp. Captain Perrine stands at its south end; every Scarlet there can drop a ring."] = "沿着道路前往西南来自布瑞尔前往血色十字军营地。派瑞恩队长位于它的南尽头；每个血色那里可以掉落一个戒指。",
	["Follow the road south-west from Far Watch Post to the Crossroads. The Barrens guide starts here."] = "沿着道路前往西南来自前沿哨所前往十字路口。贫瘠之地指南始于此处。",
	["Follow the road south-west out of Shadowglen to Dolanaar."] = "沿着道路前往西南离开幽影谷前往多兰纳尔。",
	["Follow the road south-west out of Sun Rock into Desolace and on south past Nijel's Point. Cork Gizelton's kodo caravan waits by the road north of Kolkar Village; if it has already left, ride on."] = "沿着道路前往西南离开烈日石居进入凄凉之地与在南经过尼耶尔前哨站。考克·基泽尔顿的科多兽商队等候在路边在科尔卡村以北；如果它有已经左侧，骑行在。",
	["Follow the road south-west out of the pass to Cenarion Hold."] = "沿着道路前往西南离开穿过前往塞纳里奥要塞。",
	["Follow the road south. Onu is the ancient at the Grove; Arbal and Kerlonian Evershade sleep beside him."] = "沿着道路前往南。安努是远古在树林；阿巴尔与克罗尼亚·恒影睡眠旁边他。",
	["Follow the road south. The Dalaran Crate sits beside it, north of Pyrewood."] = "沿着道路前往南。达拉然木箱位于旁边它，在焚木村以北。",
	["Follow the road south; the basilisks bask on the rocks east of it in the middle of the jungle. Their shards drop often."] = "沿着道路前往南；石化蜥蜴晒太阳在岩石在它东面在丛林的中央。它们的碎片掉落经常。",
	["Follow the road through the tunnel and north-east to Kharanos. Senir Whitebeard, Eric Brighthammer and his campfire are outside the Thunderbrew Distillery; Tannok, Maxan and Ragnar are inside; Tharek Blackstone works the forge."] = "沿着道路前往穿过隧道与东北前往卡拉诺斯。森内尔·白须，埃里克·明锤与他的营火是外部雷酒酿制厂；塔诺克·霜锤，马克萨恩·安沃尔与拉格纳·雷酒是内部；萨雷克·黑石有效锻炉。",
	["Follow the road up to Ironforge and take the Mystic Ward: Brandur Ironhammer, Tiza Battleforge and Muiredon Battleforge are in the Hall of Mysteries. John Turner, a beggar, wanders the city. He asks for ten Linen Cloth: the troggs and trolls of Dun Morogh drop it, and the Auction House sells it."] = "沿着道路前往上前往铁炉堡与接取秘法区：布兰度尔·铁锤，蒂萨·热炉与穆里顿·热炉是在秘法大厅。约翰·特纳，一个乞丐，游荡主城。他需要10亚麻布：穴居人与巨魔的丹莫罗掉落它，与拍卖行出售它。",
	["Follow the road up to Ironforge and train with your class trainer. The Deeprun Tram leaves from Tinker Town, in the east of the city. Ride it to Stormwind."] = "沿着道路前往上前往铁炉堡与训练与你的职业训练师。矿道地铁离开来自工匠区，在主城以东。骑行它前往暴风城。",
	["Follow the road west across the north of Desolace to the ruins of Ethel Rethor; the wrecked ship's chest lies on the shore just west of them."] = "沿着道路前往西穿过在凄凉之地以北前往废墟的艾瑟雷索；失事的船的箱子位于岸边就在它们西面。",
	["Follow the road west back to Goldshire."] = "沿着道路前往西返回前往闪金镇。",
	["Follow the road west back to Goldshire; Helene and Jason stand on the lake shore before town."] = "沿着道路前往西返回前往闪金镇；海伦尼·派特斯金纳与贾森·玛瑟斯位于湖岸边之前城镇。",
	["Follow the road west from Hillsbrad past Southpoint Tower into Silverpine Forest, Horde country with Horde guards at the Sepulcher."] = "沿着道路前往西来自希尔斯布莱德经过南点哨塔进入银松森林，部落领地与部落卫兵在瑟伯切尔。",
	["Follow the road west from Razor Hill over the Southfury River bridge; Far Watch Post sits just above it on the Barrens side."] = "沿着道路前往西来自剃刀岭越过怒水河桥；前沿哨所位于就在上方它在贫瘠之地一侧。",
	["Follow the road west into Darnassus. Mydrannul stands on the Craftsmen's Terrace just inside the city; Sister Aquinne is in the west of the city, on the way to the pink portal down to Rut'theran."] = "沿着道路前往西进入达纳苏斯。迈德兰努尔位于工匠阶地就在主城内；艾奎恩妮是在主城以西，在途中前往粉色传送门下前往鲁瑟兰村。",
	["Follow the road west out of Astranaar; Maestra's Post lies north of it."] = "沿着道路前往西离开阿斯特兰纳；迈斯特拉岗哨位于它北面。",
	["Follow the road west past Agamand Mills to the Whispering Forest. Leonid stands just north of Hilda's camp."] = "沿着道路前往西经过阿加曼德磨坊前往耳语森林。莱尼德·巴萨罗梅位于就在破城者希尔达的以北营地。",
	["Follow the road west past Sun Rock Retreat (Horde) and south-west through the Charred Vale into Desolace; Nijel's Point stands at the top of the pass."] = "沿着道路前往西经过烈日石居（部落）与西南穿过焦炭谷进入凄凉之地；尼耶尔前哨站位于穿过的顶部。",
	["Follow the road west past Westbrook into Westfall, then south along it to Sentinel Hill. Thor, the gryphon master, stands on the hill."] = "沿着道路前往西经过西泉要塞进入西部荒野，然后南沿着它前往哨兵岭。索尔，狮鹫管理员，位于山丘。",
	["Follow the road west to Donova's camp beside the hot springs."] = "沿着道路前往西前往多诺瓦的营地在热温泉旁边。",
	["Follow the road west to Sun Rock Retreat."] = "沿着道路前往西前往烈日石居。",
	["Follow the road west, then climb north to the goblin camp on Flame Crest."] = "沿着道路前往西，然后爬上北前往地精营地在烈焰峰。",
	["Follow the roads east across the Hinterlands to the troll village on the eastern coast."] = "沿着道路东穿过辛特兰前往巨魔村庄在东部海岸。",
	["Follow the shore west past Southshore's bay; the Torn Fin murlocs camp on the beaches beyond it."] = "沿着岸边西经过南海镇的海湾；破鳍鱼人营地在海滩越过它。",
	["Follow the southern road east into the Eastern Plaguelands; the ruins of Darrowshire lie south of it. Pamela's ghost plays by the ruined house at the south end."] = "沿着南部道路东进入东瘟疫之地；废墟的达隆郡位于它南面。帕米拉的幽灵进行在旁毁坏的房屋在南尽头。",
	["Follow the west coast north; the haunted island lies off the shore west of Nesingwary's camp. Just reach it."] = "沿着西海岸北；闹鬼的岛屿位于偏离/关闭岸边在奈辛瓦里的营地以西。就在抵达它。",
	["For Archbishop Benedictus in Stormwind, in the next guide"] = "给大主教本尼迪塔斯在暴风城，在下一份指南中",
	["For Archmage Ansirem in Alterac Mountains"] = "给大法师大法师安斯雷姆·鲁因维沃尔在奥特兰克山脉",
	["For Bishop Farthing in Stormwind, in the next guide"] = "给主教法席恩在暴风城，在下一份指南中",
	["For Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind Keep: keep it"] = "给伯瓦尔·弗塔根公爵伯瓦尔·弗塔根公爵在暴风城要塞：请保留该任务/物品",
	["For Catelyn the Blade in Booty Bay: keep it"] = "给利刃凯特琳在藏宝海湾：请保留该任务/物品",
	["For Chillwind Camp: keep it"] = "给冰风岗：请保留该任务/物品",
	["For Curator Thorius in Ironforge, later"] = "给索里奥斯馆长在铁炉堡，稍后",
	["For Elling Trias in Stormwind, in the next guide"] = "给埃林·提亚斯在暴风城，在下一份指南中",
	["For Falfindel Waywarder in Feralas, much later"] = "给法芬德尔在菲拉斯，很久以后",
	["For Felwood: keep it"] = "给费伍德森林：请保留该任务/物品",
	["For Fleet Master Seahorn in Booty Bay: keep it"] = "给舰队指挥官卡拉·海角在藏宝海湾：请保留该任务/物品",
	["For Gregan Brewspewer in Feralas: keep it"] = "给格雷甘·山酒在菲拉斯：请保留该任务/物品",
	["For Gryan Stoutmantle at Sentinel Hill"] = "给格里安·斯托曼在哨兵岭",
	["For Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn, later"] = "给赫米特·奈辛瓦里二世在荆棘谷，稍后",
	["For Janice Felstone: keep it"] = "给詹妮丝·费尔斯通：请保留该任务/物品",
	["For Kernda in Timbermaw Hold: keep it"] = "给克尔达在木喉要塞：请保留该任务/物品",
	["For Kin'weelay at Grom'gol, in the next guide"] = "给肯维雷在格罗姆高，在下一份指南中",
	["For Lieutenant Farren Orinelle in Southshore: keep it"] = "给法尔林·奥里涅尔中尉在南海镇：请保留该任务/物品",
	["For Milton Sheaf in Stormwind: keep it"] = "给米尔顿·西弗在暴风城：请保留该任务/物品",
	["For Phin Odelic in Southshore"] = "给费恩·奥德利克在南海镇",
	["For Silithus: keep it"] = "给希利苏斯：请保留该任务/物品",
	["For Sprite Jumpsprocket in Stormwind's Dwarven District"] = "给斯普莱特在暴风城的矮人区",
	["For Stormwind: keep it"] = "给暴风城：请保留该任务/物品",
	["For Wiley the Black in Lakeshire, Redridge"] = "给黑衣威利在湖畔镇，赤脊山",
	["For the druids of Darnassus: keep it"] = "给德鲁伊的达纳苏斯：请保留该任务/物品",
	["For the giant crocolisks of the north coast, on your next visit"] = "给巨型鳄鱼的北海岸，在下次来访时",
	["Foreman Oslow"] = "工头奥斯洛",
	["Foreman Stonebrow"] = "工头乔尼·石眉",
	["Foreman Thazz'ril"] = "工头塔兹利尔",
	["Forest Song, the Night Elf outpost at the eastern end of the road."] = "林歌神殿，夜晚精灵前哨站在道路的东端。",
	["Forever adds the dungeons Hall of Thanes and Ruins of Lordaeron; their bosses and brackets are not in our data yet."] = "无限服新增地下城领主大厅与洛丹伦废墟；它们的首领与等级段是暂未收录于当前数据。",
	["Forever's PvP ranks come from Rank Points earned in battlegrounds and world PvP, with a weekly cap; Commander (rank 11) unlocks the Black War mounts. Polestar cannot read your rank, so this step waits for level 40 and the riding skill."] = "无限服的 PvP 军衔来自等级点数获得的在战场与世界 PvP，与一个每周上限；指挥官（等级11）解锁黑色战争坐骑。Polestar 无法阅读你的等级，因此此步骤等候给40级与骑行技能。",
	["Forever's PvP ranks come from Rank Points earned in battlegrounds and world PvP, with a weekly cap; Lieutenant General (rank 11) unlocks the Black War mounts. Polestar cannot read your rank, so this step waits for level 40 and the riding skill."] = "无限服的 PvP 军衔来自等级点数获得的在战场与世界 PvP，与一个每周上限；中尉将军（等级11）解锁黑色战争坐骑。Polestar 无法阅读你的等级，因此此步骤等候给40级与骑行技能。",
	["Forked Mudrock Tongue"] = "分叉的泥石龟舌",
	["Foulweald Den Watcher"] = "污林卫兵",
	["Foulweald Totemic"] = "污林图腾师",
	["Foulweald Ursa"] = "污林巨熊怪",
	["Foulweald Warrior"] = "污林战士",
	["Four rune rubbings in Azshara: keep it"] = "4符文拓片在艾萨拉：请保留该任务/物品",
	["Fourth Relic Fragment"] = "第四块遗物碎片",
	["Fraggar Thundermantle"] = "弗拉加尔",
	["Fraggar keeps paying for necklaces: hand in any extras"] = "弗拉加尔保留支付给项链：上交任意多余的",
	["Frast Dokner"] = "弗拉斯特·多克南",
	["Frast Dokner: blacksmiths only"] = "弗拉斯特·多克南：铁匠仅",
	["Free Pal'juh and see her safely out of the crag"] = "解救帕尔朱与查看她的安全地离开峭壁",
	["Free six Webbed Victims inside the cave for Aramis"] = "解救6被网住的受害者在洞穴给内阿拉米斯·锤手",
	["Frenzied Plaguehound"] = "狂怒的瘟疫犬",
	["Frenzied Plaguehounds and Monstrous Plaguebats share the fields around Northdale and Eastwall Tower, south of Zul'Mashar."] = "狂怒的瘟疫犬与巨型瘟疫蝙蝠共享农田在北谷周围与东墙哨塔，在祖尔玛夏以南。",
	["Frenzied Pterrordax"] = "狂怒的翼手龙",
	["From Algaz Station take the tunnel west into Dun Morogh. Kharanos and Ironforge's gates are Alliance ground."] = "来自奥加兹岗哨穿过隧道西进入丹莫罗。卡拉诺斯与铁炉堡的大门是联盟领地。",
	["From Algaz Station, the road north through the Dun Algaz pass leads into the Wetlands."] = "来自奥加兹岗哨，道路北穿过丹奥加兹穿过通往湿地。",
	["From Astranaar head south-west to the Talondeep Path, a tunnel through the mountains into Stonetalon."] = "来自阿斯特兰纳前往西南前往石爪小径，一个隧道穿过山脉进入石爪山脉。",
	["From Astranaar ride north-west into the hills: the Heartswood is a glowing tree north of the road to Maestra's Post. Then back past Astranaar to the Talondeep Path."] = "来自阿斯特兰纳骑行西北进入丘陵：同心树是一个发光的树在道路前往以北迈斯特拉岗哨。然后返回经过阿斯特兰纳前往石爪小径。",
	["From Booty Bay, fly to Grom'gol. The Undercity zeppelin leaves from the tower on the west side of the camp."] = "来自藏宝海湾，飞往前往格罗姆高。幽暗城飞艇离开来自哨塔在营地的西侧。",
	["From Camp Mojache's flight master."] = "来自莫沙彻营地的飞行管理员。",
	["From Darkshire follow the road east through Deadwind Pass into the Swamp of Sorrows; Biggs guards the road junction just inside it."] = "来自夜色镇沿着道路前往东穿过逆风小径进入悲伤沼泽；卫兵比格斯卫兵道路交界处就在内部它。",
	["From Darla Harris in Southshore"] = "来自达尔拉·哈瑞斯在南海镇",
	["From Dungar Longdrink in Stormwind"] = "来自杜加尔·朗德瑞克在暴风城",
	["From Duskwood take the road south into Stranglethorn; the hunters' tents stand just west of the road past the Rebel Camp turn-off."] = "来自暮色森林沿着道路走南进入荆棘谷；猎人的帐篷位于就在道路经过以西反抗军营地交还-偏离/关闭。",
	["From Freewind Post, fly to Orgrimmar."] = "来自乱风岗，飞往前往奥格瑞玛。",
	["From Honored on, Corruptor's Scourgestones (one per turn-in) and Scourge kills in Stratholme and Scholomance carry the reputation. Corruptor's stones drop from the Scourge bosses there (Darkmaster Gandling, Marduk Blackpool, Vectus) and from Araj the Summoner and Putridius in Western Plaguelands. Many dungeon runs pay off faster than any open-world farm."] = "来自尊敬在，堕落者的天灾石（1每交任务）与天灾军团击杀在斯坦索姆与通灵学院携带声望。堕落者的石头掉落来自天灾军团首领那里（黑暗院长加丁，马杜克·布莱克波尔，维克图斯）与来自召唤者阿拉基与普特里迪乌斯在西瘟疫之地。许多地下城通往奖励偏离/关闭更快比任意打开/开启-世界农场。",
	["From Ironforge take the tunnel east through Dun Morogh into Loch Modan and follow the road to Thelsamar."] = "来自铁炉堡穿过隧道东穿过丹莫罗进入洛克莫丹与沿着道路前往前往塞尔萨玛。",
	["From Ironforge's Gryth Thurden"] = "来自铁炉堡的格莱斯·瑟登",
	["From Krakle in Un'Goro"] = "来自克拉兰克在安戈洛环形山",
	["From Light's Hope Chapel's flight master, fly to the Undercity."] = "来自圣光之愿礼拜堂的飞行管理员，飞往前往幽暗城。",
	["From Nijel's Point"] = "来自尼耶尔前哨站",
	["From Orgrimmar (zeppelin from the towers outside the Undercity) fly to Camp Taurajo."] = "来自奥格瑞玛（飞艇来自哨塔外部幽暗城）飞往前往陶拉祖营地。",
	["From Orgrimmar (zeppelin from the towers outside the Undercity) fly to Thunder Bluff and train on Elder Rise, then fly on to Camp Taurajo."] = "来自奥格瑞玛（飞艇来自哨塔外部幽暗城）飞往前往雷霆崖与训练在长者高地，然后飞往在前往陶拉祖营地。",
	["From Ratchet, fly to Everlook and ride south to Owl Wing Thicket."] = "来自棘齿城，飞往前往永望镇与骑行南前往枭翼树丛。",
	["From Ratchet, fly to Gadgetzan."] = "来自棘齿城，飞往前往加基森。",
	["From Revantusk Village's flight master, fly to the Undercity."] = "来自恶齿村的飞行管理员，飞往前往幽暗城。",
	["From Rut'theran Village, fly to Feathermoon Stronghold."] = "来自鲁瑟兰村，飞往前往羽月要塞。",
	["From Shadowprey Village fly to Ratchet."] = "来自葬影村飞往前往棘齿城。",
	["From Stormwind Harbor take the boat to Auberdine, then ride south along the road through Darkshore."] = "来自暴风城港口乘船前往奥伯丁，然后骑行南沿着道路穿过黑海岸。",
	["From Stormwind Harbor, ride through the city gates into Elwynn Forest and follow the road west to Westfall."] = "来自暴风城港口，骑行穿过主城大门进入艾尔文森林与沿着道路前往西前往西部荒野。",
	["From Tarren Mill go south-east into the hills on the way to Durnholde Keep. Rogues and Watchmen hold the camps along the way."] = "来自塔伦米尔前往东南进入丘陵在途中前往敦霍尔德城堡。潜行者与卫兵要塞扎营沿途。",
	["From Thelsamar fly to Menethil Harbor, take the boat to Theramore and fly on to Gadgetzan. Torwa's first quest in the crater needs level 48: finish the level here if you are short."] = "来自塞尔萨玛飞往前往米奈希尔港，乘船前往塞拉摩与飞往在前往加基森。托尔瓦的第一任务在环形山需要48级：完成等级此处如果数量还不够。",
	["From Thelsamar ride south into the Badlands, then west past the Horde town of Kargath (give it room) and up the trail into Searing Gorge. Thorium Point is the scaffolded camp on the north-west rim."] = "来自塞尔萨玛骑行南进入荒芜之地，然后西经过部落城镇的卡加斯（交给它房间）与上小路进入灼热峡谷。瑟银哨塔是脚手架营地在西北边缘。",
	["From Theramore follow the road west out of Dustwallow into the Barrens and south along it; give Camp Taurajo a wide berth. The Great Lift at the Barrens' south end takes you down into Thousand Needles. The journal lies at the foot of the lift."] = "来自塞拉摩沿着道路前往西离开尘泥沼泽进入贫瘠之地与南沿着它；交给陶拉祖营地一个宽阔泊位。升降梯在贫瘠之地的南尽头接收你下进入千针石林。日记位于升降梯的底部。",
	["From Theramore, fly to Nijel's Point and ride south out of Desolace into Feralas; the road leads west to the Forgotten Coast dock, where the boat crosses to Feathermoon on Sardor Isle."] = "来自塞拉摩，飞往前往尼耶尔前哨站与骑行南离开凄凉之地进入菲拉斯；道路通往西前往被遗忘的海岸码头，在船穿过前往羽月要塞在萨多尔岛。",
	["From Thorium Point's flight master."] = "来自瑟银哨塔的飞行管理员。",
	["From here on pick up every Power Crystal (blue, green, red, yellow) and every Un'Goro Soil pile you pass: 25 soil in all, 20 for Hamuul and 5 for Pestlezugg."] = "来自此处在拾取/接取每个能量水晶（蓝色，绿色，红色，黄色）与每个安戈洛的泥土堆你穿过：25泥土在全部，20给大德鲁伊哈缪尔·符文图腾与5给炼金师匹斯特苏格。",
	["From here on, the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj raid and the Abyssal Council turn-ins (crests, signets, scepters) carry most of the reputation."] = "来自此处在，安其拉废墟团队副本与深渊议会交任务（纹章，印戒，节杖）携带大多数的声望。",
	["From the Auberdine dock, fly to Astranaar."] = "来自奥伯丁码头，飞往前往阿斯特兰纳。",
	["From the Booty Bay flight master, above the harbour."] = "来自藏宝海湾飞行管理员，在港口上方。",
	["From the Broken Pillar ride west to the long ramp that winds down into Un'Goro Crater, then follow the crater's north wall to Marshal's Refuge, a camp in the cliff caves. Everyone here is neutral."] = "来自破碎石柱骑行西前往长坡道该风下进入安戈洛环形山，然后沿着环形山的北城墙前往马绍尔营地，一个扎营于悬崖洞穴。所有人此处是中立。",
	["From the Crossroads follow the road north. Kadrak stands on the watch tower of the Mor'shan Rampart where the road enters Ashenvale. Open the Bundle of Reports he gives you."] = "来自十字路口沿着道路前往北。卡德拉克位于守望哨塔的莫尔杉农场在道路进入灰谷。打开/开启报告集他给你。",
	["From the Crossroads, follow the road north-east to Orgrimmar and walk in by the main gate. Doras, the wind rider master, stands on the tower in the Valley of Strength."] = "来自十字路口，沿着道路前往东北前往奥格瑞玛与步行在旁主大门。多拉斯，双足飞龙管理员，位于哨塔在力量谷。",
	["From the Forgotten Coast dock, boat to Feathermoon and fly to Thalanaar, then ride east through Thousand Needles to the Mirage Raceway on the Shimmering Flats. Fizzle Brassbolts and Pozzik are in the camps beside the track; Zamek stands by the goblin camp."] = "来自被遗忘的海岸码头，船前往羽月要塞与飞往前往萨兰纳尔，然后骑行东穿过千针石林前往沙漠赛道在闪光平原。菲兹尔·铜栓与普兹克是在扎营在追踪旁边；扎米克站在旁边：地精营地。",
	["From the Tome of Divinity he gives you"] = "来自圣洁之书他给你",
	["From the Tome of Divinity she gives you"] = "来自圣洁之书她给你",
	["From the Undercity, take the zeppelin from the tower outside the city to Orgrimmar."] = "来自幽暗城，搭乘飞艇来自哨塔在主城前往外奥格瑞玛。",
	["From the harbour walk into Old Town. Ilsa Corbin trains warriors there; Harry Burlguard and Bartleby stand together by the Pig and Whistle Tavern. Bartleby fights you for his mug."] = "来自港口步行进入旧城区。伊尔萨·考宾训练战士那里；哈里·伯加德与巴特莱比位于一起在旁猪和哨声旅店。巴特莱比战斗你给他的酒杯。",
	["From the pass, take the Gold Road north to the Crossroads, the Horde town in the middle of the Barrens."] = "来自穿过，接取金币道路北前往十字路口，部落城镇在中间的贫瘠之地。",
	["From the southern Barrens take the Great Lift down into Thousand Needles. Freewind Post is a Horde town."] = "来自南部贫瘠之地接取升降梯下进入千针石林。乱风岗是一个部落城镇。",
	["From western Tanaris take the path down into Un'Goro Crater. Marshal's Refuge in the north is a neutral camp."] = "来自西部塔纳利斯沿着小径走下进入安戈洛环形山。马绍尔营地在北面是一个中立营地。",
	["Frostmane Headhunter"] = "霜鬃猎头者",
	["Frostmane Hold is the troll cave in the hills west of Brewnall Village. Kill Headhunters at its mouth and walk through to its far end."] = "霜鬃巨魔要塞是巨魔洞穴在丘陵在烈酒村以西。击杀猎头者在它的入口/河口与步行穿过前往它的远处尽头。",
	["Frostmane Troll Whelp"] = "霜鬃巨魔幼崽",
	["Frostmane Troll Whelps fill the slopes south and east of Grelin's camp."] = "霜鬃巨魔幼崽装满山坡南与在格雷林的以东营地。",
	["Frostwolf Quartermaster: Coldtooth and Irondeep Supplies from the mines"] = "霜狼军需官：冷齿矿洞与深铁矿洞补给品来自矿洞",
	["Full games that kill Drek'Thar after the towers fall pay the most."] = "完整游戏该击杀德雷克塔尔之后哨塔跳下/坠落奖励大多数。",
	["Full games that kill Vanndar Stormpike after the towers fall pay the most."] = "完整游戏该击杀范达尔·雷矛之后哨塔跳下/坠落奖励大多数。",
	["Fun with Elementals: Nimsy"] = "有趣与元素：妮姆希",
	["Furl Scornbrow"] = "弗恩·凝眉",
	["Furl Scornbrow, in the watchtower"] = "弗恩·凝眉，在哨塔",
	["Furlbrow's Wardrobe"] = "法布隆的柜子",
	["Further north along the road. The Furlbrows sit by their burned farm. Click the Sacks of Oats in the fields as you go and fill the vial at the stead's well."] = "更远处北沿着道路。农夫法布隆坐在旁它们的烧焦的农场。点击燕麦袋在农田沿途顺路与装满小瓶在农场的水井。",
	["Further north, the goblins of the Venture Co. dig at the mine east of the road; miners, foremen, surveyors and tinkerers all drop the crystals."] = "更远处北，地精的风险投资公司挖掘在采矿在道路以东；矿工，工头，勘测员与技师全部掉落水晶。",
	["Further south, Junior Surveyor Scrimshank's gear lies at the mouth of a Centipaar hive."] = "更远处南，初级药剂师霍兰德勘测员斯克林尚克的装备位于入口/河口的一个森提帕尔虫巢。",
	["Fyldren Moonfeather"] = "菲尔迪恩·月羽",
	["Gadgetzan is the walled goblin town just past the Tanaris border."] = "加基森是有围墙的地精城镇就在经过塔纳利斯边界。",
	["Gaea Dirt Mounds"] = "盖亚土堆",
	["Gaeriyan in Gadgetzan: keep it"] = "加里杨在加基森：请保留该任务/物品",
	["Gaeriyan is a ghost at the graveyard just north of Gadgetzan; the Conspicuous Gravestone is south of it, outside the town wall."] = "加里杨是一个幽灵在墓地就在加基森以北；显眼的墓碑位于它南面，在城镇城墙外。",
	["Gaeriyan waits at the graveyard just east of town; the gravestone stands nearby."] = "加里杨等候于墓地就在城镇东面；墓碑位于附近。",
	["Gaerolas Talvethren"] = "盖洛拉斯·塔文斯伦",
	["Gahrron's Withering Cauldron Key"] = "盖罗恩农场的瘟疫之锅钥匙",
	["Gahz'ridian Ornament"] = "加兹瑞迪安饰物",
	["Gakin the Darkbinder"] = "黑暗缚灵者加科因",
	["Gakin the Darkbinder waits in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar, in the Mage Quarter. Use the Heartswood Core at the summoning circle there and defeat the succubus it calls."] = "黑暗缚灵者加科因等候于已宰的羔羊旅店的地窖，在法师区。使用同心树之核在召唤法阵那里与击败魅魔它召唤。",
	["Gakin the Darkbinder waits in the cellar of the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter."] = "黑暗缚灵者加科因等候于地窖的已宰的羔羊旅店，在法师区。",
	["Gakin the Darkbinder: Takar the Seer in the Barrens takes it, later"] = "黑暗缚灵者加科因：先知塔卡尔在贫瘠之地接收该任务，稍后",
	["Galen Goodward is held in the Fallow Sanctuary in the swamp's north-east. Free him and follow him out, fighting off the swamp creatures that chase him."] = "加林·古瓦德是持有在农田避难所在沼泽的东北。解救他与沿着他出，战斗偏离/关闭沼泽生物该追击他。",
	["Galen is caged at the north end of the sanctuary. Free him and keep him alive on the walk out; his strongbox waits by the road afterwards."] = "加林·古瓦德是关在笼中的在圣地的北端。解救他与保留他存活在步行出；他的保险箱等候在路边随后。",
	["Galen's Strongbox"] = "加林的保险箱",
	["Galestriders need level 40 and Riding (Galestrider Riding comes with it in the Forever client). Any riding trainer of your faction teaches it; see the Level 40 mount guides for where."] = "疾风陆行鸟需要40级与骑术（疾风陆行鸟骑术来自与它在无限服客户端）。任意骑术训练师的你的阵营传授它；查看40级坐骑指南给在。",
	["Galestriders: Genn Fairweather, in Valanaar on Zephras Isle."] = "疾风陆行鸟：吉恩·费尔韦瑟，在瓦拉纳尔在泽弗拉斯岛。",
	["Galgar"] = "戈加尔",
	["Galgar, by the cooking fire"] = "戈加尔，在旁烹饪营火",
	["Gan'rul Bloodeye"] = "甘鲁尔·血眼",
	["Gan'rul Bloodeye stands in the Cleft of Shadow. Use Dogran's Pendant on the summoning circle there and defeat the succubus to bind her."] = "甘鲁尔·血眼位于暗影裂口。使用多格兰的坠饰在召唤法阵那里与击败魅魔前往绑定她的。",
	["Gan'rul Bloodeye: Summon Voidwalker"] = "甘鲁尔·血眼：召唤虚空行者",
	["Gann waits in a small camp further south, on the road toward Bael Modan."] = "加恩·石塔等候于一个小型营地更远处南，在路上朝巴尔莫丹方向。",
	["Gar'Thok"] = "加索克",
	["Garek camps by himself in Dustwind Gulch, south-east of the digsite."] = "加瑞克扎营在旁他自己在尘风峡谷，在挖掘场以东南。",
	["Garek's next task is an elite hunt: skip it."] = "加瑞克的下一个任务是一个精英狩猎：跳过即可。",
	["Garen Largo trains Paladins in the Undercity."] = "加伦·拉尔戈训练圣骑士在幽暗城。",
	["Garion Wendell"] = "加里奥·温德尔",
	["Garrick's Head: Garrick Padfoot"] = "加瑞克的头颅：加瑞克·帕德弗特",
	["Gaxim Rustfizzle"] = "加克希姆·尘链",
	["Gazban swims off the north-west coast, on the northern loop"] = "加兹班游动偏离/关闭西北海岸，在北部环线",
	["Gazin Tenorm"] = "贾森·坦诺姆",
	["Gazlowe"] = "加兹鲁维",
	["Gazrog"] = "加兹罗格",
	["Gelkak Gyromast"] = "基尔卡克·旋杆",
	["Gelkak Gyromast hides on the little island off the ruins; Stormscale Beastmistresses walk the shore. The key pieces drop from Giant Foreststriders (top), Greymist murlocs (middle) and Raging Reef Crawlers (bottom)."] = "基尔卡克·旋杆藏身在小岛屿偏离/关闭废墟；风暴鳞片驭兽者步行岸边。钥匙碎片掉落来自凶猛的森林陆行鸟（顶部），灰雾鱼人（中间）与狂暴暗礁蟹（底部）。",
	["Geltharis leads the Xavian satyrs; he carries the branch."] = "加萨里斯通往萨维亚萨特；他携带树枝。",
	["General Kirika"] = "吉里卡将军",
	["General Twinbraid's Strongbox"] = "塔文布莱德将军的保险箱",
	["Genn Fairweather is in Valanaar, the island's harbour town, near the skyboat docks. The Forever client lists each Galestrider at 20g; choose one."] = "吉恩·费尔韦瑟是在瓦拉纳尔，岛屿的港口城镇，在天舟码头附近。无限服客户端列出每个疾风陆行鸟在20金；选择1。",
	["Genn Fairweather is in Valanaar, the island's harbour town, near the skyboat docks. The Forever client lists each Swift Galestrider at 200g; choose one."] = "吉恩·费尔韦瑟是在瓦拉纳尔，岛屿的港口城镇，在天舟码头附近。无限服客户端列出每个赫格拉姆疾风陆行鸟在200金；选择1。",
	["Geologist Larksbane"] = "地质学家拉克斯班",
	["Gerrig Bonegrip"] = "葛利·硬骨",
	["Ghak Healtouch"] = "加克",
	["Ghak Healtouch, in the inn"] = "加克，在旅店内",
	["Ghede"] = "格德",
	["Ghost-o-plasm"] = "幽灵电浆",
	["Ghoul Fang"] = "食尸鬼的牙齿",
	["Ghouls and skeletons all over Western Plaguelands drop Minion's Scourgestones about half the time; this cluster is dense. Hand them in 20 at a time to any Argent Officer (Pureheart at Chillwind Camp, Garush at The Bulwark, Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff at Light's Hope Chapel). Each turn-in also pays an Argent Dawn Valor Token for the Argent quartermasters."] = "食尸鬼与骷髅全部越过西瘟疫之地掉落爪牙的天灾石约一半时间；此簇是密集的。上交它们在20在一个时间前往任意银色黎明军官（银色黎明军官普尔哈特在冰风岗，银色黎明军官加鲁什在亡灵壁垒，尼古拉斯·瑟伦霍夫公爵在圣光之愿礼拜堂）。每个交任务也奖励一个银色黎明勇气勋章给银色黎明军需官。",
	["Giant Crocolisk Skin"] = "巨型鳄鱼的皮",
	["Giant Eggs drop from the Ironbeak owls of Felwood."] = "巨蛋掉落来自铁喙猫头鹰猫头鹰的费伍德森林。",
	["Gilshalan Windwalker"] = "基尔沙兰·风行者",
	["Gilshalan Windwalker, on the tree's ramp"] = "基尔沙兰·风行者，在树的坡道",
	["Gilthares Firebough is chained inside the hold. Talk to him to start the escort and stay close: Theramore soldiers attack on the way out. He walks you back to Ratchet."] = "基尔萨瑞斯·火枝是被锁住的在要塞内。与…交谈他前往开始护送与留在靠近：塞拉摩士兵攻击在途中出。他步行你返回前往棘齿城。",
	["Gilveradin Sunchaser"] = "基沃拉丁·猎日者",
	["Ginro Hearthkindle"] = "基恩诺·火花",
	["Gives the Tapped Dowsing Widget"] = "给予使用过的寻水器",
	["Glittering Sunstone, from any Bloodfury harpy"] = "闪耀的太阳石，来自任意血怒雷巫鹰身人",
	["Glorin Steelbrow"] = "戈罗林·钢眉",
	["Glorin Steelbrow, upstairs in the inn"] = "戈罗林·钢眉，在旅店楼上",
	["Glorin stands on the upper floor of Menethil's keep."] = "戈罗林·钢眉位于米奈希尔的上层层保留。",
	["Glowing Ember: Minor Manifestation of Fire"] = "余烬：火焰之魂",
	["Glowing Gem"] = "发光的宝石",
	["Glowing Soul Gem"] = "发光的灵魂宝石",
	["Gluggle, a rare murloc on the coast west of camp, drops the Pendant of Myzrael: take it if you meet him"] = "格鲁格尔，一个稀有鱼人在海岸边在营地西面，掉落密斯莱尔坠饰：接取它如果你会合他",
	["Glyphs of Summoning"] = "召唤铭文",
	["Gnarled Thistleshrub"] = "长瘤的灌木兽",
	["Gnarlpine Ambushers hide along the road west of Fel Rock."] = "瘤背伏击者兽皮沿着道路在地狱石以西。",
	["Gnarlpine Mystics and Ferocitas camp north-east of Starbreeze Village. Ferocitas drops the Gnarlpine Necklace: open it for the jewel."] = "瘤背秘法师与费罗西塔斯营地在星风村以东北。费罗西塔斯掉落瘤背熊怪的项链：打开/开启它给宝石。",
	["Gnarlpine Shamans"] = "瘤背萨满祭司",
	["Gnarlpine Totem"] = "扭木图腾",
	["Gnoll Paws"] = "豺狼人的爪子",
	["Gnomeregan"] = "诺莫瑞根",
	["Go back down to Rut'theran Village and fly to Auberdine. The Moonkin Stone stands in the hills just east of the village: use the Cenarion Moondust there, defeat Lunaclaw and speak to the Lunaclaw Spirit."] = "前往返回下前往鲁瑟兰村与飞往前往奥伯丁。枭兽石位于丘陵就在村庄以东：使用塞纳里奥月尘那里，击败月爪枭兽与对话前往月爪枭兽的灵魂。",
	["Go back down to Rut'theran Village, take the boat to Auberdine and the boat on to Stormwind Harbor. Bring sixty Silk, sixty Mageweave and sixty Runecloth for Clavicus: buy what you lack at the Auction House."] = "前往返回下前往鲁瑟兰村，乘船前往奥伯丁与船在前往暴风城港口。携带60丝绸，60魔纹布与60符文布给克拉维斯·纳文哈姆：购买所你缺少在拍卖行。",
	["Go back into southern Desolace; the road continues south into Feralas."] = "前往返回进入南部凄凉之地；道路继续延伸南进入菲拉斯。",
	["Go back into the Barrens and west through Honor's Stand into the Stonetalon Mountains. Sun Rock Retreat is the Horde town; Stonetalon Peak in the north is Alliance."] = "前往返回进入贫瘠之地与西穿过荣耀岗哨进入石爪山脉。烈日石居是部落城镇；石爪峰在北面是联盟。",
	["Go back north into Duskwood and follow its road east through Deadwind Pass (level 50+ creatures off the road) into the Swamp of Sorrows."] = "前往返回北进入暮色森林与沿着道路前往东穿过逆风小径（50级+ 生物道路两侧）进入悲伤沼泽。",
	["Go back north through the Swamp of Sorrows and west into Deadwind Pass."] = "前往返回北穿过悲伤沼泽与西进入逆风小径。",
	["Go back west across the Barrens; the road west from Camp Taurajo climbs into Mulgore, tauren country with guards at Bloodhoof Village and Thunder Bluff."] = "前往返回西穿过贫瘠之地；道路西来自陶拉祖营地爬上进入莫高雷，牛头人领地与卫兵在血蹄村与雷霆崖。",
	["Go east through Elwynn Forest to Three Corners, where Redridge starts. Lakeshire is an Alliance town."] = "前往东穿过艾尔文森林前往三角路口，在赤脊山始于。湖畔镇是一个联盟城镇。",
	["Go through Timbermaw Hold and take the Moonglade branch of the tunnel. Rabine is in Nighthaven."] = "前往穿过木喉要塞与接取月光林地树枝的隧道。拉比恩·萨图纳是在永夜港。",
	["Go through Timbermaw Hold to its Winterspring exit; Salfa stands just outside. The quests and kills so far usually reach Unfriendly, and then the Timbermaw let you pass. If they still show red, kill more Deadwood by the tunnel first."] = "前往穿过木喉要塞前往它的冬泉谷出口；萨尔法位于就在外部。任务与击杀因此远处通常抵达冷淡，与然后木喉允许你穿过。如果它们仍然显示红色，击杀更多死木在旁隧道第一。",
	["Go through the tunnel into Loch Modan. Just past it, a path marked by stones climbs the hills on the right of the road north to Braldir's camp."] = "前往穿过隧道进入洛克莫丹。就在经过它，一个小径标记的在旁石头爬上丘陵在右侧的道路北前往布拉尔迪尔·灰袍的营地。",
	["Gobbler's Head"] = "高布勒尔的头颅",
	["Gol'dir"] = "高迪尔",
	["Gold Dust"] = "金砂",
	["Gold Pickup Schedule: Gruff Swiftbite"] = "采金日程表：格鲁夫·疾咬",
	["Goldtooth, a named kobold, sits in the back of the Fargodeep Mine's lower level. Defias Bandits around the vineyards drop a Westfall Deed now and then: right-click it."] = "金牙，一个名为狗头人，位于返回的法戈第矿洞的下层等级。迪菲亚强盗在葡萄园掉落一个周围西部荒野地契现在与然后：右键点击它。",
	["Golem Oil"] = "傀儡之油",
	["Golm Fragment"] = "高尔姆碎片",
	["Good Luck Charm goes back to Janice Felstone in the Western Plaguelands: keep it."] = "好运护符交回给詹妮丝·费尔斯通在西瘟疫之地：请保留该任务/物品。",
	["Good Luck Other-Half-Charm"] = "好运半边护符",
	["Gor'marok the Ravager"] = "掠夺者格玛洛克",
	["Gor'mul"] = "戈穆尔",
	["Gor'tesh"] = "戈泰什",
	["Gor'tesh and the Blackrock orcs hold the camps and the stronghold at the foot of Blackrock Mountain, west of Flame Crest. Pull them one at a time; every orc and worg may drop a medallion, so kill them until you have fifty."] = "戈泰什与黑石杀戮者兽人要塞扎营与要塞在黑石山的底部，在烈焰峰以西。拉怪它们1在一个时间；每个兽人与座狼可能掉落一个勋章，因此击杀它们直到你有50。",
	["Gorbold Steelhand"] = "高尔博德·钢手",
	["Gordo, the big abomination, walks the road a little further east. The Gloom Weed grows along the road around him."] = "葛尔多，大憎恶，步行道路一个小更远处东。阴暗草生长沿着道路周围他。",
