	["Goretusk Liver"] = "血牙野猪的肝",
	["Goretusk Liver Pie is orange from 50 (yellow at 90, grey at 130): about 52 crafts to 100. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "猪肝馅饼是橙色来自50（黄色在90，灰色在130）：约52制作前往100。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
