	["Gregan's camp lies north of the Twin Colossals. He sells the Videre Elixir once he has his bait."] = "格雷甘·山酒的营地位于北的双塔山。他出售视灵药剂一次他有他的鱼饵。",
	["Gregor Agamand"] = "格里高·阿加曼德",
