	["Grund Drokda stands in Coldridge Valley by Felix. Gozwin's camp is in the hills to the north-west of him; the Snow Leopard Prowler prowls around it."] = "格隆德·德罗克达位于寒脊山谷在旁菲利克斯。戈兹温的营地是在丘陵前往在他西北面；雪豹觅食的灰狼潜行游荡周围它。",
	["Grunt Logmar"] = "步兵劳格玛",
	["Gryan Stoutmantle"] = "格里安·斯托曼",
	["Gryan Stoutmantle and Captain Danuvin stand at the top of the stone tower. Quartermaster Lewis is in the tower, Scout Galiaan and Alba Fairmoon on the south side of the hill, next to the inn and Thor the gryphon master."] = "格里安·斯托曼与丹努文队长位于石头哨塔的顶部。军需官刘易斯是在哨塔内，哨兵加里安与阿尔芭·明月在山丘的南侧，在旅店与旁边索尔狮鹫管理员。",
	["Gryfe"] = "格莱菲",
	["Gryphon Master Talonaxe"] = "狮鹫管理员沙拉克·鹰斧",
