	["Haldarr Trickster"] = "哈达尔欺诈者",
	["Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility: the Strange Lockbox under the water off the north coast, west of the ruins"] = "水兽敏捷坠饰：奇怪的保险箱在下方水偏离/关闭北海岸，在废墟以西",
	["Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance: the Strange Lockbox"] = "水兽耐力坠饰：奇怪的保险箱",
	["Half-Eaten Fish"] = "吃了一半的鱼",
	["Half-buried Barrel"] = "半埋的大桶",
	["Hall of Thanes and Ruins of Lordaeron are new in Forever. Their bosses, levels and Legacy bracket are not in our data, so tick them off yourself."] = "领主大厅与洛丹伦废墟是新在无限服。它们的首领，等级与传承等级段是暂未收录于当前数据，因此勾选它们偏离/关闭你自己。",
	["Halpa"] = "哈尔帕",
	["Halpa sells three whistles in Thunder Bluff (50s each); the two ground squirrels are new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "哈尔帕出售3哨子在雷霆崖（50银每个）；2领地松鼠是新在无限服。每个宠物物品传授它的伙伴当你使用它；目标留在勾选随后。",
	["Hameya hides among the Mossflayer trolls of Zul'Mashar, in the north-east corner."] = "渗透者哈米亚藏身在其中：烂苔暗影猎手巨魔的祖尔玛夏，在东北面角落。",
	["Hameya's Key"] = "哈米亚的钥匙",
	["Hamish Bergwort"] = "哈米什·伯格沃特",
	["Hamish Bergwort and Blixie Fitzwink stand at the foot of the tower."] = "哈米什·伯格沃特与布里克西·菲兹温克位于哨塔的底部。",
	["Hammerfall in the east is the Horde town; Refuge Pointe in the middle is Alliance."] = "落锤镇在东面是部落城镇；避难谷地在中间是联盟。",
	["Hana'zua lies wounded at the foot of the hills north-west of the Den."] = "哈纳祖位于受伤的在丘陵北的底部-西的兽穴。",
	["Hanaa Nightwind"] = "哈娜·夜风",
	["Hanaa Nightwind camps south of the Ursera den. The Al'Aketh thugs hold the camp south-west of her; Malduko Cloudcrush stands in its middle."] = "哈娜·夜风扎营南的乌尔塞拉兽穴。奥阿凯斯暴徒要塞营地在她西南面；马尔杜科·碎云位于它的中间。",
	["Hanaa waits in Thendal Grove, south-west of the village. The Al'Aketh camp is just beyond her; Malduko Cloudcrush leads it."] = "哈娜·夜风等候于森达尔林地，在村庄以西南。阿尔阿凯斯营地是就在越过她的；马尔杜科·碎云通往它。",
	["Hand Unbagwa the fangs and stay by him: he calls three waves of gorillas, then Mokk. Fight them one at a time."] = "上交巫医安巴格瓦獠牙与留在旁他：他召唤3波次的猩猩，然后莫克。迎战它们1在一个时间。",
	["Hand him the ten texts you kept"] = "上交他10文本你保留",
	["Hand in the fangs and stay: three waves of gorillas come, Mokk the Savage last. Fight at full health."] = "上交獠牙与留在：3波次的猩猩来到，野蛮的莫克最后。迎战在完整生命值。",
	["Handful of Stardust"] = "一份星尘",
	["Hands Springsprocket, at the tunnel"] = "汉兹·跳链，在隧道",
	["Hansel Heavyhands"] = "汉瑟尔·重拳",
	["Harb Clawhoof"] = "哈布·爪蹄",
	["Harb Clawhoof sells the other colours (200g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "哈布·爪蹄出售其他颜色（200金每个在无限服客户端）。购买任意你需要，或无如果坐骑你曾是给予的是1你像。",
	["Harb Clawhoof sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "哈布·爪蹄出售其他颜色（20金每个在无限服客户端）。购买任意你需要，或无如果坐骑你曾是给予的是1你像。",
	["Harbinger Balthazad, the Trade Quarter"] = "预言者巴萨扎德，贸易区",
	["Hardened Tortoise Shell"] = "硬化龟壳",
	["Harken Windtotem"] = "哈肯·风之图腾",
	["Harlo Barnaby, by the north gate"] = "哈尔罗·巴纳比，在旁北大门",
	["Harlo Wigglesworth"] = "哈鲁·维格索斯",
	["Harry Burlguard"] = "哈里·伯加德",
	["Harry Burlguard: Defensive Stance"] = "哈里·伯加德：防御姿态",
	["Harvest Watchers"] = "看守傀儡",
	["Harvester's Head"] = "收割者的头颅",
	["Hatecrest Naga Scale"] = "憎世纳迦的鳞片",
	["Hatefury Claw"] = "怨怒萨特的爪子",
	["Hatefury Horn"] = "怨怒萨特的角",
	["Hatescreech and Windmistress Gaedress fly just west of the moonwell, Witchmother Arysa further north."] = "恨鸣与风之主母盖德蕾丝飞往就在月亮井以西，巫母阿莉萨更远处北。",
	["Hatescreech's Amulet"] = "恨鸣的护符",
	["Haughty Modiste"] = "傲慢的店主",
	["Havunth's camp sits just west of Cenarion Hold."] = "哈文斯的营地位于就在塞纳里奥要塞以西。",
	["Hawk Owl, 50s"] = "黑色猫头鹰，50银",
	["He camps by the Writhing Haunt, south-east of Dalson's Tears."] = "他扎营在旁蠕行之祸，在达尔松之泪以东南。",
	["He offers Brutal Armor next: level 30, with pieces all over Kalimdor and the Eastern Kingdoms. Leave it."] = "他提供野蛮护甲下一个：30级，与碎片全部越过卡利姆多与东部王国。可先放着不做。",
	["He runs off to keep Rizzle busy"] = "他通往偏离/关闭前往保留里兹尔繁忙的",
	["He stands by the river west of the farm."] = "他站在旁边：河流在农场以西。",
	["He stands on Hunter Rise. Each donation wants cloth from your bags; hand them in when you have it, later in the route."] = "他位于猎人高地。每个捐献需要布料来自你的背包；上交它们在当你有它，在路线稍后阶段。",
	["Head east to the Venture Co. research site west of the Sludge Fen. Use the Control Console, close the three valves around the drill, use the console again, then take the Console Key from Tinkerer Sniggles."] = "前往东前往风险投资公司研究地点西的淤泥沼泽。使用控制台，靠近3阀门在演习周围，使用控制台再次，然后接取控制台钥匙来自工匠斯尼格斯。",
	["Head north along the western dunes; Dredge Crushers and Stonelash Pincers range from here back toward the hold."] = "前往北沿着西部沙丘；掘泥摧毁者与石鞭巨钳蝎范围来自此处返回朝要塞方向。",
	["Head north into Shadowgale Forest. Elegael Thornpaw camps in its east."] = "前往北进入影风森林。艾蕾盖尔·棘爪扎营于它的东。",
	["Head north into Shadowgale Forest; Elegael camps at its southern edge."] = "前往北进入影风森林；艾蕾盖尔·棘爪扎营于它的南部边缘。",
	["Head north out of Lakeshire up the Redridge Canyons to Render's Valley. Blackrock Champions camp in the valley."] = "前往北离开湖畔镇上赤脊峡谷前往撕裂者山谷。黑石勇士扎营于山谷。",
	["Head north past Go'Shek Farm; the shards glitter on the hill by the Circle of East Binding."] = "前往北经过格沙克农场；碎片闪光在山丘在旁东部禁锢法阵。",
	["Head north to Red Rocks, east of Thunder Bluff. Lorekeeper Raintotem stands at the foot of the rocks; the Bristleback Interlopers dig at the burial ground and the Ancestral Spirit waits on top."] = "前往北前往红石，在雷霆崖以东。博学者诺拉·暴雨图腾位于岩石的底部；刺背干涉者挖掘在埋葬领地与先祖之魂等候于顶部。",
	["Head north-west to the hippogryph nests on the western cliffs. Hippogryph Down lies around the nests; the Matriarch patrols among them."] = "前往西北前往角鹰兽巢在西部悬崖。角鹰兽绒羽位于巢周围；刺喉雌龙巡逻在其中：它们。",
	["Head of Baron Vardus"] = "瓦杜斯男爵的头颅",
	["Head of Nagaz"] = "纳伽兹的头颅",
	["Head of Urs'anah"] = "乌尔萨娜的头颅",
	["Head south through the isles. The Loa idols lie all over the southern isles; Voodoo and Hexed Trolls hold them and drop the Hexed Pendants. Zalazane and Minshina's cage are on the southernmost isle."] = "前往南穿过群岛。洛阿神灵神像位于全部越过南部群岛；巫毒与妖术巨魔要塞它们与掉落妖术挂坠。扎拉赞恩与明希纳的笼子是在最南端岛。",
	["Head south-west to the West Pylon Watchtower. Peacekeeper Vaaniel is at the top; the Bloody Note lies beside him."] = "前往西南前往西塔水晶哨塔。维和者瓦尼尔是在顶部；染血的便条位于旁边他。",
	["Head west along the foot of the mountains to the violet dome of Dalaran. Ricter, Alina and Dermot (33-34) stand together inside the crater's eastern rim, Kegan Darkmar (35) a little west of them; each carries one Bloodstone piece. The Shield Guards and Theurgists (31-32) around them drop the Worn Stone Tokens."] = "前往西沿着山脚的山脉前往紫色穹顶的达拉然。瑞克特尔，奥丽娜与德莫特（33-34）位于一起在环形山内的东部边缘，克甘达玛（35）一个小在它们西面；每个携带1血石碎片。盾牌卫兵与神圣法师（31-32）周围它们掉落用旧的石雕。",
	["Head west into the Whispering Forest; Hilda and Ephram camp at its edge."] = "前往西进入耳语森林；破城者希尔达与伊弗拉姆·巴巴罗扎营于它的边缘。",
	["Head west past the camp. Stranglethorn Raptors (33-34) hunt the clearings, and the Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins on the coast: every Bloodscalp can drop a tusk. A Pendant of Myzrael is a very rare drop from them: if one drops, read it."] = "前往西经过营地。荆棘谷迅猛龙（33-34）狩猎空地，与血顶巨魔要塞废墟在海岸边：每个血顶可以掉落一个长牙。一个密斯莱尔坠饰是一个非常稀有掉落来自它们：如果1掉落，阅读它。",
	["Head west to the cave. The Young Night Web Spiders sit outside; the Night Web Spiders and the Webbed Victims are inside."] = "前往西前往洞穴。小夜行蜘蛛坐外部；夜行蜘蛛与被网住的受害者是内部。",
	["Headshrinkers stand deeper in the compound; the Commandos lurk stealthed around it and in the cave. Pick up Green Hills pages as they drop."] = "缩头者位于更深处在营区；突击队员潜伏潜行的周围它与在洞穴内。拾取/接取绿丘书页作为它们掉落。",
	["Heart of Flame"] = "烈焰之心",
	["Heart of Mokk"] = "莫克的心脏",
	["Hearth back (or ride north if it is on cooldown)."] = "炉石返回返回（或骑行北如果它是在冷却时间）。",
	["Hearth or fly back to the Undercity (or go to Orgrimmar), take the zeppelin to Grom'gol Base Camp in Stranglethorn Vale and walk north along the road into Duskwood. Northern Stranglethorn is level 30+ off the road."] = "炉石返回或飞往返回前往幽暗城（或前往奥格瑞玛），搭乘飞艇前往格罗姆高营地在荆棘谷与步行北沿着道路进入暮色森林。北部荆棘谷是30级+ 道路两侧。",
	["Hearth to Aerie Peak."] = "炉石前往鹰巢山。",
	["Hearth to Bloodhoof Village and ride north to Elder Rise."] = "炉石前往血蹄村与骑行北前往长者高地。",
	["Hearth to Camp Taurajo and fly to Ratchet. Mahren Skyseer camps on the shore north of Ratchet."] = "炉石前往陶拉祖营地与飞往前往棘齿城。玛伦·星眼扎营在岸边在棘齿城以北。",
	["Hearth to Feathermoon."] = "炉石前往羽月要塞。",
	["Hearth to Gadgetzan."] = "炉石前往加基森。",
	["Hearth to Menethil and take the boat from the pier to Southshore."] = "炉石前往米奈希尔港与乘船在栈桥上前往南海镇。",
	["Hearth to Ratchet and fly to Gadgetzan. Buy two Thorium Bars at the Auction House here for Fire Plume Forged."] = "炉石前往棘齿城与飞往前往加基森。购买2瑟银锭在拍卖行此处给火羽山。",
	["Hearth to Stormwind and train your level 60 spells. This is the end of the leveling route: look at the reputation and dungeon guides next."] = "炉石前往暴风城与训练你的60级法术。此是尽头的升级路线：查看在声望与地下城指南下一个。",
	["Hearth to Thelsamar. The Searing Gorge guide starts at Thorium Point: from here, ride south into the Badlands, west past the Horde town of Kargath and up the trail into the gorge."] = "炉石前往塞尔萨玛。灼热峡谷指南始于瑟银哨塔：来自此处，骑行南进入荒芜之地，西经过部落城镇的卡加斯与上小路进入峡谷。",
	["Hearthglen's Scarlets are level 58-60. Ride in to the high point marked on your map, look over the town, and get out."] = "壁炉谷的血色十字军俘虏是58-60级。骑行在前往高点标记的在你的地图，查看越过城镇，与获取出。",
	["Hearthstone on cooldown? Follow the coast road back south."] = "炉石在冷却时间? 沿着海岸道路返回南。",
	["Hearthstone on cooldown? Follow the road north-east."] = "炉石在冷却时间? 沿着道路前往东北。",
	["Hearthstone on cooldown? Ride back north through the Talondeep Path."] = "炉石在冷却时间? 骑行返回北穿过石爪小径。",
	["Hearthstone on cooldown? Ride back north-west."] = "炉石在冷却时间? 骑行返回西北。",
	["Heartswood"] = "同心树",
	["Heartswood: in Ashenvale, on the way to Desolace"] = "同心树：在灰谷，在途中前往凄凉之地",
	["Heavy Kodo Stew is orange from 215 (yellow at 240, grey at 280): about 10 crafts to 225. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "科多肉杂烩是橙色来自215（黄色在240，灰色在280）：约10制作前往225。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
	["Heavy Kodo Stew is orange from 225 (yellow at 240, grey at 280): about 15 crafts to 240. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "科多肉杂烩是橙色来自225（黄色在240，灰色在280）：约15制作前往240。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
	["Heavy Linen Bandage is yellow from 50 (yellow at 50, grey at 100): about 46 crafts to 80. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "厚亚麻绷带是黄色来自50（黄色在50，灰色在100）：约46制作前往80。绷带需要无营火：制作它们任何地方。",
	["Heavy Silk Bandage is yellow from 180 (yellow at 180, grey at 240): about 42 crafts to 210. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "厚丝质绷带是黄色来自180（黄色在180，灰色在240）：约42制作前往210。绷带需要无营火：制作它们任何地方。",
	["Heavy Stone comes from Iron Deposit nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "沉重的石头来自铁矿石采集点（采矿）；此是最密集的簇在数据。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Heavy War Golem"] = "重型作战傀儡",
	["Heavy War Golems patrol the Cauldron below Kalaran and drop the oil; the Magma and Blazing Elementals drifting among them drop the hearts. The Dark Iron Taskmasters and Slavers drive the slaves on the paths; a Slaver may drop the Grimesilt Outhouse Key: keep it."] = "重型作战傀儡巡逻于大锅在卡拉然·温布雷下方与掉落油；岩浆与炽热元素漂浮的在其中：它们掉落心脏。黑铁工头与奴隶主驱赶奴隶在小径；一个奴隶主可能掉落格里塞特厕所钥匙：请保留该任务/物品。",
	["Heavy War Golems patrol the floor of the Cauldron below Kalaran; Magma Elementals drift among them. Golems and elementals drop the oil, elementals the hearts."] = "重型作战傀儡巡逻于楼层的大锅在卡拉然·温布雷下方；熔岩元素漂浮在其中：它们。魔像与元素生物掉落油，元素心脏。",
	["Heavy Wool Bandage is yellow from 115 (yellow at 115, grey at 185): about 11 crafts to 125. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "厚绒线绷带是黄色来自115（黄色在115，灰色在185）：约11制作前往125。绷带需要无营火：制作它们任何地方。",
	["Heavy Wool Bandage is yellow from 125 (yellow at 115, grey at 185): about 38 crafts to 150. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "厚绒线绷带是黄色来自125（黄色在115，灰色在185）：约38制作前往150。绷带需要无营火：制作它们任何地方。",
	["Hecklefang Stalker"] = "乱齿捕猎者",
	["Heglan stands east of Razor Hill, towards the coast."] = "赫格兰·影眼位于剃刀岭以东，朝海岸方向。",
	["Heglan stands on the shore east of Razor Hill. The trident, banner and dagger lie on the beach around him."] = "赫格兰·影眼位于岸边在剃刀岭以东。三叉戟，旗帜与匕首位于海滩上周围他。",
	["Hegnar Rumbleshot"] = "海格纳·重枪",
	["Helene Peltskinner"] = "海伦尼·派特斯金纳",
	["Helene Peltskinner: skinners only, the pelts are skinned"] = "海伦尼·派特斯金纳：剥皮师仅，毛皮是剥皮的",
	["Helgrum the Swift"] = "赫格拉姆",
	["Hemet Nesingwary"] = "赫米特·奈辛瓦里二世",
	["Hemet Nesingwary, from Thousand Needles"] = "赫米特·奈辛瓦里二世，来自千针石林",
	["Henrig Lonebrow's Journal"] = "亨里格·独眉的日记",
	["Henze Faulk"] = "亨兹·法奥克",
	["Her brother Tyranis (36) walks the fortress with the Burning Blade cultists (30-33): pull him alone. The Burning Blade Seer keeps the sceptre in the fortress's main building."] = "她的修士泰拉尼斯（36）步行要塞与火刃邪教徒（30-33）：拉怪他独自。火刃先知保留节杖在要塞的主建筑。",
	["Her house stands on the hill south-east of Darkshire, above the Tranquil Gardens Cemetery."] = "她的房屋位于山丘在夜色镇以东南，上方静谧花园墓场。",
	["Her house stands on the hill south-east of Darkshire."] = "她的房屋位于山丘在夜色镇以东南。",
	["Herald Moonstalker"] = "赫拉德·月行者",
	["Herald Moonstalker and Gracina Spiritmight stand by the Temple of the Moon; fill Eridan's Vial at the moonwell inside."] = "赫拉德·月行者与格拉希娜·灵风站在旁边：月神殿；装满艾瑞丹的瓶子在月亮井处内部。",
	["Herod's records lie in a hut on the compound's west side; his strongbox sits farther east, by the cave mouth."] = "赫洛德的记录位于一个小屋在营区的西一侧；他的保险箱位于更远处东，在旁洞穴入口/河口。",
	["Heroes of Darrowshire's items lie in the later Plaguelands zones: keep it."] = "达隆郡的英雄的物品位于稍后瘟疫之地区域：请保留该任务/物品。",
	["Hezrul leads the Kolkar on the west shore of Lushwater Oasis, south of Regthar. Hand his head to Regthar on your last Crossroads stop."] = "赫兹鲁尔通往科卡尔在甜水绿洲的西岸，在雷戈萨·死门以南。上交他的前往前往雷戈萨·死门在你的最后十字路口停靠。",
	["Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania"] = "塞朵拉·穆瓦丹尼",
	["High Executor Darthalia"] = "高级执行官达萨利亚",
	["High Executor Darthalia: orders for Deathstalker Masoj, on the way to Durnholde"] = "高级执行官达萨利亚：命令给死亡猎手马索吉，在途中前往敦霍尔德",
	["High Executor Derrington"] = "高级执行官德灵顿",
	["High Executor Hadrec"] = "高级执行官哈德瑞克",
	["High Priest Rohan and High Priestess Mims are in the Hall of Mysteries, in the Mystic Ward."] = "高阶牧师洛汉与高阶祭司米姆斯是在秘法大厅，在秘法区。",
	["High Priest Rohan: Chastise"] = "高阶牧师洛汉：惩戒",
	["High Priestess Laurena"] = "高阶牧师劳瑞娜",
	["High Priestess Laurena is in the Cathedral of Light."] = "高阶牧师劳瑞娜是在圣光大教堂。",
	["High Priestess Laurena: Desperate Prayer"] = "高阶牧师劳瑞娜：绝望祷言",
	["High Priestess Laurena: High Priest Rohan in Ironforge takes it, later"] = "高阶牧师劳瑞娜：高阶牧师洛汉在铁炉堡接收该任务，稍后",
	["High Priestess Laurena: High Priestess Mims in Ironforge takes it, later"] = "高阶牧师劳瑞娜：高阶祭司米姆斯在铁炉堡接收该任务，稍后",
	["High Priestess Laurena: Priestess Alathea in Darnassus takes it, later"] = "高阶牧师劳瑞娜：女祭司阿兰希雅在达纳苏斯接收该任务，稍后",
	["High Priestess MacDonnell"] = "高阶牧师玛多妮尔",
	["High Priestess Mims: Confounding Flash"] = "高阶祭司米姆斯：眩惑闪光",
	["High Priestess Mims: Contingency Plan"] = "高阶祭司米姆斯：应急预案",
	["High Sorcerer Andromath: for Nethergarde Keep, keep it"] = "高阶巫师安多玛斯：给守望堡，请保留该任务/物品",
	["Highborne Apparition"] = "上层精灵的幻影",
	["Highborne Lichling"] = "上层精灵鬼巫",
	["Highborne Relics"] = "上层精灵的遗物",
	["Highland Fleshstalkers (36-37) hunt the southern highlands, a pack north of Boulderfist Hall and another on the plain to its west. Pull them one at a time."] = "高地猎兽龙（36-37）狩猎南部高地，一个包在石拳大厅以北与另一个在平原前往它的西。拉怪它们1在一个时间。",
	["Highland Razormaw (72%), Elder Razormaw (67%) in Wetlands, or wherever the arrow points"] = "高地刺喉龙（72%），老刺喉龙（67%）在湿地，或跟随箭头指示位置",
	["Highland Striders roam the hills all around Hammerfall; both they and the Thrashers further west drop the eyes."] = "高地阔步龙游荡于丘陵全部在落锤镇周围；两个它们与鞭笞者更远处西掉落眼睛。",
	["Highlord Bolvar Fordragon"] = "伯瓦尔·弗塔根公爵",
	["Highvale Notes"] = "高原精灵信件",
	["Highvale Records"] = "高原精灵记录",
	["Highvale Report"] = "高原精灵报告",
	["Hilda the Breaker"] = "破城者希尔达",
	["Hillsbrad Proclamation"] = "希尔斯布莱德宣言",
	["His crate is for Stranglethorn, later on the route"] = "他的木箱是给荆棘谷，稍后在路线",
	["His next errand is not on this route."] = "他的下一个差事是不在本路线内。",
	["His next request needs the Symbol of Ragnaros from elite cultists: leave it."] = "他的下一个请求需要拉格纳罗斯符记来自精英邪教徒：可先放着不做。",
	["His next request, going on to the Altar of Zul, is for a group."] = "他的下一个请求，前往在前往祖尔祭坛，是需要组队完成。",
	["His strongbox waits at his old camp north of Stonard."] = "他的保险箱等候于他的旧营地在斯通纳德以北。",
	["Historian Karnik"] = "史学家卡尼克",
	["Hit the sleeping peons north of the Den with the Foreman's Blackjack."] = "攻击/达到沉睡的苦工北的兽穴与工头的木棒。",
	["Hive Wall Sample"] = "虫穴内壁样本",
	["Hol'anyee Marshal"] = "霍莱伊·马绍尔",
	["Hollow Vulture Bone"] = "空心秃鹫骨",
	["Holt Thunderhorn, Hunter Rise"] = "浩特·雷角，猎人高地",
	["Homing Robot OOX-09/HL"] = "自动导航机器人OOX-09/HL",
	["Homing Robot OOX-17/TN"] = "自动导航机器人OOX-17/TN",
	["Hoof of Lakota'mani"] = "拉克塔曼尼的蹄子",
	["Hoofprints"] = "蹄印",
	["Horde guards: touch the edge of Bloodhoof Village and move on"] = "部落卫兵：靠近血蹄村边缘触发探索即可离开",
	["Horde guards: touch the edge of Brill and move on"] = "部落卫兵：靠近布瑞尔边缘触发探索即可离开",
	["Horde guards: touch the edge of Camp Taurajo and move on"] = "部落卫兵：靠近陶拉祖营地边缘触发探索即可离开",
	["Horde guards: touch the edge of Deathknell and move on"] = "部落卫兵：靠近丧钟镇边缘触发探索即可离开",
	["Horde guards: touch the edge of Freewind Post and move on"] = "部落卫兵：靠近乱风岗边缘触发探索即可离开",
	["Horde guards: touch the edge of Malaka'jin and move on"] = "部落卫兵：靠近玛拉卡金边缘触发探索即可离开",
	["Horde guards: touch the edge of Orgrimmar and move on"] = "部落卫兵：靠近奥格瑞玛边缘触发探索即可离开",
	["Horde guards: touch the edge of Razor Hill and move on"] = "部落卫兵：靠近剃刀岭边缘触发探索即可离开",
	["Horde guards: touch the edge of Ruins of Lordaeron and move on"] = "部落卫兵：靠近洛丹伦废墟边缘触发探索即可离开",
	["Horde guards: touch the edge of Sen'jin Village and move on"] = "部落卫兵：靠近森金村边缘触发探索即可离开",
	["Horde guards: touch the edge of Sun Rock Retreat and move on"] = "部落卫兵：靠近烈日石居边缘触发探索即可离开",
	["Horde guards: touch the edge of Tarren Mill and move on"] = "部落卫兵：靠近塔伦米尔边缘触发探索即可离开",
	["Horde guards: touch the edge of The Crossroads and move on"] = "部落卫兵：靠近十字路口边缘触发探索即可离开",
	["Horde guards: touch the edge of The Sepulcher and move on"] = "部落卫兵：靠近瑟伯切尔边缘触发探索即可离开",
	["Horde guards: touch the edge of Thunder Bluff and move on"] = "部落卫兵：靠近雷霆崖边缘触发探索即可离开",
	["Horde guards: touch the edge of Valley of Trials and move on"] = "部落卫兵：靠近试炼谷边缘触发探索即可离开",
	["Horde town: Alliance characters only need to touch its edge (guards)"] = "部落城镇：联盟角色只需靠近其边缘触发即可（注意卫兵）",
	["Horde town: Alliance characters only need to touch its edge (guards); any one of these names counts"] = "部落城镇：联盟角色只需靠近其边缘触发即可（注意卫兵）；触发其中任意一个名称即可",
	["Horgus' skull lies at Blackwood Lake and Marduk's sword in the Infectis Scar, each where ghosts fight; grown Plaguehounds hunt the plains between."] = "霍古斯的头颅位于黑木湖与马杜克的剑在魔刃之痕，每个在幽灵迎战；种植的瘟疫犬狩猎平原之间。",
	["Horn of the Black Wolf is in the client (20g) but our data has no vendor selling it."] = "黑狼号角是在客户端（20金）但我们的数据有无商人出售它。",
	["Horn of the Brown Wolf, 20g"] = "暗棕狼号角，20金",
	["Horn of the Dire Wolf, 20g"] = "暗灰狼号角，20金",
	["Horn of the Swift Brown Wolf, 200g"] = "迅捷棕狼号角，200金",
	["Horn of the Swift Gray Wolf, 200g"] = "迅捷灰狼号角，200金",
	["Horn of the Swift Timber Wolf, 200g"] = "迅捷森林狼号角，200金",
	["Horn of the Timber Wolf, 20g"] = "棕狼号角，20金",
	["Hornizz Brimbuzzle"] = "霍恩尼兹",
	["Hornizz stands at the edge of the Kodo Graveyard, south-west of Kormek's Hut; Kodo Bones lie among the skeletons."] = "霍恩尼兹位于边缘的科多兽坟场，在考米克小屋以西南；科多兽骨位于其中：骷髅。",
	["Hornizz waits at the goblin camp on the west side of the Kodo Graveyard."] = "霍恩尼兹等候于地精营地在西一侧的科多兽坟场。",
	["Hot Lion Chops is orange from 140 (yellow at 175, grey at 215): about 35 crafts to 175. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "烤狮排是橙色来自140（黄色在175，灰色在215）：约35制作前往175。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
	["Hulking Gritjaw Basilisk (level 35-36) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "笨重的砂腭蜥蜴（35-36级）掉落它此处。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Hulking Mountain Lion"] = "巨型山地狮",
	["Huntsman Malkhor's skull lies on a pile below the Vilebranch ruins, his bones on a pile at the foot of Jintha'Alor. The Vessels of Tainted Blood sit on the lower terraces, and Elder Torntusk is held at the top. Keep to the paths: the trolls inside are elite."] = "猎户马克霍尔马尔科尔的头颅位于一个堆下方邪枝废墟，他的骨头在一个堆在辛萨罗的底部。污血容器坐在下层阶地，与断齿长者是持有在顶部。保留前往小径：巨魔内部为精英。",
	["Huntsman Markhor"] = "猎户马克霍尔",
	["Huntsman Radley"] = "猎人莱德雷",
	["Huntsman Radley stands east of the lumber camp; Cavalier Durgen guards the road north-east of Kirsta, toward Hearthglen."] = "猎人莱德雷位于伐木场营地以东；骑士杜尔根卫兵道路在科尔斯塔·迪普沙东以东北，朝壁炉谷方向。",
	["Huntsman Radley walks the Northridge camp east of Kirsta; Cavalier Durgen guards the tower at Hearthglen's southern approach."] = "猎人莱德雷步行北山伐木场营地在科尔斯塔·迪普沙东以东；骑士杜尔根卫兵哨塔在壁炉谷的南部靠近。",
	["Hyusaa Quickbreeze"] = "休萨·疾风",
	["Iaadaria Bitterwind"] = "伊阿达莉亚·苦风",
	["Ice Claw Bear"] = "冰爪熊",
	["Ice Claw Bear: tame it with the Taming Rod"] = "冰爪熊：驯服它与驯兽棒",
	["Ice Thistle yetis live in the hills south of Winterfall Village, Chillwind Chimaeras in the valley toward Everlook."] = "冰蓟雪人实测在丘陵在寒水村以南，冰风奇美拉在山谷朝永望镇方向。",
	["Iceclaw Bear Pendants, from the Frostmane Troll Whelps on the slopes above the camp"] = "冰爪熊坠饰，来自霜鬃巨魔幼崽在山坡在营地上方",
	["Idriana, in the bank"] = "伊迪瑞娜，在银行内",
	["If you already know the Tarren Mill flight path, fly there and skip this step. Otherwise leave the Undercity and ride south down the road through Silverpine Forest past the Sepulcher and Pyrewood. Where the road turns east into Hillsbrad, Deathstalker Lesh waits at Southpoint Tower."] = "如果你已经知道塔伦米尔飞行点，飞往那里与跳过此步骤。否则跳过幽暗城与骑行南顺着道路穿过银松森林经过瑟伯切尔与焚木村。在道路交还东进入希尔斯布莱德，亡灵哨兵莱什等候于南点哨塔。",
	["Ilkrud Magthrull's Tome"] = "伊克鲁德·玛格苏尔之书",
	["Ilkrud and his voidwalkers hold the Ruins of Ordil'Aran south of the shrine. Pull his guards first."] = "伊克鲁德与他的虚空行者要塞奥迪拉兰废墟在神龛以南。拉怪他的卫兵第一。",
	["Illaya Amberwind"] = "伊拉雅·琥珀风",
	["Illiyana"] = "伊莉亚娜",
	["Illiyana Moonblaze hands out one Sentinel care package by level"] = "艾蒂尔·月火发放1哨兵照料包裹在旁等级",
