	["Inside the hold, Troll Chests lie along the tunnels. Ruul Snowhoof is held deep inside: free him and protect him all the way out, then he runs home to Night Run."] = "在要塞内，巨魔箱子位于沿着隧道。鲁尔·雪蹄是持有深处内部：解救他与保护他全部路出，然后他通往炉石前往夜道谷。",
