	["Iron Shaft"] = "铁杆",
	["Ironbeak Hunter (40%) in Felwood, or wherever the arrow points"] = "铁喙狩猎者（40%）在费伍德森林，或跟随箭头指示位置",
	["Ironforge has no druid trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from Tinker Town to Stormwind and train with Sheldras Moontree."] = "铁炉堡有无德鲁伊训练师：接取矿道地铁来自工匠区前往暴风城与训练与沙德拉斯·月树。",
	["Ironforge has no druid trainer: take the portal up to Darnassus and train in the Cenarion Enclave, then come back down to Rut'theran Village."] = "铁炉堡有无德鲁伊训练师：接取传送门上前往达纳苏斯与训练在塞纳里奥区，然后来到返回下前往鲁瑟兰村。",
	["Ironforge has no druid trainer: train with Sheldras Moontree in Stormwind before the tram."] = "铁炉堡有无德鲁伊训练师：训练与沙德拉斯·月树在暴风城之前地铁。",
	["Ironforge, where the next guide trains, has no druid trainer"] = "铁炉堡，在下一个指南训练，有无德鲁伊训练师",
	["Irontree Stompers"] = "铁木践踏者",
	["Isaac Chan, beside her: Training Lesson"] = "艾萨克·陈，旁边她的：训练课程",
	["Isha Awak, a big threshadon, swims in the shallows off the Merchant Coast, east of Mahren."] = "依沙瓦克，一个大蛇颈龙，游动在浅滩偏离/关闭商人海岸，在玛伦·星眼以东。",
	["Ishamuhale, a big Sunscale raptor, hunts the plains north of the road from Ratchet to the Crossroads."] = "伊沙姆哈尔，一个大日鳞迅猛龙，狩猎平原在道路来自以北棘齿城前往十字路口。",
	["Islen Waterseer"] = "水之先知伊斯伦",
	["Islen Waterseer, on the coast north of town"] = "水之先知伊斯伦，在海岸边在城镇北面",
	["Islen Waterseer: Healing Stream Totem and your Water Totem"] = "水之先知伊斯伦：治疗之泉图腾与你的水之图腾",
	["Islen camps on the shore just north of Ratchet."] = "水之先知伊斯伦扎营在岸边就在棘齿城以北。",
	["Islen waits on the hill south of Ratchet, on your way north."] = "水之先知伊斯伦等候于山丘在棘齿城以南，在你的路北。",
	["It lies by the river north-west of the logging camp."] = "它位于旁河流在伐木营地以西北。",
	["Its jars are filled on the next Un'Goro visit"] = "它的罐子是装满的在下一个安戈洛环形山造访",
	["Iverron"] = "埃沃隆",
	["Ivy Leafrunner: ends in Winterspring, keep it"] = "伊维·飘叶：终结于冬泉谷，请保留该任务/物品",
