	["Jadefire Hellcaller"] = "碧火唤魔者",
	["Jadefire Rogue"] = "碧火潜行者",
	["Jadefire Run is the satyr valley in the north-west, with Xavaric at its far end. He drops the Flute of Xavaric; every Jadefire satyr can drop Jadefire Felbind."] = "碧火小径是萨特山谷在西北面，与萨瓦里克在它的远处尽头。他掉落萨瓦里克长笛；每个碧火萨特可以掉落碧火魔符。",
	["Jadefire Shadowstalker"] = "碧火捕猎者",
	["Jadefire Trickster"] = "碧火欺诈者",
	["Jaedenar Adept"] = "加德纳尔精兵",
	["Jaedenar Cultist"] = "加德纳尔祭司",
	["Jaedenar Guardian"] = "加德纳尔守护者",
	["Jaedenar Hound"] = "加德纳尔恶犬",
	["Jaedenar is the ruined temple north of the glen. Some of its cultists drop a Blood Red Key, about one kill in thirty: it opens Arko'narin's cell in Shadow Hold, the cave at the back. If it drops, clear the way out before you free her; if not, skip her quests."] = "加德纳尔是毁坏的神庙在幽谷以北。一些的它的邪教徒掉落一个血红钥匙，约1击杀在30：它开启亚科纳琳的牢房在暗影堡，洞穴在返回。如果它掉落，清理路出之前你解救她的；如果不，跳过她的任务。",
	["James Halloran"] = "詹姆斯·哈洛兰",
	["James Halloran, by the north gate"] = "詹姆斯·哈洛兰，在旁北大门",
	["Jang"] = "贾恩",
	["Jang stands on the Booty Bay docks."] = "贾恩位于藏宝海湾码头。",
	["Jang, Booty Bay"] = "贾恩，藏宝海湾",
	["Jangdor Swiftstrider"] = "杉多尔·迅蹄",
	["Janice Felstone's farm is the first one east of the Bulwark. Jabbering Ghouls on the farm carry the other half of her charm; Cauldron Lord Bilemaw guards the cauldron in the field."] = "詹妮丝·费尔斯通的农场是第一1东的亡灵壁垒。喋喋不休的食尸鬼在农场携带其他一半的她的护符；护锅者拜尔摩卫兵大锅在田野。",
	["Janice's Parcel"] = "詹妮丝的包裹",
	["Janice's Parcel, beside the house"] = "詹妮丝的包裹，在房屋旁边",
	["Janice's ghost wanders by the farmhouse of Felstone Field, west of Andorhal. The Jabbering Ghouls in the field carry the other half of the charm: combine the two halves."] = "詹妮丝·费尔斯通的幽灵游荡在旁农舍的费尔斯通农场，在安多哈尔以西。喋喋不休的食尸鬼在田野携带其他一半的护符：合成2两半。",
	["Janice's ghost wanders by the farmhouse of Felstone Field, west of Dalson's Tears; her parcel lies inside."] = "詹妮丝·费尔斯通的幽灵游荡在旁农舍的费尔斯通农场，在达尔松之泪以西；她的包裹位于内部。",
	["Jarkal Mossmeld"] = "加卡尔",
	["Jarl lives in the Swamplight Manor south-east of Witch Hill."] = "卡尔住在水光庄园在女巫岭以东南。",
	["Jaron Stoneshaper"] = "加隆·石矛",
	["Jaron's Supplies"] = "加隆的补给物资",
	["Jaron's Wagon"] = "加隆的马车",
	["Jartsam"] = "贾萨姆",
	["Jartsam and Lelanai's sabers are in the Cenarion Enclave's riding grounds in Darnassus. At 40 Jartsam teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Alliance race ride these."] = "贾萨姆与莱拉奈的刃豹是在塞纳里奥区的骑行领地在达纳苏斯。在40贾萨姆传授骑术（100金每暴雪的设计师），与学习它给你一个坐骑。无限服客户端允许每个联盟种族骑行这些。",
	["Jartsam and Lelanai's sabers are in the Cenarion Enclave's riding grounds in Darnassus. At 60 Jartsam teaches Journeyman Riding (1,000g per Blizzard's designers); Blizzard says learning riding grants a mount. The Forever client sells each swift saber for 200g at level 60."] = "贾萨姆与莱拉奈的刃豹是在塞纳里奥区的骑行领地在达纳苏斯。在60贾萨姆传授中级骑术（1,000金每暴雪的设计师）；暴雪说学习骑行奖励一匹坐骑。无限服客户端出售每个迅捷刃豹给200金在60级。",
	["Jartsam, riding trainer"] = "贾萨姆，骑术训练师",
	["Jason Mathers"] = "贾森·玛瑟斯",
	["Je'neu Sancrea"] = "耶努萨克雷",
	["Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar, at 27"] = "耶努萨克雷在佐拉姆加，在27",
	["Je'neu offers a Blackfathom Deeps quest next; leave it unless you have a group."] = "耶努萨克雷提供一个黑暗深渊任务下一个；可先放着不做除非你有队伍。",
	["Jediga"] = "杰迪加",
	["Jekyll Flandring, 200g"] = "耶克里·弗兰迪，200金",
	["Jenal, in the Cenarion Enclave"] = "耶纳尔，在塞纳里奥区",
	["Jer'kai Moonweaver"] = "耶尔卡·月纹",
	["Jeremiah Payson"] = "杰雷米亚·派森",
	["Jeremiah Payson sells three cockroaches in the Undercity (50s each); the Plagued and Undercity Cockroaches are new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "杰雷米亚·派森出售3蟑螂在幽暗城（50银每个）；染病的与幽暗城蟑螂是新在无限服。每个宠物物品传授它的伙伴当你使用它；目标留在勾选随后。",
	["Jeremiah Payson, nearby"] = "杰雷米亚·派森，附近",
	["Jes'rimon, the Cleft of Shadow"] = "杰斯雷蒙，暗影裂口",
	["Jessica Redpath: keep it for Darrowshire"] = "杰希卡·雷德帕斯：留到达隆郡再做",
	["Jessir Moonbow"] = "杰希尔·月弓",
	["Jitters hides in the house at the west end of Raven Hill."] = "基特斯藏身在房屋在乌鸦岭的西端。",
	["Jocaste in Darnassus takes it"] = "祖卡斯特在达纳苏斯接收该任务",
	["Jocaste, in the Cenarion Enclave: Beast Training"] = "祖卡斯特，在塞纳里奥区：训练野兽",
	["John Turner"] = "约翰·特纳",
	["Jon-Jon's Golden Spyglass"] = "乔乔的金色望远镜",
	["Jonathan Carevin, by Elaine Carevin's house"] = "乔纳森·卡尔文，在旁艾莱尼·卡尔文的房屋",
	["Jorah Annison"] = "约拉·安尼森",
	["Jorah Annison stands in the Magic Quarter."] = "约拉·安尼森位于魔法区。",
	["Jorgen"] = "乔贞",
	["Jorn Skyseer"] = "乔恩·星眼",
	["Joseph's Wedding Ring, at the monument"] = "约瑟夫的结婚戒指，在纪念碑",
	["Josephine Carson"] = "约瑟芬·卡森",
	["Josephine Carson stands with the Goldshire trainers. Each of her quests hands you a Taming Rod: use it on the beast she names, then bring the rod back to her. Rockhide Boars and Young Forest Bears roam the hills south of the Maclure Vineyards, Gray Forest Wolves the woods east of Crystal Lake."] = "约瑟芬·卡森位于与闪金镇训练师。每个的她的任务发放你一个驯兽棒：使用它在野兽她名称，然后携带魔杖返回前往她的。石皮野猪与森林幼熊游荡于丘陵南的马科伦农场，森林灰狼树林在水晶湖以东。",
	["Journeyman Cooking raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10: the arrow picks the nearest Cooking trainer of your faction."] = "中级烹饪将技能上限提升至150；它需要技能等级50与角色等级10：箭头会自动指向最近的一位烹饪训练师的你的阵营。",
	["Journeyman First Aid raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10: the arrow picks the nearest First Aid trainer of your faction. Learn Heavy Linen Bandage on the same visit."] = "中级急救将技能上限提升至150；它需要技能等级50与角色等级10：箭头会自动指向最近的一位急救训练师的你的阵营。学习厚亚麻绷带在相同造访。",
	["Journeyman Fishing raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10. The arrow picks the nearest Fishing trainer of your faction."] = "中级钓鱼将技能上限提升至150；它需要技能等级50与角色等级10。箭头会自动指向最近的一位钓鱼训练师的你的阵营。",
	["Journeyman Herbalism raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10. The arrow picks the nearest Herbalism trainer of your faction."] = "中级草药学将技能上限提升至150；它需要技能等级50与角色等级10。箭头会自动指向最近的一位草药学训练师的你的阵营。",
	["Journeyman Mining raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10. The arrow picks the nearest Mining trainer of your faction."] = "中级采矿将技能上限提升至150；它需要技能等级50与角色等级10。箭头会自动指向最近的一位采矿训练师的你的阵营。",
	["Journeyman Skinning raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10. The arrow picks the nearest Skinning trainer of your faction."] = "中级剥皮将技能上限提升至150；它需要技能等级50与角色等级10。箭头会自动指向最近的一位剥皮训练师的你的阵营。",
	["Journeyman needs character level 10 and Alchemy 50; it raises the cap to 150. Materials for 75-150 are worth about 1g 46s in all."] = "中级需要角色等级10与炼金术50；它将技能上限提升至150。75-150阶段所需材料总计约需花费1金46银。",
	["Journeyman needs character level 10 and Blacksmithing 50; it raises the cap to 150. Materials for 75-150 are worth about 3g 92s in all."] = "中级需要角色等级10与锻造50；它将技能上限提升至150。75-150阶段所需材料总计约需花费3金92银。",
	["Journeyman needs character level 10 and Enchanting 50; it raises the cap to 150. Materials for 75-150 are worth about 30g in all."] = "中级需要角色等级10与附魔50；它将技能上限提升至150。75-150阶段所需材料总计约需花费30金。",
	["Journeyman needs character level 10 and Engineering 50; it raises the cap to 150. Materials for 75-150 are worth about 3g 26s in all."] = "中级需要角色等级10与工程学50；它将技能上限提升至150。75-150阶段所需材料总计约需花费3金26银。",
	["Journeyman needs character level 10 and Leatherworking 50; it raises the cap to 150. Materials for 75-150 are worth about 5g 83s in all."] = "中级需要角色等级10与制皮50；它将技能上限提升至150。75-150阶段所需材料总计约需花费5金83银。",
	["Journeyman needs character level 10 and Tailoring 50; it raises the cap to 150. Materials for 75-150 are worth about 7g 61s in all."] = "中级需要角色等级10与裁缝50；它将技能上限提升至150。75-150阶段所需材料总计约需花费7金61银。",
	["Jungle Remedy"] = "密林药剂",
	["Junior Apothecary Holland"] = "初级药剂师霍兰德",
	["Juvenile Vuldren and Pesky Cirrusflies roam the meadow just south-east of the grove."] = "幼年瓦德伦与恼人的卷云蝇游荡于草地就在树林以东南。",
	["Kadrak"] = "卡德拉克",
	["Kaela Shadowspear"] = "凯拉·影矛",
	["Kal: Mathrengyl Bearwalker in Darnassus takes it"] = "卡尔：玛斯雷·驭熊者在达纳苏斯接收该任务",
	["Kalaran stands alone south of Thorium Point, at the edge of the Cauldron. Listen to his story."] = "卡拉然·温布雷位于独自在瑟银哨塔以南，在大锅的边缘。倾听前往他的故事。",
	["Kalaran stands on the rim of the Cauldron, south of Thorium Point. Listen to his story."] = "卡拉然·温布雷位于边缘的大锅，在瑟银哨塔以南。倾听前往他的故事。",
	["Kaldorei Tome of Summoning"] = "卡多雷召唤魔典",
	["Kaltunk, where you start"] = "卡尔图克，在你开始",
	["Kanati Greycloud"] = "卡纳提·灰云",
	["Kar Stormsinger and Harb Clawhoof's kodos are in Bloodhoof Village, Mulgore. At 40 Kar Stormsinger teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Horde race ride these."] = "卡尔·雷歌与哈布·爪蹄的科多兽是在血蹄村，莫高雷。在40卡尔·雷歌传授骑术（100金每暴雪的设计师），与学习它给你一个坐骑。无限服客户端允许每个部落种族骑行这些。",
	["Kar Stormsinger and Harb Clawhoof's kodos are in Bloodhoof Village, Mulgore. At 60 Kar Stormsinger teaches Journeyman Riding (1,000g per Blizzard's designers); Blizzard says learning riding grants a mount. The Forever client sells each great kodo for 200g at level 60."] = "卡尔·雷歌与哈布·爪蹄的科多兽是在血蹄村，莫高雷。在60卡尔·雷歌传授中级骑术（1,000金每暴雪的设计师）；暴雪说学习骑行奖励一匹坐骑。无限服客户端出售每个巨型科多兽给200金在60级。",
	["Kar Stormsinger, riding trainer"] = "卡尔·雷歌，骑术训练师",
	["Karang Amakkar"] = "卡拉恩·阿玛卡",
	["Kargal Battlescar"] = "卡加尔·战痕",
	["Kargath in the west is the Horde town."] = "卡加斯在西面是部落城镇。",
	["Kargath is the Horde fortress built into the cliffs at the zone's western edge."] = "卡加斯是部落要塞建于进入悬崖在区域的西部边缘。",
	["Karl Boran, on the pier north of the inn"] = "卡尔·波兰，在栈桥上在旅店以北",
	["Karl Boran: for Captain Stoutfist in the keep"] = "卡尔·波兰：给斯托菲队长在要塞内",
	["Karna Remtravel, just outside"] = "卡尔纳·雷塔维，就在外部",
	["Karna stands just outside the refuge."] = "卡尔纳·雷塔维位于就在营地外。",
	["Karnitol's Chest"] = "卡尼托的箱子",
	["Karos Razok"] = "卡洛斯·拉佐克",
	["Kary Thunderhorn"] = "卡瑞·雷角",
	["Katar"] = "卡塔尔",
	["Katie Hunter"] = "凯蒂·亨特",
	["Katie Hunter sells the other colours (200g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "凯蒂·亨特出售其他颜色（200金每个在无限服客户端）。购买任意你需要，或无如果坐骑你曾是给予的是1你像。",
	["Katie Hunter sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "凯蒂·亨特出售其他颜色（20金每个在无限服客户端）。购买任意你需要，或无如果坐骑你曾是给予的是1你像。",
	["Katie Hunter: other colours, 20g"] = "凯蒂·亨特：其他颜色，20金",
	["Katoom the Angler"] = "钓鱼者卡图姆",
	["Kayneth Stillwind"] = "凯尼斯·静风",
	["Kebok"] = "科博克",
	["Kebok, in the tavern"] = "科博克，在酒馆内",
	["Keep Auntie Marlene: Marlene lives at Sorrow Hill in the Western Plaguelands."] = "保留玛莱恩姑妈：玛莱恩·雷德帕斯住在悔恨岭在西瘟疫之地。",
	["Keep Jes'rimon's payment and Ag'tor's Betrayed: they go back to Valormok on a later visit."] = "保留杰斯雷蒙的报酬与阿格图·血拳的叛徒：它们返回瓦罗莫克在后续再来时。",
	["Keep Larion's Marvon's Workshop and Linken's letter for later guides."] = "保留拉瑞安的玛尔冯的车间与林克的信件给稍后指南。",
	["Keep Linken's Memory: Eridan Bluewind is at the Emerald Sanctuary, on the next guide's way through Felwood."] = "保留林克的记忆：艾瑞丹·蓝风是在翡翠圣地，在下一个指南的路穿过费伍德森林。",
	["Keep Little Pamela: Pamela is in Darrowshire, visited again later."] = "保留小帕米拉：帕米拉是在达隆郡，造访再次稍后。",
	["Keep Seeking Spiritual Aid: Islen Waterseer is in the Barrens."] = "保留水之魂的帮助：水之先知伊斯伦是在贫瘠之地。",
	["Keep Speak to Salfa for Winterspring."] = "保留与萨尔法交谈给冬泉谷。",
	["Keep Sunken Temple for Marvon in Tanaris."] = "保留沉没的神庙给马冯在塔纳利斯。",
	["Keep The Stone Circle: Marvon's chest is opened on a later visit."] = "保留石环：马冯的箱子是打开在后续再来时。",
	["Keep Tinkee's letter: Felnok Steelspring is in Everlook, Winterspring."] = "保留丁奇·斯迪波尔的信件：菲诺克是在永望镇，冬泉谷。",
	["Keep capturing flags in Warsong Gulch."] = "保留占领旗帜在战歌峡谷。",
	["Keep clearing the Molten Core until Exalted."] = "保留空地熔火之心直到崇拜。",
	["Keep east on the road. Torek waits south-west of the Warsong lumber camp. He and his grunts storm the Silverwing Outpost: let them take aggro and stay with Torek until Duriel Moonfire is dead."] = "保留东在路上。托雷克等候西南的战歌信使伐木场营地。他与他的步兵风暴银翼前哨站：允许它们接取引怪与留在与托雷克直到杜瑞尔·月火是死亡的。",
	["Keep farming the Twilight camps. Wearing the Twilight Trappings (the Twilight cultist set plus a Medallion of Station, from Aurel Goldleaf's Medallion of Station quest) lets you summon Abyssal Templars at the Wind Stones; their Abyssal Crests go to Bor Wildmane."] = "保留农场暮光扎营。佩戴暮光装饰（暮光邪教徒设置外加一个阶级勋章，来自奥蕾尔·金叶的阶级勋章任务）允许你召唤深渊圣殿骑士在风石头；它们的深渊纹章前往鲍尔·蛮鬃。",
	["Keep filling Waylaid Crates for Dokimi until Exalted."] = "保留装满被劫的货箱给多基米直到崇拜。",
	["Keep filling Waylaid Crates for Dokimi."] = "保留装满被劫的货箱给多基米。",
	["Keep filling Waylaid Crates for Marcy Baker until Exalted."] = "保留装满被劫的货箱给玛茜·贝克直到崇拜。",
	["Keep filling Waylaid Crates for Marcy Baker."] = "保留装满被劫的货箱给玛茜·贝克。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Darkspear Trolls is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布直到暗矛巨魔是崇拜。符文布：黑暗教徒与暗影法师（58-60级）在东瘟疫之地，或拍卖行。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Darnassus is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布直到达纳苏斯是崇拜。符文布：黑暗教徒与暗影法师（58-60级）在东瘟疫之地，或拍卖行。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Gnomeregan Exiles is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布直到诺莫瑞根流亡者是崇拜。符文布：黑暗教徒与暗影法师（58-60级）在东瘟疫之地，或拍卖行。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Ironforge is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布直到铁炉堡是崇拜。符文布：黑暗教徒与暗影法师（58-60级）在东瘟疫之地，或拍卖行。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Orgrimmar is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布直到奥格瑞玛是崇拜。符文布：黑暗教徒与暗影法师（58-60级）在东瘟疫之地，或拍卖行。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Stormwind is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布直到暴风城是崇拜。符文布：黑暗教徒与暗影法师（58-60级）在东瘟疫之地，或拍卖行。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Thunder Bluff is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布直到雷霆崖是崇拜。符文布：黑暗教徒与暗影法师（58-60级）在东瘟疫之地，或拍卖行。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Undercity is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布直到幽暗城是崇拜。符文布：黑暗教徒与暗影法师（58-60级）在东瘟疫之地，或拍卖行。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth, 20 Runecloth at a time. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布，20符文布在一个时间。符文布：黑暗教徒与暗影法师（58-60级）在东瘟疫之地，或拍卖行。",
	["Keep her alive until she is out of the cave"] = "保留她的存活直到她是离开洞穴",
	["Keep it: Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill, a later guide"] = "请保留该任务/物品：药剂师林度恩在塔伦米尔，一个稍后指南",
	["Keep it: Gan'rul in Orgrimmar, at the end of this guide"] = "请保留该任务/物品：甘鲁尔·血眼在奥格瑞玛，在尽头的此指南",
	["Keep it: Gregan in Feralas brews the elixir later"] = "请保留该任务/物品：格雷甘·山酒在菲拉斯酿造药剂稍后",
	["Keep it: Rilli Greasygob stands outside Orgrimmar; a later guide hands it in"] = "请保留该任务/物品：雷里·格里斯高布位于奥格瑞玛外；一个稍后指南发放它在",
	["Keep it: Senani Thunderheart in Ashenvale, next guide"] = "请保留该任务/物品：塞娜尼·雷心在灰谷，下一个指南",
	["Keep it: Thork at the Crossroads"] = "请保留该任务/物品：索克在十字路口",
	["Keep it: the Hillsbrad coast, later on the route"] = "请保留该任务/物品：希尔斯布莱德海岸，稍后在路线",
	["Keep it: the Spring Well is beside Tarren Mill"] = "请保留该任务/物品：灵魂之井是在塔伦米尔旁边",
	["Keep north on the road. The Warsong Scout waits at the Warsong lumber camp, south of Splintertree."] = "保留北在路上。战歌斥候等候于战歌信使伐木场营地，在碎木岗哨以南。",
	["Keep north on the road; the chest lies in the Uldaman dig site, at the foot of the ruins north-west of the road."] = "保留北在路上；箱子位于奥达曼挖掘地点，在废墟的底部在道路以西北。",
	["Keep north to Sar'theris Strand. The Oracles stand among the other naga at its north end; pull one at a time."] = "保留北前往萨瑟里斯海岸。神谕者位于其中：其他纳迦在它的北尽头；拉怪1在一个时间。",
	["Keep playing Arathi Basin. On Call to Arms: Arathi Basin weekends the Alliance Brigadier General in the capitals takes three Arathi Basin Marks of Honor for extra reputation."] = "保留游玩阿拉希盆地。在短兵相接：阿拉希盆地周末联盟准将在主城接收3阿拉希盆地马克的荣誉给额外声望。",
	["Keep playing Arathi Basin. On Call to Arms: Arathi Basin weekends the Horde Warbringer in the capitals takes three Arathi Basin Marks of Honor for extra reputation."] = "保留游玩阿拉希盆地。在短兵相接：阿拉希盆地周末部落战争使者在主城接收3阿拉希盆地马克的荣誉给额外声望。",
	["Keep playing Arathi Basin; wins with many bases held pay the most."] = "保留游玩阿拉希盆地；获胜与许多基地持有奖励大多数。",
	["Keep playing Warsong Gulch and capturing flags. On Call to Arms: Warsong Gulch weekends the Alliance Brigadier General in the capitals takes three Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor for extra reputation."] = "保留游玩战歌峡谷与占领旗帜。在短兵相接：战歌峡谷周末联盟准将在主城接收3战歌峡谷荣誉奖章给额外声望。",
	["Keep playing Warsong Gulch and capturing flags. On Call to Arms: Warsong Gulch weekends the Horde Warbringer in the capitals takes three Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor for extra reputation."] = "保留游玩战歌峡谷与占领旗帜。在短兵相接：战歌峡谷周末部落战争使者在主城接收3战歌峡谷荣誉奖章给额外声望。",
	["Keep riding north into Duskwood, then east along the road through Deadwind Pass. Stonard lies in the reeds south of the road."] = "保留骑行北进入暮色森林，然后东沿着道路穿过逆风小径。斯通纳德位于芦苇在道路以南。",
	["Keep riding west to the coast. The Coast Crawl Deepseers and Snapclaws on the beaches drop OOX-22/FE's distress beacon about one kill in forty: if one drops, use it to start the quest."] = "保留骑行西前往海岸。海滩龙虾人先知与海滩利爪龙虾人在海滩掉落自动导航机器人OOX-22/FE的求救信标约1击杀在40：如果1掉落，使用它前往开始任务。",
	["Keep running Stratholme and Scholomance and turning in every Corruptor's Scourgestone at Light's Hope Chapel until Exalted."] = "保留刷斯坦索姆与通灵学院与交还在每个堕落者的天灾石在圣光之愿礼拜堂直到崇拜。",
	["Keep running the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj and turning in Abyssal Council insignia until Exalted."] = "保留刷安其拉废墟与交还在深渊议会徽记直到崇拜。",
	["Keep the Book of Aquor, the claws and the heart he hands back"] = "保留阿奎尔之书，爪与心脏他发放返回",
	["Keep the bait: Lar'korwi is level 56, and the second loop passes his lair."] = "保留鱼饵：拉克维是56级，与第二环线经过他的巢穴。",
	["Keep the branch: Nara Wildmane is in Thunder Bluff."] = "保留树枝：纳拉·蛮鬃是在雷霆崖。",
	["Keep the deliveries for Magatha, Jes'rimon and Andron Gant: you pass Thunder Bluff, Orgrimmar and the Undercity later."] = "保留递送物给玛加萨·野性图腾，杰斯雷蒙与安德隆·甘特：你穿过雷霆崖，奥格瑞玛与幽暗城稍后。",
	["Keep the parcel: Royal Overseer Bauhaus is in the Undercity."] = "保留包裹：皇家管理人巴哈乌斯是在幽暗城。",
	["Keep turning in Molten Core materials and Dark Iron Ore at Lokhtos until Exalted."] = "保留交还在熔火之心材料与黑铁矿石在洛克图斯直到崇拜。",
	["Keep turning in feathers and beads until Exalted."] = "保留交还在羽毛与串珠直到崇拜。",
	["Keep west on the road to Donova's camp beside the hot springs."] = "保留西在路上前往多诺瓦的营地在热温泉旁边。",
	["Keep winning Alterac Valley. More Armor Scraps (Murgot Deepforge), Storm Crystals for Arch Druid Renferal (they summon Ivus the Forest Lord) and Frostwolf Hides for the Stormpike Ram Rider Commander all repeat."] = "保留获胜奥特兰克山谷。护甲碎片（莫高特·深炉），风暴水晶给大德鲁伊雷弗拉尔（它们召唤森林之王伊弗斯）与霜狼毛皮给雷矛山羊骑兵指挥官全部重复。",
	["Keep winning Alterac Valley. More Booty! (Smith Regzar), Stormpike Soldier's Blood for Primalist Thurloga (it summons Lokholar the Ice Lord) and Alterac Ram Hides for the Frostwolf Wolf Rider Commander all repeat."] = "保留获胜奥特兰克山谷。取之于敌（铁匠雷格萨），联盟士兵的血给指挥官瑟鲁加（它召唤冰雪之王洛克霍拉）与奥特兰克山羊皮给霜狼骑兵指挥官全部重复。",
	["Keeper Bel'varil"] = "看守者贝瓦里尔",
	["Keeshan hides at the very north end of the valley, by the Burning Steppes border. Escort him down to Lakeshire; Blackrock orcs ambush you on the way."] = "基沙恩下士藏身在非常北尽头的山谷，在旁燃烧平原边界。护送他下前往湖畔镇；黑石杀戮者兽人伏击你在途中。",
	["Kegan Darkmar"] = "克甘达玛",
	["Keldran"] = "科尔丹",
	["Kelm Hargunth hands out one Outrider care package by level"] = "凯尔姆·哈古斯发放1前锋照料包裹在旁等级",
	["Ken'zigla lives in Malaka'jin, the troll village just inside Stonetalon at the end of the road west from Regthar."] = "肯兹格拉住在玛拉卡金，巨魔村庄就在石爪山脉内在道路西来自的端雷戈萨·死门。",
	["Kerlonian Evershade: his escort to Maestra's Post is done on the Ashenvale leg"] = "克罗尼亚·恒影：他的护送前往迈斯特拉岗哨已完成在灰谷腿",
	["Kerlonian sleeps at the Grove of the Ancients in southern Darkshore. Use the Horn of Awakening to wake him and lead him south along the road into Ashenvale to Liladris Moonriver at Maestra's Post; blow the horn again whenever he falls asleep."] = "克罗尼亚·恒影沉睡于在古树之林在南部黑海岸。使用唤醒号角前往唤醒他与引导他南沿着道路进入灰谷前往利拉迪斯·月河在迈斯特拉岗哨；吹响角再次每当他坠落睡着的。",
	["Kernda, at the tunnel mouth"] = "克尔达，在隧道入口/河口",
	["Kernda, just inside the cave: only from Neutral with the Timbermaw"] = "克尔达，就在洞穴内：仅来自中立与木喉",
	["Kernda: the Timbermaw speak to you only from Neutral"] = "克尔达：木喉对话前往你仅来自中立",
	["Khadgar's Essays on Dimensional Convergence"] = "卡德加的空间收敛研究笔记",
	["Khaelyn Steelwing"] = "凯琳·斯蒂文",
	["Khaz Modan Iron"] = "卡兹莫丹铁锭",
	["Khaz Modan Timber"] = "卡兹莫丹木材",
	["Kibler stands at Flame Crest in northern Burning Steppes, near the Blackrock Mountain path."] = "基布雷尔位于烈焰峰在北部燃烧平原，附近黑石山小径。",
	["Kildar and Ogunaro Wolfrunner's kennel are in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor. At 40 Kildar teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Horde race ride these."] = "基尔达与奥古纳罗的兽栏是在奥格瑞玛的荣誉谷。在40基尔达传授骑术（100金每暴雪的设计师），与学习它给你一个坐骑。无限服客户端允许每个部落种族骑行这些。",
	["Kildar and Ogunaro Wolfrunner's kennel are in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor. At 60 Kildar teaches Journeyman Riding (1,000g per Blizzard's designers); Blizzard says learning riding grants a mount. The Forever client sells each swift wolf for 200g at level 60."] = "基尔达与奥古纳罗的兽栏是在奥格瑞玛的荣誉谷。在60基尔达传授中级骑术（1,000金每暴雪的设计师）；暴雪说学习骑行奖励一匹坐骑。无限服客户端出售每个迅捷狼给200金在60级。",
	["Kildar, riding trainer"] = "基尔达，骑术训练师",
	["Kill Rabid Thistle Bears in the hills east of Auberdine, then walk up to the furbolg camp south-east of them: nothing to kill yet."] = "击杀狂暴蓟熊在丘陵在奥伯丁以东，然后步行上前往熊怪营地在它们东南面：无奖励前往击杀尚。",
	["Kill a Firelord, a Molten Giant, an Ancient Core Hound and a Lava Surger in the Molten Core. Every Molten Core elemental and boss also counts toward the Waterlords."] = "击杀一个火焰之王，一个熔核巨人，一个上古熔火恶犬与一个熔岩奔腾者在熔火之心。每个熔火之心元素与首领也计入朝水元素领主方向。",
	["Kill and skin Adult Plainstrider (6), Battleboar (3), Elder Plainstrider (8), Flatland Cougar (7), Flatland Prowler (9), Kodo Calf (7), Mountain Cougar (3), Plainstrider (1), Prairie Stalker (7), Prairie Wolf (5), Prairie Wolf Alpha (9) along the loop until Skinning 50; skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 1-10."] = "击杀与剥皮成年平原陆行鸟（6），斗猪（3），老平原陆行鸟（8），平原狮（7），平原徘徊者（9），小科多兽（7），山狮（3），平原陆行鸟（1），草原捕食者（7），草原狼（5），草原狼前锋（9）沿着环线直到剥皮50；剥皮最高-等级野兽你的技能允许。一个野兽的等级 L 需要技能（L-10）x10上前往20级与 ×5上方。区域1-10级。",
	["Kill and skin Armored Scorpid (7), Bloodtalon Scythemaw (8), Bloodtalon Taillasher (6), Clattering Scorpid (5), Dire Mottled Boar (6), Dreadmaw Crocolisk (9), Durotar Tiger (7), Elder Mottled Boar (8), Mottled Boar (1), Scorpid Worker (3), Thunder Lizard (9), Venomtail Scorpid (9) along the loop until Skinning 50; skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 1-10."] = "击杀与剥皮硬甲蝎（7），血爪锐齿龙（8），血爪鞭尾龙（6），巨钳蝎（5），可怕的杂斑野猪（6），巨齿鳄鱼（9），杜隆塔尔猛虎（7），老杂斑野猪（8），杂斑野猪（1），蝎子（3），雷霆蜥蜴（9），毒尾蝎（9）沿着环线直到剥皮50；剥皮最高-等级野兽你的技能允许。一个野兽的等级 L 需要技能（L-10）x10上前往20级与 ×5上方。区域1-10级。",
	["Kill and skin Coyote (10), Coyote Packleader (11), Young Goretusk (12), Goretusk (14), Great Goretusk (16, needs 60) along the loop until Skinning 100; skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 10-20."] = "击杀与剥皮山狗（10），山狗首领（11），幼年血牙野猪（12），血牙野猪（14），巨型血牙野猪（16，需要60）沿着环线直到剥皮100；剥皮最高-等级野兽你的技能允许。一个野兽的等级 L 需要技能（L-10）x10上前往20级与 ×5上方。区域10-20级。",
