	["Kill and skin Surf Glider (level 48-50) here. The Auction House works too."] = "击杀与剥皮海浪龟（48-50级）此处。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Kill and skin Thistle Bear (11), Rabid Thistle Bear (13), Moonstalker (14), Grizzled Thistle Bear (16, needs 60), Moonstalker Runt (16, needs 60), Moonstalker Sire (17, needs 70), Ghostpaw Runner (19, needs 90), Moonstalker Matriarch (19, needs 90) along the loop until Skinning 100; skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 10-20."] = "击杀与剥皮蓟熊（11），狂暴蓟熊（13），月夜猛虎（14），灰斑蓟熊（16，需要60），月夜猛虎幼崽（16，需要60），月夜雄虎（17，需要70），幽爪奔跑者（19，需要90），月夜雌虎（19，需要90）沿着环线直到剥皮100；剥皮最高-等级野兽你的技能允许。一个野兽的等级 L 需要技能（L-10）x10上前往20级与 ×5上方。区域10-20级。",
	["Kill and skin Vicious Owlbeast (42), Silvermane Wolf (43), Primitive Owlbeast (44), Savage Owlbeast (46, needs 230), Silvermane Stalker (47, needs 235), Saltwater Snapjaw (49, needs 245) along the loop until Skinning 250; skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 40-50."] = "击杀与剥皮邪恶的枭兽（42），银鬃狼（43），远古枭兽（44），野蛮的枭兽（46，需要230），银鬃捕猎者（47，需要235），海水钳嘴龟（49，需要245）沿着环线直到剥皮250；剥皮最高-等级野兽你的技能允许。一个野兽的等级 L 需要技能（L-10）x10上前往20级与 ×5上方。区域40-50级。",
	["Kill and skin Worg (10), Ferocious Grizzled Bear (11), Mottled Worg (11), Giant Grizzled Bear (12), Bloodsnout Worg (16, needs 60) along the loop until Skinning 100; skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 10-20."] = "击杀与剥皮座狼（10），凶猛的灰斑熊（11），杂斑座狼（11），巨型灰斑熊（12），血牙座狼（16，需要60）沿着环线直到剥皮100；剥皮最高-等级野兽你的技能允许。一个野兽的等级 L 需要技能（L-10）x10上前往20级与 ×5上方。区域10-20级。",
	["Kill and skin Young Wetlands Crocolisk (21), Mottled Raptor (22), Highland Raptor (23), Wetlands Crocolisk (23), Highland Lashtail (24), Mottled Screecher (24), Giant Wetlands Crocolisk (25), Mottled Scytheclaw (25), Mottled Razormaw (26, needs 130), Highland Razormaw (27, needs 135), Elder Razormaw (29, needs 145) along the loop until Skinning 150; skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 20-30."] = "击杀与剥皮湿地鳄鱼幼崽（21），杂斑迅猛龙（22），高地迅猛龙（23），湿地鳄鱼（23），高地鞭尾龙（24），杂斑尖啸龙（24），巨型湿地鳄鱼（25），杂斑镰爪龙（25），杂斑刺喉龙（26，需要130），高地刺喉龙（27，需要135），老刺喉龙（29，需要145）沿着环线直到剥皮150；剥皮最高-等级野兽你的技能允许。一个野兽的等级 L 需要技能（L-10）x10上前往20级与 ×5上方。区域20-30级。",
	["Kill the Galak Assassin that comes for Kanati"] = "击杀加拉克刺客该来自给卡纳提·灰云",
	["Kill the elementals for 5 Intact Elemental Bracers, then use the Divining Scroll"] = "击杀元素给5完整的元素护腕，然后使用占卜卷轴",
	["Kill the mobs that drop it at the farm spot Polestar picks for your level and faction. The Auction House works too."] = "击杀怪物该掉落它在农场地点 Polestar 指向给你的等级与阵营。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Killing Onyxia is a point. In Classic her lair needs an attunement: Drakefire Amulet for the Alliance, Blood of the Black Dragon Champion for the Horde."] = "击杀奥妮克希亚是一个点。在经典旧世她的巢穴需要一个门任务：龙火护符给联盟，黑龙勇士之血给部落。",
	["Kim'Jael's Compass"] = "基姆加尔的指南针",
	["Kim'Jael's Scope"] = "基姆加尔的望远镜",
	["Kim'Jael's Stuffed Chicken"] = "基姆加尔的烧鸡",
	["Kim'Jael's Wizzlegoober"] = "基姆加尔的花生",
	["Kim'jael camps at the Legashi Encampment in the north; his equipment lies all over the Thalassian Base Camp just south-east of him."] = "基姆加尔扎营于雷加什营地在北面；他的装备位于全部越过萨拉斯营地就在他东南面。",
	["Kin'weelay"] = "肯维雷",
	["Kindal Moonweaver"] = "辛达尔·月纹",
	["Kinelory"] = "基恩洛",
	["Kirsta's last task needs level 53. The Scarlet Knights and Magi (54-55) working the lumber camp just south-west of her are the closest camp."] = "科尔斯塔·迪普沙东的最后任务需要53级。血色骑士与法师（54-55）有效的伐木场营地就在她西南面是最近的营地。",
	["Klannoc Macleod"] = "克兰诺克·马克雷德",
	["Klannoc Macleod: Berserker Stance"] = "克兰诺克·马克雷德：狂暴姿态",
	["Klaven Mortwake's Journal, in the chest"] = "克拉文·摩特维克的日记，在箱子",
	["Knights and magi work the Northridge Lumber Camp; the medics and hunters camp south of it."] = "骑士与法师有效北山伐木场；医疗兵与猎人营地在它南面。",
	["Kobold Diggers"] = "狗头人掘地工",
	["Kobold Geomancer"] = "狗头人地卜师",
	["Kobold Laborer"] = "狗头人苦力",
	["Kobold Laborers work the tunnels inside the mine. Shinyfinder Narf waits down the second turn on the right."] = "狗头人苦力有效隧道在采矿内。寻宝者纳夫等候下第二交还在右侧。",
	["Kobold Vermin"] = "狗头人歹徒",
	["Kobold Vermin dig in the vineyards north-east of the Abbey. Now and then one drops a Nibbled-On Book: right-click it."] = "狗头人歹徒挖掘在葡萄园在修道院以东北。现在与然后1掉落一个被啃过的书：右键点击它。",
	["Kobold Worker"] = "狗头人劳工",
	["Kodo Bone"] = "科多兽骨",
	["Kodos: Harb Clawhoof, beside Kar Stormsinger in Bloodhoof Village."] = "科多兽：哈布·爪蹄，在卡尔·雷歌旁边在血蹄村。",
	["Kolkar Crag lies west of Sen'jin. The three attack plans sit on the ground among the centaur tents. Pal'juh is held at the crag as well."] = "科卡尔峭壁位于森金村以西。3攻击图纸坐在领地在其中：半人马帐篷。帕尔朱是持有在峭壁作为水井。",
	["Kolkar Wranglers and Stormers hold the camps south of Regthar."] = "科卡尔牧民与峭壁雷鸣蜥蜴要塞扎营在雷戈萨·死门以南。",
	["Kolkar centaur (level 30-33) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "科卡尔半人马（30-33级）掉落它此处。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Kor'geld"] = "考吉尔德",
	["Kor'geld and Yelmak run the alchemy shop in the Drag; Whuut is next door."] = "考吉尔德与耶尔玛克前往炼金术商店在暗巷区；伍特是下一个门。",
	["Kor'gresh, an ogre mage, holds the cave at the southern end of the Witherbark valley."] = "科格雷什，一个食人魔法师，持有洞穴在南部尽头的枯木山谷。",
	["Korran"] = "科兰",
	["Korran: the eggs are in the Field of Giants, later"] = "科兰：蛋是在巨人旷野，稍后",
	["Krakle sends you to Donova Snowden in Winterspring: keep it."] = "克拉兰克派你前往多诺瓦·雪山在冬泉谷：请保留该任务/物品。",
	["Krakle the goblin sits at Golakka Hot Springs, just east of the pylon."] = "克拉兰克地精位于葛拉卡温泉，就在水晶塔以东。",
	["Kranal Fiss stands on the ridge north of the Razormane camp, east of the Crossroads."] = "卡纳尔·菲斯位于山脊北的刺鬃营地，东的十字路口。",
	["Kranal Fiss stands on the ridge north of the Razormane camp."] = "卡纳尔·菲斯位于山脊北的刺鬃营地。",
	["Krang Stonehoof's quest: beat three Novice Warriors (or players in duels) next to him."] = "克朗·石蹄的任务：击败3新战士（或玩家在决斗）下一个前往他。",
	["Kravel Koalbeard"] = "克拉维尔·浓须",
	["Krazek"] = "克拉兹克",
	["Krazek's missing hunters' camp is Nesingwary's: walk among its tents and the investigation completes. River Crocolisks lie along the river below the camp."] = "克拉兹克的失踪的猎人的营地是赫米特·奈辛瓦里二世的：步行在其中：它的帐篷与调查完成。淡水鳄位于沿着河流在营地下方。",
	["Krazek, in the tavern"] = "克拉兹克，在酒馆内",
	["Krazek: for Tran'rek in Gadgetzan"] = "克拉兹克：给特兰雷克在加基森",
	["Krazek: for Tran'rek in Tanaris, keep it"] = "克拉兹克：给特兰雷克在塔纳利斯，请保留该任务/物品",
	["Kreldig Ungor"] = "克雷迪格·安戈尔",
	["Kreldig's next task, Karnitol's Satchel, is a drop on the far coast: skip it."] = "克雷迪格·安戈尔的下一个任务，卡尼托的背包，是一个掉落在对岸：跳过即可。",
	["Krinkle Goodsteel"] = "克林科·古德斯迪尔",
	["Krinkle Goodsteel in Gadgetzan: keep it"] = "克林科·古德斯迪尔在加基森：请保留该任务/物品",
	["Krog"] = "克罗格",
	["Krolg, a furbolg untouched by the corruption, sits south of the road below Mystral Lake."] = "克罗尔格，一个熊怪未受污染的在旁腐化，位于道路下方以南密斯特拉湖。",
	["Krom'Grul walks the caves and mine tunnels of Dreadmaul Rock; if he isn't home, clear the ogres around the entrances until he comes back."] = "克罗格鲁尔步行洞穴与采矿隧道的巨槌石；如果他不是炉石，清理食人魔在入口直到他来自返回周围。",
	["Krueg Skullsplitter"] = "克鲁伊格·碎颅",
	["Krusk"] = "克鲁斯克",
	["Krusk: for the Barrens, later on the route"] = "克鲁斯克：给贫瘠之地，稍后在路线",
	["Kum'isha waits at the Rise of the Defiler, the hill south-west of the keep. The Blasted Lands mobs on the way drop the Imperfect Draenethyst Fragments; bring her what you have."] = "收藏家库米沙等候于污染者高地，山丘在保留以西南。诅咒之地怪物在途中掉落不完美的德莱尼水晶碎片；携带她的所你有。",
	["Kuray'bin stands at the lumber camp. The night elf Outrunners stalk the woods south-east of it; they stealth, so watch for them."] = "库莱比位于伐木场营地。夜晚精灵斥候潜伏树林在它东南面；它们潜行，因此守望给它们。",
	["Kurzen Commando"] = "库尔森特种兵",
	["Kurzen Headshrinker"] = "库尔森精神医师",
	["Kurzen Jungle Fighter"] = "库尔森丛林战士",
	["Kurzen's Mystery: four troll legends"] = "库尔森的秘密：4巨魔传说",
	["Kzan stands behind the Den, on its west side."] = "克赞·荆条位于后面兽穴，在它的西一侧。",
	["Laden Dew Gland"] = "饱满的露水腺",
	["Lady Jaina Proudmoore"] = "吉安娜·普罗德摩尔",
	["Lady's Tear Moss grows around Elegael's camp and Shriekings fly over it. The Al'Aketh camp east of her holds the Bloody Heirloom."] = "女神之泪苔藓生长在艾蕾盖尔·棘爪的周围营地与尖啸幼体飞往越过它。阿尔阿凯斯营地在她东面持有染血的传家宝。",
	["Lago Blackwrench: Gakin the Darkbinder in Stormwind takes it"] = "拉戈·黑钳：黑暗缚灵者加科因在暴风城接收该任务",
	["Laird"] = "莱尔德",
	["Laird's fish stall is by the docks. Then take the boat to Stormwind."] = "莱尔德的钓鱼摊位是在旁码头。然后乘船前往暴风城。",
	["Lakota Windsong"] = "拉克塔·风歌",
	["Lanie Reed"] = "兰尼·瑞德",
	["Lar Prowltusk"] = "拉尔·猎齿",
	["Lar'korwi's lair is just south of the pylon. Use Torwa's bait there; Lar'korwi is level 56 and hits hard, so start at full health."] = "拉克维的巢穴是就在水晶塔以南。使用托尔瓦的鱼饵那里；拉克维是56级与攻击困难，因此开始在完整生命值。",
	["Lar'korwi's lair lies in the jungle north of Torwa, below the eastern cliffs: use Torwa's Pouch there. Lar'korwi is level 56: start at full health."] = "拉克维的巢穴位于丛林在托尔瓦以北，在东部悬崖下方：使用托尔瓦的麻袋那里。拉克维是56级：开始在完整生命值。",
	["Lard"] = "拉尔德",
	["Large Candles"] = "大蜡烛",
	["Large Crag Boar: tame it with the Taming Rod"] = "大峭壁野猪：驯服它与驯兽棒",
	["Large Leather Backpacks"] = "大型皮背包",
	["Large Opal comes from Rich Thorium Vein nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "大猫眼石来自富瑟银矿采集点（采矿）；此是最密集的簇在数据。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Large Opal comes from Small Thorium Vein nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "大猫眼石来自软泥覆盖的瑟银矿脉采集点（采矿）；此是最密集的簇在数据。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Large River Crocolisk Skin"] = "淡水鳄的皮",
	["Large Stone Slab"] = "大石片",
	["Larion"] = "拉瑞安",
	["Laris Geardawdle"] = "拉里斯·空轮",
	["Laris Geardawdle: the oozes are in Felwood, keep it"] = "拉里斯·空轮：软泥怪是在费伍德森林，请保留该任务/物品",
	["Lars"] = "拉尔斯",
	["Lashtail Raptor"] = "鞭尾迅猛龙",
	["Latronicus Moonspear"] = "拉托尼库斯·月矛",
	["Latronicus Moonspear, at the top of the stronghold"] = "拉托尼库斯·月矛，在要塞的顶部",
	["Laurna Morninglight"] = "劳尔娜·晨光",
	["Laurna Morninglight: Priestess Alathea in Darnassus takes it"] = "劳尔娜·晨光：女祭司阿兰希雅在达纳苏斯接收该任务",
	["Lead Dalinda out of the fortress; she walks off once you are clear of it. Vahlarriel takes the turn-in at Nijel's Point at the end of the guide."] = "引导黛琳达·玛雷姆离开要塞；她自行离开一次你是清理的它。瓦拉里尔·屠魔者负责交接该任务在尼耶尔前哨站在本指南末尾。",
	["Lead Ringo north to Marshal's Refuge. When he faints, use Spraggle's Canteen on him to wake him."] = "引导林格北前往马绍尔营地。当他昏迷，使用斯普拉格的水壶在他前往唤醒他。",
	["Lean Venison is orange from 110 (yellow at 150, grey at 190): about 15 crafts to 125. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "瘦鹿肉是橙色来自110（黄色在150，灰色在190）：约15制作前往125。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
	["Lean Venison is orange from 125 (yellow at 150, grey at 190): about 25 crafts to 150. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "瘦鹿肉是橙色来自125（黄色在150，灰色在190）：约25制作前往150。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
	["Learn the Auberdine flight path on the hill south of the inn, then cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven; the Great Bear Spirit sits in the woods to the north-west. Learn the Moonglade flight path in Nighthaven and fly to Rut'theran Village (by way of Auberdine)."] = "学习奥伯丁飞行点在山丘在旅店以南，然后施放传送：月光林地。德迪利特·星焰是在永夜港；巨熊之灵位于树林向西北。学习月光林地飞行点在永夜港与飞往前往鲁瑟兰村（在旁路的奥伯丁）。",
	["Leatherworking runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 1g 7s in all."] = "制皮可随升级同步练习升级。无限服传承系统奖励制作专业在技能等级150，225与300（中级，高级与大师级上限），因此以上每个阶段节点均计入进度。1-75阶段所需材料总计约需花费1金7银。",
	["Leave Deathknell by the road north-east. Calvin Montague stands by the farmhouse at the Solliden Farmstead."] = "跳过丧钟镇在路边东北。卡尔文·蒙泰古站在旁边：农舍在索利丹农场。",
	["Leave Dun Morogh east through the gate tunnel; it opens into Loch Modan at Algaz Station."] = "跳过丹莫罗东穿过大门隧道；它开启进入洛克莫丹在奥加兹岗哨。",
	["Leave Mulgore by the south-eastern pass and follow the road to the Crossroads."] = "跳过莫高雷在旁南-东部穿过与沿着道路前往前往十字路口。",
	["Leave Orgrimmar by the main gate; the zeppelin tower stands just north-east of it. Take the Undercity zeppelin."] = "跳过奥格瑞玛在旁主大门；飞艇哨塔位于就在它东北面。接取幽暗城飞艇。",
	["Leave Stormwind by the main gate, go south to Goldshire and east along the road to the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch. Surena Caledon (level 9) stands by its farmhouse."] = "跳过暴风城在旁主大门，前往南前往闪金镇与东沿着道路前往布拉克威尔南瓜田。苏伦娜·凯尔东（9级）站在旁边：它的农舍。",
	["Leave the Undercity and ride east along the road through Tirisfal Glades to the Bulwark, the Forsaken fort on the border."] = "跳过幽暗城与骑行东沿着道路穿过提瑞斯法林地前往亡灵壁垒，被遗忘者堡垒在边界。",
	["Leave the Undercity and ride east along the road through Tirisfal Glades, past the Bulwark. Felstone Farm is the first farm along the road; Janice waits in the house."] = "跳过幽暗城与骑行东沿着道路穿过提瑞斯法林地，经过亡灵壁垒。詹妮丝·费尔斯通农场是第一农场沿着道路；詹妮丝·费尔斯通等候于房屋。",
	["Leave the Undercity by the lift and walk up through the ruins to the zeppelin towers; the Grom'gol zeppelin is the one on the south-west tower."] = "跳过幽暗城在旁升降梯与步行上穿过废墟前往飞艇哨塔；格罗姆高飞艇是1在西南哨塔。",
	["Leave town by the tunnel and follow the coast north; the letter lies in the Bloodsail camp on the beach, where \"Pretty Boy\" Duncan walks."] = "跳过城镇在旁隧道与沿着海岸北；信件位于血帆营地在海滩上，在帅小伙子邓肯步行。",
	["Leave town by the tunnel; the note lies in the pirates' cove just north of Booty Bay."] = "跳过城镇在旁隧道；说明位于海盗的小湾就在藏宝海湾以北。",
	["Lee Brown"] = "李·布朗",
	["Legacki: Sprinkle and Quixxil come later"] = "莱加奇：斯普琳科与奎克希尔来到稍后",
	["Legacy Points are account-wide: each Legacy Challenge (a class reaching 25, 45 and 60, professions, PvP, exploring) is worth one. The Progress Track gives the Replica Ironforge Air Rifle at 15, the Spectral Bear Cub at 25, the Spectral Bear Tabard at 40 and the Reins of the Spectral Bear at 55. How rewards are delivered is not known yet (perhaps by mail); this goal ticks once the cub is in your bags."] = "传承点数是账号通用：每个传承挑战（一个职业抵达25，45与60，专业，PvP，探索）是价值1。进度追踪给予复制品铁炉堡气步枪在15，幽灵幼熊在25，幽灵熊战袍在40与幽灵熊缰绳在55。如何奖励是送达是不已知尚（或许在旁邮件）；此目标一旦满足即勾选：幼崽是在你的背包。",
	["Legacy Points are account-wide: each Legacy Challenge (a class reaching 25, 45 and 60, professions, PvP, exploring) is worth one. The Progress Track gives the Replica Ironforge Air Rifle at 15, the Spectral Bear Cub at 25, the Spectral Bear Tabard at 40 and the reins at 55. How rewards are delivered is not known yet (perhaps by mail); this goal ticks once the reins are in your bags."] = "传承点数是账号通用：每个传承挑战（一个职业抵达25，45与60，专业，PvP，探索）是价值1。进度追踪给予复制品铁炉堡气步枪在15，幽灵幼熊在25，幽灵熊战袍在40与缰绳在55。如何奖励是送达是不已知尚（或许在旁邮件）；此目标一旦满足即勾选：缰绳是在你的背包。",
	["Lelanai"] = "莱拉奈",
	["Lelanai sells the other colours (200g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "莱拉奈出售其他颜色（200金每个在无限服客户端）。购买任意你需要，或无如果坐骑你曾是给予的是1你像。",
	["Lelanai sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "莱拉奈出售其他颜色（20金每个在无限服客户端）。购买任意你需要，或无如果坐骑你曾是给予的是1你像。",
	["Lelanai: other colours, 20g"] = "莱拉奈：其他颜色，20金",
	["Leper Gnomes around Brewnall and the Gnomeregan road carry the cogs and gears. Ice Claw Bears, Elder Crag Boars and Snow Leopards roam the hills around the lake."] = "麻疯侏儒在烈酒村周围与诺莫瑞根道路携带齿轮与齿轮。冰爪熊，老峭壁野猪与雪豹游荡于丘陵在湖周围。",
	["Lesser Bloodstone Ore"] = "次级血石矿",
