	["Lieutenant Karter"] = "卡特尔中尉",
	["Lieutenant Karter sells the mounts in the Champions' Hall in Stormwind's Old Town, beside the other honor quartermasters such as Officer Areyn. The Forever client lists each at 100g; choose one."] = "卡特尔中尉出售坐骑在黑石勇士的大厅在暴风城的旧城区，在其他荣誉军需官此类作为旁边埃雷恩。无限服客户端列出每个在100金；选择1。",
	["Lieutenant Rotimer"] = "洛泰姆中尉",
	["Light the campfire"] = "圣光营火",
	["Light the campfire next to Raan, then take the meal to Zerril Softbreeze at the cook fire."] = "圣光营火在拉恩·狂风旁边，然后接取餐食前往泽瑞尔·柔风在烹饪营火。",
	["Lightforge Ingot"] = "光铸铁锭",
	["Lil Timmy"] = "利尔·迪米",
	["Lil Timmy sells the White Kitten (60s). He walks around the city, so the waypoint is only one point on his path; look along the nearby streets if he is not there. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "利尔·迪米出售白猫（60银）。他步行在主城周围，因此路径点是仅1点在他的小径；查看沿着附近街道如果他是不那里。每个宠物物品传授它的伙伴当你使用它；目标留在勾选随后。",
	["Liladris Moonriver"] = "利拉迪斯·月河",
	["Linen Bandage is orange from 1 (yellow at 30, grey at 60): about 61 crafts to 50. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "亚麻绷带是橙色来自1（黄色在30，灰色在60）：约61制作前往50。绷带需要无营火：制作它们任何地方。",
	["Linen Cloth"] = "亚麻布",
	["Linken"] = "林克",
	["Linken's Sword goes back to Linken in Un'Goro: keep it."] = "林克的剑交回给林克在安戈洛环形山：请保留该任务/物品。",
	["Linken's letter"] = "林克的信件",
	["Linken, at the back of the refuge"] = "林克，在营地的后方",
	["Listen to Halaan"] = "倾听前往哈兰·鹰眼",
	["Listen to Leonid and Danitha Morr, then talk to him again"] = "倾听前往莱尼德·巴萨罗梅与达妮莎·莫尔，然后对话前往他再次",
	["Listen to his story"] = "倾听前往他的故事",
	["Liv Rizzlefix"] = "莉芙·雷兹菲克斯",
	["Liv Rizzlefix: keep it for Un'Goro"] = "莉芙·雷兹菲克斯：留到安戈洛环形山再做",
	["Liv's workshop is at the north end of Ratchet's docks; Marvon's Chest stands inside it."] = "莉芙的工坊是在棘齿城的北端码头；玛尔冯的箱子位于内部它。",
	["Living Rot spoils within ten minutes: kill the town's Scourge quickly and grind the seven pieces with the Mortar and Pestle at once."] = "生命腐质战利品内部10分钟：击杀城镇的天灾军团迅速与刷怪7碎片与研钵和捣杵一次性。",
	["Loch Frenzy (50%) in Loch Modan, or wherever the arrow points"] = "洛克湖狂鱼（50%）在洛克莫丹，或跟随箭头指示位置",
	["Loch Frenzy Delight is orange from 50 (yellow at 90, grey at 130): about 52 crafts to 100. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "洛克湖狂鱼是橙色来自50（黄色在90，灰色在130）：约52制作前往100。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
	["Locked Cabinet"] = "锁住的柜橱",
	["Locked Cabinet, in the farmhouse"] = "锁住的柜橱，在农舍",
	["Loh'atu"] = "罗哈图",
	["Lokhtos Darkbargainer trades in the Grim Guzzler inside Blackrock Depths. His Favor Amongst the Brotherhood turn-ins take Dark Iron Ore (mined from Dark Iron Deposits with Mining), Blood of the Mountain, Fiery Core, Lava Core and Core Leather. Lothos Riftwaker at the Blackrock Mountain entrance offers attunement to the Molten Core."] = "罗克图斯·暗契可兑换在布莱德·长须黑铁酒吧在黑石杀戮者内深渊。他的兄弟会的好感交任务接取黑铁矿石（开采的来自黑铁矿矿脉与采矿），山脉之血，炽热之核，熔岩之核与熔火犬皮。洛索斯·天痕在黑石山入口提供门任务前往熔火之心。",
	["Lolo the Lookout"] = "哨兵鲁鲁",
	["Lomac Gearstrip, Tinker Town"] = "洛玛克·链带，工匠区",
