	["Mary's Looking Glass"] = "玛丽的眼镜",
	["Masoj hides on the hillside above Dun Garok, south of Durnholde, on the way down to the blossoms."] = "死亡猎手马索吉藏身在山坡在敦加洛克上方，在敦霍尔德以南，在途中下前往花朵。",
