	["Master Mathias Shaw is at SI:7 in Old Town, Gakin the Darkbinder in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar in the Mage Quarter, High Priestess Laurena in the Cathedral of Light."] = "马迪亚斯·肖尔是在军情七处在旧城区，黑暗缚灵者加科因在已宰的羔羊旅店的地窖在法师区，高阶牧师劳瑞娜在圣光大教堂。",
