	["Mayhoa Skyhoof walks a long loop through Orgrimmar (from the Valley of Strength to the Drag); the waypoint is one point on her path. The carrier costs 60s. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "梅霍亚·天蹄步行一个长环线穿过奥格瑞玛（来自力量谷前往暗巷区）；路径点是1点在她的小径。笼子花费60银。每个宠物物品传授它的伙伴当你使用它；目标留在勾选随后。",
