	["Milli Featherwhistle sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "米利·羽哨出售其他颜色（20金每个在无限服客户端）。购买任意你需要，或无如果坐骑你曾是给予的是1你像。",
