	["Mine every Copper (1, green), Tin (65, orange), Silver (from 75) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 125. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 10-20."] = "采矿每个铜矿（1，绿色），锡矿（65，橙色），银色（来自75）采集点你穿过与法阵路径点直到采矿125。熔炼矿石在一个锻炉当你的背包装满：熔炼也提升采矿。区域10-20级。",
	["Mine every Copper (1, green), Tin (65, orange), Silver (from 75) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 125. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 10-25."] = "采矿每个铜矿（1，绿色），锡矿（65，橙色），银色（来自75）采集点你穿过与法阵路径点直到采矿125。熔炼矿石在一个锻炉当你的背包装满：熔炼也提升采矿。区域10-25级。",
	["Mine every Copper (1, green), Tin (65, orange), Silver (from 75) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 125. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 15-25."] = "采矿每个铜矿（1，绿色），锡矿（65，橙色），银色（来自75）采集点你穿过与法阵路径点直到采矿125。熔炼矿石在一个锻炉当你的背包装满：熔炼也提升采矿。区域15-25级。",
	["Mine every Copper (1, green), Tin (65, orange), Silver (from 75) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 125. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 20-30."] = "采矿每个铜矿（1，绿色），锡矿（65，橙色），银色（来自75）采集点你穿过与法阵路径点直到采矿125。熔炼矿石在一个锻炉当你的背包装满：熔炼也提升采矿。区域20-30级。",
	["Mine every Copper (1, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 50. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 1-10."] = "采矿每个铜矿（1，橙色）采集点你穿过与法阵路径点直到采矿50。熔炼矿石在一个锻炉当你的背包装满：熔炼也提升采矿。区域1-10级。",
	["Mine every Copper (1, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 50. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 10-20."] = "采矿每个铜矿（1，橙色）采集点你穿过与法阵路径点直到采矿50。熔炼矿石在一个锻炉当你的背包装满：熔炼也提升采矿。区域10-20级。",
	["Mine every Copper (1, yellow) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 65. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 1-10."] = "采矿每个铜矿（1，黄色）采集点你穿过与法阵路径点直到采矿65。熔炼矿石在一个锻炉当你的背包装满：熔炼也提升采矿。区域1-10级。",
	["Mine every Copper (1, yellow) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 65. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 10-20."] = "采矿每个铜矿（1，黄色）采集点你穿过与法阵路径点直到采矿65。熔炼矿石在一个锻炉当你的背包装满：熔炼也提升采矿。区域10-20级。",
	["Mine every Dark Iron (230, yellow), Truesilver (230, yellow), Small Thorium (245, yellow), Rich Thorium (275, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 300. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 50-58."] = "采矿每个黑铁矿（230，黄色），真银矿（230，黄色），富瑟银（245，黄色），富瑟银矿（275，橙色）采集点你穿过与法阵路径点直到采矿300。熔炼矿石在一个锻炉当你的背包装满：熔炼也提升采矿。区域50-58级。",
	["Mine every Gold (155, green), Mithril (175, green), Dark Iron (230, orange), Truesilver (230, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 245. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 43-50."] = "采矿每个金币（155，绿色），秘银（175，绿色），黑铁矿（230，橙色），真银矿（230，橙色）采集点你穿过与法阵路径点直到采矿245。熔炼矿石在一个锻炉当你的背包装满：熔炼也提升采矿。区域43-50级。",
	["Mine every Gold (155, green), Mithril (175, green), Truesilver (230, orange), Small Thorium (245, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 275. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 45-55."] = "采矿每个金币（155，绿色），秘银（175，绿色），真银矿（230，橙色），富瑟银（245，橙色）采集点你穿过与法阵路径点直到采矿275。熔炼矿石在一个锻炉当你的背包装满：熔炼也提升采矿。区域45-55级。",
	["Mine every Iron (125, green), Gold (155, orange), Mithril (175, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 200. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 35-45."] = "采矿每个铁（125，绿色），金币（155，橙色），秘银（175，橙色）采集点你穿过与法阵路径点直到采矿200。熔炼矿石在一个锻炉当你的背包装满：熔炼也提升采矿。区域35-45级。",
	["Mine every Iron (125, green), Gold (155, yellow), Mithril (175, yellow) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 230. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 35-45."] = "采矿每个铁（125，绿色），金币（155，黄色），秘银（175，黄色）采集点你穿过与法阵路径点直到采矿230。熔炼矿石在一个锻炉当你的背包装满：熔炼也提升采矿。区域35-45级。",
	["Mine every Silver (75, green), Iron (125, yellow), Gold (155, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 175. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 35-45."] = "采矿每个银色（75，绿色），铁（125，黄色），金币（155，橙色）采集点你穿过与法阵路径点直到采矿175。熔炼矿石在一个锻炉当你的背包装满：熔炼也提升采矿。区域35-45级。",
	["Mine every Tin (65, green), Silver (75, green), Iron (125, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 155. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 18-30."] = "采矿每个锡矿（65，绿色），银色（75，绿色），铁（125，橙色）采集点你穿过与法阵路径点直到采矿155。熔炼矿石在一个锻炉当你的背包装满：熔炼也提升采矿。区域18-30级。",
	["Mine every Tin (65, green), Silver (75, green), Iron (125, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 155. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 30-40."] = "采矿每个锡矿（65，绿色），银色（75，绿色），铁（125，橙色）采集点你穿过与法阵路径点直到采矿155。熔炼矿石在一个锻炉当你的背包装满：熔炼也提升采矿。区域30-40级。",
