	["Minor Ice Elemental"] = "次级冰元素",
	["Minor Ice Elementals drift around the frozen lake by the refuge. The three rifles are in the snow around it."] = "次级冰元素漂浮在冰冻的湖在旁营地周围。3步枪是在雪周围它。",
	["Minor Manifestation of Earth"] = "大地之魂",
