	["Minor Manifestation of Water"] = "水之魂",
	["Mirefin Head"] = "泥鳍小鱼",
	["Misha Tor'kren lives in the farmstead south of Thunder Ridge. Kron's Amulet drops from the Death Flayers and Venomtail Scorpids on the ridge."] = "米莎·托克伦住在农庄在雷霆山以南。克鲁恩的护身符掉落来自死亡剥皮者与毒尾蝎在山脊。",
	["Misha's hut stands south of the lizards. The crocolisks along the Southfury River to the west carry Kron's Amulet."] = "米莎的小屋位于蜥蜴以南。鳄鱼沿着怒水河向西携带克鲁恩的护身符。",
	["Missionary Jasaan"] = "传教士贾萨恩",
	["Missionary Jasaan waits at the entrance to Falaath Village, south of Shen'dar. The Mark of Akir lets you walk in among the faithful."] = "传教士贾萨恩等候在法拉斯村入口处，在辛达尔以南。马克的阿基尔允许你步行在其中：信徒。",
	["Mist Veil's Lockbox"] = "迷雾之纱号的保险箱",
	["Mistina Steelshield"] = "米斯蒂娜·钢盾",
	["Mistina Steelshield takes cloth for Ironforge in Ironforge. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "米斯蒂娜·钢盾接收布料给铁炉堡在铁炉堡。第一捐献的毛料，丝绸，魔纹布与符文布（60布料每个）已完成一次与交给大多数声望每布料；之后它们，更多的符文布可重复直到崇拜。崇拜与另一个种族的主城允许你购买该种族的坐骑。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["Mistvale Giblets"] = "薄雾谷猩猩的内脏",
	["Mitsuwa"] = "米苏瓦",
	["Modr Fragment"] = "莫德尔碎片",
	["Mokvar then offers your class's Saving the Best for Last, the final upgrade of the dungeon set."] = "莫克瓦尔然后提供你的职业的把最好的留到最后，最终升级的地下城设置。",
	["Mokvar, Orgrimmar"] = "莫克瓦尔，奥格瑞玛",
	["Molten Core clears carry the rest. Bosses always count; in Classic, trash kills stop giving Waterlords reputation partway up, so late on the bosses do the work."] = "熔火之心清理携带其余。首领总是计入；在经典旧世，杂物击杀停靠给予水元素领主声望半途上，因此后期在首领做有效。",
	["Molten Core materials: Favor Amongst the Brotherhood, Fiery Core, Lava Core, Core Leather and Blood of the Mountain, all repeatable at Lokhtos."] = "熔火之心材料：兄弟会的好感 - 炽热之核，熔岩之核，熔火犬皮与山脉之血，全部可重复在洛克图斯。",
	["Monster Omelet is orange from 240 (yellow at 265, grey at 305): about 105 crafts to 300. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "超级煎蛋卷是橙色来自240（黄色在265，灰色在305）：约105制作前往300。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
	["Moon Priestess Amara"] = "哨兵阿玛拉·夜行者",
	["Moon Priestess Amara, on the road west of the village"] = "哨兵阿玛拉·夜行者，在路上在村庄以西",
	["Moonstalker Fangs"] = "月夜猛虎的牙齿",
	["Moonstalker Sires prowl the woods around the glaive. The Scrying Bowl and the Twilight Tome sit at the bottom of the crater; Therylune stands on its north side."] = "月夜雄虎游荡树林在之剑周围。占卜之碗与暮光密典坐在环形山的底部；瑟瑞露尼位于它的北一侧。",
	["Moonstalkers prowl the hills between Bashal'Aran and the tower. Buzzbox 323 stands on the hill west of the tower; Grizzled Thistle Bears roam around it."] = "月夜猛虎游荡丘陵在巴莎兰与哨塔之间。传声盒323号位于山丘在哨塔以西；灰斑蓟熊游荡周围它。",
	["Moontouched Feather"] = "月光羽毛",
	["Moora"] = "米莱恩",
	["Moora, Salia and Shadow Lord Fel'dan wait at the back of Shadow Hold, the cave in Jaedenar's north. Clear the tunnel as you go."] = "米莱恩，萨莉亚与暗影领主费尔丹等待在暗影堡的后方，洞穴在加德纳尔的北。清理隧道沿途顺路。",
	["Mor'rogal, beside Maggran"] = "摩罗加尔，在马格兰旁边",
	["More Vile Fin murlocs walk the shore just north of the outpost."] = "更多邪鳍鱼人步行岸边就在前哨站以北。",
	["Morgan Stern"] = "摩根·斯特恩",
	["Morgan Stern stands near the inn; Helenia Olden, a trade supplier a few steps south, sells the spices Jarl wants."] = "摩根·斯特恩位于旅店附近；海伦妮亚·奥德恩，一个商业供应商一个少量台阶南，出售香料卡尔需要。",
	["Morin camps by the Winterhoof Water Well south-east of Bloodhoof."] = "摩林·云行者扎营在旁冰蹄水井在血蹄以东南。",
	["Mosshide Fenrunners and Mistweavers roam the riverbanks just west and south of Rethiel; almost every one drops flint."] = "藓皮沼泽行者与织雾者游荡于河岸就在西与在绿色守卫者雷希耶尔以南；几乎每个1掉落燧石。",
	["Mosshide Gnoll"] = "藓皮豺狼人",
	["Mosshide Gnolls and Mongrels hold the hills south-east of the Green Belt."] = "藓皮豺狼人与杂种豺狼人要塞丘陵东南的绿带草地。",
	["Mosshide Mongrel"] = "混血藓皮豺狼人",
	["Most Hinterlands mobs can drop OOX-09/HL's beacon (about 1-2.5% per kill in our data)."] = "大多数辛特兰怪物可以掉落 OOX-09/HL型定位器的信标（约1-2.5%每击杀在我们的数据）。",
	["Most Tanaris mobs can drop OOX-17/TN's beacon (about 0.5-3% per kill in our data)."] = "大多数塔纳利斯怪物可以掉落 OOX-17/TN型定位器的信标（约0.5-3%每击杀在我们的数据）。",
	["Mote of Myzrael"] = "密斯莱尔之尘",
	["Motega Firemane"] = "莫特加·火鬃",
	["Motega's next quest, Sacred Fire, ends in Thunder Bluff, off this route. Skip it."] = "莫特加·火鬃的下一个任务，神圣之火，终结于雷霆崖，不在本路线内。跳过即可。",
	["Mottled Raptor"] = "杂斑迅猛龙",
	["Mottled Raptors and Screechers roam the hills west of the excavation site."] = "杂斑迅猛龙与血沼尖啸龙游荡于丘陵在挖掘场地点以西。",
	["Mottled Razormaw"] = "杂斑刺喉龙",
	["Mottled Screecher"] = "杂斑尖啸龙",
	["Mottled Scytheclaw"] = "杂斑镰爪龙",
	["Mottled Worgs prowl the hills around the house. Then walk south along the lake shore: the Vile Fin Shredders and Tidehunters there drop the murloc eyes."] = "杂斑座狼游荡丘陵在房屋周围。然后步行南沿着湖岸边：邪鳍切割者与潮汐猎手那里掉落鱼人眼睛。",
	["Mound of Dirt"] = "一堆泥土",
	["Mound of loose dirt"] = "松散的土堆",
	["Mount Hyjal is reached from Winterspring through Darkwhisper Gorge in the south. It is Forever's endgame leveling zone."] = "海加尔山是可抵达来自冬泉谷穿过暗语峡谷在南面。它是无限服的满级后升级区域。",
	["Mountain Cougars prowl the hills south of the camp."] = "山狮游荡丘陵在营地以南。",
	["Mountain Lion"] = "山地狮",
	["Mountaineer Barleybrew"] = "巡山人维拉特·麦酒",
	["Mountaineer Gretchen"] = "巡山人格雷琴",
	["Mountaineer Thalos"] = "巡山人萨鲁斯",
	["Mountaineer Thalos guards the tunnel out of the valley, east of Anvilmar."] = "巡山人萨鲁斯卫兵隧道离开山谷，在安威玛尔以东。",
	["Mountaineer Thalos, at the Coldridge tunnel"] = "巡山人萨鲁斯，在寒脊山谷隧道",
	["Mrs. Dalson's Diary"] = "达尔松夫人的日记",
	["Mudcrush Durtfeet"] = "马德克拉什",
	["Mudcrush Durtfeet, at the south edge of the village"] = "马德克拉什，在村庄的南边缘",
	["Muglash walks north up the strand to a naga brazier. Put the brazier out, then guard him through the naga waves until Vorsha is dead."] = "穆格拉什步行北上海滩前往一个纳迦火盆。放置火盆出，然后守卫他穿过纳迦波次直到沃沙是死亡的。",
	["Muglash: starts his escort at once"] = "穆格拉什：始于他的护送一次性",
	["Muigin"] = "穆尔金",
	["Muiredon Battleforge"] = "穆里顿·热炉",
	["Mulgris stands by the farm at the Writhing Haunt, north-east of the fields."] = "穆格雷斯·深水站在旁边：农场在蠕行之祸，在农田以东北。",
	["Mull Thunderhorn"] = "穆尔·雷角",
	["Mull Thunderhorn, for Hamuul in Thunder Bluff"] = "穆尔·雷角，给大德鲁伊哈缪尔·符文图腾在雷霆崖",
	["Muln Earthfury, by the landing: for Turak Runetotem in Thunder Bluff"] = "穆恩·大地之怒，在旁陆地：给图拉克·符文图腾在雷霆崖",
	["Mura Runetotem"] = "茉拉·符文图腾",
	["Mura Runetotem: the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest, next guide"] = "茉拉·符文图腾：瑟伯切尔在银松森林，下一个指南",
	["Murdaloc"] = "莫达洛克",
	["Murgot Deepforge: More Armor Scraps"] = "莫高特·深炉：护甲碎片",
	["Murkdeep"] = "莫克迪普",
	["Murkdeep camps on the beach west of the glaive: kill the murlocs at the camp fire; he comes in the third wave with his hound. Three beached remains lie on the beaches south of Remtravel's Excavation."] = "莫克迪普扎营在海滩上在之剑以西：击杀鱼人在营地营火；他来自在第三波次与他的猎犬。3搁浅的遗骸位于海滩在雷姆塔维尔挖掘场以南。",
	["Murloc"] = "鱼人",
	["Murloc Coastrunners and Raiders line the beach north of the mine. They flee at low health: pull one at a time."] = "滩行鱼人与狼骑兵波尔克路线海滩在采矿以北。它们逃跑在低生命值：拉怪1在一个时间。",
	["Murloc Eye"] = "鱼人的眼球",
	["Murloc Fin"] = "鱼人的鳍",
	["Murloc Flesheaters and Tidecallers line the south shore east of the bridge. Any of them can carry a Spotted Sunfish or a fin."] = "鱼人食腐者与潮汐召唤者路线南岸边在桥以东。任意的它们可以携带一个斑点太阳鱼或一个鱼鳍。",
	["Murloc Foragers and Lurkers line the river south of the bridge. Morgan the Collector, a Defias, walks the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch west of it. Finish the Prowlers and Young Forest Bears on the way."] = "鱼人强盗与潜伏者路线河流在桥以南。收货人莫根，一个迪菲亚，步行布拉克威尔南瓜田在它西面。完成觅食的灰狼与森林幼熊在途中。",
	["Murloc Head"] = "鱼人的头颅",
	["Murloc Streamrunner"] = "鱼人士兵",
	["Murlocs and Murloc Streamrunners hold the east shore; the Junk Piles lie in their camp."] = "鱼人与鱼人士兵要塞东岸边；垃圾堆位于它们的营地。",
	["Mydrannul"] = "迈德兰努尔",
	["Myriaal Mistwake"] = "米莉亚尔·雾痕",
	["Mysterious Red Crystal"] = "神秘的红色水晶",
	["Mysterious Relic"] = "神秘遗物",
	["Mystery Goo: Donova Snowden in Winterspring, keep it"] = "神秘的粘液：多诺瓦·雪山在冬泉谷，请保留该任务/物品",
	["Mystic Yayo'jin"] = "秘法师雅尔金",
	["Nafien waits at the north end of Felwood"] = "纳菲恩等候在费伍德森林的北端",
	["Nafien waits in northern Felwood at the tunnel into Timbermaw Hold."] = "纳菲恩等候于北部费伍德森林在隧道进入木喉要塞。",
	["Nafien: Feathers for Nafien"] = "纳菲恩：给纳菲恩的羽毛",
	["Nara Wildmane"] = "纳拉·蛮鬃",
	["Narkk"] = "纳尔克",
	["Narkk, the pirate supplier in Booty Bay, sells two parrots (40s each). Booty Bay is neutral: the boat from Ratchet and the Stranglethorn road both arrive there. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "纳尔克，海盗供应商在藏宝海湾，出售2鹦鹉（40银每个）。藏宝海湾是中立：船来自棘齿城与荆棘谷道路两个抵达那里。每个宠物物品传授它的伙伴当你使用它；目标留在勾选随后。",
	["Narm Faulk"] = "纳姆·法奥克",
	["Nat Pagle fishes from the shore of a small island off the east coast, south of Theramore."] = "纳特·帕格钓鱼来自岸边的一个小型岛屿偏离/关闭东海岸，在塞拉摩以南。",
	["Nathaniel Dumah"] = "纳萨尼尔·杜马",
	["Nathaniel Dumah: the termites come later, in Terrordale"] = "纳萨尼尔·杜马：白蚁来到稍后，在恐惧谷",
	["Nathanos' errands are not on this route. Skip them."] = "纳萨诺斯·凋零者的差事是不在本路线内。跳过即可。",
	["Nazeer Bloodpike"] = "纳泽尔·血矛",
	["Neeka Bloodscar"] = "尼卡·血痕",
	["Neeru Fireblade"] = "尼尔鲁·火刃",
	["Neeru Fireblade, Cleft of Shadow"] = "尼尔鲁·火刃，暗影裂口",
	["Neru Fragment: the Loose Soil"] = "奈尔鲁碎片：松软的土壤",
	["Nessa Shadowsong"] = "尼莎·影歌",
	["Nether Wing"] = "魔女之翼",
	["Next: Stormwind for training, then the boat from Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine for Ashenvale."] = "下一个：暴风城给训练，然后船来自暴风城港口前往奥伯丁给灰谷。",
	["Next: fly to Darkshire."] = "下一个：飞往前往夜色镇。",
	["Nibbled-On Book"] = "被啃过的书",
	["Night Elves fly from Auberdine to Rut'theran Village; Skyborne take the boat from the Auberdine dock and learn the Rut'theran flight path there. Take the portal up to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave."] = "暗夜精灵飞往来自奥伯丁前往鲁瑟兰村；天裔乘船来自奥伯丁码头与学习鲁瑟兰村飞行点那里。接取传送门上前往玛斯雷·驭熊者在塞纳里奥区。",
	["Nightbane Dark Runner"] = "夜行黑暗狼人",
	["Nightbane Shadow Weaver"] = "夜行织影狼人",
	["Nightbane Tainted One"] = "夜行堕落狼人",
	["Nightbane Vile Fang"] = "夜行邪齿狼人",
	["Nightsaber Fang"] = "夜刃豹的牙齿",
	["Nightsaber Stalker: tame it with the Taming Rod"] = "夜刃捕食者：驯服它与驯兽棒",
	["Nightsabers"] = "夜刃豹",
	["Nightsabers, Strigid Owls and Webwood Lurkers live along the road east. The moonwell is at the west edge of Starbreeze Village."] = "夜刃豹，巨翼枭与树林潜伏者实测沿着道路东。月亮井是在星风村的西边缘。",
	["Nimboya"] = "尼姆布亚",
	["Nimboya: for Arathi, later on the route"] = "尼姆布亚：给阿拉希高地，稍后在路线",
	["Nissa Agamand"] = "妮萨·阿加曼德",
	["Nissa Firestone, Ironforge"] = "尼莎·火石，铁炉堡",
	["Noboru wanders the clearing south-west of the Fallow Sanctuary; his cudgel starts a quest."] = "诺博鲁游荡空地西南的农田避难所；他的木槌始于一个任务。",
	["Noggle Ficklespragg"] = "诺格·斯巴格",
	["Noggle's Satchel"] = "诺格的背包",
	["Nori Pridedrift, next to him"] = "诺里斯·激流，下一个前往他",
	["North again to the Yoricks' house. Ivar the Foul lurks a short walk west of it."] = "北再次前往奎恩·尤瑞克的房屋。邪恶的伊瓦潜伏一个不足步行在它西面。",
	["North along the coast, Lard's picnic basket is on the small island; a Vilebranch Kidnapper guards it."] = "北沿着海岸，拉尔德的野餐篮子是在小型岛屿；一个邪枝绑架者卫兵它。",
	["North along the eastern hills, the satyrs hold the ruins of Sargeron. The Shadowstalkers walk unseen; the four kinds you need do not."] = "北沿着东部丘陵，萨特要塞废墟的萨格隆。碧火捕猎者步行隐形的；4种类你需要做不。",
	["North along the hills. Asterion waits in the ruins of Bashal'Aran; Wild Grells and Vile Sprites fill them, Deth'ryll Satyrs the eastern edge. Buzzbox 411 stands by the road west of the ruins."] = "北沿着丘陵。阿斯特利安等候在废墟中的巴莎兰；野生劣魔与恶灵劣魔装满它们，戴瑟雷萨特东部边缘。传声盒411号位于路边在废墟以西。",
	["North of Maestra's Post, plant bundles lie around the ruins of Bathran's Haunt. Dark Strand cultists hold the ruins just south of them: any of them can drop the Glowing Soul Gem."] = "在迈斯特拉岗哨以北，植物捆位于废墟的周围巴斯兰鬼屋。深色暗滩唤魔师邪教徒要塞废墟就在它们南面：任意的它们可以掉落发光的灵魂宝石。",
	["North of Molsen Farm. Defias Trappers and Smugglers camp outside the mine, Kobold Diggers work inside. Furlbrow's Wardrobe stands by the ruined house east of the mine."] = "在莫尔森农场以北。迪菲亚捕兽者与走私者营地在采矿外，狗头人掘地工有效内部。法布隆的柜子站在旁边：毁坏的房屋在采矿以东。",
	["North of Torwa, a dead Threshadon lies by the water."] = "在托尔瓦以北，一个死亡的蛇颈龙位于旁水。",
	["North of the Sepulcher. Nightlash haunts the Dead Field: kill it, then walk across the field."] = "北的瑟伯切尔。奈塔拉什出没死去的教徒奥斯莱特元帅：击杀它，然后步行穿过田野。",
	["North of the cones: the Wind Hollows drift around the refugees' camp, the Abandoned Belongings lie between the tents, and Resaan Nimbuswalker lies at its north end."] = "在松果以北：风穴魔漂浮在营地周围的营地，遗弃的随身物品位于之间帐篷，与雷萨恩伊拉妮·云行者位于它的北尽头。",
	["North of the gnolls the ogres hold a hilltop outpost; pull the ogre-magi to you. The cobalt is in the dirt mounds around the outpost, and the scroll lies on the ground inside it."] = "在豺狼人食人魔要塞一个山顶前哨站以北；拉怪食人魔-法师前往你。钴是在泥土土堆在前哨站周围，与卷轴位于领地内部它。",
	["North to the Dry Hills. Walton's camp and Vrang Wildgore are a few steps apart below the hills."] = "北前往枯水谷。沃尔顿的营地与弗朗恩·凝血是一个少量台阶相隔在丘陵下方。",
	["North to the lumber camp; set the termite barrel down in the middle of the mill."] = "北前往伐木场营地；设置白蚁木桶下在磨坊的中央。",
	["North up the road to Splintertree Post and Night Run beside it."] = "北顺着道路往上前往碎木岗哨与夜道谷旁边它。",
	["North-east from Ursal's den, back to Dolanaar."] = "东北来自乌萨尔的兽穴，返回前往多兰纳尔。",
	["North-east of Hammerfall the Drywhisker kobolds mine the gorge; the Kobolds at the mouth and the Diggers and Surveyors deeper in all drop the Motes of Myzrael."] = "在落锤镇以东北枯须狗头人采矿峡谷；狗头人在入口/河口与迪菲亚掘地工与勘测员更深处在全部掉落微粒的密斯莱尔。",
	["North-east of Mistvale, Zanzil's followers camp in the jungle; every one of them can carry the mixture."] = "在迷雾谷以东北，赞吉尔的追随者扎营于丛林；每个1的它们可以携带混合物。",
	["North-east of the logging camp. Defias Rogue Wizards camp on the shores of the lake."] = "在伐木营地以东北。迪菲亚流浪巫师营地在海岸的湖。",
	["North-west along the road, the Rage Scar yetis live around the caves in the hills. Any of them can also drop a Perfect Yeti Hide, which starts a quest of its own."] = "西北沿着道路，怒痕雪人实测在洞穴在丘陵周围。任意的它们可以也掉落一个完美的雪人毛皮，其中始于一个任务的它的自己的。",
	["North-west of Grom'gol the Vile Reef lies under the water off the coast. The Tablet Shard rests on the sea floor by the sunken ruins; watch your breath and the murlocs."] = "在格罗姆高以西北邪恶暗礁位于下方水偏离/关闭海岸。石板碎片停放于在大海楼层在旁沉没的废墟；守望你的吐息与鱼人。",
	["North-west of Splintertree, the Felmusk satyrs camp in the woods. Every satyr can drop horns."] = "在碎木岗哨以西北，邪雾萨特扎营于树林。每个萨特可以掉落角。",
	["North-west of Valanaar along the road: Fendaal Windstone watches the Al'Aketh Assassins; the dead cultist lies just north of him."] = "在瓦拉纳尔以西北沿着道路：芬达尔·风石注视奥阿凯斯刺客；死亡的邪教徒位于就在他北面。",
	["Northshire Valley opens onto Elwynn Forest; Goldshire is south down the road."] = "北郡山谷通向艾尔文森林；闪金镇是南顺着道路。",
	["Northwatch Hold, on the coast further south. The Theramore Marines and Preservers (15-16) drop the medals; Captain Fairmount (20) and the two cannoneers (19) stand in the keep and on its walls, and they are why the hold waits until now."] = "北方城堡，在海岸边更远处南。塞拉摩水兵与保护者（15-16）掉落奖章；法莫斯队长（20）与2炮手（19）位于要塞内与在它的城墙，与它们是原因要塞等候直到现在。",
	["Novice Elreth"] = "新兵艾尔雷斯",
	["Novice Elreth, beside the church"] = "新兵艾尔雷斯，在教堂旁边",
	["Novice Thaivand"] = "学徒塞万德",
	["Nyalah Brightfire"] = "妮雅拉·明火",
	["OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon, a rare drop"] = "OOX-09/HL定位器，稀有掉落",
	["OOX-17/TN Distress Beacon, a rare drop"] = "OOX-17/TN定位器，稀有掉落",
	["Oasis Snapjaws crawl around Lushwater Oasis, south-west of the Crossroads, and around the Stagnant Oasis."] = "绿洲钳嘴龟爬行在甜水绿洲周围，西南的十字路口，与周围死水绿洲。",
	["Oasis Snapjaws crowd the water of Lushwater Oasis, south-west of the Crossroads."] = "绿洲钳嘴龟怪群水的甜水绿洲，西南的十字路口。",
	["Oben Rageclaw"] = "奥本·怒爪",
	["Oglethorpe Obnoticus"] = "奥格索普·奥布诺提斯",
	["Oglethorpe Obnoticus is in Booty Bay. With all three robots home he offers An OOX of Your Own, whose reward is the Mechanical Chicken; it needs level 45."] = "奥格索普·奥布诺提斯是在藏宝海湾。与全部3机器人炉石他提供你自己的OOX，其奖励是机械小鸡；它需要45级。",
	["Ogron waits in the Quagmire east of the village. Follow him to Reethe and keep him alive through the fight that breaks out."] = "奥格隆等候于夸格米尔在村庄以东。沿着他前往瑞瑟与保留他存活穿过迎战该破坏出。",
	["Ogunaro Wolfrunner"] = "奥古纳罗",
	["Ogunaro Wolfrunner sells the other colours (200g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "奥古纳罗出售其他颜色（200金每个在无限服客户端）。购买任意你需要，或无如果坐骑你曾是给予的是1你像。",
	["Ogunaro Wolfrunner sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "奥古纳罗出售其他颜色（20金每个在无限服客户端）。购买任意你需要，或无如果坐骑你曾是给予的是1你像。",
	["Okra"] = "秋葵",
	["Ol' Emma, who walks the canals"] = "艾玛，其步行运河",
	["Olariaan Swiftburn"] = "奥拉里安·疾燃",
	["Omusa Thunderhorn"] = "欧姆萨·雷角",
	["On Hunter Rise. Have the Wool, Silk and Mageweave in your bags."] = "在猎人高地。有毛料，丝绸与魔纹布在你的背包。",
	["On Legacki, by the inn"] = "在莱加奇，在旅店旁",
	["On Sprinkle"] = "在斯普琳科",
	["On the ride north to Ratchet, Fray Island lies off the Merchant Coast south of the town: wade over the sand bar shallows. Klannoc Macleod sends four challengers and then Big Will (level 33) at you, one at a time."] = "在骑行北前往棘齿城，勇士岛位于偏离/关闭商人海岸在城镇以南：涉水越过沙子锭浅滩。克兰诺克·马克雷德派往4挑战者与然后比格维尔（33级）在你，1在一个时间。",
	["On the ride south through the Wetlands, the Dragonmaw Bonewarders and Shadowwarders hold the hills just east of the road: the rods drop from them."] = "在骑行南穿过湿地，龙喉白骨守卫与暗影守卫要塞丘陵就在道路以东：棒掉落来自它们。",
	["On the road south through the Barrens, Takar the Seer camps east of the road, north-east of Camp Taurajo; come in from the east and keep clear of the Horde guards."] = "在路上南穿过贫瘠之地，先知塔卡尔扎营在道路以东，在陶拉祖营地以东北；来到在来自东与保留清理的部落卫兵。",
	["On the way back east, the Vilebranch soothsayers hold the Altar of Zul, the troll temple south of the central hills. Qiaga and Morta'gya the Keeper (elite, 50) stand at its top: take the soothsayers on the lower steps."] = "在返回途中东，邪枝占卜师要塞祖尔祭坛，巨魔神庙在中央丘陵以南。琪亚加与守护者莫塔加亚（精英，50）位于它的顶部：接取占卜师在下层台阶。",
	["On the way back to the Crossroads, the Razormane camp again: Geomancers and Defenders hold its eastern half; Kreenig Snarlsnout walks among them."] = "在返回途中前往十字路口，刺鬃营地再次：坑道鼠地卜师与防御者要塞它的东部一半；克里尼格·糟鼻步行在其中：它们。",
	["On the way north, back to Urs'endris by the falls."] = "在途中北，返回前往乌尔森德里斯在旁坠落。",
	["Only if Dalar gave you Arugal's Folly: the Bloodhowlers prowl the woods south-west of Ambermill, east of Pyrewood; they drop the Worgen Bits."] = "仅如果达拉尔·道恩维沃尔给的你阿鲁高的愚行：血嚎者游荡树林在安伯米尔以西南，在焚木村以东；它们掉落狼人碎块。",
	["Only if Donova gave you Toxic Horrors: ride north up the Felwood road to Irontree Woods; the Toxic Horrors ooze between the trees."] = "仅如果多诺瓦给的你剧毒之水：骑行北上费伍德森林道路前往铁木森林；剧毒之水软泥怪之间树木。",
	["Only if Gallywix fell in the Barrens (Mission: Possible But Not Probable): Serge Hinott stands in Tarren Mill. Wait beside him while he brews the cure, then take your reward: Poisons."] = "仅如果加里维克斯掉落在贫瘠之地（基本不可能的任务）：瑟尔格·希诺特位于塔伦米尔。等待旁边他当他酿造治愈，然后接取你的奖励：毒药。",
	["Only if Gluggle gave you the pendant in Stranglethorn"] = "仅如果格鲁格尔给的你挂坠在荆棘谷",
	["Only if a Blood Red Key dropped: use it to start the quest, then free Arko'narin in her cage in Shadow Hold, the cave at the north end of Jaedenar, and escort her out."] = "仅如果一个血红钥匙掉落：使用它前往开始任务，然后解救亚科纳琳在她的笼子在暗影堡，洞穴在加德纳尔的北端，与护送她的出。",
	["Only if a Winterfall Ritual Totem dropped for you: Kernda waits at the Felwood entrance of Timbermaw Hold, and speaks to you only at Neutral with the Timbermaw."] = "仅如果一个冬泉仪祭图腾掉落给你：克尔达等候于费伍德森林入口的木喉要塞，与对话前往你仅在中立与木喉。",
	["Only if he takes the isosprings alone"] = "仅如果他接收温泉独自",
	["Only if the letter dropped"] = "仅如果信件掉落",
	["Only if you are not level 48 yet."] = "仅如果你是不48级尚。",
	["Only if you carry Winterfall Runners: the runners walk the road from Timbermaw Hold toward Winterfall Village in small groups; wait by the road near Donova and kill them as they pass. Each one carries a crate."] = "仅如果你携带冬泉信使：奔行者步行道路来自木喉要塞朝寒水村方向在小型小队；等待在路边在多诺瓦附近与击杀它们作为它们穿过。每个1携带一个木箱。",
	["Only if you found a Winterfall Firewater flask in Winterspring: ride north up the road. The cauldron stands in Felpaw Village, just south-west of Timbermaw Hold; the Deadwood furbolgs there are hostile."] = "仅如果你找到一个冬泉火酒烧瓶在冬泉谷：骑行北顺着道路往上。大锅位于魔爪村，就在木喉要塞以西南；死木熊怪那里是敌对。",
	["Only if you looted An Old History Book in Duskwood"] = "仅如果你拾取的一本破旧的历史书在暮色森林",
	["Only if you looted a Westfall Deed in Elwynn: right-click it"] = "仅如果你拾取的一个西部荒野地契在艾尔文森林：右键点击它",
	["Only if you rescued Arko'narin: the succubus Rakaiah waits in the middle of Jaedenar, beside the Remains of Trey Lightforge."] = "仅如果你获救的亚科纳琳：魅魔拉凯雅等候在加德纳尔的中央，旁边特雷·莱弗治的残骸。",
	["Only once all three robots are home"] = "仅一次全部3机器人是炉石",
	["Only with 30 Runecloth, and only at Neutral with the Timbermaw: follow the road north to Timbermaw Hold; Meilosh trades just inside the entrance."] = "仅与30符文布，与仅在中立与木喉：沿着道路前往北前往木喉要塞；梅罗什可兑换就在入口内。",
	["Only with 5 Deadwood Headdress Feathers"] = "仅与5死木头饰羽毛",
	["Only with the Grimesilt Outhouse Key: back east to the Wooden Outhouse at the dig site."] = "仅与格里塞特厕所钥匙：返回东前往木制厕所在挖掘地点。",
	["Only with the distress beacon: OOX-17/TN sits south-east of Scrimshank's hive. Escort it north to Steamwheedle Port; its reward waits with Oglethorpe in Booty Bay."] = "仅与求救信标：OOX-17/TN型定位器位于斯克里姆山克的以东南虫巢。护送它北前往热砂港；它的奖励等候与奥格索普·奥布诺提斯在藏宝海湾。",
	["Only with the distress beacon: the robot sits at the head of the river west of Skulk Rock. Escort it east to the shore beyond the Overlook Cliffs; its reward waits with Oglethorpe in Booty Bay."] = "仅与求救信标：机器人位于河流的尽头在隐匿石以西。护送它东前往岸边越过悬崖悬崖；它的奖励等候与奥格索普·奥布诺提斯在藏宝海湾。",
	["Only with the distress beacon: the robot sits in a small cave on the north side of Feral Scar Vale. Escort it to the dock on the Forgotten Coast; yetis and gorillas ambush you on the way. Its reward waits in Booty Bay for a later visit."] = "仅与求救信标：机器人位于一个小型洞穴在深痕谷的北侧。护送它前往码头在被遗忘的海岸；雪人与猩猩伏击你在途中。它的奖励等候于藏宝海湾给一个稍后造访。",
	["Onu"] = "安努",
	["Onu, at the Grove"] = "安努，在树林",
	["Onyxia's Lair, Dustwallow Marsh"] = "奥妮克希亚的巢穴，尘泥沼泽",
	["Oozes drop the Oozing Bag: the Vile Slimes, Large Vile Slimes and Devouring Oozes of Western Plaguelands, and the oozes of Felwood, Un'Goro Crater and Eastern Plaguelands, at about 0.07-0.09% per kill in our data. The waypoint is a Vile Slime spawn in eastern Western Plaguelands."] = "软泥怪掉落沾满淤泥的袋子：可憎的软泥怪，可憎的大软泥怪与吞噬淤泥怪的西瘟疫之地，与软泥怪的费伍德森林，安戈洛环形山与东瘟疫之地，在约0.07-0.09%每击杀在我们的数据。路径点是一个可憎的软泥怪刷新在东部西瘟疫之地。",
	["Open Giant Clams here. The Auction House works too."] = "打开/开启巨型蚌壳此处。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Open Marvon's Chest for the Stone Circle"] = "打开/开启玛尔冯的箱子给石环",
	["Open the Oozing Bag from your bags."] = "打开渗漏的袋子来自你的背包。",
	["Ophek, by the inn"] = "奥菲克，在旅店旁",
	["Optional. Running Stratholme, Scholomance, Lower Blackrock Spire or Blackrock Depths with a group instead of grinding gets you there faster."] = "可选。刷斯坦索姆，通灵学院，下层黑石塔或黑石杀戮者深渊如果有队伍代替的刷怪使你达到你那里更快。",
	["Optional: Franclorn's ghost stands on his tomb on the great chain inside Blackrock Mountain, and only the dead can see him. If you die near the mountain anyway, run your spirit to him before resurrecting."] = "可选：弗兰克罗恩·铸铁的幽灵位于他的陵墓在巨型任务链在黑石山内，与仅死亡的可以查看他。如果你死亡在山脉无论如何附近，前往你的之灵前往他之前复活。",
	["Optional: Sanath Lim-yo wants two Undamaged Hippogryph Feathers from the hippogryphs around his camp. The data lists no experience for it."] = "可选：萨纳斯需要2完好的角鹰兽羽毛来自角鹰兽周围他的营地。数据列出无经验值给它。",
	["Optional: with a group, a 55-60 dungeon replaces the grind below."] = "可选：如果有队伍，一个55-60地下城替代刷怪下方。",
	["Oracle Tree Bark, just west of the moonwell"] = "神谕林树皮，就在月亮井以西",
	["Oralius"] = "奥拉留斯",
	["Oralius: the Blackrock orcs drop the medallions, keep it open all through the Steppes"] = "奥拉留斯：黑石杀戮者兽人掉落勋章，请保留该任务/物品打开/开启全部穿过平原",
	["Oran Snakewrithe, the Royal Quarter"] = "奥兰·斯内克威瑟，皇家区",
	["Oran stands in the Magic Quarter."] = "奥兰·斯内克威瑟位于魔法区。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 110, yellow until 130, green until 150. Needs an anvil nearby."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到110，黄色直到130，绿色直到150。需要一个铁砧附近。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 130, yellow until 150, green until 170. Alchemy 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到130，黄色直到150，绿色直到170。炼金术150是一个传承系统里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 135, yellow until 155, green until 175. Enchant your own gear: any item for that slot will do."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到135，黄色直到155，绿色直到175。附魔你的自己的装备：任意物品给该栏位会做。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 140, yellow until 157, green until 175. Tailoring 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到140，黄色直到157，绿色直到175。裁缝150是一个传承系统里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 145, yellow until 160, green until 175. Needs an anvil nearby. Blacksmithing 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到145，黄色直到160，绿色直到175。需要一个铁砧附近。锻造150是一个传承系统里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 15, yellow until 35, green until 55."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到15，黄色直到35，绿色直到55。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 165, yellow until 185, green until 205. Enchant your own gear: any item for that slot will do."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到165，黄色直到185，绿色直到205。附魔你的自己的装备：任意物品给该栏位会做。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 165, yellow until 185, green until 205. Enchant your own gear: any item for that slot will do. Enchanting 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到165，黄色直到185，绿色直到205。附魔你的自己的装备：任意物品给该栏位会做。附魔150是一个传承系统里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 195, yellow until 210, green until 225."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到195，黄色直到210，绿色直到225。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 195, yellow until 215, green until 235. Alchemy 225 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到195，黄色直到215，绿色直到235。炼金术225是一个传承系统里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 20, yellow until 30, green until 40."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到20，黄色直到30，绿色直到40。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 260, yellow until 270, green until 280."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到260，黄色直到270，绿色直到280。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 265, yellow until 280, green until 295."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到265，黄色直到280，绿色直到295。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 280, yellow until 290, green until 300."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到280，黄色直到290，绿色直到300。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 280, yellow until 290, green until 300. Needs an anvil nearby."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到280，黄色直到290，绿色直到300。需要一个铁砧附近。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 280, yellow until 300, green until 320. Alchemy 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到280，黄色直到300，绿色直到320。炼金术300是一个传承系统里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 285, yellow until 295, green until 305. Enchanting 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到285，黄色直到295，绿色直到305。附魔300是一个传承系统里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 290, yellow until 305, green until 320. Tailoring 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到290，黄色直到305，绿色直到320。裁缝300是一个传承系统里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 295, yellow until 305, green until 315. Needs an anvil nearby. Engineering 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到295，黄色直到305，绿色直到315。需要一个铁砧附近。工程学300是一个传承系统里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 30, yellow until 45, green until 60."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到30，黄色直到45，绿色直到60。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 300, yellow until 312, green until 325. Needs an anvil nearby."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到300，黄色直到312，绿色直到325。需要一个铁砧附近。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 305, yellow until 317, green until 330. Needs an anvil nearby. Blacksmithing 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到305，黄色直到317，绿色直到330。需要一个铁砧附近。锻造300是一个传承系统里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 310, yellow until 320, green until 330. Leatherworking 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到310，黄色直到320，绿色直到330。制皮300是一个传承系统里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 35, yellow until 47, green until 60."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到35，黄色直到47，绿色直到60。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 55, yellow until 75, green until 95. 75 is the Apprentice cap."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到55，黄色直到75，绿色直到95。75是初级上限。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 70, yellow until 90, green until 110. Enchant your own gear: any item for that slot will do. 75 is the Apprentice cap."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到70，黄色直到90，绿色直到110。附魔你的自己的装备：任意物品给该栏位会做。75是初级上限。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 85, yellow until 105, green until 125."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到85，黄色直到105，绿色直到125。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 90, yellow until 105, green until 120."] = "橙色（一个点每个制作）直到90，黄色直到105，绿色直到120。",
	["Orendil Broadleaf"] = "奥雷迪尔·阔叶",
	["Orgnil Soulscar"] = "奥戈尼尔·魂痕",
	["Orgrimmar's main gate is just west of Skull Rock. Gan'rul stands in the Cleft of Shadow, the canyon under the Valley of Strength."] = "奥格瑞玛的主大门是就在骷髅石以西。甘鲁尔·血眼位于暗影裂口，峡谷在下方力量谷。",
	["Ormak Grimshot stands in the Valley of Honor, Ur'kyo in the Valley of Spirits on the city's west side."] = "奥玛克位于荣誉谷，乌尔库在精神谷在主城的西一侧。",
	["Ormak Grimshot: Beast Training"] = "奥玛克：训练野兽",
	["Ormer Ironbraid"] = "奥莫尔·铁衣",
	["Ormin Pelford"] = "奥尔明·佩尔福德",
	["Orwin Gizzmick"] = "奥尔文·吉兹米克",
	["Oslow's Toolbox"] = "奥斯洛的工具箱",
	["Osseous Agitator"] = "骨质分离素",
	["Otho Moji'ko"] = "奥索·莫吉克",
	["Outhouse"] = "厕所",
	["Overgrown Duskweed grows in the fields around the vineyards and the Stonefield farm; Stonetusk Boars around them give the blood."] = "茂盛的暮光草生长在农田在葡萄园与周围斯通菲尔德农场；石牙野猪周围它们交给血液。",
	["Overlord Mok'Morokk"] = "莫格穆洛克大王",
	["Overlord Mok'Morokk is elite: grouping up is advised. Beat him down until he gives up, then report to Draz'Zilb."] = "莫格穆洛克大王为精英：建议组队前往。击败他下直到他给予上，然后报告前往德拉兹辛比。",
	["Owatanka's Tailspike"] = "奥瓦坦卡的尾刺",
	["Ozwin Ironsprocket"] = "奥兹温·铁齿轮",
	["Pa'zula"] = "帕祖拉",
	["Pa'zula: enchanters only, the residue is disenchanted from Hexed Pendants"] = "帕祖拉：附魔师仅，残留物是分解的来自妖术挂坠",
	["Pages of The Green Hills of Stranglethorn drop at about 1% each from the Bloodscalp and Skullsplitter trolls; keep every page you loot and look on the auction house for the rest. Barnil takes the chapters later in this guide."] = "书页的荆棘谷的青山掉落在约1%每个来自血顶与碎颅巨魔；保留每个书页你拾取与查看在拍卖房屋给其余。巴尼尔·石罐接收章节在本指南稍后阶段。",
	["Pages of The Green Hills of Stranglethorn drop at about 1% each from the Bloodscalp and Skullsplitter trolls; take what drops and check the Auction House for the rest."] = "书页的荆棘谷的青山掉落在约1%每个来自血顶与碎颅巨魔；接取所掉落与查看拍卖行给其余。",
	["Painted Gnoll Armbands"] = "彩色豺狼人臂章",
	["Paladins: Rediscovering the Light is done once you have healed five Injured Deathguard around the church with Holy Light."] = "圣骑士：重拾圣光已完成一次你有治疗5受伤的死亡卫兵在教堂与周围圣光术。",
	["Pamela's Doll's Head"] = "帕米拉的洋娃娃的脑袋",
	["Pamela's Doll's Left Side"] = "帕米拉的洋娃娃的左身",
	["Pamela's Doll's Right Side"] = "帕米拉的洋娃娃的右身",
	["Pamela's ghost stands in the ruins of Darrowshire, in the south-west."] = "帕米拉的幽灵位于废墟中的达隆郡，在西南面。",
	["Pamela's own errand is not on this route. Skip it."] = "帕米拉的自己的差事是不在本路线内。跳过即可。",
	["Panther"] = "黑豹",
	["Pao'ka Swiftmountain"] = "波卡·雨山",
	["Parrot Cage (Cockatiel), 40s"] = "鹦鹉笼（红尾鹦鹉），40银",
	["Parrot Cage (Senegal), 40s"] = "鹦鹉笼（金翼鹦鹉），40银",
	["Pathfinders, Den Watchers and Totemics share the furbolg camps around the hot springs; Ragged Owlbeasts roam the slopes between them. Kill Totemics first. Save every Runecloth you loot for Meilosh."] = "托尔瓦·寻路者，兽穴守夜人道茨与图腾师共享熊怪扎营在热温泉周围；蓬毛枭兽游荡于山坡之间它们。击杀图腾师第一。留存每个符文布你拾取给梅罗什。",
	["Paw of Sin'Dall"] = "辛达尔的爪子",
	["Peacekeeper Vaaniel"] = "维和者瓦尼尔",
	["Peacekeeper Vaaniel holds the western watch, south-west of Falaath. Skypriest Aanders and the fallen guards lie just south of her."] = "维和者瓦尼尔持有西部守望，在法拉斯以西南。天空祭司安德斯与阵亡的卫兵位于就在她南面。",
	["Peerless Eye: Twilight Disciples and Thugs"] = "无双之眼：暮光信徒与暴徒",
	["Pelturas Whitemoon"] = "皮尔图拉斯·怀特姆恩",
	["Pendant of the Sea Lion: join the two halves"] = "海狮坠饰：加入2两半",
	["Pendant of the Sea Lion: use a half at the Shrine of Remulos"] = "海狮坠饰：使用一个一半在雷姆洛斯神殿",
	["Perfect Yeti Hide, a rare drop"] = "完美的雪人毛皮，稀有掉落",
	["Perrine's Chest stands beside Captain Perrine at the camp's south end."] = "佩林的箱子位于派瑞恩队长旁边在营地的南尽头。",
	["Pesky Cirrusflies and Juvenile Vuldren roam the grove just south-east of the village."] = "恼人的卷云蝇与幼年瓦德伦游荡于树林就在村庄以东南。",
	["Pestlezugg's next quest needs the Gorishi Hive Queen, an elite boss. Skip it."] = "炼金师匹斯特苏格的下一个任务需要格里什皇后，一个精英首领。跳过即可。",
	["Phin Odelic"] = "费恩·奥德利克",
