	["Rabbit Crate (Snowshoe), 20s"] = "兔笼（黄纹兔），20银",
	["Rabid Dire Wolf"] = "疯狂的恐狼",
	["Rabid Dire Wolves roam the woods around the cemetery and Abercrombie, Starving Dire Wolves the hills north-east of him. Pygmy Venom Web Spiders crawl east of the cemetery and drop the venom. Every ghoul of the cemetery's northern half can drop a fang."] = "疯狂的恐狼游荡于树林在墓园与周围亚伯克隆比，饥饿的恐狼丘陵在他东北面。小型结网毒蜘蛛爬行在墓园与掉落毒液以东。每个食尸鬼的墓园的北部一半可以掉落一个獠牙。",
	["Rabid Thistle Bears roam the hills just east of Auberdine. Use Tharnariun's Hope on one and lead it back to him."] = "狂暴蓟熊游荡于丘陵就在奥伯丁以东。使用萨纳瑞恩的希望在1与引导它返回前往他。",
	["Rabine Saturna in Moonglade: keep it"] = "拉比恩·萨图纳在月光林地：请保留该任务/物品",
	["Rabine Saturna waits in Moonglade: keep it for later."] = "拉比恩·萨图纳等候于月光林地：留着稍后做。",
	["Rabine Saturna's house stands in Nighthaven, east of Umber."] = "拉比恩·萨图纳的房屋位于永夜港，在阿姆伯尔以东。",
	["Rabine's Shards of the Felvine needs Dire Maul. Skip it."] = "拉比恩·萨图纳的魔藤碎片需要厄运之槌。跳过即可。",
	["Raedon Duskstriker takes cloth for Darnassus in Darnassus. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "莱顿·暗影接收布料给达纳苏斯在达纳苏斯。第一捐献的毛料，丝绸，魔纹布与符文布（60布料每个）已完成一次与交给大多数声望每布料；之后它们，更多的符文布可重复直到崇拜。崇拜与另一个种族的主城允许你购买该种族的坐骑。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["Raene Wolfrunner"] = "莱恩·狼行者",
	["Raene Wolfrunner, in the inn"] = "莱恩·狼行者，在旅店内",
	["Rage Scar Yeti Hide"] = "怒痕雪人的毛皮",
	["Rageclaw, in the den"] = "怒爪，在兽穴",
	["Ragefire Chasm"] = "怒焰裂谷",
	["Ragged Young Wolves roam the snow just south of Anvilmar."] = "蓬毛幼狼游荡于雪就在安威玛尔以南。",
	["Ragnar Thunderbrew"] = "拉格纳·雷酒",
	["Raider Bork"] = "狼骑兵波尔克",
	["Raider Bork sells the mounts in the Hall of Legends in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, beside the other honor quartermasters such as Sergeant Ba'sha. The Forever client lists each at 100g; choose one."] = "狼骑兵波尔克出售坐骑在传说大厅在奥格瑞玛的荣誉谷，在其他荣誉军需官此类作为旁边巴沙。无限服客户端列出每个在100金；选择1。",
	["Rainbow Fin Albacore is orange from 50 (yellow at 90, grey at 130): about 68 crafts to 110. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking. Fishing off the Auberdine docks catches Raw Rainbow Fin Albacore."] = "彩鳍鱼是橙色来自50（黄色在90，灰色在130）：约68制作前往110。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。钓鱼偏离/关闭奥伯丁码头捕获新鲜的彩鳍鱼。",
	["Rakaiah"] = "拉凯雅",
	["Raleigh the Devout"] = "虔诚的莱雷恩",
	["Raleigh's next errand is in the Scarlet Monastery: skip it."] = "虔诚的莱雷恩的下一个差事是在血色修道院：跳过即可。",
	["Rally Valennia, Ayessa Dawnsinger (west of town) and Elaadrin"] = "集结瓦伦妮娅·风暴之拳，阿耶莎·晨歌（在城镇西面）与艾拉德琳·暮风",
	["Ralston Farnsley takes cloth for Undercity in Undercity. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "莱斯顿·法斯雷接收布料给幽暗城在幽暗城。第一捐献的毛料，丝绸，魔纹布与符文布（60布料每个）已完成一次与交给大多数声望每布料；之后它们，更多的符文布可重复直到崇拜。崇拜与另一个种族的主城允许你购买该种族的坐骑。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["Ran Bloodtooth"] = "兰恩·血牙",
	["Ran Bloodtooth and his guards camp just east of Krolg."] = "兰恩·血牙与他的卫兵营地就在克罗尔格以东。",
	["Randal Hunter"] = "兰达尔·亨特",
	["Randal Hunter and Katie Hunter's horse pen are at Eastvale Logging Camp in eastern Elwynn Forest. At 40 Randal Hunter teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Alliance race ride these."] = "兰达尔·亨特与凯蒂·亨特的马围栏是在东谷伐木场在东部艾尔文森林。在40兰达尔·亨特传授骑术（100金每暴雪的设计师），与学习它给你一个坐骑。无限服客户端允许每个联盟种族骑行这些。",
	["Randal Hunter and Katie Hunter's horse pen are at Eastvale Logging Camp in eastern Elwynn Forest. At 60 Randal Hunter teaches Journeyman Riding (1,000g per Blizzard's designers); Blizzard says learning riding grants a mount. The Forever client sells each swift horse for 200g at level 60."] = "兰达尔·亨特与凯蒂·亨特的马围栏是在东谷伐木场在东部艾尔文森林。在60兰达尔·亨特传授中级骑术（1,000金每暴雪的设计师）；暴雪说学习骑行奖励一匹坐骑。无限服客户端出售每个迅捷马给200金在60级。",
	["Randal Hunter, riding trainer"] = "兰达尔·亨特，骑术训练师",
	["Rane Yorick"] = "兰妮·尤瑞克",
	["Ranks 3, 7, 10, 13 and 14 are a point each. Polestar cannot read your highest rank yet, so tick each one off yourself. Forever's honor rules for reaching a rank have not been published in detail; in Classic, ranks come from your weekly honor standing, and 13-14 take many weeks of top standing."] = "军阶3，7，10，13与14是一个点每个。Polestar 无法阅读你的最高等级尚，因此勾选每个1偏离/关闭你自己。无限服的荣誉规则给抵达一个等级有不已已发布在详情；在经典旧世，军阶来自你的每周荣誉声望等级，与13-14接取许多周的顶部声望等级。",
	["Ranshalla in Winterspring: keep it"] = "兰莎尔拉在冬泉谷：请保留该任务/物品",
	["Ranshalla: her escort comes later on the route"] = "兰莎尔拉：她的护送来自稍后在路线",
	["Raptors: Zjolnir, beside Xar'Ti in Sen'jin Village."] = "迅猛龙：佐尔尼尔，在克萨尔迪旁边在森金村。",
	["Rashona Straglash takes cloth for Orgrimmar in Orgrimmar. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "莱什纳·刺藤接收布料给奥格瑞玛在奥格瑞玛。第一捐献的毛料，丝绸，魔纹布与符文布（60布料每个）已完成一次与交给大多数声望每布料；之后它们，更多的符文布可重复直到崇拜。崇拜与另一个种族的主城允许你购买该种族的坐骑。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["Ratchet is on the Barrens coast east of the Crossroads; from the Alliance side, take the boat from Booty Bay. Strahad Farsan's follow-up teaches Summon Felsteed."] = "棘齿城是在贫瘠之地海岸东的十字路口；来自联盟一侧，乘船来自藏宝海湾。斯坦哈德·法尔杉的后续任务传授召唤地狱战马。",
	["Rathiril Sunlance"] = "拉希瑞尔·日枪",
	["Rattlecage Skeletons wander the ruined houses in the north half of Deathknell. Young Scavengers and Duskbats roam all around the village; the Ragged Scavengers and Mangy Duskbats are on its east side."] = "断骨骷髅游荡毁坏的房屋在北面一半的丧钟镇。食腐狼幼崽与夜行蝙蝠游荡全部在村庄周围；蓬毛食腐狼与癞皮夜行蝙蝠是在它的东一侧。",
	["Ravasaur Pheromone Gland"] = "暴掠龙信息素",
	["Raven Hill Tome, from the Memory of Valor"] = "乌鸦岭典籍，来自英勇的记忆",
	["Ravenous Darkhound (88%) in Tirisfal Glades, or wherever the arrow points"] = "饥饿的黑暗犬（88%）在提瑞斯法林地，或跟随箭头指示位置",
	["Razorfen Downs"] = "剃刀高地",
	["Razorfen Kraul"] = "剃刀沼泽",
	["Razormane Seer (level 23-24) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "钢鬃先知（23-24级）掉落它此处。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Razzle Sprysprocket"] = "拉兹·滑链",
	["Razzle Sprysprocket, by the depot"] = "拉兹·滑链，在旁补给站",
	["Read both tablets"] = "阅读两个石板",
	["Read the tablet in the Dark Iron camp among the ruins, south-west of Flame Crest, to copy the transcript."] = "阅读石板在黑铁矿营地在其中：废墟，在烈焰峰以西南，前往副本抄本。",
	["Reagent Pouch: Stonesplinter Seers"] = "试剂袋：碎石怪先知",
	["Red Burlap Bandanas"] = "红色粗麻面罩",
	["Red Leather Bandanas: every Defias drops them"] = "红色皮质面罩：每个迪菲亚掉落它们",
	["Red Linen Bandanas"] = "红色亚麻面罩",
	["Red Mechanostrider, 20g"] = "红色机械陆行鸟，20金",
	["Red Power Crystal"] = "红色能量水晶",
	["Red Skeletal Horse, 20g"] = "红色骸骨军马，20金",
	["Redpath's Shield"] = "雷德帕斯之盾",
	["Redpath's Shield lies east of the barn at Gahrron's Withering."] = "雷德帕斯之盾位于谷仓在以东盖罗恩农场。",
	["Redridge Mongrel"] = "混血赤脊山豺狼人",
	["Redridge Mongrels and other gnolls hold the hills east of Three Corners, north of the road; Redridge Thrashers prowl among them, Poachers camp south of the road. Dire Condors and Great Goretusks roam the same hills."] = "混血赤脊山豺狼人与其他豺狼人要塞丘陵在三角路口以东，在道路以北；赤脊山鞭笞者游荡在其中：它们，偷猎者营地在道路以南。恐鹫与巨型血牙野猪游荡于相同丘陵。",
	["Redridge Poacher"] = "赤脊山偷猎者",
	["Redridge starts at Three Corners, where the roads from Elwynn Forest and Duskwood meet."] = "赤脊山始于三角路口，在道路来自艾尔文森林与暮色森林会合。",
	["Refreshing Spring Water from Innkeeper Keldamyr, for Byancie"] = "清凉的泉水来自旅店老板凯达米尔，给拜恩希",
	["Refuge Pointe in the middle is the Alliance town; Hammerfall in the east is Horde."] = "避难谷地在中间是联盟城镇；落锤镇在东面是部落。",
	["Regthar stands at the Kolkar watch post just west of the Crossroads."] = "雷戈萨·死门位于科卡尔守望岗哨就在西的十字路口。",
	["Reins of the Spotted Frostsaber, 20g"] = "斑点霜刃豹缰绳，20金",
	["Reins of the Striped Dawnsaber is a new Forever saber (level 40, 20g in the client) whose source is not known yet."] = "条纹晨刃豹缰绳是一个新无限服刃豹（40级，20金在客户端）其获取来源尚不明确。",
	["Reins of the Striped Frostsaber, 20g"] = "条纹霜刃豹缰绳，20金",
	["Reins of the Striped Nightsaber, 20g"] = "条纹夜刃豹缰绳，20金",
	["Reins of the Swift Frostsaber, 200g"] = "迅捷霜刃豹缰绳，200金",
	["Reins of the Swift Mistsaber, 200g"] = "迅捷雾刃豹缰绳，200金",
	["Reins of the Swift Stormsaber, 200g"] = "迅捷雷刃豹缰绳，200金",
	["Rejold Barleybrew"] = "雷杰德·麦酒",
	["Relic of the Claw"] = "利爪圣物",
	["Relic of the Fang"] = "尖牙圣物",
	["Relic of the Silent Shadow"] = "寂静暗影圣物",
	["Remains of Trey Lightforge"] = "特雷·莱弗治的残骸",
	["Remen Marcot: Gakin the Darkbinder in Stormwind takes it"] = "雷门·玛考特：黑暗缚灵者加科因在暴风城接收该任务",
	["Remy \"Two Times\""] = "雷米",
	["Resaan's Heirloom"] = "雷萨恩的传家宝",
	["Research Equipment"] = "研究设备",
	["Resonating Skull, from the Scourge Champions"] = "共鸣颅骨，来自天灾勇士",
	["Restoring Fiery Flux Supplies repeats in three versions: Kingsblood, Iron Bars or Heavy Leather, each with Coal and an Incendosaur Scale. Incendosaurs (level 47-49) in the north of Searing Gorge drop a scale every time; Burninate himself sells Coal."] = "炽热助熔剂的补给可重复在3版本：皇血草，铁锭或重皮，每个与煤块与一个熏火龙的鳞片。熏火龙（47-49级）在灼热峡谷以北掉落一个鳞片每个时间；大铁匠博恩奈特他自己出售煤块。",
	["Rethiel the Greenwarden"] = "绿色守卫者雷希耶尔",
	["Rezlak"] = "雷兹拉克",
	["Rezlak stands on the road west of the ravine. The Thunder Lizards roam Thunder Ridge to the west."] = "雷兹拉克位于路上在深谷以西。雷霆蜥蜴游荡雷霆山向西。",
	["Rhag Garmason, Dun Modr"] = "拉格·加玛森，丹莫德",
	["Rhapsody camps on the road east of Aerie Peak."] = "拉普索迪·铁铲扎营在路上在鹰巢山以东。",
	["Rhapsody's cocktail needs parts from Kalimdor: skip it."] = "拉普索迪·铁铲的鸡尾酒需要零件来自卡利姆多：跳过即可。",
	["Riaani Nightwind"] = "莉安妮·夜风",
	["Riaani stands in the Gustberry Lowlands just north-west of town."] = "莉安妮·夜风位于风莓低地就在城镇西北面。",
	["Ricter"] = "瑞克特尔",
	["Ride a lift up to the mesas. Tal keeps the wind riders on the central rise; Cairne stands in the great tent there."] = "骑行一个升降梯上前往台地。塔尔保留风骑兵在中央高地；凯恩·血蹄位于巨型帐篷那里。",
	["Ride all the way west to the Wildhammer town of Aerie Peak and place the message by the well in its centre. The town is full of Alliance guards: get in, place it and get out."] = "骑行全部路西前往弗斯塔德·蛮锤城镇的鹰巢山与放置口信在旁水井在它的中心。城镇是完整的联盟卫兵：获取在，放置它与获取出。",
	["Ride back down the Webwinder Path to Malaka'jin."] = "骑行返回下蛛网小径前往玛拉卡金。",
	["Ride back down to town; Shaky stands at the tunnel mouth."] = "骑行返回下前往城镇；“发抖者”菲利普位于隧道入口/河口。",
	["Ride back east along the road to the Vigil."] = "骑行返回东沿着道路前往岗哨。",
	["Ride back east along the road to the Yorgen Farmstead."] = "骑行返回东沿着道路前往约根农庄。",
	["Ride back east past Stonard and follow the road south-east to the small Horde post on the shore."] = "骑行返回东经过斯通纳德与沿着道路前往东南前往小型部落岗哨在岸边。",
	["Ride back east to Darkshire."] = "骑行返回东前往夜色镇。",
	["Ride back east to Dustwind Gulch."] = "骑行返回东前往尘风峡谷。",
	["Ride back east to Tarren Mill."] = "骑行返回东前往塔伦米尔。",
	["Ride back east to the camp. Stay here: the next guide starts with the flight to Gadgetzan."] = "骑行返回东前往营地。留在此处：下一个指南始于飞行前往加基森。",
	["Ride back north to Brackenwall."] = "骑行返回北前往蕨墙村。",
	["Ride back north to Everlook and west along the road to the night elf village."] = "骑行返回北前往永望镇与西沿着道路前往夜晚精灵村庄。",
	["Ride back north to Ironband's camp."] = "骑行返回北前往勘察员基恩萨·铁环的营地。",
	["Ride back north to Tarren Mill, keeping west of Southshore."] = "骑行返回北前往塔伦米尔，保留在南海镇以西。",
	["Ride back north to Thorium Point. Stay here: the next guide starts with the flight to Stonard."] = "骑行返回北前往瑟银哨塔。留在此处：下一个指南始于飞行前往斯通纳德。",
	["Ride back north to the bloodmages."] = "骑行返回北前往血法师。",
	["Ride back north-east past Refuge Pointe; Quae and Kinelory camp in the hills north of Go'Shek Farm."] = "骑行返回东北经过避难谷地；奎伊与基内洛里扎营于丘陵在格沙克农场以北。",
	["Ride back north-west from Misty Reed Post to Stonard and fly to Grom'gol."] = "骑行返回西北来自芦苇哨岗前往斯通纳德与飞往前往格罗姆高。",
	["Ride back north-west to the Forgotten Coast dock and take the boat to the island."] = "骑行返回西北前往被遗忘的海岸码头与乘船前往岛屿。",
	["Ride back out of Ironforge and east along the road to Helm's Bed Lake. Narm Faulk lies dead by its shore: use the Symbol of Life on him. The Dark Iron Spies sneaking around the lake carry the script."] = "骑行返回离开铁炉堡与东沿着道路前往涌冰湖。纳姆·法奥克位于死亡的在旁它的岸边：使用生命符记在他。黑铁间谍潜行在湖携带手稿周围。",
	["Ride back out through Goldshire and east along the road to the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch. Surena Caledon (level 9) stands by its farmhouse."] = "骑行返回出穿过闪金镇与东沿着道路前往布拉克威尔南瓜田。苏伦娜·凯尔东（9级）站在旁边：它的农舍。",
	["Ride back out through Goldshire and east to Stone Cairn Lake. Henze Faulk lies south of the lake: use the Symbol of Life on him. The Defias Rogue Wizards around him carry the Defias Script."] = "骑行返回出穿过闪金镇与东前往石碑湖。亨兹·法奥克位于湖以南：使用生命符记在他。迪菲亚流浪巫师周围他携带迪菲亚手稿。",
	["Ride back south along the road to the Sanctuary."] = "骑行返回南沿着道路前往圣地。",
	["Ride back south down the road, past the Valley of Fangs."] = "骑行返回南顺着道路，经过巨牙谷。",
	["Ride back south past Jaedenar to the corrupted moonwell of the Jadefire satyrs and fill Winna's flasket there."] = "骑行返回南经过加德纳尔前往腐化的月亮井的碧火萨特与装满温娜·哈萨德的小瓶那里。",
	["Ride back south to Grom'gol."] = "骑行返回南前往格罗姆高。",
	["Ride back south to Tarren Mill."] = "骑行返回南前往塔伦米尔。",
	["Ride back south to the Crossroads and fly to Ratchet."] = "骑行返回南前往十字路口与飞往前往棘齿城。",
	["Ride back south to the camp. Buy the Arcane Quickeners for the cauldrons from Alchemist Arbington."] = "骑行返回南前往营地。购买奥术催化剂给大锅来自化学家阿尔比顿。",
	["Ride back south to the post."] = "骑行返回南前往岗哨。",
	["Ride back south-east to the Sanctuary."] = "骑行返回东南前往圣地。",
	["Ride back south-east to the hermit."] = "骑行返回东南前往隐士。",
	["Ride back south-west to Chillwind Camp."] = "骑行返回西南前往冰风岗。",
	["Ride back to Cenarion Hold and fly to Ratchet."] = "骑行返回前往塞纳里奥要塞与飞往前往棘齿城。",
	["Ride back to Chillwind Camp and fly to Menethil Harbor, take the boat to Auberdine and fly to Rut'theran Village; the portal leads up to Darnassus."] = "骑行返回前往冰风岗与飞往前往米奈希尔港，乘船前往奥伯丁与飞往前往鲁瑟兰村；传送门通往上前往达纳苏斯。",
	["Ride back to Nethergarde Keep and fly to Aerie Peak. The Wildkin Feathers lie on the ground across the Hinterlands, south and east of Aerie Peak, where the owlbeasts roam; the mobs here are well below you now."] = "骑行返回前往守望堡与飞往前往鹰巢山。枭兽羽毛位于领地穿过辛特兰，南与在鹰巢山以东，在枭兽游荡；怪物此处是水井下方你现在。",
	["Ride back to Talrendis Point and fly to Everlook."] = "骑行返回前往塔伦迪斯营地与飞往前往永望镇。",
	["Ride back to the Forgotten Coast; the goblin stands by the dock."] = "骑行返回前往被遗忘的海岸；地精站在旁边：码头。",
	["Ride back to the Undercity, take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar and fly to Splintertree Post. Follow the road west out of Splintertree and take the fork north into Felwood."] = "骑行返回前往幽暗城，搭乘飞艇前往奥格瑞玛与飞往前往碎木岗哨。沿着道路前往西离开碎木岗哨与接取岔路口北进入费伍德森林。",
	["Ride back west along the road to Menethil Harbor."] = "骑行返回西沿着道路前往米奈希尔港。",
	["Ride back west along the road, then north into the Rage Scar hills. Every yeti here can drop a hide; one may drop a Pristine Yeti Hide, which Pratt pays for too."] = "骑行返回西沿着道路，然后北进入怒痕堡丘陵。每个雪人此处可以掉落一个兽皮；1可能掉落一个原始雪人毛皮，其中普拉特·马克格鲁比奖励给也。",
	["Ride back west along the road."] = "骑行返回西沿着道路。",
	["Ride back west to Brackenwall with the head."] = "骑行返回西前往蕨墙村与前往。",
	["Ride back west to Frostfire Hot Springs."] = "骑行返回西前往霜火温泉。",
	["Ride back west to Gadgetzan."] = "骑行返回西前往加基森。",
	["Ride back west to Valormok."] = "骑行返回西前往瓦罗莫克。",
	["Ride back west to the road and follow it south out of Loch Modan through the pass into the Badlands. Prospector Ryedol and Sigrun Ironhew camp side by side at the dig."] = "骑行返回西前往道路与沿着它南离开洛克莫丹穿过穿过进入荒芜之地。勘察员雷杜尔与西格鲁·铁斧营地并排在挖掘。",
	["Ride back west toward Gadgetzan. The Wastewander bandits and thieves hold the dunes on the way; any of them can carry a water pouch."] = "骑行返回西朝加基森方向。废土漫游者强盗与盗贼要塞沙丘在途中；任意的它们可以携带一个水袋子。",
	["Ride down into the Undercity: Jorah Annison stands in the Magic Quarter."] = "骑行下进入幽暗城：约拉·安尼森位于魔法区。",
	["Ride down the east side of the crater to the pylon on the eastern cliffs."] = "骑行下东一侧的环形山前往水晶塔在东部悬崖。",
	["Ride down the ramp into the crater: Torwa camps at its foot."] = "骑行下坡道进入环形山：托尔瓦扎营于它的山脚。",
	["Ride down to Bloodhoof Village and tame with the Taming Rod: an Adult Plainstrider on the plains, a Prairie Stalker north of the village, a Swoop to the north-west."] = "骑行下前往血蹄村与驯服与驯兽棒：一个成年平原陆行鸟在平原，一个草原捕食者在村庄以北，一个猛鹫向西北。",
	["Ride east across the Cauldron to the Grimesilt Dig Site in the south-east. The prisoner in the wooden outhouse wants 15 Silk Cloth and eight dead Dark Iron Geologists from the dig site around it. The outhouse also opens with the key, if you found one."] = "骑行东穿过大锅前往煤渣挖掘场在东南面。囚犯在木制户外厕所需要15丝绸与8死亡的黑铁地质学家来自挖掘地点周围它。户外厕所也开启与钥匙，如果你找到1。",
	["Ride east across the dunes to the goblin harbour on the north-east coast."] = "骑行东穿过沙丘前往地精港口在东北海岸。",
	["Ride east across the plaguelands to the chapel."] = "骑行东穿过瘟疫之地前往礼拜堂。",
	["Ride east again; the catapult stands at the Dragonmaw camp south of the road."] = "骑行东再次；投石车位于龙喉营地在道路以南。",
	["Ride east along the Wetlands road, south through Dun Algaz into Loch Modan and west through the tunnel into Dun Morogh to Ironforge."] = "骑行东沿着湿地道路，南穿过丹奥加兹进入洛克莫丹与西穿过隧道进入丹莫罗前往铁炉堡。",
	["Ride east along the road out of Ashenvale into Azshara to the Sentinels' camp at Talrendis Point."] = "骑行东沿着道路离开灰谷进入艾萨拉前往哨兵的扎营于塔伦迪斯营地。",
	["Ride east along the road out of Splintertree. Loh'atu waits at the Shadowsong Shrine just off the road, a few steps west of the Alliance's Talrendis Point: come in from the west and keep clear of the Azshara Sentinels and Jarrodenus (elite)."] = "骑行东沿着道路离开碎木岗哨。罗哈图等候于影歌神殿就在道路两侧，一个少量台阶西的联盟的塔伦迪斯营地：来到在来自西与保留清理的艾萨拉哨兵与加罗迪努斯（精英）。",
	["Ride east along the road to Everlook."] = "骑行东沿着道路前往永望镇。",
	["Ride east along the road to the Bulwark on the border."] = "骑行东沿着道路前往亡灵壁垒在边界。",
	["Ride east along the south shore of the loch to Ironband's camp."] = "骑行东沿着南岸边的湖前往勘察员基恩萨·铁环的营地。",
	["Ride east back to the Swamplight Manor."] = "骑行东返回前往水光庄园。",
	["Ride east from Camp Taurajo along the road into the marsh. The burned-out Shady Rest Inn stands beside it just past the border; the shield, the badge and the hoofprints are in and beside the ruin."] = "骑行东来自陶拉祖营地沿着道路进入沼泽。烧焦的-出树荫旅店站在旁边：它就在经过边界；盾牌，徽章与蹄印是在与在废墟旁边。",
	["Ride east into the hills. Use the Book of Aquor to summon Aquementas, then defeat him for the totem."] = "骑行东进入丘陵。使用阿奎尔之书前往召唤亚奎门塔斯，然后击败他给图腾。",
	["Ride east out of Tarren Mill through Thoradin's Wall and follow the road east. The Boulderfist Ogres and Enforcers (32-34) camp south of the road, south-east of Northfold Manor."] = "骑行东离开塔伦米尔穿过索拉丁之墙与沿着道路前往东。石拳食人魔与石拳执行者（32-34）营地在道路以南，在诺斯弗德农场以东南。",
	["Ride east through Deadwind Pass into the Swamp of Sorrows and south down the road into the Blasted Lands. The bloodmages' camp is the first stop beside the road."] = "骑行东穿过逆风小径进入悲伤沼泽与南顺着道路进入诅咒之地。血法师的营地是第一停靠在道路旁边。",
	["Ride east to Everlook and north out of it; the Moontouched Owlbeasts roam the hills of Frostsaber Rock's southern slopes. Pull them one at a time."] = "骑行东前往永望镇与北出的它；月触枭兽游荡于丘陵的霜刀石的南部山坡。拉怪它们1在一个时间。",
	["Ride east to Fire Plume Ridge, climb it and use Krakle's Thermometer at the lava vent near the top, then ride back west to Krakle."] = "骑行东前往火羽山，爬上它与使用克拉兰克的温度计在熔岩喷口在顶部附近，然后骑行返回西前往克拉兰克。",
	["Ride east to Fire Plume Ridge, climb it and use Krakle's Thermometer at the lava vents near the top."] = "骑行东前往火羽山，爬上它与使用克拉兰克的温度计在熔岩喷口在顶部附近。",
	["Ride east to Layo Starstrike."] = "骑行东前往莱耶·星击。",
	["Ride east to Mannoroc Coven. Use the Rod of Banishing by each demon portal to close six of them."] = "骑行东前往玛诺洛克集会所。使用魔杖的放逐在旁每个恶魔传送门前往靠近6的它们。",
	["Ride east to Tirion's hut by the Thondroril River and hear him out."] = "骑行东前往提里奥的小屋在旁索多里尔河与听完他出。",
	["Ride east to the Crossroads and fly to Orgrimmar. Take the zeppelin from the towers outside Orgrimmar to Tirisfal Glades; the Undercity lies below the Ruins of Lordaeron. The bat handler is in the Trade Quarter."] = "骑行东前往十字路口与飞往前往奥格瑞玛。搭乘飞艇来自哨塔在奥格瑞玛外前往提瑞斯法林地；幽暗城位于下方洛丹伦废墟。蝙蝠管理员是在贸易区。",
	["Ride east to the Gordunni camp in the hills south-east of the yeti valley: Warlocks and Shaman hold the camp, Brutes wander the slopes around it and further north."] = "骑行东前往戈杜尼扎营于丘陵在雪人山谷以东南：术士与萨满祭司要塞营地，蛮兵游荡山坡周围它与更远处北。",
	["Ride east to the Hive'Ashi tower in Southwind Village; climb it and kill the ambushers that rise for the encrusted object."] = "骑行东前往亚什虫巢哨塔在南风村；爬上它与击杀伏击者该高地给覆壳的物件。",
	["Ride east to the border river: Tirion lives in a small hut on the bank."] = "骑行东前往边界河流：提里奥住在一个小型小屋在银行。",
	["Ride east to the keep."] = "骑行东前往保留。",
	["Ride east to the night elf camp at Talonbranch Glade."] = "骑行东前往夜晚精灵扎营于刺枝林地。",
	["Ride east to the ogre mound. Abercrombie's Crate sits in the camp at its entrance; Splinter Fist ogres guard it."] = "骑行东前往食人魔土堆。亚伯克隆比的箱子位于营地里在它的入口；碎木拳食人魔守卫它。",
	["Ride east to the ruins of Southwind Village. The Dusty Reliquary lies among the ruined buildings, watched by Tortured Sentinels."] = "骑行东前往废墟的南风村。积灰的圣物箱位于其中：毁坏的建筑，被监视的在旁被折磨的哨兵。",
	["Ride east to the ruins on the coast. Fill Cuely's four vials at the tide pools along the shore; Spitelash naga patrol between them."] = "骑行东前往废墟在海岸边。装满药剂师科雷的4小瓶在潮汐水池沿着岸边；怨灵纳迦巡逻之间它们。",
	["Ride east, then south down Frostwhisper Gorge. The Frostmaul giants there are elite level 59: keep to the middle and keep moving. The strange source is at the mouth of Darkwhisper Gorge, at the south end."] = "骑行东，然后南下霜语峡谷。霜槌巨人那里为精英59级：保留前往中间与保留移动的。奇怪的来源是在暗语峡谷的入口，在南尽头。",
	["Ride east: Ashmane Boars and Redstone Basilisks share the slopes south-west of Nethergarde Keep. Keep clear of the Helboars further south: they are level 52."] = "骑行东：灰鬃野猪与红石蜥蜴共享山坡在守望堡以西南。保留清理的地狱野猪更远处南：它们是52级。",
	["Ride east; the Tangled Horrors along the way also drop the essays. Search the edge of the Pool of Tears, where the temple's ruins break the water."] = "骑行东；纠缠恐兽沿途也掉落论文。搜索边缘的泪水之池，在神庙的废墟打断水。",
	["Ride from Theramore west along the Dustwallow road into the Barrens and north to Ratchet on the coast. Learn the flight path from Bragok, then take the boat to Booty Bay from the dock."] = "骑行来自塞拉摩西沿着尘泥沼泽道路进入贫瘠之地与北前往棘齿城在海岸边。学习飞行点来自布拉高克，然后乘船前往藏宝海湾来自码头。",
	["Ride inland to the Mistvale gorilla hills. Elder Mistvale Gorillas drop the giblets; Witch Doctor Unbagwa sits among them."] = "骑行内陆前往迷雾谷猩猩丘陵。老迈的薄雾谷猩猩掉落内脏；巫医安巴格瓦位于其中：它们。",
	["Ride north along the east side of the crater to Marshal's Refuge, the camp in the caves of the northern cliff. Give the elite devilsaurs and stegodons a wide berth. Pick up every Power Crystal and Un'Goro Dirt Pile you pass from here on."] = "骑行北沿着东一侧的环形山前往马绍尔营地，扎营于洞穴的北部悬崖。交给精英魔暴龙与剑龙一个宽阔泊位。拾取/接取每个能量水晶与安戈洛土堆你穿过来自此处在。",
	["Ride north along the east side to the gorilla plateau. U'cha, a level 55 gorilla, sits in its deepest cave: clear the gorillas at the cave mouth first."] = "骑行北沿着东一侧前往猩猩高原。尤尔查，一个55级猩猩，位于它的最深处洞穴：清理猩猩在洞穴入口/河口第一。",
	["Ride north along the east side. Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers fill the jungle."] = "骑行北沿着东一侧。血瓣花鞭笞者与长尾鲨装满丛林。",
	["Ride north along the eastern hills; Tirion lives in a small house by the Thondroril River, at the border with the Eastern Plaguelands."] = "骑行北沿着东部丘陵；提里奥住在一个小型房屋在旁索多里尔河，在边界与东瘟疫之地。",
	["Ride north along the road, past Jaedenar, to Bloodvenom Post."] = "骑行北沿着道路，经过加德纳尔，前往血毒岗哨。",
	["Ride north along the west side to Mayna's small camp."] = "骑行北沿着西一侧前往梅娜的小型营地。",
	["Ride north along the western jungle back to the refuge."] = "骑行北沿着西部丛林返回前往营地。",
	["Ride north back to Kargath."] = "骑行北返回前往卡加斯。",
	["Ride north back to Marshal's Refuge."] = "骑行北返回前往马绍尔营地。",
	["Ride north back to Stonard and fly to the Undercity."] = "骑行北返回前往斯通纳德与飞往前往幽暗城。",
	["Ride north into the yeti valley. Every Feral Scar yeti can drop a thick hide; Bloodroar the Stalker (level 48) prowls the middle."] = "骑行北进入雪人山谷。每个野性伤痕雪人可以掉落一个密集兽皮；血吼钢鬃捕猎者（48级）潜行游荡中间。",
	["Ride north out of Astranaar into Felwood to the druids' camp on the road just past the border."] = "骑行北离开阿斯特兰纳进入费伍德森林前往德鲁伊的营地在路上就在经过边界。",
	["Ride north out of Astranaar into Felwood. Grazle the furbolg stands by the road just south of the Emerald Sanctuary."] = "骑行北离开阿斯特兰纳进入费伍德森林。格拉兹熊怪位于路边就在南的翡翠圣地。",
	["Ride north out of Lakeshire through the pass into the Burning Steppes; Morgan's Vigil sits at the top, in the south-east of the Steppes."] = "骑行北离开湖畔镇穿过穿过进入燃烧平原；摩根的岗哨位于顶部，在平原以东南。",
	["Ride north past Nesingwary's camp to the lake. The Venture Co. Geologists (34-36) work the camps along its western shore; they carry the Tumbled Crystals."] = "骑行北经过奈辛瓦里的营地前往湖。风险投资公司地质学家拉克斯班（34-36）有效扎营沿着它的西部岸边；它们携带打磨过的水晶。",
	["Ride north past Valik's camp to Strahnbrad, the Syndicate-held village (35-37). Jailor Borhuin carries the Rusted Iron Key; Gol'dir sits in a cage in the house on the north side."] = "骑行北经过仆从瓦里克的营地前往斯坦恩布莱德，辛迪加-持有村庄（35-37）。看守员博胡恩携带锈铁钥匙；高迪尔位于一个笼子在房屋在北一侧。",
	["Ride north through Elwynn to Stormwind; Mathias Shaw is at SI:7 in Old Town."] = "骑行北穿过艾尔文森林前往暴风城；马迪亚斯·肖尔马迪亚斯·肖尔是在军情七处在旧城区。",
	["Ride north to Ironstone Plateau, where the robot stands among the gorillas. Stay out of the deep cave there."] = "骑行北前往铁石高原，在机器人位于其中：猩猩。留在离开深处洞穴那里。",
	["Ride north to Marshal's Refuge. Use Umi's Mechanical Yeti beside Quixxil."] = "骑行北前往马绍尔营地。使用乌米的机械雪人在奎克希尔旁边。",
	["Ride north to Skulk Rock in the middle of the Hinterlands. Green Sludges and Jade Oozes crawl all around it."] = "骑行北前往隐匿石在中间的辛特兰。绿色淤泥怪与玉石软泥怪爬行全部周围它。",
	["Ride north to Terrordale. Augustus lives in the ruined hut, and his receipt book lies in the ruined inn nearby."] = "骑行北前往恐惧谷。被感动的奥古斯图斯住在毁坏的小屋，与他的收据书位于毁坏的旅店附近。",
	["Ride north to Thelsamar and fly to Southshore. Raleigh the Devout preaches by the inn."] = "骑行北前往塞尔萨玛与飞往前往南海镇。虔诚的莱雷恩布道在旅店旁。",
	["Ride north to Timbermaw Hold (or fly back to Talonbranch Glade first) and through the tunnel into Winterspring; follow the road east to the goblin town of Everlook."] = "骑行北前往木喉要塞（或飞往返回前往刺枝林地第一）与穿过隧道进入冬泉谷；沿着道路前往东前往地精城镇的永望镇。",
	["Ride north to Witch Hill. Stinky stands at the foot of the hill; escort him while he gathers Bogbean Leaves just south of it."] = "骑行北前往女巫岭。斯汀基位于山丘的底部；护送他当他采集泽豆叶就在它南面。",
	["Ride north to the Deadwood furbolgs' village by the Timbermaw Hold cave mouth."] = "骑行北前往死木熊怪的村庄在旁木喉要塞洞穴入口/河口。",
	["Ride north to the Plaguewood's north-eastern edge."] = "骑行北前往病木林的北-东部边缘。",
	["Ride north to the Skullsplitter ruins east of the Venture Co. mine; pull the headhunters and berserkers one at a time. Ana'thek the Cruel guards the south-western ruins, and one pile of trophy skulls stands on the ruins' north side. Every Skullsplitter can drop a tusk or a necklace: the necklaces are the slow part, so keep killing in the warriors' camp north of the ruins until you have them all."] = "骑行北前往碎颅废墟东的风险投资公司矿洞；拉怪猎头者与狂战士1在一个时间。残忍的安纳希克卫兵南-西部废墟，与1堆的战利品头颅位于废墟的北一侧。每个裂颅者可以掉落一个长牙或一个项链：项链是缓慢部分，因此保留击杀在战士的营地在废墟直到你有它们全部以北。",
	["Ride north to the hills west of the road. Maury \"Club Foot\" Wilkins and Jon-Jon the Crow stand together just north of Zanzil's village."] = "骑行北前往丘陵在道路以西。“畸脚”莫里·威金斯与火柴棍乔乔位于一起就在赞吉尔村以北。",
	["Ride north up the coast. Giant Softshell Clams lie in the shallows and the Enraged Reef Crawlers walk the beach; open each clam in your bags for its meat."] = "骑行北上海岸。巨型软壳蚌壳位于浅滩与狂怒的暗礁蟹步行海滩；打开/开启每个蚌壳在你的背包给它的肉。",
	["Ride north up the road again."] = "骑行北顺着道路往上再次。",
	["Ride north up the road from the Crossroads to the Forgotten Pools; Regthar keeps watch on the rise above the water."] = "骑行北顺着道路往上来自十字路口前往遗忘之池；雷戈萨·死门保留守望在高地在水上方。",
	["Ride north up the road to the Northridge lumber mill; Kirsta hides at the camp's edge."] = "骑行北顺着道路往上前往北山伐木场伐木场磨坊；科尔斯塔·迪普沙东藏身在营地的边缘。",
	["Ride north up the road to the hunters' camp."] = "骑行北顺着道路往上前往猎人的营地。",
	["Ride north up the road to the hut by the road north of the graveyard."] = "骑行北顺着道路往上前往小屋在路边在墓地以北。",
	["Ride north up the road to the lumber mill and set the termite barrel down in the middle of it."] = "骑行北顺着道路往上前往伐木场磨坊与设置白蚁木桶下在中间的它。",
	["Ride north up the road; the hunters camp on the hill above the river."] = "骑行北顺着道路往上；猎人营地在山丘在河流上方。",
	["Ride north-east from Tarren Mill into the Hinterlands and east along the road; Gilveradin Sunchaser camps on the hill south of the elves' Quel'Danil Lodge."] = "骑行东北来自塔伦米尔进入辛特兰与东沿着道路；基沃拉丁·猎日者扎营在山丘在精灵以南的奎尔丹尼小屋。",
	["Ride north-east out of Southshore on the road into the Hinterlands; Aerie Peak sits just past the border. Falstad holds court at the top, Gryphon Master Talonaxe tends the aviary and Fraggar Thundermantle stands by the inn."] = "骑行东北离开南海镇在路上进入辛特兰；鹰巢山位于就在经过边界。弗斯塔德·蛮锤持有庭院在顶部，狮鹫管理员沙拉克·鹰斧照看鸟舍与弗拉加尔位于旅店旁。",
	["Ride north-east past Nesingwary's camp and follow the road north to the camp at the top of the vale."] = "骑行东北经过奈辛瓦里的营地与沿着道路前往北前往营地在山谷的顶部。",
	["Ride north-east to Kolkar Village. Khan Dez'hepah (35) walks among the tents on the east side with a Battle Lord or two (32-33): clear around him, then pull him alone at full health."] = "骑行东北前往科尔卡村。戴兹帕可汗（35）步行在其中：帐篷在东一侧与一个战斗领主或2（32-33）：清理周围他，然后拉怪他独自在完整生命值。",
	["Ride north-east to Ortell's Hideout."] = "骑行东北前往隐士奥泰尔的藏身处。",
	["Ride north-east to Valor's Rest; you leave Silithus through the pass beside it."] = "骑行东北前往勇气之眠；你跳过希利苏斯穿过穿过旁边它。",
	["Ride north-east to the East Pylon Watchtower. The Al'Aketh camp is just west of it, with Commander Belguilos at its north end. Every cultist can drop a windstone charm."] = "骑行东北前往东塔水晶哨塔。阿尔阿凯斯营地是就在它西面，与指挥官贝尔吉洛斯在它的北尽头。每个邪教徒可以掉落一个风石护符。",
	["Ride north-east to the Valley of Spears. Melizza is held in the Maraudine centaur camp; free her and escort her out east of the valley."] = "骑行东北前往长矛谷。梅丽萨是持有在玛拉丁半人马营地；解救她的与护送她的出在山谷以东。",
	["Ride north-east to the abandoned dig; the supply crate lies there among the Dustbelcher ogres."] = "骑行东北前往废弃的挖掘；补给木箱位于那里在其中：尘嗝食人魔。",
	["Ride north-east to the dwarven ruins in the north of the Badlands; the chest sits among the Shadowforge dwarves. Ambassador Infernus nearby is elite: give him room."] = "骑行东北前往矮人废墟在北面的荒芜之地；箱子位于其中：暗炉战士矮人。因弗努斯大使附近为精英：交给他房间。",
	["Ride north-east to the goblin harbour on the coast."] = "骑行东北前往地精港口在海岸边。",
	["Ride north-east to the goblin's camp on the cliffs above the Bay of Storms."] = "骑行东北前往地精的营地在悬崖上方风暴海湾。",
	["Ride north-east to the night elf outpost on the Thousand Needles border."] = "骑行东北前往夜晚精灵前哨站在千针石林边界。",
	["Ride north-west across the gorge; Thorium Point is the scaffolded camp in the north-west."] = "骑行西北穿过峡谷；瑟银哨塔是脚手架营地在西北面。",
	["Ride north-west back to the village."] = "骑行西北返回前往村庄。",
	["Ride north-west from the mine to the bay on the north-west coast. The Giant Clams lie on its floor and hold the pearls; Gazban swims among them and drops the Stone of the Tides."] = "骑行西北来自采矿前往海湾在西北海岸。巨型蚌壳位于它的楼层与要塞珍珠；加兹班游动在其中：它们与掉落海潮之石。",
	["Ride north-west into Andorhal. Chromie waits in the ruined inn on the west side of town; the skeletons inside are 54-57, so keep to the edges."] = "骑行西北进入安多哈尔。克罗米等候于毁坏的旅店在西一侧的城镇；骷髅内部是54-57，因此保留前往边缘。",
	["Ride north-west to Grom'gol."] = "骑行西北前往格罗姆高。",
	["Ride north-west to Jaedenar. The four braziers stand among the Shadow Council's buildings; use the Cleansed Water on each one."] = "骑行西北前往加德纳尔。4火盆位于其中：暗影议会的建筑；使用净化的水在每个1。",
	["Ride north-west to Quel'Lithien Lodge, at the edge of the Plaguewood."] = "骑行西北前往奎尔林斯小屋，在边缘的病木林。",
	["Ride north-west to Tirion's hut."] = "骑行西北前往提里奥的小屋。",
	["Ride north-west to the Centipaar hive in the dunes. Any Centipaar can drop insect parts."] = "骑行西北前往森提帕尔虫巢在沙丘。任意森提帕尔可以掉落昆虫零件。",
	["Ride north-west to the Dalson farm. The diary lies in the barn; a wandering skeleton carries the outhouse key, and Farmer Dalson waits in the outhouse with the cabinet key."] = "骑行西北前往达尔松农场。日记位于谷仓；一个游荡的骷髅携带户外厕所钥匙，与农夫达尔松等候于户外厕所与橱柜钥匙。",
	["Ride north-west to the Forgotten Coast; Zorbin waits on the dock."] = "骑行西北前往被遗忘的海岸；佐尔宾等候在码头上。",
	["Ride north-west to the Sandfury troll camp at Sandsorrow Watch. Use the Untapped Dowsing Widget at the edge of its pool; the trolls stand close, so pull the nearest first."] = "骑行西北前往沙怒巨魔扎营于流沙岗哨。使用未使用的寻水器在边缘的它的水池；巨魔位于靠近，因此拉怪最近的第一。",
	["Ride north; the outer circle stands in the middle of the highlands."] = "骑行北；外侧法阵位于高地的中央。",
	["Ride on north to Chillwind Camp and fly to Light's Hope Chapel."] = "骑行在北前往冰风岗与飞往前往圣光之愿礼拜堂。",
	["Ride out of the crater's north-western pass into Silithus and on to Cenarion Hold."] = "骑行离开环形山的北-西部穿过进入希利苏斯与在前往塞纳里奥要塞。",
	["Ride south along the coast from Ratchet to Fray Island. Klannoc Macleod stands by the arena: step on the grate to start the fight; the challengers come one at a time, then Big Will (33)."] = "骑行南沿着海岸来自棘齿城前往勇士岛。克兰诺克·马克雷德站在旁边：竞技场：步骤在格栅前往开始迎战；挑战者来到1在一个时间，然后比格维尔（33）。",
	["Ride south along the eastern cliffs to Torwa at the foot of the ramp."] = "骑行南沿着东部悬崖前往托尔瓦在坡道的底部。",
	["Ride south along the road to the Broken Pillar; Marvon Rivetseeker camps beside it. From here the road west leads down into Un'Goro Crater, where the next guide starts."] = "骑行南沿着道路前往破碎石柱；玛尔冯·瑞文斯克扎营旁边它。来自此处道路西通往下进入安戈洛环形山，在下一个指南始于。",
	["Ride south back to the road and follow it east across the whole zone to Light's Hope Chapel."] = "骑行南返回前往道路与沿着它东穿过整个区域前往圣光之愿礼拜堂。",
	["Ride south down the coast back to Shadowprey."] = "骑行南下海岸返回前往葬影村。",
	["Ride south down the coast to Grom'gol and fly to Booty Bay."] = "骑行南下海岸前往格罗姆高与飞往前往藏宝海湾。",
	["Ride south down the east side. Young Diemetradons graze the eastern jungle and Fledgling Pterrordax fly near the eastern cliffs; both drop Shizzle's scales."] = "骑行南下东一侧。幼双帆龙吃草东部丛林与小翼手龙飞往在东部悬崖附近；两个掉落希兹尔的鳞片。",
	["Ride south into Andorhal. Chromie waits in the ruined inn on the west side of town. Stand in the doorway of each of the four towers with the Beacon Torch to mark it; keep to the edges of town. Use the Temporal Displacer by the silos in the middle of town to bring out Temporal Parasites."] = "骑行南进入安多哈尔。克罗米等候于毁坏的旅店在西一侧的城镇。位于门口的每个的4哨塔与信号火炬前往标记它；保留前往边缘的城镇。使用时空置换器在旁粮仓在中间的城镇前往携带出时光寄生虫。",
	["Ride south into Thistleshrub Valley. The Dew Collectors drop the glands; only some are full, so keep the Laden one. Gnarled Thistleshrubs and Rootshapers share the valley. The Thistleshrubs are 48-50, above you: pull one at a time."] = "骑行南进入灌木谷。露水收藏家库米沙掉落腺体；仅一些是完整，因此保留满载的1。长瘤的灌木兽与塑根者共享山谷。蓟木是48-50，上方你：拉怪1在一个时间。",
	["Ride south out of Loch Modan through the pass into the Badlands; Sigrun Ironhew camps at the dig."] = "骑行南离开洛克莫丹穿过穿过进入荒芜之地；西格鲁·铁斧扎营于挖掘。",
	["Ride south past Mystral Lake into the Talondeep Path tunnel; it comes out in Stonetalon's Windshear Crag. Kaela and Gaxim camp on the Webwinder Path south-west of the crag."] = "骑行南经过密斯特拉湖进入石爪小径隧道；它来自出在石爪山脉的狂风峭壁。凯拉·影矛与加克希姆·尘链营地在蛛网小径在峭壁以西南。",
	["Ride south past the Broken Pillar to the Gaping Chasm, the Hazzali tunnels; Scrimshank's gear lies deep inside."] = "骑行南经过破碎石柱前往大裂口，哈扎里隧道；斯克林尚克的装备位于深处内部。",
	["Ride south past the Writhing Haunt to Sorrow Hill; Marlene's house stands by the road, and Joseph Redpath's monument is in the graveyard behind it. Kill the Diseased Wolves you meet in the fields on the way."] = "骑行南经过蠕行之祸前往悔恨岭；玛莱恩·雷德帕斯的房屋位于路边，与约瑟夫·雷德帕斯的纪念碑是在墓地后面它。击杀患病的狼你会合在农田在途中。",
	["Ride south through the pass into the Badlands' northern edge: the Stonevault troggs dig outside Uldaman there. The carved urns and the magenta mushroom clusters sit in their caves and tunnels, outside the dungeon itself."] = "骑行南穿过穿过进入荒芜之地的北部边缘：石窖穴居人挖掘在奥达曼外那里。雕刻的骨灰瓮与洋红蘑菇簇坐在它们的洞穴与隧道，在地下城其本身外。",
	["Ride south to Agmond's End."] = "骑行南前往埃格蒙德的营地。",
	["Ride south to Booty Bay. Shaky Phillipe waits on the docks."] = "骑行南前往藏宝海湾。“发抖者”菲利普等候在码头上。",
	["Ride south to Fire Plume Ridge in the middle of the crater, then east into the eastern jungle. Crystal clusters stand all over the crater, many of them around Fire Plume Ridge: take a few extra of each colour. Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers drop the petals; the expedition's Crate of Foodstuffs sits at an abandoned camp in the eastern jungle."] = "骑行南前往火羽山在环形山的中央，然后东进入东部丛林。水晶簇位于全部越过环形山，许多的它们在火羽山周围：接取一个少量额外的每个颜色。血瓣花鞭笞者与长尾鲨掉落花瓣；远征队的食物箱位于一个废弃的扎营于东部丛林。",
	["Ride south to Gahrron's Withering, where Cauldron Lord Soulwrath guards the cauldron."] = "骑行南前往盖罗恩农场，在护锅者索瓦斯卫兵大锅。",
	["Ride south to Owl Wing Thicket. Protect Ranshalla while she lights the torches on the way to the Altar of Elune."] = "骑行南前往枭翼树丛。保护兰莎尔拉当她点燃火炬在途中前往艾露恩祭坛。",
	["Ride south to the Crossroads, then west along the road out of the Barrens into Stonetalon. The troll village of Malaka'jin sits at the entrance of the canyon."] = "骑行南前往十字路口，然后西沿着道路出的贫瘠之地进入石爪山脉。巨魔村庄的玛拉卡金位于峡谷入口处。",
	["Ride south to the dig camp at the Broken Pillar. Marvon hands you a detector helm: wear it to see the Gahz'ridian mounds, which lie thick in the sand around the camp and south-west toward the ogres."] = "骑行南前往挖掘扎营于破碎石柱。马冯发放你一个探测器头盔：佩戴它前往查看加兹瑞迪安土堆，其中位于密集在沙子在营地与南周围-西朝食人魔方向。",
	["Ride south to the giant's hut in the middle of the marsh."] = "骑行南前往巨型的小屋在沼泽的中央。",
	["Ride south, east of Southshore, down to the coast. The Daggerspine naga line the shore south-east of the town."] = "骑行南，在南海镇以东，下前往海岸。匕首沼纳迦路线岸边在城镇以东南。",
	["Ride south-east down the valley to Jaron's damaged crate in the snow at Mazthoril, with his wrecked wagon just east of it."] = "骑行东南下山谷前往加隆·石矛的受损的木箱在雪在麦索瑞尔，与他的失事的马车就在它东面。",
	["Ride south-east off the Shimmering Flats into Tanaris. Gadgetzan is just inside the border."] = "骑行东南偏离/关闭闪光平原进入塔纳利斯。加基森是就在边界内。",
	["Ride south-east to Ortell's Hideout under the Un'Goro cliffs."] = "骑行东南前往隐士奥泰尔的藏身处在下方安戈洛环形山悬崖。",
	["Ride south-east to Waterspring Field. Caliph stands in the middle of the southern Wastewander camp: clear around him first."] = "骑行东南前往清泉平原。卡利夫位于南部的中央废土窃贼营地：清理周围他第一。",
	["Ride south-east to the Altar of Zul, the stepped Vilebranch temple in the south of the Hinterlands, and climb to the top. Qiaga and Morta'gya the Keeper (elite, 50) stand up there: touch the top and come straight back down."] = "骑行东南前往祖尔祭坛，踩踏邪枝神庙在南面的辛特兰，与爬上前往顶部。琪亚加与守护者莫塔加亚（精英，50）位于上那里：触碰/靠近顶部与来到直走返回下。",
	["Ride south-east to the Woodpaw gnolls; the courier's backpacks lie in their southern camp, and a parcel inside them starts a delivery to Thalanaar. The Zukk'ash hive is just south: fight down to the pod that holds Raschal, free him and keep him alive on the way out."] = "骑行东南前往木爪豺狼人；信使的背包位于它们的南部营地，与一个包裹内部它们始于一个递送物前往萨兰纳尔。祖卡什虫巢是就在南：迎战下前往豆荚该持有拉斯查尔，解救他与保留他存活在途中出。",
	["Ride south-east to the post."] = "骑行东南前往岗哨。",
	["Ride south-west along the western cliffs. Frenzied Pterrordax fly over the west side, and Bloodpetal Trappers grow in the same jungle."] = "骑行西南沿着西部悬崖。狂怒的翼手龙飞往越过西一侧，与血瓣花捕兽者生长在相同丛林。",
	["Ride south-west out of Arathi over Thandol Span, south through the Wetlands (keep clear of Menethil Harbor) and east into Loch Modan; the road leaves Loch Modan to the south into the Badlands. Follow it south to the goblin camp in the Valley of Fangs."] = "骑行西南离开阿拉希高地越过萨多尔大桥，南穿过湿地（保留清理的米奈希尔港）与东进入洛克莫丹；道路离开洛克莫丹向南进入荒芜之地。沿着它南前往地精扎营于巨牙谷。",
	["Ride south-west past Felstone Farm and follow the road west back to the Bulwark."] = "骑行西南经过詹妮丝·费尔斯通农场与沿着道路前往西返回前往亡灵壁垒。",
	["Ride south-west to Chromie in Andorhal."] = "骑行西南前往克罗米在安多哈尔。",
	["Ride south-west to Fire Plume Ridge, the volcano in the middle of the crater. Bloodpetal Flayers grow around its foot."] = "骑行西南前往火羽山，火山在环形山的中央。血瓣花掠夺者生长周围它的山脚。",
	["Ride south-west to Gadgetzan."] = "骑行西南前往加基森。",
	["Ride south-west to Marvon Rivetseeker's camp at the Broken Pillar."] = "骑行西南前往玛尔冯·瑞文斯克的扎营于破碎石柱。",
	["Ride south-west to the Musty Scroll, then east through the Wyrmbog. The Firemane scouts and ash tails roam its northern edge with the Searing hatchlings and whelps; the scalebanes guard the dragon caves further south-east. Mok'Morokk's snuff, grog and strongbox lie in the dragonkin camps."] = "骑行西南前往发霉的卷轴，然后东穿过巨龙沼泽。莫特加·火鬃斥候与灰烬尾巴游荡它的北部边缘与炎鹏幼体与雏龙；鳞灾守卫龙洞穴更远处东南。莫格穆洛克大王的熄灭，烈酒与保险箱位于龙类扎营。",
	["Ride south-west to the Undercroft. The mound of dirt lies inside. Mercutio Filthgorger is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "骑行西南前往地下墓穴。土堆的泥土位于内部。米库提奥·污血为精英：建议组队前往。",
	["Ride south-west to the camp."] = "骑行西南前往营地。",
	["Ride south-west to the dwarves' camp near the southern mountains and question Frankal Stonebridge and Rutgar Glyphshaper. Noggle's satchel lies in the sand just south-east of the camp."] = "骑行西南前往矮人的营地在南部山脉与问题附近弗兰卡·石桥与鲁特加尔·雕石。诺格·斯巴格的挎包位于沙子就在营地以东南。",
	["Ride south-west to the goblins' cove on the southern coast. Lolo the Lookout keeps watch on the cliff above it."] = "骑行西南前往地精的小湾在南部海岸。哨兵鲁鲁保留守望在悬崖上方它。",
	["Ride south-west to the ogre compound. Brutes and Enforcers (46-48) fill it; Gor'marok the Ravager (49) stands in the middle with guards around him: clear them first."] = "骑行西南前往食人魔营区。蛮兵与石拳执行者（46-48）装满它；掠夺者格玛洛克（49）位于中间与卫兵周围他：清理它们第一。",
	["Ride south-west to the ogre ruins below Feral Scar Vale. Shamans, warlocks and maulers fill them; the Mage-Lords at the southern end carry the orb."] = "骑行西南前往食人魔废墟在深痕谷下方。萨满祭司，术士与槌兵装满它们；法师-领主在南部尽头携带宝珠。",
	["Ride south-west to the ruins of Southwind Village. The Dusty Reliquary for Rabine Saturna sits inside one of the ruined houses."] = "骑行西南前往废墟的南风村。积灰的圣物箱给拉比恩·萨图纳位于内部1的毁坏的房屋。",
	["Ride south-west to the ruins. The four tablets lie among the ruins, guarded by Spitelash naga; any Siren or Myrmidon can carry Kim'jael's rune."] = "骑行西南前往废墟。4石板位于其中：废墟，有守卫的在旁怨灵纳迦；任意海妖或皇家卫兵可以携带基姆加尔的符文。",
	["Ride south-west to the troll village on the coast, keeping clear of the Gelkis Village on the way."] = "骑行西南前往巨魔村庄在海岸边，保留清理的吉尔吉斯村在途中。",
	["Ride south-west towards Shadowprey. The Gelkis centaurs (32-35) around their village are a good camp; fight them until level 32."] = "骑行西南朝葬影村方向。吉尔吉斯半人马（32-35）周围它们的村庄是一个好营地；迎战它们直到32级。",
	["Ride the lift down, then follow the road east through the canyons to Freewind Post, a Tauren village on top of the mesas. Its lift is on the north side."] = "骑行升降梯下，然后沿着道路前往东穿过峡谷前往乱风岗，一个牛头人村庄在顶部的台地。它的升降梯是在北一侧。",
	["Ride the road south through Felwood to the Sanctuary."] = "骑行道路南穿过费伍德森林前往圣地。",
	["Ride to Darrowshire in the south-west; Pamela plays among the houses. Mercutio Filthgorger lurks in the Undercroft, the crypt just west of the town."] = "骑行前往达隆郡在西南面；帕米拉进行在其中：房屋。米库提奥·污血潜伏在地下墓穴，地穴就在城镇以西。",
	["Ride to Stormwind. It has no shaman trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge, train with Eldrun Stormbreaker, then ride the tram back for the boat."] = "骑行前往暴风城。它有无萨满祭司训练师：接取矿道地铁来自矮人区前往铁炉堡，训练与埃尔德伦·破风者，然后骑行地铁返回给船。",
	["Ride west across the Badlands to the Dustbelcher camp at Camp Boff. Boss Tho'grun stands in its middle with Wyrmhunters and Maulers around him."] = "骑行西穿过荒芜之地前往尘嗝扎营于博夫营地。索格伦位于它的中间与猎龙者与科卡尔虐待者周围他。",
	["Ride west along the crater's northern wall to the pass in the north-west corner that climbs into Silithus."] = "骑行西沿着环形山的北部城墙前往穿过在西北面角落该爬上进入希利苏斯。",
	["Ride west along the main road across Ashenvale, past Astranaar (Alliance: keep to the road), to the coast. Zoram'gar Outpost is on the Zoram Strand in the north-west. Its other quests are for the next visit, at 27."] = "骑行西沿着主道路穿过灰谷，经过阿斯特兰纳（联盟：保留前往道路），前往海岸。佐拉姆加前哨站是在佐拉姆暗滩唤魔师在西北面。它的其他任务是给下一个造访，在27。",
	["Ride west along the road once more."] = "骑行西沿着道路一次更多。",
	["Ride west along the road out of Raven Hill into Westfall. Agent Kearnen watches Klaven Mortwake's tower from the hills just inside the border. The Malformed Defias Drone (level 23) guarding the tower carries its key; Klaven's journal is in the chest at the top."] = "骑行西沿着道路离开乌鸦岭进入西部荒野。密探吉尔妮注视克拉文·摩特维克的哨塔来自丘陵就在边界内。丑陋的迪菲亚懒汉（23级）守卫哨塔携带它的钥匙；克拉文的日记是在箱子在顶部。",
	["Ride west along the road past Lake Kel'Theril; Raging Owlbeasts roam the hills north of it."] = "骑行西沿着道路经过凯斯利尔湖；狂怒枭兽游荡于丘陵在它北面。",
	["Ride west along the road to Jaron."] = "骑行西沿着道路前往加隆·石矛。",
	["Ride west along the road to the draenei camp at the Harborage, near the way in from Deadwind Pass."] = "骑行西沿着道路前往德莱尼扎营于庇护所，在路在来自附近逆风小径。",
	["Ride west along the road to the hot springs."] = "骑行西沿着道路前往热温泉。",
	["Ride west along the road to the night elf village."] = "骑行西沿着道路前往夜晚精灵村庄。",
	["Ride west along the road; Lotwil's camp sits in the Dustbowl halfway to Kargath."] = "骑行西沿着道路；洛特维尔的营地位于尘风盆地半路前往卡加斯。",
	["Ride west along the road; the hermit's shack stands north-east of the Raven Hill Cemetery."] = "骑行西沿着道路；隐士的棚屋位于东北的乌鸦岭墓地。",
	["Ride west along the road; the scroll lies at the water's edge in the swamp's far west."] = "骑行西沿着道路；卷轴位于水的边缘在沼泽的远处西。",
	["Ride west back across the marsh. The Darkfang Venomspitters on the ridges north of Brackenwall drop the venom sacs. Theramore Infiltrators (35-36) sneak through the same woods: they are stealthed, so look closely."] = "骑行西返回穿过沼泽。暗牙毒蜘蛛在山脊在蕨墙村以北掉落毒液囊。塞拉摩间谍（35-36）潜行穿过相同树林：它们是潜行的，因此查看紧密地。",
	["Ride west back to Valormok."] = "骑行西返回前往瓦罗莫克。",
	["Ride west back to the refuge."] = "骑行西返回前往营地。",
	["Ride west from Torwa: the silithid hive fills the south of the crater. Use the Scraping Vial on a hatchery, a chamber with hanging larvae. Gorishi wasps and workers drop Un'Goro Soil; Pterrordax nest on the southern cliffs if you still need kills."] = "骑行西来自托尔瓦：异种虫虫巢装满在环形山以南。使用刮取瓶在一个孵化间，一个密室与悬挂的幼虫。戈里什黄蜂与工人掉落安戈洛的泥土；翼手龙巢在南部悬崖如果你仍然需要击杀。",
	["Ride west into the Dustbowl; Lotwil works by his machines in the middle of it."] = "骑行西进入尘风盆地；洛特维尔有效在旁他的机器在中间的它。",
	["Ride west into the middle of Feralas. Kill a Rogue Vale Screecher, use Yeh'kinya's Bramble on its body and kill the spirit that rises."] = "骑行西进入中间的菲拉斯。击杀一个游荡的山谷尖啸者，使用叶基亚的树枝在它的尸体与击杀之灵该高地。",
	["Ride west out of Gadgetzan to the long ramp down into Un'Goro Crater. Torwa camps at the foot of the ramp, in the south-east corner of the crater."] = "骑行西离开加基森前往长坡道下进入安戈洛环形山。托尔瓦扎营在坡道的底部，在东南面角落的环形山。",
	["Ride west out of Stonard and south through the canyon into the Blasted Lands; the two bloodmages stand by the road just inside."] = "骑行西离开斯通纳德与南穿过峡谷进入诅咒之地；2血法师位于路边就在内部。",
	["Ride west past Marshal's Refuge and south down the western side to Golakka Hot Springs: Krakle the goblin sits by the water."] = "骑行西经过马绍尔营地与南下西部一侧前往葛拉卡温泉：克拉兰克地精位于水。",
	["Ride west to Azore Aldamort's tower at Ethel Rethor on the north-west coast."] = "骑行西前往阿佐尔·奥达蒙特的哨塔在艾瑟雷索在西北海岸。",
	["Ride west to Grom'gol."] = "骑行西前往格罗姆高。",
	["Ride west to Terrordale. Plaguehound Runts, Plaguebats and Carrion Grubs roam its woods; fill the Empty Termite Jar at the big termite mounds and kill the Frenzied Plaguehounds further north."] = "骑行西前往恐惧谷。瘟疫幼犬，瘟疫蝙蝠与腐肉虫游荡它的树林；装满空的白蚁瓶在大白蚁土堆与击杀狂怒的瘟疫犬更远处北。",
	["Ride west to Thunder Axe Fortress. Beat a Burning Blade cultist down, then use the Burning Gem on it before it dies to fill one Infused Burning Gem. They also drop a Flayed Demon Skin now and then (1-5%); if one drops, read it."] = "骑行西前往雷斧堡垒。击败一个火刃邪教徒下，然后使用燃烧宝石在它之前它死亡前往装满1灌入灵魂的燃烧宝石。它们也掉落一个恶魔之皮现在与然后（1-5%）；如果1掉落，阅读它。",
	["Ride west to the Horde camp north of Hive'Regal."] = "骑行西前往部落营地在雷戈虫巢以北。",
	["Ride west to the Marris Stead."] = "骑行西前往玛瑞斯农场。",
	["Ride west to the Northridge Lumber Camp; Kirsta hides on the hill north-east of it."] = "骑行西前往北山伐木场；科尔斯塔·迪普沙东藏身在山丘在它东北面。",
	["Ride west to the Valley of Fangs in the middle of the Badlands; Rigglefuzz camps beside Martek."] = "骑行西前往巨牙谷在中间的荒芜之地；里格弗兹扎营在流放者马特克旁边。",
	["Ride west to the dig site. War Reaver golems (53) stomp around it and drop the shards often; the Tablet of the Seven stands in its middle among the Thaurissan dwarves. Copy it."] = "骑行西前往挖掘地点。战争掠夺者魔像（53）践踏周围它与掉落碎片经常；七贤石板位于它的中间在其中：索瑞森矮人。副本它。",
	["Ride west to the friendly mountain giant at the foot of the hills. Land Walkers and Cliff Giants around him are elite: give them room."] = "骑行西前往友善山脉巨型在丘陵的底部。大地行者与峭壁巨人周围他为精英：交给它们房间。",
	["Ride west to the hermit once more."] = "骑行西前往隐士一次更多。",
	["Ride west to the shore of Lake Falathim. Teronis lies among the Saltspittle murlocs; any murloc can drop the Glowing Gem."] = "骑行西前往岸边的法拉希姆湖。特罗尼斯位于其中：盐沫鱼人；任意鱼人可以掉落发光的宝石。",
	["Ride west to the walled hold in the middle of the desert."] = "骑行西前往有围墙的要塞在沙漠的中央。",
	["Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. In Classic each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is Kar Stormsinger in Bloodhoof Village, with Harb Clawhoof's kodos (20 gold each) beside him. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (not confirmed): try Kildar in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor first, as he is the nearest, and skip this step if he teaches you."] = "骑术需要40级与花费100金币；学习它给你一个坐骑。在经典旧世每个种族学习它来自它的自己的种族的训练师：你的是卡尔·雷歌在血蹄村，与哈布·爪蹄的科多兽（20金币每个）旁边他。无限服可能允许任意种族学习来自任意骑术训练师（不已确认）：尝试基尔达在奥格瑞玛的荣誉谷第一，作为他是最近的，与跳过此步骤如果他传授你。",
	["Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. In Classic each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is Velma Warnam in Brill, with Zachariah Post's skeletal horses (20 gold each) beside her. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (not confirmed): try Kildar in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor first, as he is the nearest, and skip this step if he teaches you."] = "骑术需要40级与花费100金币；学习它给你一个坐骑。在经典旧世每个种族学习它来自它的自己的种族的训练师：你的是维尔玛·瓦纳姆在布瑞尔，与撒迦利亚·普斯特的骷髅马（20金币每个）旁边她的。无限服可能允许任意种族学习来自任意骑术训练师（不已确认）：尝试基尔达在奥格瑞玛的荣誉谷第一，作为他是最近的，与跳过此步骤如果他传授你。",
	["Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. In Classic each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is Xar'Ti in Sen'jin Village on the Durotar coast, with Zjolnir's raptors (20 gold each) beside him. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (not confirmed): try Kildar in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor first, as he is the nearest, and skip this step if he teaches you."] = "骑术需要40级与花费100金币；学习它给你一个坐骑。在经典旧世每个种族学习它来自它的自己的种族的训练师：你的是克萨尔迪在森金村在杜隆塔尔海岸，与佐尔尼尔的迅猛龙（20金币每个）旁边他。无限服可能允许任意种族学习来自任意骑术训练师（不已确认）：尝试基尔达在奥格瑞玛的荣誉谷第一，作为他是最近的，与跳过此步骤如果他传授你。",
	["Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Kildar teaches Orcs in the Valley of Honor, by Ogunaro Wolfrunner's kennel; no Skyborne riding trainer is known, so Skyborne try Kildar too. Your race's other mounts are 20 gold each: Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 has a guide for each."] = "骑术需要40级与花费100金币；学习它给你一个坐骑。基尔达传授兽人在荣誉谷，在旁奥古纳罗的兽栏；无天裔骑术训练师是已知，因此天裔尝试基尔达也。你的种族的其他坐骑是20金币每个：藏品收集，坐骑 · 40级有一个指南给每个。",
	["Rifleman Torrig, at the Alliance tents"] = "火枪手托瑞格，在联盟帐篷",
	["Rigger Gizelton"] = "里格·基泽尔顿",
	["Rigger Gizelton's caravan stops on the road at the edge of Mannoroc Coven. Escort it east past the coven; demons attack it twice."] = "里格·基泽尔顿的商队停靠在路上在玛诺洛克集会所的边缘。护送它东经过女巫团；恶魔攻击它两次。",
	["Rigger Gizelton's caravan stops on the road east of Gelkis Village. Take the quest and walk with the kodos past the Mannoroc Coven, killing the demons that jump them; talk to Smeed at his camp east of the Kodo Graveyard afterwards."] = "里格·基泽尔顿的商队停靠在路上在吉尔吉斯村以东。接取任务与步行与科多兽经过玛诺洛克集会所，击杀恶魔该跳下它们；对话前往斯米德在他的营地东的科多兽坟场随后。",
	["Rigglefuzz"] = "里格弗兹",
	["Rigglefuzz's next quest pays no experience: skip it."] = "里格弗兹的下一个任务不给经验值：跳过即可。",
	["Rilli Greasygob, Valley of Honor"] = "雷里·格里斯高布，荣誉谷",
	["Rimtori's camp is at the east end of the base camp. Read the Kaldorei Tome of Summoning there, then kill the Magus."] = "里姆托里的营地是在基地营地的东端。阅读卡多雷召唤魔典那里，然后击杀魔导师。",
	["Rin'ji"] = "林吉",
	["Ring of Zoram"] = "佐拉姆之戒",
	["Ring the bell whenever Shay stops to wander, and lead her south to Rockbiter."] = "戒指钟每当沙恩·飘叶停靠前往游荡，与引导她的南前往罗克比特。",
	["Ringo sits on the ridge, lost and exhausted."] = "林格位于山脊，遗失的与力竭的。",
	["Ringo sits on the south-east slope of Fire Plume Ridge, in the middle of the crater."] = "林格位于东南山坡的火羽山，在环形山的中央。",
	["Ripe Stormapples and Hungry Bandits are in the orchard by the farm, Flutterfly Dust in the fields north-east of it, Ornery Galestriders all around. The Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct stands in the field north-east of the farm."] = "成熟的风暴苹果与饥饿的强盗是在果园在旁农场，彩蝶粉尘在农田在它东北面，暴躁的疾风陆行鸟全部周围。失灵的旋风构造体位于田野在农场以东北。",
	["Ripped Missive"] = "撕裂的密信",
	["River Crocolisks swim the river by the Rebel Camp."] = "淡水鳄游泳河流在旁反抗军营地。",
	["Rivern Frostwind at Frostsaber Rock in northern Winterspring offers the repeatable Frostsaber Provisions, Winterfall Intrusion and Rampaging Giants (level 58); they are the whole road to Exalted, so expect weeks of turn-ins."] = "雷沃·霜翼在霜刀石在北部冬泉谷提供可重复霜刃豹的食物，冬泉熊怪的侵扰与狂暴的巨人（58级）；它们是整个道路前往崇拜，因此预计周的交任务。",
	["Rivern Frostwind, 200g"] = "雷沃·霜翼，200金",
	["Rivern Frostwind, Frostsaber Rock"] = "雷沃·霜翼，霜刀石",
	["Riverpaw Bandits and Taskmasters (level 16-18) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "河爪强盗与监工（16-18级）掉落它此处。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Riverpaw Gnolls and Scouts roam the hills between the coast and the Jansen Stead."] = "河爪豺狼人与斥候游荡于丘陵之间海岸与詹森农场。",
	["Riverpaw Miners"] = "河爪矿工",
	["Riverpaw Runts and Outrunners hold the hills south of the garrison, along the Westfall border. Gruff Swiftbite, a level 12 gnoll, walks among them and carries the Gold Pickup Schedule: right-click it."] = "矮小的河爪豺狼人与斥候要塞丘陵在兵营以南，沿着西部荒野边界。格鲁夫·疾咬，一个12级豺狼人，步行在其中：它们与携带采金日程表：右键点击它。",
	["Riverpaw Taskmaster (level 17-18) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "河爪监工（17-18级）掉落它此处。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Riverpaw gnolls camp in the hills west of Stone Cairn Lake; the Stolen Enchanting Supplies lie in their camps."] = "河爪豺狼人扎营于丘陵在石碑湖以西；被盗的附魔物资位于它们的扎营。",
	["Rizzle's Unguarded Plans"] = "无人看守的瑞兹尔设计图",
	["Roast Raptor is orange from 175 (yellow at 215, grey at 255): about 40 crafts to 215. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "烤迅猛龙肉是橙色来自175（黄色在215，灰色在255）：约40制作前往215。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
	["Roasted Boar Meat is orange from 1 (yellow at 45, grey at 85): about 50 crafts to 50. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "烤野猪肉是橙色来自1（黄色在45，灰色在85）：约50制作前往50。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
	["Rock Elemental Shard"] = "石元素的碎片",
	["Rock Stalker Fang"] = "石行蜘蛛的牙齿",
	["Rockbiter"] = "罗克比特",
	["Rocket Car Parts"] = "火箭车零件",
	["Rocket Car Rubble lies all over the flats north of the raceway. Scorpid Reavers and Sparkleshell Tortoises roam the north half, Salt Flats Scavengers circle overhead, and Saltstone Basilisks graze west of the track. The Crystalhides roam the middle of the flats and the Gazers (34-35, five levels above you: one at a time) the far south."] = "火箭车残骸位于全部越过平原在赛道以北。恐蝎劫掠者与盐壳龟游荡于北一半，盐湖食腐鹫法阵上方，与盐石蜥蜴吃草在追踪以西。晶皮游荡于中间的平原与凝视者（34-35，5等级上方你：1在一个时间）远处南。",
	["Rocket Car Rubble lies all over the flats. Scorpid Reavers, Sparkleshell Tortoises and Saltstone Basilisks roam the north half, Crystalhides, Scorpid Terrors and Snappers the middle, and the Gazers (34-35, five levels above you: one at a time) the far south. Vultures circle over all of it."] = "火箭车残骸位于全部越过平原。恐蝎劫掠者，盐壳龟与盐石蜥蜴游荡于北一半，晶皮，恐蝎与咬龟中间，与凝视者（34-35，5等级上方你：1在一个时间）远处南。秃鹫法阵越过全部的它。",
	["Rockjaw Ambushers by Helm's Bed Lake, north of the quarry, and Rockjaw Backbreakers further east drop the Stolen Blasting Powder."] = "石腭伏击者在旁涌冰湖，在采石场以北，与石腭碎脊者更远处东掉落被盗的炸药粉。",
	["Rockjaw Bonesnapper"] = "石腭断骨者",
	["Rockjaw Bonesnappers prowl the quarry and Helm's Bed Lake; Dark Iron Spies sneak around the lake shore. One spy drops the Dark Iron Map."] = "石腭断骨者游荡采石场与涌冰湖；黑铁间谍潜行在湖岸边周围。1间谍掉落黑铁地图。",
	["Rockjaw Skullthumper"] = "石腭击颅者",
	["Rockjaw Skullthumpers fill the quarry; Rockjaw Ambushers by Helm's Bed Lake drop the Empty Powder Keg."] = "石腭击颅者装满采石场；石腭伏击者在旁涌冰湖掉落空火药桶。",
	["Rockjaw Trogg"] = "石腭穴居人",
	["Rockjaw Troggs and Burly Rockjaw Troggs dig all over the valley floor south of Anvilmar. Hands Springsprocket stands at the mouth of the tunnel to the east."] = "石腭穴居人与壮实的石腭怪挖掘全部越过山谷楼层在安威玛尔以南。汉兹·跳链位于隧道前往东的入口。",
	["Rod of Deep Dominion: Stormscale Beastmistress"] = "深渊统御之杖：风暴鳞片驭兽者",
	["Roetten Stonehammer"] = "罗顿·石锤",
	["Rok Orhan"] = "洛卡·奥赫",
	["Rok'Alim, a hard-hitting rock elemental, walks the cliffs of Highperch. Rok'Alim the Pounder is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "洛卡里姆，一个困难-攻击岩石元素，步行悬崖的风巢。罗卡里姆为精英：建议组队前往。",
	["Rolf's corpse"] = "罗尔夫的尸体",
	["Roon Wildmane: for Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn"] = "鲁恩·蛮鬃：给赫米特·奈辛瓦里二世在荆棘谷",
	["Ror stands at the far south end of Deadwood Village."] = "罗尔位于远处南尽头的死木村。",
	["Rorian the Dayseeker"] = "寻日者罗里安",
	["Rotting Dead and Ravaged Corpses shamble through the fields just west of Brill; Darkhounds roam a little further west, toward Gordo."] = "腐烂的死者与破碎的尸体蹒跚游荡穿过农田就在布瑞尔以西；饥饿的黑暗犬游荡一个小更远处西，朝葛尔多方向。",
	["Rough Stone comes from Copper Vein nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "劣质的石头来自铜矿脉采集点（采矿）；此是最密集的簇在数据。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Rough Wolf Pelts"] = "粗糙的狼皮",
	["Royal Factor Bathrilor"] = "皇家代理人巴瑟罗尔",
	["Royal Historian Archesonus"] = "皇家历史学家阿克瑟努斯",
	["Royal Overseer Bauhaus"] = "皇家管理人巴哈乌斯",
	["Rudra Amberstill"] = "鲁德拉·冻石",
	["Ruga Ragetotem"] = "鲁迦·狂暴图腾",
	["Rumstag Proudstrider takes cloth for Thunder Bluff in Thunder Bluff. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "拉姆斯塔格接收布料给雷霆崖在雷霆崖。第一捐献的毛料，丝绸，魔纹布与符文布（60布料每个）已完成一次与交给大多数声望每布料；之后它们，更多的符文布可重复直到崇拜。崇拜与另一个种族的主城允许你购买该种族的坐骑。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["Run Stratholme (both wings) and Scholomance, killing every Scourge you pass."] = "前往斯坦索姆（两个翅膀）与通灵学院，击杀每个天灾军团你穿过。",
	["Rune of Beth'Amara"] = "贝萨玛拉符文",
	["Rune of Jin'yael"] = "辛耶尔符文",
	["Rune of Markri"] = "玛克雷符文",
	["Rune of Sael'hai"] = "萨尔哈符文",
	["Runecloth"] = "符文布",
	["Runecloth Bandage (skill 260) is an Artisan recipe: only the Triage doctor teaches it (Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen in Theramore, Doctor Gregory Victor in Hammerfall)."] = "符文布绷带（技能等级260）是一个大师级配方：仅救死扶伤医生传授它（古斯塔夫·范沃森医生在塞拉摩，格里高利·维克托医生在落锤镇）。",
	["Runecloth Bandage is yellow from 260 (yellow at 260, grey at 320): about 65 crafts to 300. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Runecloth Bandage stays yellow to 320, so it carries you to 300 without a trip for Heavy Runecloth."] = "符文布绷带是黄色来自260（黄色在260，灰色在320）：约65制作前往300。绷带需要无营火：制作它们任何地方。符文布绷带留在黄色前往320，因此它携带你前往300没有一个行程给重型作战傀儡符文布。",
	["Runecloth, for Meilosh later"] = "符文布，给梅罗什稍后",
	["Runes of Summoning"] = "召唤符文",
	["Running Dire Maul in Feralas instead of grinding gets you there faster in a group. Skip this step to grind solo."] = "刷厄运之槌在菲拉斯代替的刷怪使你达到你那里更快组队情况下。跳过此步骤前往刷怪单人。",
	["Running Scholomance (Caer Darrow, south-east Western Plaguelands) or Stratholme instead of grinding gets you there faster in a group. Skip this step to grind solo."] = "刷通灵学院（凯尔达隆，东南西瘟疫之地）或斯坦索姆代替的刷怪使你达到你那里更快组队情况下。跳过此步骤前往刷怪单人。",
	["Running Zul'Farrak instead of grinding gets you there faster in a group. The troll city lies in northern Tanaris, the next zone on the route; come back to Zorbin on the Forgotten Coast afterwards."] = "刷用祖尔法拉克代替刷怪使你达到你那里更快组队情况下。巨魔主城位于北部塔纳利斯，下一个区域在路线；来到返回前往佐尔宾在被遗忘的海岸随后。",
	["Running Zul'Farrak instead of grinding gets you there faster in a group. The troll city lies in the north-west of Tanaris, just north of Gadgetzan."] = "刷用祖尔法拉克代替刷怪使你达到你那里更快组队情况下。巨魔主城位于塔纳利斯以西北，就在加基森以北。",
	["Running the Sunken Temple instead of grinding gets you there faster in a group. Skip this step to grind solo."] = "刷沉没的神庙代替的刷怪使你达到你那里更快组队情况下。跳过此步骤前往刷怪单人。",
	["Rusty chests lie around the Shadethicket furbolg camps west of the Forsaken; open them until one holds the pommel."] = "生锈的箱子位于影茂熊怪扎营西的周围被遗忘者；打开/开启它们直到1持有剑柄。",
	["Rutherford Twing"] = "卢瑟弗·图恩",
	["Rutherford Twing hands out one Defiler's care package by level"] = "卢瑟弗·图恩发放1污染者的照料包裹在旁等级",
	["Ruul Eagletalon"] = "卢尔·鹰爪",
	["Ruul Snowhoof"] = "鲁尔·雪蹄",
	["Ruuzel walks the northern tip of the Zoram Strand with Wrathtail guards."] = "卢泽尔步行北部尖端的佐拉姆暗滩唤魔师与怒尾海巫卫兵。",
	["Ruzan"] = "鲁赞",
	["Ryedol's Lucky Pick"] = "雷杜尔的好运锄",
	["Ryedol's next errand goes into Uldaman: skip it."] = "勘察员雷杜尔的下一个差事前往进入奥达曼：跳过即可。",
	["Sacks of Oats"] = "燕麦袋",
	["Salfa guards the mouth of Timbermaw Hold, north-west of Donova."] = "萨尔法卫兵入口/河口的木喉要塞，在多诺瓦以西北。",
	["Salfa stands at the Winterspring end of the tunnel: keep it"] = "萨尔法位于冬泉谷尽头的隧道：请保留该任务/物品",
	["Salfa stands by the Winterspring exit of Timbermaw Hold's tunnel, north of the hot springs."] = "萨尔法站在旁边：冬泉谷出口的木喉要塞的隧道，在热温泉以北。",
	["Salfa: Beads for Salfa"] = "萨尔法：给萨尔法的珠串",
	["Salia"] = "萨莉亚",
	["Salma Saldean"] = "萨尔玛·萨丁",
	["Saltstone Basilisk"] = "盐石蜥蜴",
	["Saltstone Crystalhide"] = "盐石水晶蜥蜴",
	["Saltstone Gazer"] = "盐石凝视者",
	["Salty Scorpid Venom"] = "含盐的蝎毒",
	["Sam Sarsaparilla"] = "山姆·菝葜",
	["Sam Sarsaparilla camps north-east of the inn; Helene Peltskinner, Jason Mathers and Lee Brown stand on the shore of Crystal Lake east of town."] = "山姆·菝葜扎营在旅店以东北；海伦尼·派特斯金纳，贾森·玛瑟斯与李·布朗位于水晶湖的岸上在城镇东面。",
	["Samuel Hawke hands out one Arathor care package by level"] = "萨缪尔·霍克发放1阿拉索照料包裹在旁等级",
	["Samuel's Remains, from Samuel Fipps"] = "塞缪尔的遗骸，来自塞缪尔·菲普斯",
	["Sanath Lim-yo, at the east edge of the camp: no experience, only a teleport to Azshara Tower"] = "萨纳斯，在营地的东边缘：无经验值，仅一个传送前往艾萨拉哨塔",
	["Sand Skitterer Fang"] = "掠沙蜘蛛的牙齿",
	["Sania Silverstream"] = "萨妮娅·银溪",
	["Sara Timberlain"] = "萨拉·迪博雷恩",
	["Sarkoth, a large scorpid, prowls the slope south of Hana'zua."] = "萨科斯，一个大型蝎子，潜行游荡山坡在哈纳祖以南。",
	["Sarltooth's Talon"] = "萨尔图斯的爪子",
	["Savages and Storm Witches nest in Drygulch Ravine, east of Rezlak. A Storm Witch drops the Dull Storm Orb."] = "野人与血怒雷巫女巫巢在枯水谷，在雷兹拉克以东。一个血怒雷巫女巫掉落黯淡的风暴宝珠。",
	["Scaber Stalks"] = "粗柄蘑菇",
	["Scarlet Hunter"] = "血色猎人",
	["Scarlet Knight"] = "血色骑士",
	["Scarlet Mage"] = "血色法师",
	["Scarlet Medic"] = "血色医护员",
	["Scarlet Monastery: Armory"] = "血色修道院：军械库",
	["Scarlet Monastery: Cathedral"] = "血色修道院：大教堂",
	["Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard"] = "血色修道院：墓地",
	["Scarlet Monastery: Library"] = "血色修道院：图书馆",
	["Scarlet Warriors guard the outpost just west of the pumpkin fields. Bareth Dawnstone is held inside: talk to him and stay with him until he is out."] = "血色战士守卫前哨站就在南瓜农田以西。巴雷斯·晨石是持有内部：对话前往他与留在与他直到他是出。",
	["Scarred Crag Boar (38%), Elder Crag Boar (36%) in Dun Morogh, or wherever the arrow points"] = "有伤疤的峭壁野猪（38%），老峭壁野猪（36%）在丹莫罗，或跟随箭头指示位置",
	["Sceptre of Light"] = "圣光节杖",
	["Scholomance"] = "通灵学院",
	["Scholomance fits levels 58 to 60; The Key to Scholomance is handed in at Chillwind Camp below."] = "通灵学院适合58至60级；通灵学院的钥匙是上交在冰风岗下方。",
	["Scorpashi Venom"] = "鞭尾蝎的毒液",
	["Scorpok Pincer"] = "厚甲蝎螯",
	["Scourge Cauldron"] = "天灾大锅",
	["Scourge Champion"] = "天灾勇士",
	["Scourge Champions (59) roam the Noxious Glade, north of Light's Hope Chapel. Pass Carlin's Mystic Crystal over each one you kill: the skulls that resonate are the ones he wants. Pull them one at a time."] = "天灾勇士（59）游荡于剧毒林地，在圣光之愿礼拜堂以北。穿过卡林的秘法水晶越过每个1你击杀：头颅该共鸣是在他需要。拉怪它们1在一个时间。",
	["Scourge Champions roam the Noxious Glade, north of the chapel. Pass Carlin's Mystic Crystal over each one you kill: the skulls that resonate are the ones he wants."] = "天灾勇士游荡于剧毒林地，在礼拜堂以北。穿过卡林的秘法水晶越过每个1你击杀：头颅该共鸣是在他需要。",
	["Scout Bloodfist"] = "斥候布拉菲·血拳",
	["Scout Galiaan"] = "哨兵加里安",
	["Scrap Metal"] = "金属碎块",
	["Scrawny Ursera prowl the slopes south-west of the village, on the way to Hanaa."] = "瘦弱的乌尔塞拉游荡山坡在村庄以西南，在途中前往哈娜·夜风。",
	["Scrawny Ursera prowl the woods just west of the grove; the Ursera Scavengers den further west, with Urs'anah, the matriarch, at the back of the den."] = "瘦弱的乌尔塞拉游荡树林就在树林以西；乌尔塞拉食腐熊兽穴更远处西，与乌尔萨娜，主母，在兽穴的后方。",
	["Scrimshank's Surveying Gear"] = "谢申克的勘探设备",
	["Sea Creature Bones"] = "海洋生物的骸骨",
	["Sea Turtle Remains, on the beach west of the docks"] = "海龟的残骸，在海滩上在码头以西",
	["Sea elementals and sea sprays wash along the shore around the dock. Zap the giants with Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker first: shrunken, they lose their elite strength. Shore striders wade in the water; the land walkers and cliff giants roam the hills further north."] = "海元素与大海喷洒冲上沿着岸边在码头周围。电击巨人与索尔宾的超级压缩器第一：缩小的，它们丢失它们的精英力量。岸边陆行鸟涉水在水；陆地行者与悬崖巨人游荡于丘陵更远处北。",
	["Seahorn's next errand goes back to Arathi: skip it."] = "舰队指挥官卡拉·海角的下一个差事交回给阿拉希高地：跳过即可。",
	["Sealed Barrel"] = "密封的桶",
	["Sealed Folder"] = "密封的信件",
	["Search the dead cultist"] = "搜索死亡的邪教徒",
	["Search the wardrobe"] = "搜索衣柜",
	["Searn Firewarder"] = "希尔恩·火结",
	["Searn Firewarder stands in the Valley of Wisdom; Gan'rul Bloodeye in the Cleft of Shadow, under the Valley of Strength."] = "希尔恩·火结位于智慧谷；甘鲁尔·血眼在暗影裂口，在下方力量谷。",
	["Second Relic Fragment"] = "第二块遗物碎片",
	["Second Witherbark Cage"] = "第二个枯木牢笼",
	["Secret Plans: Fiery Flux"] = "秘密设计图：炽热助熔剂",
	["Security Chief Bilgewhizzle"] = "安全主管吉罗姆·比格维兹",
	["Seena Skybreaker"] = "希娜·破天者",
	["Seena Skybreaker stands in the middle of Valanaar."] = "希娜·破天者位于瓦拉纳尔的中央。",
	["Seena Skybreaker: Defensive Stance"] = "希娜·破天者：防御姿态",
	["Seena Skybreaker: Zaal Stormshield waits at the Shrine of Akir"] = "希娜·破天者：扎尔·风暴之盾等候于阿基尔神龛",
	["Seer Ravenfeather"] = "鸦羽先知",
	["Seer Ravenfeather stands in Camp Narache. Call of Earth needs level 4, which you reach with the turn-ins here."] = "鸦羽先知位于纳拉其营地。大地的召唤需要4级，其中你抵达与交任务此处。",
	["Seer Ravenfeather: Stoneskin Totem and your Earth Totem"] = "鸦羽先知：石肤图腾与你的大地图腾",
	["Seer Wiserunner stands at the edge of the Bael'dun Digsite, south of the well."] = "先知奥萨迪·智慧行者位于边缘的巴尔丹挖掘场，在水井以南。",
	["Senani Thunderheart"] = "塞娜尼·雷心",
	["Senani Thunderheart stands at Night Run, the Warsong camp just north-east of Splintertree, beside the hunt board."] = "塞娜尼·雷心位于夜道谷，战歌信使营地就在碎木岗哨以东北，在狩猎告示板旁边。",
	["Senani's hunt targets (Ursangous, Shadumbra, Sharptalon) are for the next Ashenvale visit, at 27."] = "塞娜尼·雷心的狩猎目标（乌萨苟斯，萨杜布拉，沙普塔隆）是给下一个灰谷造访，在27。",
	["Senator Mehr Stonehallow, in the quarry"] = "参议员梅尔·圣石，在采石场",
	["Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser"] = "高级勘探员菲兹杜瑟",
	["Senir Whitebeard"] = "森内尔·白须",
	["Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak, by the moonwell"] = "哨兵阿瑞尼亚·碎云，在旁月亮井",
	["Sentinel Elissa Starbreeze"] = "哨兵艾莉萨·星风",
	["Sentinel Farsong takes Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor for Vanquish the Invaders!, once per level bracket (data); check them live."] = "哨兵艾蒂亚·轻歌接收战歌峡谷荣誉奖章给消灭侵略者！，每个等级段一次（数据）；请在游戏内实测确认。",
	["Sentinel Farsong, Silverwing Grove"] = "哨兵艾蒂亚·轻歌，银翼树林",
	["Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea"] = "哨兵戈琳达·纳希恩",
	["Sentinel Kyra Starsong"] = "哨兵凯拉·星歌",
	["Sentinel Lynessa Duskblossom"] = "哨兵莉妮莎·暮花",
	["Sentinel Melyria Frostshadow"] = "哨兵梅丽瑞亚·霜影",
	["Sentinel Selarin: for Raene Wolfrunner in Astranaar, on the later Ashenvale leg"] = "哨兵塞拉伊：给莱恩·狼行者在阿斯特兰纳，在稍后灰谷腿",
	["Sentinel Thenysil"] = "哨兵塞恩希尔",
	["Sentinel Tysha Moonblade"] = "哨兵坦莎·月刃",
	["Sentinel Tysha Moonblade stands at the north edge of the ruins. Cursed, Writhing and Wailing Highborne haunt them; Anaya Dawnrunner's ghost walks among them, Jai'vhanel the owl circles east of them. The two tablets lie in the ruins; a Beached Sea Turtle lies on the shore west of them."] = "哨兵坦莎·月刃位于废墟的北边缘。被诅咒的水兵，蠕行与哀嚎的贵族出没它们；安娜雅·晨路的幽灵步行在其中：它们，贾瓦内尔猫头鹰法阵在它们东面。2石板位于废墟中；一个搁浅的海龟位于岸边在它们西面。",
	["Sentinel Velene Starstrike"] = "哨兵维尔莉妮·星坠",
	["Sentinel Velene Starstrike stands at the Silverwind Refuge on the east shore of Mystral Lake; Alonso camps on its west shore. Befouled Water Elementals wade in the lake between them."] = "哨兵维尔莉妮·星坠位于赛顿·银风营地在密斯特拉湖的东岸；阿隆索扎营在它的西岸边。污浊的水元素涉水在湖之间它们。",
	["Serge Hinott"] = "瑟尔格·希诺特",
	["Serge Hinott in Tarren Mill teaches Poisons: keep it"] = "瑟尔格·希诺特在塔伦米尔传授毒药：请保留该任务/物品",
	["Serge Hinott: Poisons"] = "瑟尔格·希诺特：毒药",
	["Sergeant Yohwa"] = "尤瓦中士",
	["Sergra Darkthorn"] = "瑟格拉·黑棘",
	["Sessaria Skystride"] = "塞萨莉亚·天行",
	["Sessaria Skystride stands on Valanaar's west side."] = "塞萨莉亚·天行位于瓦拉纳尔的西一侧。",
	["Sessaria Skystride: Searing Totem and your Fire Totem"] = "塞萨莉亚·天行：灼热图腾与你的火焰图腾",
	["Sewer Beast"] = "下水道野兽",
	["Shadow Hold is the cave at the back of Jaedenar, west of the road. Use the Purified Moonwell Water on the four braziers inside. Kill the Angerclaw bears and Felpaw wolves you pass for the Silvery Claws."] = "暗影堡是洞穴在加德纳尔的后方，在道路以西。使用净化过的月亮井水在4火盆内部。击杀怒爪熊与魔爪狼你穿过给银爪。",
	["Shadow Hunter Knife"] = "暗影猎手的小刀",
	["Shadow Lord Fel'dan"] = "暗影领主费尔丹",
	["Shadow Priest Allister"] = "暗影牧师奥利斯特",
	["Shadow Priest Sarvis"] = "暗影牧师萨维斯",
	["Shadow Priest Sarvis: the scroll for Aramis"] = "暗影牧师萨维斯：卷轴给阿拉米斯·锤手",
	["Shadow Priestess Vandis"] = "暗影牧师范蒂丝",
	["Shadowfang Keep"] = "影牙城堡",
	["Shadowgem comes from Copper Vein nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "暗影石来自铜矿脉采集点（采矿）；此是最密集的簇在数据。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Shadowglen opens onto Teldrassil; Dolanaar is south along the road. Rut'theran Village, at the foot of the tree, is reached through the portal in Darnassus."] = "幽影谷通向泰达希尔；多兰纳尔是南沿着道路。鲁瑟兰村，在树的底部，是可抵达穿过传送门在达纳苏斯。",
	["Shadowhide Pendant: any Shadowhide gnoll"] = "暗皮坠饰：任意暗皮战士豺狼人",
	["Shadowmaw Panther"] = "深喉猎豹",
	["Shadowprey Village flight master"] = "葬影村飞行管理员",
	["Shadowvale is the hollow at the west edge of the glades. The Shadowvale Lurchers and Mystics drop the bones; the bottles lie on the ground among them, and the Glowing Crystal Fragment is at the south end."] = "影谷是山坳在林地的西边缘。影谷蹒跚者与秘法师雅尔金掉落骨头；瓶子位于领地在其中：它们，与发光的水晶碎片是在南尽头。",
	["Shadowy Assassin"] = "暗影刺客",
	["Shadumbra, a shadow panther, stalks the woods around Raynewood Retreat, west of the Felmusk camp. Her head starts the next hunt quest."] = "萨杜布拉，一个暗影豹，潜伏树林在林中树居周围，在魔麝营地以西。她的前往始于下一个狩猎任务。",
	["Shakes O'Breen"] = "沙克斯·奥布里",
	["Shallow Grave, just east of the keep"] = "浅墓穴，就在保留以东",
	["Shanda, inside the tree"] = "珊达，在树内",
	["Shandris Feathermoon"] = "珊蒂斯·羽月",
	["Shandris Feathermoon, beside him"] = "珊蒂斯·羽月，旁边他",
	["Shandris then asks you to carry news to Darnassus: skip it, Gadgetzan sends you there instead."] = "珊蒂斯·羽月然后要求你携带消息前往达纳苏斯：跳过即可，加基森派往你那里代替。",
	["Shari Stilwell"] = "莎莉·斯蒂尔维尔",
	["Shari Stilwell trains Paladins in Brill, a short walk north up the road from the zeppelin towers. Come back down the same road for Silverpine."] = "莎莉·斯蒂尔维尔训练圣骑士在布瑞尔，一个不足步行北顺着道路往上来自飞艇哨塔。来到返回下相同道路给银松森林。",
	["Sharptalon, a big nightsaber, prowls the woods south-east of the Warsong lumber camp. Her claw starts the next hunt quest."] = "沙普塔隆，一个大夜刃豹，潜行游荡树林东南的战歌信使伐木场营地。她的爪始于下一个狩猎任务。",
	["Shattered Sword of Marduk"] = "马杜克的破碎之剑",
	["Shay wanders the hills north of Rockbiter, among the Northspring harpies; her bell is in the chest beside her."] = "沙恩·飘叶游荡丘陵在罗克比特以北，在其中：北泉鹰身女妖；她的钟是在箱子旁边她的。",
	["Shay's Bell"] = "沙恩的铃铛",
	["She sits inside the farmhouse."] = "她位于农舍内。",
	["She stands by her cart at the vineyard east of the Abbey."] = "她站在旁边：她的推车在葡萄园在修道院以东。",
	["She stands outside the mine entrance. Shinyfinder Narf, inside, is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "她位于采矿入口外。寻宝者纳夫，内部，为精英：建议组队前往。",
	["Shelene Rhobart"] = "舍伦尼·洛巴尔特",
	["Shellei Brondir"] = "谢尔雷·布隆迪尔",
	["Shellei Brondir, Menethil Harbor"] = "谢尔雷·布隆迪尔，米奈希尔港",
	["Shen'dralas, the ruins between Desolace and Mulgore, is entered from southern Desolace through the Valley of Bones."] = "辛德拉拉斯，废墟在凄凉之地与莫高雷之间，是进入来自南部凄凉之地穿过白骨之谷。",
	["Shenthul stands in the Cleft of Shadow. Target him and type /salute to finish The Shattered Salute."] = "申苏尔位于暗影裂口。目标他与类型 /敬礼前往完成碎手军礼。",
	["Shenthul, Cleft of Shadow"] = "申苏尔，暗影裂口",
	["Shimmerweed bushes grow on the hills around Brewnall Village."] = "微光草灌木生长在丘陵在烈酒村周围。",
	["Shindrell Swiftfire"] = "辛德瑞尔·速火",
	["Shiny Junk"] = "闪亮的垃圾",
	["Shinyfinder Narf"] = "寻宝者纳夫",
	["Shizzle"] = "希兹尔",
	["Shizzle, at the refuge entrance"] = "希兹尔，在营地入口",
	["Shore Striders, Deep Striders and Wave Striders (elite giants) wade along the coast north of the dock: zap one with Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker and kill the shrunken giant. Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays drift in the same surf."] = "海岸巨人，深海巨人与波涛巨人（精英巨人）涉水沿着海岸在码头以北：电击1与索尔宾的超级压缩器与击杀缩小的巨型。海元素与巨型海元素漂浮在相同浪花。",
	["Short of level 54 after the yetis? Running the Sunken Temple (50-54) instead of grinding gets you there faster in a group. Come back to Everlook afterwards."] = "不足的54级之后雪人? 刷沉没的神庙（50-54）代替的刷怪使你达到你那里更快组队情况下。来到返回前往永望镇随后。",
	["Shriekling Matriarch's Head"] = "尖啸鸟主母的头颅",
	["Shrine Bauble, from a Bauble Container in the lake"] = "神殿灵珠，来自一个饰物容器在湖",
	["Shylenai"] = "夏琳奈尔",
	["Shylenai sells three owls in Darnassus (50s each); the Eagle Owl is new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "夏琳奈尔出售3猫头鹰在达纳苏斯（50银每个）；雕鸮是新在无限服。每个宠物物品传授它的伙伴当你使用它；目标留在勾选随后。",
	["Shyn"] = "夏恩",
	["Sida"] = "塞达",
	["Sida's Bag"] = "塞达的背包",
	["Sign of the Earth"] = "大地印章",
	["Sigrun Ironhew"] = "西格鲁·铁斧",
	["Silithus is west of Un'Goro Crater. Cenarion Hold is neutral."] = "希利苏斯是在安戈洛环形山以西。塞纳里奥要塞是中立。",
	["Silithyst geysers erupt across the southern desert. Walk into the Silithyst one leaves behind and carry it to the Horde's Silithyst Extractor at Kirika's camp; fighting or mounting drops it."] = "水晶尘间歇泉喷发穿过南部沙漠。步行进入水晶尘1离开后面与携带它前往部落的水晶尘提取器在吉里卡将军的营地；战斗或骑乘掉落它。",
	["Silk Bandage is yellow from 150 (yellow at 150, grey at 210): about 42 crafts to 180. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "丝质绷带是黄色来自150（黄色在150，灰色在210）：约42制作前往180。绷带需要无营火：制作它们任何地方。",
	["Silk Cloth"] = "丝绸",
	["Silt Crawler (level 40-41) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "淤泥蟹（40-41级）掉落它此处。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Silver Dawning's Lockbox"] = "银色清晨号的保险箱",
	["Silverpine Forest is south of Tirisfal Glades: follow the road south from Brill."] = "银松森林是在提瑞斯法林地以南：沿着道路前往南来自布瑞尔。",
	["Silverpine's road north leads into Tirisfal Glades. Brill, Deathknell and the Undercity ruins are Horde ground."] = "银松森林的道路北通往进入提瑞斯法林地。布瑞尔，丧钟镇与幽暗城废墟是部落领地。",
	["Sin'Dall, a level 37 tiger, prowls the hilltop south-west of the camp."] = "辛达尔，一个37级虎，潜行游荡山顶在营地以西南。",
	["Sin'Dall, the great tiger, lairs on the hilltop south-west of the camp; Lashtail Raptors run south of it, along the way to Booty Bay."] = "辛达尔，巨型虎，巢穴在山顶在营地以西南；鞭尾迅猛龙前往在它南面，沿途前往藏宝海湾。",
	["Singed Letter"] = "烧焦的信件",
	["Singing Blue Crystal"] = "蓝色歌唱水晶",
	["Singing Crystal Shard"] = "歌唱水晶碎片",
	["Sir S. J. Erlgadin"] = "埃尔加丁爵士",
	["Sirra Von'Indi"] = "希拉·沃宁迪",
	["Sirra Von'Indi, in the house behind the town hall"] = "希拉·沃宁迪，在房屋在城镇大厅后面",
	["Sister Aquinne"] = "艾奎恩妮",
	["Sit (/sit) by his campfire until you have Boosted Rest"] = "坐（/坐）在旁他的营火直到你有强化休息",
	["Sit by Eric's campfire (type /sit) and wait for the buff, then Gremlock Pilsnor in the distillery teaches you cooking."] = "坐在旁艾瑞克的营火（类型 /坐）与等待给增益，然后格雷姆罗克·匹斯诺尔在酿酒厂传授你烹饪。",
	["Sixty Wool Cloth, if you carry them"] = "60毛料，如果你携带它们",
	["Skeletal Fiend"] = "骸骨魔",
	["Skeletal Flayer"] = "骷髅剥皮者",
	["Skeletal Flayers and Slavering Ghouls roam the fields north of the camp; all the Scourge here drop Scourgestones."] = "骷髅剥皮者与被奴役的食尸鬼游荡于农田在营地以北；全部天灾军团此处掉落天灾石。",
	["Skeletal Fragments"] = "骸骨碎片",
	["Skeletal Healer"] = "骷髅医师",
	["Skeletal Horror"] = "恐怖骸骨",
	["Skeletal Horrors walk the hillside between Darkshire and the Tranquil Gardens Cemetery, south-east of town; they drop the Rot Blossoms."] = "恐怖骸骨步行山坡之间夜色镇与静谧花园墓场，在城镇东南面；它们掉落腐化之花。",
	["Skeletal Mage"] = "骷髅法师",
	["Skeletal Raider"] = "骷髅袭击者",
	["Skeletal Raiders, Healers and Warders hold the west part of the cemetery, just east of Sven's camp."] = "骷髅袭击者，治疗者与守卫要塞西部分的墓园，就在斯温·约根的以东营地。",
	["Skeletal Warder"] = "骷髅看守",
	["Skeletal Warrior"] = "骷髅战士",
	["Skeletal Warriors and Skeletal Mages walk among the graves south-east of Darkshire, below Blind Mary's house on the hill. Every skeleton in Duskwood can drop a Skeleton Finger."] = "骷髅战士与骷髅法师步行在其中：坟墓在夜色镇以东南，在盲眼玛丽的下方房屋在山丘。每个骷髅在暮色森林可以掉落一个骷髅的手指。",
	["Skeletal horses: Zachariah Post, beside Velma Warnam in Brill."] = "骷髅巫师马：撒迦利亚·普斯特，在维尔玛·瓦纳姆旁边在布瑞尔。",
	["Skeleton Finger"] = "骷髅的手指",
	["Skin Armored Scorpid, Bloodtalon Scythemaw, Bloodtalon Taillasher, Clattering Scorpid, Dire Mottled Boar, Dreadmaw Crocolisk, Durotar Tiger, Elder Mottled Boar, Thunder Lizard, Venomtail Scorpid here (beasts of level 5-20 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剥皮硬甲蝎，血爪锐齿龙，血爪鞭尾龙，巨钳蝎，可怕的杂斑野猪，巨齿鳄鱼，杜隆塔尔猛虎，老杂斑野猪，雷霆蜥蜴，毒尾蝎此处（野兽的5-20级产出它）；剥皮指南路线此。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Skin Ashenvale Bear, Elder Ashenvale Bear, Elder Shadowhorn Stag, Ghostpaw Runner, Giant Ashenvale Bear, Shadowhorn Stag here (beasts of level 18-30 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剥皮灰谷熊，老灰谷熊，老黑角鹿，幽爪奔跑者，灰谷巨熊，黑角鹿此处（野兽的18-30级产出它）；剥皮指南路线此。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Skin Cave Yeti, Elder Gray Bear, Gray Bear, Snapjaw here (beasts of level 18-30 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剥皮洞穴雪人，老灰熊，灰熊，钳嘴龟此处（野兽的18-30级产出它）；剥皮指南路线此。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Skin Cave Yeti, Ferocious Yeti, Giant Yeti, Hulking Mountain Lion, Mountain Lion, Mountain Yeti, Snapjaw here (beasts of level 28-40 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剥皮洞穴雪人，凶恶的雪人，巨型雪人，巨型山地狮，山地狮，山岭雪人，钳嘴龟此处（野兽的28-40级产出它）；剥皮指南路线此。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Skin Coralshell Tortoise, Mosshoof Stag, Thunderhead Consort, Thunderhead Patriarch, Thunderhead Skystormer, Thunderhead Stagwing here (beasts of level 48-60 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剥皮珊瑚海龟，苔蹄雄鹿，雷首角鹰雌兽，雷首角鹰雄兽，雷首天鸣者，雷首翼鹿此处（野兽的48-60级产出它）；剥皮指南路线此。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Skin Crag Boar, Elder Crag Boar, Ice Claw Bear, Juvenile Snow Leopard, Large Crag Boar, Scarred Crag Boar, Snow Leopard, Snow Tracker Wolf, Winter Wolf, Young Black Bear here (beasts of level 5-20 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剥皮峭壁野猪，老峭壁野猪，冰爪熊，雪豹幼崽，大峭壁野猪，有伤疤的峭壁野猪，雪豹，雪狼，冬狼，黑熊幼崽此处（野兽的5-20级产出它）；剥皮指南路线此。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Skin Diseased Black Bear, Diseased Grizzly, Diseased Wolf here (beasts of level 48-60 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剥皮生病的黑熊，生病的灰熊，生病的狼此处（野兽的48-60级产出它）；剥皮指南路线此。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Skin Elder Crag Coyote, Rabid Crag Coyote, Ridge Huntress, Ridge Stalker Patriarch here (beasts of level 38-50 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剥皮老峭壁山狗，疯狂的峭壁山狗，山脊雌豹，山脊雄豹此处（野兽的38-50级产出它）；剥皮指南路线此。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Skin Feral Scar Yeti, Frayfeather Hippogryph, Frayfeather Stagwing, Grizzled Ironfur Bear, Groddoc Ape, Groddoc Thunderer, Ironfur Bear, Ironfur Patriarch, Longtooth Howler, Longtooth Runner, Rabid Longtooth, Rage Scar Yeti here (beasts of level 38-50 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剥皮深痕雪人，乱羽角鹰兽，乱羽翼鹿，铁鬃灰熊，格罗多克猿人，格罗多克大猩猩，铁鬃熊，铁鬃熊王，长牙嚎叫者，长牙奔跑者，疯狂的长牙狼，狂暴的怒痕雪人此处（野兽的38-50级产出它）；剥皮指南路线此。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Skin Highperch Wyvern, Saltstone Basilisk, Scorpid Reaver, Scorpid Terror, Sparkleshell Snapper, Sparkleshell Tortoise here (beasts of level 28-40 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剥皮风巢双足飞龙，盐石蜥蜴，恐蝎劫掠者，恐蝎，盐壳钳嘴龟，盐壳龟此处（野兽的28-40级产出它）；剥皮指南路线此。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Skinned, disenchanted or crafted by another profession: gather them yourself or buy them on the Auction House."] = "剥皮的，分解的或制作的在旁另一个专业：采集它们你自己或购买它们在拍卖行。",
	["Skorn Whitecloud"] = "斯考恩·白云",
	["Skuerto"] = "斯奎尔图",
	["Skull Rock lies just north of the ravine. Gazz'uz hides at the back of the caves and drops the Eye of Burning Shadow."] = "骷髅石位于就在深谷以北。加祖兹藏身在洞穴与掉落的后方燃影之眼。",
	["Skull of Horgus"] = "霍古斯的颅骨",
	["Skullsplitter Fetish"] = "劈颅巨魔的神像",
	["Skullsplitter Tusk"] = "劈颅巨魔的獠牙",
	["Skyborne Portal to Stormwind"] = "通往暴风城的天裔传送门",
	["Skyborne start here. Everyone else takes a skyboat, about every five minutes; either faction may take either one."] = "天裔开始此处。所有人其他搭乘天舟，大约每5分钟一班；双方阵营均可搭乘任意一班。",
	["Skybreaker Bulwark: Zaal Stormshield, west of the shrine's approach"] = "破天壁垒：扎尔·风暴之盾，在神龛以西的靠近",
	["Skyhoppers hop about the fields just west of Valennia."] = "跳空者跳过约农田就在瓦伦妮娅·风暴之拳以西。",
	["Skyhoppers swarm the fields west of Valanaar."] = "跳空者虫群农田在瓦拉纳尔以西。",
	["Skypriest Aanders"] = "天空祭司安德斯",
	["Slab of Carrion Worm Meat"] = "食腐虫肉块",
	["Slavering Ghoul"] = "被奴役的食尸鬼",
	["Small Crag Boar"] = "小型峭壁野猪",
	["Small Crag Boars graze around Talin's camp and along the west side of the valley."] = "小型峭壁野猪吃草在塔林·锐眼的周围营地与沿着西一侧的山谷。",
	["Small Stone Shard"] = "小石头碎块",
	["Small lockboxes lie in the rubble all over Andorhal; each holds a watch."] = "小型锁箱位于碎石全部越过安多哈尔；每个持有一个守望。",
	["Smeed Scrabblescrew"] = "斯米德·瑟卡布斯库",
	["Smeed's camp is on the road south of Kolkar Village, by the Kodo Graveyard."] = "斯米德的营地是在路上在科尔卡村以南，在旁科多兽坟场。",
	["Smith Regzar: More Booty!"] = "铁匠雷格萨：取之于敌",
	["Smith Slagtree"] = "铁匠斯拉提",
	["Smithing Tuyere"] = "冶炼鼓风机",
	["Smolderweb Carrier"] = "烟网蜘蛛笼",
	["Snapjaw Crocolisk Skin"] = "钳嘴鳄鱼的皮",
	["Snapjaw Crocolisks bask on the shore and islands along the coast north of Booty Bay."] = "钳嘴鳄鱼晒太阳在岸边与群岛沿着海岸在藏宝海湾以北。",
	["Snellig's Snuffbox: First Mate Snellig"] = "斯涅利格的鼻烟盒：大副斯涅利格",
	["Snickerfang Jowl"] = "弯牙土狼的颚骨",
	["Snow Leopard"] = "雪豹",
	["Snow Leopard: tame it with the Taming Rod"] = "雪豹：驯服它与驯兽棒",
	["Snow Leopards and boars roam the snow between the ranch and the quarry. Blacksmiths: Copper Bars come from smelting Copper Ore or the trade vendors."] = "雪豹与野猪游荡于雪在牧场与采石场之间。铁匠：铜锭来自熔炼铜矿石或商业商人。",
	["Snuff"] = "鼻烟",
	["Soft Dirt Mound"] = "软土堆",
	["Solarsal Gazebo"] = "索兰萨尔了望台",
	["Solid Stone comes from Mithril Deposit nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "坚固的石头来自秘银矿脉采集点（采矿）；此是最密集的簇在数据。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Somatic Intensifier"] = "细胞增强剂",
	["Soothing Spices, for \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl"] = "舒心草，给 \"沼泽之眼\"加尔",
	["Soothing Spices, for \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl in Dustwallow Marsh"] = "舒心草，给 \"沼泽之眼\"加尔在尘泥沼泽",
	["Soothing Spices, from Micha Yance"] = "舒心草，来自米沙·杨斯",
	["Sorek"] = "索瑞克",
	["Sorek, Valley of Honor"] = "索瑞克，荣誉谷",
	["Sorrow Spinner"] = "沼泽纺丝蛛",
	["South along the coast, the Southsea pirates hold the cove. Andre Firebeard and the stolen cargo are on the docks at its far end. Any pirate can drop a hat, the kidnappers most often."] = "南沿着海岸，南海流氓海盗要塞小湾。安德雷·费尔比德与被盗的货物是在码头上在它的远处尽头。任意海盗可以掉落一个帽子，绑架者大多数经常。",
	["South down the road again."] = "南顺着道路再次。",
	["South down the road to the Maclure Vineyards."] = "南顺着道路前往马科伦农场。",
	["South of Booty Bay the Bloodsail swashbucklers camp on the Wild Shore; the charts and the orders lie in their tents. Any Bloodsail can carry snuff and Dizzy's eye, so keep killing until you have both."] = "在藏宝海湾以南血帆剑客营地在狂野海岸；海图与命令位于它们的帐篷。任意血帆可以携带熄灭与独眼迪兹的眼睛，因此保留击杀直到你有两个。",
	["South of Camp Taurajo the Silithid Mounds dot the Field of Giants; the eggs lie in them, and Silithid Swarmers come out to defend them. Silithid Harvesters are rare: if you see one, kill it for its head."] = "在陶拉祖营地以南异种虫土堆持续伤害巨人旷野；蛋位于它们，与异种群居蝎来到出前往保卫它们。异种收割者是稀有：如果你查看1，击杀它给它的前往。",
	["South of Darkcloud, the harpies of Roguefeather Den. Grenka Bloodscreech (31) walks among them: thin out the harpies around her before you pull her."] = "南的暗云，鹰身人的飞羽洞穴。格林卡·血啸（31）步行在其中：它们：狭窄/薄出鹰身人周围她的之前你拉怪她的。",
	["South of Gann, the Bael'dun dwarves dig at Bael Modan. Excavators and Foremen work the pit; Prospector Khazgorm (26) carries the journal: pull him alone."] = "在加恩·石塔以南，巴尔丹矮人挖掘在巴尔莫丹。暗滩挖掘者与工头有效深坑；勘察员卡兹戈姆（26）携带日记：拉怪他独自。",
	["South of Zenn. Denalan tends his saplings on the shore; Lasher Sproutlings and Timberlings wander around him, and the Timberling Sprouts grow among them."] = "在赛恩·腐蹄以南。德纳兰照看他的树苗在岸边；玛诺洛克鞭笞者嫩芽幼体与林精游荡周围他，与林精的新芽生长在其中：它们。",
	["South of the Noxious Lair the Dunemaul ogres hold their compound, with Gor'marok the Ravager at its eastern end. Dig up Gahz'ridian ornaments between the fights."] = "南的剧毒之巢砂槌食人魔要塞它们的营区，与掠夺者格玛洛克在它的东部尽头。挖掘上加兹瑞迪安饰物之间战斗。",
	["South of the hot springs, Stegodons graze and Dinosaur Bones drop from them or lie on the ground; Diemetradons nearby carry the scales Shizzle wants. Ravasaurs hunt in packs in the south-west: their claws are for Jes'rimon, and now and then one carries a Mangled Journal (a rare drop: take its quest only if you get one). Avoid Gruff, a level 57 Stegodon."] = "在热温泉以南，剑龙吃草与恐龙骨头掉落来自它们或位于领地；双帆龙附近携带鳞片希兹尔需要。暴掠龙狩猎在怪群在西南面：它们的爪是给杰斯雷蒙，与现在与然后1携带一个残破的日记（稀有掉落：接取它的任务仅如果你获取1）。避开格鲁夫，一个57级剑龙。",
	["South of the lodge the Witherbark trolls hold their villages. Every one of them carries a skull: with twenty, use Nimboya's Pike to make the Laden Pike, then plant it inside the village."] = "在旅舍以南枯木巨魔要塞它们的村庄。每个1的它们携带一个头颅：与20，使用尼姆布亚之矛前往制作满载的长矛，然后植物它在村庄内。",
	["South of the murlocs, Therysil waits at the Shrine of Aessina."] = "在鱼人以南，瑟瑞希尔等候于艾希娜神殿。",
	["South of the pools. The Strange Fruited Plant grows by the Hold."] = "在水池以南。奇怪的果树生长在旁要塞。",
	["South of the vale the Frayfeather hippogryphs roost on the slopes; nearly every one drops sinew and metallic fragments."] = "在山谷以南羽须角鹰兽栖木在山坡；接近每个1掉落肌腱与金属碎片。",
	["South to Regthar's watch post on the Kolkar border."] = "南前往雷戈萨·死门的守望岗哨在科卡尔边界。",
	["South to the Sanctuary once more."] = "南前往圣地一次更多。",
	["South-east along the loch to the dig site."] = "东南沿着湖前往挖掘地点。",
	["South-east down the road to Ambermill. Protectors guard the outskirts and Mages the town; both drop pendants. Wizards and Watchers patrol the roads around it. Stay out of the middle, where Archmage Ataeric stands."] = "东南顺着道路前往安伯米尔。保卫者守卫外围与法师城镇；两个掉落挂坠。巫师与守夜人道茨巡逻于道路周围它。留在离开中间，在大法师阿塔瑞克位于。",
	["South-east of Dolanaar, to Denalan. Lasher Sproutlings wander around him on the shore."] = "在多兰纳尔以东南，前往德纳兰。玛诺洛克鞭笞者嫩芽幼体游荡周围他在岸边。",
	["South-east of Gadgetzan the Wastewander bandits camp in the dunes; Caliph stands in the eastern camp."] = "在加基森以东南废土漫游者强盗扎营于沙丘；卡利夫位于东部营地。",
	["South-east of the Crossroads. Test the seeds at the bubbling fissure on the oasis' east bank."] = "东南的十字路口。测试种子在冒泡的裂隙在绿洲的东银行。",
	["South-west again, the exile hides by the ruins of Shadra'Alor."] = "西南再次，流放者藏身在旁废墟的沙德拉洛。",
	["South-west of Bael Modan, Grish Longrunner waits at the top of the Great Lift."] = "在巴尔莫丹以西南，瑞什·远行者等候于顶部的升降梯。",
	["South-west of Durnholde, the Mudsnout Blossoms grow on the hillsides above the river."] = "在敦霍尔德以西南，泥头花生长在山坡在河流上方。",
	["South-west of Sun Rock lies the burned Charred Vale. Plant the Gaea Seeds in the dirt mounds on the valley floor; the fire elementals drop Incendrites. Bloodfury Harpies and Ambushers nest on the north side, Slayers and Roguefeathers to the south."] = "在烈日石居以西南位于烧焦的焦炭谷。植物盖亚种子在泥土土堆在山谷楼层；营火元素掉落焚火余烬。血怒鹰身人与邪枝伏击者巢在北一侧，黑石杀戮者与狂羽向南。",
	["South-west of the barrow. The moonwell sits by the pools."] = "在兽穴以西南。月亮井位于水池。",
	["South-west to the Kirin Tor camp on the lake shore west of Dalaran: the Image of Archmage Modera stands there. Archmage Ansirem stands south-east of it, by the dome."] = "西南前往肯瑞托营地在湖岸边在达拉然以西：大法师莫德拉的影像位于那里。大法师大法师安斯雷姆·鲁因维沃尔位于它东南面，在旁穹顶。",
	["South-west, the Cave and Ferocious Yetis (30-31) fill the caves in the hills west of Tarren Mill; about one in sixteen carries the rod."] = "西南，洞穴与凶恶的雪人（30-31）装满洞穴在丘陵在塔伦米尔以西；约1在16携带魔杖。",
	["South-west, the Silvermane Howlers roam the hills east of the Witherbark villages."] = "西南，银鬃嗥叫者游荡于丘陵东的枯木村庄。",
	["South-west, the yetis den in Feral Scar Vale; every yeti there can drop a thick hide."] = "西南，雪人兽穴在深痕谷；每个雪人那里可以掉落一个密集兽皮。",
	["Southsea Dock Worker"] = "南海码头工人",
	["Southsea Freebooter"] = "南海劫掠者",
	["Southsea Pirate"] = "南海海盗",
	["Southsea Pirate Hat"] = "南海海盗帽",
	["Southsea Swashbuckler"] = "南海流氓",
	["Southshore Stout, for Henchman Valik"] = "南海镇烈酒，给仆从瓦里克",
	["Spark Nilminer"] = "斯巴克·尼米尔",
	["Speak with Jorel and Naaleos"] = "对话与乔雷尔与纳利奥斯",
	["Speak with Rathiril Sunlance and Coriella Calmbreeze, north-west of the village"] = "对话与拉希瑞尔·日枪与科瑞拉·静风，在村庄以西北",
	["Speak with Tomas"] = "对话与厨师托马斯",
	["Speak with Zarrin, south of the inn"] = "对话与扎瑞恩，在旅店以南",
	["Speak with the Great Bear Spirit"] = "对话与巨熊之灵",
	["Special Chicken Feed, from Farmer Saldean"] = "特殊的鸡饲料，来自农夫萨丁",
	["Spigot Operator Luglunket"] = "操作员鲁格伦克",
	["Spigot Operator Luglunket, next to him"] = "操作员鲁格伦克，下一个前往他",
	["Spiked Collar: Redridge Thrashers"] = "尖刺项圈：赤脊山鞭笞者",
	["Splintertree Post is just north up the road."] = "碎木岗哨是就在北顺着道路往上。",
	["Spotted Sunfish"] = "斑点太阳鱼",
	["Spraggle Frock"] = "斯普拉格·弗劳克",
	["Spraggle's friend Ringo has gone missing."] = "斯普拉格·弗劳克的朋友林格有耗尽失踪的。",
	["Sprinkle"] = "斯普琳科",
	["Sprinkle's next ingredient grows in the Hinterlands, and the route never brings it back: skip it."] = "斯普琳科的下一个材料生长在辛特兰，与路线从不携带它返回：跳过即可。",
	["Sprite Jumpsprocket, Dwarven District"] = "斯普莱特，矮人区",
	["Sprouted Frond, beside him"] = "发芽的树叶，旁边他",
	["Sputtervalve"] = "斯布特瓦夫",
	["Sputtervalve in Ratchet: later, on the way"] = "斯布特瓦夫在棘齿城：稍后，在途中",
	["Sputtervalve in Ratchet: the next guide passes there"] = "斯布特瓦夫在棘齿城：下一个指南经过那里",
	["Sputtervalve, by the docks in Ratchet"] = "斯布特瓦夫，在旁码头在棘齿城",
	["Sputtervalve. Keep it: Ziz Fizziks is in Stonetalon, later"] = "斯布特瓦夫。请保留该任务/物品：菲兹克斯是在石爪山脉，稍后",
	["Sputtervalve: the console is in the Sludge Fen, later"] = "斯布特瓦夫：控制台是在淤泥沼泽，稍后",
	["Stand with Aamelia against Ferauu the Bludgeon"] = "位于与阿米莉亚·风野迎战重槌费劳",
	["Stanley is Farmer Ray's dog, at the northern farmhouse in Hillsbrad Fields."] = "斯坦雷是农夫雷恩的狗，在北部农舍在希尔斯布莱德农场。",
	["Starts in Tanaris, south of Dustwallow Marsh. The last area of this guide completes the Kalimdor map. 20 areas to discover here, levels 40-50."] = "始于塔纳利斯，在尘泥沼泽以南。最后区域的此指南完成卡利姆多地图。20区域前往探索发现此处，40-50级。",
	["Starts where the 30-45 guide ends, in the Swamp of Sorrows. The last area of this guide completes the Eastern Kingdoms map. 9 areas to discover here, levels 46-63."] = "始于在30-45指南结束，在悲伤沼泽。最后区域的此指南完成东部王国地图。9区域前往探索发现此处，46-63级。",
	["Starving Dire Wolf"] = "饥饿的恐狼",
	["Starving Snickerfangs roam the dry hills just south of the camp; Scorpok Stingers (level 50) scuttle across the middle of the north. Black Slayer vultures circle over all of it. Pull one at a time."] = "饥饿的弯牙土狼游荡于干涸丘陵就在营地以南；厚甲毒刺蝎（50级）爬行穿过中间的北。黑色屠戮者秃鹫法阵越过全部的它。拉怪1在一个时间。",
	["Stay stealthed: Foreman Silixiz carries the key to the tower; Gallywix and his lockbox are at the top. Gallywix is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "留在潜行的：工头希里克斯携带钥匙前往哨塔；加里维克斯与他的锁箱是在顶部。加里维克斯为精英：建议组队前往。",
	["Stay with Kinelory while she sneaks into Go'Shek Farm and back; Horde orcs jump you on the way."] = "留在与基恩洛当她潜行进入格沙克农场与返回；部落兽人跳下你在途中。",
	["Steelgrill's Depot is just east of Kharanos; Binjy Featherwhistle stands beside Milli Featherwhistle's mechanostriders. At 40 Binjy Featherwhistle teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Alliance race ride these."] = "钢架补给站是就在卡拉诺斯以东；宾吉·羽哨位于米利·羽哨的旁边机械陆行鸟。在40宾吉·羽哨传授骑术（100金每暴雪的设计师），与学习它给你一个坐骑。无限服客户端允许每个联盟种族骑行这些。",
	["Steelgrill's Depot is just east of Kharanos; Binjy Featherwhistle stands beside Milli Featherwhistle's mechanostriders. At 60 Binjy Featherwhistle teaches Journeyman Riding (1,000g per Blizzard's designers); Blizzard says learning riding grants a mount. The Forever client sells each swift mechanostrider for 200g at level 60."] = "钢架补给站是就在卡拉诺斯以东；宾吉·羽哨位于米利·羽哨的旁边机械陆行鸟。在60宾吉·羽哨传授中级骑术（1,000金每暴雪的设计师）；暴雪说学习骑行奖励一匹坐骑。无限服客户端出售每个迅捷机械陆行鸟给200金在60级。",
	["Sten Stoutarm"] = "斯登·粗臂",
	["Step into the cave: Kernda and Meilosh stand just inside."] = "步骤进入洞穴：克尔达与梅罗什位于就在内部。",
	["Step through the portal into Darnassus. The Temple of the Moon is in the south of the city."] = "步骤穿过传送门进入达纳苏斯。月神殿是在主城以南。",
	["Stephanie Turner, Old Town"] = "斯蒂芬妮·特纳，旧城区",
	["Stinky waits west of the manor, in the marsh below North Point Tower. Lead him to his Bogbean leaves and keep the swamp creatures off him."] = "斯汀基等候在庄园以西，在沼泽在北点哨塔下方。引导他前往他的泽豆离开与保留沼泽生物偏离/关闭他。",
	["Stolen Books"] = "被盗的书籍",
	["Stolen Enchanting Supplies"] = "被盗的附魔物资",
	["Stoley"] = "斯杜雷",
	["Stoley's Shipment"] = "斯杜雷的货物",
	["Stoley's next delivery goes back to Booty Bay: skip it."] = "斯杜雷的下一个递送物交回给藏宝海湾：跳过即可。",
	["Stoley, in the port's tavern"] = "斯杜雷，在港口的酒馆",
	["Stonard is the Horde town."] = "斯通纳德是部落城镇。",
	["Stone Circle"] = "石环",
	["Stone of Inner Binding"] = "内禁锢之石",
	["Stone of the Tides"] = "海潮之石",
	["Stonelash Flayer Stinger"] = "石鞭掠夺者之刺",
	["Stonelash Flayers and Rock Stalkers roam the dunes south-west of Kirika's camp."] = "石鞭掠夺者与石行蜘蛛游荡于沙丘在吉里卡将军的以西南营地。",
	["Stonelash Pincer Stinger"] = "石鞭巨钳蝎之刺",
	["Stonelash Scorpid Stinger"] = "石鞭蝎之刺",
	["Stonesplinter Seers (level 13) stand among the troggs in the south of Stonesplinter Valley, south of Braldir; Tunnel Rat Geomancers (level 12) work the Silver Stream Mine at the north end of the loch. The troggs come in packs and some throw from range: pull one at a time."] = "碎石怪先知（13级）位于其中：穴居人在碎石怪之谷以南，在布拉尔迪尔·灰袍以南；坑道鼠地卜师（12级）有效银泉矿洞在湖的北端。穴居人来到在怪群与一些投掷来自范围：拉怪1在一个时间。",
	["Stonetusk Boars graze between the vineyards and the farm."] = "石牙野猪吃草在葡萄园与农场之间。",
	["Stonevault Bonesnapper"] = "石窟断骨者",
	["Stormapples and flutterfly dust lie all over the orchard; Hungry Bandits raid it. Galestriders graze in the fields east of it. The broken construct floats at the orchard's north edge."] = "风暴苹果与彩蝶粉尘位于全部越过果园；饥饿的强盗团队副本它。疾风陆行鸟吃草在农田在它东面。损坏的构造体漂浮在果园的北边缘。",
	["Stormhide, on the plain between Gann and the ridge"] = "雷鳞蜥蜴，在平原在加恩·石塔与山脊之间",
	["Stormpike Quartermaster: Irondeep and Coldtooth Supplies from the mines"] = "雷矛军需官：铁深矿洞与冷齿补给品来自矿洞",
	["Stormwind has no shaman trainer"] = "暴风城有无萨满祭司训练师",
	["Stormwind has no shaman trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge and train with Eldrun Stormbreaker. Gryth Thurden in the Great Forge flies to Southshore too."] = "暴风城有无萨满祭司训练师：接取矿道地铁来自矮人区前往铁炉堡与训练与埃尔德伦·破风者。格莱斯·瑟登在大锻炉飞往前往南海镇也。",
	["Stormwind has no shaman trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge and train your level 60 spells with Eldrun Stormbreaker."] = "暴风城有无萨满祭司训练师：接取矿道地铁来自矮人区前往铁炉堡与训练你的60级法术与埃尔德伦·破风者。",
	["Stormwind has no shaman trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge, train with Eldrun Stormbreaker, then ride the tram back for the Auberdine boat."] = "暴风城有无萨满祭司训练师：接取矿道地铁来自矮人区前往铁炉堡，训练与埃尔德伦·破风者，然后骑行地铁返回给奥伯丁船。",
	["Stormwind has no shaman trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge, train with Eldrun Stormbreaker, then ride the tram back."] = "暴风城有无萨满祭司训练师：接取矿道地铁来自矮人区前往铁炉堡，训练与埃尔德伦·破风者，然后骑行地铁返回。",
	["Strahad Farsan"] = "斯坦哈德·法尔杉",
	["Strahad Farsan: Summon Felhunter"] = "斯坦哈德·法尔杉：召唤地狱猎犬",
	["Strahad stands on the hill in Ratchet. Use the Tome of the Cabal on the summoning circle beside him and defeat the felhunter to bind it."] = "斯坦哈德·法尔杉位于山丘在棘齿城。使用阴谋之书在召唤法阵旁边他与击败地狱猎犬前往绑定它。",
	["Strange Fronded Plant"] = "奇怪的树木",
	["Strange Fruited Plant"] = "奇怪的果树",
	["Strange Hermit"] = "奇怪的隐士",
	["Stranglethorn Raptor"] = "荆棘谷迅猛龙",
	["Stranglethorn Tiger"] = "荆棘谷猛虎",
	["Stranglethorn Tigers and Panthers (32-33) roam the hills east of the camp, along the lake shore."] = "荆棘谷猛虎与豹（32-33）游荡于丘陵在营地以东，沿着湖岸边。",
	["Stratholme is a group of five, level 58-60. The Service Entrance at Elders' Square, in north-western Eastern Plaguelands, leads to the undead side; Baron Rivendare waits in the Slaughter House at its end. Our data gives the reins a 0.02% drop chance (pfQuest, Era): one in about five thousand kills. Nothing shows Forever changing it."] = "斯坦索姆是一个队伍的5，58-60级。服务入口在长者的广场，在北-西部东瘟疫之地，通往亡灵一侧；瑞文戴尔男爵等候于屠宰场房屋在它的尽头。我们的数据给予缰绳一个0.02%掉落几率（pfQuest，旧世）：1在约5 1000击杀。无奖励显示无限服更换它。",
	["Stratholme, Live side"] = "斯坦索姆，实测一侧",
	["Stratholme, Undead side"] = "斯坦索姆，亡灵一侧",
	["Strider Clutchmother"] = "雌性森林陆行鸟",
	["Strider Stew is orange from 50 (yellow at 90, grey at 130): about 52 crafts to 100. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "炖陆行鸟是橙色来自50（黄色在90，灰色在130）：约52制作前往100。烹饪在任意营火：基础营火来自与烹饪。",
	["Strigid Owl Feather"] = "巨翼枭的羽毛",
	["Strigid Screecher: tame it with the Taming Rod"] = "巨翼恶枭：驯服它与驯兽棒",
	["Stringy Vulture Meat: Fleshrippers"] = "秃鹫肉条：碎尸鸟",
	["Strong Troll's Blood Potion: auction house or an alchemist, for Elixir of Agony."] = "强力巨魔之血药水：拍卖房屋或一个炼金师，给苦楚药剂。",
	["Subdue the succubus"] = "制服魅魔",
	["Subdue the voidwalker"] = "制服虚空行者",
	["Sulhasa"] = "苏哈萨",
	["Sulhasa, up in the tree just east of Gann"] = "苏哈萨，上在树就在加恩·石塔以东",
	["Summon Succubus"] = "召唤魅魔",
	["Summon Voidwalker"] = "召唤虚空行者",
	["Sundried Driftwood"] = "晒干的流木",
	["Sunken Temple"] = "沉没的神庙",
	["Sunscale Scytheclaws hunt the plains south of the Crossroads, around the Raptor Grounds; they drop the horns. Hand them in on your next pass through Ratchet."] = "赤鳞镰爪龙狩猎平原南的十字路口，周围迅猛龙巢穴；它们掉落角。上交它们在你的下一个穿过穿过棘齿城。",
	["Super Reaper 6000 Blueprints"] = "超级收割机6000型的设计图",
	["Super Sticky Tar"] = "极度粘稠的沥青",
	["Supervisor Raelen"] = "管理员莱琳",
	["Supply Crate"] = "补给箱",
	["Surena's Choker: Surena Caledon"] = "苏伦娜的项圈：苏伦娜·凯尔东",
	["Surf Glider (level 48-50) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "海浪龟（48-50级）掉落它此处。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Suspicious Industrial Supplies, from the crates around Moonbrook"] = "可疑的工业物资，来自木箱在月溪镇周围",
	["Sven Yorgen"] = "斯温·约根",
	["Swamp Jaguar"] = "沼泽虎",
	["Swamp Jaguar (level 36-37) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "沼泽虎（36-37级）掉落它此处。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Swart"] = "斯瓦特",
	["Swift Blue Raptor, 200g"] = "迅捷蓝色迅猛龙，200金",
	["Swift Brown Ram, 200g"] = "迅捷棕山羊，200金",
	["Swift Brown Steed, 200g"] = "迅捷棕马，200金",
	["Swift Galestriders need level 60 and Journeyman Riding from a riding trainer of your faction; see the Level 60 mount guides for where."] = "赫格拉姆疾风陆行鸟需要60级与中级骑术来自一个骑术训练师的你的阵营；查看等级60坐骑指南给在。",
	["Swift Gray Ram, 200g"] = "迅捷灰山羊，200金",
	["Swift Green Mechanostrider, 200g"] = "迅捷绿色机械陆行鸟，200金",
	["Swift Olive Raptor, 200g"] = "迅捷绿色迅猛龙，200金",
	["Swift Orange Raptor, 200g"] = "迅捷橙色迅猛龙，200金",
	["Swift Palomino, 200g"] = "迅捷褐色马，200金",
	["Swift White Mechanostrider, 200g"] = "迅捷白色机械陆行鸟，200金",
	["Swift White Ram, 200g"] = "迅捷白山羊，200金",
	["Swift White Steed, 200g"] = "迅捷白马，200金",
	["Swift Yellow Mechanostrider, 200g"] = "迅捷黄色机械陆行鸟，200金",
	["Swiftthistle comes from Briarthorn nodes (Herbalism); this is the densest patch in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "雨燕草来自石南草采集点（草药学）；此是最密集的区域在数据。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Swim back and follow the road west to the Sepulcher."] = "游泳返回与沿着道路前往西前往瑟伯切尔。",
	["Swim east from the bridge into Lake Everstill; the chest lies on the lake bed."] = "游泳东来自桥进入止水湖；箱子位于湖床。",
	["Swim south from the island to the Isle of Dread. Hatecrest Serpent Guards and Sorceresses hold it; Lord Shalzaru (level 47) waits in the cave at its south end. Pull his guards first."] = "游泳南来自岛屿前往恐怖之岛。憎世毒蛇守卫与女巫要塞它；沙尔扎鲁（47级）等候在洞穴内在它的南尽头。拉怪他的卫兵第一。",
	["Swim to the small island off the southern tip of Azshara: Pilot Xiggs Fuselighter waits by the monument."] = "游泳前往小型岛屿偏离/关闭南部尖端的艾萨拉：驾驶员西格斯·熔光等候于纪念碑。",
	["Swoops glide over the plains all around Bloodhoof."] = "猛鹫滑翔越过平原全部在血蹄周围。",
	["Syndicate Documents"] = "辛迪加文件",
	["Syndicate Footpad"] = "辛迪加劫匪",
	["Syndicate Highwayman"] = "辛迪加路霸",
	["Syndicate Mercenaries at Stromgarde (level 31-32) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "辛迪加雇佣兵在激流堡（31-32级）掉落它此处。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Syndicate Mercenary"] = "辛迪加雇佣兵",
	["Syndicate Thief"] = "辛迪加窃贼",
	["Syral Bladeleaf"] = "塞拉尔·刃叶",
	["Tablet of Ryun'eh"] = "雷乌纳石板",
	["Taelan's Hammer, from Mercutio Filthgorger"] = "泰兰之锤，来自米库提奥·污血",
	["Tai'jin, for Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar: keep it"] = "泰金，给乌尔库在奥格瑞玛：请保留该任务/物品",
	["Taiga Wisemane"] = "泰迦·慧鬃",
	["Tailoring runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 1g 12s in all."] = "裁缝可随升级同步练习升级。无限服传承系统奖励制作专业在技能等级150，225与300（中级，高级与大师级上限），因此以上每个阶段节点均计入进度。1-75阶段所需材料总计约需花费1金12银。",
	["Tajarri"] = "塔加里",
	["Tajarri, at the Shrine of Remulos"] = "塔加里，在雷姆洛斯神殿",
	["Takar the Seer"] = "先知塔卡尔",
	["Takata Steelblade"] = "塔卡塔·钢刃",
	["Takata's next Alliance Relations sends you back to Orgrimmar for nothing: leave it."] = "塔卡塔·钢刃的下一个联盟关系派往你返回前往奥格瑞玛给无奖励：可先放着不做。",
	["Takata's next errand sends you after a demon lord with an elite guard: skip it."] = "塔卡塔·钢刃的下一个差事派你去讨伐一个恶魔领主与一个精英守卫：跳过即可。",
	["Take a Box of Incendiaries from the crate next to Derrington for Scarlet Diversions, done on the way back. Equip the Argent Dawn Commission: Scourgestones only drop while you wear it."] = "接取一个燃烧弹箱来自木箱在高级执行官德灵顿旁边给误导血色十字军，完成在返回途中。装备银色黎明委任徽章：天灾石仅掉落当你佩戴它。",
	["Take the Deeprun Tram from Stormwind's Dwarven District to Ironforge (or fly to Ironforge), then leave the city through its gates."] = "接取矿道地铁来自暴风城的矮人区前往铁炉堡（或飞往前往铁炉堡），然后跳过主城穿过它的大门。",
	["Take the Deeprun Tram from Tinker Town to Stormwind's Dwarven District, then walk to the Cathedral Square."] = "接取矿道地铁来自工匠区前往暴风城的矮人区，然后步行前往大教堂广场。",
	["Take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge."] = "接取矿道地铁来自矮人区前往铁炉堡。",
	["Take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District. Roetten is in the Reclaimers' hall by the Hall of Explorers, Prospector Stormpike in the hall itself, Gerrig Bonegrip in the Forlorn Cavern. The next guide flies on to Thelsamar."] = "接取矿道地铁来自矮人区。罗顿·石锤是在夺回者的大厅在旁探险者大厅，勘察员塔伯斯·雷矛在大厅其本身，葛利·硬骨在荒弃的洞穴。下一个指南飞往在前往塞尔萨玛。",
	["Take the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge."] = "接取矿道地铁前往铁炉堡。",
	["Take the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge. Bubulo Acerbus and Mistina Steelshield each want sixty Wool, sixty Silk and sixty Mageweave, then sixty Runecloth: 120 of each in all, from your bags or the Auction House."] = "接取矿道地铁前往铁炉堡。巴巴罗·阿克巴斯与米斯蒂娜·钢盾每个需要60毛料，60丝绸与60魔纹布，然后60符文布：120的每个在全部，来自你的背包或拍卖行。",
	["Take the Orgrimmar zeppelin from the tower on the west side of Grom'gol and fly to Freewind Post. The Damaged Chest lies in the canyon north of the post."] = "接取奥格瑞玛飞艇来自哨塔在格罗姆高的西侧与飞往前往乱风岗。破损的箱子位于峡谷在岗哨以北。",
	["Take the Orgrimmar zeppelin from the tower on the west side of Grom'gol and fly to Ratchet. Islen Waterseer camps on the coast a short ride south of it."] = "接取奥格瑞玛飞艇来自哨塔在格罗姆高的西侧与飞往前往棘齿城。水之先知伊斯伦扎营在海岸边一个不足骑行在它南面。",
	["Take the Orgrimmar zeppelin from the tower on the west side of Grom'gol and train in the city before you fly on."] = "接取奥格瑞玛飞艇来自哨塔在格罗姆高的西侧与训练在主城之前你飞往在。",
	["Take the Orgrimmar zeppelin from the tower on the west side of Grom'gol."] = "接取奥格瑞玛飞艇来自哨塔在格罗姆高的西侧。",
	["Take the Timbermaw Hold tunnel from its Winterspring mouth, west of Donova, and follow the Moonglade branch to Nighthaven. Umber studies by the lake shore."] = "接取木喉要塞隧道来自它的冬泉谷入口/河口，在多诺瓦以西，与沿着月光林地树枝前往永夜港。阿姆伯尔研究在旁湖岸边。",
	["Take the Timbermaw Hold tunnel in northern Felwood through to Moonglade (druids: Teleport: Moonglade). Nighthaven is neutral."] = "接取木喉要塞隧道在北部费伍德森林穿过前往月光林地（德鲁伊：传送：月光林地）。永夜港是中立。",
	["Take the Torch of Dormant Flame to Olariaan Swiftburn at the Shrine of Flames, south-west of Valanaar in the Gustberry Lowlands."] = "接取休眠火炬加拉克烈焰守卫前往奥拉里安·疾燃在神龛的加拉克烈焰守卫，在瓦拉纳尔以西南在风莓低地。",
	["Take the beacon to OOX-09/HL at the head of the river near Skulk Rock, then escort it to the shore beyond Overlook Cliff."] = "接取信标前往 OOX-09/HL型定位器在河流附近的尽头隐匿石，然后护送它前往岸边越过悬崖悬崖。",
	["Take the beacon to OOX-17/TN in Tanaris, then escort it to Steamwheedle Port. Its turn-in is in Booty Bay too."] = "接取信标前往 OOX-17/TN型定位器在塔纳利斯，然后护送它前往热砂港。它的交任务是在藏宝海湾也。",
	["Take the beacon to OOX-22/FE in a cave near Feral Scar Vale, then escort it to the dock on the Forgotten Coast. Its turn-in is in Booty Bay; keep it for later."] = "接取信标前往自动导航机器人OOX-22/FE 在一个洞穴在深痕谷附近，然后护送它前往码头在被遗忘的海岸。它的交任务是在藏宝海湾；留着稍后做。",
	["Take the boat from Auberdine to Rut'theran Village."] = "乘船来自奥伯丁前往鲁瑟兰村。",
	["Take the boat from Auberdine to Rut'theran Village. Teldrassil is night elf country: Dolanaar and Shadowglen have guards, and Darnassus is reached only through the portal in Rut'theran Village."] = "乘船来自奥伯丁前往鲁瑟兰村。泰达希尔是夜晚精灵领地：多兰纳尔与幽影谷有卫兵，与达纳苏斯是可抵达仅穿过传送门在鲁瑟兰村。",
	["Take the boat from Menethil's pier to Theramore Isle in Dustwallow Marsh."] = "乘船来自米奈希尔的栈桥前往塞拉摩岛在尘泥沼泽。",
	["Take the boat from Ratchet to Booty Bay and fly to Stormwind."] = "乘船来自棘齿城前往藏宝海湾与飞往前往暴风城。",
	["Take the boat from Rut'theran Village to Auberdine and fly to Astranaar."] = "乘船来自鲁瑟兰村前往奥伯丁与飞往前往阿斯特兰纳。",
	["Take the boat from Rut'theran Village to Auberdine."] = "乘船来自鲁瑟兰村前往奥伯丁。",
	["Take the boat from Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine and fly to Rut'theran Village; Priestess Alathea is in the Temple of the Moon. Then fly back to Auberdine."] = "乘船来自暴风城港口前往奥伯丁与飞往前往鲁瑟兰村；女祭司阿兰希雅是在月神殿。然后飞往返回前往奥伯丁。",
	["Take the boat from Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine. Join the two half pendants into the Pendant of the Sea Lion and cast Teleport: Moonglade: Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven. Then fly to Rut'theran Village (by way of Auberdine)."] = "乘船来自暴风城港口前往奥伯丁。加入2一半挂坠进入海狮坠饰与施放传送：月光林地：德迪利特·星焰是在永夜港。然后飞往前往鲁瑟兰村（在旁路的奥伯丁）。",
	["Take the boat to Auberdine from Menethil's docks."] = "乘船前往奥伯丁来自米奈希尔的码头。",
	["Take the boat to Menethil Harbor from Auberdine's docks."] = "乘船前往米奈希尔港来自奥伯丁的码头。",
	["Take the boat to Theramore from the far pier."] = "乘船前往塞拉摩来自远处栈桥。",
	["Take the boat to the Forgotten Coast and follow the shore south to the wrecked row boat on the beach."] = "乘船前往被遗忘的海岸与沿着岸边南前往失事的排船在海滩上。",
	["Take the boat to the mainland and ride north-east to Zorbin's camp by the Twin Colossals."] = "乘船前往大陆与骑行东北前往佐尔宾的营地在旁双塔山。",
	["Take the flight path in Nighthaven and fly to Auberdine."] = "接取飞行点在永夜港与飞往前往奥伯丁。",
	["Take the kitten to the same moonwell and release it there; once it has turned into a Corrupted Saber, bring it back to Winna and click on it to hand it over."] = "接取小猫前往相同月亮井与释放它那里；一次它有交还进入一个堕落的杂斑野猪刃豹，携带它返回前往温娜·哈萨德与点击在它前往上交它越过。",
	["Take the lift down. The egg lies in a nest on the canyon floor in one of three spots: south-east of the mesas (52.3,55.2), east (56.4,50.4) or south-west (37.6,56.1)."] = "接取升降梯下。蛋位于一个巢在峡谷楼层在1的3地点：在台地以东南（52.3,55.2），东（56.4,50.4）或西南（37.6,56.1）。",
	["Take the pass out of Kargath's west side into the Searing Gorge, then ride south across the gorge to the long bridge into Blackrock Mountain. Inside, follow the chain walkways down and leave through the southern exit; stay off the paths to the dungeon portals."] = "穿过山道离开卡加斯的西一侧进入灼热峡谷，然后骑行南穿过峡谷前往长桥进入黑石山。内部，沿着任务链步道下与跳过穿过南部出口；留在偏离/关闭小径前往地下城传送门。",
	["Take the pass out of Kargath's west side into the Searing Gorge, then ride south-west to the dig site. The Wooden Outhouse stands at its southern end; the Dark Iron Geologists dig just north of it. Bring 15 Silk Cloth (the Auction House sells it)."] = "穿过山道离开卡加斯的西一侧进入灼热峡谷，然后骑行西南前往挖掘地点。木制厕所位于它的南部尽头；黑铁地质学家挖掘就在它北面。携带15丝绸（拍卖行出售它）。",
	["Take the portal down to Rut'theran Village. Nessa stands on the dock, Vesprystus by the hippogryphs."] = "接取传送门下前往鲁瑟兰村。尼莎·影歌位于码头上，维斯派塔斯在旁角鹰兽。",
	["Take the portal up from Rut'theran Village to Mathrengyl in the Cenarion Enclave."] = "接取传送门上来自鲁瑟兰村前往玛斯雷·驭熊者在塞纳里奥区。",
	["Take the portal up to Darnassus."] = "接取传送门上前往达纳苏斯。",
	["Take the portal up to Mathrengyl, then fly back to Auberdine for the boat to Stormwind."] = "接取传送门上前往玛斯雷·驭熊者，然后飞往返回前往奥伯丁给船前往暴风城。",
	["Take the portal up to the Cenarion Enclave, then fly back to Auberdine."] = "接取传送门上前往塞纳里奥区，然后飞往返回前往奥伯丁。",
	["Take the portal up to the Rohashi Spires and join Elaadrin and Ayessa against the High Priestess."] = "接取传送门上前往罗哈什尖塔与加入艾拉德琳·暮风与阿耶莎·晨歌迎战高女祭司。",
	["Take the road north at the fork to the ogre village of Brackenwall."] = "沿着道路走北在岔路口前往食人魔村庄的蕨墙村。",
	["Take the road north out of Booty Bay; Unbagwa sits on a hill in Mistvale Valley, east of the road."] = "沿着道路走北离开藏宝海湾；巫医安巴格瓦位于一个山丘在迷雾谷，在道路以东。",
	["Take the road north to the ruined manor; Jarl lives in the shack beside it and the loose dirt is at the corner of the house."] = "沿着道路走北前往毁坏的庄园；卡尔住在棚屋旁边它与松动的泥土是在角落的房屋。",
	["Take the road north-west from Dolanaar again; she still lies beside it, on the way to Darnassus."] = "沿着道路走西北来自多兰纳尔再次；她仍然位于旁边它，在途中前往达纳苏斯。",
	["Take the road north-west from Dolanaar towards the Oracle Glade; she lies hurt beside it."] = "沿着道路走西北来自多兰纳尔朝向神谕林地；她位于受伤旁边它。",
	["Take the road north; Private Thorsen stands on it, the camp sits in the hills to the west."] = "沿着道路走北；列兵索尔森位于它，营地位于丘陵向西。",
	["Take the road south towards Booty Bay. The Elder Mistvale Gorillas (40-41) live in Mistvale Valley, east of the road; about one in twenty carries an aged sinew."] = "沿着道路走南朝藏宝海湾方向。老迈的薄雾谷猩猩（40-41）实测在迷雾谷，在道路以东；约1在20携带一个老迈的肌腱。",
	["Take the road south-east out of Brill; Terrence stands on it short of the zeppelin towers."] = "沿着道路走东南离开布瑞尔；亡灵卫兵特伦斯位于它不足的飞艇哨塔。",
	["Take the road south-east to Valanaar, the Skyborne town on the south coast. Nyalah and Alvarion stand at its western edge."] = "沿着道路走东南前往瓦拉纳尔，天裔城镇在南海岸。妮雅拉·明火与阿尔瓦里奥·风野位于它的西部边缘。",
	["Take the road south-east. Nyalah Brightfire and Alvarion Windfield stand by the road west of Valanaar; Windsong Crawlers line the shore around them."] = "沿着道路走东南。妮雅拉·明火与阿尔瓦里奥·风野位于路边在瓦拉纳尔以西；风歌爬行者路线岸边周围它们。",
	["Take the road south-west out of the Stonetalon Mountains into Desolace; Nijel's Point in the north is the Alliance town."] = "沿着道路走西南出的石爪山脉进入凄凉之地；尼耶尔前哨站在北面是联盟城镇。",
	["Take the road west down into the crater and ride to the Slithering Scar, the silithid cave in the south. The Gorishi Hive Queen waits in its deepest chamber."] = "沿着道路走西下进入环形山与骑行前往滑行之痕，异种虫洞穴在南面。格里什皇后等候于它的最深处密室。",
	["Take the tunnel into the Howling Vale; the tome lies in the ruins at its west end."] = "穿过隧道进入狼嚎谷；法典位于废墟中在它的西尽头。",
	["Take the zeppelin back to Orgrimmar."] = "搭乘飞艇返回前往奥格瑞玛。",
	["Take the zeppelin from Orgrimmar or the Undercity to Grom'gol Base Camp."] = "搭乘飞艇来自奥格瑞玛或幽暗城前往格罗姆高营地。",
	["Take the zeppelin from the tower outside Orgrimmar to Tirisfal Glades and ride into the Undercity. Lady Sylvanas holds the Royal Quarter."] = "搭乘飞艇来自哨塔在奥格瑞玛外前往提瑞斯法林地与骑行进入幽暗城。雷蒂希尔瓦娜斯·风行者持有皇家区。",
	["Take the zeppelin from the towers outside the Undercity to Orgrimmar and train before you fly on."] = "搭乘飞艇来自哨塔外部幽暗城前往奥格瑞玛与训练之前你飞往在。",
	["Take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar from the tower outside the Undercity, then fly to Splintertree Post."] = "搭乘飞艇前往奥格瑞玛来自哨塔外部幽暗城，然后飞往前往碎木岗哨。",
	["Takrin Pathseeker"] = "塔克林·寻路者",
	["Tal"] = "塔尔",
	["Talaanis Shadowsong"] = "塔拉尼斯·影歌",
	["Taleen Shimmerthread"] = "塔琳·微光丝",
	["Talen"] = "塔尔伦",
	["Talin Keeneye"] = "塔林·锐眼",
	["Talin's camp is at the west end of the valley. Felix's Box lies in the snow south of it, his Chest by the troll cave and his Bucket of Bolts east of the cave: grab them as you pass."] = "塔林·锐眼的营地是在山谷的西端。菲利克斯的盒子位于雪在它南面，他的箱子在旁巨魔洞穴与他的一桶螺栓在洞穴以东：拿取它们作为你穿过。",
	["Talisman of Corruption, in Xabraxxis' Demon Bag"] = "堕落护符，在萨巴克希斯的恶魔背包",
	["Talk to Cook Torka"] = "与…交谈厨师托尔卡",
	["Tallonkai Swiftroot"] = "塔隆凯·捷根",
	["Tallonkai Swiftroot, back in Dolanaar"] = "塔隆凯·捷根，返回在多兰纳尔",
	["Tallonkai's Dresser"] = "塔隆凯的衣柜",
	["Tallow: for Hammerfall in Arathi, later on the route"] = "塔隆：给落锤镇在阿拉希高地，稍后在路线",
	["Talo Thornhoof"] = "塔罗·刺蹄",
	["Talo Thornhoof: the bears are in Felwood"] = "塔罗·刺蹄：熊是在费伍德森林",
	["Talonaxe's next task waits for a later Hinterlands guide."] = "狮鹫管理员沙拉克·鹰斧的下一个任务等候给一个稍后辛特兰指南。",
	["Tame Beast"] = "驯服野兽",
	["Tame it with the Taming Rod"] = "驯服它与驯兽棒",
	["Taming Lesson: Tame Beast"] = "驯兽课程：驯服野兽",
	["Tammra Windfield"] = "塔姆拉·荒原",
	["Tanaris is south of Dustwallow Marsh and Thousand Needles. Gadgetzan is a neutral goblin town."] = "塔纳利斯是在尘泥沼泽以南与千针石林。加基森是一个中立地精城镇。",
	["Tannok Frosthammer, in the distillery"] = "塔诺克·霜锤，在酿酒厂",
	["Tapoke \"Slim\" Jahn"] = "“瘦子”塔波克·詹",
	["Tar Beasts wallow in the Lakkari Tar Pits; the fire elementals of Fire Plume Ridge in the middle carry the ash; the Gorishi wasps of the Slithering Scar in the south carry the gland. Every creature in the crater can drop Un'Goro Soil."] = "焦油兽打滚在拉卡利油沼；营火元素的火羽山在中间携带灰烬；戈里什黄蜂的滑行之痕在南面携带腺体。每个生物在环形山可以掉落安戈洛的泥土。",
	["Target one of the frogs here and type /sing; a Musical Gustjumper appears. Interact with it to get the pet."] = "目标1的青蛙此处与类型 /唱歌；一个八音跃风兽出现。交互与它前往获取宠物。",
	["Tarindrella"] = "塔琳德拉",
	["Tarindrella, south of the tree"] = "塔琳德拉，在树以南",
	["Taronn Redfeather"] = "塔诺恩·红羽",
	["Tarrel Rockweaver"] = "塔雷尔·石纹",
	["Tarrel Rockweaver, by the north gate"] = "塔雷尔·石纹，在旁北大门",
	["Tarshaw Jaggedscar"] = "塔绍尔·锯痕",
	["Taskmaster Scrange"] = "监工斯克兰格",
	["Taskmasters and Slavers drive the slaves all over the Cauldron, and any of them can carry a Thorium Plated Dagger. The Steamsmiths work at the furnaces in the middle (the Smithing Tuyere), the Lookouts stand on the southern ridges (the Spyglass). Any Dark Iron may drop the Grimesilt Outhouse Key: keep it."] = "监工与奴隶主驱赶奴隶全部越过大锅，与任意的它们可以携带一个瑟银匕首。蒸汽铁匠有效在熔炉在中间（冶炼鼓风机），哨兵鲁鲁位于南部山脊（望远镜）。任意黑铁矿可能掉落格里塞特厕所钥匙：请保留该任务/物品。",
	["Tatternack Steelforge"] = "塔特纳克·钢炉",
	["Tauren: the Great Cat Spirit waits on the southern hill above the bridge. Skyborne: the Avatar of Saeyleenan stands south of the twin bridges. Then the dens east of the lake: leave your form, click the statue at the entrance for five minutes of stealth, keep clear of the spirits inside and take one of each relic; the Relic of the Silent Shadow lies at the foot of the white cat statue."] = "牛头人：巨豹之灵等候于南部山丘在桥上方。天裔：赛琳南的化身位于双生桥以南。然后兽穴在湖以东：跳过你的形态，点击雕像在入口给5分钟的潜行，保留清理的灵魂内部与接取1的每个圣物；寂静暗影圣物位于白色猫雕像的底部。",
	["Tavernkeep Smitts"] = "旅店老板斯密茨",
	["Tavernkeep Smitts, in the tavern"] = "旅店老板斯密茨，在酒馆内",
	["Teaches Azure Silk Cloak (needs Tailoring 175). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "传授碧蓝丝质披风（需要裁缝175）。商人出售它在限量库存该刷新补货；拍卖行经常有它也。",
	["Teaches Elixir of Superior Defense (needs Alchemy 265). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "传授超强防御药剂（需要炼金术265）。商人出售它在限量库存该刷新补货；拍卖行经常有它也。",
	["Teaches Enchant Bracer - Lesser Strength (needs Enchanting 140). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "传授附魔护腕 - 次级力量（需要附魔140）。商人出售它在限量库存该刷新补货；拍卖行经常有它也。",
	["Teaches Enchant Cloak - Minor Agility (needs Enchanting 110). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "传授附魔披风 - 初级敏捷（需要附魔110）。商人出售它在限量库存该刷新补货；拍卖行经常有它也。",
	["Teaches Great Rage Potion (needs Alchemy 175). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "传授暴怒药水（需要炼金术175）。商人出售它在限量库存该刷新补货；拍卖行经常有它也。",
	["Teaches Holy Protection Potion (needs Alchemy 100). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "传授神圣防护药水（需要炼金术100）。商人出售它在限量库存该刷新补货；拍卖行经常有它也。",
	["Teaches Huge Thorium Battleaxe (needs Blacksmithing 280)."] = "传授巨型瑟银战斧（需要锻造280）。",
	["Teaches Lesser Mana Oil (needs Enchanting 250)."] = "传授次级法力之油（需要附魔250）。",
	["Teaches Ornate Thorium Handaxe (needs Blacksmithing 275)."] = "传授华丽瑟银手斧（需要锻造275）。",
	["Teaches Red Woolen Bag (needs Tailoring 115). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "传授红色毛纺包（需要裁缝115）。商人出售它在限量库存该刷新补货；拍卖行经常有它也。",
	["Teaches Runecloth Gloves (needs Tailoring 275). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "传授符文布手套（需要裁缝275）。商人出售它在限量库存该刷新补货；拍卖行经常有它也。",
	["Teaches Runic Leather Headband (needs Leatherworking 290). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "传授符文皮甲头环（需要制皮290）。商人出售它在限量库存该刷新补货；拍卖行经常有它也。",
	["Teaches Thorium Tube (needs Engineering 275). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "传授瑟银管（需要工程学275）。商人出售它在限量库存该刷新补货；拍卖行经常有它也。",
	["Teaches Thorium Widget (needs Engineering 260). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "传授瑟银零件（需要工程学260）。商人出售它在限量库存该刷新补货；拍卖行经常有它也。",
	["Teaches Tuxedo Jacket (needs Tailoring 250). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "传授礼服夹克（需要裁缝250）。商人出售它在限量库存该刷新补货；拍卖行经常有它也。",
	["Teaches Wicked Leather Gauntlets (needs Leatherworking 260). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "传授邪恶皮甲护手（需要制皮260）。商人出售它在限量库存该刷新补货；拍卖行经常有它也。",
	["Teaches Wizard Oil (needs Enchanting 275)."] = "传授巫师之油（需要附魔275）。",
	["Teeri Wellwind"] = "蒂莉·顺风",
	["Telf makes Fire Sapta from the tar and pouch. Use it by the brazier next to him to reveal the Minor Manifestation of Fire, kill it for the Glowing Ember, then place the ember in the brazier."] = "泰尔夫·祖拉姆制作火焰萨普塔来自焦油与袋子。使用它在旁火盆下一个前往他前往揭示火焰之魂，击杀它给余烬，然后放置余烬在火盆。",
	["Telf waits on the Durotar bank of the Southfury River, east of the Razormane camp."] = "泰尔夫·祖拉姆等候于杜隆塔尔银行的怒水河，东的刺鬃营地。",
	["Telf waits on the riverbank south of Far Watch Post, across the bridge."] = "泰尔夫·祖拉姆等候于河岸在前沿哨所以南，穿过桥。",
	["Temporal Displacer"] = "时空置换器",
	["Temporal Parasite"] = "时光寄生虫",
	["Ten Morrowgrain from the Evergreen Pouch"] = "10晨光麦来自常青袋",
	["Ten more for True Believers"] = "10更多给真正的信徒",
	["Tenaron Stormgrip, at the top of the tree"] = "特纳隆·雷拳，在树的顶部",
	["Teo Hammerstorm"] = "提奥·锤暴",
	["Teo Hammerstorm, inside Anvilmar"] = "提奥·锤暴，在安威玛尔内",
	["Teo Hammerstorm: Stoneskin Totem and your Earth Totem"] = "提奥·锤暴：石肤图腾与你的大地图腾",
	["Terenthis"] = "特伦希斯",
	["Termite Barrel"] = "白蚁桶",
	["Teronis' Corpse"] = "泰洛尼斯的尸体",
	["Thadius Grimshade, at the top of the keep"] = "萨迪斯·格希德，在保留的顶部",
	["Thadius' next task, Nekrum's Medallion, is a Zul'Farrak quest: skip it."] = "萨迪斯·格希德的下一个任务，耐克鲁姆的徽章，是一个祖尔法拉克任务：跳过即可。",
	["Thaivand's next task ends at Southshore's graveyard and the magus offers a dungeon errand: leave both."] = "学徒塞万德的下一个任务终结于南海镇的墓地与魔导师提供一个地下城差事：两个都可先跳过。",
	["Thal'trak Proudtusk"] = "萨特拉克",
	["Thalia Amberhide"] = "萨利亚",
	["Thanthaldis Snowgleam, 200g"] = "塔萨迪斯·雪光，200金",
	["Tharek Blackstone"] = "萨雷克·黑石",
	["Tharg"] = "萨尔格",
	["Tharnariun Treetender"] = "萨纳瑞恩·绿树",
	["Thatog"] = "萨托格",
	["The Al'Aketh cultists in the camp beyond Hanaa carry the signet."] = "奥阿凯斯邪教徒在营地里越过哈娜·夜风携带印戒。",
	["The Alliance camp is at Three Corners in western Redridge Mountains. Loot supply crates in the world, fill them and hand them in to Marcy Baker for Merchant's Favor (5-20 a crate); the treat costs 1,500."] = "联盟营地是在三角路口在西部赤脊山。拾取补给木箱在世界，装满它们与上交它们在前往玛茜·贝克给商人的青睐（5-20一个木箱）；点心花费1,500。",
	["The Annals lie among the Musty Tomes in Andorhal's town hall; open them until you find the right one."] = "编年史位于其中：发霉的典籍在安多哈尔的城镇大厅；打开/开启它们直到你寻找右侧1。",
	["The Arathi Highlands lie east of the Alterac Mountains and Hillsbrad Foothills."] = "阿拉希高地位于东的奥特兰克山脉与希尔斯布莱德丘陵。",
	["The Argent Dawn starts out Neutral. Take the Commission from Argent Officer Garush at The Bulwark and wear it: in Classic, Scourgestones only drop while the Argent Dawn Commission trinket is equipped. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "银色黎明始于出中立。接取委任徽章来自银色黎明军官加鲁什在亡灵壁垒与佩戴它：在经典旧世，天灾石仅掉落当银色黎明委任徽章饰品是装备。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["The Argent Dawn starts out Neutral. Take the Commission from Argent Officer Pureheart at Chillwind Camp and wear it: in Classic, Scourgestones only drop while the Argent Dawn Commission trinket is equipped. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "银色黎明始于出中立。接取委任徽章来自银色黎明军官普尔哈特在冰风岗与佩戴它：在经典旧世，天灾石仅掉落当银色黎明委任徽章饰品是装备。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["The Auberdine boat docks at Stormwind Harbor. Walk up into the city for training, then leave by the main gate and follow the road east through Elwynn Forest."] = "奥伯丁船码头在暴风城港口。步行上进入主城给训练，然后跳过在旁主大门与沿着道路前往东穿过艾尔文森林。",
	["The Azeroth Commerce Authority is the Alliance's tradeskill faction in Forever. Its camp is at Three Corners in western Redridge Mountains. From level 10 mobs drop Waylaid Crates: fill each with the goods its label asks for and hand the Sealed Crate to Marcy Baker at the camp for reputation and Merchant's Favor. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "艾泽拉斯贸易局是联盟的商业技能阵营在无限服。它的营地是在三角路口在西部赤脊山。来自10级怪物掉落被劫的货箱：装满每个与商品它的标签需要与上交密封的箱子前往玛茜·贝克在营地给声望与商人的青睐。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["The Azurelode Mine lies south of Hillsbrad town. Miners work the tunnels; Foreman Bonds (30) and Miner Hackett (29) are deep inside."] = "碧玉矿洞位于希尔斯布莱德以南城镇。矿工有效隧道；工头邦德斯（30）与矿工哈克特（29）是深处内部。",
	["The Bael'dun Soldiers, Riflemen and Officers guard the fortress on the east side of the dig; all three items drop from them."] = "巴尔丹士兵，步枪手与军官守卫要塞在挖掘的东侧；全部3物品掉落来自它们。",
	["The Bandit Highwaymen hold the hills north of the farm."] = "强盗路霸要塞丘陵在农场以北。",
	["The Banshee Queen's champion holds the Marris Stead farmhouse, north of the Undercroft."] = "女妖之王的勇士持有玛瑞斯农场农舍，北的地下墓穴。",
	["The Banshee Queen's champion holds the Marris Stead farmhouse."] = "女妖之王的勇士持有玛瑞斯农场农舍。",
	["The Bitter Baitling is a fishing reward: Jang trades it for one Extravagant Extravaganza Coin, a reward of the fishing contest Jang runs in Booty Bay. The coin's exact source is not published yet."] = "苦味鱼饵是一个钓鱼奖励：贾恩可兑换它给1奢华盛典硬币，一个奖励的钓鱼比赛贾恩通往在藏宝海湾。硬币的精确的来源是不已发布尚。",
	["The Blasted Lands are south of the Swamp of Sorrows; the road arrives at Nethergarde Keep (Alliance)."] = "诅咒之地是南的悲伤沼泽；道路抵达在守望堡（联盟）。",
	["The Bloodfeather harpies nest on the slopes west and north of the glade."] = "血羽鹰身女妖巢在山坡西与在林地以北。",
	["The Bloodscalp Headhunters (36-37) in the village on the coast carry the shrunken heads."] = "血顶猎头者（36-37）在村子里在海岸边携带缩小的头颅。",
	["The Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins on the coast west of Nesingwary's camp."] = "血顶巨魔要塞废墟在海岸边在奈辛瓦里的营地以西。",
	["The Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins up the coast north of the reef and the village beyond; every one can drop a Bloody Bone Necklace. Keep looting pages of The Green Hills of Stranglethorn."] = "血顶巨魔要塞废墟上海岸在暗礁与村庄越过以北；每个1可以掉落一个染血的白骨项链。保留拾取书页的荆棘谷的青山。",
	["The Bloodstained Satchel"] = "染血的背包",
	["The Bloodstained Satchel lies by the path west of Valanaar; Fillion's camp is north-west of it, and the Shriekling Matriarchs nest just west of the camp."] = "染血的背包位于旁小径在瓦拉纳尔以西；菲利奥·焰风的营地位于它西北面，与尖啸幼体刺喉雌龙巢就在营地以西。",
	["The Bloody Note"] = "染血的便条",
	["The Bluegill murlocs on the beach south-west of Menethil carry the ingots."] = "蓝腮鱼人在海滩上在米奈希尔以西南携带锭。",
	["The Boulderfist Brutes camp outside the ogres' hall south of Hammerfall; the Magus stand among them. Pull them one at a time."] = "石拳蛮兵营地在食人魔外的大厅在落锤镇以南；魔导师位于其中：它们。拉怪它们1在一个时间。",
	["The Brill trainers are in and around the inn"] = "布瑞尔训练师是在与在旅店周围",
	["The Bristleback quilboar camps spread over the plains north of Camp Taurajo, either side of the Gold Road. Every Bristleback drops a tusk and the Razormane Raiders among them carry Olgra's Adornments; Mankrik's wife lies at the north edge. Keep one Blood Shard. Lakota'mani, a grey kodo, sometimes wanders here: his hoof starts a quest."] = "刺背野猪人扎营分布越过平原在陶拉祖营地以北，任一一侧的金币道路。每个刺背掉落一个长牙与钢鬃狼骑兵波尔克在其中：它们携带奥格拉的饰物；曼科里克的妻子位于北边缘。保留1血岩碎片。拉克塔曼尼，一个灰色科多兽，有时游荡此处：他的蹄始于一个任务。",
	["The Bubbling Cauldron beside Kin'weelay"] = "冒泡的大锅在肯维雷旁边",
	["The Burning Blade Stash stands in Skull Rock, among the cultists you just fought."] = "火刃营地位于骷髅石，在其中：邪教徒你就在战斗。",
	["The Burning Blade hold the fortress north-west of Kormek's Hut. Use the Demon Pick on the Demon Spirit in the fortress to get the Demon Box."] = "火刃要塞要塞在考米克小屋以西北。使用恶魔之锄在恶魔灵魂在要塞前往获取恶魔之盒。",
	["The Captured Mountaineer, in the town hall basement"] = "被俘虏的巡山人，在市政厅内地下室",
	["The Captured Scarlet Zealot, in the town hall basement"] = "血色十字军俘虏，在市政厅内地下室",
	["The Centipaar silithid crawl around the Noxious Lair in western Tanaris, just east of the crater ramp. The Workers are the easiest pulls."] = "森提帕尔异种虫爬行周围剧毒之巢在西部塔纳利斯，就在环形山坡道以东。迪菲亚工人是最容易的拉怪。",
	["The Circle of Imprisonment stands in the satyr camp of Satyrnaar, further east along the road."] = "禁锢法阵位于萨特营地的萨提纳尔，更远处东沿着道路。",
	["The Cleft of Shadow is the canyon under the Valley of Strength."] = "暗影裂口是峡谷在下方力量谷。",
	["The Cleft of Shadow is the canyon under the Valley of Strength; Neeru Fireblade stands at its far end."] = "暗影裂口是峡谷在下方力量谷；尼尔鲁·火刃位于它的远处尽头。",
	["The Cold Eye Basilisks lie on the rocks west of the mine."] = "冷眼蜥蜴位于岩石在采矿以西。",
	["The Collector's Ring: Morgan the Collector"] = "收货人的戒指：收货人莫根",
	["The Control Console stands at the Venture Co. research site west of the Sludge Fen. Close the three valves around the drill, use the console again, then take the Console Key from Tinkerer Sniggles beside it."] = "控制台位于风险投资公司研究地点西的淤泥沼泽。关闭3阀门在演习周围，使用控制台再次，然后接取控制台钥匙来自工匠斯尼格斯旁边它。",
	["The Corpse Laden Boat lies at the ferry landing on the lake shore east of the Sepulcher."] = "装满尸体的船位于渡口陆地在湖岸边东的瑟伯切尔。",
	["The Crazed and Withered Ancients north of the moonwell carry the Wooden Key; the worn chest it opens stands among them."] = "疯狂的枭兽与干枯的古树在月亮井携带以北木制钥匙；穿戴的箱子它开启位于其中：它们。",
	["The Crossroads is your base for this guide. Everyone you need stands within a few steps of the inn."] = "十字路口是你的基地给此指南。所有人你需要位于内部一个少量台阶的旅店。",
	["The Crushridge ogres hold the hills north of Strahnbrad. Farther north, a worn wooden chest holds the Ensorcelled Parchment; Nagaz of the Dark Council stands right by it."] = "碎鳍食人魔要塞丘陵在斯坦恩布莱德以北。更远处北，一个穿戴的木制箱子持有附有魔法的羊皮纸；纳伽兹的黑暗议会位于右侧在旁它。",
	["The Cult of the Damned holds the farm just south-east of the camp. The Necrotic Crystal Fragments lie on the ground among the cultists, and the cultists carry some too."] = "诅咒神教持有农场就在营地以东南。通灵水晶碎片位于领地在其中：邪教徒，与邪教徒携带一些也。",
	["The Cursed and Tainted Oozes slide about the streams and fel pools around Jaedenar and Bloodvenom Falls: kill them and use Laris's Empty Ooze Jars on their remains."] = "被诅咒的水兵与被污染的软泥怪滑下约溪流与邪能水池在加德纳尔周围与血毒瀑布：击杀它们与使用拉里斯·空轮的空软泥怪瓶在它们的遗骸。",
	["The Dalaran Spellscribe, a rare spawn among the mages at Ambermill in southern Silverpine Forest, drops it about 17% of the time in our data; the other Dalaran mages at Ambermill and around the Dalaran crater drop it at about 0.2%. Kill the mages until the Spellscribe appears. Alliance players buy it on the Auction House."] = "达拉然铭文师，一个稀有刷新在其中：法师在安伯米尔在南部银松森林，掉落它约17%的时间在我们的数据；其他达拉然法师在安伯米尔与周围达拉然环形山掉落它在约0.2%。击杀法师直到符文师出现。联盟玩家购买它在拍卖行。",
	["The Dangerous! poster: its targets come up along the way"] = "危险！通缉令：它的目标来到上沿途",
	["The Dark Iron Lookouts stand on the ridges around the sentry towers south of the Cauldron; about one in ten carries the Lookout's Spyglass."] = "黑铁斥候位于山脊在哨兵哨塔周围在大锅以南；约1在10携带侦查员的望远镜。",
	["The Dark Iron Steamsmiths work the furnaces in the middle of the Cauldron; half of them carry a Thorium Plated Dagger, one in ten the Smithing Tuyere. Slaves, Slavers and Taskmasters carry daggers too."] = "黑铁锻造师有效熔炉在大锅的中央；一半的它们携带一个瑟银匕首，1在10冶炼鼓风机。挖掘场奴隶，奴隶主与监工携带匕首也。",
	["The Dark Runners prowl the woods south of the road, west of Darkshire."] = "深色奔行者游荡树林在道路以南，在夜色镇以西。",
	["The Darkmist spiders nest around the cavern in the north-west of the marsh; every spider drops eyes."] = "黑雾蜘蛛巢在洞窟在周围在沼泽以西北；每个蜘蛛掉落眼睛。",
	["The Darkmist spiders swarm the cavern mouth north-west of Brackenwall; every kind drops eyes."] = "黑雾蜘蛛虫群洞窟入口/河口在蕨墙村以西北；每个种类掉落眼睛。",
	["The Deadmines"] = "死亡矿井",
	["The Deadmines is a group of five under Moonbrook; the instance portal is inside the Moonbrook mine. Cookie, the murloc cook near the ship at the end, drops the Siamese about 15% of the time in our data."] = "死亡矿井是一个队伍的5在下方月溪镇；副本传送门是内部月溪镇采矿。曲奇，鱼人烹饪在船在尽头附近，掉落暹罗猫约15%的时间在我们的数据。",
	["The Deadmines is a group of five under Moonbrook; the instance portal is inside the Moonbrook mine. The Defias Pirates on and around the ship drop the macaw about 3.5% of the time in our data."] = "死亡矿井是一个队伍的5在下方月溪镇；副本传送门是内部月溪镇采矿。迪菲亚海盗在与在船掉落金刚鹦鹉约周围3.5%的时间在我们的数据。",
	["The Deadwood cauldron in Felwood: keep it"] = "死木大锅在费伍德森林：请保留该任务/物品",
	["The Deadwood furbolg village just west of the tunnel. Chieftain Bloodmaw (56) stands among them. Meilosh, a friendly furbolg, sits at the north end of the village."] = "死木熊怪村庄就在隧道以西。血喉酋长（56）位于其中：它们。梅罗什，一个友善熊怪，位于村庄的北端。",
	["The Deadwood furbolg village lies just south of the Sanctuary. Every Deadwood kill also raises your Timbermaw Hold reputation; keep the headdress feathers."] = "死木熊怪村庄位于就在圣地以南。每个死木击杀也提升你的木喉要塞声望；保留头饰羽毛。",
	["The Deadwood furbolgs live in the village just south-west of Grazle; keep the Deadwood Headdress Feathers they drop."] = "死木熊怪实测在村子里就在格拉兹以西南；保留死木头饰羽毛它们掉落。",
	["The Deadwood furbolgs of Felpaw Village fill the hills west of the cave. The Avengers can drop a Deadwood Ritual Totem."] = "死木熊怪的魔爪村装满丘陵在洞穴以西。复仇者可以掉落一个死木仪祭图腾。",
	["The Deathknell trainers stand around the church"] = "丧钟镇训练师位于教堂周围",
	["The Defias camp lies in the south-west of Duskwood, south of Raven Hill near the Westfall border. The strongbox stands among the tents."] = "迪菲亚营地位于暮色森林以西南，在乌鸦岭以南附近西部荒野边界。保险箱位于其中：帐篷。",
	["The Defilers fight for Arathi Basin from Hammerfall. Their reputation comes from the battleground: the resources your team gathers pay it to everyone, so holding more bases for longer pays more. Queue at any battlemaster. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "污染者迎战给阿拉希盆地来自落锤镇。它们的声望来自战场：资源你的队伍采集奖励它前往所有人，因此持有更多基地给更长奖励更多。排队在任意战场军官。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["The Doom Weed grows in the graveyard fields just north of Brill."] = "末日草生长在墓地农田就在布瑞尔以北。",
	["The Dragonmaw camp lies south of the road, just west of the Green Belt: Raiders, Swamprunners and Bonewarders. Pilot Longbeard's quest in Dun Morogh needs level 28."] = "龙喉营地位于道路以南，就在西的绿带草地：狼骑兵波尔克，沼泽奔行者与白骨守卫。飞行员比罗·长须的任务在丹莫罗需要28级。",
	["The Dragonmaw orcs camp east of the excavation site. Raiders and Swamprunners carry the war banners."] = "龙喉兽人营地在挖掘场地点以东。狼骑兵波尔克与沼泽奔行者携带战争旗帜。",
	["The Dreaming Whelps (level 35) in western Swamp of Sorrows drop it about once in 1,250 kills in our data."] = "梦游雏龙（35级）在西部悲伤沼泽掉落它约一次在1,250击杀在我们的数据。",
	["The Dry Branches lie on the ground around the south-west edge of Brill."] = "干枯的树枝位于领地在南周围-西边缘的布瑞尔。",
	["The Drywhisker kobolds dig in the gorge east of Hammerfall (Horde); skirt the town to the north. They drop both the motes and Krazek's ore."] = "枯须狗头人挖掘在峡谷在落锤镇以东（部落）；绕过城镇向北。它们掉落两个微粒与克拉兹克的矿石。",
	["The Dun Algaz pass in south-eastern Wetlands leads down into Loch Modan by Algaz Station."] = "丹奥加兹穿过在南-东部湿地通往下进入洛克莫丹在旁奥加兹岗哨。",
	["The Dustbelcher ogres camp just south of the valley; any of them drops scrap. Buzzards circle the plain to the east."] = "尘嗝食人魔营地就在山谷以南；任意的它们掉落废料。秃鹫法阵平原向东。",
	["The Dustwind harpies nest in Drygulch Ravine to the north; the storm witches drop the Dull Storm Orb."] = "尘风鹰身人巢在枯水谷向北；风暴女巫掉落黯淡的风暴宝珠。",
	["The Egg-O-Matic machine"] = "自动验蛋器机器",
	["The Eggs of Onyxia lie in the dragon caves in the Wyrmbog's south-east, guarded by the scalebanes; smash five."] = "蛋的奥妮克希亚位于龙洞穴在巨龙沼泽的东南，有守卫的在旁鳞灾；砸碎5。",
	["The Elder Crag Coyotes and Giant Buzzards roam the basin south of the Dustbowl. Coyotes drop both the jawbones and the fangs; only the buzzards drop wings and gizzards."] = "老峭壁山狗与巨型秃鹫游荡于盆地南的尘风盆地。山狗掉落两个下颌骨与獠牙；仅秃鹫掉落翅膀与砂囊。",
	["The Elder Stranglethorn Tigers (34-35) roam the hills south-west of the camp; the Lashtail Raptors (35-36) hunt further south, towards Grom'gol."] = "老年荆棘谷猛虎（34-35）游荡于丘陵在营地以西南；鞭尾迅猛龙（35-36）狩猎更远处南，朝格罗姆高方向。",
	["The Equipment Boxes lie beside the ruined houses in the north of Deathknell."] = "装备箱位于毁坏的房屋在旁边在丧钟镇以北。",
	["The Field of Honor PvP season has weekly journey quests; finishing the ones for weeks 4, 7 and 10 is a point each. These quests are new in Forever and not in our data, so tick each one off yourself."] = "奥斯莱特元帅的荣誉 PvP 季节有每周旅程任务；完成在给周4，7与10是一个点每个。这些任务是新在无限服与暂未收录于当前数据，因此勾选每个1偏离/关闭你自己。",
	["The Firegut ogres hold the great rock north of the Vigil, with the Brutes on its east side."] = "火腹食人魔要塞巨型岩石在岗哨以北，与蛮兵在它的东一侧。",
	["The Fishing Traps sit along the west shore of the lake."] = "钓鱼陷阱坐沿着西岸边的湖。",
	["The Forever client lists it at 200g and level 60, and asks for no riding rank."] = "无限服客户端列出它在200金与60级，与需要无骑行等级。",
	["The Forsaken's camp lies in the woods south of Forest Song."] = "被遗忘者的营地位于树林在林歌神殿以南。",
	["The Foulweald furbolgs hold the woods east of Mystral Lake, south of the road. Place Karang's Banner on the Foulweald Totem Mound and guard it: the furbolgs come to tear it down. Chief Murgut comes last; his totem drops in the basket."] = "邪恶林地熊怪要塞树林在密斯特拉湖以东，在道路以南。放置卡拉恩的旗子在污林图腾堆与守卫它：熊怪来到前往眼泪它下。穆戈特酋长来自最后；他的图腾掉落在篮子。",
	["The Foulweald furbolgs live in the woods south of the road, south-east of Astranaar. The Den Watcher and the Ursas guard the den."] = "邪恶林地熊怪实测在树林在道路以南，在阿斯特兰纳以东南。大兽穴守夜人道茨与木喉巨熊怪守卫兽穴。",
	["The Frostwolf Clan holds Frostwolf Keep in the south of Alterac Valley. Destroying towers, taking graveyards and mines, and killing captains and generals all pay reputation to the whole team. Loot Armor Scraps from fallen enemies for Smith Regzar. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "霜狼氏族持有霜狼保留在奥特兰克山谷以南。摧毁哨塔，接取墓地与矿洞，与击杀队长与将军全部奖励声望前往整个队伍。拾取护甲碎片来自阵亡的敌人给铁匠雷格萨。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["The Gaea Seeds lie in the grass around the southern shore of Mirkfallon Lake, north of Sun Rock."] = "盖亚种子位于草在南部岸边的周围暗色湖，在烈日石居以北。",
	["The Galak camps fill the canyon north of Freewind; Scouts, Wranglers and Windchasers share every camp. A lone Galak Messenger walks between the camps: kill him when you meet him, his note starts a quest for Whitereach Post."] = "加拉克扎营装满峡谷在乱风岗以北；斥候，牧马人与追风者共享每个营地。一个单独的加拉克信使步行之间扎营：击杀他当你会合他，他的说明始于一个任务给白沙岗哨。",
	["The Galak centaurs camp on the plains north of the Rolling Plains; Herak leads them. Prairie Wolf Alphas roam among the wolves."] = "加拉克半人马营地在平原北的滚岩平原；赫拉克通往它们。草原狼前锋游荡在其中：狼。",
	["The Gizelton Caravan waits at Kormek's Hut."] = "基泽尔顿车队等候于考米克小屋。",
	["The Great Cat Spirit (Night Elves) and the Avatar of Saeyleenan (Skyborne) wait in southern Moonglade. The three relics lie in the Stormrage Barrow Dens, east of them. Reports from the first weeks say a relic gives no loot while another player is looting it: wait a moment and try again."] = "巨猫之灵（暗夜精灵）与赛琳南的化身（天裔）等候于南部月光林地。3圣物位于怒风兽穴，在它们东面。报告来自第一周说一个圣物给予无拾取当另一个玩家是拾取它：等待一个片刻与尝试再次。",
	["The Greater Lava Spiders roam the plateaus and lava pools in the south-west of the gorge."] = "大型熔岩蜘蛛游荡于高原与熔岩水池在峡谷以西南。",
	["The Greater Rock Elementals (42-44, well above you) wander the gulches in the south-west; the bracers drop about one kill in five. Pull one at a time and rest between fights, or leave them. Keep killing coyotes and buzzards you still need on the way."] = "大型岩石元素（42-44，水井上方你）游荡峡谷在西南面；护腕掉落约1击杀在5。拉怪1在一个时间与其余之间战斗，或可先放着不做。保留击杀山狗与秃鹫你仍然需要在途中。",
	["The Greater Rock Elementals (level 42) walk the far south-west corner below Camp Boff; pull them one at a time. The Dustbelcher Wyrmhunters and Maulers at Camp Boff also drop scrap."] = "大型岩石元素（42级）步行远处西南角落在博夫营地下方；拉怪它们1在一个时间。火烟猎龙者与科卡尔虐待者在博夫营地也掉落废料。",
	["The Grimtotem tauren camp beside the sprite darters' grove; raiders, naturalists and shamans all carry horns."] = "恐怖图腾牛头人营地在林精精灵龙旁边的树林；劫掠者，博物学家与萨满祭司全部携带角。",
	["The Grizzled Den is the wendigo cave south-west of Kharanos. Flintfire's shipments lie on the cave floor."] = "灰色洞穴是温迪戈洞穴在卡拉诺斯以西南。托格努斯·燧火的货物位于洞穴楼层。",
	["The Grom'gol zeppelin leaves from the tower just north-east of Orgrimmar's main gate."] = "格罗姆高飞艇离开来自哨塔就在奥格瑞玛的以东北主大门。",
	["The Hatefury Shadowstalkers at Sargeron walk unseen until they strike; about one in three carries a scalp."] = "怨怒巡影者在萨格隆步行隐形的直到它们打击；约1在3携带一个头皮。",
	["The Hatefury satyrs hold the ruins of Sargeron, east of Nijel's Point."] = "恨怒萨特要塞废墟的萨格隆，在尼耶尔前哨站以东。",
	["The Highborne ghosts haunt the ruins around the shrine; the Haldarr satyrs hold the camp just north of it."] = "上层精灵幽灵出没废墟在神龛周围；哈达尔萨特要塞营地就在它北面。",
	["The Highborne ghosts haunt the ruins just north of the shrine; the Haldarr satyrs camp a little further north."] = "上层精灵幽灵出没废墟就在神龛以北；哈达尔萨特营地一个小更远处北。",
	["The Highlands Bandits camp north-east of the village. \"Badwind\" Bennic waits at the far north end of their camp."] = "高地强盗营地在村庄以东北。“恶风”本尼克等候于远处北尽头的它们的营地。",
	["The Highvale elves camp around Quel'Danil Lodge. Burn the records, the notes and the report in their camps. Rin'ji is held inside the lodge: lead him out and fight off the ambush on the way."] = "高谷精灵营地在奎尔丹尼小屋周围。烧毁记录，说明与报告在它们的扎营。林吉是持有在旅舍内：引导他出与迎战偏离/关闭伏击在途中。",
	["The Horde airship docks at the south-west edge of Valanaar. Ride it to Kalimdor; it lands in northern Mulgore."] = "部落飞艇码头在西南边缘的瓦拉纳尔。骑行它前往卡利姆多；它之地在北部莫高雷。",
	["The Horde camp is just outside the Crossroads. Loot supply crates in the world, fill them and hand them in at the camp for Merchant's Favor; the treat costs 1,500. (Another Gishah stands in the Undercity; this is the one at the camp.)"] = "部落营地是就在外部十字路口。拾取补给木箱在世界，装满它们与上交它们在营地给商人的青睐；点心花费1,500。（另一个吉莎位于幽暗城；此是1在营地.）",
	["The Horde camp just north of Jaedenar."] = "部落营地就在加德纳尔以北。",
	["The Iridescent Shards lie at the far end of the gorge."] = "虹光水晶裂片位于远处尽头的峡谷。",
	["The Jadefire satyrs hold the glen west of the road, with Xavathras at its back."] = "碧火萨特要塞幽谷在道路以西，与萨瓦瑟拉斯在它的返回。",
	["The Jungle Stalkers (40-41) hunt the coast south of Grom'gol. They are well above you: pull one at a time and rest between fights."] = "丛林潜伏者（40-41）狩猎海岸在格罗姆高以南。它们是水井上方你：拉怪1在一个时间与其余之间战斗。",
	["The Kolkar camps spread north-west of Regthar; every Kolkar can drop Centaur Bracers. The Forgotten Pools lie in their middle, with Laden Mushrooms around the water. Savannah Prowlers roam the same plains."] = "科尔卡营地分布在雷戈萨·死门以西北；每个科卡尔可以掉落半人马护腕。遗忘之池位于它们的中间，与满载的蘑菇在水周围。草原徘徊者游荡于相同平原。",
	["The Kolkar roam the plains around Kolkar Village; their ears are for Corporal Melkins."] = "科卡尔游荡于平原在科尔卡村周围；它们的耳朵是给麦尔金斯下士。",
	["The Kurzen rebels hold the camp east of the Rebel Camp; work its outer edge, where Jungle Fighters and Medicine Men stand, and loot the supply crates by the tents."] = "库尔森叛军要塞营地东的反抗军营地；有效它的外侧边缘，在丛林战士与巫医人位于，与拾取补给木箱在旁帐篷。",
	["The Land Walkers and Cliff Giants roam the hills north of the dock. Zap each one with Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker first: shrunken, they are no longer elite. Every zapped giant drops residue; use the Muisek Vessel on its body too."] = "大地行者与峭壁巨人游荡于丘陵在码头以北。电击每个1与索尔宾的超级压缩器第一：缩小的，它们是无更长精英。每个被电击的巨型掉落残留物；使用穆塞克容器在它的尸体也。",
	["The Lar'korwi Mates prowl the jungle north-west of Torwa."] = "拉克维的配偶游荡丛林在托尔瓦以西北。",
	["The Lar'korwi Mates prowl the jungle west of Torwa. The wrecked raft lies on the shore of the lake there; the small pack sits in the water beside it. Keep the compass, map and key for Linken. Any beast in the crater may drop A Mangled Journal: right-click it."] = "拉克维的配偶游荡丛林在托尔瓦以西。失事的木筏位于湖那里的岸上；小型包位于水旁边它。保留罗盘，地图与钥匙给林克。任意野兽在环形山可能掉落被撕破的日记：右键点击它。",
	["The Large Termite Mounds stand all over the hills east of Terrordale. Use the Empty Termite Jar on each mound you pass."] = "大型白蚁土堆位于全部越过丘陵在恐惧谷以东。使用空的白蚁瓶在每个土堆你穿过。",
	["The Lashtail Raptors (35-36) hunt the jungle just north-east of Grom'gol."] = "鞭尾迅猛龙（35-36）狩猎丛林就在格罗姆高以东北。",
	["The League of Arathor fights for Arathi Basin from Refuge Pointe. Their reputation comes from the battleground: the resources your team gathers pay it to everyone, so holding more bases for longer pays more. Queue at any battlemaster. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "阿拉索联军战斗给阿拉希盆地来自避难谷地。它们的声望来自战场：资源你的队伍采集奖励它前往所有人，因此持有更多基地给更长奖励更多。排队在任意战场军官。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["The Lesser Rock Elementals wander the Dustbowl west of Lotwil."] = "次级岩石元素游荡尘风盆地在洛特维尔以西。",
	["The Ley Line"] = "魔网能量线",
	["The Lord Valthalak questline is a point. It is the level 60 dungeon-set chain: Deliana (Ironforge) or Mokvar (Orgrimmar) send you through In Search of Anthion and Anthion's Parting Words to Bodley at Blackrock Mountain, whose Three Kings of Flame, the Left and Right Pieces of Lord Valthalak's Amulet, Final Preparations and Mea Culpa, Lord Valthalak end with Return to Bodley. Back to the Beginning then leads to the class Saving the Best for Last quests."] = "瓦塔拉克公爵任务线是一个点。它是60级地下城-设置任务链：德莉亚娜（铁炉堡）或莫克瓦尔（奥格瑞玛）派往你穿过寻找安泰恩与告别安泰恩前往伯德雷在黑石山，其烈焰之王，左侧与右侧碎片的瓦塔拉克饰品，最后的准备与瓦塔拉克公爵尽头与向伯德雷回复。回到起点然后通往职业把最好的留到最后任务。",
	["The Marsh Murlocs live on the strand south of the post; the Inkspewers are along the shore east of it and the Flesheaters further west, around the huts on the western shore."] = "沼泽鱼人实测在海滩在岗哨以南；喷墨者是沿着岸边在它东面与食肉者更远处西，在小屋在西部岸边周围。",
	["The Mirefin murlocs crowd the coast east and north-east of Witch Hill; every kind drops heads."] = "泥鳍鱼人怪群海岸东与在女巫岭以东北；每个种类掉落头颅。",
	["The Mirefin murlocs crowd the north coast past Swamplight Manor; finish the tongues on the tortoises beside them."] = "泥鳍鱼人怪群北海岸经过水光庄园；完成舌头在陆龟旁边它们。",
	["The Moldy Tome lies on the shore a little further west, past the murloc camps."] = "发霉的书籍位于岸边一个小更远处西，经过鱼人扎营。",
	["The Molten Core materials carry the rest: Fiery Cores drop from Firewalkers, Flameguards and Firelords, and Lava Cores from Lava Elementals, Lava Reavers and Molten Destroyers there. Blood of the Mountain comes from Molten Destroyers and rarely elsewhere."] = "熔火之心材料携带其余：炽热之核掉落来自火焰行者，烈焰守卫与火焰之王，与熔岩之核来自熔岩元素，熔岩掠夺者与熔核摧毁者那里。山脉之血来自熔核摧毁者与极少别处。",
	["The Monstrous Crawlers walk the beaches of the east coast, few and far between: kill every one you see on the way south."] = "巨型爬行者步行海滩的东海岸，少量与远处之间：击杀每个1你查看在途中南。",
	["The Mosh'Ogg ogres camp in the hills just east of Grom'gol. Kill one Brute and one Witch Doctor (36-37); pull them one at a time."] = "莫什奥格食人魔扎营于丘陵就在格罗姆高以东。击杀1蛮兵与1女巫医生（36-37）；拉怪它们1在一个时间。",
	["The Mound of Dirt is just behind the Undercroft."] = "一堆泥土是就在后面地下墓穴。",
	["The Mudrock Tortoises and Spikeshells sun themselves on the shore north-east of the manor."] = "泥石海龟与刺壳龟太阳它们自己在岸边在庄园以东北。",
	["The Northspring harpies nest on the ridges in the far north-west. They are 48-50, a few levels above you: the Windcallers heal, so kill them first and pull one at a time."] = "北泉鹰身女妖巢在山脊在远处西北。它们是48-50，一个少量等级上方你：尖啸的唤风者治疗，因此击杀它们第一与拉怪1在一个时间。",
	["The Novice Seers practise in the clearing west of Shen'dar."] = "学徒塞万德先知练习在空地在辛达尔以西。",
	["The Orgrimmar zeppelin leaves from the tower beside Grom'gol; it lands just outside Orgrimmar's main gate."] = "奥格瑞玛飞艇离开来自哨塔在格罗姆高旁边；它之地就在奥格瑞玛的外主大门。",
	["The Palemane gnolls hold Palemane Rock, south of the digsite and west of Bloodhoof. Perith Stormhoof is held in their camp: lead him out."] = "苍鬃豺狼人要塞白鬃石，在挖掘场与西的以南血蹄。佩里斯·风暴之蹄是持有在它们的营地：引导他出。",
	["The Peasants work the fields south of the farmhouses. Every Hillsbrad human drops skulls; the Peasants drop them most often."] = "农民有效农田在农舍以南。每个希尔斯布莱德人类掉落头颅；农民掉落它们大多数经常。",
	["The Plague Spreaders walk the northern half of the Raven Hill Cemetery. Mor'Ladim, an elite, wanders the graves: keep away from him."] = "瘟疫传播者步行北部一半的乌鸦岭墓地。摩拉迪姆，一个精英，游荡坟墓：保留离开来自他。",
	["The Rabid Shardtooth bears roam the snowy valley south of Owl Wing Thicket."] = "疯狂的碎齿熊熊游荡于雪地山谷在枭翼树丛以南。",
	["The Raptor Grounds lie south-west of the oasis. Sunscale Scytheclaws drop the feathers you use on the three nests."] = "迅猛龙巢穴位于绿洲以西南。赤鳞镰爪龙掉落羽毛你使用在3巢。",
	["The Rattlecage Skeletons in the ruined houses drop the skulls."] = "断骨骷髅在毁坏的房屋掉落头颅。",
	["The Raw Windstones are blue crystals on the slopes around the village."] = "原始风石是蓝色水晶在山坡在村庄周围。",
	["The Raw Windstones glitter on the ground just south of the grove. The Cirrusfly Queen hovers over the meadow further east, on the way to Yala."] = "原始风石闪光在领地就在树林以南。卷云蝇女王盘旋越过草地更远处东，在途中前往雅拉·观风者。",
	["The Red, Crimson and Flamesnorting Whelps (levels 23-26) in the eastern Wetlands drop it about once in 600-1,600 kills in our data."] = "红色，深红与喷火雏龙（23-26级）在东部湿地掉落它约一次在600-1,600击杀在我们的数据。",
	["The Riverglades lie east of the Badlands and the Burning Steppes: the way in is the fork east off the Redridge Mountains road (a ship also runs from Tanaris to Powderfuse Port, the neutral goblin port on its coast). Krol'dok Stronghold is an ogre clan's outdoor dungeon."] = "河间林地位于东的荒芜之地与燃烧平原：路在是岔路口东偏离/关闭赤脊山道路（一个船也通往来自塔纳利斯前往引线港，中立地精港口在它的海岸）。克罗多克要塞是一个食人魔氏族的户外地下城。",
	["The Rock Elementals roam south-east of Lotwil; Giant Buzzards and Elder Crag Coyotes share the plain to their west."] = "磐石元素游荡在洛特维尔以东南；巨型秃鹫与老峭壁山狗共享平原前往它们的西。",
	["The Rot Hide Graverobbers dig through the graveyards north of Brill; all the Rot Hides drop the ichor."] = "腐皮盗墓贼挖掘穿过墓地在布瑞尔以北；全部腐烂藏身掉落脓液。",
	["The Rot Hide Mongrels hold the hills further north. Maggot Eye (level 11) stands in their camp on the hill south of the shore: clear the gnolls around him first."] = "混血腐皮豺狼人要塞丘陵更远处北。蛆眼（11级）位于它们的营地在山丘在岸边以南：清理豺狼人周围他第一。",
	["The Salty Sailor Tavern is the tall building over the harbour; most of the quest givers are on its floors or the docks below."] = "咸水海员旅店是高大建筑越过港口；大多数的任务发布者是在它的楼层或码头下方。",
	["The Sapphires grow on the rocks at the far north end of the strand, by the Blackfathom Deeps ruins."] = "蓝宝石生长在岩石在远处北尽头的海滩，在旁黑暗深渊废墟。",
	["The Savannah Prowlers hunt the plains between town and the Razormane camp to the east. In the camp, Water Seekers and Thornweavers hold the western half, Hunters the middle; the supply crates sit at its eastern end."] = "草原徘徊者狩猎平原之间城镇与刺鬃营地向东。在营地里，水搜寻者迪亚索鲁斯与织棘者要塞西部一半，猎人中间；补给木箱坐在它的东部尽头。",
	["The Scalding Whelps nest in the ravine east of Garek; leave the Scorched Guardians (elite) alone. The Black Drake's Heart drops rarely: take it if it comes while you grind."] = "滚烫的雏龙巢在深谷在加瑞克以东；跳过烈焰守护者（精英）独自。黑色幼龙之心掉落极少：接取它如果它来自当你刷怪。",
	["The Scarlet Converts and Initiates hold the farm east of Deathknell. Samuel Fipps wanders between the farmhouses: his remains are for Marla's Last Wish."] = "血色信徒与新兵要塞农场在丧钟镇以东。塞缪尔·菲普斯游荡之间农舍：他的遗骸是给玛拉的遗愿。",
	["The Scarlet Crusade's tents stand between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears. Torch the command tent with the Box of Incendiaries and plant the Scourge banner."] = "血色十字军的帐篷位于费尔斯通农场与达尔松之泪之间。火炬指挥帐篷与燃烧弹箱与植物天灾军团旗帜。",
	["The Scarlet Friars camp just north-east of the graves; Captain Vachon stands among them."] = "血色苦行修士营地就在坟墓以东北；瓦松队长位于其中：它们。",
	["The Scarlet Medics, Hunters, Knights and Mages patrol the lumber camp and the road toward Hearthglen."] = "血色医护员，猎人，骑士与法师巡逻于伐木场营地与道路朝壁炉谷方向。",
	["The Scorpashi scorpids hunt the hills around Kormek's Hut on the road south."] = "斯科帕什蝎子狩猎丘陵在考米克小屋周围在路上南。",
	["The Scourge around Corin's Crossing, west of the chapel, drop both kinds of Scourgestone; Darrowshire Spirits rise from them: talk to each one to free it."] = "天灾军团在考林路口周围，在礼拜堂以西，掉落两个种类的天灾石；达罗郡的幽灵高地来自它们：对话前往每个1前往解救它。",
	["The Scrying Bowl"] = "占卜之碗",
	["The Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays wash along the shore around the dock."] = "海元素与巨型海元素冲上沿着岸边在码头周围。",
	["The Searing Whelps of the Wyrmbog in southern Dustwallow Marsh (level 42) and the Scalding Whelps of eastern Badlands (level 41) drop it about once in 900 kills in our data. The waypoint is the Wyrmbog; the Badlands whelps are the same grind."] = "灼热雏龙的巨龙沼泽在南部尘泥沼泽（42级）与滚烫的雏龙的东部荒芜之地（41级）掉落它约一次在900击杀在我们的数据。路径点是巨龙沼泽；荒芜之地雏龙是相同刷怪。",
	["The Seer stands on the south side of Thunder Axe Fortress, east of Ethel Rethor. Clear the cultists around it first."] = "先知位于雷斧堡垒的南侧，在艾瑟雷索以东。清理邪教徒周围它第一。",
	["The Sepulcher is the Forsaken crypt-town in the middle of the forest. Everyone you need stands around the crypt entrance; Karos Razok, the bat handler, is just east of it."] = "瑟伯切尔是被遗忘者地穴-城镇在森林的中央。所有人你需要位于地穴入口周围；卡洛斯·拉佐克，蝙蝠管理员，是就在它东面。",
	["The Sewer Beast is a rare level 50 crocolisk that swims Stormwind's canals; early kill counts give about 1.5% per kill. It is friendly to nobody: Horde players can farm it too, but they are in an enemy capital."] = "下水道野兽是一个稀有50级鳄鱼该游动暴风城的运河；早期击杀计入交给约1.5%每击杀。它是友善前往无人：部落玩家可以农场它也，但它们是在一个敌人主城。",
	["The Shadethicket Oracle walks the shore of Fallen Sky Lake, south-west of the chests."] = "沼泽兽智者步行岸边的坠星湖，在箱子以西南。",
	["The Shadowforge dwarves camp just north of the digsite; the crumpled map lies among their tents. Tunnelers and Darkweavers carry Ryedol's pick. Crag Coyotes roam the slopes around it."] = "暗炉战士矮人营地就在挖掘场以北；揉皱的地图位于其中：它们的帐篷。暗炉隧道工与暗织者携带勘察员雷杜尔的拾取。峭壁山狗游荡于山坡周围它。",
	["The Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) stalk the jungle east of the Mosh'Ogg hills and north-east towards the lake; they strike from stealth. Loot every Green Hills page you find on the way."] = "深喉猎豹（37-38）潜伏丛林东的莫什奥格丘陵与东北朝湖方向；它们打击来自潜行。拾取每个荆棘谷的青山书页你寻找在途中。",
	["The Shrine of Akir is north of Valanaar. Fight through the guards up to Hyusaa Quickbreeze at its east side."] = "阿基尔神殿是在瓦拉纳尔以北。迎战穿过卫兵上前往休萨·疾风在它的东一侧。",
	["The Sickly and Haggard Refugees shamble along the road south of Pyrewood toward the Greymane Wall."] = "病态的与哈迦德难民蹒跚游荡沿着道路在焚木村以南朝向格雷迈恩之墙。",
	["The Silvermane Stalkers, Savage Owlbeasts and Razorbeak Skylords share the hills between the temples and Skulk Rock. Use the Wildkin Muisek Vessel on the owlbeasts you kill. The Skylords also drop Long Elegant Feathers: keep ten for Otho's second message."] = "银鬃捕猎者，野蛮的枭兽与翱翔的锋喙狮鹫共享丘陵在神庙与隐匿石之间。使用枭兽灵魂精华容器在枭兽你击杀。天空领主也掉落细长的狮鹫羽毛：保留10给奥索·莫吉克的第二口信。",
	["The Silverwing Sentinels are the Night Elves holding Warsong Gulch. Their reputation comes from the battleground: every enemy flag your team captures pays it to the whole team. Queue at any battlemaster. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "银翼哨兵是暗夜精灵持有战歌峡谷。它们的声望来自战场：每个敌人旗帜你的队伍占领奖励它前往整个队伍。排队在任意战场军官。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["The Skullsplitter trolls hold the ruins east of the road between Nesingwary and Grom'gol."] = "碎颅巨魔要塞废墟在道路之间以东赫米特·奈辛瓦里二世与格罗姆高。",
	["The Skullsplitter trolls hold the ruins just east of the mine; any of them can drop tusks, their panthers always do."] = "碎颅巨魔要塞废墟就在采矿以东；任意的它们可以掉落长牙，它们的豹总是做。",
	["The Slag Pit opens in the north of the Cauldron. Incendosaurs swim in its lava pools: pull them to the edge. The secret plans lie on the pit's upper ledge."] = "熔渣之池开启在大锅以北。熏火龙游泳在它的熔岩水池：拉怪它们前往边缘。秘密的图纸位于深坑的上层岩架。",
	["The Slag Pit opens in the north of the Cauldron. The Secret Plans lie on its upper ledge; Incendosaurs swim in the lava pools further in, so pull them to the edge. Stay clear of Overseer Maltorius and his elite guards deep inside."] = "熔渣之池开启在大锅以北。机密计划位于它的上层岩架；熏火龙游泳在熔岩水池更远处在，因此拉怪它们前往边缘。留在清理的工头玛托留斯与他的精英卫兵深处内部。",
	["The Slaughtered Lamb is in the Mage Quarter."] = "已宰的羔羊是在法师区。",
	["The Slayers hold the western end of the Dry Hills, past the harpies you fought before; they drop the rings."] = "黑石杀戮者要塞西部尽头的枯水谷，经过鹰身人你战斗之前；它们掉落戒指。",
	["The Slitherblade naga hold the coast north of Ethel Rethor, up to Sar'theris Strand. Lord Kragaru guards the Book of the Ancients at the far northern tip."] = "滑刃纳迦要塞海岸在艾瑟雷索以北，上前往萨瑟里斯海岸。科拉加鲁卫兵上古之书在远处北部尖端。",
	["The Snapjaw turtles bask along the river east of Southshore, south of Tarren Mill (Horde)."] = "钳嘴龟海龟晒太阳沿着河流在南海镇以东，在塔伦米尔以南（部落）。",
	["The Spitelash naga of the Ruins of Eldarath carry Some Rune. Tymor's four runes stand among the ruins: use his Drawing Kit on each."] = "怨灵纳迦的埃达拉斯废墟携带一些符文。法师泰摩尔的4前往位于其中：废墟：使用他的绘图工具包在每个。",
	["The Stockade: the usual last kill; the Stockade has no fixed final boss"] = "监狱：通常的最后击杀；监狱有无固定的最终首领",
	["The Stone Circle is in Ratchet"] = "石环是在棘齿城",
	["The Stonefield farm is west of the mine. Ma and \"Auntie\" Bernice stand by the house."] = "斯通菲尔德农场是在采矿以西。妈与 \"伯母\" 伯妮斯站在旁边：房屋。",
	["The Stonetalon Mountains border Ashenvale to the south-west; Stonetalon Peak in the north is the Alliance flight point."] = "石爪山脉边界灰谷向西南；石爪峰在北面是联盟飞行点。",
	["The Stonevault troggs dig around the cave mouths south of the Valley of Fangs, on the way to Agmond's End; the Bonesnappers and Shamans drop the flakes."] = "石窖穴居人挖掘在洞穴嘴南的周围巨牙谷，在途中前往埃格蒙德的营地；折骨者与萨满祭司掉落薄片。",
	["The Stormpike Guard holds Dun Baldar in the north of Alterac Valley. Destroying towers, taking graveyards and mines, and killing captains and generals all pay reputation to the whole team. Loot Armor Scraps from fallen enemies for Murgot Deepforge. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "雷矛卫队持有丹巴达尔在奥特兰克山谷以北。摧毁哨塔，接取墓地与矿洞，与击杀队长与将军全部奖励声望前往整个队伍。拾取护甲碎片来自阵亡的敌人给莫高特·深炉。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["The Strange Hermit lives west of Elegael. The Zephyrseed Cones lie in the woods between his hut and Elegael."] = "奇怪的隐士住在艾蕾盖尔·棘爪以西。微风之种松果位于树林之间他的小屋与艾蕾盖尔·棘爪。",
	["The Strange Lockbox lies at the north edge of the Sludge Fen, by the Venture Co. tower. It holds the Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility for Trial of the Sea Lion."] = "奇怪的保险箱位于北边缘的淤泥沼泽，在旁风险投资公司哨塔。它持有水兽敏捷坠饰给海狮试炼。",
	["The Strange Lockbox lies on the coast west of the Dead Field. It holds the Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance for Trial of the Sea Lion."] = "奇怪的保险箱位于海岸边西的死去的教徒奥斯莱特元帅。它持有水兽耐力坠饰给海狮试炼。",
	["The Strider Clutchmother is a rare level 20 tallstrider in southern Darkshore; early kill counts give about 0.6% per kill, so expect many respawns."] = "雌性森林陆行鸟是一个稀有20级高地陆行鸟在南部黑海岸；早期击杀计入交给约0.6%每击杀，因此预计许多刷新。",
	["The Summon Charger chain is long and needs Scholomance. After this hand-off, Lord Grayson sends you on Emphasis on Sacrifice (High Priest Rohan in Ironforge), To Show Due Judgment and Exorcising Terrordale (25 Terrordale Spirits), The Work of Grimand Elmore (Collection of Goods: 40 Runecloth, 6 Arcanite Bars, 10 Arthas' Tears, 5 Stratholme Holy Water), Ancient Equine Spirit (Manna-Enriched Horse Feed from Merideth Carlson in Southshore), The Divination Scryer (an Azerothian Diamond and a Pristine Black Diamond) and Judgment and Redemption, which ends with Darkreaver's Fallen Charger in Scholomance."] = "召唤战马任务链是长与需要通灵学院。之后此上交-偏离/关闭，领主格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵派往你在牺牲精神（高阶牧师洛汉在铁炉堡），圣骑士的审判与恐惧谷的灵魂（25恐惧谷的灵魂），格瑞曼德·艾尔默（收集材料：40符文布，6奥金锭，10 Arthas的眼泪，5斯坦索姆圣水），上古圣马之魂（魔法粮草来自梅丽德丝·卡尔森在南海镇），预言水晶球（一个艾泽拉斯钻石与一个原始黑钻石）与审判和救赎，其中终结于达克雷尔的堕落战马在通灵学院。",
	["The Summon Dreadsteed chain is long and needs Dire Maul. After this hand-off: Rage of Blood (30 Raging Beast's Blood), Wildeyes, Lord Banehollow in Felwood, Ulathek the Traitor, Xorothian Stardust, Bell of Dethmoora (10 Elixir of Shadow Power), Wheel of the Black March (6 Large Brilliant Shards, 25 Dark Iron Ore), Doomsday Candle (35 Black Dragonscales), Arcanite (3 Arcanite Bars), Imp Delivery (J'eevee) and Dreadsteed of Xoroth, the ritual in Dire Maul."] = "召唤恐惧战马任务链是长与需要厄运之槌。之后此上交-偏离/关闭：血之狂暴（30狂暴野兽的血），戈瑟奇·邪眼，魔王贝恩霍勒在费伍德森林，背叛者乌拉泰克，克索诺斯星尘，达斯莫拉之铃（10暗影之力药剂），黑暗战车之轮（6大块魔光碎片，25黑铁矿石），末日蜡烛（35黑龙鳞片），奥金锭（3奥金锭），瓶中的小鬼（耶维尔）与克索诺斯恐惧战马，仪式在厄运之槌。",
	["The Syndicate Footpads and Thieves (32-33) around the camps west of the road carry the missives; about one in three drops one."] = "辛迪加劫匪与盗贼（32-33）在扎营周围在道路携带密信以西；约1在3掉落1。",
	["The Syndicate camp sits on the Alterac border in northern Hillsbrad, west of Tarren Mill (Horde); the documents lie in the camp."] = "辛迪加营地位于奥特兰克边界在北部希尔斯布莱德，在塔伦米尔以西（部落）；文件位于营地里。",
	["The Syndicate hold the farm north-west of Refuge Pointe."] = "辛迪加要塞农场在避难谷地以西北。",
	["The Syndicate hold the walled manor and its farm in the north-west; their Highwaymen, Mercenaries and Pathstalkers carry the Bloodstone Amulets."] = "辛迪加要塞有围墙的庄园与它的农场在西北面；它们的拦路强盗，恐怖图腾佣兵与巡路者携带血石护符。",
	["The Talondeep Path tunnel in eastern Stonetalon leads north into Ashenvale. Splintertree Post and Zoram'gar Outpost are Horde; Astranaar is Alliance."] = "石爪小径隧道在东部石爪山脉通往北进入灰谷。碎木岗哨与佐拉姆加前哨站是部落；阿斯特兰纳是联盟。",
	["The Thunderhead Hippogryphs fly over the hills just south of Valormok."] = "雷首角鹰兽飞往越过丘陵就在瓦罗莫克以南。",
	["The Tool Buckets sit around the Venture Co. camp in the Sludge Fen, east of Wenikee."] = "工具桶坐周围风险投资公司营地在淤泥沼泽，在维妮·布特巴克以东。",
	["The Torn Fin murlocs crowd the Western Strand, south-west of Southshore."] = "破鳍鱼人怪群西部海滩，在南海镇以西南。",
	["The Twilight Tome"] = "暮光密典",
	["The Twilight's Hammer dig fills the north-west corner: tablet fragments lie on the ground and the Dust Stormers and Desert Rumblers carry them too. Every cultist can drop an Encrypted Twilight Text: keep twenty, ten for Bor Wildmane and ten for Hermit Ortell later."] = "暮光之锤挖掘装满西北角落：石板碎片位于领地与尘暴者与沙漠奔腾者携带它们也。每个邪教徒可以掉落一个暮光密文信：保留20，10给鲍尔·蛮鬃与10给隐士奥泰尔稍后。",
	["The Undercity has no Hunter or Shaman trainer: take the Orgrimmar zeppelin from the same tower instead and train in the city, then take the Undercity zeppelin from the tower outside Orgrimmar's main gate."] = "幽暗城有无猎人或萨满祭司训练师：接取奥格瑞玛飞艇来自相同哨塔代替与训练在主城，然后接取幽暗城飞艇来自哨塔在奥格瑞玛的外主大门。",
	["The Undercity is under the Ruins of Lordaeron, beside the zeppelin towers. Carendin Halgar is in the Magic Quarter: use the Runes of Summoning on the summoning circle beside him and defeat the voidwalker. Aelthalyste is in the War Quarter."] = "幽暗城是在下方洛丹伦废墟，在飞艇哨塔旁边。凯伦丁·哈加尔是在魔法区：使用召唤符文在召唤法阵旁边他与击败虚空行者。艾萨莱斯特是在军事区。",
	["The Undercity's flight master is in the Trade Quarter's west tower, outside the walls."] = "幽暗城的飞行管理员是在贸易区的西哨塔，在城墙外。",
	["The Unguarded Thunder Ale Barrel in the distillery"] = "无人守卫的雷霆麦芽酒桶在酿酒厂",
	["The Ursera den is west of the village. Urs'anah, their matriarch, sits at its far end."] = "乌尔塞拉兽穴是在村庄以西。乌尔萨娜，它们的主母，位于它的远处尽头。",
	["The Valley of Trials opens onto Durotar; Razor Hill is north along the road."] = "试炼谷通向杜隆塔尔；剃刀岭是北沿着道路。",
	["The Venture Co. Overseers and Enforcers at the mine in the north-east corner of the zone drop the Cats Eye Emerald."] = "风险投资公司监工与石拳执行者在采矿在东北面角落的区域掉落猫眼翡翠。",
	["The Venture Co. clear the forest of Windshear Crag. Loggers and Deforesters work all over it; the Operators run the shredders and one carries the blueprints."] = "风险投资公司清理森林的狂风峭壁。伐木工与砍伐者有效全部越过它；操作员鲁格伦克前往伐木机与1携带蓝图。",
	["The Videre Elixir comes from Gregan Brewspewer in Feralas, later in this guide."] = "视灵药剂来自格雷甘·山酒在菲拉斯，在本指南稍后阶段。",
	["The Vile Fin Lakestalkers and Oracles sit on the lake shore south of the Decrepit Ferry, east of the Sepulcher."] = "邪鳍巡湖者与神谕者坐在湖岸边南的破旧渡口，东的瑟伯切尔。",
	["The Vile Fin murlocs line the north shore."] = "邪鳍鱼人路线北岸边。",
	["The WANTED poster"] = "通缉通缉令",
	["The WANTED poster by the inn"] = "通缉通缉令在旅店旁",
	["The WANTED poster outside the inn"] = "通缉通缉令在旅店外",
	["The Wanted poster beside Cliffwatcher"] = "通缉通缉令在峭壁卫兵图林·长角旁边",
	["The Wanted poster beside him"] = "通缉通缉令旁边他",
	["The Wanted poster by Security Chief Bilgewhizzle"] = "通缉通缉令在旁安全主管吉罗姆·比格维兹",
	["The Wanted poster by the inn"] = "通缉通缉令在旅店旁",
	["The Wanted poster by the inn: Lieutenant Fangore, in Galardell Valley"] = "通缉通缉令在旅店旁：范高雷中尉，在加拉德尔山谷",
	["The Wanted/Missing/Lost & Found board"] = "通缉/失踪/失物招领告示板",
	["The Warpwood treants of Irontree Woods, east of Jadefire Run, carry the Blood Amber."] = "扭木树人的铁木森林，在碧火小径以东，携带血琥珀。",
	["The Warsong Outrider patrols the road east of Night Run toward the Satyrnaar."] = "战歌侦查骑兵巡逻于道路在夜道谷以东朝向萨提纳尔。",
	["The Warsong Outriders are the Orcs logging Ashenvale. Their reputation comes from the battleground: every enemy flag your team captures pays it to the whole team. Queue at any battlemaster. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "战歌氏族是兽人伐木灰谷。它们的声望来自战场：每个敌人旗帜你的队伍占领奖励它前往整个队伍。排队在任意战场军官。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["The Waterlogged Saw, Axe and Toolbox lie in the river south of the bridge. Princess, a big boar, roots in the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch west of the river with her Porcine Entourage: pull the piglets away first. Kill Prowlers and Young Forest Bears on the way."] = "浸水的锯子，斧与工具箱位于河流在桥以南。公主，一个大野猪，根茎在布拉克威尔南瓜田在河流与她的以西公主的随从：拉怪小猪离开第一。击杀觅食的灰狼与森林幼熊在途中。",
	["The Webwood Eggs lie at the back of Shadowthread Cave. Hyacinth Mushrooms drop from Grells, Moonpetal Lilies grow by the ponds north of Aldrassil."] = "树林蜘蛛的卵位于阴丝洞的后方。紫蓝色蘑菇掉落来自小劣魔，月牙百合花生长在旁池塘在奥达希尔以北。",
	["The Windfury harpies hold Windfury Ridge, north and west of the well."] = "风怒唤风者鹰身人要塞狂风山，北与在水井以西。",
	["The Windstone Formations stand on the rise west of Fillion's camp."] = "风石阵位于高地在菲利奥·焰风的以西营地。",
	["The Winterfall furbolg village lies east of Everlook: Shaman (56-57), Den Watchers (55-56) and Ursa (57-58), all above you. Kill the Shaman first, they heal, and pull from the edge. High Chief Winterfall in the cave at the back is elite: stay out."] = "寒冬熊怪村庄位于永望镇以东：萨满祭司（56-57），兽穴守夜人道茨（55-56）与木喉巨熊怪（57-58），全部上方你。击杀萨满祭司第一，它们治疗，与拉怪来自边缘。冬泉酋长在洞穴内在返回为精英：留在出。",
	["The Witchwing Slayers hold the western Dry Hills; they wear the rings."] = "巫翼杀戮者要塞西部枯水谷；它们佩戴戒指。",
	["The Witherbark trolls hold the village in the south-eastern hills. Axe Throwers guard the outer huts; the Witch Doctors and Headhunters hold the heart of the village."] = "枯木巨魔要塞村庄在南面-东部丘陵。斧投掷者守卫外侧小屋；女巫医生与猎头者要塞心脏的村庄。",
	["The Witherbark trolls live in the hills south of Go'Shek Farm; Witch Doctors stand in the village, Shadow Hunters guard the far end of the valley."] = "枯木巨魔实测在丘陵在格沙克农场以南；女巫医生位于村子里，暗影猎人守卫远处尽头的山谷。",
	["The Woodpaw gnolls camp in the hills just north-west of Mojache; any of them can drop a mane."] = "木爪豺狼人扎营于丘陵就在莫沙彻营地以西北；任意的它们可以掉落一个鬃毛。",
	["The Wyrmbog"] = "巨龙沼泽",
	["The Zukk'ash hive burrows into the hills south-east of the camp; Stinglasher waits in its deepest chamber."] = "祖卡什虫巢洞穴进入丘陵在营地以东南；毒刺鞭笞者等候于它的最深处密室。",
	["The adult tigers prowl the hills just south and west of the camp."] = "成年虎游荡丘陵就在南与在营地以西。",
	["The ammo crate sits in the Frostmane camp on Shimmer Ridge; Hegnar Rumbleshot camps south of it, by the road to Coldridge."] = "弹药木箱位于霜鬃先知营地在闪光岭；海格纳·重枪扎营在它南面，在路边前往寒脊山谷。",
	["The apprentices practise north-east of the village."] = "学徒练习在村庄以东北。",
	["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item."] = "箭头会自动指向最近的一位商人的你的阵营给每个物品。",
	["The bandit camps are north-east of the village; \"Badwind\" Bennic holds the top camp. Bandits carry the stolen windstones."] = "强盗扎营是在村庄以东北；“恶风”本尼克持有顶部营地。强盗携带被盗的风石。",
	["The bandits and thieves camp in the dunes east of Gadgetzan. Every Wastewander can carry a water pouch: keep ten, five for each of Luglunket's bounties."] = "强盗与盗贼扎营于沙丘在加基森以东。每个废土窃贼可以携带一个水袋子：保留10，5给每个的操作员鲁格伦克的悬赏。",
	["The barrow is south of the road. Sentinel Lynessa Duskblossom is held inside, Oben Rageclaw sleeps in its depths, and the four relic chests sit in the lower rooms."] = "兽穴是在道路以南。哨兵莉妮莎·暮花是持有内部，奥本·怒爪沉睡于在它的深渊，与4圣物箱子坐在下层房间。",
	["The battered skeleton lies at the edge of the Stonevault trogg camp; Murdaloc, Agmond's killer, walks among the Bonesnappers."] = "破损的骷髅位于边缘的石窟断骨者穴居人营地；莫达洛克，阿格蒙德的杀手，步行在其中：折骨者。",
	["The battered skeleton lies just east of the ogres, at the edge of the Stonevault trogg camp; the Bonesnappers and Shamans around it drop the flakes. Theldurin sits by the ruined camp further south."] = "破损的骷髅位于就在食人魔以东，在边缘的石窟断骨者穴居人营地；折骨者与萨满祭司周围它掉落薄片。迷失者塞尔杜林位于毁坏的营地更远处南。",
	["The battle map lies in the Woodpaw camp south of Mojache."] = "战斗地图位于木爪营地在莫沙彻营地以南。",
	["The bears roam the hills north and east of the Writhing Haunt."] = "熊游荡于丘陵北与东的蠕行之祸。",
	["The big turtles crawl along the beaches north of the village. Whiskey Slim's port bottles lie on these beaches too, but his quest is not on this route. A snapjaw can drop OOX-09/HL's distress beacon, rarely: keep it."] = "大海龟爬行沿着海滩在村庄以北。威士忌斯利姆的港口瓶子位于这些海滩也，但他的任务是不在本路线内。一个钳嘴龟可以掉落 OOX-09/HL型定位器的求救信标，极少：请保留该任务/物品。",
	["The bigger Rock Elementals stand on the slopes north-west of the Dustbowl; each one drops a slab."] = "更大岩石元素位于山坡西北的尘风盆地；每个1掉落一个石板。",
	["The bigger raptors hunt in the valley just west of the dig."] = "更大迅猛龙狩猎在山谷就在挖掘以西。",
	["The blood elves camp on the cliffs in the north-east, by the Bay of Storms."] = "血液精灵营地在悬崖在东北面，在旁风暴海湾。",
	["The blood elves' camp lies just south of Kim'jael. His four pieces of equipment lie in the crates around the camp."] = "血液精灵的营地位于就在基姆加尔以南。他的4碎片的装备位于木箱在营地周围。",
	["The bloodmages' second tier pays for the same parts with a buff item and no experience: skip it."] = "血法师的第二阶段奖励给相同零件与一个增益物品与无经验值：跳过即可。",
	["The boat docks west of the village. The flight master stands on the hill south of the inn; the quest givers are spread along the main street."] = "船码头在村庄以西。飞行管理员位于山丘在旅店以南；任务发布者是分布沿着主街道。",
	["The boat lands in Booty Bay's harbour. The quest givers stand on the boardwalks around the harbour and in the inn."] = "船之地在藏宝海湾的港口。任务发布者位于木栈道在港口与在旅店周围。",
	["The boat to Booty Bay docks at Ratchet's pier, below the flight master's hill."] = "船前往藏宝海湾码头在棘齿城的栈桥，下方飞行管理员的山丘。",
	["The boat to Booty Bay docks at the end of Ratchet's pier."] = "船前往藏宝海湾码头在棘齿城的端栈桥。",
	["The book lies in the ruined inn of Terrordale."] = "书位于毁坏的旅店的恐惧谷。",
	["The bounty board"] = "悬赏告示板",
	["The burned inn stands on the road west, toward the Barrens; the guard's badge lies in the ashes and the hoofprints are in the mud beside the inn."] = "烧焦的旅店位于路上西，朝向贫瘠之地；守卫的徽章位于灰烬与蹄印是在泥地在旅店旁边。",
	["The camp is at Three Corners in western Redridge Mountains, between Elwynn Forest and Lakeshire. Loot supply crates in the world, fill them, and hand them in at the camp for Merchant's Favor (5-20 a crate); the Pack Kodo costs 6,000. Craftsman's Writs may help from level 10."] = "营地是在三角路口在西部赤脊山，在艾尔文森林与湖畔镇之间。拾取补给木箱在世界，装满它们，与上交它们在营地给商人的青睐（5-20一个木箱）；打包科多兽花费6,000。工匠威尔海姆的文书可能帮助来自10级。",
	["The camp is just outside the Crossroads in the Barrens. Loot supply crates in the world, fill them, and hand them in at the camp for Merchant's Favor (5-20 a crate); the Pack Kodo costs 6,000. Craftsman's Writs may help from level 10."] = "营地是就在外部十字路口在贫瘠之地。拾取补给木箱在世界，装满它们，与上交它们在营地给商人的青睐（5-20一个木箱）；打包科多兽花费6,000。工匠威尔海姆的文书可能帮助来自10级。",
	["The camp is north-east of the bridge. Bundles of Wood lie around the camp and in the woods north of it."] = "营地是在桥以东北。木柴堆位于营地与在树林周围在它北面。",
	["The captain walks the deck of the wrecked ship; his strongbox sits in the hold."] = "队长步行甲板的失事的船；他的保险箱位于要塞。",
	["The captains stand on the ships anchored off the Wild Shore, each with a crew of 42-45 pirates: Stillwater (45) and Keelhaul (46) on the nearer decks, Fleet Master Firallon (48) on the flagship. At 42 this is a fight for a group or for the end of the guide; clear each deck first if you go. Cortello's scroll lies on the wreck by the shore."] = "队长位于船只停泊的偏离/关闭狂野海岸，每个与一个船员的42-45海盗：静水（45）与拖行刑（46）在更靠近甲板，舰队指挥官菲尔拉伦（48）在旗舰。在42此是一个迎战需要组队完成或给尽头的指南；清理每个甲板第一如果你前往。科特罗的卷轴位于残骸在旁岸边。",
	["The caravan ends at Smeed's camp on the east side of the Kodo Graveyard."] = "商队终结于斯米德的营地在东一侧的科多兽坟场。",
	["The caravan rolls south past Kolkar Village. Kolkar raiders ambush it in waves: kill them before they reach Cork. It stops by Scrabblescrew's Camp, east of Ghost Walker Post."] = "商队滚动南经过科尔卡村。科卡尔劫掠者伏击它在波次：击杀它们之前它们抵达考克·基泽尔顿。它停靠在旁瑟卡布斯库的营地，在幽灵岗哨以东。",
	["The cattails and speargrass grow along the water in the Valley of Honor, east of the Drag."] = "香蒲与矛草生长沿着水在荣誉谷，东的暗巷区。",
	["The cauldron now offers its own task; the skeletons around it drop Osseous Agitators."] = "大锅现在提供它的自己的任务；骷髅周围它掉落骨质分离素。",
	["The cauldron sits at Dalson's Tears, north-east of Felstone; its Cauldron Lord stands beside it."] = "大锅位于达尔松之泪，在詹妮丝·费尔斯通以东北；它的大锅领主站在旁边：它。",
	["The cauldron sits at the Writhing Haunt, by Mulgris' farm."] = "大锅位于蠕行之祸，在旁穆格雷斯·深水的农场。",
	["The cave in the hill just west of Dolanaar. Lord Melenas waits at the back."] = "洞穴在山丘就在多兰纳尔以西。迈雷纳斯等候于返回。",
	["The cave lies south of the falls: Scaber Stalks grow all through it, the Death Cap at the very back. The Den Mother lairs in the hills south of the falls; Xabraxxis' Demon Bag lies at the satyr camp north of her."] = "洞穴位于坠落以南：粗柄蘑菇生长全部穿过它，毒帽蘑菇在非常返回。大兽穴主母巢穴在丘陵在坠落以南；萨巴克希斯的恶魔背包位于萨特营地在她北面。",
	["The cemetery lies north of the village. Skeletal Horrors and Skeletal Fiends walk its southern half. Mor'Ladim, an elite, wanders the graves: keep away from him."] = "墓园位于村庄以北。恐怖骸骨与骸骨魔步行它的南部一半。摩拉迪姆，一个精英，游荡坟墓：保留离开来自他。",
	["The cheese shop in the Trade District."] = "奶酪商店在贸易区。",
	["The chest lies in the ruins south-west of Nijel's Point."] = "箱子位于废墟中在尼耶尔前哨站以西南。",
	["The chimaeras roam the snowfields south and west of Everlook. Stay clear of Mazthoril's cave: its blue dragonkin are elite."] = "奇美拉游荡于雪原南与在永望镇以西。留在清理的麦索瑞尔的洞穴：它的蓝色龙类为精英。",
	["The clams lie on Stranglethorn's north-west coast, in the next guide: keep it"] = "蚌壳位于荆棘谷的西北海岸，在下一份指南中：请保留该任务/物品",
	["The class trainers stand together in the grove"] = "职业训练师位于一起在树林",
	["The courier walks the road west of Go'Shek Farm with two guards; pull them off the road."] = "信使步行道路在格沙克农场以西与2卫兵；拉怪它们道路两侧。",
	["The crates of Hinterlands Honey Ripple lie around the abandoned Horde camp at Skulk Rock, among the oozes."] = "木箱的辛特兰蜜糖位于废弃的周围部落扎营于隐匿石，在其中：软泥怪。",
	["The crates of grapes lie in the vineyards behind the Defias. Garrick Padfoot waits by the cabin at the east end of the valley."] = "木箱的葡萄位于葡萄园后面迪菲亚。加瑞克·帕德弗特等候于船舱在山谷的东端。",
	["The crawlers scuttle along the shore south-west of town."] = "爬行者爬行沿着岸边在城镇西南面。",
	["The crocolisks wallow in the pools around Galen's camp and south towards Stonard; about one in four drops a flank."] = "鳄鱼打滚在水池在加林·古瓦德的周围营地与南朝斯通纳德方向；约1在4掉落一个侧翼。",
	["The crystal clusters stand all over the crater, many around Fire Plume Ridge. Take a few extra of each colour for the pylons."] = "水晶簇位于全部越过环形山，许多在火羽山周围。接取一个少量额外的每个颜色给水晶塔。",
	["The dead Threshadon lies by the water north of Torwa."] = "死亡的蛇颈龙位于旁水在托尔瓦以北。",
	["The demons gather at the Mannoroc Coven in southern Desolace: felhounds (Mana Eaters, Mage and Ley Hunters), Nether Maidens and Sisters, and Doomwarder Captains around the pit."] = "恶魔采集在玛诺洛克集会所在南部凄凉之地：地狱犬（噬法魔犬，法师与灵能猎犬），地狱魔女与姐妹，与末日看守队长在深坑周围。",
	["The deserters camp south of the road, west of Mudcrush's hut."] = "逃兵营地在道路以南，在马德克拉什的以西小屋。",
	["The diary lies in the farmhouse, the cabinet stands inside and the outhouse is behind it. A Wandering Skeleton carries the outhouse key; Farmer Dalson comes out when you open the outhouse and carries the cabinet key."] = "日记位于农舍，橱柜位于内部与户外厕所是后面它。一个游荡的骷髅携带户外厕所钥匙；农夫达尔松来自出当你打开/开启户外厕所与携带橱柜钥匙。",
	["The doll's head and its two sides lie in the houses around Pamela; join them from your bags."] = "人偶的前往与它的2两侧位于房屋在帕米拉周围；加入它们来自你的背包。",
	["The driftwood washes up along the eastern shore."] = "浮木冲上上沿着东部岸边。",
	["The druid trainers stand in the Enclave; Ironforge has none"] = "德鲁伊训练师位于飞地；铁炉堡有无",
	["The druids' camp is just past the border."] = "德鲁伊的营地是就在经过边界。",
	["The dwarf stands by the road at the dig site. Follow him north along the road and fight off the Dark Iron ambushes. When it is over, read the Singed Letter he leaves on the road in Dustfire Valley."] = "矮人位于路边在挖掘地点。沿着他北沿着道路与迎战偏离/关闭黑铁矿伏击。当它是越过，阅读烧焦的信件他离开在路上在尘火谷。",
	["The dwarves of the Bael'dun Digsite carry the Prospector's Picks. Smash them at the forge in Bloodhoof Village."] = "矮人的巴尔丹挖掘场携带勘察员的锄头。砸碎它们在锻炉在血蹄村。",
	["The dwarves' flying machine sits on its platform inside the dig site."] = "矮人的飞行的机器位于它的平台在挖掘地点内。",
	["The elder tigers come later, on the way back from the Rebel Camp"] = "长者/老年虎来到稍后，在返回途中来自反抗军营地",
	["The excavation site sits on the hill south of the road."] = "挖掘场地点位于山丘在道路以南。",
	["The expedition's crate sits at an abandoned camp in the eastern jungle."] = "远征队的木箱位于一个废弃的扎营于东部丛林。",
	["The expedition's lost equipment lies in the south-west jungle."] = "远征队的遗失的装备位于西南面丛林。",
	["The faerie dragons flit around the woods just west of the camp. Use the vessel on each one you kill."] = "精灵龙飞掠在树林周围就在营地以西。使用容器在每个1你击杀。",
	["The farms east of Hillsbrad town. Farmer Ray works the field by the northern farmhouse, Farmer Getz the one further south-east; Farmhands and Farmers are everywhere. Farmer Kalaba tends the field south of the farms."] = "农场在希尔斯布莱德以东城镇。农夫雷恩有效田野在旁北部农舍，农夫盖兹1更远处东南；农夫与农夫法布隆是到处。农夫卡拉巴照看田野在农场以南。",
	["The final boss of every level 15-25 dungeon earns one point together. Tick each boss off when you kill it; the grouping follows the usual Classic level ranges, so check the in-game Legacy panel for the exact list."] = "最终首领的每个15-25级地下城获得1点一起。勾选每个首领偏离/关闭当你击杀它；队伍接续通常的经典旧世等级范围，因此查看游戏内传承面板给精确的列表。",
	["The final boss of every level 26-45 dungeon earns one point together."] = "最终首领的每个26-45级地下城获得1点一起。",
	["The final boss of every level 46-60 dungeon earns one point together."] = "最终首领的每个46-60级地下城获得1点一起。",
	["The firewood lies in the snow around the frozen lake by the refuge."] = "柴火位于雪在冰冻的湖在旁营地周围。",
	["The first two cages stand together in the Witherbark village south of Rhapsody; the third is in the next village to the east. Every Witherbark troll can drop a necklace."] = "第一2笼子位于一起在枯木村庄在拉普索迪·铁铲以南；第三是在下一个村庄向东。每个枯木巨魔可以掉落一个项链。",
	["The five quests share the same parts: gather them all in one sweep. West of the road the Black Slayer vultures, Starving Snickerfangs, Scorpok Stingers and Deatheye basilisks share the hills."] = "5任务共享相同零件：采集它们全部在1清剿。在道路以西黑色屠戮者秃鹫，饥饿的弯牙土狼，厚甲毒刺蝎与死眼石化蜥蜴共享丘陵。",
	["The flame burns in the south of Ameth'Aran."] = "烈焰燃烧在亚米萨兰以南。",
	["The flight master stands by the gate of Foothold Citadel; Clerk Lendry and Commander Samaul are inside the citadel."] = "飞行管理员站在旁边：大门的塞拉摩堡垒；书记员伦德瑞与指挥官萨穆尔是在堡垒内。",
	["The foreman stands at the lumber pile east of the Den."] = "工头位于伐木场堆东的兽穴。",
	["The fountain stands in the middle of the Ruins of Stardust: use the Empty Blue Waterskin there."] = "喷泉位于中间的星尘废墟：使用空的蓝色水囊那里。",
	["The furbolg village fills the valley north-east of Everlook. Kill Shamans first; they heal. High Chief Winterfall in the cave at the back is elite: stay out."] = "熊怪村庄装满山谷在永望镇以东北。击杀萨满祭司第一；它们治疗。冬泉酋长在洞穴内在返回为精英：留在出。",
	["The glowing tablet fragments lie around the Twilight camp in the far north-west; the Dust Stormers and Desert Rumblers there drop them too."] = "发光的石板碎片位于周围暮光扎营于远处西北；尘暴者与沙漠奔腾者那里掉落它们也。",
	["The gnomish toolboxes lie in the wreckage along the shore east and south-east of Razor Hill. Follow the shore south to Sen'jin."] = "侏儒工具箱位于残骸沿着岸边东与在剃刀岭以东南。沿着岸边南前往森金村。",
	["The goblins work the mine in the hills north-east of the well. Supervisor Fizsprocket stands in the back of the mine; his Mulgore Expansion Plans start Fizsprocket's Notes, and the other pages lie inside the mine."] = "地精有效采矿在丘陵在水井以东北。菲兹普罗克主管位于采矿的后方；他的莫高雷扩张计划开始菲兹普罗克特的笔记，与其他书页位于采矿内。",
	["The gorillas live on Ironstone Plateau, east of Marshal's Refuge. Keep their pelts for Torwa Pathfinder. Stay out of the deepest cave: U'cha is level 55."] = "猩猩实测在铁石高原，在马绍尔营地以东。保留它们的毛皮给托尔瓦·寻路者。留在离开最深处洞穴：尤尔查是55级。",
	["The gorillas live on the north-east plateau. Stay out of the deepest cave: U'cha lives there."] = "猩猩实测在东北高原。留在离开最深处洞穴：尤尔查住在那里。",
	["The gorillas of Ironstone Plateau come in small groups and drop nothing for you yet; Torwa's pelt quest comes later. Stay out of the deepest cave: U'cha is level 55."] = "猩猩的铁石高原来到在小型小队与掉落无奖励给你尚；托尔瓦的毛皮任务来自稍后。留在离开最深处洞穴：尤尔查是55级。",
	["The gorillas roam the valley around Unbagwa. The elders drop the giblets; any of them can drop a fang."] = "猩猩游荡于山谷在巫医安巴格瓦周围。长者掉落内脏；任意的它们可以掉落一个獠牙。",
	["The half pendants lie in Darkshore and Westfall: later on the route"] = "一半挂坠位于黑海岸与西部荒野：稍后在路线",
	["The harpies nest in the Dry Hills north-west of the Forgotten Pools; any of them can drop a talon."] = "鹰身人巢在枯水谷西北的遗忘之池；任意的它们可以掉落一个利爪。",
	["The hermit hides among the rocks south-east of Southwind Village."] = "隐士藏身在其中：岩石在南风村以东南。",
	["The hermit lives at Windsong Lake's west shore. Zephyrseed cones grow south of him; the Wind Hollows drift east of the lake."] = "隐士住在风歌湖的西岸边。微风之种松果生长在他南面；风穴魔漂浮在湖以东。",
	["The hermit's shack stands in the woods north-east of the Raven Hill Cemetery."] = "隐士的棚屋位于树林东北的乌鸦岭墓地。",
	["The high elf Rangers, Pathstriders and Woodsmen guard the lodge by Northpass Tower; the Registry lies inside. Rangers reach 60: pull one at a time. Noxious Plaguebats fly over the fields on the way."] = "高精灵游侠，巡路者与樵夫守卫旅舍在旁北地哨塔；名册位于内部。游侠抵达60：拉怪1在一个时间。毒性瘟疫蝙蝠飞往越过农田在途中。",
	["The highwaymen hold the hills north-east of the orchard. More Construct Parts lie near the road to Valanaar."] = "拦路强盗要塞丘陵在果园以东北。更多失灵的旋风构造体零件位于道路前往附近瓦拉纳尔。",
	["The hippogryph nests are north-west of the tower, west of Falaath Village; the Matriarch sits at the western end. Hippogryph Down lies on the ground around them, and the hippogryphs drop the Small Eggs."] = "角鹰兽巢是在哨塔以西北，在法拉斯村以西；刺喉雌龙位于西部尽头。角鹰兽绒羽位于领地周围它们，与角鹰兽掉落小蛋。",
	["The hippogryphs nest on the hills south-west of the camp. Kill one, then use the Muisek Vessel on its body."] = "角鹰兽巢在丘陵在营地以西南。击杀1，然后使用穆塞克容器在它的尸体。",
	["The incense burns out in ten minutes: run straight east along the southern hills to the Ritual Fire."] = "熏香燃烧出在10分钟：前往直走东沿着南部丘陵前往仪式之火。",
	["The inner circle lies south of the western circle, east of Stromgarde."] = "内侧法阵位于西部法阵以南，在激流堡以东。",
	["The keep stands on the coast south-east of Razor Hill. The raiders' axe, bow and shield lie on its outskirts. Sailors and marines drop the Canvas Scraps. Lieutenant Benedict waits at the top of the keep; his key opens the chest beside him, which holds the Aged Envelope."] = "保留位于海岸边在剃刀岭以东南。劫掠者的斧，弓与盾牌位于它的外围。水手与水兵掉落帆布脚料。本尼迪克上尉等候在保留的顶部；他的钥匙开启箱子旁边他，其中持有旧信封。",
	["The keg stands with a few others at the Syndicate camp on the south-east coast of Hillsbrad."] = "酒桶位于与一个少量其他在辛迪加营地在东南海岸的希尔斯布莱德。",
	["The last skulls are in the ruins a short ride west, on the way back to Grom'gol."] = "最后头颅是在废墟中一个不足骑行西，在返回途中前往格罗姆高。",
	["The level-20 class quests in Orgrimmar (Sorek, Searn Firewarder, the Warlock and Rogue trainers) are only offered from level 20, so finish the level here before you fly. The Thunderhawk Hatchlings (18) on the plains south-west of the Crossroads and the Kolkar (14-15) at the Stagnant Oasis are the nearest mobs worth killing; you need well under a level."] = "等级-20职业任务在奥格瑞玛（索瑞克，希尔恩·火结，术士与潜行者训练师）是仅提供的来自20级，因此完成等级此处之前你飞往。雷鹰雏鸟（18）在平原西南的十字路口与科卡尔（14-15）在死水绿洲是最近的怪物价值击杀；你需要水井在下方一个等级。",
	["The libram lies further north, on the way to Hearthglen."] = "圣契位于更远处北，在途中前往壁炉谷。",
	["The little turtle Tooga hides at the north end of the valley. Lead him home to his wife Torta, by the water just east of Steamwheedle Port: he walks slowly and the desert's beasts go for him, so keep him alive."] = "小海龟图加藏身在山谷的北端。引导他炉石前往他的妻子托尔塔，在旁水就在热砂港以东：他步行缓慢地与沙漠的野兽前往给他，因此保留他存活。",
	["The mine is south-west of the gnoll camps. Mining Tools lie near the entrance; Kobold Geomancers hold the tunnels."] = "采矿是在豺狼人扎营以西南。采矿工具位于入口附近；狗头人地卜师要塞隧道。",
	["The mine is west of the vineyards. Kobold Miners and Tunnelers fill both levels; Nimsy, a named kobold, holds the picture book in the lower tunnels. Nimsy is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "采矿是在葡萄园以西。狗头人矿工与暗炉隧道工装满两个等级；妮姆希，一个名为狗头人，持有图画书在下层隧道。妮姆希为精英：建议组队前往。",
	["The moonwell is in the middle of the glade. The Strange Fronded Plant grows at its north end."] = "月亮井是在林地的中央。奇怪的树木生长在它的北尽头。",
	["The moonwell lies in the hills north-east of Astranaar."] = "月亮井位于丘陵在阿斯特兰纳以东北。",
	["The moonwell sits north of Aldrassil; Iverron is a little further north-west."] = "月亮井位于奥达希尔以北；埃沃隆是一个小更远处西北。",
	["The mound of loose dirt lies south of the farmhouse, by the old stump."] = "土堆的松动的泥土位于农舍以南，在旁旧树桩。",
	["The mountain lets you out beside Blackrock Stronghold, full of 55-57 orcs. Follow the road east along the northern cliffs to the Horde camp at Flame Crest."] = "山脉允许你出在黑石要塞旁边，完整的55-57兽人。沿着道路前往东沿着北部悬崖前往部落扎营于烈焰峰。",
	["The murlocs on the east shore drop the kelp. Skinners: Gray Forest Wolves roam the woods between the lake and the Tower of Azora; Prowlers further east give pelts too."] = "鱼人在东岸边掉落海藻。剥皮师：森林灰狼游荡于树林之间湖与阿祖拉之塔；觅食的灰狼更远处东交给毛皮也。",
	["The naga comb the beaches north of the Bloodsail camp; they drop the reeds."] = "纳迦梳理海滩北的血帆营地；它们掉落芦苇。",
	["The naga hold the shore south-east of Southshore."] = "纳迦要塞岸边在南海镇以东南。",
	["The naga raid the coast east of Razor Hill: their weapons, banners and spinefins come from them."] = "纳迦团队副本海岸在剃刀岭以东：它们的武器，旗帜与刺鳍鱼来自它们。",
	["The new Forever Green, Dark and Purple Skeletal Horses and the Ochre Skeletal Warhorse (level 60) have no known source yet."] = "新无限服绿色、暗色与紫色骷髅马与赭色骷髅战马（60级）目前尚无已知获取来源。",
	["The next guide flies on from here to Orgrimmar."] = "下一个指南飞往在来自此处前往奥格瑞玛。",
	["The next guide flies you north to Tarren Mill and into the Arathi Highlands."] = "下一个指南飞往你北前往塔伦米尔与进入阿拉希高地。",
	["The next guide heads into Dustwallow Marsh."] = "下一个指南头颅进入尘泥沼泽。",
	["The next guide starts here and flies to Chillwind Camp."] = "下一个指南始于此处与飞往前往冰风岗。",
	["The next guide starts here and takes you to Tanaris."] = "下一个指南始于此处与接收你前往塔纳利斯。",
	["The next guide starts here in Ratchet and flies on to Gadgetzan."] = "下一个指南始于此处在棘齿城与飞往在前往加基森。",
	["The next guide starts here in Ratchet."] = "下一个指南始于此处在棘齿城。",
	["The next guide starts here, at Revantusk Village."] = "下一个指南始于此处，在恶齿村。",
	["The next guide starts here, at the chapel's flight master."] = "下一个指南始于此处，在礼拜堂的飞行管理员。",
	["The next guide starts in Theramore."] = "下一个指南始于塞拉摩。",
	["The next guide starts in the Undercity, at the Grom'gol zeppelin."] = "下一个指南始于幽暗城，在格罗姆高飞艇。",
	["The next guide takes you back to Stranglethorn Vale."] = "下一个指南接收你返回前往荆棘谷。",
	["The next step, Defeat Nek'rosh, pits you against an elite chieftain: skip it."] = "下一个步骤，击败纳克罗什，需要你迎战一个精英酋长：跳过即可。",
	["The next trophy skulls stand in the small ruins just north of the warriors' camp."] = "下一个战利品头颅位于小型废墟就在战士以北的营地。",
	["The night elf stands alone west of Thorium Point. Hear his story."] = "夜晚精灵位于独自在瑟银哨塔以西。听完他的故事。",
	["The northern Deadwood (level 53-55) hold the camps just south of the tunnel. Keep their feathers too."] = "北部死木（53-55级）要塞扎营就在隧道以南。保留它们的羽毛也。",
	["The northern Deadwood camps by the tunnel are the densest feather spot (35% drop chance there). Hand feathers to Nafien at the tunnel, or to Grazle in the south."] = "北部死木扎营在旁隧道是最密集的羽毛地点（35%掉落几率那里）。上交羽毛前往纳菲恩在隧道，或前往格拉兹在南面。",
	["The oasis lies south-east of the Crossroads. Test the seeds at the bubbling fissure in the middle of the water."] = "绿洲位于东南的十字路口。测试种子在冒泡的裂隙在水的中央。",
	["The orc stronghold at the eastern end of the road. Urda, the wind rider master, stands by the gate."] = "兽人要塞在道路的东端。尤尔达，双足飞龙管理员，站在旁边：大门。",
	["The ore drops from Drywhisker kobolds in Arathi Highlands"] = "矿石掉落来自枯须狗头人在阿拉希高地",
	["The other exit of the Timbermaw Hold tunnel leads into Winterspring. Everlook is a neutral goblin town with flight masters for both factions."] = "其他出口的木喉要塞隧道通往进入冬泉谷。永望镇是一个中立地精城镇与双方阵营的飞行管理员。",
	["The pass from Un'Goro comes out at Valor's Rest, the graveyard in north-east Silithus. Layo stands among the graves."] = "穿过来自安戈洛环形山来自出在勇气之眠，墓地在东北希利苏斯。莱耶·星击位于其中：坟墓。",
	["The pelts come after loop 2, on the gorilla plateau"] = "毛皮来到之后环线2，在猩猩高原",
	["The pirates camp along the beach south of Ratchet. The piles of complicated parts lie in and around their camp."] = "海盗营地沿着海滩在棘齿城以南。堆的复杂的零件位于与周围它们的营地。",
	["The pirates camp on the beach south of Ratchet. The piles of complicated parts lie in the sand among them."] = "海盗营地在海滩上在棘齿城以南。堆的复杂的零件位于沙子在其中：它们。",
	["The pirates camp on the beach south of Ratchet; Baron Longshore stands at its southern end."] = "海盗营地在海滩上在棘齿城以南；巴隆·朗绍尔位于它的南部尽头。",
	["The plans lie in the Slag Pit of the Cauldron, guarded by Dark Iron dwarves. Dark Iron dwarves also drop Dark Iron Residue, which Burninate takes for Gaining Acceptance."] = "图纸位于熔渣深坑的大锅，有守卫的在旁黑铁矮人。黑铁矮人也掉落黑铁残油，其中大铁匠博恩奈特接收给获得信任。",
	["The pools lie just north of Regthar. Walk into the water to explore them; the Laden Mushrooms for Helbrim grow around them. Kill every Kolkar you pass for bracers."] = "水池位于就在雷戈萨·死门以北。步行进入水前往探索它们；满载的蘑菇给药剂师赫布瑞姆生长周围它们。击杀每个科卡尔你穿过给护腕。",
	["The prickly pears grow among the quilboar huts just west of town."] = "多刺梨生长在其中：野猪人小屋就在城镇西面。",
	["The prisoner's next task, Ledger from Tanaris, sends you to the Swamp of Sorrows and Dustwallow Marsh: skip it."] = "囚犯的下一个任务，塔纳利斯的账本，派你前往悲伤沼泽与尘泥沼泽：跳过即可。",
	["The pumpkins grow in the Scarlet-held fields north-west of Solliden."] = "南瓜生长在血色-持有农田在索利丹以西北。",
	["The pylon stands on the eastern cliffs."] = "水晶塔位于东部悬崖。",
	["The pylon stands on the slope east of the refuge."] = "水晶塔位于山坡在营地以东。",
	["The pylon stands on the slope east of the refuge. Pterrordax circle the slopes around it: they count for Spraggle and drop Shizzle's scales."] = "水晶塔位于山坡在营地以东。翼手龙法阵山坡周围它：它们计入给斯普拉格·弗劳克与掉落希兹尔的鳞片。",
	["The pylon stands on the western cliffs. Frenzied Pterrordax fly over the whole west side."] = "水晶塔位于西部悬崖。狂怒的翼手龙飞往越过整个西一侧。",
	["The quarry lies south-east of the ranch."] = "采石场位于牧场以东南。",
	["The queen hovers at the south-east end of the grove, on your way back from the stones."] = "女王盘旋在东南尽头的树林，在你的路返回来自石头。",
	["The quests run out here. Rabid Shardtooths prowl Frostwhisper Gorge in southern Winterspring, south of the road from Everlook."] = "任务前往出此处。疯狂的碎齿熊游荡霜语峡谷在南部冬泉谷，在道路来自以南永望镇。",
	["The raft lies on the shore of the south-eastern lake; the small pack sits in the water beside it."] = "木筏位于南的岸上-东部湖；小型包位于水旁边它。",
	["The refugees' belongings lie along the north shore of Windsong Lake; Resaan Nimbuswalker is at its north-west end."] = "难民的遗物位于沿着北岸边的风歌湖；雷萨恩伊拉妮·云行者是在它的西北尽头。",
	["The reins need level 60 and Journeyman Riding (Forever client). Train it at your race's riding trainer; see the Level 60 mount guides."] = "缰绳需要60级与中级骑术（无限服客户端）。训练它在你的种族的骑术训练师；查看等级60坐骑指南。",
	["The reins need level 60 and Journeyman Riding to ride (Forever client); you can buy them earlier."] = "缰绳需要60级与中级骑术前往骑行（无限服客户端）；你可以购买它们此前。",
	["The relics are in the Burning Steppes: keep it"] = "圣物是在燃烧平原：请保留该任务/物品",
	["The relics are the carved stones scattered through the Ruins of Thaurissan around Flame Crest: click them until the information is recovered."] = "圣物是雕刻的石头散落的穿过索瑞森废墟在烈焰峰周围：点击它们直到信息是找回的。",
	["The relics lie in the dig itself. Sarltooth, a big Razormaw, prowls the raptor valley just west of it."] = "圣物位于挖掘其本身。萨尔图斯，一个大老刺喉龙，潜行游荡迅猛龙山谷就在它西面。",
	["The riddle's next scroll lies in western Dustwallow: skip it."] = "谜题的下一个卷轴位于西部尘泥沼泽：跳过即可。",
	["The road climbs north as the Webwinder Path. Ziz Fizziks has a hut where the road forks east to Windshear Crag."] = "道路爬上北作为蛛网小径。菲兹克斯有一个小屋在道路岔路口东前往狂风峭壁。",
	["The road ends at Nafien, outside the Timbermaw Hold tunnel in the far north-east."] = "道路终结于纳菲恩，外部木喉要塞隧道在远处东北。",
	["The road from Elwynn enters Redridge at Three Corners. Guard Parker stands where the roads to Redridge and Duskwood meet."] = "道路来自艾尔文森林进入赤脊山在三角路口。卫兵帕克位于道路前往赤脊山与暮色森林会合。",
	["The road west from Camp Taurajo climbs into Mulgore."] = "道路西来自陶拉祖营地爬上进入莫高雷。",
	["The ruins lie around the frozen lake south of Starfall Village. Click the four relic fragments in the ruins, and pick up the Moontouched Feathers on the ground where the wildkin roam."] = "废墟位于冰冻的湖周围在坠星村以南。点击4圣物碎片在废墟中，与拾取/接取月光羽毛在领地在野性枭兽游荡。",
	["The same murlocs again, plus the Oracles, who stay near the huts on the western shore."] = "相同鱼人再次，外加神谕者，其留在小屋在西部岸边附近。",
	["The satchel lies in the mountains of the far south, past Bronzebeard's Encampment. Deathclasp, an elite scorpid, patrols near it: grab it while he is away."] = "挎包位于山脉的远处南，经过铜须营地。死亡弯钩，一个精英蝎子，巡逻附近它：拿取它当他是离开。",
	["The scroll lies in the marsh north of Biggs. The Swampwalkers north of it can drop Khadgar's essays."] = "卷轴位于沼泽在卫兵比格斯以北。沼泽漫步者在它北面可以掉落卡德加的论文。",
	["The second Circle of Imprisonment lies in the valley of Night Run, on the way west."] = "第二禁锢法阵位于山谷的夜道谷，在途中西。",
	["The secret lies on the Overlook Cliffs, above the beach."] = "秘密的位于悬崖悬崖，在海滩上方。",
	["The shadow mages, rogues and assassins camp south-east of Gadgetzan."] = "暗影法师，潜行者与刺客营地在加基森以东南。",
	["The shards lie at the far end of Drywhisker Gorge."] = "碎片位于远处尽头的枯须峡谷。",
	["The shattered sword lies on the ground north-west of the lake."] = "破碎的剑位于领地在湖以西北。",
	["The shield lies at Gahrron's Withering, south of Tirion's hut."] = "盾牌位于盖罗恩农场，在提里奥的以南小屋。",
	["The shrine lies in the south-west corner of Azshara, south of Talrendis Point."] = "神龛位于西南面角落的艾萨拉，在塔伦迪斯营地以南。",
	["The shrine sits on the hill just south-east of the moonwell; follow the winding path up."] = "神龛位于山丘就在月亮井以东南；沿着风小径上。",
	["The shrunken giants roam the Twin Colossals; the sea elementals wade along the coast to the west."] = "缩小的巨人游荡于双塔山；大海元素涉水沿着海岸向西。",
	["The silithid hive fills the south of the crater. Gorishi wasps and workers drop the scent gland; use the Scraping Vial on the egg mass inside the first chamber. The Hive Queen at the bottom is an elite boss: stay out of her chamber. Pterrordax nest on the cliffs above the hive; their scales are for Shizzle."] = "异种虫虫巢装满在环形山以南。戈里什黄蜂与工人掉落气味腺体；使用刮取瓶在蛋大量在第一密室内。虫巢女王在底部是一个精英首领：留在出的她的密室。翼手龙巢在悬崖在虫巢上方；它们的鳞片是给希兹尔。",
	["The skeleton's next task, Murdaloc, waits until the later Badlands guide at 43."] = "骷髅的下一个任务，莫达洛克，等候直到稍后荒芜之地指南在43。",
	["The skull sits in the Pestilent Scar, among Blighted Horrors and Plague Monstrosities."] = "头颅位于瘟疫之痕，在其中：荒芜水元素与瘟疫水元素。",
	["The skyboat leaves the cliffs south of Skywatcher Plateau, north of Thunder Bluff (another flies from Dalaran)."] = "天舟离开悬崖在观天者高原以南，在雷霆崖以北（另一个飞往来自达拉然）。",
	["The skyboat leaves the north side of Dalaran in the Alterac Mountains (another flies from north of Thunder Bluff)."] = "天舟离开北一侧的达拉然在奥特兰克山脉（另一个飞往来自在雷霆崖以北）。",
	["The skycutter docks at the tower south of Valanaar. It lands by the Kirin Tor camp on the lake shore west of Dalaran."] = "斩天者码头在哨塔在瓦拉纳尔以南。它之地在旁肯瑞托营地在湖岸边在达拉然以西。",
	["The small Horde post on the southern shore."] = "小型部落岗哨在南部岸边。",
	["The small elementals drift across the flats just west of Lotwil's camp. Every rock elemental in the zone can drop Jarkal's Rock Elemental Shards: keep them."] = "小型元素漂浮穿过平原就在洛特维尔的以西营地。每个岩石元素在区域可以掉落加卡尔的石元素的碎片：请保留它们。",
	["The smithy stands in the middle of Hillsbrad town. Blacksmith Verringtan and his apprentices work at the forge; the Shipment of Iron is stacked beside it. Citizen Wilkes walks the street north of it."] = "铁匠铺位于希尔斯布莱德的中央城镇。铁匠维林坦与他的学徒有效在锻炉；一箱铁材是堆叠的旁边它。平民维尔克斯步行街道在它北面。",
	["The snappers line the strand south of the post."] = "咬龟路线海滩在岗哨以南。",
	["The spare texts from the cultists"] = "备用文本来自邪教徒",
	["The spiders lurk in the hills along the road north toward Razor Hill."] = "蜘蛛潜伏在丘陵沿着道路北朝剃刀岭方向。",
	["The spiders lurk in the woods at the far east end of the glades."] = "蜘蛛潜伏在树林在远处东尽头的林地。",
	["The spiders roam the plateaus and lava pools in the south-west of the gorge."] = "蜘蛛游荡于高原与熔岩水池在峡谷以西南。",
	["The sprite darters flit over the grove just west of Mojache; nearly every one drops a wing. The Woodpaw alphas lead the camps south-west of it: kill them within the hour."] = "林精精灵龙飞掠越过树林就在莫沙彻营地以西；接近每个1掉落一个翅膀。木爪头狼引导扎营在它西南面：击杀它们内部小时。",
	["The sprite darters flit over the grove just west of the camp and carry the Encrusted Minerals; the Wandering Forest Walkers, a little further west, carry the Splintered Logs."] = "林精精灵龙飞掠越过树林就在营地与携带以西包壳矿石；流浪的森林行者，一个小更远处西，携带断裂的原木。",
	["The stalker raptors hunt the jungle south of Grom'gol, out towards the west coast."] = "潜猎者迅猛龙狩猎丛林在格罗姆高以南，出朝西海岸方向。",
	["The stone stands in the pass out of Mulgore, on your way east. Use the Cenarion Lunardust there and defeat Lunaclaw."] = "石头位于穿过离开莫高雷，在你的路东。使用赛纳里奥银尘那里与击败月爪枭兽。",
	["The stone's next task needs Fozruk, a level 42 elite: leave it."] = "石头的下一个任务需要弗兹鲁克，一个42级精英：可先放着不做。",
	["The strongest worgen roam the woods south of Darkshire, west and south of the Tranquil Gardens Cemetery. The Insane Ghoul hides in the small crypt by the cemetery."] = "最强的狼人游荡于树林在夜色镇以南，西与南的静谧花园墓场。疯狂的食尸鬼藏身在小型地穴在旁墓园。",
	["The tar pits lie just south of the refuge. Tar Beasts, Lurkers and Creepers drop the Super Sticky Tar."] = "焦油深坑位于就在营地以南。焦油兽，潜伏者与爬行者掉落极度粘稠的沥青。",
	["The tears glow on the small isle east of Astranaar."] = "眼泪发光在小型岛在阿斯特兰纳以东。",
	["The three druids stand together at the Forsaken camp south of Forest Song."] = "3德鲁伊位于一起在被遗忘者营地在林歌神殿以南。",
	["The three ghostly pirates haunt the jungle north of Booty Bay, near Zanzil's camps: Maury and Jon-Jon stand together, Chucky further east."] = "3幽灵海盗出没丛林在藏宝海湾以北，在赞吉尔的营地附近：莫里与乔恩乔恩位于一起，查基更远处东。",
	["The three nests sit together in the Raptor Grounds south-west of the oasis; Sunscale Scytheclaws guard them."] = "3巢坐一起在迅猛龙巢穴在绿洲以西南；赤鳞镰爪龙守卫它们。",
	["The three pieces of the doll lie in the ruined houses of Darrowshire; picking one up can call out ghosts. Combine them into the doll."] = "3碎片的人偶位于毁坏的房屋的达隆郡；采摘1上可以召唤出幽灵。合成它们进入人偶。",
	["The three ships lie off the Wild Shore. The crews are 42-45, Stillwater 45, Keelhaul 46 and Fleet Master Firallon 48: at 41 this is a fight for a group, or for the end of the guide. If you go, swim out and pull the crew to the rail one at a time. A scroll, Cortello's Riddle, lies on the ships' decks: take it."] = "3船只位于偏离/关闭狂野海岸。船员是42-45，静水45，拖行刑46与舰队指挥官菲尔拉伦48：在41此是一个迎战需要组队完成，或给尽头的指南。如果你前往，游泳出与拉怪船员前往船舷1在一个时间。一个卷轴，科泰罗的谜题，位于船只的甲板：接取它。",
	["The tomes lie in the ruined keep west of Strahnbrad; Argus Shadow Mages hold the ruins."] = "典籍位于毁坏的保留在斯坦恩布莱德以西；暗影大法师要塞废墟。",
	["The tool buckets with the slugs lie around the Venture Co. drill site in the Sludge Fen, east of Wenikee."] = "工具桶与蛞蝓位于周围风险投资公司演习地点在淤泥沼泽，在维妮·布特巴克以东。",
	["The tortured druids and sentinels haunt the ruined village south-west of Layo."] = "受折磨的德鲁伊与哨兵出没毁坏的村庄在莱耶·星击以西南。",
	["The tougher Wastewander rogues, shadow mages and assassins camp south-east of Gadgetzan, south of the bandits. Leave Caliph Scorpidsting in the middle of the southern camp for later."] = "更棘手的废土窃贼潜行者，暗影法师与刺客营地在加基森以东南，在强盗以南。跳过卡利夫·斯科比斯汀在南部营地给稍后的中央。",
	["The town hall is on the west side of Hillsbrad. Magistrate Burnside (30) and Clerk Horrace Whitesteed are inside with the Town Registry; the Proclamation is pinned up beside it. Councilmen walk the town."] = "城镇大厅是在希尔斯布莱德的西侧。波恩塞德镇长（30）与书记员赫拉斯·怀特斯蒂德是内部与城镇名册；告示是钉在上旁边它。议员步行城镇。",
	["The tram arrives in the Dwarven District. Ilsa Corbin trains warriors in Old Town; Harry Burlguard and Bartleby stand together by the Pig and Whistle Tavern there. Bartleby fights you for his mug."] = "地铁抵达在矮人区。伊尔萨·考宾训练战士在旧城区；哈里·伯加德与巴特莱比位于一起在旁猪和哨声旅店那里。巴特莱比战斗你给他的酒杯。",
	["The treants wander the forest roads between the camp and the middle of Feralas; there are only a few, so look along the paths."] = "树人游荡森林道路在营地与中间的之间菲拉斯；那里是仅一个少量，因此查看沿着小径。",
	["The turncoat's house is in the Gustberry Lowlands north-west of Valanaar. Fendaal Windstone waits nearby; his assassins lurk around the house."] = "叛徒的房屋是在风莓低地在瓦拉纳尔以西北。芬达尔·风石等候附近；他的刺客潜伏在房屋周围。",
	["The two stand together at the western end of the road."] = "2位于一起在道路的西端。",
	["The two wrecks lie in the bay west of the cove. The charts and logs are inside them; the gems lie on the sea floor around them. Daggerspine naga swim the whole bay."] = "2残骸位于海湾在小湾以西。海图与原木是内部它们；宝石位于大海楼层周围它们。匕首沼纳迦游泳整个海湾。",
	["The vial is filled in Darnassus: keep it"] = "小瓶是装满的在达纳苏斯：请保留该任务/物品",
	["The violet shards glow just off the road a short way west of Hammerfall."] = "紫色碎片发光就在道路两侧一个不足路在落锤镇以西。",
	["The weapons lie around the Den and the training grounds; the Mottled Boars roam the whole valley floor."] = "武器位于周围兽穴与训练领地；杂斑野猪游荡于整个山谷楼层。",
	["The well lies north of the village. Well Stones sit around the well, Ambercorn lies under the trees nearby. Kill wolves, cougars, plainstriders and swoops on the way for Mazzranache and Swoop Hunting."] = "水井位于村庄以北。水井石坐在水井周围，琥珀颗粒位于下方树木附近。击杀狼，美洲狮，平原陆行鸟与俯冲在途中给玛兹拉纳其与猎捕猛鹫。",
	["The well lies south-east of the village."] = "水井位于村庄以东南。",
	["The western Winterfall camp sits in the hills between Salfa and Donova. Any furbolg here can drop an Empty Firewater Flask (about one in ten) and, rarely, a Winterfall Ritual Totem: right-click whichever drops. Keep the Runecloth the furbolgs drop for Meilosh."] = "西部寒冬营地位于丘陵在萨尔法与多诺瓦之间。任意熊怪此处可以掉落一个空的火酒瓶（约1在10）与，极少，一个冬泉仪祭图腾：右键点击任选其一：掉落。保留符文布熊怪掉落给梅罗什。",
	["The western Winterfall furbolgs drop the beads."] = "西部寒冬熊怪掉落串珠。",
	["The western circle is near Thoradin's Wall, where you rode in."] = "西部法阵是在索拉丁之墙附近，在你骑行在。",
	["The wildkin are in Winterspring: keep it"] = "野性枭兽是在冬泉谷：请保留该任务/物品",
	["The wolves roam the fields between Andorhal, Dalson's Tears and the Writhing Haunt. Finish them on the ride back east."] = "狼游荡于农田之间安多哈尔，达尔松之泪与蠕行之祸。完成它们在骑行返回东。",
	["The wooden sign beside Spraggle"] = "木制路牌/标志在斯普拉格·弗劳克旁边",
	["The wooden sign beside Spraggle Frock"] = "木制路牌/标志在斯普拉格·弗劳克旁边",
	["The worgen hold the woods of Brightwood, west of Darkshire and north of the road. Pull them one at a time."] = "狼人要塞树林的夜色森林，在夜色镇以西与在道路以北。拉怪它们1在一个时间。",
	["The wreck of the Flying Osprey lies in the shallows south of the keep."] = "残骸的飞翔的鱼鹰位于浅滩在保留以南。",
	["The wrecked caravan lies north-west of the centaurs, east of the road to Thunder Bluff."] = "失事的商队位于半人马以西北，在道路前往以东雷霆崖。",
	["The wrecked caravan lies off the road near Biggs."] = "失事的商队位于道路两侧在卫兵比格斯附近。",
	["The yeti hills start just south-east of Everlook. Every yeti drops fur; only Matriarchs and Patriarchs drop horns, so keep those for after the turn-in."] = "雪人丘陵开始就在永望镇以东南。每个雪人掉落毛皮；仅刺喉雌龙与族长掉落角，因此保留那些给之后交任务。",
	["The yetis live in the cave in the hills north of Southshore, on your way back south."] = "雪人实测在洞穴内在丘陵在南海镇以北，在你的路返回南。",
	["The zeppelin lands at the tower just north-east of Orgrimmar's main gate. Follow the road south into Durotar, cross the Southfury River bridge below Far Watch Post and follow the road west to the Crossroads."] = "飞艇之地在哨塔就在奥格瑞玛的以东北主大门。沿着道路前往南进入杜隆塔尔，穿过怒水河桥在前沿哨所下方与沿着道路前往西前往十字路口。",
	["The zeppelin lands at the tower on the west side of the camp."] = "飞艇之地在哨塔在营地的西侧。",
	["The zeppelin lands at the towers outside the Ruins of Lordaeron. Walk west along the road past the ruins and south into Silverpine Forest; follow the road to the Sepulcher."] = "飞艇之地在哨塔外部洛丹伦废墟。步行西沿着道路经过废墟与南进入银松森林；沿着道路前往前往瑟伯切尔。",
	["The zeppelin lands at the towers outside the Undercity: ride down into the city and fly to Tarren Mill."] = "飞艇之地在哨塔外部幽暗城：骑行下进入主城与飞往前往塔伦米尔。",
	["The zeppelin to Orgrimmar leaves from the tower beside Grom'gol; it lands just north-east of Orgrimmar's main gate."] = "飞艇前往奥格瑞玛离开来自哨塔在格罗姆高旁边；它之地就在奥格瑞玛的以东北主大门。",
	["The zeppelin tower stands just north-east of Orgrimmar's main gate; take the Undercity zeppelin."] = "飞艇哨塔位于就在奥格瑞玛的以东北主大门；接取幽暗城飞艇。",
	["The zeppelin towers stand just outside Orgrimmar's main gate. Take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades (the other one goes to Grom'gol)."] = "飞艇哨塔位于就在奥格瑞玛的外主大门。搭乘飞艇前往提瑞斯法林地（其他1前往/交给格罗姆高）。",
	["The zombies shamble around the graveyard and the houses just east of the church."] = "僵尸蹒跚游荡在墓地与房屋周围就在教堂以东。",
	["Their follow-ups ask for the same parts again for a buff item and pay no experience: leave them."] = "它们的后续任务需要相同零件再次给一个增益物品与不给经验值：可先放着不做。",
	["Theldurin sits among the dwarven ruins at Agmond's End, south of the Valley of Fangs."] = "迷失者塞尔杜林位于其中：矮人废墟在埃格蒙德的营地，南的巨牙谷。",
	["Theldurin the Lost"] = "迷失者塞尔杜林",
	["Theodora's next errand goes to Lotwil east of town and then into Blackrock Depths: skip it."] = "塞朵拉·穆瓦丹尼的下一个差事前往/交给洛特维尔在城镇东面与然后进入黑石杀戮者深渊：跳过即可。",
	["Theodora's quest in Kargath needs level 52. The Tar Lurkers and Tar Lords just south of the refuge are the closest camp."] = "塞朵拉·穆瓦丹尼的任务在卡加斯需要52级。焦油潜伏者与焦油兽王就在营地是最近的营地以南。",
	["Theramore Guard Badge"] = "塞拉摩守卫徽章",
	["Theramore Lieutenant"] = "塞拉摩海军上尉",
	["Thersa Windsong, beside him"] = "瑟尔萨·风歌，旁边他",
	["Therylune"] = "瑟瑞露尼",
	["Therysil"] = "瑟瑞希尔",
	["Thick Yeti Fur"] = "厚雪人毛皮",
	["Thick Yeti Hide"] = "厚重的雪人皮",
	["Third Relic Fragment"] = "第三块遗物碎片",
	["Third Witherbark Cage"] = "第三个枯木牢笼",
	["This step cannot check the whole map by itself yet; it becomes a tracked goal once the Legacy achievement ids are recorded."] = "此步骤无法查看整个地图在旁其本身尚；它变为一个追踪的目标一次传承成就 ID 是记录。",
	["Thistleshrub Rootshaper"] = "灌木塑根者",
	["Thomas, in the Cathedral of Light"] = "托马斯，在圣光大教堂",
	["Thor; skip the free flight it offers"] = "索尔；跳过它提供的免费飞行",
	["Thorium Plated Dagger"] = "瑟银匕首",
	["Thorium Point, on the scaffolds in the north-west of Searing Gorge, is the Brotherhood's outpost. The Thorium Brotherhood starts out Neutral. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "瑟银哨塔，在脚手架在灼热峡谷以西北，是兄弟会的前哨站。瑟银兄弟会始于出中立。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["Thork"] = "索克",
	["Thork, at the top of the tower"] = "索克，在哨塔的顶部",
	["Thork. Keep it: Kadrak at the Mor'shan Rampart, next guide"] = "索克。请保留该任务/物品：卡德拉克在莫尔杉农场，下一个指南",
	["Thorsen patrols the road north of camp, toward the Rebel Camp."] = "列兵索尔森巡逻于道路在营地北面，朝向反抗军营地。",
	["Thotar"] = "索塔尔",
	["Thotar: Ormak Grimshot in Orgrimmar teaches Beast Training"] = "索塔尔：奥玛克在奥格瑞玛传授训练野兽",
	["Thra"] = "斯拉",
	["Thra and Migi sit behind Grommash Hold in the Valley of Wisdom; the Smooth Boulders lie around them. Train while you are in the city (Druids and Paladins have no trainer here). The next guide starts at Doras, the wind rider master in the Valley of Strength."] = "斯拉与米吉坐在格罗玛什要塞后面在智慧谷；光滑的巨石位于周围它们。训练当你是在主城（德鲁伊与圣骑士有无训练师此处）。下一个指南始于多拉斯，双足飞龙管理员在力量谷。",
	["Thrall, inside Grommash Hold"] = "萨尔，在格罗玛什要塞内",
	["Three containers in the murloc hovels, south to north: the Damaged Crate, then the Sealed Barrel, then the Half-buried Barrel at the north end."] = "3容器在鱼人棚屋，南前往北：破损的木箱，然后密封的桶，然后半埋的大桶在北尽头。",
	["Thresher Eyes"] = "蛇颈龙的眼球",
	["Through the Timbermaw tunnel to Moonglade. Umber reads in a house in Nighthaven."] = "穿过木喉隧道前往月光林地。阿姆伯尔写着在一个房屋在永夜港。",
	["Through the pass and east along the northern cliffs to Marshal's Refuge. Linken stands by the cave; J.D. Collie is inside it."] = "穿过穿过与东沿着北部悬崖前往马绍尔营地。林克站在旁边：洞穴；科琳是内部它。",
	["Thun'grim camps beside the road east of the Crossroads."] = "索恩格瑞姆·火眼扎营在道路东的旁边十字路口。",
	["Thun'grim camps beside the road east toward Ratchet."] = "索恩格瑞姆·火眼扎营在道路东朝向旁边棘齿城。",
	["Thun'grim camps beside the road from the Crossroads to Ratchet. The Stolen Iron Chest sits in the south of the Razormane camp just north of him."] = "索恩格瑞姆·火眼扎营在道路来自旁边十字路口前往棘齿城。被偷走的铁箱位于南面的刺鬃营地就在他北面。",
	["Thunder Bluff is beside the landing: ride up a lift and learn the flight path from Tal, the wind rider master. Then follow the road south past Bloodhoof Village and through the eastern pass into the Barrens."] = "雷霆崖是在陆地旁边：骑行上一个升降梯与学习飞行点来自塔尔，双足飞龙管理员。然后沿着道路前往南经过血蹄村与穿过东部穿过进入贫瘠之地。",
	["Thunder Lizards and Lightning Hides graze just across the bridge below Far Watch Post."] = "雷霆蜥蜴与闪电蜥蜴吃草就在穿过桥在前沿哨所下方。",
	["Thunder Lizards and Lightning Hides graze on Thunder Ridge across the bridge; any of them can drop a Singed Scale."] = "雷霆蜥蜴与闪电蜥蜴吃草在雷霆山穿过桥；任意的它们可以掉落一个烧焦的鳞片。",
	["Thunder Lizards and Lightning Hides graze on Thunder Ridge, just west and south-west of Rezlak."] = "雷霆蜥蜴与闪电蜥蜴吃草在雷霆山，就在西与在雷兹拉克以西南。",
	["Thunderhawk Cloudscrapers circle over the same plains south of the camp."] = "雷鹰破云者法阵越过相同平原在营地以南。",
	["Thunderhead (59%), Owatanka (35%) in The Barrens, or wherever the arrow points"] = "电角蜥蜴（59%），奥瓦坦卡（35%）在贫瘠之地，或跟随箭头指示位置",
	["Thunderheads graze on the plains just south of Camp Taurajo. Owatanka, a blue thunder lizard, roams among them: his Tailspike starts a quest."] = "电角蜥蜴吃草在平原就在陶拉祖营地以南。奥瓦坦卡，一个蓝色雷电蜥蜴，游荡在其中：它们：他的尾刺始于一个任务。",
	["Thunderhorn Cleansing Totem"] = "雷角之井净化图腾",
	["Thundering Key"] = "雷霆钥匙",
	["Thundris Windweaver"] = "桑迪斯·织风",
	["Thundris Windweaver, north end of the village"] = "桑迪斯·织风，北尽头的村庄",
	["Thurman Agamand"] = "萨尔曼·阿加曼德",
	["Thyssiana"] = "赛希亚娜",
	["Thysta"] = "塞斯塔",
	["Thysta, the flight master, stands just east of the zeppelin tower. Fly to Stonard: the next guide starts there."] = "塞斯塔，飞行管理员，位于就在飞艇哨塔以东。飞往斯通纳德：下一个指南始于那里。",
	["Ticks once you finish the chain"] = "一旦满足即勾选：你完成任务链",
	["Tide Crawlers scuttle along the shore below the village; Buzzbox 827 stands on the beach just south of the docks. Darkshore Threshers swim in the shallows. The Beached Sea Creature lies on the shore just south of the village."] = "潮行蟹爬行沿着岸边在村庄下方；传声盒827号位于海滩上就在码头以南。黑海岸蛇颈龙游泳在浅滩。搁浅的海洋生物位于岸边就在村庄以南。",
	["Tideress, a corrupted water elemental, drifts in Mystral Lake. Her Befouled Water Globe starts a quest for Splintertree."] = "泰德雷斯，一个腐化的水元素，漂浮在密斯特拉湖。她的被污染的水球始于一个任务给碎木岗哨。",
	["Timber and iron piles lie around the keep and along the harbor's walls."] = "狂暴的冬狼与铁堆位于保留与沿着港口周围的城墙。",
	["Timbermaw Hold starts out Hostile, and its furbolgs in the tunnels attack until you reach Unfriendly. Every Deadwood and Winterfall furbolg you kill raises it, so the quests below pay twice. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "木喉要塞始于出敌对，与它的熊怪在隧道攻击直到你抵达冷淡。每个死木与寒冬熊怪你击杀提升它，因此任务下方奖励两次。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["Tinkee Steamboil"] = "丁奇·斯迪波尔",
	["Tirion lives in a small hut on the border river, north-east of the lumber camp. Hand in Of Forgotten Memories if you finished it."] = "提里奥住在一个小型小屋在边界河流，在伐木场营地以东北。上交遗忘的记忆如果你完成后它。",
	["Tirion's hunts are in the Eastern Plaguelands: keep them for later."] = "提里奥的狩猎是在东瘟疫之地：留着稍后做。",
	["Tirion's next task, Of Lost Honor, is not on this route. Skip it."] = "提里奥的下一个任务，失落的荣耀，是不在本路线内。跳过即可。",
	["Tiza Battleforge"] = "蒂萨·热炉",
	["Tiza Battleforge: Redemption"] = "蒂萨·热炉：救赎",
	["Tog'thar's ball and chain"] = "托格萨的铁球与任务链",
	["Tognus Flintfire"] = "托格努斯·燧火",
	["Tok'Kar"] = "托克卡尔",
	["Tomas"] = "厨师托马斯",
	["Tomas cooks in the inn's kitchen."] = "厨师托马斯烹饪在旅店内的厨房。",
	["Tome of the Cabal"] = "阴谋之书",
	["Tonga Runetotem"] = "图加·符文图腾",
	["Tooga"] = "图加",
	["Tooga waits in the valley. Walk him all the way to his wife Torta in Steamwheedle Port, north-east across the desert: stay close, slow down for him and fight off what attacks him. Do not mount or hearth out of his reach. Yeh'kinya stands in the port too."] = "图加等候于山谷。步行他全部路前往他的妻子托尔塔在热砂港，东北穿过沙漠：留在靠近，缓慢下给他与迎战偏离/关闭所攻击他。做不坐骑或炉石返回出的他的抵达。叶基亚位于港口也。",
	["Tor'gan"] = "托尔甘",
	["Tordrin Sternblade"] = "托德林·严刃",
	["Tordrin Sternblade stands behind the Abbey, by the stables."] = "托德林·严刃位于修道院后面，在旁兽栏。",
	["Torm Ragetotem"] = "托姆·狂暴图腾",
	["Torn Fin Oracle"] = "碎鳍智者",
	["Torn Fin Tidehunter"] = "碎鳍潮行鱼人",
	["Torn Murloc Fins"] = "破损的鱼人鳞片",
	["Torn Scroll"] = "破损的卷轴",
	["Torta"] = "托尔塔",
	["Torta, Steamwheedle Port"] = "托尔塔，热砂港",
	["Tortured Druid"] = "被折磨的德鲁伊",
	["Tortured Sentinel"] = "被折磨的哨兵",
	["Torwa camps in the south-east corner of the crater."] = "托尔瓦扎营在东南面角落的环形山。",
	["Torwa now asks for U'cha's pelt, back in the north-east cave: skip it."] = "托尔瓦现在需要尤尔查的毛皮，返回在东北面洞穴：跳过即可。",
	["Tough Condor Meat"] = "硬秃鹫肉",
	["Tough Wolf Meat"] = "硬狼肉",
	["Toxic Horrors are in Felwood, on a later trip: keep it if you have it."] = "剧毒之水是在费伍德森林，在后续行程中：请保留该任务/物品如果你已解锁/拥有它。",
	["Trackmaster Zherin"] = "赛道管理员泽尔林",
	["Train in Stormwind, north through Elwynn Forest. Then take the boat from Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine."] = "训练在暴风城，北穿过艾尔文森林。然后乘船来自暴风城港口前往奥伯丁。",
	["Train while you are in the Undercity: the trainers stand in the War Quarter, the Rogues' Quarter and the Magic Quarter (Paladins: Garen Largo)."] = "训练当你是在幽暗城：训练师位于军事区，潜行者的区与魔法区（圣骑士：加伦·拉尔戈）。",
	["Train your new spells."] = "训练你的新法术。",
	["Tran'rek"] = "特兰雷克",
	["Tran'rek's tar and Pestlezugg's samples come from Un'Goro Crater."] = "特兰雷克的焦油与炼金师匹斯特苏格的样本来自安戈洛环形山。",
	["Tran'rek, north side of town"] = "特兰雷克，北一侧的城镇",
	["Tree Frog Box, 1g"] = "树蛙盒，1金",
	["Trelane's Wand of Invocation"] = "特雷莱恩的符咒魔杖",
	["Triage: treat the wounded soldiers in the doctor's tent with the bandages the doctor gives you, the most critical first, before any of them die."] = "救死扶伤：点心受伤的士兵在医生的帐篷与绷带医生给你，大多数危急的第一，之前任意的它们死亡。",
	["Troll Tribal Necklace"] = "巨魔部族项链",
	["Troyas Moonbreeze: his answer waits in Rut'theran Village, later"] = "特洛亚斯·月风：他的答案等候于鲁瑟兰村，稍后",
	["Trull Failbane"] = "特鲁尔·法贝恩",
	["Trull Failbane: the owlbeasts are in Winterspring"] = "特鲁尔·法贝恩：枭兽是在冬泉谷",
	["Trull's next Wild Guardians would bring you back here from Winterspring. Skip it."] = "特鲁尔·法贝恩的下一个冬泉谷的枭兽会携带你返回此处来自冬泉谷。跳过即可。",
	["Tsunaman"] = "苏纳曼",
	["Tumbled Crystal"] = "打磨过的水晶",
	["Tundra MacGrann"] = "图德拉·马克格拉恩",
	["Tundra MacGrann camps in Chill Breeze Valley, south of Brewnall. His meats are in the locker in Old Icebeard's cave to the north-east of his camp: grab them and leave quickly."] = "图德拉·马克格拉恩扎营于寒风峡谷，在烈酒村以南。他的肉是在储物柜在冰须的洞穴向东北的他的营地：拿取它们与跳过迅速。",
	["Turak Runetotem"] = "图拉克·符文图腾",
	["Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise; Alodan the Hopeful"] = "图拉克·符文图腾在长者高地；怀抱希望的阿洛丹",
	["Turak Runetotem trains druids on Elder Rise. He teaches you Teleport: Moonglade; Dendrite Starblaze's welcome waits for your Cat Form trip at about 23 (forever/horde/04-the-barrens)."] = "图拉克·符文图腾训练德鲁伊在长者高地。他传授你传送：月光林地；德迪利特·星焰的欢迎信等候给你的猎豹形态行程在约23（无限服/部落/04--贫瘠之地）。",
	["Turak Runetotem, Elder Rise"] = "图拉克·符文图腾，长者高地",
	["Turak Runetotem: Aquatic Form"] = "图拉克·符文图腾：水栖形态",
	["Turak Runetotem: Cat Form"] = "图拉克·符文图腾：猎豹形态",
	["Turroc"] = "图罗克",
	["Turtle Meat"] = "海龟肉",
	["Twilight Geolords needs level 60"] = "暮光地王需要60级",
	["Twilight Keeper Exeter"] = "暮光守护者埃克斯特",
	["Twilight Keeper Exeter holds the cultists' camp in the far south-west."] = "暮光守护者埃克斯特持有邪教徒的扎营于远处西南。",
	["Twilight Keeper Exeter walks the Vanguard camp in the far south-west. Every cultist here drops Encrypted Twilight Texts, quest or not: collect twenty, ten for Bor Wildmane and ten for Ortell."] = "暮光守护者埃克斯特步行先锋扎营于远处西南。每个邪教徒此处掉落加密的暮光文本，任务或不：收集20，10给鲍尔·蛮鬃与10给隐士奥泰尔。",
	["Twilight Keeper Havunth stands in the outpost west of Cenarion Hold. Top your Encrypted Twilight Texts up to twenty on the cultists here."] = "暮光守护者哈弗斯位于前哨站在塞纳里奥要塞以西。顶部你的加密的暮光文本上前往20在邪教徒此处。",
	["Twilight Keeper Mayna holds the camp in the west."] = "暮光守护者玛恩纳持有营地在西面。",
	["Twilight Tablet Fragments"] = "暮光石板碎片",
	["Twilight's Hammer cultists"] = "暮光之锤邪教徒",
	["Twilight's Hammer cultists hold the camps in western Silithus. Twilight Geolords and Stonecallers mix here; any cultist can drop an Encrypted Twilight Text. Every cultist kill also counts toward the Cenarion Circle. The Geolords count for Twilight Geolords only if you are 60 and took it."] = "暮光之锤邪教徒要塞扎营于西部希利苏斯。暮光地王与暮光唤石者混合此处；任意邪教徒可以掉落一个暮光密文信。每个邪教徒击杀也计入朝向塞纳里奥议会。地质领主计入给暮光地王仅如果你是60与拿走它。",
	["Twitching Antennae from the silithid"] = "抽动的触角来自异种虫",
	["Two wrecks lie on the sea floor in the bay north of Auberdine; each holds a lockbox. Reef Crawlers and Encrusted Tide Crawlers line this shore."] = "2残骸位于大海楼层在海湾在奥伯丁以北；每个持有一个锁箱。暗礁蟹与硬壳潮行蟹路线此岸边。",
	["Tymor"] = "法师泰摩尔",
	["Tymor, Mystic Ward"] = "法师泰摩尔，秘法区",
	["Tyrande Whisperwind"] = "泰兰德·语风",
	["Tyranis' Pendant"] = "泰拉尼斯的坠饰",
	["Ukor stands on the road at the valley's eastern exit."] = "乌克尔位于路上在山谷的东部出口。",
	["Uldaman (level 41-51; may count in the 46-60 bracket)"] = "奥达曼（41-51级；可能计入在46-60等级段）",
	["Ultham Ironhorn"] = "奥萨姆·铁角",
	["Ultham Ironhorn, riding trainer"] = "奥萨姆·铁角，骑术训练师",
	["Umber in Moonglade: keep it"] = "阿姆伯尔在月光林地：请保留该任务/物品",
	["Umi Rumplesnicker"] = "乌米",
	["Umi's Mechanical Yeti"] = "乌米的机械雪人",
	["Umi's third prank targets goblins in Gadgetzan and Un'Goro: keep it for later."] = "乌米的第三恶作剧目标地精在加基森与安戈洛环形山：留着稍后做。",
	["Umpi, next to Lydon"] = "乌比，在药剂师林度恩旁边",
	["Un'Goro Ash"] = "安戈洛灰烬",
	["Un'Goro Gorilla Pelt"] = "安戈洛猩猩的皮",
	["Un'Goro Soil"] = "安戈洛的泥土",
	["Un'Goro Soil is gathered in the next guide; Magatha's payment goes back to Jediga later."] = "安戈洛的泥土是收集的在下一份指南中；玛加萨·野性图腾的报酬交回给杰迪加稍后。",
	["Un'Goro Stomper Pelt"] = "安戈洛巨猩猩的皮",
	["Un'Goro Thunderer Pelt"] = "安戈洛大猩猩的皮",
	["Uncracked Chillwind Horn"] = "完整的冰风奇美拉角",
	["Undead Ravager"] = "亡灵劫掠者",
	["Undead Ravagers roam the bone fields south of the Magram village, east of the Coven; at the far south-east, use the Crate of Ghost Magnets to draw the Magrami Spectres."] = "亡灵劫掠者游荡于骨头农田南的玛格拉姆村庄，在女巫团以东；在远处东南，使用幽灵磁铁箱前往引出玛格拉姆鬼魂。",
	["Undelivered Parcel, from the backpacks"] = "未递送的包裹，来自背包",
	["Unfinished Skeleton Key"] = "未完工的骷髅钥匙",
	["Unpainted Mechanostrider, 20g"] = "未涂色的机械陆行鸟，20金",
	["Unpopped Darkmist Eye"] = "黑雾蜘蛛的眼球",
	["Upper Blackrock Spire"] = "上层黑石塔",
	["Upper Blackrock Spire is a raid group of up to ten, level 58-60. Use Kibler's cage on a Bloodaxe Worg Pup (Halycon's den) to get the Caged Worg Pup."] = "上层黑石塔是一个团队副本队伍的上前往10，58-60级。使用基布雷尔的笼子在一个血斧座狼幼崽（哈雷肯的兽穴）前往获取笼中的座狼幼崽。",
	["Ur'endra roams the slopes just south of the turncoat's house."] = "乌尔恩德拉游荡于山坡就在叛徒以南的房屋。",
	["Ur'endra, in the highlands south-west of the cultist"] = "乌尔恩德拉，在高地在邪教徒以西南",
	["Ur'kyo"] = "乌尔库",
	["Ur'kyo stands in the Valley of Spirits, on the city's west side."] = "乌尔库位于精神谷，在主城的西一侧。",
	["Ur'kyo: Aelthalyste in the Undercity, two guides on"] = "乌尔库：艾萨莱斯特在幽暗城，2指南在",
	["Ur'kyo: Hex of Weakness"] = "乌尔库：虚弱妖术",
	["Ur'kyo: Shadowguard"] = "乌尔库：暗影守卫",
	["Urs'endris"] = "乌尔森德里斯",
	["Urs'endris waits by the falls just north of the watchtower."] = "乌尔森德里斯等候于坠落就在哨塔以北。",
	["Urs'endris waits by the falls north-east of Valanaar. Ur'endra prowls the Shen'dar Highlands west of Valanaar, by the road you take next."] = "乌尔森德里斯等候于坠落在瓦拉纳尔以东北。乌尔恩德拉潜行游荡申达尔高地在瓦拉纳尔以西，在路边你接取下一个。",
	["Urs'endris: Bear Form"] = "乌尔森德里斯：熊形态",
	["Use Smeed's Kodo Kombobulator on an Aged Kodo and walk the tamed kodo back to his camp, five times; Aged Kodos also drop the hides."] = "使用斯米德的科多兽诱引器在一个老迈的科多兽与步行驯服的科多兽返回前往他的营地，5次；老迈的科多兽也掉落藏身。",
	["Use Smeed's Kodo Kombobulator on an Aged, Dying or Ancient Kodo in the graveyard and walk the tamed kodo back to Smeed. Five kodos, one at a time."] = "使用斯米德的科多兽诱引器在一个老迈的科多兽，濒死的科多兽或远古科多兽在墓地与步行驯服的科多兽返回前往斯米德。5科多兽，1在一个时间。",
	["Use Umi's Mechanical Yeti on Quixxil"] = "使用乌米的机械雪人在奎克希尔",
	["Use Umi's Mechanical Yeti on Sprinkle, the goblin girl in Gadgetzan. Quixxil and Legacki are scared later in the route."] = "使用乌米的机械雪人在斯普琳科，地精女孩在加基森。奎克希尔与莱加奇是受惊的在路线稍后阶段。",
	["Use Walk on Air"] = "使用步行在空气",
	["Use the Amethyst Phial at the moonwell"] = "使用紫水晶瓶在月亮井处",
	["Use the Aspect of Neptulon on the poisoned water elementals of Eastern Plaguelands, then loot their Discordant Bracers (12). Our data has no spawn points for those elementals."] = "使用海神之水在中毒的水元素的东瘟疫之地，然后拾取它们的不谐护腕（12）。我们的数据有无刷新点数给那些元素。",
	["Use the Beacon Torch at the foot of each of the four watchtowers around the edge of Andorhal, north of the camp."] = "使用信号火炬在山脚的每个的4哨塔在边缘的周围安多哈尔，在营地以北。",
	["Use the Crystal Phial at the moonwell"] = "使用水晶之瓶在月亮井处",
	["Use the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on a Black Broodling on the slopes east of Flame Crest just before it dies, then loot the essence it leaves."] = "使用龙灵采集器900型在一个黑色小龙在山坡在烈焰峰以东就在之前它死亡，然后拾取精华它离开。",
	["Use the Empty Canteen at the corrupted moonwell in the middle of Jaedenar. If you freed Arko'narin, go back into Shadow Hold for the succubus Rakaiah; Trey Lightforge's remains lie beside her."] = "使用空壶在腐化的月亮井在加德纳尔的中央。如果你被解救的亚科纳琳，前往返回进入暗影堡给魅魔拉凯雅；特雷·莱弗治的残骸特雷·莱弗治的残骸的遗骸位于旁边她的。",
	["Use the Executor's Motivator on five idle Deathguards around town"] = "使用执行官的激励棒在5闲置的死亡卫兵周围城镇",
	["Use the Jade Phial at the moonwell"] = "使用翡翠瓶在月亮井处",
	["Use the Mangled Journal to start it"] = "使用残破的日记前往开始它",
	["Use the Symbol of Life on Henze Faulk"] = "使用生命符记在亨兹·法奥克",
	["Use the Symbol of Life on Narm Faulk"] = "使用生命符记在纳姆·法奥克",
	["Use the Temporal Displacer by the grain silos to draw out Temporal Parasites. The Annals of Darrowshire is one of the musty tomes in the town hall. Every skeleton in town drops Skeletal Fragments."] = "使用时空置换器在旁谷物粮仓前往引出出时光寄生虫。达隆郡的历史是1的发霉的典籍在市政厅内。每个骷髅在城镇掉落骸骨碎片。",
	["Use the Tourmaline Phial at the moonwell"] = "使用红玉瓶在月亮井处",
	["Use the jars on slain oozes"] = "使用罐子在击杀软泥怪",
	["Uthel'nay, Valley of Spirits"] = "尤塞尔奈，精神谷",
	["Uzzek"] = "犹塞克",
	["Vahlarriel Demonslayer"] = "瓦拉里尔·屠魔者",
	["Valennia Stormfist"] = "瓦伦妮娅·风暴之拳",
	["Valennia Stormfist and Talaanis Shadowsong stand at the north end of Valanaar, Elaadrin Evengale and Dondallion Whisperwind at the south end."] = "瓦伦妮娅·风暴之拳与塔拉尼斯·影歌位于瓦拉纳尔的北端，艾拉德琳·暮风与唐达里奥·语风在南尽头。",
	["Valennia Stormfist, in the sanctum"] = "瓦伦妮娅·风暴之拳，在圣殿",
	["Valley of Honor, then the Cleft of Shadow and the Valley of Spirits."] = "荣誉谷，然后暗影裂口与精神谷。",
	["Valreaa Valewind"] = "瓦尔蕾娅·谷风",
	["Valstag Ironjaw, by the keep"] = "瓦斯塔格·铁腭，在要塞旁",
	["Vayn Moongaze"] = "薇恩·月凝",
	["Vayn Moongaze sells the squirrel (50s) once you are Revered with the Nightclaw Druids."] = "薇恩·月凝出售松鼠（50银）一次你是与夜爪德鲁伊崇敬。",
	["Vayn Moongaze, Jorel Windsinger and Naaleos Leafwhisper are north-east of Elegael; Commander Haalien stands east of them. Haalien also drops a Ripped Missive."] = "薇恩·月凝，乔雷尔·风歌与纳里奥斯·叶语是在艾蕾盖尔·棘爪以东北；指挥官哈利恩位于它们东面。哈利恩也掉落一个撕裂的密信。",
	["Vehena takes cloth for Darkspear Trolls in the Valley of Spirits, Orgrimmar. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "维赫纳接收布料给暗矛巨魔在精神谷，奥格瑞玛。第一捐献的毛料，丝绸，魔纹布与符文布（60布料每个）已完成一次与交给大多数声望每布料；之后它们，更多的符文布可重复直到崇拜。崇拜与另一个种族的主城允许你购买该种族的坐骑。无限服的传承外交家特权提高声望提升。",
	["Vel'rin Fang"] = "维尔林·长牙",
	["Velma Warnam and Zachariah Post's stable are in Brill, Tirisfal Glades. At 40 Velma Warnam teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Horde race ride these."] = "维尔玛·瓦纳姆与撒迦利亚·普斯特的兽栏是在布瑞尔，提瑞斯法林地。在40维尔玛·瓦纳姆传授骑术（100金每暴雪的设计师），与学习它给你一个坐骑。无限服客户端允许每个部落种族骑行这些。",
	["Velma Warnam and Zachariah Post's stable are in Brill, Tirisfal Glades. At 60 Velma Warnam teaches Journeyman Riding (1,000g per Blizzard's designers); Blizzard says learning riding grants a mount. The Forever client sells each skeletal warhorse for 200g at level 60."] = "维尔玛·瓦纳姆与撒迦利亚·普斯特的兽栏是在布瑞尔，提瑞斯法林地。在60维尔玛·瓦纳姆传授中级骑术（1,000金每暴雪的设计师）；暴雪说学习骑行奖励一匹坐骑。无限服客户端出售每个骷髅战马给200金在60级。",
	["Velma Warnam, riding trainer"] = "维尔玛·瓦纳姆，骑术训练师",
	["Venom Fern Extract, from a Kurzen Supplies crate"] = "毒草汁液，来自一个库尔森补给品木箱",
	["Ventaari Brightwish"] = "文塔莉·明愿",
	["Venture Co. Deforester"] = "风险投资公司砍树工",
	["Venture Co. Enforcers at the Boulder Lode Mine (level 16-17) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "风险投资公司执行者在石矿洞（16-17级）掉落它此处。拍卖行有效也。",
	["Venture Co. Logger"] = "风险投资公司樵夫",
	["Venya Marthand"] = "温雅·玛山德",
	["Venya Marthand: Summon Imp"] = "温雅·玛山德：召唤小鬼",
	["Verna Furlbrow"] = "弗娜·法布隆",
	["Verog walks among the Kolkar at the Stagnant Oasis south-east of the Crossroads."] = "维罗戈步行在其中：科卡尔在死水绿洲东南的十字路口。",
	["Veron Amberstill"] = "维隆·冻石",
	["Veron Amberstill sells the other colours (200g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "维隆·冻石出售其他颜色（200金每个在无限服客户端）。购买任意你需要，或无如果坐骑你曾是给予的是1你像。",
	["Veron Amberstill sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "维隆·冻石出售其他颜色（20金每个在无限服客户端）。购买任意你需要，或无如果坐骑你曾是给予的是1你像。",
	["Veron Amberstill: other colours, 20g"] = "维隆·冻石：其他颜色，20金",
	["Vesprystus"] = "维斯派塔斯",
	["Vestia Moonspear"] = "维斯提亚·月矛",
	["Vial of Animal Blood: Stonetusk Boars"] = "一瓶动物鲜血：石牙野猪",
	["Vial of Blessed Water"] = "祝福之水",
	["Vial of Spider Venom"] = "瓶装蜘蛛毒液",
	["Videre Elixir"] = "视灵药剂",
	["Viktori Prism'Antras"] = "维克托·安特拉斯",
	["Viktori Prism'Antras, at the east end of town"] = "维克托·安特拉斯，在东尽头的城镇",
	["Viktori's house stands at the east end of town. Herble Baubbletump sells engineering goods in the house beside it."] = "维克托·安特拉斯的房屋位于东尽头的城镇。赫尔伯出售工程学商品在房屋旁边它。",
	["Vile Slimes, Western Plaguelands"] = "可憎的软泥怪，西瘟疫之地",
	["Vincent Hyal"] = "文森特·海厄尔",
	["Vincent Hyal, Mikhail and Tapoke Jahn are all at Menethil's inn; Tapoke fights you when you talk to Mikhail, but gives up once beaten."] = "文森特·海厄尔，米克哈尔与塔波克·詹是全部在米奈希尔的旅店；塔波克战斗你当你对话前往米克哈尔，但给予上一次被殴打的。",
	["Volcor"] = "沃科尔",
	["Volcor hides in the hills east of the Master's Glaive. Help him back to the road; he fights on his way out."] = "沃科尔藏身在丘陵东的主宰之剑。帮助他返回前往道路；他战斗在他的路出。",
	["Vrang Wildgore"] = "弗朗恩·凝血",
	["Vulgara lurks in the hills south-west of the village, on the way back. Vulgara the Insatiable is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "沃尔加拉潜伏在丘陵在村庄以西南，在返回途中。贪得无厌的沃尔加拉为精英：建议组队前往。",
	["Vulgara lurks south of the village, among the Prideclaws. Vulgara is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "沃尔加拉潜伏在村庄以南，在其中：傲爪兽。沃尔加拉为精英：建议组队前往。",
	["Vulgara's Head"] = "瓦尔加拉的头颅",
	["Vulture Gizzard"] = "秃鹫的砂囊",
	["WANTED poster"] = "通缉通缉令",
	["Wade across to the northern Echo Isle. The Matriarch prowls among the raptors there."] = "涉水穿过前往北部回音群岛。刺喉雌龙潜行游荡在其中：迅猛龙那里。",
	["Wade back west to the shore south of Sen'jin. Durotar Tigers roam it and the Taillasher eggs sit in nests along the beach."] = "涉水返回西前往岸边在森金村以南。杜隆塔尔猛虎游荡它与鞭尾蝎蛋坐在巢沿着海滩。",
	["Wade into the pools to explore them"] = "涉水进入水池前往探索它们",
	["Wailing Caverns (appears after the Disciple of Naralex's event)"] = "哀嚎洞穴（出现之后纳拉雷克斯的信徒的事件）",
	["Wait a moment for Eridan"] = "等待一个片刻给艾瑞丹·蓝风",
	["Wait a moment, then speak with her again"] = "等待一个片刻，然后对话与她的再次",
	["Walk Lynessa out and keep her alive"] = "步行哨兵莉妮莎·暮花出与保留她的存活",
	["Walk back north; the Crystalvein Mine lies west of the road in the middle of the jungle. The Crystal Spine Basilisks there drop the shards."] = "步行返回北；水晶矿洞位于道路在中间的丛林以西。晶背蜥蜴那里掉落碎片。",
	["Walk back onto the span: Ebenezer lies under its Arathi end."] = "步行返回登上大桥：埃比尼泽位于下方它的阿拉希高地尽头。",
	["Walk back south to the Crossroads. The next guide starts here and takes you to Orgrimmar and the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades."] = "步行返回南前往十字路口。下一个指南始于此处与接收你前往奥格瑞玛与飞艇前往提瑞斯法林地。",
	["Walk back to Hillsbrad Foothills and north through the Alterac Mountains to Chillwind Camp in southern Western Plaguelands."] = "步行返回前往希尔斯布莱德丘陵与北穿过奥特兰克山脉前往冰风岗在南部西瘟疫之地。",
	["Walk back to Hillsbrad Foothills and north through the Alterac Mountains, or from Tirisfal Glades east past The Bulwark, into Western Plaguelands."] = "步行返回前往希尔斯布莱德丘陵与北穿过奥特兰克山脉，或来自提瑞斯法林地东经过亡灵壁垒，进入西瘟疫之地。",
	["Walk back up the road to the Crossroads. Savannah Prowlers hunt along it and on the plains west of town: finish the claws before you hand them in."] = "步行返回顺着道路往上前往十字路口。草原徘徊者狩猎沿着它与在平原在城镇西面：完成爪之前你上交它们在。",
	["Walk back west along the road to the Crossroads."] = "步行返回西沿着道路前往十字路口。",
	["Walk back west over the bridge to the Crossroads."] = "步行返回西越过桥前往十字路口。",
	["Walk east from Hillsbrad into the Arathi Highlands (level 30+ creatures off the road), south to the Thandol Span bridge, and across it into the Wetlands. Menethil Harbor is an Alliance town."] = "步行东来自希尔斯布莱德进入阿拉希高地（30级+ 生物道路两侧），南前往萨多尔大桥桥，与穿过它进入湿地。米奈希尔港是一个联盟城镇。",
	["Walk east out of Stonetalon (or south out of Ashenvale) into the Barrens. The Crossroads and Camp Taurajo are Horde towns; Ratchet is a neutral port."] = "步行东离开石爪山脉（或南离开灰谷）进入贫瘠之地。十字路口与陶拉祖营地是部落城镇；棘齿城是一个中立港口。",
	["Walk in through the main gate. Thatog stands in the Valley of Strength; Borstan's Firepit is a few steps north."] = "步行在穿过主大门。萨托格位于力量谷；博斯坦的火坑是一个少量台阶北。",
	["Walk into Timbermaw Hold and take the Moonglade branch of the tunnel to Nighthaven."] = "步行进入木喉要塞与接取月光林地树枝的隧道前往永夜港。",
	["Walk into the Timbermaw Hold tunnel beside Nafien and never attack the Timbermaw furbolgs inside. The tunnel opens into Winterspring; follow the road east to Everlook, the goblin town where the next guide starts."] = "步行进入木喉要塞隧道在纳菲恩旁边与从不攻击木喉熊怪内部。隧道开启进入冬泉谷；沿着道路前往东前往永望镇，地精城镇在下一个指南始于。",
	["Walk into the mine"] = "步行进入采矿",
	["Walk north to Shen'dar Village; finish the Strider Meat on the Galestriders along the way if you are short."] = "步行北前往申达尔村；完成陆行鸟肉在疾风陆行鸟沿途如果数量还不够。",
	["Walk on west to Calvin and talk to him: he wants a duel."] = "步行在西前往卡尔文·蒙泰古与对话前往他：他需要一个决斗。",
	["Walk south along the island to the naga ruins; the gazebo stands among them."] = "步行南沿着岛屿前往纳迦废墟；凉亭位于其中：它们。",
	["Walk south along the west side of the island. Ursal prowls the far south, below the Pools of Arlithrien."] = "步行南沿着西一侧的岛屿。乌萨尔潜行游荡远处南，下方阿里斯瑞恩之池。",
	["Walk south from Brill to the Ruins of Lordaeron and down into the Undercity. Carendin Halgar stands in the Magic Quarter. The Scarlet camp is just west of the ruins."] = "步行南来自布瑞尔前往洛丹伦废墟与下进入幽暗城。凯伦丁·哈加尔位于魔法区。血色营地是就在废墟以西。",
	["Walk south-east from Brill to the zeppelin towers outside the Ruins of Lordaeron and board the zeppelin to Orgrimmar (the other one goes to Grom'gol)."] = "步行东南来自布瑞尔前往飞艇哨塔外部洛丹伦废墟与告示板飞艇前往奥格瑞玛（其他1前往/交给格罗姆高）。",
	["Walk south-east from Thunder Ridge back to Razor Hill."] = "步行东南来自雷霆山返回前往剃刀岭。",
	["Walk south-west to the Solliden Farmstead; Simmer stands at the farm."] = "步行西南前往索利丹农场；亡灵卫兵希米尔位于农场。",
	["Walk through Timbermaw Hold to Felwood and fly on to the Eastern Kingdoms (Auberdine, the boat to Menethil Harbor). Fly to Southshore and ride north up the road through Alterac to Chillwind Camp."] = "步行穿过木喉要塞前往费伍德森林与飞往在前往东部王国（奥伯丁，船前往米奈希尔港）。飞往南海镇与骑行北顺着道路往上穿过奥特兰克前往冰风岗。",
	["Walk through the mine"] = "步行穿过采矿",
	["Walk with the caravan south past Kolkar Village; Kolkar ambushers jump it on the way. Stay close until it stops at Scrabblescrew's Camp. The ambushers are 34-35 and come in waves: skip it if you are below 33."] = "步行与商队南经过科尔卡村；科卡尔伏击者跳下它在途中。留在靠近直到它停靠在瑟卡布斯库的营地。伏击者是34-35与来到在波次：跳过即可如果你是下方33。",
	["Walton"] = "沃尔顿",
	["Warsong Gulch"] = "战歌峡谷",
	["Warsong Outrider"] = "战歌侦查骑兵",
	["Warsong Runner"] = "战歌信使",
	["Warsong Scout"] = "战歌斥候",
	["Washte Pawne's Feather"] = "瓦希塔帕恩的羽毛",
	["Wastewander Assassin"] = "废土刺客",
	["Wastewander Bandit"] = "废土强盗",
	["Wastewander Rogue"] = "废土游荡者",
	["Wastewander Shadow Mage"] = "废土暗法师",
	["Wastewander Thief"] = "废土窃贼",
	["Wastewander Water Pouch"] = "废土水袋",
	["Watcher Backus"] = "守夜人巴库斯",
	["Watcher Backus, at the north entrance of town"] = "守夜人巴库斯，在北入口的城镇",
	["Watcher Biggs"] = "卫兵比格斯",
	["Watcher Dodds stands south of the road, at the Yorgen Farmstead."] = "守夜人道茨位于道路以南，在约根农庄。",
	["Watcher Mahar Ba"] = "看守者马哈尔巴",
	["Watchmaster Sorigal"] = "守卫队长索里加尔",
	["Water Elemental Bracers"] = "水元素护腕",
	["Water Elemental Core"] = "水元素核心",
	["Water Seekers, Thornweavers and Hunters hold the camp east of the Crossroads. The supply crates sit at its eastern end. Warriors: the Stolen Iron Chest stands in the camp. Shamans: the quilboar drop the Fire Tar. Kill Savannah Prowlers you pass for their claws."] = "水搜寻者迪亚索鲁斯，织棘者与猎人要塞营地东的十字路口。补给木箱坐在它的东部尽头。战士：被偷走的铁箱位于营地里。萨满祭司：野猪人掉落火焰焦油。击杀草原徘徊者你穿过给它们的爪。",
	["Waterlogged Axe"] = "浸水的斧头",
	["Waterlogged Saw"] = "浸水的锯子",
	["Waterlogged Toolbox"] = "浸水的工具箱",
	["Webbed Diemetradon Scale"] = "精细的双帆龙鳞片",
	["Webbed Pterrordax Scale"] = "精细的翼手龙鳞片",
	["Webwood Lurker: tame it with the Taming Rod"] = "树林潜伏者：驯服它与驯兽棒",
	["Webwood Lurkers"] = "树林潜伏者",
	["Webwood Spider Silk"] = "树林蜘蛛丝",
	["Webwood Spiders"] = "树林蜘蛛",
	["West along the coast to the goblins' cove; Lolo keeps watch on the rocks above it."] = "西沿着海岸前往地精的小湾；哨兵鲁鲁保留守望在岩石上方它。",
	["West along the road south; Marvon camps by the ruins at the Broken Pillar. Put on his Gahz'ridian Detector: it shows the buried ornaments, here and around the Dunemaul Compound."] = "西沿着道路南；马冯扎营在旁废墟在破碎石柱。放置在他的加兹瑞迪安探测器：它显示埋藏的饰物，此处与周围砂槌营地。",
	["West of Freewind, the Grimtotem camps below Darkcloud Pinnacle. The Secret Notes are in Document Chests at the south-east, south-west and north-west camps."] = "在乱风岗以西，恐怖图腾营地在黑云峰下方。秘密笔记是在文件箱在东南，西南与西北扎营。",
	["West of Gadgetzan, use the Untapped Dowsing Widget beside the water hole in the troll camp."] = "在加基森以西，使用未使用的寻水器在水洞在巨魔营地旁边。",
	["West of Gann, the Razormane hold Blackthorn Ridge. Kuz is on the east side, Nak to the south, Lok Orcbane at the west end. Lok (25) and the Warfrenzies (24-25) are a few levels above you; Hagg Taurenbane, a rare elite, sometimes walks the ridge: leave him. Pathfinders and Stalkers drop the Backstabber, Seers the Wand, Warfrenzies the War Shield. Stormhide lizards and Hecklefang Stalkers roam the plain between Gann and the ridge. Washte Pawne, a rare red wind serpent, flies over the ridge: its feather starts a quest."] = "在加恩·石塔以西，钢鬃要塞黑棘山。卡兹是在东一侧，纳克向南，洛克·奥克班恩在西尽头。洛克（25）与狂战者（24-25）是一个少量等级上方你；哈格，一个稀有精英，有时步行山脊：跳过他。托尔瓦·寻路者与钢鬃捕猎者掉落背刺者，先知魔杖，狂战者战盾。雷鳞蜥蜴蜥蜴与乱齿捕猎者游荡于平原在加恩·石塔与山脊之间。瓦希塔帕恩，一个稀有红色风风蛇，飞往越过山脊：它的羽毛始于一个任务。",
	["West of Molsen Farm, toward the coast. Riverpaw Miners work the quarry."] = "在莫尔森农场以西，朝海岸方向。河爪矿工有效采石场。",
	["West of Mystral Lake, the stardust bushes grow among the ruins."] = "在密斯特拉湖以西，星尘灌木生长在其中：废墟。",
	["West of Saldean's. Harvest Watchers and Golems work the fields; they drop the isosprings, gyrostabilizers, Okra and sometimes a Precessive Autocognition Assembly. Foe Reaper 4000, a level 20 rare, walks here: leave it alone. Keep killing Goretusks and Fleshrippers on every leg of this loop."] = "在萨尔玛·萨丁的以西。看守傀儡与魔像有效农田；它们掉落温泉，陀螺稳定器，秋葵与有时一个进动自认知组件。死敌收割机4000，一个20级稀有，步行此处：可先放着不做独自。保留击杀血牙野猪与碎尸鸟在每个腿的此环线。",
	["West of Tarren Mill, Gray Bears, Forest Moss Creepers and Starving Mountain Lions roam the hills on the way down to the farms. The creepers drop Creeper Ichor rarely; you need only one."] = "在塔伦米尔以西，灰熊，森林食苔蛛与饥饿的山地狮游荡于丘陵在途中下前往农场。爬行者掉落食苔蛛的毒液极少；你需要仅1。",
	["West of Whitereach the wyverns nest on the Highperch cliffs; the eggs lie in the nests. Pao'ka Swiftmountain waits on the east side of the nesting grounds: free him and keep him alive on the walk back to Whitereach Post."] = "在白触岗哨以西双足飞龙巢在风巢悬崖；蛋位于巢。波卡·雨山等候在巢领地的东侧：解救他与保留他存活在步行返回前往白沙岗哨。",
	["West of the compound the cactus creatures fill the valley; only the Dew Collectors carry a dew gland. Most mobs in Tanaris can drop OOX-17/TN's distress beacon, rarely: keep it if you see one."] = "在营区仙人掌生物装满山谷以西；仅露水收藏家库米沙携带一个露水腺体。大多数怪物在塔纳利斯可以掉落 OOX-17/TN型定位器的求救信标，极少：请保留该任务/物品如果你查看1。",
	["West of the cove the Daggerspine Raiders and Sorceresses (38-40) hold the shore: pull them one at a time. The two wrecks lie in the shallows off it, the charts and logs inside them; the gems lie on the sea floor around the wrecks."] = "在小湾以西刺脊袭击者与女巫（38-40）要塞岸边：拉怪它们1在一个时间。2残骸位于浅滩偏离/关闭它，海图与原木内部它们；宝石位于大海楼层在残骸周围。",
	["West of the expedition, the Bloodscalp chiefs Gan'zulah and Nezzliok stand together in the ruins of Zul'Kunda. Clear their guards first, then pull them."] = "在远征队以西，血顶首领甘祖拉恩与奈兹里奥克位于一起在废墟中的祖尔昆达。清理它们的卫兵第一，然后拉怪它们。",
	["West of the island, the Vilebranch scalpers hold the temples of Agol'watha and Shaol'watha. Slagtree's tools lie at one of the temples."] = "在岛屿以西，邪枝剥皮匪要塞神庙的亚戈瓦萨与沙尔瓦萨。铁匠斯拉提的工具位于1的神庙。",
	["West past the camp, Crystal Spine Basilisks (34-35) sit on the rocks; every Bloodscalp in the village beyond can drop an ear."] = "西经过营地，晶背蜥蜴（34-35）坐在岩石；每个血顶在村子里越过可以掉落一个耳朵。",
	["West to the Bulwark. The next guide starts in the Undercity, a short ride west."] = "西前往亡灵壁垒。下一个指南始于幽暗城，一个不足骑行西。",
	["West to the Dry Hills. The Witchwing harpies nest all over them; any of them can drop a talon. Chen's Empty Keg lies in their hills."] = "西前往枯水谷。巫翼鹰身女妖巢全部越过它们；任意的它们可以掉落一个利爪。老陈的空酒桶位于它们的丘陵。",
	["West, the Centipaar insects swarm around their hives; any of them drops the parts."] = "西，森提帕尔昆虫虫群周围它们的虫巢；任意的它们掉落零件。",
	["Westfall Deed"] = "西部荒野地契",
	["Westfall borders Duskwood to the west. Sentinel Hill is an Alliance town."] = "西部荒野接壤暮色森林向西。哨兵岭是一个联盟城镇。",
	["Westfall borders Elwynn Forest to the west: follow the road out past the Westbrook Garrison."] = "西部荒野接壤艾尔文森林向西：沿着道路前往出经过西泉要塞。",
	["Wetlands Crocolisk (50%) in Wetlands, or wherever the arrow points"] = "湿地鳄鱼（50%）在湿地，或跟随箭头指示位置",
	["Wetlands whelps"] = "湿地雏龙",
	["Wharfmaster Dizzywig"] = "码头管理员迪兹维格",
	["Which quest Blizzard counts as the end of the questline (Return to Bodley or your class's Saving the Best for Last) is unconfirmed until the Legacy data is recorded."] = "其中任务暴雪计入作为尽头的任务线（向伯德雷回复或你的职业的把最好的留到最后）是待确认直到传承数据是记录。",
	["While Zamek keeps Rizzle talking, his plans lie unguarded in the gnome camp across the track."] = "当扎米克保留里兹尔对话，他的图纸位于无守卫的在侏儒营地穿过追踪。",
	["Whistle of the Emerald Raptor, 20g"] = "绿色迅猛龙之哨，20金",
	["Whistle of the Turquoise Raptor, 20g"] = "青色迅猛龙之哨，20金",
	["Whistle of the Venomhide Ravasaur (level 60) is in the Forever client, but its source is not known yet."] = "毒皮魔暴龙哨（60级）是在无限服客户端，但其获取来源尚不明确。",
	["Whistle of the Violet Raptor, 20g"] = "紫色迅猛龙之哨，20金",
	["White Kodo and Lavender Kodo are new Forever kodos (level 40, 20g in the client) whose source is not known yet."] = "白色科多兽与淡紫色科多兽是新无限服科多兽（40级，20金在客户端）其获取来源尚不明确。",
	["White Ram, 20g"] = "白山羊，20金",
	["Whuut"] = "伍特",
	["Wildkin Feather"] = "枭兽羽毛",
	["Wildmane Cleansing Totem"] = "蛮鬃之井净化图腾",
	["Wiley the Black, by the docks"] = "黑衣威利，在旁码头",
	["William Pestle"] = "威廉·匹斯特",
	["William Pickman, in the inn: ask him about cooking"] = "威廉·皮克曼，在旅店内：要求他约烹饪",
	["Williden Marshal"] = "威利德·马绍尔",
	["Wind Hollows drift over the lowlands around Valanaar. The first Construct Parts lie west of the orchard road."] = "风穴魔漂浮越过低地在瓦拉纳尔周围。第一失灵的旋风构造体零件位于果园道路以西。",
	["Windcaller Proudhorn"] = "唤风者梅恩·长角",
	["Windfield Orchard is west of Valanaar along the coast road."] = "风野果园是在瓦拉纳尔以西沿着海岸道路。",
	["Windmistress Gaedress' Amulet"] = "风语者盖德蕾丝的护符",
	["Windshaper Boro"] = "塑风者博罗",
	["Windshaper Boro sends you to the Rise of Spirits, just east of the village: drink the Earth Sapta there to see the Minor Manifestation of Earth, then take the Rough Quartz back to him."] = "塑风者博罗派你前往灵魂高地，就在村庄以东：饮用大地萨普塔那里前往查看大地之魂，然后接取粗石英返回前往他。",
	["Windshaper Boro stands in the village."] = "塑风者博罗位于村子里。",
	["Windshaper Boro: Stoneskin Totem and your Earth Totem"] = "塑风者博罗：石肤图腾与你的大地图腾",
	["Windsong Crawler: tame it with the Taming Rod"] = "风歌爬行者：驯服它与驯兽棒",
	["Winna Hazzard"] = "温娜·哈萨德",
	["Winterfall Den Watcher"] = "冬泉巢穴守卫",
	["Winterfall Pathfinder"] = "冬泉探路者",
	["Winterfall Ritual Totem, a rare drop"] = "冬泉仪祭图腾，稀有掉落",
	["Winterfall Ritual Totem, a rare drop from the Winterfall furbolgs"] = "冬泉仪祭图腾，由寒冬熊怪稀有掉落",
	["Winterfall Shaman"] = "冬泉萨满祭司",
	["Winterfall Totemic"] = "冬泉图腾师",
	["Winterfall Ursa"] = "冬泉巨熊怪",
	["Winterfall Village sits on the eastern side of Winterspring. Keep every Winterfall Spirit Beads you loot: Salfa takes them."] = "寒水村位于冬泉谷的东侧。保留每个冬泉灵魂珠串你拾取：萨尔法接收它们。",
	["Winterhoof Cleansing Totem"] = "冰蹄之井净化图腾",
	["Witch Doctor Jin'Zil"] = "巫医金吉尔",
	["Witch Doctor Mau'ari, beside him"] = "巫医玛艾里，旁边他",
	["Witch Doctor Unbagwa"] = "巫医安巴格瓦",
	["Witch Doctor Uzer'i"] = "巫医尤克里",
	["Witch Doctor Uzer'i: for Orgrimmar, around level 45"] = "巫医尤克里：给奥格瑞玛，周围45级",
	["Witchmother Arysa's Amulet"] = "巫母阿莉萨的护符",
	["With Carlin's quest in your log, slain Scourge sometimes leave a Darrowshire Spirit; talk to it to free it. Kill undead on the ride south-west to Darrowshire."] = "与卡林的任务在你的原木，击杀天灾军团有时跳过一个达隆郡居民的灵魂；对话前往它前往解救它。击杀亡灵在骑行西南前往达隆郡。",
	["Witherbark Medicine Pouch"] = "枯木巨魔的医药包",
	["Witherbark Skull"] = "枯木头颅",
	["Witherbark Tusk"] = "枯木巨魔的獠牙",
	["Wizards' Reagents"] = "巫师的材料",
	["Wizbang Cranktoggle, by the inn"] = "维兹班恩·曲针，在旅店旁",
	["Wizzle Brassbolts"] = "维兹尔·铜栓",
	["Wizzlecrank drives his shredder out of the camp: stay with him and kill whatever attacks him. Sputtervalve takes it in Ratchet."] = "维兹尔克兰克驾驶他的伐木机离开营地：留在与他与击杀任何攻击他。斯布特瓦夫接收该任务在棘齿城。",
	["Wolves: Ogunaro Wolfrunner, beside Kildar."] = "狼：奥古纳罗，在基尔达旁边。",
	["Wood Frog Box, 1g"] = "林蛙盒，1金",
	["Wool Bandage is yellow from 80 (yellow at 80, grey at 150): about 49 crafts to 115. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any First Aid trainer of your faction teaches it; the arrow picks the nearest."] = "绒线绷带是黄色来自80（黄色在80，灰色在150）：约49制作前往115。绷带需要无营火：制作它们任何地方。任意急救训练师的你的阵营传授它；箭头会自动指向最近的一位。",
	["Wool Cloth"] = "毛料",
	["Worg Carrier"] = "座狼笼",
	["Worn Parchment: Dark Strand Fanatics"] = "破旧的羊皮纸：暗滩狂热者",
	["Wrecked Row Boat"] = "搁浅的小船",
	["Wrenix the Wretched"] = "卑鄙的维尼克斯",
	["Writhing Haunt Cauldron Key"] = "嚎哭鬼屋的瘟疫之锅钥匙",
	["Wu Shen"] = "武神",
	["Wu Shen trains warriors in Old Town, beside the Pig and Whistle. Klannoc Macleod waits on Fray Island in the Barrens, on the way to Ratchet much later (40-50/01)."] = "武神训练战士在旧城区，旁边猪和哨声旅店。克兰诺克·马克雷德等候于勇士岛在贫瘠之地，在途中前往棘齿城很久以后（40-50/01）。",
	["Wynd Nightchaser"] = "维恩德·夜风",
	["Xan'tish"] = "克萨迪斯",
	["Xan'tish sells four snakes in Orgrimmar (50s each); the Jungle Boa is new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "克萨迪斯出售4蛇在奥格瑞玛（50银每个）；丛林蚺蛇是新在无限服。每个宠物物品传授它的伙伴当你使用它；目标留在勾选随后。",
	["Xar'Ti"] = "克萨尔迪",
	["Xar'Ti and Zjolnir's raptors are in Sen'jin Village on the Durotar coast. At 40 Xar'Ti teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Horde race ride these."] = "克萨尔迪与佐尔尼尔的迅猛龙是在森金村在杜隆塔尔海岸。在40克萨尔迪传授骑术（100金每暴雪的设计师），与学习它给你一个坐骑。无限服客户端允许每个部落种族骑行这些。",
	["Xar'Ti and Zjolnir's raptors are in Sen'jin Village on the Durotar coast. At 60 Xar'Ti teaches Journeyman Riding (1,000g per Blizzard's designers); Blizzard says learning riding grants a mount. The Forever client sells each swift raptor for 200g at level 60."] = "克萨尔迪与佐尔尼尔的迅猛龙是在森金村在杜隆塔尔海岸。在60克萨尔迪传授中级骑术（1,000金每暴雪的设计师）；暴雪说学习骑行奖励一匹坐骑。无限服客户端出售每个迅捷迅猛龙给200金在60级。",
	["Xar'Ti, riding trainer"] = "克萨尔迪，骑术训练师",
	["Xavaric"] = "萨瓦里克",
	["Xavathras"] = "萨瓦瑟拉斯",
	["Xiggs waits in the Military Ward."] = "驾驶员西格斯·熔光等候于军事区。",
	["Xylem's tower stands on the cliff just north of Valormok; the path winds up its north side."] = "大法师克希雷姆的哨塔位于悬崖就在瓦罗莫克以北；小径风上它的北一侧。",
	["Yala Windwatcher"] = "雅拉·观风者",
	["Yala Windwatcher keeps watch east of the grove. The Roiling Winds and Al'Aketh Converts gather just north of her; the Ley Line rises further north."] = "雅拉·观风者保留守望在树林以东。翻腾之风与奥阿凯斯皈依者采集就在她北面；魔网能量线高地更远处北。",
	["Yala Windwatcher stands at the Thendal Standing Stones, east of the village. Roiling Winds and Al'Aketh Converts gather just north of her; the Elemental Convergence is just north-east of her."] = "雅拉·观风者位于森达尔立石，在村庄以东。翻腾之风与奥阿凯斯皈依者采集就在她北面；元素交汇点是就在她东北面。",
	["Yama Snowhoof"] = "雅玛·雪蹄",
	["Yarlyn Amberstill"] = "亚尔林·冻石",
	["Yarlyn Amberstill stands at Amberstill Ranch, east of Kharanos. Each rabbit crate costs 20s; the Arctic and Brown crates are new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "亚尔林·冻石位于冻石农场，在卡拉诺斯以东。每个兔子木箱花费20银；北极与李·布朗木箱是新在无限服。每个宠物物品传授它的伙伴当你使用它；目标留在勾选随后。",
	["Yarrog Baneshadow waits at the back of the cave on the valley's north side."] = "亚罗格·刺影等候在洞穴在山谷的后方的北一侧。",
	["Yaw Sharpmane"] = "雅文·刺鬃",
	["Yeh'kinya"] = "叶基亚",
	["Yeh'kinya: the screechers live in Feralas"] = "叶基亚：尖啸者实测在菲拉斯",
	["Yellow Power Crystal"] = "黄色能量水晶",
