	["Yelmak"] = "耶尔玛克",
	["Yeti Fur"] = "雪人的毛皮",
	["Yorana Windyreed"] = "约拉娜·风苇",
	["Yorana Windyreed holds the watchtower north of Valanaar. The Al'Aketh camp is beside the tower; Commander Belguilos stands at its north end. The Al'Aketh there drop Windstone Charms."] = "约拉娜·风苇持有哨塔在瓦拉纳尔以北。阿尔阿凯斯营地是在哨塔旁边；指挥官贝尔吉洛斯位于它的北尽头。奥阿凯斯那里掉落芬达尔·风石护符。",
	["You arrive bound at the Tarren Mill inn. Everyone stands around the town square."] = "你抵达绑定在塔伦米尔旅店。所有人位于城镇广场周围。",
	["You arrive from Far Watch Post. Sergra stands by the inn; Thork and Darsok on the tower platform; Helbrim and Gazrog by the north gate; Tonga at the south gate."] = "你抵达来自前沿哨所。瑟格拉·黑棘位于旅店旁；索克与达索克·快刀在哨塔平台上；药剂师赫布瑞姆与加兹罗格在旁北大门；图加·符文图腾在南大门。",
	["You end at the Forgotten Coast dock: the Tanaris guide starts with the trip east from here."] = "你尽头在被遗忘的海岸码头：塔纳利斯指南始于行程东来自此处。",
	["You leave the isle for good. Alaana Stormwalker waits where the airship lands."] = "你跳过岛给好。阿拉娜·风暴行者等候在飞艇之地。",
	["You rise in the crypt at the south end of Deathknell. Undertaker Mordo waits just outside."] = "你高地在地穴在丧钟镇的南端。管理员摩尔多等候就在外部。",
	["You start at the foot of Aldrassil, the great tree of Shadowglen."] = "你开始在奥达希尔的底部，巨型树的幽影谷。",
	["You start in Ratchet, where the previous guide hearthed you. Fly to Astranaar."] = "你开始在棘齿城，在上一个指南炉石返回你。飞往阿斯特兰纳。",
	["You start in Stonard. Bind here: you hearth back after the coast."] = "你开始在斯通纳德。绑定此处：你炉石返回返回之后海岸。",
	["You start in front of Anvilmar, the stone hall at the north end of the valley. Sten Stoutarm waits outside the door."] = "你开始在安威玛尔前面，石头大厅在山谷的北端。斯登·粗臂等候在门外。",
	["You start in front of the Abbey. Deputy Willem stands at the foot of the steps, Marshal McBride inside the hall, Brother Paxton and Daniel in the library to the right, Eagan Peltskinner outside the north-west corner."] = "你开始在修道院前面。维里副队长位于台阶的底部，治安官玛克布莱德在大厅内，帕克斯顿修士与丹尼尔在图书馆内前往右侧，伊根·派特斯金纳在北外-西角落。",
	["You start on the mesa of Camp Narache. Grull and the chief stand by the big tent in the middle."] = "你开始在台地的纳拉其营地。格鲁尔·鹰风与首领站在旁边：大帐篷在中间。",
	["You wake in Thendal Grove. Ailee Farheart stands beside you; Rorian the Dayseeker is a few steps west, Elatrell Featherlight by the south edge of the grove."] = "你唤醒在森达尔林地。艾莉·远心站在旁边：你；寻日者罗里安是一个少量台阶西，艾拉特蕾尔·轻羽在旁南边缘的树林。",
	["You wake in Thendal Village, in the north of the isle. Ailee stands by the path, Rorian at the village centre."] = "你唤醒在森达尔村，在岛以北。艾莉·远心站在旁边：小径，寻日者罗里安在村庄中心。",
	["Young Crocolisk Skin"] = "小鳄鱼皮",
	["Young Forest Bear"] = "森林熊幼崽",
	["Young Goretusks and Fleshrippers roam the fields around the farm: start on livers and the stew's meat on the way back."] = "幼年血牙野猪与碎尸鸟游荡于农田在农场周围：开始在肝脏与炖菜的肉在返回途中。",
	["Young Nightsabers and Young Thistle Boars roam around Aldrassil. Grells carry Fel Moss in the woods west of the tree, where the Gnarlpine Totems stand."] = "夜刃豹幼崽与草刺野猪幼崽游荡在奥达希尔周围。小劣魔携带魔苔在树林在树以西，在扭木图腾位于。",
	["Young Panther"] = "猎豹幼崽",
	["Young Sawtooth Crocolisk"] = "小盐齿鳄鱼",
	["Young Stranglethorn Tiger"] = "荆棘谷猛虎幼崽",
	["Young Stranglethorn Tigers prowl west of the camp, Young Panthers south and east of it."] = "荆棘谷猛虎幼崽游荡在营地以西，猎豹幼崽南与在它东面。",
	["Young Wolves and Timber Wolves roam the fields right around the Abbey."] = "幼狼与森林狼游荡于农田右侧在修道院周围。",
	["Young crocolisks, Sorrow Spinners and Swamp Jaguars all roam the swamp around the road."] = "幼年鳄鱼，沼泽纺丝蛛与沼泽虎全部游荡于沼泽在道路周围。",
	["Your trainer is in Thunder Bluff, one flight away: Turak Runetotem (Druids) on Elder Rise, Alodan the Hopeful (Paladins). Fly on to Sun Rock Retreat from there."] = "你的训练师是在雷霆崖，1飞行离开：图拉克·符文图腾（德鲁伊）在长者高地，怀抱希望的阿洛丹（圣骑士）。飞往在前往烈日石居来自那里。",
	["Your trainer is in Thunder Bluff, one flight from Orgrimmar: Turak Runetotem (Druids) on Elder Rise, Alodan the Hopeful (Paladins). Fly on to the Crossroads from there."] = "你的训练师是在雷霆崖，1飞行来自奥格瑞玛：图拉克·符文图腾（德鲁伊）在长者高地，怀抱希望的阿洛丹（圣骑士）。飞往在前往十字路口来自那里。",
	["Your trainer is in Thunder Bluff: Turak Runetotem (Druids) on Elder Rise, Alodan the Hopeful (Paladins). Fly there from Orgrimmar, then on to Freewind Post."] = "你的训练师是在雷霆崖：图拉克·符文图腾（德鲁伊）在长者高地，怀抱希望的阿洛丹（圣骑士）。飞往那里来自奥格瑞玛，然后在前往乱风岗。",
	["Your trainer is in Thunder Bluff: fly there (no flight path there yet? fly to Camp Taurajo and ride west through Mulgore), then on to Brackenwall Village."] = "你的训练师是在雷霆崖：飞往那里（无飞行点那里尚? 飞往前往陶拉祖营地与骑行西穿过莫高雷），然后在前往蕨墙村。",
	["Yvette Farthing, in the inn"] = "伊维特·法席恩，在旅店内",
	["Zaal Stormshield holds the Skybreaker Bulwark on the west side of the shrine."] = "扎尔·风暴之盾持有破天壁垒在神龛的西侧。",
	["Zachariah Post"] = "撒迦利亚·普斯特",
	["Zachariah Post sells the other colours (200g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "撒迦利亚·普斯特出售其他颜色（200金每个在无限服客户端）。购买任意你需要，或无如果坐骑你曾是给予的是1你像。",
	["Zachariah Post sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "撒迦利亚·普斯特出售其他颜色（20金每个在无限服客户端）。购买任意你需要，或无如果坐骑你曾是给予的是1你像。",
	["Zaeldarr is elite: grouping up is advised. He waits at the bottom of the Undercroft, the crypt in the south-west of the zone."] = "泽尔达尔为精英：建议组队前往。他等候于底部的地下墓穴，地穴在区域以西南。",
	["Zaeldarr lurks just west of Darrowshire."] = "泽尔达尔潜伏就在达隆郡以西。",
	["Zaeldarr's Head"] = "塞达尔的头颅",
	["Zamek"] = "扎米克",
	["Zamja, Orgrimmar"] = "扎姆沙，奥格瑞玛",
	["Zankaja, Valley of Strength"] = "赞卡沙，力量谷",
	["Zanzil's Mixture"] = "赞吉尔的药剂",
	["Zarlman Two-Moons"] = "扎尔曼-双月",
	["Zarrin"] = "扎瑞恩",
	["Zengu"] = "森古",
	["Zenn Foulhoof, on the way back"] = "赛恩·腐蹄，在返回途中",
	["Zenn sits by the road just east of Dolanaar, on the way to Starbreeze Village."] = "赛恩·腐蹄位于路边就在多兰纳尔以东，在途中前往星风村。",
	["Zephras Isle is the Skyborne starting island, a world of its own in Skywall; anyone may visit, and its map counts towards exploring the world. 20 areas to discover here, levels 3-12."] = "泽弗拉斯岛是天裔起始岛屿，一个世界的它的自己的在天空之墙；任何人可能造访，与它的地图计入朝向探索世界。20区域前往探索发现此处，3-12级。",
	["Zephras Isle is the Skyborne starting island; anyone may visit. A skyboat leaves the cliffs south of Skywatcher Plateau, north of Thunder Bluff, about every five minutes (another flies from Dalaran; either faction may take either). Skip this if you are already on the island."] = "泽弗拉斯岛是天裔起始岛屿；任何人可能造访。一个天舟离开悬崖在观天者高原以南，在雷霆崖以北，大约每5分钟一班（另一个飞往来自达拉然；任一阵营可能接取任一）。跳过此如果你是已经在岛屿。",
	["Zephras Isle is the Skyborne starting island; anyone may visit. A skyboat leaves the north side of Dalaran about every five minutes (another flies from north of Thunder Bluff; either faction may take either). Skip this if you are already on the island."] = "泽弗拉斯岛是天裔起始岛屿；任何人可能造访。一个天舟离开北一侧的达拉然大约每5分钟一班（另一个飞往来自在雷霆崖以北；任一阵营可能接取任一）。跳过此如果你是已经在岛屿。",
	["Zerril Softbreeze"] = "泽瑞尔·柔风",
	["Zesty Clam Meat has no drop data: buy it at the Gadgetzan Auction House, next to Dirge, or open clams looted from coastal creatures."] = "美味的蚌肉有无掉落数据：购买它在加基森拍卖行，在迪尔格·奎克里弗旁边，或打开/开启蚌壳拾取的来自沿海生物。",
	["Zevrost, Cleft of Shadow"] = "泽弗洛斯特，暗影裂口",
	["Zhevra Runners graze north and east of town."] = "快步斑马吃草北与在城镇东面。",
	["Zhevra Runners graze on the same plains; finish the raptor heads as you go."] = "快步斑马吃草在相同平原；完成迅猛龙头颅沿途顺路。",
	["Zilzibin Drumlore, Valley of Spirits"] = "基尔兹宾·鼓眼，精神谷",
	["Ziz Fizziks"] = "菲兹克斯",
	["Ziz Fizziks, in the hut north of them"] = "菲兹克斯，在小屋在它们北面",
	["Zjolnir"] = "佐尔尼尔",
	["Zjolnir sells the other colours (200g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "佐尔尼尔出售其他颜色（200金每个在无限服客户端）。购买任意你需要，或无如果坐骑你曾是给予的是1你像。",
	["Zjolnir sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "佐尔尼尔出售其他颜色（20金每个在无限服客户端）。购买任意你需要，或无如果坐骑你曾是给予的是1你像。",
	["Zorbin's refills are level 55: skip them."] = "佐尔宾的补充品是55级：跳过即可。",
	["Zukk'ash Pod"] = "祖卡什虫茧",
	["Zul'Farrak"] = "祖尔法拉克",
	["Zureetha Fargaze"] = "祖雷萨",
	["a tool: keep it in your bags"] = "工具：请留在背包中",
	["any one of these names counts"] = "触发其中任意一个名称即可",
	["elite Blackrock orcs: discover it from the edge"] = "精英黑石杀戮者兽人：探索发现它来自边缘",
	["elite Syndicate and ogres inside the walls: the discovery triggers at the gate"] = "精英辛迪加与食人魔在城墙内：探索触发在大门",
	["elite ogres: discover it from the edge"] = "精英食人魔：探索发现它来自边缘",
	["elite trolls on the upper terraces: discover it from the bottom"] = "精英巨魔在上层阶地：探索发现它来自底部",
	["escort Melizza back toward the graveyard"] = "护送梅丽萨返回朝墓地方向",
	["for Booty Bay, around level 50"] = "给藏宝海湾，周围50级",
	["for Corporal Kaleb at the Rebel Camp, on the northern loop"] = "给卡雷布下士在反抗军营地，在北部环线",
	["for Darnassus: the route takes you there at 47"] = "给达纳苏斯：路线接收你那里在47",
	["for Dran Droffers in Orgrimmar, around level 50"] = "给德兰·杜佛斯在奥格瑞玛，周围50级",
	["for Falstad Wildhammer at Aerie Peak: keep it"] = "给弗斯塔德·蛮锤在鹰巢山：请保留该任务/物品",
	["for Fizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats: the Tanaris guide crosses them at 45, keep it"] = "给菲兹尔·铜栓在闪光平原：塔纳利斯指南穿过它们在45，请保留该任务/物品",
	["for Fleet Master Seahorn in Booty Bay, around level 44"] = "给舰队指挥官卡拉·海角在藏宝海湾，周围44级",
	["for Gerrig Bonegrip in Ironforge: keep it"] = "给葛利·硬骨在铁炉堡：请保留该任务/物品",
	["for Helgrum in Stonard, around level 42"] = "给赫格拉姆在斯通纳德，周围42级",
	["for Islen Waterseer, south of Ratchet: next guide"] = "给水之先知伊斯伦，在棘齿城以南：下一个指南",
	["for Islen Waterseer: from Stranglethorn, next guide"] = "给水之先知伊斯伦：来自荆棘谷，下一个指南",
	["for Nethergarde Keep: keep it"] = "给守望堡：请保留该任务/物品",
	["for Oran Snakewrithe in the Undercity, around level 50"] = "给奥兰·斯内克威瑟在幽暗城，周围50级",
	["for Orgrimmar, around level 45"] = "给奥格瑞玛，周围45级",
	["for Privateer Groy in Theramore: keep it"] = "给海盗格罗伊在塞拉摩：请保留该任务/物品",
	["for Raleigh the Devout in Southshore: keep it"] = "给虔诚的莱雷恩在南海镇：请保留该任务/物品",
	["for Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge: keep it"] = "给罗顿·石锤在铁炉堡：请保留该任务/物品",
	["for Stoley in Tanaris"] = "给斯杜雷在塔纳利斯",
	["for Stoley in Tanaris: keep it"] = "给斯杜雷在塔纳利斯：请保留该任务/物品",
	["for Thadius Grimshade at Nethergarde Keep, later"] = "给萨迪斯·格希德在守望堡，稍后",
	["for Tyrande in Darnassus: the route takes you there at 47"] = "给泰兰德在达纳苏斯：路线接收你那里在47",
	["for Zilzibin Drumlore in Orgrimmar, around level 50"] = "给基尔兹宾·鼓眼在奥格瑞玛，周围50级",
