	["Alliance town: Horde characters only need to touch its edge (guards)"] = "聯盟城鎮：部落角色只需靠近其邊緣觸發即可（注意衛兵）",
	["Alliance town: Horde characters only need to touch its edge (guards); any one of these names counts"] = "聯盟城鎮：部落角色只需靠近其邊緣觸發即可（注意衛兵）；觸發其中任意一個名稱即可",
	["Alodan the Hopeful teaches Paladins in Thunder Bluff. You have no flight path there yet: fly to Camp Taurajo, ride west through Mulgore and up a lift, and take the flight path from Tal on the central rise."] = "懷抱希望的阿洛丹傳授聖騎士在雷霆崖。你有無飛行點那裡尚：飛往前往陶拉祖營地，騎行西穿過莫高雷與上一個升降梯，與接取飛行點來自塔爾在中央高地。",
	["Alonso"] = "阿隆索",
	["Alonso, a Forever addition, stands on the west shore of Mystral Lake with three quick Dragonslayer quests."] = "阿隆索，一個永恆服新增內容，位於密斯特拉湖的西岸與3快速屠龍者任務。",
	["Alpha Strike: one hour from now"] = "突然襲擊：一小時後",
	["Alterac Signet Ring"] = "奧特蘭克徽記之戒",
	["Alterac Valley"] = "奧特蘭克山谷",
	["Alterac Valley (level 51+) raises Frostwolf Clan: win, capture towers and graveyards, and hand in the battleground's turn-ins. Jekyll Flandring waits at the Horde end of Alterac Mountains outside the battleground; Grunnda Wolfheart inside Alterac Valley sells the same mount."] = "奧特蘭克山谷（51級+）提升霜狼氏族：獲勝，佔領哨塔與墓地，與上交戰場的交任務。耶克里·弗蘭迪等候於部落盡頭的奧特蘭克山脈在戰場外；格倫達·狼心在奧特蘭克山谷內出售相同坐騎。",
	["Alterac Valley (level 51+) raises Stormpike Guard: win, capture towers and graveyards, and hand in the battleground's turn-ins. Thanthaldis Snowgleam waits outside the battleground on the Alterac Mountains border above Hillsbrad; Gaelden Hammersmith inside Alterac Valley sells the same mount."] = "奧特蘭克山谷（51級+）提升雷矛衛隊：獲勝，佔領哨塔與墓地，與上交戰場的交任務。塔薩迪斯·雪光等候在戰場在外奧特蘭克山脈邊界在希爾斯布萊德上方；蓋爾丁在奧特蘭克山谷內出售相同坐騎。",
	["Alternate Deadwood feathers (Nafien) and Winterfall beads (Salfa), whichever camp is less crowded."] = "交替刷死木羽毛（納菲恩）與寒冬串珠（薩爾法），任選其一：營地是更少擁擠的。",
	["Alvarion Windfield"] = "阿爾瓦里奧·風野",
	["Amaryllis Webb gives you an Entomology Starter Kit: use its items to catch an Arbor Tarantula, a Hay Weevil Specimen and a Flesh Picker. This quest is named as the weevil's source but gives only money as its reward; the pet may come from the Hay Weevil you catch. If you lose the kit, she sells another."] = "阿瑪莉莉絲·韋伯給你一個昆蟲學入門工具包：使用它的物品前往捕獲一個樹棲捕鳥蛛，一個乾草象鼻蟲樣本與一個啄肉鳥。此任務是名為作為象鼻蟲的來源但給予僅金錢作為它的獎勵；寵物可能來自乾草象鼻蟲你捕獲。如果你丟失工具包，她出售另一個。",
	["Ambermill"] = "安伯米爾",
	["Ambermill comes later, on the southern loop"] = "安伯米爾來自稍後，在南部環線",
	["Amberstill Ranch is east of Kharanos on the road to Loch Modan; Ultham Ironhorn stands beside Veron Amberstill's rams. At 40 Ultham Ironhorn teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Alliance race ride these."] = "凍石農場是在卡拉諾斯以東在路上前往洛克莫丹；奧薩姆·鐵角位於維隆·凍石的旁邊山羊。在40奧薩姆·鐵角傳授騎術（100金每暴雪的設計師），與學習它給你一個坐騎。永恆服客戶端允許每個聯盟種族騎行這些。",
	["Amberstill Ranch is east of Kharanos on the road to Loch Modan; Ultham Ironhorn stands beside Veron Amberstill's rams. At 60 Ultham Ironhorn teaches Journeyman Riding (1,000g per Blizzard's designers); Blizzard says learning riding grants a mount. The Forever client sells each swift ram for 200g at level 60."] = "凍石農場是在卡拉諾斯以東在路上前往洛克莫丹；奧薩姆·鐵角位於維隆·凍石的旁邊山羊。在60奧薩姆·鐵角傳授中級騎術（1,000金每暴雪的設計師）；暴雪說學習騎行獎勵一匹坐騎。永恆服客戶端出售每個迅捷山羊給200金在60級。",
	["An Old History Book: a rare drop from Duskwood's mobs"] = "一本破舊的歷史書：由暮色森林的怪物稀有掉落",
	["Anaya's Pendant"] = "安娜雅的墜飾",
	["Ancient Moonstone Seal: Deth'ryll Satyrs"] = "遠古月亮石封印：戴瑟雷薩特",
	["Ancient Statuette, in the ruins on the shore"] = "古代雕像，在廢墟中在岸邊",
	["Ancona Chicken, 1g"] = "安科納小雞，1金",
	["Andi Lynn"] = "安迪·利恩",
	["Andorhal Tower Four"] = "安多哈爾四號哨塔",
	["Andorhal Tower One"] = "安多哈爾一號哨塔",
