	["Angelas Moonbreeze"] = "安吉拉斯·月風",
	["Angelas Moonbreeze: keep it for Tanaris"] = "安吉拉斯·月風：留到塔納利斯再做",
	["Angerclaw bears and Felpaw wolves"] = "怒爪熊與魔爪狼",
	["Angus Stern"] = "安古斯·斯特恩",
	["Angus Stern cooks in the Blue Recluse; Brohann Caskbelly is in the Dwarven District."] = "安古斯·斯特恩烹飪在藍隱士旅店；布羅哈恩·鐵桶是在矮人區。",
	["Angus Stern, Stormwind Harbor road"] = "安古斯·斯特恩，暴風城港口道路",
	["Annals of Darrowshire"] = "達隆郡的歷史",
	["Annora teaches Artisan Enchanting inside the Uldaman dungeon (Badlands); bring a group"] = "安諾拉傳授大師級附魔內部奧達曼地下城（荒蕪之地）；請組隊前往",
	["Antur stands at the west end of the camp."] = "安圖爾·荒野位於營地的西端。",
	["Any Cooking trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice Cooking (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest."] = "任意烹飪訓練師的你的陣營傳授初級烹飪（角色等級5）；箭頭會自動指向最近的一位。",
	["Any First Aid trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice First Aid (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest."] = "任意急救訓練師的你的陣營傳授初級急救（角色等級5）；箭頭會自動指向最近的一位。",
	["Any Fishing trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice Fishing (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a Fishing Pole from a trade goods or fishing vendor and equip it."] = "任意釣魚訓練師的你的陣營傳授初級釣魚（角色等級5）；箭頭會自動指向最近的一位。購買一個魚竿來自一個商業技能或釣魚供應商與裝備它。",
	["Any Herbalism trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice Herbalism (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest."] = "任意草藥學訓練師的你的陣營傳授初級草藥學（角色等級5）；箭頭會自動指向最近的一位。",
	["Any Mining trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice Mining (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a Mining Pick from a trade goods or general vendor: keep it in your bags, you cannot mine without it."] = "任意採礦訓練師的你的陣營傳授初級採礦（角色等級5）；箭頭會自動指向最近的一位。購買一個礦工鋤來自一個商業技能或雜貨商：請留在背包中，沒有它無法採礦。",
	["Any Skinning trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice Skinning (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a Skinning Knife from a trade goods or general vendor: keep it in your bags, you cannot skin without it."] = "任意剝皮訓練師的你的陣營傳授初級剝皮（角色等級5）；箭頭會自動指向最近的一位。購買一個剝皮小刀來自一個商業技能或雜貨商：請留在背包中，沒有它無法剝皮。",
	["Any Winterfall furbolg can carry the beads; the camps just south of Salfa are the closest."] = "任意寒冬熊怪可以攜帶串珠；紮營就在薩爾法以南是最近的。",
