	["Apothecary Johaan"] = "藥劑師喬漢",
	["Apothecary Lydon"] = "藥劑師林度恩",
	["Apothecary Renferrel"] = "藥劑師倫弗利爾",
	["Apprentice Kryten"] = "學徒克里汀",
	["Araj is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "阿拉基為精英：建議組隊前往。",
	["Araj the Summoner is a level 61 elite"] = "召喚者阿拉基是一個61級精英",
	["Araj the Summoner is elite: grouping up is advised. He guards his phylactery in the middle of Andorhal."] = "召喚者阿拉基為精英：建議組隊前往。他衛兵他的命匣在安多哈爾的中央。",
	["Araj's Phylactery Shard"] = "阿拉基的護符匣碎片",
	["Aramis Hammerhand"] = "阿拉米斯·錘手",
	["Aramis Hammerhand and Venya Marthand stand beside the church."] = "阿拉米斯·錘手與溫雅·瑪山德位於教堂旁邊。",
	["Aramis Hammerhand: Holy Light"] = "阿拉米斯·錘手：聖光術",
	["Arathandris Silversky"] = "阿拉珊蒂絲·銀空",
	["Arathandris Silversky, in the ruins just east of Grazle"] = "阿拉珊蒂絲·銀空，在廢墟中就在格拉茲以東",
	["Arathi Basin"] = "阿拉希盆地",
	["Arbal"] = "阿巴爾",
	["Arcane Feedback"] = "奧術回饋者",
	["Arcane Quickener, from Alchemist Arbington"] = "奧術催化劑，來自化學家阿爾比頓",
	["Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm"] = "大德魯伊範達爾·鹿盔",
	["Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm, at the top of the tree"] = "大德魯伊範達爾·鹿盔，在樹的頂部",
	["Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm, atop the Cenarion Enclave"] = "大德魯伊範達爾·鹿盔，在頂部：塞納里奧區",
	["Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem"] = "大德魯伊哈繆爾·符文圖騰",
	["Arch Druid Renferal: Crystal Cluster"] = "大德魯伊雷弗拉爾：水晶簇",
	["Archbishop Benedictus"] = "大主教本尼迪塔斯",
	["Archesonus stands beside King Magni in the High Seat."] = "皇家歷史學家阿克瑟努斯站在旁邊：國王麥格尼在王座廳。",
	["Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver"] = "大法師安斯雷姆·魯因維沃爾",
	["Archmage Malin"] = "大法師馬林",
	["Archmage Malin is in the Slaughtered Lamb; Garion Wendell near the canal; Connor Rivers south of the Mage Quarter."] = "大法師馬林是在已宰的羔羊旅店；加里奧·溫德爾在運河附近；科諾爾·瑞沃斯南的法師區。",
	["Archmage Tervosh"] = "大法師特沃什",
	["Arei waits in Irontree Woods. Escort her out of the woods and keep her alive."] = "艾雷等候於鐵木森林。護送她的離開樹林與保留她的存活。",
	["Argent Officer Garush"] = "銀色黎明軍官加魯什",
	["Argent Officer Garush, The Bulwark"] = "銀色黎明軍官加魯什，亡靈壁壘",
	["Argent Officer Pureheart"] = "銀色黎明軍官普爾哈特",
	["Argent Officer Pureheart, Chillwind Camp"] = "銀色黎明軍官普爾哈特，冰風崗",
	["Argent Officer Pureheart, at the graveyard's south end"] = "銀色黎明軍官普爾哈特，在墓地的南盡頭",
	["Argus Shadow Mage"] = "暗影大法師",
	["Armored Scorpids crawl over the plains west of Razor Hill. Tame one, then return to Thotar."] = "硬甲蠍爬行越過平原在剃刀嶺以西。馴服1，然後返回前往索塔爾。",
	["Arnak Grimtotem"] = "阿納克·恐怖圖騰",
	["Arnok, Orgrimmar"] = "阿諾克，奧格瑞瑪",
	["Artisan Cooking"] = "大師級烹飪",
	["Artisan Cooking comes from Dirge Quikcleave in Gadgetzan (Tanaris). The cooking trainer in Ironforge sends you; it needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "大師級烹飪來自迪爾格·奎克里弗在加基森（塔納利斯）。烹飪訓練師在鐵爐堡派往你；它需要技能等級225與35級。",
	["Artisan Cooking comes from Dirge Quikcleave in Gadgetzan (Tanaris). The cooking trainer in Orgrimmar sends you; it needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "大師級烹飪來自迪爾格·奎克里弗在加基森（塔納利斯）。烹飪訓練師在奧格瑞瑪派往你；它需要技能等級225與35級。",
	["Artisan First Aid"] = "大師級急救",
	["Artisan First Aid comes from the Triage quest. It needs skill 225 and level 40; the First Aid trainer in Ironforge sends you to the doctor in Theramore."] = "大師級急救來自救死扶傷任務。它需要技能等級225與40級；急救訓練師在鐵爐堡派你前往醫生在塞拉摩。",
	["Artisan First Aid comes from the Triage quest. It needs skill 225 and level 40; the First Aid trainer in Orgrimmar sends you to the doctor in Hammerfall."] = "大師級急救來自救死扶傷任務。它需要技能等級225與40級；急救訓練師在奧格瑞瑪派你前往醫生在落錘鎮。",
	["Artisan Fishing"] = "大師級釣魚",
	["Artisan Fishing (cap 300) comes from Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh. The fishing trainer in Ironforge sends you to him; the quest needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "大師級釣魚（上限300）來自納特·帕格在塵泥沼澤。釣魚訓練師在鐵爐堡派你前往他；任務需要技能等級225與35級。",
	["Artisan Fishing (cap 300) comes from Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh. The fishing trainer in Orgrimmar sends you to him; the quest needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "大師級釣魚（上限300）來自納特·帕格在塵泥沼澤。釣魚訓練師在奧格瑞瑪派你前往他；任務需要技能等級225與35級。",
	["Artisan Herbalism raises the cap to 300; it needs skill 200 and character level 35. The arrow picks the nearest Herbalism trainer of your faction."] = "大師級草藥學將技能上限提升至300；它需要技能等級200與角色等級35。箭頭會自動指向最近的一位草藥學訓練師的你的陣營。",
	["Artisan Mining raises the cap to 300; it needs skill 200 and character level 35. The arrow picks the nearest Mining trainer of your faction."] = "大師級採礦將技能上限提升至300；它需要技能等級200與角色等級35。箭頭會自動指向最近的一位採礦訓練師的你的陣營。",
	["Artisan Skinning raises the cap to 300; it needs skill 200 and character level 35. The arrow picks the nearest Skinning trainer of your faction."] = "大師級剝皮將技能上限提升至300；它需要技能等級200與角色等級35。箭頭會自動指向最近的一位剝皮訓練師的你的陣營。",
	["Artisan needs character level 35 and Alchemy 200; it raises the cap to 300. Materials for 225-300 are worth about 9g 73s in all."] = "大師級需要角色等級35與煉金術200；它將技能上限提升至300。225-300階段所需材料總計約需花費9金73銀。",
	["Artisan needs character level 35 and Blacksmithing 200; it raises the cap to 300. Materials for 225-300 are worth about 563g in all."] = "大師級需要角色等級35與鍛造200；它將技能上限提升至300。225-300階段所需材料總計約需花費563金。",
	["Artisan needs character level 35 and Enchanting 200; it raises the cap to 300. Materials for 225-300 are worth about 283g in all."] = "大師級需要角色等級35與附魔200；它將技能上限提升至300。225-300階段所需材料總計約需花費283金。",
	["Artisan needs character level 35 and Engineering 200; it raises the cap to 300. Materials for 225-300 are worth about 67g in all."] = "大師級需要角色等級35與工程學200；它將技能上限提升至300。225-300階段所需材料總計約需花費67金。",
	["Artisan needs character level 35 and Leatherworking 200; it raises the cap to 300. Materials for 225-300 are worth about 182g in all."] = "大師級需要角色等級35與制皮200；它將技能上限提升至300。225-300階段所需材料總計約需花費182金。",
	["Artisan needs character level 35 and Tailoring 200; it raises the cap to 300. Materials for 225-300 are worth about 240g in all."] = "大師級需要角色等級35與裁縫200；它將技能上限提升至300。225-300階段所需材料總計約需花費240金。",
	["Arvensus Shadowsong"] = "阿文蘇斯影歌",
	["Ask Deathguard Dillinger for his report"] = "要求亡靈衛兵迪林格爾給他的報告",
	["Ask Deathguard Kristof for his report"] = "要求死亡衛兵克里斯托夫給他的報告",
	["Ask Gordo for his report"] = "要求葛爾多給他的報告",
	["Assist Walton: stay by him when Terry Longdrink and the Kul Tiras marines come up the ridge"] = "協助沃爾頓：留在旁他當特里杜加爾·朗德瑞克與庫爾提拉斯水兵來到上山脊",
	["Asterion"] = "阿斯特利安",
	["At 40 Brandur Ironhammer in the Mystic Ward sends you to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind's Cathedral of Light. Take the tram from Ironforge to Stormwind."] = "在40布蘭度爾·鐵錘在秘法區派你前往達索瑞恩·拉爾在暴風城的聖光大教堂。搭乘地鐵來自鐵爐堡前往暴風城。",
	["At 40 Briarthorn in Ironforge sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet."] = "在40石南草在鐵爐堡派你前往斯坦哈德·法爾杉在棘齒城。",
	["At 40 Demisette Cloyce in the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet."] = "在40德米賽特·克勞斯在已宰的羔羊旅店，在法師區，派你前往斯坦哈德·法爾杉在棘齒城。",
	["At 40 Kaal Soulreaper in the Magic Quarter sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. The zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades flies to Durotar."] = "在40卡爾·噬靈在魔法區派你前往斯坦哈德·法爾杉在棘齒城。飛艇來自提瑞斯法林地飛往前往杜隆塔爾。",
	["At 40 Zevrost in the Cleft of Shadow sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet."] = "在40澤弗洛斯特在暗影裂口派你前往斯坦哈德·法爾杉在棘齒城。",
	["At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Binjy Featherwhistle teaches Gnomes at Steelgrill's Depot, just east of Kharanos, beside Milli Featherwhistle's mechanostriders. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (unconfirmed). Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists every colour."] = "在40與100金幣你可以學習前往騎行，與學習它給你一個坐騎。賓吉·羽哨傳授侏儒在鋼架補給站，就在卡拉諾斯以東，在米利·羽哨的旁邊機械陸行鳥。永恆服可能允許任意種族學習來自任意騎術訓練師（待確認）。藏品收集，坐騎 · 40級列出每個顏色。",
	["At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Jartsam teaches Night Elves in Darnassus, beside Lelanai's sabers: the boat from Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine, then the flight to Rut'theran Village. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (unconfirmed), such as Randal Hunter at Eastvale Logging Camp in Elwynn Forest. Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists every colour."] = "在40與100金幣你可以學習前往騎行，與學習它給你一個坐騎。賈薩姆傳授暗夜精靈在達納蘇斯，在萊拉奈的旁邊刃豹：船來自暴風城港口前往奧伯丁，然後飛行前往魯瑟蘭村。永恆服可能允許任意種族學習來自任意騎術訓練師（待確認），此類作為蘭達爾·亨特在東谷伐木場在艾爾文森林。藏品收集，坐騎 · 40級列出每個顏色。",
	["At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. No Skyborne riding trainer is known; the Forever client files Galestrider Riding under the one Riding skill, so Randal Hunter at Eastvale Logging Camp in eastern Elwynn Forest, the nearest trainer to Stormwind, should teach it (unconfirmed). The Galestriders are sold by Genn Fairweather in Valanaar on Zephras Isle; Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists them."] = "在40與100金幣你可以學習前往騎行，與學習它給你一個坐騎。無天裔騎術訓練師是已知；永恆服客戶端歸類為疾風陸行鳥騎術在下方1騎術技能，因此蘭達爾·亨特在東谷伐木場在東部艾爾文森林，最近的訓練師前往暴風城，應當傳授它（待確認）。疾風陸行鳥是出售在旁吉恩·費爾韋瑟在瓦拉納爾在澤弗拉斯島；藏品收集，坐騎 · 40級列出它們。",
	["At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Randal Hunter teaches Humans at Eastvale Logging Camp in eastern Elwynn Forest, beside Katie Hunter's horses. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (unconfirmed). Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists every colour."] = "在40與100金幣你可以學習前往騎行，與學習它給你一個坐騎。蘭達爾·亨特傳授人類在東谷伐木場在東部艾爾文森林，在凱蒂·亨特的旁邊馬。永恆服可能允許任意種族學習來自任意騎術訓練師（待確認）。藏品收集，坐騎 · 40級列出每個顏色。",
	["At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Ultham Ironhorn teaches Dwarves at Amberstill Ranch, east of Kharanos on the road to Loch Modan, beside Veron Amberstill's rams. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (unconfirmed). Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists every colour."] = "在40與100金幣你可以學習前往騎行，與學習它給你一個坐騎。奧薩姆·鐵角傳授矮人在凍石農場，在卡拉諾斯以東在路上前往洛克莫丹，在維隆·凍石的旁邊山羊。永恆服可能允許任意種族學習來自任意騎術訓練師（待確認）。藏品收集，坐騎 · 40級列出每個顏色。",
	["At 60 Brandur Ironhammer in the Mystic Ward sends you to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral of Light."] = "在60布蘭度爾·鐵錘在秘法區派你前往格雷森·沙東布瑞克公爵在暴風城的聖光大教堂。",
	["At 60 Jubahl Corpseseeker in Ironforge sends you to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes."] = "在60尋屍者祖貝爾在鐵爐堡派你前往莫蘇爾·召血者在燃燒平原。",
	["At 60 Kurgul in the Cleft of Shadow sends you to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes."] = "在60庫古爾在暗影裂口派你前往莫蘇爾·召血者在燃燒平原。",
	["At 60 Martha Strain in the Magic Quarter sends you to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes."] = "在60馬爾薩·斯坦恩在魔法區派你前往莫蘇爾·召血者在燃燒平原。",
	["At 60 Spackle Thornberry in the Slaughtered Lamb sends you to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes."] = "在60斯巴克爾在已宰的羔羊旅店派你前往莫蘇爾·召血者在燃燒平原。",
	["At the Shrine of Remulos"] = "在雷姆洛斯神殿",
	["At the south end of Silverpine the road turns east into Hillsbrad Foothills by Southpoint Tower. Tarren Mill in the north-east is the Horde town; Southshore is Alliance."] = "在銀松森林的南端道路交還東進入希爾斯布萊德丘陵在旁南點哨塔。塔倫米爾在東北面是部落城鎮；南海鎮是聯盟。",
	["Atal'ai Exile"] = "阿塔萊流放者",
	["Athridas Bearmantle"] = "阿斯瑞達斯·熊皮",
	["Auntie Marlene, in the Western Plaguelands: keep it"] = "瑪萊恩姑媽，在西瘟疫之地：請保留該任務/物品",
	["Avala's Core is by the frozen lake, among the ice elementals."] = "阿瓦拉的核心是在旁冰凍的湖，在其中：冰元素。",
	["Avatar of Saeyleenan"] = "賽琳南的化身",
	["Ayessa Dawnsinger"] = "阿耶莎·晨歌",
	["Azore Aldamort"] = "阿佐爾·奧達蒙特",
	["Azore Aldamort waits in the ruined tower of Ethel Rethor, inland to the south-east."] = "阿佐爾·奧達蒙特等候於毀壞的哨塔的艾瑟雷索，內陸向東南。",
	["Azore's tower stands on the hill east of the wreck."] = "亞佐爾的哨塔位於山丘在殘骸以東。",
	["Azore's tower stands on the hill west of Thunder Axe Fortress: take his quest first, the sceptre he wants is in the fortress."] = "亞佐爾的哨塔位於山丘在雷斧堡壘以西：接取他的任務第一，節杖他需要是在要塞。",
	["Back at Camp Mojache."] = "返回在莫沙徹營地。",
	["Back at Falaath Village: Stormcallers and Living Lightning fill the village, the Supply Caches stand among the houses and Commander Cyclas waits at its south-east end."] = "返回在法拉斯村：喚風者與活體閃電裝滿村莊，補給箱位於其中：房屋與指揮官賽克拉斯等候於它的東南盡頭。",
	["Back at Felpaw Village, the Deadwood furbolgs (53-54) are close to the tunnel and every kill raises your Timbermaw reputation."] = "返回在魔爪村，死木熊怪（53-54）是靠近前往隧道與每個擊殺提升你的木喉聲望。",
	["Back at Grelin's camp"] = "返回在格雷林的營地",
	["Back at Kolkar Village, every Kolkar can drop an ear."] = "返回在科爾卡村，每個科卡爾可以掉落一個耳朵。",
	["Back down the beach, past the pirate camp: the crate of boots and the fragile crate with the lens sit at its south end."] = "返回下海灘，經過海盜營地：木箱的靴子與易碎的木箱與透鏡坐在它的南盡頭。",
	["Back east past Stonard: the Atal'ai artifacts lie in the water and on the banks of the Pool of Tears."] = "返回東經過斯通納德：阿塔萊流放者神器位於水與在河岸的淚水之池。",
	["Back east to Brambleblade Ravine: the Bristleback Shamans stand among the quilboar there."] = "返回東前往刺刃峽谷：刺背薩滿祭司位於其中：野豬人那裡。",
	["Back east to the naga on the coast: Naga Spinefins drop from them."] = "返回東前往納迦在海岸邊：納迦脊鰭掉落來自它們。",
	["Back east to the shore north of Heglan. Spitelash Scouts and Attendants hold the beach below Drygulch Ravine. Hunters: tame a Surf Crawler on the beach."] = "返回東前往岸邊在赫格蘭·影眼以北。怨鞭斥候與侍從要塞海灘在枯水谷下方。獵人：馴服一個海浪蟹在海灘上。",
	["Back in Falaath Village: Stormcallers and Living Lightning fill the village, the Stormcallers carry the stolen supplies, and Commander Cyclas stands at its south end."] = "返回在法拉斯村：喚風者與活體閃電裝滿村莊，喚風者攜帶被盜的補給品，與指揮官賽克拉斯位於它的南盡頭。",
	["Back in Theramore: Tervosh waits with Lady Jaina in the tower of Foothold Citadel."] = "返回在塞拉摩：大法師特沃什等候與雷蒂吉安娜·普羅德摩爾在哨塔內的塞拉摩堡壘。",
	["Back into Shadow Hold: Moora and Salia guard Shadow Lord Fel'dan in its deepest chamber."] = "返回進入暗影堡：米萊恩與薩莉亞守衛暗影領主費爾丹在它的最深處密室。",
	["Back into the Timbermaw tunnel and take the Winterspring exit; Donova camps by the hot springs just outside."] = "返回進入木喉隧道與接取冬泉谷出口；多諾瓦紮營在旁熱溫泉就在外部。",
	["Back north to Jaedenar. Fill Greta's canteen at the corrupted moonwell in the middle of the southern camp."] = "返回北前往加德納爾。裝滿格雷塔·苔蹄的水壺在腐化的月亮井在南部營地的中央。",
	["Back north to the Writhing Haunt: the cauldron offers its own task now. The ghouls nearby drop Somatic Intensifiers."] = "返回北前往蠕行之禍：大鍋提供它的自己的任務現在。食屍鬼附近掉落細胞增強劑。",
	["Back north to the camp."] = "返回北前往營地。",
	["Back north-east into the mountains to the crystal."] = "返回東北進入山脈前往水晶。",
	["Back north-east to Flame Crest."] = "返回東北前往烈焰峰。",
	["Back north-east to Kim'jael."] = "返回東北前往基姆加爾。",
	["Back south past Nesingwary: Panthers and Stranglethorn Raptors run in the clearings west of the camp toward the coast; the elder tigers hold the hills south-west."] = "返回南方經過赫米特·奈辛瓦里二世：豹與荊棘谷迅猛龍前往在空地在營地朝向海岸以西；長者/老年虎要塞丘陵西南。",
	["Back south to Razor Hill."] = "返回南方前往剃刀嶺。",
	["Back south to the Sanctuary, a short ride."] = "返回南方前往聖地，一個不足騎行。",
	["Back south-east to the Winterhoof Water Well."] = "返回南方-東前往冰蹄水井。",
	["Back south-west to Mystral Lake. Befouled Water Elementals drift around its shores; the gazebo stands on the island, overlooking the Alliance outpost."] = "返回南方-西前往密斯特拉湖。污濁的水元素漂浮周圍它的海岸；涼亭位於島嶼，俯瞰聯盟前哨站。",
	["Back through the tunnel and take the Winterspring exit, then ride south to Frostfire Hot Springs."] = "返回穿過隧道與接取冬泉谷出口，然後騎行南前往霜火溫泉。",
	["Back through the tunnel to Bruegs' cave above the farm."] = "返回穿過隧道前往布魯格斯·火生的洞穴在農場上方。",
	["Back to Brill."] = "返回前往布瑞爾。",
	["Back to Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven, then fly to Rut'theran Village (by way of Auberdine)."] = "回到丹德里特德迪利特·星焰在永夜港，然後飛往前往魯瑟蘭村（在旁路的奧伯丁）。",
	["Back to Gakin. Use the Bloodstone Choker at the summoning circle in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar and defeat the voidwalker it calls."] = "返回前往黑暗縛靈者加科因。使用血石頸環在召喚法陣在已宰的羔羊旅店的地窖與擊敗虛空行者它召喚。",
	["Back to Gakin. Use the Bloodstone Choker at the summoning circle in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar and defeat the voidwalker it calls. Westfall is next, west of Goldshire."] = "返回前往黑暗縛靈者加科因。使用血石頸環在召喚法陣在已宰的羔羊旅店的地窖與擊敗虛空行者它召喚。西部荒野是下一個，在閃金鎮以西。",
	["Back to Gan'rul in the Cleft of Shadow. Use the Glyphs of Summoning on the summoning circle there and defeat the voidwalker to bind it."] = "返回前往甘魯爾·血眼在暗影裂口。使用召喚銘文在召喚法陣那裡與擊敗虛空行者前往綁定它。",
	["Back to Grom'gol."] = "返回前往格羅姆高。",
	["Back to Loh'atu at the shrine; stay west of the Talrendis Point guards."] = "返回前往羅哈圖在神龕；留在西的塔倫迪斯營地衛兵。",
	["Back to Olariaan, then west into the Shen'dar Highlands: Kuramaa's home is in the hills south of the Windsong Crawlers' lakes."] = "返回前往奧拉里安·疾燃，然後西進入申達爾高地：庫拉瑪的爐石是在丘陵南的風歌爬行者的湖泊。",
	["Back to Olariaan. Wait for him to light the Brazier of Offering, then carry the flame straight to the Brazier of Eternal Flame beside Sessaria in Valanaar before the timer runs out."] = "返回前往奧拉里安·疾燃。等待給他前往聖光祭品火盆，然後攜帶烈焰直走前往永恆火盆加拉克烈焰守衛在塞薩莉亞·天行旁邊在瓦拉納爾之前計時器通往出。",
	["Back to Razor Hill."] = "返回前往剃刀嶺。",
	["Back to Seer Ravenfeather in the camp. The Minor Manifestation of Earth waits on the mesa east of the camp: drink the Earth Sapta there to see it, then take the Rough Quartz back to the Seer."] = "返回前往鴉羽先知在營地裡。大地之魂等候於台地在營地以東：飲用大地薩普塔那裡前往查看它，然後接取粗石英返回前往先知。",
	["Back to Shen'dar Village with what you found."] = "回到申達爾村莊與所你找到。",
	["Back to Southwind and climb the tower. Stirring the hive at the top brings out Hive'Ashi Ambushers; one carries the Encrusted Silithid Object."] = "返回前往南風村與爬上哨塔。攪動蟲巢在頂部攜帶出亞什伏擊者；1攜帶異種蠍粘液包裹的物體。",
	["Back to Teo Hammerstorm in Anvilmar. He gives you the Earth Sapta: take the rubble-marked path that climbs west from the south of the valley to the Spirit Stone on the ridge, drink the Sapta beside it and speak to the Minor Manifestation of Earth, then bring its Rough Quartz back to Teo."] = "返回前往提奧·錘暴在安威瑪爾。他給你大地薩普塔：接取碎石-標記的小徑該爬上西來自在山谷前往以南靈魂石在山脊，飲用薩普塔旁邊它與對話前往大地之魂，然後攜帶它的粗石英返回前往提奧。",
	["Back to Urs'endris by the falls north-east of Valanaar, on the way north to the shrine."] = "返回前往烏爾森德里斯在旁墜落在瓦拉納爾以東北，在途中北前往神龕。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Big Black Mace is taught from Blacksmithing 255."] = "返回前往一個鍛造訓練師：巨型黑色錘是傳授來自鍛造255。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Dense Grinding Stone is taught from Blacksmithing 255."] = "返回前往一個鍛造訓練師：致密砂輪是傳授來自鍛造255。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Dense Sharpening Stone is taught from Blacksmithing 255."] = "返回前往一個鍛造訓練師：致密磨刀石是傳授來自鍛造255。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Golden Scale Bracers is taught from Blacksmithing 210."] = "返回前往一個鍛造訓練師：金鱗護腕是傳授來自鍛造210。",
	["Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Green Iron Bracers is taught from Blacksmithing 190."] = "返回前往一個鍛造訓練師：綠鐵護腕是傳授來自鍛造190。",
