	["Back to a Tailoring trainer: Black Mageweave Gloves is taught from Tailoring 230."] = "返回前往一個裁縫訓練師：黑色魔紋手套是傳授來自裁縫230。",
	["Back to a Tailoring trainer: Black Mageweave Headband is taught from Tailoring 245."] = "返回前往一個裁縫訓練師：黑色魔紋頭帶是傳授來自裁縫245。",
	["Back to a Tailoring trainer: Bolt of Runecloth is taught from Tailoring 255."] = "返回前往一個裁縫訓練師：符文布卷是傳授來自裁縫255。",
	["Back to a Tailoring trainer: Bolt of Woolen Cloth, Woolen Cape are taught from Tailoring 100."] = "返回前往一個裁縫訓練師：毛布卷，毛紡鬥篷是傳授來自裁縫100。",
	["Back to a Tailoring trainer: Crimson Silk Pantaloons is taught from Tailoring 215."] = "返回前往一個裁縫訓練師：深紅絲質馬褲是傳授來自裁縫215。",
	["Back to a Tailoring trainer: Linen Belt is taught from Tailoring 50."] = "返回前往一個裁縫訓練師：亞麻腰帶是傳授來自裁縫50。",
