	["Back to an Alchemy trainer: Elixir of Detect Undead is taught from Alchemy 245."] = "返回前往一個煉金術訓練師：偵測亡靈藥劑是傳授來自煉金術245。",
	["Back to an Alchemy trainer: Elixir of Firepower is taught from Alchemy 165."] = "返回前往一個煉金術訓練師：火力藥劑是傳授來自煉金術165。",
	["Back to an Alchemy trainer: Lesser Healing Potion is taught from Alchemy 80."] = "返回前往一個煉金術訓練師：次級治療藥水是傳授來自煉金術80。",
	["Back to an Alchemy trainer: Stonescale Oil is taught from Alchemy 250."] = "返回前往一個煉金術訓練師：石鱗魚油是傳授來自煉金術250。",
	["Back to an Enchanting trainer: Enchant Bracer - Minor Stamina is taught from Enchanting 100."] = "返回前往一個附魔訓練師：附魔護腕 - 初級耐力是傳授來自附魔100。",
	["Back to an Enchanting trainer: Enchant Bracer - Strength is taught from Enchanting 200."] = "返回前往一個附魔訓練師：附魔護腕 - 力量是傳授來自附魔200。",
	["Back to an Enchanting trainer: Runed Golden Rod, Enchant Chest - Greater Health are taught from Enchanting 180."] = "返回前往一個附魔訓練師：符文金棒，附魔胸甲 - 強效生命是傳授來自附魔180。",
	["Back to an Enchanting trainer: Runed Silver Rod is taught from Enchanting 130."] = "返回前往一個附魔訓練師：符文銀棒是傳授來自附魔130。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Coarse Blasting Powder is taught from Engineering 85."] = "返回前往一個工程學訓練師：粗制火藥粉是傳授來自工程學85。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Copper Modulator is taught from Engineering 95."] = "返回前往一個工程學訓練師：銅質調節器是傳授來自工程學95。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Copper Tube is taught from Engineering 80."] = "返回前往一個工程學訓練師：銅管是傳授來自工程學80。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Gyromatic Micro-Adjustor is taught from Engineering 175."] = "返回前往一個工程學訓練師：侏儒微調器是傳授來自工程學175。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Handful of Copper Bolts is taught from Engineering 45."] = "返回前往一個工程學訓練師：一把螺栓是傳授來自工程學45。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Heavy Blasting Powder is taught from Engineering 125."] = "返回前往一個工程學訓練師：烈性火藥是傳授來自工程學125。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Mithril Gyro-Shot is taught from Engineering 245."] = "返回前往一個工程學訓練師：秘銀螺旋彈是傳授來自工程學245。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Practice Lock is taught from Engineering 115."] = "返回前往一個工程學訓練師：練習鎖是傳授來自工程學115。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Rough Copper Bomb is taught from Engineering 60."] = "返回前往一個工程學訓練師：劣質銅殼炸彈是傳授來自工程學60。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Solid Blasting Powder, Hi-Impact Mithril Slugs are taught from Engineering 210."] = "返回前往一個工程學訓練師：實心炸藥，高速秘銀彈頭是傳授來自工程學210。",
	["Back to an Engineering trainer: Whirring Bronze Gizmo is taught from Engineering 125."] = "返回前往一個工程學訓練師：高速青銅齒輪是傳授來自工程學125。",
	["Back to the Cathedral of Light."] = "返回前往聖光大教堂。",
	["Back to the Cathedral of Light: Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker stands inside."] = "返回前往聖光大教堂：格雷森·沙東布瑞克公爵位於內部。",
	["Back to the Crossroads; the next guide starts here."] = "回到十字路口；下一個指南始於此處。",
	["Back to the Razormane camp. Geomancers and Defenders hold its eastern half; Kreenig Snarlsnout walks among them."] = "返回前往刺鬃營地。坑道鼠地卜師與防禦者要塞它的東部一半；克里尼格·糟鼻步行在其中：它們。",
	["Back to the Ruins of Solarsal. Every Hatecrest naga there can drop scales."] = "返回前往索蘭薩爾廢墟。每個恨鱗納迦那裡可以掉落鱗片。",
	["Back to the hills: only the Ice Thistle Matriarchs and Patriarchs carry the horns. Keep killing yetis until level 54: Harlo's wildkin quests are red before that."] = "返回前往丘陵：僅冰薊雪人女王與族長攜帶角。保留擊殺雪人直到54級：哈魯·維格索斯的野性梟獸任務是紅色之前該。",
	["Back to the moonwell."] = "返回前往月亮井。",
	["Back to the pirate camp: the boots are in the crate marked Drizzlik's Emporium at the camp's south end, the lens in the Fragile crate just east of it."] = "返回前往海盜營地：靴子是在木箱標記的崔斯里克的貨物在營地的南盡頭，透鏡在易碎的木箱就在它東面。",
	["Back to the same murlocs; not every one drops a head."] = "返回前往相同魚人；不每個1掉落一個前往。",
	["Back to the top of Aldrassil. The Lost Journal lies beside him."] = "返回前往頂部的奧達希爾。遺失的日誌位於旁邊他。",
	["Back up the road to Brill."] = "返回順著道路往上前往布瑞爾。",
	["Back west along the road."] = "返回西沿著道路。",
	["Back west through Deadwind Pass to Darkshire."] = "返回西穿過逆風小徑前往夜色鎮。",
	["Back west to Quel'Danil Lodge; rangers and marksmen stay near the lodge, scouts and outrunners on the slopes south of it."] = "返回西前往奎爾丹尼小屋；遊俠與神射手留在旅捨附近，斥候與斥候在山坡在它南面。",
	["Back west to Razor Hill."] = "返回西前往剃刀嶺。",
	["Back west to Zoram'gar before heading east for good."] = "返回西前往佐拉姆加之前前往東給好。",
	["Back west to the camp."] = "返回西前往營地。",
	["Bailiff Conacher"] = "拜里弗·科納徹爾",
	["Baine Bloodhoof"] = "貝恩·血蹄",
	["Baine Bloodhoof, for Cairne in Thunder Bluff"] = "貝恩·血蹄，給凱恩·血蹄在雷霆崖",
	["Balir Frosthammer"] = "巴爾林·霜錘",
	["Balir Frosthammer, next to Sten"] = "巴爾林·霜錘，在斯登·粗臂旁邊",
	["Balthule Shadowstrike"] = "巴蘇爾·影擊",
	["Balthule Shadowstrike hides at the foot of the tower among the Dark Strand Fanatics. Keep his letter for Delgren in Ashenvale."] = "巴蘇爾·影擊藏身在哨塔在其中：的底部暗灘狂熱者。保留他的信件給淨化者德爾格倫在灰谷。",
	["Barak stands in the Kolkar camp north-west of Regthar."] = "巴拉克位於科卡爾營地在雷戈薩·死門以西北。",
	["Bareth Dawnstone"] = "巴雷斯·晨石",
	["Baritanas Skyriver"] = "巴瑞特·克羅斯",
	["Barithras Moonshade"] = "巴瑞薩斯·月影",
	["Barnil Stonepot"] = "巴尼爾·石罐",
	["Barnil collects the Green Hills of Stranglethorn: the pages drop from almost every humanoid in the jungle. Turn the pages into chapters as you go."] = "巴尼爾·石罐收集荊棘谷的青山的荊棘谷：書頁掉落來自幾乎每個人形生物在叢林。交還書頁進入章節沿途順路。",
	["Baron Revilgaz"] = "大財主里維加茲",
	["Baron Revilgaz, upstairs in the tavern"] = "大財主里維加茲，在酒館樓上",
	["Baron Rivendare"] = "瑞文戴爾男爵",
	["Bartleby"] = "巴特萊比",
	["Bartolo Ginsetti"] = "巴圖羅·吉塞提",
	["Bartolo also wants a Hillman's Cloak, a Bolt of Woolen Cloth and Fine Thread: crafted or bought; the cloak is turned in when you are back in Southshore later."] = "巴圖羅·吉塞提也需要一個山地披風，一個毛布卷與細線：製作的或購買的；披風是交還當你是返回在南海鎮稍後。",
	["Bashana buys Morrowgrain grown from your Un'Goro Soil."] = "巴珊娜·符文圖騰可兌換晨光麥種植的來自你的安戈洛的泥土。",
	["Basilisk Brain"] = "石化蜥蜴的大腦",
	["Bathran's Hair, from the plant bundles"] = "巴斯蘭的頭髮，來自植物捆",
	["Battered Dwarven Skeleton"] = "殘破的矮人骷髏",
	["Battleboars graze north of the shrine; the Bristleback quilboar hold the ravine to the north-east. Chief Sharptusk Thornmantle stands at its eastern end, and the Dirt-stained Map lies on the ground in the camp."] = "鬥豬吃草在神龕以北；刺背野豬人要塞深谷向東北。刺鬃酋長位於它的東部盡頭，與沾滿泥土的地圖位於領地在營地裡。",
	["Battleworn Axe: any Blackrock orc"] = "破斧：任意黑石殺戮者獸人",
	["Beached Sea Creature"] = "擱淺的海洋生物",
	["Beached Sea Turtle"] = "擱淺的海龜",
	["Beat Bartleby"] = "擊敗巴特萊比",
	["Beat Calvin in the duel"] = "擊敗卡爾文·蒙泰古在決鬥",
	["Beetix Ficklespragg"] = "比提克斯·斯巴格",
	["Belathaan waits on the road north of Valanaar, towards the Shrine of Akir."] = "貝拉薩恩等候在路上在瓦拉納爾以北，朝向阿基爾神龕。",
	["Beldin Steelgrill"] = "貝爾丁·鋼架",
	["Belgrom Rockmaul, Valley of Honor"] = "貝爾戈洛姆·石槌，榮譽谷",
	["Belia Thundergranite in Ironforge takes it"] = "貝莉亞·雷岩在鐵爐堡接收該任務",
	["Belia Thundergranite is in the Hall of Arms, High Priestess Mims in the Hall of Mysteries, Lago Blackwrench in the Forlorn Cavern."] = "貝莉亞·雷岩是在武器大廳，高階祭司米姆斯在秘法大廳，拉戈·黑鉗在荒棄的洞穴。",
	["Belia Thundergranite: Beast Training"] = "貝莉亞·雷岩：訓練野獸",
	["Bellygrub (level 24) roots around the pen just west of Lakeshire. Pull him away from the other boars and fight at full health."] = "貝利格拉布（24級）根莖在圍欄周圍就在湖畔鎮以西。拉怪他離開來自其他野豬與迎戰在完整生命值。",
	["Bellygrub's Tusk"] = "貝利格拉布的獠牙",
	["Bera Stonehammer"] = "博拉·石錘",
	["Bernice's Necklace"] = "波尼斯的項鍊",
	["Bibbly F'utzbuckle"] = "比布里·弗斯巴克",
	["Bibilfaz Featherwhistle"] = "比比爾法茲",
	["Billy plays in the Maclure Vineyards, east of the mine."] = "比利進行在馬科倫農場，在採礦以東。",
	["Binjy Featherwhistle"] = "賓吉·羽哨",
	["Binjy Featherwhistle, riding trainer"] = "賓吉·羽哨，騎術訓練師",
	["Bishop DeLavey"] = "德拉維主教",
	["Bishop Farthing"] = "主教法席恩",
	["Black Broodlings nest in the hills just east of Flame Crest. Use Tinkee's Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on a broodling when it is almost dead to capture its essence."] = "黑色雛龍巢在丘陵就在烈焰峰以東。使用丁奇·斯迪波爾的龍靈採集器900型在一個幼龍當它是幾乎死亡的前往佔領它的精華。",
	["Black Drake's Heart"] = "黑色幼龍之心",
	["Black Kingsnake, 50s"] = "黑色王蛇，50銀",
	["Black Oozes creep through the marsh north of the Green Belt road, west of Einar's camp. Any ooze may hold Sida's bag."] = "黑色軟泥怪潛行穿過沼澤北的綠帶草地道路，在埃納爾·石鉗的以西營地。任意軟泥怪可能要塞塞達的背包。",
	["Black Skeletal Horse is a new Forever horse (level 40) whose source is not known yet."] = "黑色骷髏馬是一個新永恆服馬（40級）其獲取來源尚不明確。",
	["Black Stallion Bridle is in the client, but no vendor is confirmed to sell it in Forever."] = "黑馬繮繩是在客戶端，但無商人是已確認前往出售它在永恆服。",
	["Blackfathom Deeps"] = "黑暗深淵",
	["Blackrock Champion"] = "黑石勇士",
	["Blackrock Depths"] = "黑石殺戮者深淵",
	["Blackrock Medallion"] = "黑石獎章",
	["Blacksmith Hammer: a tool, keep it in your bags"] = "鐵匠之錘：工具：請留在背包中",
	["Blacksmithing runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 17s in all."] = "鍛造可隨升級同步練習升級。永恆服傳承系統獎勵製作專業在技能等級150，225與300（中級，高級與大師級上限），因此以上每個階段節點均計入進度。1-75階段所需材料總計約需花費17銀。",
	["Blacksmithing: Golden Rod (or the Auction House)"] = "鍛造：金棒（或從拍賣行購買）",
	["Blacksmithing: Iron Buckle (or the Auction House)"] = "鍛造：鐵扣環（或從拍賣行購買）",
	["Blacksmithing: Silver Rod (or the Auction House)"] = "鍛造：銀棒（或從拍賣行購買）",
	["Blacksmithing: Truesilver Rod (or the Auction House)"] = "鍛造：真銀棒（或從拍賣行購買）",
	["Blackwood Pathfinders and Windtalkers hold the camp south-east of Auberdine."] = "黑木探路者與黑木風語者要塞營地在奧伯丁以東南。",
	["Blasted Boar Lung"] = "詛咒之地的野豬肺",
	["Blixie Fitzwink"] = "布里克西·菲茲溫克",
	["Blizzard counts four battleground reputations, but our faction data has three per side (Warsong Gulch, Arathi Basin, Alterac Valley). The fourth is likely tied to Forever's new PvP content; check the in-game Legacy panel."] = "暴雪計入4戰場聲望，但我們的陣營數據有3每一側（戰歌峽谷，阿拉希盆地，奧特蘭克山谷）。第四是可能關聯前往永恆服的新 PvP 內容；查看遊戲內傳承面板。",
	["Blood Red Key, a rare drop"] = "血紅鑰匙，稀有掉落",
	["Bloodfeather Belt"] = "血羽腰帶",
