	["Boat to the Forgotten Coast and ride east across Feralas to the Grimtotem camp north of the road. Kindal Moonweaver waits outside it; free the Sprite Darters from the pen in the middle and keep Kindal and at least six of them alive."] = "船前往被遺忘的海岸與騎行東穿過菲拉斯前往恐怖圖騰營地在道路以北。辛達爾·月紋在外面等候：它；解救小精靈射手來自圍欄在中間與保留辛達爾·月紋與至少6的它們存活。",
	["Boat to the Forgotten Coast and ride east into Feral Scar Vale. Zorbin's quests on the coast need level 45."] = "船前往被遺忘的海岸與騎行東進入深痕谷。佐爾賓的任務在海岸邊需要45級。",
	["Bodley offers it once Return to Bodley is turned in"] = "伯德雷提供它當向伯德雷回復完成後",
	["Bolvar Fordragon stands in the throne room of Stormwind Keep, at the north end of the city. Then leave by the main gate for Westfall."] = "伯瓦爾·弗塔根公爵伯瓦爾·弗塔根公爵位於王座房間的暴風城要塞，在主城的北端。然後跳過在旁主大門給西部荒野。",
