	["Both Runecloth donations are handed in later in the route: start saving Runecloth."] = "兩個符文布捐獻是上交在路線稍後階段：開始留存符文布。",
	["Both elementals roam north-western Silithus; the Rumblers cluster a little further north."] = "兩個元素遊蕩北-西部希利蘇斯；沙漠奔行者簇一個小更遠處北。",
	["Both quests lead to Silithus: keep them."] = "兩個任務通往希利蘇斯：請保留它們。",
