	["Brakk"] = "布拉克",
	["Brakk camps just south of Razor Hill. Sit by his campfire (/sit) until the Boosted Rest buff appears."] = "布拉克紮營就在剃刀嶺以南。坐在旁他的營火（/坐）直到強化休息增益出現。",
	["Braldir Ashmantle"] = "布拉爾迪爾·灰袍",
	["Braldir gives you the Fire Sapta. Climb to the peak above his camp, drink the Sapta beside the Spirit Stone and defeat the Minor Manifestation of Fire, then place its Glowing Ember in the Brazier of the Dormant Flame, atop the Shrine of Eternal Flame."] = "布拉爾迪爾·灰袍給你火焰薩普塔。爬上前往山峰上方他的營地，飲用薩普塔旁邊靈魂石與擊敗火焰之魂，然後放置它的餘燼在眠炎火盆，在頂部：永恆神殿加拉克烈焰守衛。",
