	["Breyk"] = "佈雷依克",
	["Brilliant Smallfish is orange from 1 (yellow at 45, grey at 85): about 50 crafts to 50. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking. Raw Brilliant Smallfish is the common catch in Teldrassil's waters."] = "美味小魚是橙色來自1（黃色在45，灰色在85）：約50製作前往50。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。新鮮的美味小魚是普通捕獲在泰達希爾的水域。",
	["Brine"] = "布瑞恩",
	["Brine's hut stands on the ridge above the quilboar watering hole, south of Camp Taurajo, on the way to Bael Modan."] = "布瑞恩的小屋位於山脊在野豬人水洞上方，在陶拉祖營地以南，在途中前往巴爾莫丹。",
	["Brine, just west of Gann"] = "布瑞恩，就在加恩·石塔以西",
