	["Brine: the red waterskin from Tarren Mill"] = "布瑞恩：紅色水袋來自塔倫米爾",
	["Bring the Hands of Lucifron, Gehennas, Shazzrah and Sulfuron from the Molten Core."] = "攜帶漢茲·跳鏈的魯西弗隆，基赫納斯，沙斯拉爾與薩弗隆來自熔火之心。",
	["Brohann Caskbelly"] = "布羅哈恩·鐵桶",
	["Bronze Tube, from Herble Baubbletump: limited stock. Sold out? Neal Allen in Menethil Harbor sells it too."] = "青銅管，來自赫爾伯：限量庫存。出售出? 尼爾·奧雷在米奈希爾港出售它也。",
