	["Bruegs Kindleborn: Searing Totem and your Fire Totem"] = "布魯格斯·火生：灼熱圖騰與你的火焰圖騰",
	["Bruegs waits in a cave above the farm north-west of the South Gate Outpost; the path up starts behind the farm."] = "布魯格斯·火生等候於一個洞穴在農場北上方-西的南門哨崗；小徑上始於在農場後面。",
	["Bruuz swims in the harbour just off Ratchet's docks. Bruuz is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "布魯茲游動在港口就在偏離/關閉棘齒城的碼頭。布魯茲為精英：建議組隊前往。",
	["Bubulo Acerbus"] = "巴巴羅·阿克巴斯",
	["Bubulo Acerbus takes cloth for Gnomeregan Exiles in Tinker Town, Ironforge. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "巴巴羅·阿克巴斯接收布料給諾莫瑞根流亡者在工匠區，鐵爐堡。第一捐獻的毛料，絲綢，魔紋布與符文布（60布料每個）已完成一次與交給大多數聲望每布料；之後它們，更多的符文布可重復直到崇拜。崇拜與另一個種族的主城允許你購買該種族的坐騎。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["Bulkrek Ragefist"] = "布科雷克·怒拳",
	["Bundle of Wood"] = "一捆木柴",
	["Bunthen Plainswind in Nighthaven flies druids there"] = "布瑟恩·草風在永夜港飛往德魯伊那裡",
	["Bunthen Plainswind in Nighthaven flies druids there; then fly on to Orgrimmar for the zeppelin"] = "布瑟恩·草風在永夜港飛往德魯伊那裡；然後飛往在前往奧格瑞瑪給飛艇",
	["Burly Rockjaw Trogg"] = "壯實的石齶怪",
	["Burning Blade Cultists hold Dustwind Gulch in northern Durotar, by Drygulch Ravine; they drop the Reagent Pouch."] = "火刃祭司要塞塵風峽谷在北部杜隆塔爾，在旁枯水谷；它們掉落試劑袋。",
	["Burning Blade Cultists hold Dustwind Gulch in northern Durotar; they drop the Reagent Pouch. The Fire Tar comes from the Razormane on your next visit to their camp."] = "火刃祭司要塞塵風峽谷在北部杜隆塔爾；它們掉落試劑袋。火焰焦油來自鋼鬃在下次來訪時前往它們的營地。",
	["Burning Blade cultists hold the caves of Skull Rock to the north; any of them drops a Searing Collar. Gazz'uz, a level 14 warlock, stands deep inside and drops the Eye of Burning Shadow."] = "火刃邪教徒要塞洞穴的骷髏石向北；任意的它們掉落一個灼熱項圈。加祖茲，一個14級術士，位於深處內部與掉落燃影之眼。",
	["Burning Key"] = "烈焰鑰匙",
