	["Buy and read Expert First Aid - Under Wraps (Expert First Aid)"] = "購買並閱讀高級急救教材 - 繃帶縛體（高級急救）",
	["Buy and read Expert Fishing - The Bass and You (Expert Fishing)"] = "購買並閱讀高級釣魚教材 - 鱸魚與你（高級釣魚）",
