	["Canaga stands just outside the Den."] = "坎納甘·地鳴位於就在外部獸穴。",
	["Canaga stands outside the Den. Spirit Rock is the hill just south of it: drink the Earth Sapta there to see the Minor Manifestation of Earth, then take the Rough Quartz back to Canaga."] = "坎納甘·地鳴位於外部獸穴。靈魂石是山丘就在它南面：飲用大地薩普塔那裡前往查看大地之魂，然後接取粗石英返回前往坎納甘·地鳴。",
	["Captain Danuvin"] = "丹努文隊長",
	["Captain Garran Vimes"] = "蓋蘭·維米斯隊長",
	["Captain Keelhaul"] = "尼哈魯船長",
	["Captain Nials"] = "尼艾絲隊長",
	["Captain Shatterskull takes Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor for Quell the Silverwing Usurpers, once per level bracket (data); check them live."] = "沙塔爾·碎顱接收戰歌峽谷榮譽獎章給鎮壓銀翼篡權者，每個等級段一次（數據）；請在遊戲內實測確認。",
