	["Captain Stoutfist stands in Menethil Keep, a short walk from Karl Boran."] = "斯托菲隊長位於米奈希爾城堡，一個不足步行來自卡爾·波蘭。",
	["Captain Stoutfist, by the keep"] = "斯托菲隊長，在要塞旁",
