	["Carendin Halgar"] = "凱倫丁·哈加爾",
	["Carendin Halgar: Summon Voidwalker"] = "凱倫丁·哈加爾：召喚虛空行者",
	["Caretaker Alen"] = "護理者奧林",
	["Caretaker Alen, by the graves south of the chapel"] = "護理者奧林，在旁墳墓在禮拜堂以南",
	["Caretaker Alen: Zaeldarr is a level 54 elite"] = "護理者奧林：澤爾達爾是一個54級精英",
