	["Carved Stone Urn"] = "雕紋石罐",
	["Cast Teleport: Moonglade and take Bunthen Plainswind's flight to Thunder Bluff; Turak Runetotem trains you on Elder Rise. Then fly to Orgrimmar and take the Undercity zeppelin from the tower outside the main gate."] = "施放傳送：月光林地與接取布瑟恩·草風的飛行前往雷霆崖；圖拉克·符文圖騰訓練你在長者高地。然後飛往前往奧格瑞瑪與接取幽暗城飛艇來自哨塔在主大門外。",
	["Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven. Shrine Baubles lie in the containers on the floor of Lake Elune'ara, below Nighthaven: take one to the Shrine of Remulos in the north-west, use it there and speak to Tajarri. Then fly back to Auberdine from Nighthaven."] = "施放傳送：月光林地。德迪利特·星焰是在永夜港。神殿靈珠位於容器在樓層的月神湖，在永夜港下方：接取1前往雷姆洛斯神殿在西北面，使用它那裡與對話前往塔加里。然後飛往返回前往奧伯丁來自永夜港。",
	["Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven; learn the flight path there if you do not have it."] = "施放傳送：月光林地。德迪利特·星焰是在永夜港；學習飛行點那裡如果你做不有它。",
	["Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven; the Great Bear Spirit sits in the north-western woods."] = "施放傳送：月光林地。德迪利特·星焰是在永夜港；巨熊之靈位於北面-西部樹林。",
	["Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Tauren: join the two pendant halves at the Shrine of Remulos, on the north-west shore of the lake, before you see Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven."] = "施放傳送：月光林地。牛頭人：加入2掛墜兩半在雷姆洛斯神殿，在西北岸邊的湖，之前你查看德迪利特·星焰在永夜港。",
	["Cast Teleport: Moonglade; Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven. The Shrine Baubles lie on the bed of Lake Elune'ara and fade within minutes: swim one straight to the Shrine of Remulos on the north-west shore, use it there and speak to Tajarri."] = "施放傳送：月光林地；德迪利特·星焰是在永夜港。神殿靈珠位於床的月神湖與消失內部分鐘：游泳1直走前往雷姆洛斯神殿在西北岸邊，使用它那裡與對話前往塔加里。",
	["Cat Carrier (Bombay), 40s"] = "貓籠（孟買貓），40銀",
	["Cat Carrier (Cornish Rex), 40s"] = "貓籠（康沃爾帝王貓），40銀",
