	["Cat Carrier (White Kitten), 60s"] = "貓籠（白貓），60銀",
	["Catch about 50 Raw Brilliant Smallfish here by fishing (see the Fishing guide)."] = "在此處捕獲約50條新鮮的美味小魚通過釣魚（查看釣魚指南）。",
	["Catch about 68 Raw Rainbow Fin Albacore here by fishing (see the Fishing guide)."] = "在此處捕獲約68條新鮮的彩鰭魚通過釣魚（查看釣魚指南）。",
