	["Cenarion Emissary Blackhoof, Valley of Wisdom: keep it for Silithus"] = "塞納里奧使者托爾·黑蹄，智慧谷：留到希利蘇斯再做",
	["Cenarion Emissary Jademoon"] = "塞納里奧使者安亞·碧月",
	["Cenarion Hold is the walled town in north-central Silithus. Bor and Huum Wildmane stand together inside. The Cenarion Circle starts out Neutral. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "塞納里奧要塞是有圍牆的城鎮在北-中央希利蘇斯。博爾與霍姆·蠻鬃位於一起內部。塞納里奧議會始於出中立。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["Cenarion Lunardust"] = "賽納里奧銀塵",
	["Cenarion Moondust"] = "塞納里奧月塵",
	["Centaur Ear"] = "半人馬的耳朵",
	["Centipaar Insect Parts"] = "森提帕爾昆蟲肢體",
	["Cerellean Whiteclaw"] = "塞瑞利恩·白爪",
	["Cerellean Whiteclaw, on the pier"] = "塞瑞利恩·白爪，在棧橋上",
	["Chakuyak, a lone wolf, prowls the plains west of the village. Prairie Stalkers and Flatland Cougars roam the plains north and west of it."] = "查庫亞克，一個單獨的狼，潛行遊蕩平原在村莊以西。草原捕食者與平原獅遊蕩於平原北與在它西面。",
	["Chapter I"] = "荊棘谷的青山 - 第一章",
	["Chapter II"] = "荊棘谷的青山 - 第二章",
	["Chapter III"] = "荊棘谷的青山 - 第三章",
	["Chapter IV"] = "荊棘谷的青山 - 第四章",
	["Charred Wolf Meat is orange from 1 (yellow at 45, grey at 85): about 50 crafts to 50. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "燒烤狼肉是橙色來自1（黃色在45，灰色在85）：約50製作前往50。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。",
	["Chef Breanna"] = "廚師佈雷納",
	["Chef Jessen"] = "廚師傑森",
	["Chemist Cuely"] = "藥劑師科雷",
	["Chemist Cuely, the Apothecarium: the vials fill in Azshara later"] = "藥劑師科雷，煉金房：小瓶裝滿在艾薩拉稍後",
	["Chestnut Mare Bridle, 20g"] = "栗色馬繮繩，20金",
	["Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle"] = "首席工程師沙克斯·比格維茲",
	["Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle, by the water tower"] = "首席工程師沙克斯·比格維茲，在水塔旁",
	["Chief Hawkwind"] = "鷹風酋長",
	["Chilled Basilisk Haunch"] = "冷蜥蜴肉",
	["Chromie"] = "克羅米",
	["Chromie in Andorhal: keep it"] = "克羅米在安多哈爾：請保留該任務/物品",
	["Chromie waits in the ruined inn on the west side of Andorhal, the ruined city north of the camp. Araj the Summoner guards his phylactery in the middle of the town."] = "克羅米等候於毀壞的旅店在安多哈爾的西側，毀壞的主城在營地以北。召喚者阿拉基衛兵他的命匣在城鎮的中央。",
	["Chromie waits in the ruined inn on the west side of Andorhal."] = "克羅米等候於毀壞的旅店在安多哈爾的西側。",
	["Chromie's Battle of Darrowshire ends against elites. Skip it."] = "克羅米的戰鬥的達隆郡最後需要面對精英。跳過即可。",
	["Chucky's Huge Ring"] = "蘇克的巨型戒指",
	["Chunks of Boar Meat"] = "肉塊的野豬肉",
	["Circle of Imprisonment"] = "禁錮法陣",
	["Clamlette Surprise asks for 20 Alterac Swiss (check the quest log); innkeepers and food vendors sell it, and the arrow picks the nearest."] = "蚌肉大餐需要20奧特蘭克冷酪（查看任務原木）；旅店老闆與食物商人出售它，與箭頭會自動指向最近的一位。",
	["Classes give 27 points: every class reaching 25, 45 and 60. They count once per class across your account, so a second character of a class you already raised adds nothing; a new class does. The first character to reach 25 usually unlocks the Legacy System itself."] = "職業交給27點數：每個職業抵達25，45與60。它們計入一次每職業穿過你的賬號，因此一個第二角色的一個職業你已經提升新增無獎勵；一個新職業會。第一角色前往抵達25通常解鎖傳承系統其本身。",
	["Clavicus Knavingham"] = "克拉維斯·納文哈姆",
	["Clavicus Knavingham takes cloth for Stormwind in Stormwind City. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "克拉維斯·納文哈姆接收布料給暴風城在暴風城。第一捐獻的毛料，絲綢，魔紋布與符文布（60布料每個）已完成一次與交給大多數聲望每布料；之後它們，更多的符文布可重復直到崇拜。崇拜與另一個種族的主城允許你購買該種族的坐騎。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["Clavicus Knavingham, in the Trade District"] = "克拉維斯·納文哈姆，在貿易區",
	["Cleansed Water goes to the Emerald Sanctuary in Felwood: keep it for later."] = "淨化的水前往/交給翡翠聖地在費伍德森林：留著稍後做。",
	["Clerk Daltry, in the town hall"] = "書記員達爾塔，在市政廳內",
	["Clerk Lendry"] = "書記員倫德瑞",
	["Cliffspring River Sample, at the waterfall"] = "壁泉河水樣，在瀑布處",
	["Cliffwatcher Longhorn"] = "峭壁衛兵圖林·長角",
	["Climb Fire Plume Ridge in the middle of the crater and use the Skeleton Key Mold by the lava lake at the top, with two Thorium Bars in your bags. Fill Laris's Empty Pure Sample Jars on the Primal Oozes in the pools around the ridge."] = "爬上火羽山在環形山與使用的中央骷髏鑰匙模具在旁熔岩湖在頂部，與2瑟銀錠在你的背包。裝滿拉里斯·空輪的純淨樣本瓶在原生軟泥怪在水池在山脊周圍。",
	["Climb the eastern mountains east of Ameth'Aran; the Mysterious Red Crystal sits on a ledge."] = "爬上東部山脈在亞米薩蘭以東；神秘的紅色水晶位於一個岩架。",
	["Climb the hill west of Hearthglen to look down on the town."] = "爬上山丘在壁爐谷以西前往查看下在城鎮。",
	["Climb the path to the top of Darkcloud Pinnacle. Lakota Windsong is held captive beside Arnak Grimtotem (29): clear the guards and Arnak first, then free her and protect her on the walk down; Grimtotem ambushers come at you on the way."] = "爬上小徑前往頂部的黑雲峰。拉克塔·風歌是持有俘虜在阿納克·恐怖圖騰旁邊（29）：清理衛兵與阿納克第一，然後解救她的與保護她的在步行下；恐怖圖騰伏擊者來到在你在途中。",
	["Climb the watchtower in the village, jump off the top and use Walk on Air to float down."] = "爬上哨塔在村子里，跳下偏離/關閉頂部與使用步行在空氣前往漂浮下。",
	["Climb to the top of Dreadmaul Rock and plant the head in the soft dirt mound."] = "爬上前往頂部的巨槌石與植物前往在軟泥土土堆。",
	["Coarse Stone comes from Tin Vein nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "粗糙的石頭來自錫礦脈採集點（採礦）；此是最密集的簇在數據。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Coarse Thread from Abigail Shiel, for Gretchen"] = "粗線來自阿比蓋爾·沙伊爾，給格莉絲·戴瑪",
	["Cockroach, 50s"] = "蟑螂，50銀",
	["Coleman Farthing"] = "庫勒曼·法席恩",
	["Coleman Farthing, in the inn"] = "庫勒曼·法席恩，在旅店內",
	["Collect Cactus Apples and kill Scorpid Workers on the way north. The Vile Familiars swarm the slope by the cave on the valley's north side; Thazz'ril's Pick lies just inside the cave mouth."] = "收集仙人掌果與擊殺蠍子在途中北。邪靈劣魔蟲群山坡在旁洞穴在山谷的北一側；塔茲利爾的鎬位於就在洞穴入口/河口內。",
	["Collin Mauren"] = "科林·瑪倫",
	["Commander Aggro'gosh"] = "指揮官阿格羅戈什",
	["Commander Althea Ebonlocke"] = "指揮官阿爾泰婭·埃伯洛克",
	["Commander Althea Ebonlocke, in the town hall"] = "指揮官阿爾泰婭·埃伯洛克，在市政廳內",
	["Commander Ashlam Valorfist"] = "指揮官阿什拉姆·瓦羅菲斯特",
	["Commander Belguilos"] = "指揮官貝爾吉洛斯",
	["Commander Cyclas's Head"] = "指揮官賽克拉斯的頭顱",
	["Commander Haalien's Severed Head"] = "指揮官哈利恩的首級",
	["Commander Haalien, Jorel Windsinger and Naaleos Leafwhisper are in the cult camp east of Elegael. Vayn Moongaze stands at its edge. Haalien also drops a Ripped Missive: read it to start the next quest."] = "指揮官哈利恩，喬雷爾·風歌與納里奧斯·葉語是在教派營地在艾蕾蓋爾·棘爪以東。薇恩·月凝位於它的邊緣。哈利恩也掉落一個撕裂的密信：閱讀它前往開始下一個任務。",
	["Commander Mar'alith"] = "指揮官瑪爾利斯",
	["Commander Samaul"] = "指揮官薩穆爾",
	["Connor Rivers"] = "科諾爾·瑞沃斯",
	["Conservator Ilthalaine"] = "管理員伊爾薩萊恩",
	["Constable Aonda"] = "治安官奧恩達",
	["Continue south to Booty Bay. Oglethorpe Obnoticus has his workshop on the upper ring of the bay."] = "繼續南前往藏寶海灣。奧格索普·奧布諾提斯有他的工坊在上層戒指的海灣。",
	["Continue west into Duskwood, north to Redridge Mountains and take the pass north out of Redridge into the Burning Steppes; Morgan's Vigil (Alliance) is near the top."] = "繼續西進入暮色森林，北前往赤脊山與穿過山道北離開赤脊山進入燃燒平原；摩根的崗哨（聯盟）是在頂部附近。",
	["Continue west to Raven Hill. The Memory of Valor glows by the ruined house south of the road."] = "繼續西前往烏鴉嶺。英勇的記憶發光在旁毀壞的房屋在道路以南。",
	["Cook Torka"] = "廚師托爾卡",
	["Cookie"] = "曲奇",
	["Coriella Calmbreeze"] = "科瑞拉·靜風",
	["Corithras Moonrage"] = "科瑞薩斯·月怒",
	["Corithras Moonrage, south of the inn"] = "科瑞薩斯·月怒，在旅店以南",
	["Cork Gizelton"] = "考克·基澤爾頓",
	["Cornelius is missing in the Grizzled Den: find him inside, then go back to Gretchen."] = "科內留斯是失蹤的在灰白獸穴：尋找他內部，然後返回格莉絲·戴瑪。",
	["Corporal Adamore and his marines hold the wrecked caravan south of Walton. Savannah Patriarchs roam the plains east of the hills, and the Sprung Traps lie among them. Serena Bloodfeather leads the Witchwing harpies in the hills to the west."] = "亞達莫爾下士與他的水兵要塞失事的商隊在沃爾頓以南。草原獅王遊蕩於平原在丘陵以東，與觸發的陷阱位於其中：它們。塞瑞娜·血羽通往巫翼鷹身女妖在丘陵向西。",
	["Corporal Kaleb"] = "卡雷布下士",
	["Corporal Kaleb: for Krazek in Booty Bay"] = "卡雷布下士：給克拉茲克在藏寶海灣",
	["Corporal Keeshan"] = "基沙恩下士",
	["Corporal Melkins"] = "麥爾金斯下士",
	["Corporal Sethman"] = "塞斯曼下士",
	["Cortello's Riddle"] = "科泰羅的謎題",
	["Crag Boars and Young Black Bears roam the fields around Kharanos and the depot. Buy the Rhapsody Malt from the innkeeper in the distillery."] = "峭壁野豬與黑熊幼崽遊蕩於農田在卡拉諾斯與倉庫周圍。購買狂想麥酒來自旅店老闆在釀酒廠。",
	["Crag Coyote Fang"] = "峭壁山狗的牙齒",
	["Crank Fizzlebub"] = "克蘭克·菲茲巴布",
	["Crank's next Zanzil errand starts in Thousand Needles: skip it."] = "克蘭克·菲茲巴布的下一個贊吉爾差事始於千針石林：跳過即可。",
	["Crate of Foodstuffs"] = "食物箱",
	["Craven Drok"] = "克拉文·德洛克",
	["Craven Drok waits in the Drag; Keldran stands in the Valley of Spirits on the west side of the city."] = "克拉文·德洛克等候於暗巷區；科爾丹位於精神谷在主城的西側。",
	["Crawler Legs"] = "蟹腿",
	["Cresting Key"] = "海浪鑰匙",
	["Crimson Snake, 50s"] = "赤練蛇，50銀",
	["Crisp Spider Meat"] = "香脆蜘蛛肉",
	["Crispy Lizard Tail is orange from 100 (yellow at 140, grey at 180): about 25 crafts to 125. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "脆炸蜥蜴尾是橙色來自100（黃色在140，灰色在180）：約25製作前往125。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。",
	["Crispy Lizard Tail is orange from 125 (yellow at 140, grey at 180): about 15 crafts to 140. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "脆炸蜥蜴尾是橙色來自125（黃色在140，灰色在180）：約15製作前往140。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。",
	["Crocolisk Steak is orange from 100 (yellow at 120, grey at 160): about 26 crafts to 125. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "鰐魚肉排是橙色來自100（黃色在120，灰色在160）：約26製作前往125。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。",
	["Crocolisk Steak is yellow from 125 (yellow at 120, grey at 160): about 7 crafts to 130. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "鰐魚肉排是黃色來自125（黃色在120，灰色在160）：約7製作前往130。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。",
	["Cross Blackrock Mountain from the western Burning Steppes into the Searing Gorge: stay on the chain path inside, past the dungeon entrances."] = "穿過黑石山來自西部燃燒平原進入灼熱峽谷：留在任務鏈小徑內部，經過地下城入口。",
	["Cross north-west past Thunder Bluff to the Wildmane Water Well in the far north of Mulgore."] = "穿過西北經過雷霆崖前往蠻鬃水井在遠處在莫高雷以北。",
	["Cross the Southfury River bridges west out of Durotar into the Barrens. Northwatch Hold in the east is an Alliance fort."] = "穿過怒水河橋西離開杜隆塔爾進入貧瘠之地。北方城堡在東面是一個聯盟堡壘。",
	["Cross the Southfury River east from the northern Barrens into Durotar: Horde country, with guards at Razor Hill, Sen'jin Village and Orgrimmar."] = "穿過怒水河東來自北部貧瘠之地進入杜隆塔爾：部落領地，與衛兵在剃刀嶺，森金村與奧格瑞瑪。",
	["Cross the Thandol Span in northern Wetlands into the Arathi Highlands (level 30+ creatures off the road), follow the road west past Refuge Pointe and on into Hillsbrad Foothills."] = "穿過薩多爾大橋在北部濕地進入阿拉希高地（30級+ 生物道路兩側），沿著道路前往西經過避難谷地與在進入希爾斯布萊德丘陵。",
	["Cross the Thandol Span south into the Wetlands, go through the Dun Algaz pass into Loch Modan and take the road south out of Loch Modan into the Badlands."] = "穿過薩多爾大橋南進入濕地，前往穿過丹奧加茲穿過進入洛克莫丹與沿著道路走南離開洛克莫丹進入荒蕪之地。",
	["Cross the bridge into Durotar and follow the road east to Razor Hill."] = "穿過橋進入杜隆塔爾與沿著道路前往東前往剃刀嶺。",
	["Cross the long bridge north into town. Foreman Oslow and Marshal Marris stand at the north end of the bridge, Dockmaster Baren on the docks, Chef Breanna at the inn, Bailiff Conacher in the town hall, Martie Jainrose in her garden at the west end."] = "穿過長橋北進入城鎮。工頭奧斯洛與治安官馬瑞斯位於橋的北端，碼頭管理員巴倫在碼頭上，廚師佈雷納在旅店，拜里弗·科納徹爾在市政廳內，瑪蒂·詹羅斯在她的花園在西盡頭。",
	["Cross the river east of Tirion into Terrordale. The Terrordale Spirits haunt the woods there."] = "穿過河流在提里奧以東進入恐懼谷。恐懼谷的靈魂出沒樹林那裡。",
	["Cross the river east to the Undercroft, the crypt in the south-west of the zone. The Torn Scroll lies inside: its key is on Infiltrator Hameya in the far north-east, done in the next guide."] = "穿過河流東前往地下墓穴，地穴在區域以西南。破損的捲軸位於內部：它的鑰匙是在滲透者哈米亞在遠處東北，完成在下一份指南中。",
	["Cross the river west to Tirion's hut."] = "穿過河流西前往提里奧的小屋。",
	["Cross the south of the crater to Torwa by the ramp."] = "穿過在環形山前往以南托爾瓦在旁坡道。",
	["Cross the south of the crater to the pylon on the western cliffs."] = "穿過在環形山前往水晶塔在西部懸崖以南。",
	["Crumpled Map"] = "弄皺的地圖",
	["Crystal Kelp Fronds"] = "水晶藻葉",
	["Curator Thorius"] = "索里奧斯館長",
	["Curgle Cranklehop: his crate goes to Rut'theran Village, later"] = "克格爾·曲藤：他的木箱前往/交給魯瑟蘭村，稍後",
	["Curiously Tasty Omelet is orange from 130 (yellow at 170, grey at 210): about 46 crafts to 175. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "美味煎蛋捲是橙色來自130（黃色在170，灰色在210）：約46製作前往175。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。",
	["Curiously Tasty Omelet is orange from 150 (yellow at 170, grey at 210): about 26 crafts to 175. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "美味煎蛋捲是橙色來自150（黃色在170，灰色在210）：約26製作前往175。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。",
	["Cursed Marine"] = "被詛咒的水兵",
	["Cursed Sailor"] = "被詛咒的水手",
	["Daelyshia"] = "黛琳希亞",
	["Daggerspine Raider"] = "刺脊襲擊者",
	["Daggerspine Shorehunter"] = "刺脊灘行者",
	["Daggerspine Siren"] = "刺脊海妖",
	["Daggerspine Sorceress"] = "刺脊巫師",
	["Dal Bloodclaw (25) leads the Thistlefur gnolls at the camp north of Astranaar. Clear his guards first, one at a time."] = "達爾·血爪（25）通往薊皮豺狼人在營地在阿斯特蘭納以北。清理他的衛兵第一，1在一個時間。",
	["Dal Bloodclaw's Skull"] = "達爾·血爪的顱骨",
	["Dalar Dawnweaver"] = "達拉爾·道恩維沃爾",
	["Dalar Dawnweaver: take it if he offers it; it may follow his Arugal's Folly series, which the route does not run"] = "達拉爾·道恩維沃爾：接取它如果他提供該任務；它可能沿著他的阿魯高的愚行系列，其中路線會不前往",
	["Dalia the Collector"] = "收集者達莉亞",
	["Dalinda Malem"] = "黛琳達·瑪雷姆",
