	["Danarii Bellowveil"] = "達納莉·鳴紗",
	["Daniel, in the library"] = "丹尼爾，在圖書館內",
	["Dar"] = "達爾",
	["Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) drop Invader's Scourgestones here, along with Minion's stones and Runecloth. Hand Invader's in 10 at a time and Minion's 20 at a time to Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff at Light's Hope Chapel. In Classic both stop giving reputation at Honored."] = "黑暗教徒與暗影法師（58-60級）掉落侵略者的天災石此處，沿著與爪牙的石頭與符文布。上交雷霆入侵者的在10在一個時間與爪牙的20在一個時間前往尼古拉斯·瑟倫霍夫公爵在聖光之願禮拜堂。在經典舊世兩個停靠給予聲望在尊敬。",
	["Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) drop it here; every Scourge kill here also counts toward the Argent Dawn (see that guide). The Auction House works too."] = "黑暗教徒與暗影法師（58-60級）掉落它此處；每個天災軍團擊殺此處也計入朝向銀色黎明（查看該指南）。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Dark Iron Geologist"] = "黑鐵地質學家",
	["Dark Iron Map"] = "黑鐵地圖",
	["Dark Iron Ore: Favor Amongst the Brotherhood, Dark Iron Ore at Lokhtos, repeatable."] = "黑鐵礦石：兄弟會的好感 - 黑鐵礦石在洛克圖斯，可重復。",
