	["Darla Harris, Southshore"] = "達爾拉·哈瑞斯，南海鎮",
	["Darren Malvew"] = "達倫·瑪爾維",
	["Darren Malvew: the lions come later"] = "達倫·瑪爾維：獅子來到稍後",
