	["Darsok Swiftdagger"] = "達索克·快刀",
	["Darsok Swiftdagger, on the tower platform: needs level 12"] = "達索克·快刀，在哨塔平台上：需要12級",
	["Darsok Swiftdagger: the harpies come later, in the Dry Hills"] = "達索克·快刀：鷹身人來到稍後，在枯水谷",
	["Daryl Riknussun, Ironforge"] = "達瑞爾·瑞克努索，鐵爐堡",
	["Daryn Lightwind"] = "達蕾恩·輕風",
	["Daryn's next errand goes to Tanaris: skip it."] = "達蕾恩·輕風的下一個差事前往/交給塔納利斯：跳過即可。",
	["Dashel waits in the Pig and Whistle tavern in Old Town; he and his two thugs fight you, but stop once beaten."] = "達捨爾·石拳等候於豬和哨聲旅店酒館在舊城區；他與他的2暴徒迎戰你，但停靠一次被毆打的。",
	["Davil's Libram"] = "達維的聖契",
	["Davil's Libram lies in the town hall of Hearthglen, west of Tirion: the Scarlet guards stand close together."] = "達維的聖契位於市政廳內的壁爐谷，在提里奧以西：血色衛兵位於靠近一起。",
	["Dazalar"] = "達扎拉",
	["Dead Cultist"] = "死去的教徒",
	["Deadwood Avenger"] = "死木復仇者",
	["Deadwood Cauldron, if you found the Firewater flask in Winterspring"] = "死木大鍋，如果你找到火酒燒瓶在冬泉谷",
	["Deadwood Den Watcher"] = "死木守衛",
	["Deadwood Gardener"] = "死木園丁",
	["Deadwood Pathfinder"] = "死木探險者",
	["Deadwood Ritual Totem, a rare drop"] = "死木儀祭圖騰，稀有掉落",
	["Deadwood Shaman"] = "死木薩滿祭司",
	["Deadwood Warrior"] = "死木戰士",
	["Deadwood furbolgs (level 48-50) camp at the southern end of Felwood. Keep every Deadwood Headdress Feather they drop: Grazle and Nafien take them later."] = "死木熊怪（48-50級）營地在費伍德森林的南端。保留每個死木頭飾羽毛它們掉落：格拉茲與納菲恩接取它們稍後。",
	["Death Cap"] = "毒帽蘑菇",
	["Deathcharger's Reins needs level 60 and Journeyman Riding to ride (Forever client). Train it at your race's riding trainer; see the Level 60 mount guides."] = "死亡軍馬的繮繩需要60級與中級騎術前往騎行（永恆服客戶端）。訓練它在你的種族的騎術訓練師；查看等級60坐騎指南。",
	["Deathguard Bartholomew"] = "亡靈衛兵巴塞洛繆",
	["Deathguard Burgess"] = "亡靈衛兵伯吉斯",
	["Deathguard Dillinger"] = "亡靈衛兵迪林格爾",
	["Deathguard Dillinger stands in Brill. Ulag waits in the mausoleum on the hill just north of town: open the gate and fight him."] = "亡靈衛兵迪林格爾位於布瑞爾。烏拉格等候於陵墓在山丘就在城鎮北面：打開/開啓大門與迎戰他。",
	["Deathguard Dillinger: Defensive Stance"] = "亡靈衛兵迪林格爾：防禦姿態",
	["Deathguard Linnea"] = "亡靈衛兵林奈",
	["Deathguard Saltain"] = "亡靈衛兵薩爾坦",
	["Deathguard Samsa"] = "亡靈衛兵沙穆薩",
	["Deathknell opens onto Tirisfal Glades; Brill is east along the road. Orcs, trolls and tauren arrive at the zeppelin tower by the Undercity."] = "喪鐘鎮通向提瑞斯法林地；布瑞爾是東沿著道路。獸人，巨魔與牛頭人抵達在飛艇哨塔在旁幽暗城。",
	["Deathmaster Dwire's The Battle for Arathi Basin! (assault every base) and Take Four Bases / Take Five Bases are one-time quests; Deathstalker Mortis beside him takes Arathi Resource Crates."] = "屠殺者杜維爾的阿拉希盆地之戰！（突襲每個基地）與佔領四個基地 / 佔領五個基地是一次性任務；亡靈哨兵莫提斯旁邊他接收阿拉希資源箱。",
	["Deathmaster Dwire, Hammerfall"] = "屠殺者杜維爾，落錘鎮",
	["Deathstalker Erland"] = "亡靈哨兵埃蘭德",
	["Deathstalker Erland waits north-east of the house. Escort him back to Rane; worgs attack on the way."] = "亡靈哨兵埃蘭德等候在房屋以東北。護送他返回前往蘭妮·尤瑞克；座狼攻擊在途中。",
	["Deathstalker Lesh: Darthalia in Tarren Mill"] = "亡靈哨兵萊什：高級執行官達薩利亞在塔倫米爾",
	["Deathstalker Masoj"] = "死亡獵手馬索吉",
	["Deeg"] = "迪格",
	["Deep Cover: Taskmaster Fizzule, by the Sludge Fen"] = "臥底密探：工頭費蘇勒，在旁淤泥沼澤",
	["Defeat the challengers and Big Will"] = "擊敗挑戰者與比格維爾",
	["Defias Docket"] = "迪菲亞記事本",
	["Defias Pathstalkers and Knuckledusters walk Moonbrook; Highwaymen (level 17) patrol the hills south and east of it in pairs: pull them apart. The Deadmines entrance in the smithy is a group dungeon."] = "迪菲亞巡路者與指虎步行月溪鎮；攔路強盜（17級）巡邏於丘陵南與在它東面在成對：拉怪它們相隔。死亡礦井入口在鐵匠鋪是一個隊伍地下城。",
	["Defias Pillagers and Looters hold the farms west of Sentinel Hill, between the coast road and Moonbrook."] = "迪菲亞搶劫者與掠奪者要塞農場在哨兵嶺以西，在海岸道路與月溪鎮之間。",
	["Defias Pirates"] = "迪菲亞海盜",
	["Defias Rogue Wizard"] = "迪菲亞流浪巫師",
	["Defias Rogue Wizards camp on the shores of Stone Cairn Lake; they drop the Red Linen Bandanas too. Rolf's corpse lies in the murloc village on the north-east shore."] = "迪菲亞流浪巫師營地在海岸的石碑湖；它們掉落紅色亞麻面罩也。羅爾夫的屍體位於魚人村莊在東北岸邊。",
	["Defias Script: Defias Rogue Wizards"] = "迪菲亞手稿：迪菲亞流浪巫師",
	["Defias Thugs camp in the clearing east of the Abbey and along the valley's east side."] = "迪菲亞暴徒紮營於空地在修道院與沿著山谷以東的東一側。",
	["Defias Tower Key: Malformed Defias Drone"] = "迪菲亞塔樓鑰匙：醜陋的迪菲亞懶漢",
	["Delgren the Purifier"] = "淨化者德爾格倫",
	["Deliana then offers your class's Saving the Best for Last, the final upgrade of the dungeon set."] = "德莉亞娜然後提供你的職業的把最好的留到最後，最終升級的地下城設置。",
	["Deliana, Ironforge"] = "德莉亞娜，鐵爐堡",
	["Demisette Cloyce, in the Slaughtered Lamb: Strahad Farsan in Ratchet takes it at the end of the next guide"] = "德米賽特·克勞斯，在已宰的羔羊旅店：斯坦哈德·法爾杉在棘齒城接收該任務在下一份指南末尾",
	["Den Mother"] = "雌薊熊",
	["Denaaris Stargale"] = "德納里斯·星風",
	["Denaaris stands beside the Skyborne Portal where the zeppelin lands. The portal takes you to Stormwind."] = "德納里斯·星風站在旁邊：天裔傳送門在飛艇之地。傳送門接收你前往暴風城。",
	["Denalan"] = "德納蘭",
	["Dendrite Starblaze"] = "德迪利特·星焰",
	["Dendrite Starblaze, Nighthaven"] = "德迪利特·星焰，永夜港",
	["Dendrite Starblaze: the welcome from Turak"] = "德迪利特·星焰：歡迎信來自圖拉克·符文圖騰",
	["Dense Stone comes from Small Thorium Vein nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "厚重的石頭來自軟泥覆蓋的瑟銀礦脈採集點（採礦）；此是最密集的簇在數據。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Deputy Feldon"] = "菲爾頓副隊長",
	["Deputy Rainer"] = "瑞尼爾副隊長",
	["Deputy Willem"] = "維里副隊長",
	["Deputy Willem, back at the Abbey steps"] = "維里副隊長，返回在修道院台階",
	["Dermot"] = "德莫特",
	["Derrington's watchtowers, Vandis' cauldron and Mickey's barrel are done on a later visit: keep them."] = "高級執行官德靈頓的哨塔，暗影牧師範蒂絲的大鍋與米克·萊文的木桶已完成在後續再來時：請保留它們。",
	["Desperate Prayer"] = "絕望禱言",
	["Devlin Agamand"] = "代弗林·阿加曼德",
	["Devrak"] = "迪弗拉克",
	["Devrak, the wind rider master"] = "迪弗拉克，雙足飛龍管理員",
	["Dewy Lasher Frond"] = "帶露的鞭笞者葉",
	["Dinosaur Bone"] = "恐龍骨頭",
	["Dinosaur Bones lie on the ground in the south-west, among the stegodons: those are elite, pick the bones up around them and take the rest from Diemetradons. The expedition's Research Equipment lies in the south-west jungle."] = "恐龍骨頭位於領地在西南面，在其中：劍龍：那些為精英，拾取骨頭上周圍它們與接取其餘來自雙帆龍。遠徵隊的研究設備位於西南面叢林。",
	["Dirania Silvershine"] = "迪蘭妮亞·月光",
	["Dirania Silvershine, east of the tree"] = "迪蘭妮亞·月光，在樹以東",
	["Dire Maul East"] = "厄運之槌東",
	["Dire Maul North"] = "厄運之槌北",
	["Dire Maul West"] = "厄運之槌西",
	["Dire Maul fits levels 55 to 60; the Rabid Shardtooth grind below gets you to 59 alone."] = "厄運之槌適合55至60級；瘋狂的碎齒熊刷怪下方使你達到你前往59獨自。",
	["Dire Mottled Boar (99%), Elder Mottled Boar (74%) in Durotar, or wherever the arrow points"] = "可怕的雜斑野豬（99%），老雜斑野豬（74%）在杜隆塔爾，或跟隨箭頭指示位置",
	["Dirty Knucklebones"] = "骯髒的指節骨",
	["Discovering an area gives experience scaled to its level, so this runs alongside leveling. Alliance starts in Elwynn Forest; dwarves and gnomes can begin at the Dun Morogh step. 12 areas to discover here, levels 5-10."] = "探索發現一個區域給予經驗值覆鱗的前往它的等級，因此此可隨升級同步練習升級。聯盟始於艾爾文森林；矮人與侏儒可以開始在丹莫羅步驟。12區域前往探索發現此處，5-10級。",
	["Discovering an area gives experience scaled to its level, so this runs alongside leveling. Alliance starts on Teldrassil; humans, dwarves and gnomes arrive by boat at Auberdine and can begin at the Darkshore step. 11 areas to discover here, levels 5-11."] = "探索發現一個區域給予經驗值覆鱗的前往它的等級，因此此可隨升級同步練習升級。聯盟始於在泰達希爾；人類，矮人與侏儒抵達在旁船在奧伯丁與可以開始在黑海岸步驟。11區域前往探索發現此處，5-11級。",
	["Discovering an area gives experience scaled to its level, so this runs alongside leveling. Horde starts in Durotar; tauren can begin at the Mulgore step, undead arrive by zeppelin at Orgrimmar. 11 areas to discover here, levels 5-10."] = "探索發現一個區域給予經驗值覆鱗的前往它的等級，因此此可隨升級同步練習升級。部落始於杜隆塔爾；牛頭人可以開始在莫高雷步驟，亡靈抵達在旁飛艇在奧格瑞瑪。11區域前往探索發現此處，5-10級。",
	["Discovering an area gives experience scaled to its level, so this runs alongside leveling. Horde starts in Tirisfal Glades; orcs, trolls and tauren arrive by zeppelin from Orgrimmar. 17 areas to discover here, levels 5-10."] = "探索發現一個區域給予經驗值覆鱗的前往它的等級，因此此可隨升級同步練習升級。部落始於提瑞斯法林地；獸人，巨魔與牛頭人抵達在旁飛艇來自奧格瑞瑪。17區域前往探索發現此處，5-10級。",
	["Diseased Grizzly"] = "生病的灰熊",
	["Diseased Wolf"] = "生病的狼",
	["Disgusting Oozeling"] = "惡心的軟泥怪",
	["Dithers offers Skeletal Fragments (Scholomance). Skip it."] = "藥劑師迪瑟斯提供骸骨碎片（通靈學院）。跳過即可。",
	["Divine Grace"] = "神聖恩典",
	["Dizzy One-Eye"] = "獨眼迪茲",
	["Dizzy's Eye"] = "迪茲的眼睛",
	["Do your shopping in the Undercity first, then fly to the Sepulcher. The Brazier of Everfount stands on the hill just south-west of it: beat the Corrupt Manifestation of Water beside it, place its bracers in the brazier, speak to the Minor Manifestation of Water and keep the Shard of Water for Islen. Fly on to Tarren Mill from the Sepulcher."] = "做你的採購在幽暗城第一，然後飛往前往瑟伯切爾。永泉火盆位於山丘就在它西南面：擊敗腐化的大地之魂的水旁邊它，放置它的護腕在火盆，對話前往水之魂與保留水靈碎片給水之先知伊斯倫。飛往在前往塔倫米爾來自瑟伯切爾。",
	["Do'gol"] = "杜高爾",
	["Dockmaster Baren"] = "碼頭管理員巴倫",
	["Doctor Draxlegauge"] = "德拉克里格博士",
	["Doctor Gregory Victor, Hammerfall"] = "格里高利·維克托醫生，落錘鎮",
	["Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen, Theramore Isle"] = "古斯塔夫·範沃森醫生，塞拉摩島",
	["Doctor Martin Felben, in the Apothecarium"] = "馬丁·費爾本，在煉金房",
	["Document Chest, north-west camp"] = "文件箱，西北營地",
	["Document Chest, south-east camp"] = "文件箱，東南營地",
	["Document Chest, south-west camp"] = "文件箱，西南營地",
	["Dogran is chained up in the quilboar camp west of the road."] = "步兵多格蘭是被鎖住的上在野豬人營地在道路以西。",
	["Dogran's Pendant"] = "多格蘭的墜飾",
	["Dokimi stands in the Crossroads. Open each crate she hands you and bring back what is inside."] = "多基米位於十字路口。打開/開啓每個木箱她發放你與攜帶返回所是內部。",
	["Dondallion Whisperwind"] = "唐達里奧·語風",
	["Donni Anthania"] = "冬妮·安薩妮婭",
	["Donni Anthania has a farmhouse north of Goldshire. Each cat carrier costs 40s. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "冬妮·安薩妮婭有一個農舍在閃金鎮以北。每個貓籠子花費40銀。每個寵物物品傳授它的夥伴當你使用它；目標留在勾選隨後。",
	["Donova Snowden"] = "多諾瓦·雪山",
	["Donova camps among the steaming pools of Frostfire Hot Springs, in the west of the valley."] = "多諾瓦紮營在其中：冒熱氣的水池的霜火溫泉，在山谷以西。",
	["Donova next sends you after High Chief Winterfall, an elite in his cave. Skip it."] = "多諾瓦下一個派你去討伐冬泉酋長，一個精英在他的洞穴。跳過即可。",
	["Doomwarder Blood"] = "末日看守之血",
	["Doras"] = "多拉斯",
	["Doras, the wind rider master, stands on the tower in the Valley of Strength."] = "多拉斯，雙足飛龍管理員，位於哨塔在力量谷。",
	["Dorn Plainstalker"] = "多恩·平原行者",
	["Dorn Plainstalker stands on a mesa top east of the Galak camps. For the Test of Faith, walk off the end of the planks beside him: you land safely."] = "多恩·平原行者位於一個台地頂部東的加拉克紮營。給信仰的試煉，步行偏離/關閉盡頭的木板旁邊他：你陸地安全地。",
	["Down the Gold Road to Camp Taurajo again."] = "下金幣道路前往陶拉祖營地再次。",
	["Draenethyst Crystal"] = "德萊尼水晶",
	["Dragonmaw Catapult"] = "龍喉投石車",
	["Dragonmaw War Banner"] = "龍喉戰旗",
	["Dran Droffers"] = "德蘭·杜佛斯",
	["Dran Droffers, the Drag"] = "德蘭·杜佛斯，暗巷區",
	["Draz'Zilb"] = "德拉茲辛比",
	["Dreaming Whelps"] = "夢遊雛龍",
	["Dredge Crusher"] = "掘泥摧毀者",
	["Dredge Crushers dig further west; Stonelash Pincers, Flayers and Rock Stalkers hunt the same sands."] = "掘泥摧毀者挖掘更遠處西；石鞭巨鉗蠍，剝皮者與岩石潛伏者狩獵相同沙地。",
	["Dredge Crushers roam the dunes between Hive'Zora and Cenarion Hold, on your way back. Commander Mar'alith only offers Dearest Natalia from level 58."] = "掘泥摧毀者遊蕩於沙丘在佐拉蟲巢與塞納里奧要塞之間，在你的路返回。指揮官瑪爾利斯僅提供親愛的納塔莉亞來自58級。",
	["Dredge Striker"] = "掘泥打擊者",
	["Dredge Strikers dig in the dunes north-west of the hold; Stonelash Scorpids and Sand Skitterers roam all around."] = "掘泥打擊者挖掘在沙丘在要塞以西北；石鞭蠍與掠沙蜘蛛遊蕩全部周圍。",
	["Dredge Strikers, Stonelash Scorpids and Sand Skitterers share the sands just north of the hold."] = "掘泥打擊者，石鞭蠍與掠沙蜘蛛共享沙地就在要塞以北。",
	["Dreka'Sur"] = "德雷卡蘇",
	["Drizzlik"] = "崔斯里克",
	["Drizzlik, by the bank"] = "崔斯里克，在銀行旁",
	["Drizzlik: the Snapjaw skins gathered earlier"] = "崔斯里克：鉗嘴龜獸皮收集的此前",
	["Drull and Tog'thar are chained inside Durnholde Keep's courtyard buildings; open both locks."] = "德魯爾與托格薩是被鎖住的在敦霍爾德城堡的內庭院建築；打開/開啓兩個鎖。",
	["Drull's ball and chain"] = "德魯爾的鐵球與任務鏈",
	["Drulzegar Skraghook"] = "杜澤加爾",
	["Drum Fel"] = "杜拉姆法爾",
	["Drum Fel's next Call to Arms is against Boulderfist elites: leave it."] = "杜拉姆法爾的下一個短兵相接是迎戰石拳精英：可先放著不做。",
	["Drusilla La Salle, outside the Abbey"] = "杜希拉·拉薩雷，在修道院外",
	["Drusilla La Salle: Summon Imp"] = "杜希拉·拉薩雷：召喚小鬼",
	["Duke Hydraxis stands on a small island off the eastern coast of Azshara; swim or walk the shallows out to him. The Hydraxian Waterlords start out Neutral. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "海達克西斯公爵位於一個小型島嶼偏離/關閉東部海岸的艾薩拉；游泳或步行淺灘出前往他。海達希亞水元素開始出中立。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff"] = "尼古拉斯·瑟倫霍夫公爵",
	["Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff, Light's Hope Chapel"] = "尼古拉斯·瑟倫霍夫公爵，聖光之願禮拜堂",
	["Dunemaul Brute"] = "砂槌蠻兵",
	["Dunemaul Enforcer"] = "砂槌執行者",
	["Dunemaul ogres (level 45-48) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "砂槌食人魔（45-48級）掉落它此處。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Dungar Longdrink"] = "杜加爾·朗德瑞克",
	["Dungar Longdrink, Trade District; Gryth Thurden, Ironforge"] = "杜加爾·朗德瑞克，貿易區；格萊斯·瑟登，鐵爐堡",
	["Durnan Furcutter, inside Anvilmar"] = "德南·弗卡特，在安威瑪爾內",
	["Durotar Supply and Logistics is the Horde's tradeskill faction in Forever. Its camp is just outside the Crossroads in the Barrens. From level 10 mobs drop Waylaid Crates: fill each with the goods its label asks for and hand the Sealed Crate to Dokimi at the camp for reputation and Merchant's Favor. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "杜隆塔爾補給與後勤部是部落的商業技能陣營在永恆服。它的營地是就在外部十字路口在貧瘠之地。來自10級怪物掉落被劫的貨箱：裝滿每個與商品它的標籤需要與上交密封的箱子前往多基米在營地給聲望與商人的青睞。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["Duskbats and Darkhounds roam all along the road back west; finish the wings and hides on the way."] = "夜行蝙蝠與飢餓的黑暗犬遊蕩全部沿著道路返回西；完成翅膀與藏身在途中。",
	["Duskweed Petal"] = "暮色草花瓣",
	["Duskwood is east of Westfall and south of Elwynn Forest. Its road runs east to Darkshire."] = "暮色森林是在西部荒野以東與在艾爾文森林以南。它的道路通往東前往夜色鎮。",
	["Duskwood is next: follow the road west to Three Corners, then south to Darkshire."] = "暮色森林是下一個：沿著道路前往西前往三角路口，然後南前往夜色鎮。",
	["Dustwallow Marsh is east of the southern Barrens; Brackenwall Village in the north-west is the Horde town."] = "塵泥沼澤是在南部以東貧瘠之地；蕨牆村在西北面是部落城鎮。",
	["Dusty Reliquary"] = "積灰的聖物箱",
	["Dusty Shelf, inside the keep"] = "布滿灰塵的書架，在保留內",
	["Duthorian Rall"] = "達索瑞恩·拉爾",
	["Duthorian Rall stands in the Cathedral of Light. Turning in the Tome of Nobility teaches Summon Warhorse; Paladins do not buy a mount."] = "達索瑞恩·拉爾位於聖光大教堂。交還在貴族之書傳授召喚軍馬；聖騎士做不購買一個坐騎。",
	["Duthorian Rall, Cathedral of Light"] = "達索瑞恩·拉爾，聖光大教堂",
	["Duthorian Rall, in the Cathedral of Light"] = "達索瑞恩·拉爾，在聖光大教堂",
	["Duthorian Rall: Redemption"] = "達索瑞恩·拉爾：救贖",
	["Dying Kodo (55%), Ancient Kodo (54%), Aged Kodo (40%) in Desolace, or wherever the arrow points"] = "瀕死的科多獸（55%），遠古科多獸（54%），老邁的科多獸（40%）在淒涼之地，或跟隨箭頭指示位置",
	["Each Circle of Binding is a ring of standing stones; the key sits on the stone at its heart. The eastern circle is on the hills north-west of Hammerfall."] = "每個束縛法陣是一個戒指的聲望等級石頭；鑰匙位於石頭在它的心臟。東部法陣是在丘陵在落錘鎮以西北。",
	["Each crafting profession gives 3 points, at 150, 225 and 300. Ranks count once per profession across your account. Follow the Polestar guide \"Alchemy 1-300\" (Professions). A crafting profession at 150 also unlocks the Legacy System."] = "每個製作專業給予3點數，在150，225與300。軍階計入一次每專業穿過你的賬號。沿著 Polestar 指南 \"煉金術1-300\"（專業技能）。一個製作專業在150也解鎖傳承系統。",
	["Each key lies at one of the Highlands' standing-stone circles: east of the shards, near Refuge Pointe and in the west. The Stone of Inner Binding stands west of Refuge Pointe."] = "每個鑰匙位於1的高地獵獸龍的聲望等級-石頭法陣：在碎片以東，在避難谷地附近與在西面。內束縛之石位於避難谷地以西。",
	["Each of Dazalar's quests hands you a Taming Rod: use it on the beast he names, then bring the rod back to him in Dolanaar. Webwood Lurkers creep around the village, Nightsaber Stalkers and Strigid Screechers roam the woods south of it."] = "每個的達扎拉的任務發放你一個馴獸棒：使用它在野獸他名稱，然後攜帶魔杖返回前往他在多蘭納爾。樹林潛伏者潛行在村莊周圍，夜刃捕食者與巨翼惡梟遊蕩於樹林在它南面。",
	["Each of Grif Wildheart's quests hands you a Taming Rod: use it on the beast he names, then bring the rod back to him at the Kharanos smithy. Large Crag Boars, Snow Leopards and Ice Claw Bears all roam the fields just south and east of Kharanos."] = "每個的格瑞夫的任務發放你一個馴獸棒：使用它在野獸他名稱，然後攜帶魔杖返回前往他在卡拉諾斯鐵匠鋪。大峭壁野豬，雪豹與冰爪熊全部遊蕩於農田就在南與在卡拉諾斯以東。",
	["Each of Quel'ana's quests hands you a Taming Rod: use it on the beast she names, then bring the rod back to her in Valanaar. Windsong Crawlers line the shore west of town; Vuldren Alphas and Ornery Galestriders roam the Gustberry Lowlands around the Windfield farm. Her sister Quel'dora stands beside her."] = "每個的奎爾安娜·疾風的任務發放你一個馴獸棒：使用它在野獸她名稱，然後攜帶魔杖返回前往她的在瓦拉納爾。風歌爬行者路線岸邊在城鎮西面；瓦德倫首領與暴躁的疾風陸行鳥遊蕩於風莓低地周圍阿爾瓦里奧·風野農場。她的修女奎爾多拉·疾風站在旁邊：她的。",
	["Each robot starts with a distress beacon that mobs in its zone drop (about 1-2.5% per kill in our data). Start in Feralas."] = "每個機器人始於一個求救信標該怪物在它的區域掉落（約1-2.5%每擊殺在我們的數據）。開始在菲拉斯。",
	["Eagan Peltskinner"] = "伊根·派特斯金納",
	["Ealaane Nimbuswalker"] = "伊拉妮·雲行者",
	["Earth Sapta, beside the Spirit Stone"] = "大地薩普塔，旁邊靈魂石",
	["East across the plains toward the coast: the stolen silver lies in a raptor nest north-west of Northwatch Hold."] = "東穿過平原朝海岸方向：被盜的銀色位於一個迅猛龍巢在北方城堡以西北。",
	["East along the road to the Fallow Sanctuary. The Lost One mobs drop the crystals; Noboru walks the ruins and drops his cudgel."] = "東沿著道路前往農田避難所。迷失者塞爾杜林1怪物掉落水晶；諾博魯步行廢墟與掉落他的木槌。",
	["East along the road, Cauldron Lord Malvinious guards the cauldron at Dalson's Tears."] = "東沿著道路，護鍋者瑪維諾斯衛兵大鍋在達爾松之淚。",
	["East of Bloodvenom Post, the cratered vale where the Entropic Beasts and Horrors roam. Kill two of each, then walk to each of the three fel-water craters."] = "在血毒崗哨以東，環形山山谷在熱能野獸與可怕的血僵屍遊蕩。擊殺2的每個，然後步行前往每個的3邪能-水環形山。",
	["East of Ziz, the Venture Company is clear-cutting Windshear Crag; one of the Operators carries the blueprints. Piznik mines in the small mine on the east side: stay with him while he mines, Venture Co. thugs come for him."] = "在吉茲以東，風險投資公司僱員公司是清理-切割狂風峭壁；1的操作員魯格倫克攜帶藍圖。匹茲尼克礦洞在小型採礦在東一側：留在與他當他礦洞，風險投資公司暴徒來到給他。",
	["East of Zoram'gar, the Thistlefur furbolgs fill the village and the hills around their hold."] = "在佐拉姆加以東，薊皮熊怪裝滿村莊與丘陵周圍它們的要塞。",
	["East of the ogres, Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) stalk unseen until they strike; the Stranglethorn Tigresses roam the same ground and now and then drop a pristine fang. Snapjaw Crocolisks line the river just west of the jungle; keep their skins for Drizzlik."] = "在食人魔以東，深喉獵豹（37-38）潛伏隱形的直到它們打擊；荊棘谷母虎遊蕩於相同領地與現在與然後掉落一個完好的獠牙。鉗嘴鰐魚路線河流就在叢林以西；保留它們的獸皮給崔斯里克。",
	["East of the road the Ashmane boars and Grunters root on the slopes beside the Redstone basilisks. Stay away from the level 52 Helboars further south."] = "在道路灰鬃野豬與哼叫野豬根在山坡在紅石旁邊石化蜥蜴以東。留在離開來自52級地獄野豬更遠處南。",
	["East of the village, the violet flower grows in the hills."] = "在村莊以東，紫色花生長在丘陵。",
	["East past the mill and across the river. Shadowhide gnolls fill the valley; Lieutenant Fangore (26, well above you) leads them at its north end: clear his escort first and fight him at full health. Stay out of Stonewatch Keep to the south: its orcs are elite."] = "東經過磨坊與穿過河流。暗皮戰士豺狼人裝滿山谷；範高雷中尉（26，水井上方你）通往它們在它的北盡頭：清理他的護送第一與迎戰他在完整生命值。留在離開石堡保留向南：它的獸人為精英。",
	["East to Ratchet, on the coast."] = "東前往棘齒城，在海岸邊。",
	["East to the Mor'shan Rampart; Wenikee stands at the camp just south of it."] = "東前往莫爾杉農場；維妮·布特巴克位於營地就在它南面。",
	["East to the Sludge Fen. Wizzlecrank's Shredder stands inside the Venture Co. camp; Supervisor Lugwizzle carries the key."] = "東前往淤泥沼澤。維茲克蘭克的伐木機位於內部風險投資公司營地；魯格維茲主管攜帶鑰匙。",
	["Eastern Plaguelands lie east of Western Plaguelands, across the Thondroril River. Light's Hope Chapel in the east has flight masters for both factions."] = "東瘟疫之地位於西瘟疫之地以東，穿過索多里爾河。聖光之願禮拜堂在東面有雙方陣營的飛行管理員。",
	["Ebenezer Rustlocke's Corpse"] = "伊本瑟的屍體",
	["Echeyakee's lair lies south of the Sludge Fen, north-east of the Crossroads. Use the horn Sergra gave you there to call the white lion out. Then hearth to Ratchet."] = "埃其亞基的巢穴位於南的淤泥沼澤，東北的十字路口。使用角瑟格拉·黑棘給的你那裡前往召喚白色獅子出。然後爐石返回前往棘齒城。",
	["Echeyakee, a white lion, prowls the plains north of the Razormane camp."] = "埃其亞基，一個白色獅子，潛行遊蕩平原北的刺鬃營地。",
	["Egan stands by Augustus' hut in Terrordale."] = "埃根站在旁邊：被感動的奧古斯圖斯的小屋在恐懼谷。",
	["Egan the ghost stands by a hut in Terrordale, in the north-west corner."] = "埃根幽靈站在旁邊：一個小屋在恐懼谷，在西北面角落。",
	["Einar Stonegrip"] = "埃納爾·石鉗",
	["Einar Stonegrip camps by the road; Rethiel the Greenwarden stands farther east, by the river."] = "埃納爾·石鉗紮營在路邊；綠色守衛者雷希耶爾位於更遠處東，在旁河流。",
	["Elaadrin Evengale"] = "艾拉德琳·暮風",
	["Elaadrin Evengale: Denaaris Stargale waits by the Skyborne portal"] = "艾拉德琳·暮風：德納里斯·星風等候於天裔傳送門",
	["Elaine Carevin, at the south end of town"] = "艾萊尼·卡爾文，在南盡頭的城鎮",
	["Elatrell Featherlight"] = "艾拉特蕾爾·輕羽",
	["Elder Crag Boar"] = "老峭壁野豬",
	["Elder Shadowhorn Stag (53%) in Ashenvale, or wherever the arrow points"] = "老黑角鹿（53%）在灰谷，或跟隨箭頭指示位置",
	["Elder Stranglethorn Tiger"] = "老年荊棘谷猛虎",
	["Elder Torntusk, at the top of Jintha'Alor"] = "斷齒長者，在辛薩羅的頂部",
	["Eleanor camps just south-west of town."] = "埃莉諾·沙克爾頓紮營就在城鎮西南面。",
	["Elegael Thornpaw"] = "艾蕾蓋爾·棘爪",
	["Elixir of Agony needs a Strong Troll's Blood Potion, an Alchemy item: buy one at the auction house here if you can (or ask an alchemist). No potion: skip the Elixir steps in Hillsbrad."] = "苦楚藥劑需要一個強力巨魔之血藥水，一個煉金術物品：購買1在拍賣房屋此處如果你可以（或要求一個煉金師）。無藥水：跳過藥劑台階在希爾斯布萊德。",
	["Elling Trias, the cheese shop in the Trade District"] = "埃林·提亞斯，奶酪商店在貿易區",
	["Elu"] = "艾魯",
	["Elu, by the wind rider master"] = "艾魯，在旁雙足飛龍管理員",
	["Elven Gem"] = "精靈寶石",
	["Elwynn Forest is north of Westfall and Duskwood. Goldshire, Northshire Valley and Stormwind's gates are Alliance ground with guards."] = "艾爾文森林是在西部荒野以北與暮色森林。閃金鎮，北郡山谷與暴風城的大門是聯盟領地與衛兵。",
	["Emissary Jacques"] = "特使雅克",
	["Empty Firewater Flask, a rare drop"] = "空的火酒瓶，稀有掉落",
	["Empty Firewater Flask, a rare drop from the Winterfall furbolgs"] = "空的火酒瓶，由寒冬熊怪稀有掉落",
	["Empty Powder Keg"] = "空火藥桶",
	["Enchanting runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 5g 94s in all."] = "附魔可隨升級同步練習升級。永恆服傳承系統獎勵製作專業在技能等級150，225與300（中級，高級與大師級上限），因此以上每個階段節點均計入進度。1-75階段所需材料總計約需花費5金94銀。",
	["Enchanting: disenchant uncommon (green) gear (or the Auction House)"] = "附魔：分解優秀（綠色）裝備（或從拍賣行購買）",
	["Encrusted Silithid Object"] = "異種蠍粘液包裹的物體",
	["Encrypted Twilight Texts repeats: Bor Wildmane takes more texts again and again. The cultist camps are the place to farm them."] = "加密的暮光文本可重復：鮑爾·蠻鬃接收更多文本再次與再次。邪教徒紮營是放置前往農場它們。",
	["Endaria Mistgaze"] = "恩達莉亞·霧凝",
	["Ends in the Barrens: keep it"] = "終結於貧瘠之地：請保留該任務/物品",
	["Ends with Donova Snowden in Winterspring: keep it"] = "終結於多諾瓦·雪山在冬泉谷：請保留該任務/物品",
	["Ends with Felnok Steelspring in Everlook, Winterspring: keep it"] = "終結於菲諾克在永望鎮，冬泉谷：請保留該任務/物品",
	["Engineering runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 62s in all."] = "工程學可隨升級同步練習升級。永恆服傳承系統獎勵製作專業在技能等級150，225與300（中級，高級與大師級上限），因此以上每個階段節點均計入進度。1-75階段所需材料總計約需花費62銀。",
	["Entropic Beast"] = "熱能野獸",
	["Entropic Horror"] = "熱能恐獸",
	["Ephram Barbaro"] = "伊弗拉姆·巴巴羅",
	["Era let only Dwarves and Gnomes ride mechanostriders; the Forever client allows every Alliance race."] = "舊世允許僅矮人與侏儒騎行機械陸行鳥；永恆服客戶端允許每個聯盟種族。",
	["Erelas Ambersky"] = "艾瑞拉斯·琥珀",
	["Erelas Ambersky: keep it, the feathers come at the end of the Burning Steppes guide"] = "艾瑞拉斯·琥珀：請保留該任務/物品，羽毛來到在盡頭的燃燒平原指南",
	["Eric Brighthammer"] = "埃里克·明錘",
	["Eridan Bluewind"] = "艾瑞丹·藍風",
	["Eridan's Silver Heart needs an Irontree Heart from northern Felwood and a ride back here. Skip it."] = "艾瑞丹·藍風的銀爪鐵心需要一個鐵樹之心來自北部費伍德森林與一個騎行返回此處。跳過即可。",
	["Ertog Ragetusk"] = "埃爾托格·怒齒",
	["Escort Bareth out of the outpost"] = "護送巴雷斯·晨石離開前哨站",
	["Escort Kerlonian to Maestra's Post in Ashenvale."] = "護送克羅尼亞·恆影前往邁斯特拉崗哨在灰谷。",
	["Escort OOX-09/HL"] = "護送 OOX-09/HL型定位器",
	["Escort OOX-17/TN"] = "護送 OOX-17/TN型定位器",
	["Escort OOX-22/FE"] = "護送自動導航機器人OOX-22/FE",
	["Escort Sentinel Lynessa Duskblossom out of the barrow; Sentinel Kyra Starsong in Dolanaar takes the report."] = "護送哨兵莉妮莎·暮花離開獸穴；哨兵凱拉·星歌在多蘭納爾接收報告。",
	["Escort her out of the glaive; Therysil takes the turn-in in Ashenvale"] = "護送她的離開之劍；瑟瑞希爾負責交接該任務在灰谷",
	["Escort the professor down to the shore. Two Daggerspine naga ambush him on the way: stay close."] = "護送教授下前往岸邊。2匕首沼納迦伏擊他在途中：留在靠近。",
	["Escort the professor to the beach north of the cove and guard him while he works; naga attack in waves."] = "護送教授前往海灘在小灣與守衛他當他有效以北；納迦攻擊在波次。",
	["Everlook is the goblin town on the east side of the valley."] = "永望鎮是地精城鎮在山谷的東側。",
	["Every Bloodsail drops Snuff and one of them carries Dizzy's eye; the Swashbucklers walk the shore just north of town. The charts and orders lie in the pirate camp on the Wild Shore, south of Booty Bay."] = "每個血帆掉落鼻煙與1的它們攜帶獨眼迪茲的眼睛；南海流氓步行岸邊就在城鎮北面。海圖與命令位於海盜營地在狂野海岸，在藏寶海灣以南。",
	["Every Bloodsail pirate on the southern Stranglethorn coast can drop it, but only about once in 2,500-5,000 kills in our data. Expect a very long grind. The waypoint is the Bloodsail camp north of Booty Bay, among the Swashbucklers and Raiders."] = "每個血帆海盜在南部荊棘谷海岸可以掉落它，但僅約一次在2,500-5,000擊殺在我們的數據。預計一個非常長刷怪。路徑點是血帆營地在藏寶海灣以北，在其中：南海流氓與狼騎兵波爾克。",
	["Every Wrathtail naga along the strand north of the outpost drops heads."] = "每個怒尾海巫納迦沿著海灘在前哨站掉落頭顱以北。",
	["Every Zanzil follower can drop the mixture; Chucky \"Ten Thumbs\" walks the south of the camp."] = "每個贊吉爾追隨者可以掉落混合物；“笨手”查基步行在營地以南。",
	["Every ghoul of the Raven Hill Cemetery's northern half can drop a rib: Flesh Eaters, Bone Chewers, Plague Spreaders and Brain Eaters."] = "每個食屍鬼的烏鴉嶺墓地的北部一半可以掉落一個肋骨：食腐者，噬骨者，瘟疫傳播者與食腦者。",
	["Exalted with The Defilers earns a Legacy Point."] = "崇拜與污染者獲得一個傳承點數。",
	["Exalted with each battleground faction is worth a point (4 in all; this page shows three, see the note). Follow the Polestar Reputation guides Warsong Gulch Reputation, Arathi Basin Reputation and Alterac Valley Reputation. The Diplomat Legacy perk increases reputation gains."] = "崇拜與每個戰場陣營是價值一個點（4在全部；此書頁顯示3，查看說明）。沿著 Polestar 聲望指南戰歌峽谷聲望，阿拉希盆地聲望與奧特蘭克山谷聲望。外交家傳承特權提高聲望提升。",
	["Exalted with the Frostwolf Clan earns a Legacy Point."] = "崇拜與霜狼氏族獲得一個傳承點數。",
	["Exalted with the League of Arathor earns a Legacy Point."] = "崇拜與阿拉索聯軍獲得一個傳承點數。",
	["Exalted with the Silverwing Sentinels earns a Legacy Point."] = "崇拜與銀翼哨兵獲得一個傳承點數。",
	["Exalted with the Stormpike Guard earns a Legacy Point."] = "崇拜與雷矛衛隊獲得一個傳承點數。",
	["Exalted with the Warsong Outriders earns a Legacy Point."] = "崇拜與戰歌氏族獲得一個傳承點數。",
	["Executor Arren"] = "執行官阿倫",
	["Executor Arren, in the church"] = "執行官阿倫，在教堂內",
	["Executor Zygand"] = "執行官塞加德",
	["Expert Cooking raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20: it is a book, Expert Cookbook; the arrow picks its nearest seller for your faction. Buy it and read it."] = "高級烹飪將技能上限提升至225；它需要技能等級125與角色等級20：它是一個書，高級烹飪教材；箭頭指向它的最近的商人給你的陣營。購買它與閱讀它。",
	["Expert First Aid raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20: it is a book, Expert First Aid - Under Wraps; the arrow picks its nearest seller for your faction. Buy it and read it. The same vendor sells the Heavy Silk and Mageweave Bandage manuals: buy both now, you read them at 180 and 210."] = "高級急救將技能上限提升至225；它需要技能等級125與角色等級20：它是一個書，高級急救教材 - 繃帶縛體；箭頭指向它的最近的商人給你的陣營。購買它與閱讀它。相同商人出售重型作戰傀儡絲綢與魔紋繃帶手冊：購買兩個現在，你閱讀它們在180與210。",
	["Expert Fishing (cap 225) is a book, not a trainer rank: Old Man Heming sells Expert Fishing - The Bass and You in Booty Bay, at the south tip of Stranglethorn Vale, to both factions. Buy it and read it; it needs skill 125 and level 20."] = "高級釣魚（上限225）是一個書，不一個訓練師等級：老人海明威出售高級釣魚教材 - 鱸魚與你在藏寶海灣，在最南端的荊棘谷，前往兩個陣營。購買它與閱讀它；它需要技能等級125與20級。",
	["Expert Herbalism raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20. The arrow picks the nearest Herbalism trainer of your faction."] = "高級草藥學將技能上限提升至225；它需要技能等級125與角色等級20。箭頭會自動指向最近的一位草藥學訓練師的你的陣營。",
	["Expert Mining raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20. The arrow picks the nearest Mining trainer of your faction."] = "高級採礦將技能上限提升至225；它需要技能等級125與角色等級20。箭頭會自動指向最近的一位採礦訓練師的你的陣營。",
	["Expert Skinning raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20. The arrow picks the nearest Skinning trainer of your faction."] = "高級剝皮將技能上限提升至225；它需要技能等級125與角色等級20。箭頭會自動指向最近的一位剝皮訓練師的你的陣營。",
	["Expert needs character level 20 and Alchemy 125; it raises the cap to 225. Materials for 150-225 are worth about 4g 19s in all."] = "高級需要角色等級20與煉金術125；它將技能上限提升至225。150-225階段所需材料總計約需花費4金19銀。",
	["Expert needs character level 20 and Blacksmithing 125; it raises the cap to 225. Materials for 150-225 are worth about 31g in all."] = "高級需要角色等級20與鍛造125；它將技能上限提升至225。150-225階段所需材料總計約需花費31金。",
	["Expert needs character level 20 and Enchanting 125; it raises the cap to 225. Materials for 150-225 are worth about 51g in all."] = "高級需要角色等級20與附魔125；它將技能上限提升至225。150-225階段所需材料總計約需花費51金。",
	["Expert needs character level 20 and Engineering 125; it raises the cap to 225. Materials for 150-225 are worth about 15g in all."] = "高級需要角色等級20與工程學125；它將技能上限提升至225。150-225階段所需材料總計約需花費15金。",
	["Expert needs character level 20 and Leatherworking 125; it raises the cap to 225. Materials for 150-225 are worth about 40g in all."] = "高級需要角色等級20與制皮125；它將技能上限提升至225。150-225階段所需材料總計約需花費40金。",
	["Expert needs character level 20 and Tailoring 125; it raises the cap to 225. Materials for 150-225 are worth about 65g in all."] = "高級需要角色等級20與裁縫125；它將技能上限提升至225。150-225階段所需材料總計約需花費65金。",
	["Exploring the entire world map on one character is a Forever Legacy Challenge (1 account-wide Legacy Point)."] = "探索整個世界地圖在1角色是一個永恆服傳承挑戰（1賬號通用傳承點數）。",
	["Exploring the entire world map on one character is a point, and it can also unlock the Legacy System. It must all be on the same character."] = "探索整個世界地圖在1角色是一個點，與它可以也解鎖傳承系統。它必須全部為在相同角色。",
	["Falaath Village lies south of Shen'dar. Missionary Jasaan meets you at its edge; search the wardrobe in the house behind him."] = "法拉斯村位於辛達爾以南。傳教士賈薩恩交匯你在它的邊緣；搜尋衣櫃在房屋後面他。",
	["Faladiel stands on the hill west of the falls, north of Valanaar."] = "法拉迪爾位於山丘在墜落以西，在瓦拉納爾以北。",
	["Falfindel Waywarder"] = "法芬德爾",
	["Falkhaan Isenstrider, by the stables south of the Abbey"] = "法爾坎·伊森斯泰德，在旁獸欄在修道院以南",
	["Fallen Moonstone"] = "隕落的月亮石",
	["Falling to Corruption is turned in at the Deadwood Cauldron in Felwood, on a later trip."] = "墮落熊怪是交還在死木大鍋在費伍德森林，在後續行程中。",
	["Falorne Fallwind"] = "法洛恩·落風",
	["Falstad Wildhammer"] = "弗斯塔德·蠻錘",
	["Fang of Githyiss"] = "吉絲伊斯之牙",
	["Far Seer Mok'thardin"] = "先知摩克薩爾丁",
	["Farmer Dalson"] = "農夫達爾松",
	["Farmer Furlbrow"] = "農夫法布隆",
	["Farmer Saldean"] = "農夫薩丁",
	["Farsen camps on the ridge overlooking the Gol'Bolar Quarry from the west. Talk to him for his farsight."] = "大地先知法森紮營在山脊俯瞰古博拉採掘場來自西。與…交談他給他的遠視。",
	["Faster: fly to Thelsamar in Loch Modan."] = "更快：飛往前往塞爾薩瑪在洛克莫丹。",
	["Father Gavin"] = "伽文神父",
	["Feather Charms, from the Frostmane Novices"] = "羽毛咒符，來自霜鬃巨魔新兵",
	["Feather of Jai'vhanel"] = "賈瓦內爾之羽",
	["Feathermoon Stronghold on Sardor Isle is the Alliance town (boat from the Forgotten Coast)."] = "羽月要塞在薩多爾島是聯盟城鎮（船來自被遺忘的海岸）。",
	["Feathers for Grazle and Feathers for Nafien (Deadwood Headdress Feathers) and Beads for Salfa (Winterfall Spirit Beads) repeat as often as you like; every Deadwood or Winterfall kill counts as well. Winterfall Village is the densest bead spot."] = "給格拉茲的羽毛與給納菲恩的羽毛（死木頭飾羽毛）與給薩爾法的珠串（冬泉靈魂珠串）重復可無限次重復；每個死木或寒冬擊殺計入作為水井。寒水村是最密集的串珠地點。",
	["Feegly the Exiled"] = "被流放的費格雷",
	["Fel Cones lie under the trees all around Dolanaar and Zenn. Nightsabers and Webwood Lurkers keep roaming the road east. Tallonkai's Dresser is in the house on the hill at the east end of the village."] = "魔錐果位於下方樹木全部在多蘭納爾周圍與賽恩·腐蹄。夜刃豹與樹林潛伏者保留遊蕩的道路東。塔隆凱的衣櫃是在房屋在山丘在村莊的東端。",
	["Fel'zerul"] = "費澤魯爾",
	["Felgur Twocuts"] = "費古爾·雙刃",
	["Felgur stands in the post; Takata Steelblade and Maurin Bonesplitter wait on the rise west of it, above the Kodo Graveyard."] = "費古爾·雙刃位於崗哨；塔卡塔·鋼刃與瑪烏林·碎骨等待在高地在它西面，上方科多獸墳場。",
	["Felhound Brain"] = "地獄犬的腦子",
	["Felicia Maline"] = "菲利希亞·瑪林",
	["Felicia Maline, Darkshire"] = "菲利希亞·瑪林，夜色鎮",
	["Felicia Maline, at the north end of town"] = "菲利希亞·瑪林，在北盡頭的城鎮",
	["Felix Whindlebolt"] = "菲利克斯",
	["Felix Whindlebolt, by the door of Anvilmar"] = "菲利克斯，在旁門的安威瑪爾",
	["Felix's Box"] = "菲利克斯的盒子",
	["Felix's Bucket of Bolts"] = "菲利克斯的螺釘桶",
	["Felix's Chest"] = "菲利克斯的箱子",
	["Felnok Steelspring"] = "菲諾克",
	["Felstalkers roam the slope below the cave, on the valley's north side."] = "地獄捕獵者遊蕩於山坡在洞穴下方，在山谷的北一側。",
	["Felstone Field Cauldron Key"] = "費爾斯通農場的瘟疫之鍋鑰匙",
	["Felwood is north of Ashenvale."] = "費伍德森林是在灰谷以北。",
	["Fen Creepers hide in the marsh pools north-west of the Green Belt."] = "沼澤爬行者獸皮在沼澤水池西北的綠帶草地。",
	["Fendaal Windstone"] = "芬達爾·風石",
	["Feral Mountain Lion (56%) in Hillsbrad Foothills, or wherever the arrow points"] = "野生山地獅（56%）在希爾斯布萊德丘陵，或跟隨箭頭指示位置",
	["Field Marshal Oslight's The Battle for Arathi Basin! (assault every base) and Control Four Bases / Control Five Bases are one-time quests; Sergeant Maclear beside him takes Arathi Resource Crates."] = "奧斯萊特元帥的阿拉希盆地之戰！（突襲每個基地）與控制四個基地 / 控制五個基地是一次性任務；瑪克里爾中士旁邊他接收阿拉希資源箱。",
	["Field Marshal Oslight, Refuge Pointe"] = "奧斯萊特元帥，避難谷地",
	["Fight north to the Shrine of Akir. Guardians, Spiritcallers and Blademasters hold the approach; Hyusaa Quickbreeze waits at the shrine's door, Valennia inside the inner sanctum."] = "迎戰北前往阿基爾神龕。鴉爪守護者，喚靈師與劍聖仁要塞靠近；休薩·疾風等候於神龕的門，瓦倫妮婭·風暴之拳在內側聖殿內。",
	["Fill the Empty Brown Waterskin at the quilboar watering hole"] = "裝滿空的棕色水囊在野豬人水洞",
	["Fill the Empty Red Waterskin at the Spring Well beside the inn"] = "裝滿空的紅色水囊在靈魂之井在旅店旁邊",
	["Fill the tube at the moonwell in the village"] = "裝滿管子在月亮井處在村子里",
	["Fill the vial at the farm's well"] = "裝滿小瓶在農場水井處",
	["Fill the vial at the well"] = "裝滿小瓶在水井處",
	["Filled Cursed Ooze Jar"] = "被詛咒的軟泥怪樣本",
	["Filled Tainted Ooze Jar"] = "被污染的軟泥怪樣本",
	["Fillion Flamebreeze"] = "菲利奧·焰風",
	["Fin Fizracket"] = "芬·菲茲拉克",
	["Find Fillion and his bedroll"] = "尋找菲利奧·焰風與他的鋪蓋卷",
	["Find a chicken at Farmer Saldean's farm and type /chicken at it until it offers CLUCK!. Buy Special Chicken Feed from Farmer Saldean, go back, /cheer at the same chicken, then hand in the feed. The chicken lays an egg: loot it for your Chicken Egg pet."] = "尋找一個小雞在農夫薩丁的農場與類型 /小雞在它直到它提供咕咕嘎！。購買特殊的雞飼料來自農夫薩丁，前往返回，/歡呼在相同小雞，然後上交餵食。小雞位於一個蛋：拾取它給你的雞蛋寵物。",
	["Find the Excitable Slime, a critter in the Undercity canals, and /dance with it until it offers WRIGGLE. Buy Nutritious Slime Sludge from a vendor in the canals and bring it back; if the slime seems tired, dance with it again."] = "尋找躁動軟泥怪，一個小動物在幽暗城運河，與 /跳舞與它直到它提供蠕動。購買營養豐富的軟泥怪淤泥來自一個商人在運河與攜帶它返回；如果軟泥怪看似疲憊的，跳舞與它再次。",
	["Fine Crab Chunks"] = "優質蟹肉",
	["Fine Moonstalker Pelts"] = "優質月夜猛虎毛皮",
	["Finish the wolf heart, cougar femur, plainstrider scale and swoop gizzard on the plains around the village."] = "完成狼心臟，美洲獅股骨，平原陸行鳥鱗片與猛禽砂囊在平原在村莊周圍。",
	["Fire Sapta, beside the Spirit Stone"] = "火焰薩普塔，旁邊靈魂石",
	["Fire Tar: Tunnel Rat Geomancers"] = "火焰焦油：坑道鼠地卜師",
	["Firebeard's Head"] = "費爾比德的頭顱",
	["Firegut Brute"] = "火腹蠻兵",
	["Firegut Ogre"] = "火腹食人魔",
	["Firegut Ogre Mage"] = "火腹食人魔法師",
	["First Mate Crazz"] = "大副克拉茲",
	["First Mate Fitzsimmons"] = "大副菲茲莫斯",
	["First Mate Fitzsimmons, in the inn"] = "大副菲茲莫斯，在旅店內",
	["First Mate Nilzlix"] = "大副尼茲利克斯",
	["First Relic Fragment"] = "第一塊遺物碎片",
	["First Witherbark Cage"] = "第一個枯木牢籠",
	["Fish Firefin Snapper School; this is where the data has most of them. The Auction House works too."] = "釣魚火鱗鱔魚群；此是在數據有大多數的它們。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Fish Stonescale Eel Swarm; this is where the data has most of them. The Auction House works too."] = "釣魚石鱗鰻群；此是在數據有大多數的它們。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Fish here until skill 50. Click the bobber when it splashes; every catch can raise the skill."] = "釣魚此處直到技能等級50。點擊魚漂當它濺起水花；每個捕獲可以提升技能。",
	["Fish in Sar'theris Strand, the north-west coast of Desolace (Slitherblade naga shore) until you catch a Sar'theris Striker; it only bites there."] = "釣魚在薩瑟里斯海岸，西北海岸的淒涼之地（滑刃納迦岸邊）直到你捕獲一個薩瑟里斯虎魚；它僅咬那裡。",
	["Fish in the Misty Reed Strand, the south-east shore of Swamp of Sorrows until you catch a Misty Reed Mahi Mahi; it only bites there."] = "釣魚在蘆葦海灘，東南岸邊的悲傷沼澤直到你捕獲一個蘆葦海岸大馬哈魚；它僅咬那裡。",
	["Fish in the Savage Coast, the north-west shore of Stranglethorn Vale until you catch a Savage Coast Blue Sailfin; it only bites there."] = "釣魚在野蠻海岸，西北岸邊的荊棘谷直到你捕獲一個野人海岸藍色叉牙魚；它僅咬那裡。",
	["Fish in the Verdantis River in Feralas until you catch a Feralas Ahi; it only bites there."] = "釣魚在沃丹提斯河在菲拉斯直到你捕獲一個菲拉斯草魚；它僅咬那裡。",
	["Fish the pools along the coast here (eels, snappers, wreckage) until skill 300. Booty Bay sells bait and Nightcrawlers for a small fishing bonus."] = "釣魚水池沿著海岸此處（鰻魚，咬龜，殘骸）直到技能等級300。藏寶海灣出售魚餌與夜色蟲給一個小型釣魚額外獎勵。",
	["Fish the pools and open water here until skill 125. Pools (floating debris, schools of fish) also drop extra loot."] = "釣魚水池與打開/開啓水此處直到技能等級125。水池（漂浮的殘骸，魚群的釣魚）也掉落額外拾取。",
	["Fish the pools here until skill 225. If fish keep getting away, fish easier water until your skill catches up."] = "釣魚水池此處直到技能等級225。如果釣魚保留獲取離開，釣魚更容易水直到你的技能捕獲上。",
	["Five feathers buy a little Timbermaw reputation"] = "5羽毛購買一個小木喉聲望",
	["Fizzle Brassbolts"] = "菲茲爾·銅栓",
	["Fizzle Brassbolts: for Martek in the Badlands, later"] = "菲茲爾·銅栓：給流放者馬特克在荒蕪之地，稍後",
	["Fizzle Brassbolts: his letter goes to Martek in the Badlands, around level 38"] = "菲茲爾·銅栓：他的信件前往/交給流放者馬特克在荒蕪之地，周圍38級",
	["Fizzle holds the Burning Blade camp on Thunder Ridge, north-west of Razor Hill. Hunters: tame a Dire Mottled Boar with the Taming Rod on the way."] = "菲茲爾·銅栓持有火刃營地在雷霆山，在剃刀嶺以西北。獵人：馴服一個可怕的雜斑野豬與馴獸棒在途中。",
	["Fizzule runs the Venture Co. camp at the east end of the Sludge Fen. He attacks strangers: target him and /salute before he does."] = "工頭費蘇勒通往風險投資公司營地在東盡頭的淤泥沼澤。他攻擊陌生人：目標他與 /敬禮之前他會。",
	["Flagon of Mead, from Innkeeper Helbrek"] = "壺裝矮人蜜酒，來自旅店老闆赫布瑞克",
	["Flatland Prowlers roam the plains around Red Rocks"] = "平原徘徊者遊蕩於平原在紅石周圍",
	["Fleet Master Firallon"] = "艦隊指揮官菲爾拉倫",
	["Fleet Master Seahorn"] = "艦隊指揮官卡拉·海角",
	["Fleet Master Seahorn, top floor"] = "艦隊指揮官卡拉·海角，頂部樓層",
