	["Flight path here: Light's Hope Chapel (Georgia)."] = "此處飛行點：聖光之願禮拜堂（喬吉亞）。",
	["Flight path here: Light's Hope Chapel (Khaelyn Steelwing)."] = "此處飛行點：聖光之願禮拜堂（凱琳·斯蒂文）。",
