	["Flight path here: Southshore (Darla Harris)."] = "此處飛行點：南海鎮（達爾拉·哈瑞斯）。",
	["Flight path here: Stonard (Breyk)."] = "此處飛行點：斯通納德（佈雷依克）。",
	["Flight path here: Stonetalon Peak (Teloren)."] = "此處飛行點：石爪峰（泰羅倫）。",
	["Flight path here: Sun Rock Retreat (Tharm)."] = "此處飛行點：烈日石居（薩爾姆）。",
	["Flight path here: Talonbranch Glade (Mishellena)."] = "此處飛行點：刺枝林地（米薩琳娜）。",
	["Flight path here: Talrendis Point (Jarrodenus)."] = "此處飛行點：塔倫迪斯營地（加羅迪努斯）。",
	["Flight path here: Tarren Mill (Zarise)."] = "此處飛行點：塔倫米爾（扎瑞斯）。",
	["Flight path here: The Sepulcher (Karos Razok)."] = "此處飛行點：瑟伯切爾（卡洛斯·拉佐克）。",
	["Flight path here: Thelsamar (Thorgrum Borrelson)."] = "此處飛行點：塞爾薩瑪（索格拉姆·伯雷森）。",
	["Flight path here: Theramore (Baldruc)."] = "此處飛行點：塞拉摩（巴德拉克）。",
	["Flight path here: Thorium Point (Grisha)."] = "此處飛行點：瑟銀哨塔（格瑞沙）。",
	["Flight path here: Thorium Point (Lanie Reed)."] = "此處飛行點：瑟銀哨塔（蘭尼·瑞德）。",
	["Flight path here: Thunder Bluff (Tal)."] = "此處飛行點：雷霆崖（塔爾）。",
	["Flight path here: Valormok (Kroum)."] = "此處飛行點：瓦羅莫克（克隆姆）。",
	["Flight paths here: Booty Bay (Gringer), Grom'gol (Thysta)."] = "此處飛行點：藏寶海灣（格林戈），格羅姆高（塞斯塔）。",
	["Flight paths here: Ratchet (Bragok), Crossroads (Devrak), Camp Taurajo (Omusa Thunderhorn)."] = "此處飛行點：棘齒城（布拉高克），十字路口（迪弗拉克），陶拉祖營地（歐姆薩·雷角）。",
	["Flight paths here: Thalanaar (Thyssiana), Feathermoon (Fyldren Moonfeather)."] = "此處飛行點：薩蘭納爾（賽希亞娜），羽月要塞（菲爾迪恩·月羽）。",
	["Flight paths here: Zoram'gar Outpost (Andruk), Splintertree Post (Vhulgra)."] = "此處飛行點：佐拉姆加前哨站（安德魯克），碎木崗哨（烏爾格拉）。",
	["Flik"] = "弗里克",
	["Flik sells two frogs (1g each) while the Darkmoon Faire is in town. In Era the Faire sets up south of Goldshire in Elwynn Forest one month and near Thunder Bluff in Mulgore the next; go to whichever is up. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "弗里克出售2青蛙（1金每個）當暗月馬戲團是在城鎮。在舊世馬戲團設置上在閃金鎮以南在艾爾文森林1月與在雷霆崖附近在莫高雷下一個；前往任選其一：是上。每個寵物物品傳授它的夥伴當你使用它；目標留在勾選隨後。",
	["Flint Shadowmore"] = "弗林特·沙多摩爾",
	["Flint Shadowmore at Chillwind Camp: keep it"] = "弗林特·沙多摩爾在冰風崗：請保留該任務/物品",
	["Flute of Xavaric"] = "薩瓦里克長笛",
	["Fly back to the Crossroads. The next guide starts here and takes the road north to the Mor'shan Rampart and Ashenvale."] = "飛往返回前往十字路口。下一個指南始於此處與接收道路北前往莫爾杉農場與灰谷。",
	["Fly from Aerie Peak to Darkshire."] = "飛往來自鷹巢山前往夜色鎮。",
	["Fly from Auberdine to Rut'theran Village and take the portal up to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave."] = "飛往來自奧伯丁前往魯瑟蘭村與接取傳送門上前往瑪斯雷·馭熊者在塞納里奧區。",
	["Fly from Gadgetzan to Marshal's Refuge. Linken's hut stands at the Lakkari Tar Pits, west of the refuge; J.D. Collie is up the hill behind it."] = "飛往來自加基森前往馬紹爾營地。林克的小屋位於拉卡利油沼，在營地以西；科琳是上山丘後面它。",
	["Fly from Gadgetzan to Theramore, take the boat to Menethil Harbor and fly to Ironforge. Train."] = "飛往來自加基森前往塞拉摩，乘船前往米奈希爾港與飛往前往鐵爐堡。訓練。",
	["Fly from Ironforge to Lakeshire."] = "飛往來自鐵爐堡前往湖畔鎮。",
	["Fly from Ironforge to Menethil Harbor and take the boat to Auberdine."] = "飛往來自鐵爐堡前往米奈希爾港與乘船前往奧伯丁。",
	["Fly from Menethil Harbor to Ironforge and train."] = "飛往來自米奈希爾港前往鐵爐堡與訓練。",
	["Fly from Nethergarde Keep to Thelsamar."] = "飛往來自守望堡前往塞爾薩瑪。",
	["Fly from Ratchet to Zoram'gar Outpost on the Ashenvale coast."] = "飛往來自棘齒城前往佐拉姆加前哨站在灰谷海岸。",
	["Fly from Talonbranch Glade to the Sanctuary's end of the road, or ride south along it."] = "飛往來自刺枝林地前往聖地的盡頭的道路，或騎行南沿著它。",
	["Fly from Thelsamar to Ironforge."] = "飛往來自塞爾薩瑪前往鐵爐堡。",
	["Fly from Thelsamar to Menethil Harbor, take the boat to Auberdine and fly to Rut'theran Village."] = "飛往來自塞爾薩瑪前往米奈希爾港，乘船前往奧伯丁與飛往前往魯瑟蘭村。",
	["Fly from Valormok to Orgrimmar, walk out of the main gate to the zeppelin towers and take the zeppelin to Grom'gol."] = "飛往來自瓦羅莫克前往奧格瑞瑪，步行離開主大門前往飛艇哨塔與搭乘飛艇前往格羅姆高。",
	["Fly or ride to Stormwind. High Priestess Laurena is in the Cathedral of Light."] = "飛往或騎行前往暴風城。高階牧師勞瑞娜是在聖光大教堂。",
	["Fly or ride to Stormwind. Ilsa Corbin trains warriors in Old Town; Harry Burlguard and Bartleby stand together by the Pig and Whistle Tavern there. Bartleby fights you for his mug."] = "飛往或騎行前往暴風城。伊爾薩·考賓訓練戰士在舊城區；哈里·伯加德與巴特萊比位於一起在旁豬和哨聲旅店那裡。巴特萊比戰鬥你給他的酒杯。",
	["Fly or ride to Stormwind. Trainers: Old Town (Warriors, Rogues), the Cathedral (Paladins, Priests), the Mage Quarter (Mages, Warlocks), the Park (Druids). Sprite Jumpsprocket works in the Dwarven District."] = "飛往或騎行前往暴風城。訓練師：舊城區（戰士，潛行者），大教堂（聖騎士，牧師），法師區（法師，術士），公園（德魯伊）。斯普萊特有效在矮人區。",
	["Fly to Aerie Peak if you have it; otherwise fly to Southshore and walk north-east from Hillsbrad Foothills into the Hinterlands."] = "飛往鷹巢山如果你已解鎖/擁有它；否則飛往前往南海鎮與步行東北來自希爾斯布萊德丘陵進入辛特蘭。",
	["Fly to Aerie Peak. The Hinterlands guide starts here."] = "飛往鷹巢山。辛特蘭指南始於此處。",
	["Fly to Camp Mojache. The hippogryph nests are in the south of Feralas; each holds an egg for the Egg-O-Matic."] = "飛往莫沙徹營地。角鷹獸巢是在菲拉斯以南；每個持有一個蛋給自動驗蛋器。",
	["Fly to Camp Taurajo and take the road south to the Great Lift at the bottom of the Barrens."] = "飛往陶拉祖營地與沿著道路走南前往升降梯在底部的貧瘠之地。",
	["Fly to Camp Taurajo and walk south through the Barrens to the Great Lift down into Thousand Needles."] = "飛往陶拉祖營地與步行南穿過貧瘠之地前往升降梯下進入千針石林。",
	["Fly to Camp Taurajo. Brine's hut stands on the ridge above the quilboar watering hole south of the camp, on the road to the Great Lift."] = "飛往陶拉祖營地。布瑞恩的小屋位於山脊在野豬人水洞上方在營地以南，在路上前往升降梯。",
	["Fly to Darkshire (or Stormwind) and take the road south out of Duskwood into northern Stranglethorn Vale."] = "飛往夜色鎮（或暴風城）與沿著道路走南離開暮色森林進入北部荊棘谷。",
	["Fly to Darkshire and ride east through Deadwind Pass into the Swamp of Sorrows; Watcher Biggs stands by the road just past the border."] = "飛往夜色鎮與騎行東穿過逆風小徑進入悲傷沼澤；衛兵比格斯位於路邊就在經過邊界。",
	["Fly to Darkshire: Gryth Thurden in Ironforge's Great Forge, or Dungar Longdrink in Stormwind's Trade District."] = "飛往夜色鎮：格萊斯·瑟登在鐵爐堡的大鍛爐，或杜加爾·朗德瑞克在暴風城的貿易區。",
	["Fly to Freewind Post, ride down the lift east of the post and across the salt flats, then south into Tanaris."] = "飛往亂風崗，騎行下升降梯在崗哨與穿過鹽平原以東，然後南進入塔納利斯。",
	["Fly to Freewind Post, then ride west through the canyons past Whitereach Post; the road climbs into the Feralas jungle and on to Camp Mojache."] = "飛往亂風崗，然後騎行西穿過峽谷經過白沙崗哨；道路爬上進入菲拉斯叢林與在前往莫沙徹營地。",
	["Fly to Freewind Post. Prate Cloudseer hides in a small cave in the canyon wall north-east of the post."] = "飛往亂風崗。普拉特·白雲藏身在一個小型洞穴在峽谷城牆在崗哨以東北。",
	["Fly to Gadgetzan."] = "飛往加基森。",
	["Fly to Gadgetzan. The Egg-O-Matic stands in the middle of town."] = "飛往加基森。自動驗蛋器位於中間的城鎮。",
	["Fly to Marshal's Refuge, then ride south-west through Un'Goro to the pass into Silithus. The next guide opens at Valor's Rest, where the pass comes out."] = "飛往馬紹爾營地，然後騎行西南穿過安戈洛環形山前往穿過進入希利蘇斯。下一個指南開啓在勇氣之眠，在穿過來自出。",
	["Fly to Menethil Harbor and take the boat to Auberdine, then the boat on to Rut'theran Village."] = "飛往米奈希爾港與乘船前往奧伯丁，然後船在前往魯瑟蘭村。",
	["Fly to Nethergarde Keep."] = "飛往守望堡。",
	["Fly to Nijel's Point, ride south through Desolace into Feralas and follow the road to the dock on the Forgotten Coast; the boat crosses to Feathermoon Stronghold, where the next guide starts."] = "飛往尼耶爾前哨站，騎行南穿過淒涼之地進入菲拉斯與沿著道路前往前往碼頭在被遺忘的海岸；船穿過前往羽月要塞，在下一個指南始於。",
	["Fly to Orgrimmar and train before the Grom'gol zeppelin: the Undercity stop later in this guide has no Hunter or Shaman trainer."] = "飛往奧格瑞瑪與訓練之前格羅姆高飛艇：幽暗城停靠在本指南稍後階段有無獵人或薩滿祭司訓練師。",
	["Fly to Orgrimmar and train."] = "飛往奧格瑞瑪與訓練。",
	["Fly to Orgrimmar and train: the next guide's training stop is the Undercity, which has no Hunter or Shaman trainer. Then fly to Ratchet."] = "飛往奧格瑞瑪與訓練：下一個指南的訓練停靠是幽暗城，其中有無獵人或薩滿祭司訓練師。然後飛往前往棘齒城。",
	["Fly to Orgrimmar to train your level 20 ranks. Sorek is in the Valley of Honor, Searn Firewarder in the Valley of Wisdom."] = "飛往奧格瑞瑪前往訓練你的20級軍階。索瑞克是在榮譽谷，希爾恩·火結在智慧谷。",
	["Fly to Orgrimmar to train."] = "飛往奧格瑞瑪前往訓練。",
	["Fly to Orgrimmar, take the zeppelin to Grom'gol and fly from there to Kargath, built into the cliffs on the Badlands' west edge."] = "飛往奧格瑞瑪，搭乘飛艇前往格羅姆高與飛往來自那裡前往卡加斯，建於進入懸崖在荒蕪之地的西邊緣。",
	["Fly to Orgrimmar. The Droffers brothers run their shop in the Drag."] = "飛往奧格瑞瑪。德蘭·杜佛斯兄弟前往它們的商店在暗巷區。",
	["Fly to Orgrimmar; Belgrom is in the Valley of Honor."] = "飛往奧格瑞瑪；貝爾戈洛姆·石槌是在榮譽谷。",
	["Fly to Ratchet."] = "飛往棘齒城。",
	["Fly to Ratchet. Strahad Farsan stands on the hill in town; Islen Waterseer camps on the coast a short ride south of it."] = "飛往棘齒城。斯坦哈德·法爾杉位於山丘在城鎮；水之先知伊斯倫紮營在海岸邊一個不足騎行在它南面。",
	["Fly to Ratchet; Strahad Farsan teaches in the house by the bank. Fly back to Theramore afterwards."] = "飛往棘齒城；斯坦哈德·法爾杉傳授在房屋在銀行旁。飛往返回前往塞拉摩隨後。",
	["Fly to Revantusk Village if you have it; otherwise fly to Tarren Mill and walk east from Hillsbrad Foothills into the Hinterlands."] = "飛往惡齒村如果你已解鎖/擁有它；否則飛往前往塔倫米爾與步行東來自希爾斯布萊德丘陵進入辛特蘭。",
	["Fly to Rut'theran Village once more and take the portal up to Mathrengyl, then fly back to Auberdine for the boat."] = "飛往魯瑟蘭村一次更多與接取傳送門上前往瑪斯雷·馭熊者，然後飛往返回前往奧伯丁給船。",
	["Fly to Sentinel Hill and ride north-west to the coast: the Strange Lockbox lies on the sea floor off the shore. Then ride east along the road through Elwynn to Redridge."] = "飛往哨兵嶺與騎行西北前往海岸：奇怪的保險箱位於大海樓層偏離/關閉岸邊。然後騎行東沿著道路穿過艾爾文森林前往赤脊山。",
	["Fly to Southshore and ride north up the road toward Alterac: Haggerdin camps at Darrow Hill beside it."] = "飛往南海鎮與騎行北順著道路往上朝奧特蘭克方向：哈格丁中尉紮營於達隆山旁邊它。",
	["Fly to Southshore in Hillsbrad Foothills and walk north into the Alterac Mountains."] = "飛往南海鎮在希爾斯布萊德丘陵與步行北進入奧特蘭克山脈。",
	["Fly to Splintertree Post and ride north-west along the road out of Ashenvale into Felwood. The Emerald Sanctuary is the druids' camp just past the border."] = "飛往碎木崗哨與騎行西北沿著道路離開灰谷進入費伍德森林。翡翠聖地是德魯伊的營地就在經過邊界。",
	["Fly to Splintertree Post and ride south down the road to the Mor'shan Rampart."] = "飛往碎木崗哨與騎行南順著道路前往莫爾杉農場。",
	["Fly to Sun Rock Retreat and take the road south-west into Desolace; Shadowprey Village on the west coast is the Horde town."] = "飛往烈日石居與沿著道路走西南進入淒涼之地；葬影村在西海岸是部落城鎮。",
	["Fly to Talrendis Point if you have it, otherwise to Astranaar, and walk east out of Ashenvale into Azshara."] = "飛往塔倫迪斯營地如果你已解鎖/擁有它，否則前往阿斯特蘭納，與步行東離開灰谷進入艾薩拉。",
	["Fly to Talrendis Point in Azshara and ride west along the road to Forest Song, just over the Ashenvale border."] = "飛往塔倫迪斯營地在艾薩拉與騎行西沿著道路前往林歌神殿，就在越過灰谷邊界。",
	["Fly to Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad Foothills and walk north into the Alterac Mountains."] = "飛往塔倫米爾在希爾斯布萊德丘陵與步行北進入奧特蘭克山脈。",
	["Fly to Theramore (or take the boat from Menethil Harbor); Theramore Isle is the Alliance town."] = "飛往塞拉摩（或乘船來自米奈希爾港）；塞拉摩島是聯盟城鎮。",
	["Fly to Thunder Bluff and train with Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise, then fly to Orgrimmar for the Grom'gol zeppelin."] = "飛往雷霆崖與訓練與圖拉克·符文圖騰在長者高地，然後飛往前往奧格瑞瑪給格羅姆高飛艇。",
	["Fly to Thunder Bluff and train with Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise, then fly to Ratchet."] = "飛往雷霆崖與訓練與圖拉克·符文圖騰在長者高地，然後飛往前往棘齒城。",
	["Fly to Thunder Bluff and train your level 20 ranks: Turak Runetotem is on Elder Rise."] = "飛往雷霆崖與訓練你的20級軍階：圖拉克·符文圖騰是在長者高地。",
	["Fly to Thunder Bluff from Shadowprey and train with Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise, then fly on to Orgrimmar."] = "飛往雷霆崖來自葬影村與訓練與圖拉克·符文圖騰在長者高地，然後飛往在前往奧格瑞瑪。",
	["Fly to Thunder Bluff to train: Turak Runetotem is on Elder Rise."] = "飛往雷霆崖前往訓練：圖拉克·符文圖騰是在長者高地。",
	["Fly to Thunder Bluff: Turak Runetotem trains you on Elder Rise. Skyborne: fly back to Orgrimmar for the zeppelin afterwards."] = "飛往雷霆崖：圖拉克·符文圖騰訓練你在長者高地。天裔：飛往返回前往奧格瑞瑪給飛艇隨後。",
	["Fly to Thunder Bluff; it is on the way to Camp Mojache. No flight path there yet? Fly to Camp Taurajo and ride west through Mulgore. Hamuul and Magatha are on the Elder Rise; Druids and Paladins train here (Turak Runetotem, Alodan the Hopeful)."] = "飛往雷霆崖；它是在途中前往莫沙徹營地。無飛行點那裡尚? 飛往陶拉祖營地與騎行西穿過莫高雷。大德魯伊哈繆爾·符文圖騰與瑪加薩·野性圖騰是在長者高地；德魯伊與聖騎士訓練此處（圖拉克·符文圖騰，懷抱希望的阿洛丹）。",
	["Fly to Valormok if you have it, otherwise to Splintertree Post, and walk east out of Ashenvale into Azshara."] = "飛往瓦羅莫克如果你已解鎖/擁有它，否則前往碎木崗哨，與步行東離開灰谷進入艾薩拉。",
	["Fly to the Undercity, take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar and fly on to Thunder Bluff."] = "飛往幽暗城，搭乘飛艇前往奧格瑞瑪與飛往在前往雷霆崖。",
	["Follow Ashenvale's road north-west to the coast and into Darkshore, Alliance country with guards at Auberdine."] = "沿著灰谷的道路西北前往海岸與進入黑海岸，聯盟領地與衛兵在奧伯丁。",
	["Follow Darkshore's coast road south into Ashenvale. Astranaar is the Alliance town."] = "沿著黑海岸的海岸道路南進入灰谷。阿斯特蘭納是聯盟城鎮。",
	["Follow Donova's directions to the mouth of Darkwhisper Gorge, past the Frostmaul giants: pass them one at a time."] = "沿著多諾瓦的方向指引前往入口/河口的暗語峽谷，經過霜槌巨人：穿過它們1在一個時間。",
	["Follow the Gold Road south to Camp Taurajo."] = "沿著金幣道路南前往陶拉祖營地。",
	["Follow the Polestar Exploration guides: Exploration: Eastern Kingdoms 1-30, 30-45 and 45-60, and Exploration: Kalimdor 1-30, 30-45 and 45-60. They track every area as you discover it."] = "沿著 Polestar 地圖探索指南：地圖探索：東部王國1-30，30-45與45-60，與地圖探索：卡利姆多1-30，30-45與45-60。它們追蹤每個區域作為你探索發現它。",
	["Follow the Polestar guide \"Blacksmithing 1-300\" (Professions)."] = "沿著 Polestar 指南 \"鍛造1-300\"（專業技能）。",
	["Follow the Polestar guide \"Enchanting 1-300\" (Professions)."] = "沿著 Polestar 指南 \"附魔1-300\"（專業技能）。",
	["Follow the Polestar guide \"Engineering 1-300\" (Professions)."] = "沿著 Polestar 指南 \"工程學1-300\"（專業技能）。",
	["Follow the Polestar guide \"Leatherworking 1-300\" (Professions)."] = "沿著 Polestar 指南 \"制皮1-300\"（專業技能）。",
	["Follow the Polestar guide \"Tailoring 1-300\" (Professions)."] = "沿著 Polestar 指南 \"裁縫1-300\"（專業技能）。",
	["Follow the canyon east out of the mesas onto the salt flats. The goblins and gnomes of the Mirage Raceway are neutral and give quests to both factions."] = "沿著峽谷東離開台地登上鹽平原。地精與侏儒的沙漠賽道是中立與交給任務前往兩個陣營。",
	["Follow the canyon west to Whitereach Post."] = "沿著峽谷西前往白沙崗哨。",
	["Follow the canyons east to the salt flats. The goblins and gnomes of the Mirage Raceway are neutral and give quests to both factions."] = "沿著峽谷東前往鹽平原。地精與侏儒的沙漠賽道是中立與交給任務前往兩個陣營。",
	["Follow the cliffs south to Dreadmaul Rock, the Firegut ogres' hill. Sha'ni Proudtusk's remains lie at its foot."] = "沿著懸崖南前往巨槌石，火腹食人魔的山丘。沙妮·長齒的遺骸位於它的山腳。",
	["Follow the coast north out of Menethil. Bluegill Murlocs fill the marsh; Gobbler walks with a pack in the middle of it."] = "沿著海岸北離開米奈希爾。藍腮魚人裝滿沼澤；高布勒爾步行與一個包在中間的它。",
	["Follow the coast north to the Zoram Strand. Talen camps on the beach; Wrathtail nagas fill the shore."] = "沿著海岸北前往佐拉姆暗灘喚魔師。塔爾倫紮營在海灘上；怒尾海巫納迦裝滿岸邊。",
	["Follow the coast north to the wrecked ship. Cursed Sailors walk the beach, Cursed Marines the deck; First Mate Snellig stands on the beach by the bow. Giant Wetlands Crocolisks lurk on the coast just north of it."] = "沿著海岸北前往失事的船。被詛咒的水手步行海灘，被詛咒的水兵甲板；大副斯涅利格位於海灘上在旁弓。巨型濕地鰐魚潛伏在海岸邊就在它北面。",
	["Follow the coast north-east past the wreck: the Bluegill Raiders hold the marsh beyond the Giant Crocolisks."] = "沿著海岸東北經過殘骸：藍鰓掠奪者要塞沼澤越過巨型鰐魚。",
	["Follow the coast north-east to the Ruins of Mathystra. Mathystra Relics lie among the ruins; Stormscale Myrmidons, Sorceresses and Warriors hold them."] = "沿著海岸東北前往瑪塞斯特拉廢墟。瑪塞斯特拉遺物位於其中：廢墟；雷鱗侍從，女巫與戰士要塞它們。",
	["Follow the coast south past Ameth'Aran: one Beached Sea Creature lies on the shore west of the Grove, another further south near Remtravel's Excavation."] = "沿著海岸南經過亞米薩蘭：1擱淺的海洋生物位於岸邊在樹林以西，另一個更遠處南在雷姆塔維爾挖掘場附近。",
	["Follow the coast south to the pirate cove. Southsea pirates crowd the beach and the boats: work along the edge and pull one at a time. Andre Firebeard stands on the far side; Stoley's stolen cargo lies in the camp."] = "沿著海岸南前往海盜小灣。南海流氓海盜怪群海灘與船：有效沿著邊緣與拉怪1在一個時間。安德雷·費爾比德位於遠處一側；斯杜雷的被盜的貨物位於營地裡。",
	["Follow the coast south. The naga explorers wade along the shore and carry the reed bundles; the Holy Spring bubbles in the hills just east of them."] = "沿著海岸南。納迦探險家涉水沿著岸邊與攜帶蘆葦捆；神聖泉水冒泡在丘陵就在它們東面。",
	["Follow the hills north to the Cliffspring River and up to the falls. Three more beached remains lie on the north shore: near the Ruins of Mathystra, north of Bashal'Aran and west of Bashal'Aran."] = "沿著丘陵北前往壁泉河與上前往墜落。3更多擱淺的遺骸位於北岸邊：附近瑪塞斯特拉廢墟，在巴莎蘭以北與在巴莎蘭以西。",
	["Follow the hills south to the tower, on the road west."] = "沿著丘陵南前往哨塔，在路上西。",
	["Follow the hills south to the tower."] = "沿著丘陵南前往哨塔。",
	["Follow the lake shore south-east and swim out to Fenris Isle. Rot Hide gnolls cover the island; every type drops ichor. Stay out of Fenris Keep on its north side unless you go for the optional niche: the gnolls there are level 18-22."] = "沿著湖岸邊東南與游泳出前往芬里斯島。腐爛獸皮豺狼人掩護島嶼；每個類型掉落膿液。留在離開芬里斯城堡在它的北一側除非你前往給可選壁龕：豺狼人那裡是18-22級。",
	["Follow the main road east past Astranaar (Alliance: keep to the road). Ursangous, a big grizzly, roams the Ruins of Stardust south of the road, west of Mystral Lake. His paw starts the next hunt quest."] = "沿著主道路東經過阿斯特蘭納（聯盟：保留前往道路）。烏薩苟斯，一個大灰熊，遊蕩於星塵廢墟在道路以南，在密斯特拉湖以西。他的爪始於下一個狩獵任務。",
	["Follow the main road south the length of the jungle, past the Grom'gol turn-off, to Booty Bay on the southern cape."] = "沿著主道路南長度的叢林，經過格羅姆高交還-偏離/關閉，前往藏寶海灣在南部海角。",
	["Follow the path north into Deathknell; Sarvis stands in front of the church."] = "沿路線前進北進入喪鐘鎮；暗影牧師薩維斯位於教堂前面。",
	["Follow the path north to the mine. Kobold Workers swarm outside it; every kobold in the valley can drop the Stolen Books."] = "沿路線前進北前往採礦。狗頭人勞工蟲群外部它；每個狗頭人在山谷可以掉落被盜的書籍。",
	["Follow the path south out of camp to the Seer's tent at the foot of the hills."] = "沿路線前進南出的營地前往先知的帳篷在丘陵的底部。",
	["Follow the river north-west to the Westbrook Garrison, by the road to Westfall. Deputy Rainer stands outside the barracks."] = "沿著河流西北前往西泉要塞，在路邊前往西部荒野。瑞尼爾副隊長位於兵營外。",
	["Follow the road all the way east to the South Gate Outpost at the Loch Modan tunnel."] = "沿著道路前往全部路東前往南門哨崗在洛克莫丹隧道。",
	["Follow the road along the south shore of Lake Everstill to the gryphon master. Deputy Feldon and Guard Howe stand by the road next to her."] = "沿著道路前往沿著南岸邊的止水湖前往獅鷲管理員。菲爾頓副隊長與衛兵豪維位於路邊下一個前往她的。",
	["Follow the road east across the zone to the chapel."] = "沿著道路前往東穿過區域前往禮拜堂。",
	["Follow the road east along the river, then north-east up into the hills to Tarren Mill."] = "沿著道路前往東沿著河流，然後東北上進入丘陵前往塔倫米爾。",
	["Follow the road east back to Theramore. Tervosh, Lady Jaina and the officers are in the tower and Foothold Citadel."] = "沿著道路前往東返回前往塞拉摩。大法師特沃什，雷蒂吉安娜·普羅德摩爾與軍官是在哨塔內與塞拉摩堡壘。",
	["Follow the road east out of Hillsbrad over Thoradin's Wall to Refuge Pointe."] = "沿著道路前往東離開希爾斯布萊德越過索拉丁之牆前往避難谷地。",
	["Follow the road east out of the valley to Sen'jin Village on the coast."] = "沿著道路前往東離開山谷前往森金村在海岸邊。",
	["Follow the road east past the Tower of Azora to the bridge."] = "沿著道路前往東經過阿祖拉之塔前往橋。",
	["Follow the road east past the depot to Misty Pine Refuge."] = "沿著道路前往東經過補給站前往霧松避難所。",
	["Follow the road east through the Western Plaguelands and across the river into the Eastern Plaguelands; leave it north for Terrordale, the ruined town in the north-west. Augustus sits in a hut at its edge."] = "沿著道路前往東穿過西瘟疫之地與穿過河流進入東瘟疫之地；可先放著不做北給恐懼谷，毀壞的城鎮在西北面。被感動的奧古斯圖斯位於一個小屋在它的邊緣。",
	["Follow the road east to Brill. Junior Apothecary Holland stands at the north-west edge of town; the Gallows' End Tavern is the big inn in the middle, with Executor Zygand in front of it."] = "沿著道路前往東前往布瑞爾。初級藥劑師霍蘭德位於西北邊緣的城鎮；Gallows的盡頭酒館是大旅店在中間，與執行官塞加德在前方的它。",
	["Follow the road east to the Howling Vale; Shael'dryn stands by the moonwell."] = "沿著道路前往東前往狼嚎谷；莎爾蒂恩站在旁邊：月亮井。",
	["Follow the road east to the excavation site."] = "沿著道路前往東前往挖掘場地點。",
	["Follow the road east to the outpost above the Southfury River. Crossroads Conscription follows Conscript of the Horde from Razor Hill, so only Orcs, Trolls and Tauren are sent here."] = "沿著道路前往東前往前哨站上方怒水河。十字路口徵兵接續部落的新兵來自剃刀嶺，因此僅獸人，巨魔與牛頭人是派往此處。",
	["Follow the road east to the satyr camps of Xavian; Anilia hides at their edge."] = "沿著道路前往東前往薩特紮營的薩維亞；安妮莉亞藏身在它們的邊緣。",
	["Follow the road east. Bleeding Horrors and Wandering Spirits haunt the graves on the east side of the farmstead, where the Tomb Weed grows."] = "沿著道路前往東。可怕的血僵屍與遊蕩的幽靈出沒墳墓在農莊的東側，在墓地苔生長。",
	["Follow the road east. Young Wetlands Crocolisks lurk in the pools north of the excavation site."] = "沿著道路前往東。濕地鰐魚幼崽潛伏在水池在挖掘場地點以北。",
	["Follow the road north from Goldshire into Stormwind. Duthorian Rall and Gazin Tenorm are in the Cathedral of Light; Stephanie Turner stands in Old Town and asks for ten Linen Cloth (humanoids drop it; the Auction House sells it)."] = "沿著道路前往北來自閃金鎮進入暴風城。達索瑞恩·拉爾與賈森·坦諾姆是在聖光大教堂；斯蒂芬妮·特納位於舊城區與需要10亞麻布（人形生物掉落它；拍賣行出售它）。",
	["Follow the road north from Goldshire into Stormwind. Gakin the Darkbinder waits in the cellar of the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter."] = "沿著道路前往北來自閃金鎮進入暴風城。黑暗縛靈者加科因等候於地窖的已宰的羔羊旅店，在法師區。",
	["Follow the road north out of Grom'gol; Nesingwary's hunting camp sits on the hill north-east of the river. From here on, keep every page of The Green Hills of Stranglethorn you loot: Barnil asks for them later."] = "沿著道路前往北離開格羅姆高；赫米特·奈辛瓦里二世的狩獵營地位於山丘在河流以東北。來自此處在，保留每個書頁的荊棘谷的青山你拾取：巴尼爾·石罐需要它們稍後。",
	["Follow the road north out of Red Cloud Mesa. Kaga Wildhoof waits on the road just south of Bloodhoof Village; build the campfire next to her."] = "沿著道路前往北離開紅雲台地。卡加·狂蹄等候在路上就在血蹄村以南；建造營火下一個前往她的。",
	["Follow the road north out of Silverpine into Tirisfal Glades and east to the zeppelin towers outside the Ruins of Lordaeron. Take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar."] = "沿著道路前往北離開銀松森林進入提瑞斯法林地與東前往飛艇哨塔外部洛丹倫廢墟。搭乘飛艇前往奧格瑞瑪。",
	["Follow the road north out of Silverpine into Tirisfal Glades and on to Brill: Shari Stilwell trains Paladins there. The zeppelin towers are a short walk south down the road."] = "沿著道路前往北離開銀松森林進入提瑞斯法林地與在前往布瑞爾：莎莉·斯蒂爾維爾訓練聖騎士那裡。飛艇哨塔是一個不足步行南順著道路。",
	["Follow the road north out of Southshore into the mountains. Mountain lions roam the slopes; the Syndicate in Strahnbrad wear the signet rings, and Baron Vardus walks the manor grounds on the north side of town."] = "沿著道路前往北離開南海鎮進入山脈。山脈獅子遊蕩於山坡；辛迪加在斯坦恩布萊德佩戴印戒戒指，與巴隆·瓦杜斯步行莊園領地在北一側的城鎮。",
	["Follow the road north out of Tarren Mill into the Alterac foothills. Valik waits by the Syndicate camp; hand him the stout."] = "沿著道路前往北離開塔倫米爾進入奧特蘭克丘陵。僕從瓦里克等候於辛迪加營地；上交他強壯的。",
	["Follow the road north to Dun Modr, at the foot of the Thandol Span. Longbraid the Grim stands in the dwarves' camp."] = "沿著道路前往北前往丹莫德，在山腳的薩多爾大橋。布萊德·長須位於矮人的營地。",
	["Follow the road north to Irontree Woods. The Irontree Stompers carry the heart; finish the claws on the Angerclaw Grizzlies and Felpaw Ravagers of the north."] = "沿著道路前往北前往鐵木森林。鐵木踐踏者攜帶心臟；完成爪在怒爪灰熊與魔爪掠奪者的北。",
	["Follow the road north to Nijel's Point."] = "沿著道路前往北前往尼耶爾前哨站。",
	["Follow the road north to Razor Hill."] = "沿著道路前往北前往剃刀嶺。",
	["Follow the road north to Valormok, the Horde camp."] = "沿著道路前往北前往瓦羅莫克，部落營地。",
	["Follow the road north to the Mor'shan Rampart; Wenikee stands just south of it."] = "沿著道路前往北前往莫爾杉農場；維妮·布特巴克位於就在它南面。",
	["Follow the road north to the camp."] = "沿著道路前往北前往營地。",
	["Follow the road north to the cave mouth of Timbermaw Hold; Nafien guards it."] = "沿著道路前往北前往洞穴入口/河口的木喉要塞；納菲恩衛兵它。",
	["Follow the road north to the cratered vale and walk to each crater, killing the Entropic Beasts and Horrors between them."] = "沿著道路前往北前往環形山山谷與步行前往每個環形山，擊殺熱能野獸與可怕的血僵屍之間它們。",
	["Follow the road north to the draenei of the Harborage."] = "沿著道路前往北前往德萊尼的庇護所。",
	["Follow the road north toward Orgrimmar. Rezlak camps beside it; the stolen sacks lie along the road south of him."] = "沿著道路前往北朝奧格瑞瑪方向。雷茲拉克紮營旁邊它；被盜的麻袋位於沿著道路在他南面。",
	["Follow the road north toward Stonetalon Peak. Antlered Coursers graze along the way; the Sap Beasts, Twilight Runners and Fey Dragons roam the woods below the Peak, and the Cenarion druids hold the grove there."] = "沿著道路前往北朝石爪峰方向。巨角鹿吃草沿途；腐蝕獸，夜行虎與靈龍遊蕩於樹林在山峰下方，與塞納里奧使者安亞·碧月德魯伊要塞樹林那裡。",
	["Follow the road north-east from Brill past Brightwater Lake. Captain Melrache and his two Scarlet Bodyguards hold the Scarlet watchtower on the north-east coast, north of the Scarlet Watch Post: pull the bodyguards first."] = "沿著道路前往東北來自布瑞爾經過明鏡湖。麥拉其隊長與他的2血色保鏢要塞血色哨塔在東北海岸，北的血色十字軍哨崗：拉怪保鏢第一。",
	["Follow the road north-east from Kharanos to the depot below the Ironforge road."] = "沿著道路前往東北來自卡拉諾斯前往補給站下方鐵爐堡道路。",
	["Follow the road north-east to Irontree Woods. The Warpwood Moss Flayers and Shredders on the east side of the woods each carry a Blood Amber; Angerclaw Grizzlies and Felpaw Ravagers roam the same woods for Talo."] = "沿著道路前往東北前往鐵木森林。曲木食苔者與維茲克蘭克的伐木機在樹林每個攜帶一個的東側血琥珀；怒爪灰熊與魔爪掠奪者遊蕩於相同樹林給塔羅·刺蹄。",
	["Follow the road north-east to the Venture Co. camp at the Crystalvein Mine; the miners, surveyors and foremen drop the crystals."] = "沿著道路前往東北前往風險投資公司營地在水晶礦洞；礦工，勘測員與工頭掉落水晶。",
	["Follow the road north-east to the Yoricks' house at Malden's Orchard."] = "沿著道路前往東北前往奎恩·尤瑞克的房屋在瑪爾丁果園。",
	["Follow the road north-west out of Theramore to the watchtower at Sentry Point. Mudrock Burrowers roam the marsh around it."] = "沿著道路前往西北離開塞拉摩前往哨塔在警戒哨崗。泥石穴居龜遊蕩於沼澤周圍它。",
	["Follow the road north-west past the cemetery to Sven's camp on the far west edge of the forest. Lars stands beside Sven."] = "沿著道路前往西北經過墓園前往斯溫·約根的營地在遠處西邊緣的森林。拉爾斯位於斯溫·約根旁邊。",
	["Follow the road north-west to Agamand Mills. Devlin Agamand walks the graveyard south of the mills; Nissa, Gregor and Thurman Agamand haunt the mills themselves. Rattlecage and Cracked Skull Soldiers drop the ribs, Darkeye Bonecasters the skulls, and any of them may drop A Letter to Yvette. From here on, kill the Duskbats and Darkhounds you pass: Shelene wants their wings and hides."] = "沿著道路前往西北前往阿加曼德磨坊。代弗林·阿加曼德步行墓地在磨坊以南；尼莎·火石，格雷戈·格雷斯通與薩爾曼·阿加曼德出沒磨坊它們自己。脆骨與碎顱士兵掉落肋骨，暗眼骷髏法師頭顱，與任意的它們可能掉落給伊維特的信。來自此處在，擊殺夜行蝙蝠與飢餓的黑暗犬你穿過：捨倫尼·洛巴爾特需要它們的翅膀與藏身。",
	["Follow the road north-west. The south of Jaedenar, around its corrupted moonwell, is held by Shadow Council cultists, adepts, guardsmen and their hounds."] = "沿著道路前往西北。在加德納爾以南，周圍它的腐化的月亮井，是持有在旁暗影議會邪教徒，教徒，衛兵與它們的獵犬。",
	["Follow the road north."] = "沿著道路前往北。",
	["Follow the road north. Farmer Saldean stands outside, Salma in the house, Ozwin Ironsprocket in the barn to the west."] = "沿著道路前往北。農夫薩丁位於外部，薩爾瑪·薩丁在房屋，奧茲溫·鐵齒輪在穀倉向西。",
	["Follow the road north; Martek's camp is on the way."] = "沿著道路前往北；流放者馬特克的營地是在途中。",
	["Follow the road on south into Booty Bay."] = "沿著道路前往在南進入藏寶海灣。",
	["Follow the road south back to Brill."] = "沿著道路前往南返回前往布瑞爾。",
	["Follow the road south from Three Corners into Duskwood; Darkshire lies on the east side of the forest."] = "沿著道路前往南來自三角路口進入暮色森林；夜色鎮位於森林的東側。",
	["Follow the road south out of Goldshire to the Maclure Vineyards. Maybell waits by the house."] = "沿著道路前往南離開閃金鎮前往馬科倫農場。梅貝爾·馬科倫等候於房屋。",
	["Follow the road south out of the valley to Goldshire. Innkeeper Farley is in the Lion's Pride Inn; Marshal Dughan stands outside the smithy across the road, William Pestle at the inn's front and Remy \"Two Times\" by the road south of it."] = "沿著道路前往南離開山谷前往閃金鎮。旅店老闆法雷是在獅子的獅群旅店；治安官杜漢位於鐵匠鋪穿過道路外，威廉·匹斯特在旅店的前方與雷米在路邊在它南面。",
	["Follow the road south over the bridge to Dun Modr at the Wetlands end, where Rhag Garmason waits."] = "沿著道路前往南越過橋前往丹莫德在濕地盡頭，在拉格·加瑪森等候。",
	["Follow the road south to Booty Bay at the southern tip of the vale and enter through the tunnel in the cliffs. Stay on the road: the jungle beside it is well above your level. Gringer, the Horde flight master, waits on the upper deck."] = "沿著道路前往南前往藏寶海灣在最南端的山谷與進入穿過隧道在懸崖。留在路上：叢林旁邊它是水井上方你的等級。格林戈，部落飛行管理員，等候於上層甲板。",
	["Follow the road south to Grom'gol."] = "沿著道路前往南前往格羅姆高。",
	["Follow the road south to Kormek's Hut."] = "沿著道路前往南前往考米克小屋。",
	["Follow the road south to Shen'dar Village, in the middle of the isle."] = "沿著道路前往南前往申達爾村，在島的中央。",
	["Follow the road south to Shen'dar Village. Raan Wildwind camps by the fire west of the village; Constable Aonda and Rathiril Sunlance stand in its middle."] = "沿著道路前往南前往申達爾村。拉恩·狂風紮營在旁營火在村莊以西；治安官奧恩達與拉希瑞爾·日槍位於它的中間。",
	["Follow the road south to the dwarf dig site at Bael Modan. Feegly the Exiled hides at the south edge of the dig; General Twinbraid's Strongbox sits at the bottom of the excavation."] = "沿著道路前往南前往矮人挖掘地點在巴爾莫丹。被流放的費格雷藏身在挖掘的南邊緣；塔文布萊德將軍的保險箱位於挖掘場的底部。",
	["Follow the road south-east from Brill past the zeppelin towers. Linnea, Kristof and Shelene Rhobart camp by the road."] = "沿著道路前往東南來自布瑞爾經過飛艇哨塔。亡靈衛兵林奈，克里斯托夫與捨倫尼·洛巴爾特營地在路邊。",
	["Follow the road south-east to Astranaar, on the island in the lake."] = "沿著道路前往東南前往阿斯特蘭納，在島嶼在湖。",
	["Follow the road south-east to Ratchet on the coast."] = "沿著道路前往東南前往棘齒城在海岸邊。",
	["Follow the road south-west from Brill to the Scarlet Crusade camp. Captain Perrine stands at its south end; every Scarlet there can drop a ring."] = "沿著道路前往西南來自布瑞爾前往血色十字軍營地。派瑞恩隊長位於它的南盡頭；每個血色那裡可以掉落一個戒指。",
	["Follow the road south-west from Far Watch Post to the Crossroads. The Barrens guide starts here."] = "沿著道路前往西南來自前沿哨所前往十字路口。貧瘠之地指南始於此處。",
	["Follow the road south-west out of Shadowglen to Dolanaar."] = "沿著道路前往西南離開幽影谷前往多蘭納爾。",
	["Follow the road south-west out of Sun Rock into Desolace and on south past Nijel's Point. Cork Gizelton's kodo caravan waits by the road north of Kolkar Village; if it has already left, ride on."] = "沿著道路前往西南離開烈日石居進入淒涼之地與在南經過尼耶爾前哨站。考克·基澤爾頓的科多獸商隊等候在路邊在科爾卡村以北；如果它有已經左側，騎行在。",
	["Follow the road south-west out of the pass to Cenarion Hold."] = "沿著道路前往西南離開穿過前往塞納里奧要塞。",
	["Follow the road south. Onu is the ancient at the Grove; Arbal and Kerlonian Evershade sleep beside him."] = "沿著道路前往南。安努是遠古在樹林；阿巴爾與克羅尼亞·恆影睡眠旁邊他。",
	["Follow the road south. The Dalaran Crate sits beside it, north of Pyrewood."] = "沿著道路前往南。達拉然木箱位於旁邊它，在焚木村以北。",
	["Follow the road south; the basilisks bask on the rocks east of it in the middle of the jungle. Their shards drop often."] = "沿著道路前往南；石化蜥蜴曬太陽在岩石在它東面在叢林的中央。它們的碎片掉落經常。",
	["Follow the road through the tunnel and north-east to Kharanos. Senir Whitebeard, Eric Brighthammer and his campfire are outside the Thunderbrew Distillery; Tannok, Maxan and Ragnar are inside; Tharek Blackstone works the forge."] = "沿著道路前往穿過隧道與東北前往卡拉諾斯。森內爾·白須，埃里克·明錘與他的營火是外部雷酒釀製廠；塔諾克·霜錘，馬克薩恩·安沃爾與拉格納·雷酒是內部；薩雷克·黑石有效鍛爐。",
	["Follow the road up to Ironforge and take the Mystic Ward: Brandur Ironhammer, Tiza Battleforge and Muiredon Battleforge are in the Hall of Mysteries. John Turner, a beggar, wanders the city. He asks for ten Linen Cloth: the troggs and trolls of Dun Morogh drop it, and the Auction House sells it."] = "沿著道路前往上前往鐵爐堡與接取秘法區：布蘭度爾·鐵錘，蒂薩·熱爐與穆里頓·熱爐是在秘法大廳。約翰·特納，一個乞丐，遊蕩主城。他需要10亞麻布：穴居人與巨魔的丹莫羅掉落它，與拍賣行出售它。",
	["Follow the road up to Ironforge and train with your class trainer. The Deeprun Tram leaves from Tinker Town, in the east of the city. Ride it to Stormwind."] = "沿著道路前往上前往鐵爐堡與訓練與你的職業訓練師。礦道地鐵離開來自工匠區，在主城以東。騎行它前往暴風城。",
	["Follow the road west across the north of Desolace to the ruins of Ethel Rethor; the wrecked ship's chest lies on the shore just west of them."] = "沿著道路前往西穿過在淒涼之地以北前往廢墟的艾瑟雷索；失事的船的箱子位於岸邊就在它們西面。",
	["Follow the road west back to Goldshire."] = "沿著道路前往西返回前往閃金鎮。",
	["Follow the road west back to Goldshire; Helene and Jason stand on the lake shore before town."] = "沿著道路前往西返回前往閃金鎮；海倫尼·派特斯金納與賈森·瑪瑟斯位於湖岸邊之前城鎮。",
	["Follow the road west from Hillsbrad past Southpoint Tower into Silverpine Forest, Horde country with Horde guards at the Sepulcher."] = "沿著道路前往西來自希爾斯布萊德經過南點哨塔進入銀松森林，部落領地與部落衛兵在瑟伯切爾。",
	["Follow the road west from Razor Hill over the Southfury River bridge; Far Watch Post sits just above it on the Barrens side."] = "沿著道路前往西來自剃刀嶺越過怒水河橋；前沿哨所位於就在上方它在貧瘠之地一側。",
	["Follow the road west into Darnassus. Mydrannul stands on the Craftsmen's Terrace just inside the city; Sister Aquinne is in the west of the city, on the way to the pink portal down to Rut'theran."] = "沿著道路前往西進入達納蘇斯。邁德蘭努爾位於工匠階地就在主城內；艾奎恩妮是在主城以西，在途中前往粉色傳送門下前往魯瑟蘭村。",
	["Follow the road west out of Astranaar; Maestra's Post lies north of it."] = "沿著道路前往西離開阿斯特蘭納；邁斯特拉崗哨位於它北面。",
	["Follow the road west past Agamand Mills to the Whispering Forest. Leonid stands just north of Hilda's camp."] = "沿著道路前往西經過阿加曼德磨坊前往耳語森林。萊尼德·巴薩羅梅位於就在破城者希爾達的以北營地。",
	["Follow the road west past Sun Rock Retreat (Horde) and south-west through the Charred Vale into Desolace; Nijel's Point stands at the top of the pass."] = "沿著道路前往西經過烈日石居（部落）與西南穿過焦炭谷進入淒涼之地；尼耶爾前哨站位於穿過的頂部。",
	["Follow the road west past Westbrook into Westfall, then south along it to Sentinel Hill. Thor, the gryphon master, stands on the hill."] = "沿著道路前往西經過西泉要塞進入西部荒野，然後南沿著它前往哨兵嶺。索爾，獅鷲管理員，位於山丘。",
	["Follow the road west to Donova's camp beside the hot springs."] = "沿著道路前往西前往多諾瓦的營地在熱溫泉旁邊。",
	["Follow the road west to Sun Rock Retreat."] = "沿著道路前往西前往烈日石居。",
	["Follow the road west, then climb north to the goblin camp on Flame Crest."] = "沿著道路前往西，然後爬上北前往地精營地在烈焰峰。",
	["Follow the roads east across the Hinterlands to the troll village on the eastern coast."] = "沿著道路東穿過辛特蘭前往巨魔村莊在東部海岸。",
	["Follow the shore west past Southshore's bay; the Torn Fin murlocs camp on the beaches beyond it."] = "沿著岸邊西經過南海鎮的海灣；破鰭魚人營地在海灘越過它。",
	["Follow the southern road east into the Eastern Plaguelands; the ruins of Darrowshire lie south of it. Pamela's ghost plays by the ruined house at the south end."] = "沿著南部道路東進入東瘟疫之地；廢墟的達隆郡位於它南面。帕米拉的幽靈進行在旁毀壞的房屋在南盡頭。",
	["Follow the west coast north; the haunted island lies off the shore west of Nesingwary's camp. Just reach it."] = "沿著西海岸北；鬧鬼的島嶼位於偏離/關閉岸邊在奈辛瓦里的營地以西。就在抵達它。",
	["For Archbishop Benedictus in Stormwind, in the next guide"] = "給大主教本尼迪塔斯在暴風城，在下一份指南中",
	["For Archmage Ansirem in Alterac Mountains"] = "給大法師大法師安斯雷姆·魯因維沃爾在奧特蘭克山脈",
	["For Bishop Farthing in Stormwind, in the next guide"] = "給主教法席恩在暴風城，在下一份指南中",
	["For Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind Keep: keep it"] = "給伯瓦爾·弗塔根公爵伯瓦爾·弗塔根公爵在暴風城要塞：請保留該任務/物品",
	["For Catelyn the Blade in Booty Bay: keep it"] = "給利刃凱特琳在藏寶海灣：請保留該任務/物品",
	["For Chillwind Camp: keep it"] = "給冰風崗：請保留該任務/物品",
	["For Curator Thorius in Ironforge, later"] = "給索里奧斯館長在鐵爐堡，稍後",
	["For Elling Trias in Stormwind, in the next guide"] = "給埃林·提亞斯在暴風城，在下一份指南中",
	["For Falfindel Waywarder in Feralas, much later"] = "給法芬德爾在菲拉斯，很久以後",
	["For Felwood: keep it"] = "給費伍德森林：請保留該任務/物品",
	["For Fleet Master Seahorn in Booty Bay: keep it"] = "給艦隊指揮官卡拉·海角在藏寶海灣：請保留該任務/物品",
	["For Gregan Brewspewer in Feralas: keep it"] = "給格雷甘·山酒在菲拉斯：請保留該任務/物品",
	["For Gryan Stoutmantle at Sentinel Hill"] = "給格里安·斯托曼在哨兵嶺",
	["For Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn, later"] = "給赫米特·奈辛瓦里二世在荊棘谷，稍後",
	["For Janice Felstone: keep it"] = "給詹妮絲·費爾斯通：請保留該任務/物品",
	["For Kernda in Timbermaw Hold: keep it"] = "給克爾達在木喉要塞：請保留該任務/物品",
	["For Kin'weelay at Grom'gol, in the next guide"] = "給肯維雷在格羅姆高，在下一份指南中",
	["For Lieutenant Farren Orinelle in Southshore: keep it"] = "給法爾林·奧里涅爾中尉在南海鎮：請保留該任務/物品",
	["For Milton Sheaf in Stormwind: keep it"] = "給米爾頓·西弗在暴風城：請保留該任務/物品",
	["For Phin Odelic in Southshore"] = "給費恩·奧德利克在南海鎮",
	["For Silithus: keep it"] = "給希利蘇斯：請保留該任務/物品",
	["For Sprite Jumpsprocket in Stormwind's Dwarven District"] = "給斯普萊特在暴風城的矮人區",
	["For Stormwind: keep it"] = "給暴風城：請保留該任務/物品",
	["For Wiley the Black in Lakeshire, Redridge"] = "給黑衣威利在湖畔鎮，赤脊山",
	["For the druids of Darnassus: keep it"] = "給德魯伊的達納蘇斯：請保留該任務/物品",
	["For the giant crocolisks of the north coast, on your next visit"] = "給巨型鰐魚的北海岸，在下次來訪時",
	["Foreman Oslow"] = "工頭奧斯洛",
	["Foreman Stonebrow"] = "工頭喬尼·石眉",
	["Foreman Thazz'ril"] = "工頭塔茲利爾",
	["Forest Song, the Night Elf outpost at the eastern end of the road."] = "林歌神殿，夜晚精靈前哨站在道路的東端。",
	["Forever adds the dungeons Hall of Thanes and Ruins of Lordaeron; their bosses and brackets are not in our data yet."] = "永恆服新增地下城領主大廳與洛丹倫廢墟；它們的首領與等級段是暫未收錄於當前數據。",
	["Forever's PvP ranks come from Rank Points earned in battlegrounds and world PvP, with a weekly cap; Commander (rank 11) unlocks the Black War mounts. Polestar cannot read your rank, so this step waits for level 40 and the riding skill."] = "永恆服的 PvP 軍銜來自等級點數獲得的在戰場與世界 PvP，與一個每周上限；指揮官（等級11）解鎖黑色戰爭坐騎。Polestar 無法閱讀你的等級，因此此步驟等候給40級與騎行技能。",
	["Forever's PvP ranks come from Rank Points earned in battlegrounds and world PvP, with a weekly cap; Lieutenant General (rank 11) unlocks the Black War mounts. Polestar cannot read your rank, so this step waits for level 40 and the riding skill."] = "永恆服的 PvP 軍銜來自等級點數獲得的在戰場與世界 PvP，與一個每周上限；中尉將軍（等級11）解鎖黑色戰爭坐騎。Polestar 無法閱讀你的等級，因此此步驟等候給40級與騎行技能。",
	["Forked Mudrock Tongue"] = "分叉的泥石龜舌",
	["Foulweald Den Watcher"] = "污林衛兵",
	["Foulweald Totemic"] = "污林圖騰師",
	["Foulweald Ursa"] = "污林巨熊怪",
	["Foulweald Warrior"] = "污林戰士",
	["Four rune rubbings in Azshara: keep it"] = "4符文拓片在艾薩拉：請保留該任務/物品",
	["Fourth Relic Fragment"] = "第四塊遺物碎片",
	["Fraggar Thundermantle"] = "弗拉加爾",
	["Fraggar keeps paying for necklaces: hand in any extras"] = "弗拉加爾保留支付給項鍊：上交任意多餘的",
	["Frast Dokner"] = "弗拉斯特·多克南",
	["Frast Dokner: blacksmiths only"] = "弗拉斯特·多克南：鐵匠僅",
	["Free Pal'juh and see her safely out of the crag"] = "解救帕爾朱與查看她的安全地離開峭壁",
	["Free six Webbed Victims inside the cave for Aramis"] = "解救6被網住的受害者在洞穴給內阿拉米斯·錘手",
	["Frenzied Plaguehound"] = "狂怒的瘟疫犬",
	["Frenzied Plaguehounds and Monstrous Plaguebats share the fields around Northdale and Eastwall Tower, south of Zul'Mashar."] = "狂怒的瘟疫犬與巨型瘟疫蝙蝠共享農田在北谷周圍與東牆哨塔，在祖爾瑪夏以南。",
	["Frenzied Pterrordax"] = "狂怒的翼手龍",
	["From Algaz Station take the tunnel west into Dun Morogh. Kharanos and Ironforge's gates are Alliance ground."] = "來自奧加茲崗哨穿過隧道西進入丹莫羅。卡拉諾斯與鐵爐堡的大門是聯盟領地。",
	["From Algaz Station, the road north through the Dun Algaz pass leads into the Wetlands."] = "來自奧加茲崗哨，道路北穿過丹奧加茲穿過通往濕地。",
	["From Astranaar head south-west to the Talondeep Path, a tunnel through the mountains into Stonetalon."] = "來自阿斯特蘭納前往西南前往石爪小徑，一個隧道穿過山脈進入石爪山脈。",
	["From Astranaar ride north-west into the hills: the Heartswood is a glowing tree north of the road to Maestra's Post. Then back past Astranaar to the Talondeep Path."] = "來自阿斯特蘭納騎行西北進入丘陵：同心樹是一個發光的樹在道路前往以北邁斯特拉崗哨。然後返回經過阿斯特蘭納前往石爪小徑。",
	["From Booty Bay, fly to Grom'gol. The Undercity zeppelin leaves from the tower on the west side of the camp."] = "來自藏寶海灣，飛往前往格羅姆高。幽暗城飛艇離開來自哨塔在營地的西側。",
	["From Camp Mojache's flight master."] = "來自莫沙徹營地的飛行管理員。",
	["From Darkshire follow the road east through Deadwind Pass into the Swamp of Sorrows; Biggs guards the road junction just inside it."] = "來自夜色鎮沿著道路前往東穿過逆風小徑進入悲傷沼澤；衛兵比格斯衛兵道路交界處就在內部它。",
	["From Darla Harris in Southshore"] = "來自達爾拉·哈瑞斯在南海鎮",
	["From Dungar Longdrink in Stormwind"] = "來自杜加爾·朗德瑞克在暴風城",
	["From Duskwood take the road south into Stranglethorn; the hunters' tents stand just west of the road past the Rebel Camp turn-off."] = "來自暮色森林沿著道路走南進入荊棘谷；獵人的帳篷位於就在道路經過以西反抗軍營地交還-偏離/關閉。",
	["From Freewind Post, fly to Orgrimmar."] = "來自亂風崗，飛往前往奧格瑞瑪。",
	["From Honored on, Corruptor's Scourgestones (one per turn-in) and Scourge kills in Stratholme and Scholomance carry the reputation. Corruptor's stones drop from the Scourge bosses there (Darkmaster Gandling, Marduk Blackpool, Vectus) and from Araj the Summoner and Putridius in Western Plaguelands. Many dungeon runs pay off faster than any open-world farm."] = "來自尊敬在，墮落者的天災石（1每交任務）與天災軍團擊殺在斯坦索姆與通靈學院攜帶聲望。墮落者的石頭掉落來自天災軍團首領那裡（黑暗院長加丁，馬杜克·布萊克波爾，維克圖斯）與來自召喚者阿拉基與普特里迪烏斯在西瘟疫之地。許多地下城通往獎勵偏離/關閉更快比任意打開/開啓-世界農場。",
	["From Ironforge take the tunnel east through Dun Morogh into Loch Modan and follow the road to Thelsamar."] = "來自鐵爐堡穿過隧道東穿過丹莫羅進入洛克莫丹與沿著道路前往前往塞爾薩瑪。",
	["From Ironforge's Gryth Thurden"] = "來自鐵爐堡的格萊斯·瑟登",
	["From Krakle in Un'Goro"] = "來自克拉蘭克在安戈洛環形山",
	["From Light's Hope Chapel's flight master, fly to the Undercity."] = "來自聖光之願禮拜堂的飛行管理員，飛往前往幽暗城。",
	["From Nijel's Point"] = "來自尼耶爾前哨站",
	["From Orgrimmar (zeppelin from the towers outside the Undercity) fly to Camp Taurajo."] = "來自奧格瑞瑪（飛艇來自哨塔外部幽暗城）飛往前往陶拉祖營地。",
	["From Orgrimmar (zeppelin from the towers outside the Undercity) fly to Thunder Bluff and train on Elder Rise, then fly on to Camp Taurajo."] = "來自奧格瑞瑪（飛艇來自哨塔外部幽暗城）飛往前往雷霆崖與訓練在長者高地，然後飛往在前往陶拉祖營地。",
	["From Ratchet, fly to Everlook and ride south to Owl Wing Thicket."] = "來自棘齒城，飛往前往永望鎮與騎行南前往梟翼樹叢。",
	["From Ratchet, fly to Gadgetzan."] = "來自棘齒城，飛往前往加基森。",
	["From Revantusk Village's flight master, fly to the Undercity."] = "來自惡齒村的飛行管理員，飛往前往幽暗城。",
	["From Rut'theran Village, fly to Feathermoon Stronghold."] = "來自魯瑟蘭村，飛往前往羽月要塞。",
	["From Shadowprey Village fly to Ratchet."] = "來自葬影村飛往前往棘齒城。",
	["From Stormwind Harbor take the boat to Auberdine, then ride south along the road through Darkshore."] = "來自暴風城港口乘船前往奧伯丁，然後騎行南沿著道路穿過黑海岸。",
	["From Stormwind Harbor, ride through the city gates into Elwynn Forest and follow the road west to Westfall."] = "來自暴風城港口，騎行穿過主城大門進入艾爾文森林與沿著道路前往西前往西部荒野。",
	["From Tarren Mill go south-east into the hills on the way to Durnholde Keep. Rogues and Watchmen hold the camps along the way."] = "來自塔倫米爾前往東南進入丘陵在途中前往敦霍爾德城堡。潛行者與衛兵要塞紮營沿途。",
	["From Thelsamar fly to Menethil Harbor, take the boat to Theramore and fly on to Gadgetzan. Torwa's first quest in the crater needs level 48: finish the level here if you are short."] = "來自塞爾薩瑪飛往前往米奈希爾港，乘船前往塞拉摩與飛往在前往加基森。托爾瓦的第一任務在環形山需要48級：完成等級此處如果數量還不夠。",
	["From Thelsamar ride south into the Badlands, then west past the Horde town of Kargath (give it room) and up the trail into Searing Gorge. Thorium Point is the scaffolded camp on the north-west rim."] = "來自塞爾薩瑪騎行南進入荒蕪之地，然後西經過部落城鎮的卡加斯（交給它房間）與上小路進入灼熱峽谷。瑟銀哨塔是腳手架營地在西北邊緣。",
	["From Theramore follow the road west out of Dustwallow into the Barrens and south along it; give Camp Taurajo a wide berth. The Great Lift at the Barrens' south end takes you down into Thousand Needles. The journal lies at the foot of the lift."] = "來自塞拉摩沿著道路前往西離開塵泥沼澤進入貧瘠之地與南沿著它；交給陶拉祖營地一個寬闊泊位。升降梯在貧瘠之地的南盡頭接收你下進入千針石林。日記位於升降梯的底部。",
	["From Theramore, fly to Nijel's Point and ride south out of Desolace into Feralas; the road leads west to the Forgotten Coast dock, where the boat crosses to Feathermoon on Sardor Isle."] = "來自塞拉摩，飛往前往尼耶爾前哨站與騎行南離開淒涼之地進入菲拉斯；道路通往西前往被遺忘的海岸碼頭，在船穿過前往羽月要塞在薩多爾島。",
	["From Thorium Point's flight master."] = "來自瑟銀哨塔的飛行管理員。",
	["From here on pick up every Power Crystal (blue, green, red, yellow) and every Un'Goro Soil pile you pass: 25 soil in all, 20 for Hamuul and 5 for Pestlezugg."] = "來自此處在拾取/接取每個能量水晶（藍色，綠色，紅色，黃色）與每個安戈洛的泥土堆你穿過：25泥土在全部，20給大德魯伊哈繆爾·符文圖騰與5給煉金師匹斯特蘇格。",
	["From here on, the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj raid and the Abyssal Council turn-ins (crests, signets, scepters) carry most of the reputation."] = "來自此處在，安其拉廢墟團隊副本與深淵議會交任務（紋章，印戒，節杖）攜帶大多數的聲望。",
	["From the Auberdine dock, fly to Astranaar."] = "來自奧伯丁碼頭，飛往前往阿斯特蘭納。",
	["From the Booty Bay flight master, above the harbour."] = "來自藏寶海灣飛行管理員，在港口上方。",
	["From the Broken Pillar ride west to the long ramp that winds down into Un'Goro Crater, then follow the crater's north wall to Marshal's Refuge, a camp in the cliff caves. Everyone here is neutral."] = "來自破碎石柱騎行西前往長坡道該風下進入安戈洛環形山，然後沿著環形山的北城牆前往馬紹爾營地，一個紮營於懸崖洞穴。所有人此處是中立。",
	["From the Crossroads follow the road north. Kadrak stands on the watch tower of the Mor'shan Rampart where the road enters Ashenvale. Open the Bundle of Reports he gives you."] = "來自十字路口沿著道路前往北。卡德拉克位於守望哨塔的莫爾杉農場在道路進入灰谷。打開/開啓報告集他給你。",
	["From the Crossroads, follow the road north-east to Orgrimmar and walk in by the main gate. Doras, the wind rider master, stands on the tower in the Valley of Strength."] = "來自十字路口，沿著道路前往東北前往奧格瑞瑪與步行在旁主大門。多拉斯，雙足飛龍管理員，位於哨塔在力量谷。",
	["From the Forgotten Coast dock, boat to Feathermoon and fly to Thalanaar, then ride east through Thousand Needles to the Mirage Raceway on the Shimmering Flats. Fizzle Brassbolts and Pozzik are in the camps beside the track; Zamek stands by the goblin camp."] = "來自被遺忘的海岸碼頭，船前往羽月要塞與飛往前往薩蘭納爾，然後騎行東穿過千針石林前往沙漠賽道在閃光平原。菲茲爾·銅栓與普茲克是在紮營在追蹤旁邊；扎米克站在旁邊：地精營地。",
	["From the Tome of Divinity he gives you"] = "來自聖潔之書他給你",
	["From the Tome of Divinity she gives you"] = "來自聖潔之書她給你",
	["From the Undercity, take the zeppelin from the tower outside the city to Orgrimmar."] = "來自幽暗城，搭乘飛艇來自哨塔在主城前往外奧格瑞瑪。",
	["From the harbour walk into Old Town. Ilsa Corbin trains warriors there; Harry Burlguard and Bartleby stand together by the Pig and Whistle Tavern. Bartleby fights you for his mug."] = "來自港口步行進入舊城區。伊爾薩·考賓訓練戰士那裡；哈里·伯加德與巴特萊比位於一起在旁豬和哨聲旅店。巴特萊比戰鬥你給他的酒杯。",
	["From the pass, take the Gold Road north to the Crossroads, the Horde town in the middle of the Barrens."] = "來自穿過，接取金幣道路北前往十字路口，部落城鎮在中間的貧瘠之地。",
	["From the southern Barrens take the Great Lift down into Thousand Needles. Freewind Post is a Horde town."] = "來自南部貧瘠之地接取升降梯下進入千針石林。亂風崗是一個部落城鎮。",
	["From western Tanaris take the path down into Un'Goro Crater. Marshal's Refuge in the north is a neutral camp."] = "來自西部塔納利斯沿著小徑走下進入安戈洛環形山。馬紹爾營地在北面是一個中立營地。",
	["Frostmane Headhunter"] = "霜鬃獵頭者",
	["Frostmane Hold is the troll cave in the hills west of Brewnall Village. Kill Headhunters at its mouth and walk through to its far end."] = "霜鬃巨魔要塞是巨魔洞穴在丘陵在烈酒村以西。擊殺獵頭者在它的入口/河口與步行穿過前往它的遠處盡頭。",
	["Frostmane Troll Whelp"] = "霜鬃巨魔幼崽",
	["Frostmane Troll Whelps fill the slopes south and east of Grelin's camp."] = "霜鬃巨魔幼崽裝滿山坡南與在格雷林的以東營地。",
	["Frostwolf Quartermaster: Coldtooth and Irondeep Supplies from the mines"] = "霜狼軍需官：冷齒礦洞與深鐵礦洞補給品來自礦洞",
	["Full games that kill Drek'Thar after the towers fall pay the most."] = "完整遊戲該擊殺德雷克塔爾之後哨塔跳下/墜落獎勵大多數。",
	["Full games that kill Vanndar Stormpike after the towers fall pay the most."] = "完整遊戲該擊殺範達爾·雷矛之後哨塔跳下/墜落獎勵大多數。",
	["Fun with Elementals: Nimsy"] = "有趣與元素：妮姆希",
	["Furl Scornbrow"] = "弗恩·凝眉",
	["Furl Scornbrow, in the watchtower"] = "弗恩·凝眉，在哨塔",
	["Furlbrow's Wardrobe"] = "法布隆的櫃子",
	["Further north along the road. The Furlbrows sit by their burned farm. Click the Sacks of Oats in the fields as you go and fill the vial at the stead's well."] = "更遠處北沿著道路。農夫法布隆坐在旁它們的燒焦的農場。點擊燕麥袋在農田沿途順路與裝滿小瓶在農場的水井。",
	["Further north, the goblins of the Venture Co. dig at the mine east of the road; miners, foremen, surveyors and tinkerers all drop the crystals."] = "更遠處北，地精的風險投資公司挖掘在採礦在道路以東；礦工，工頭，勘測員與技師全部掉落水晶。",
	["Further south, Junior Surveyor Scrimshank's gear lies at the mouth of a Centipaar hive."] = "更遠處南，初級藥劑師霍蘭德勘測員斯克林尚克的裝備位於入口/河口的一個森提帕爾蟲巢。",
	["Fyldren Moonfeather"] = "菲爾迪恩·月羽",
	["Gadgetzan is the walled goblin town just past the Tanaris border."] = "加基森是有圍牆的地精城鎮就在經過塔納利斯邊界。",
	["Gaea Dirt Mounds"] = "蓋亞土堆",
	["Gaeriyan in Gadgetzan: keep it"] = "加里楊在加基森：請保留該任務/物品",
	["Gaeriyan is a ghost at the graveyard just north of Gadgetzan; the Conspicuous Gravestone is south of it, outside the town wall."] = "加里楊是一個幽靈在墓地就在加基森以北；顯眼的墓碑位於它南面，在城鎮城牆外。",
	["Gaeriyan waits at the graveyard just east of town; the gravestone stands nearby."] = "加里楊等候於墓地就在城鎮東面；墓碑位於附近。",
	["Gaerolas Talvethren"] = "蓋洛拉斯·塔文斯倫",
	["Gahrron's Withering Cauldron Key"] = "蓋羅恩農場的瘟疫之鍋鑰匙",
	["Gahz'ridian Ornament"] = "加茲瑞迪安飾物",
	["Gakin the Darkbinder"] = "黑暗縛靈者加科因",
	["Gakin the Darkbinder waits in the Slaughtered Lamb's cellar, in the Mage Quarter. Use the Heartswood Core at the summoning circle there and defeat the succubus it calls."] = "黑暗縛靈者加科因等候於已宰的羔羊旅店的地窖，在法師區。使用同心樹之核在召喚法陣那裡與擊敗魅魔它召喚。",
	["Gakin the Darkbinder waits in the cellar of the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter."] = "黑暗縛靈者加科因等候於地窖的已宰的羔羊旅店，在法師區。",
	["Gakin the Darkbinder: Takar the Seer in the Barrens takes it, later"] = "黑暗縛靈者加科因：先知塔卡爾在貧瘠之地接收該任務，稍後",
	["Galen Goodward is held in the Fallow Sanctuary in the swamp's north-east. Free him and follow him out, fighting off the swamp creatures that chase him."] = "加林·古瓦德是持有在農田避難所在沼澤的東北。解救他與沿著他出，戰鬥偏離/關閉沼澤生物該追擊他。",
	["Galen is caged at the north end of the sanctuary. Free him and keep him alive on the walk out; his strongbox waits by the road afterwards."] = "加林·古瓦德是關在籠中的在聖地的北端。解救他與保留他存活在步行出；他的保險箱等候在路邊隨後。",
	["Galen's Strongbox"] = "加林的保險箱",
	["Galestriders need level 40 and Riding (Galestrider Riding comes with it in the Forever client). Any riding trainer of your faction teaches it; see the Level 40 mount guides for where."] = "疾風陸行鳥需要40級與騎術（疾風陸行鳥騎術來自與它在永恆服客戶端）。任意騎術訓練師的你的陣營傳授它；查看40級坐騎指南給在。",
	["Galestriders: Genn Fairweather, in Valanaar on Zephras Isle."] = "疾風陸行鳥：吉恩·費爾韋瑟，在瓦拉納爾在澤弗拉斯島。",
	["Galgar"] = "戈加爾",
	["Galgar, by the cooking fire"] = "戈加爾，在旁烹飪營火",
	["Gan'rul Bloodeye"] = "甘魯爾·血眼",
	["Gan'rul Bloodeye stands in the Cleft of Shadow. Use Dogran's Pendant on the summoning circle there and defeat the succubus to bind her."] = "甘魯爾·血眼位於暗影裂口。使用多格蘭的墜飾在召喚法陣那裡與擊敗魅魔前往綁定她的。",
	["Gan'rul Bloodeye: Summon Voidwalker"] = "甘魯爾·血眼：召喚虛空行者",
	["Gann waits in a small camp further south, on the road toward Bael Modan."] = "加恩·石塔等候於一個小型營地更遠處南，在路上朝巴爾莫丹方向。",
	["Gar'Thok"] = "加索克",
	["Garek camps by himself in Dustwind Gulch, south-east of the digsite."] = "加瑞克紮營在旁他自己在塵風峽谷，在挖掘場以東南。",
	["Garek's next task is an elite hunt: skip it."] = "加瑞克的下一個任務是一個精英狩獵：跳過即可。",
	["Garen Largo trains Paladins in the Undercity."] = "加倫·拉爾戈訓練聖騎士在幽暗城。",
	["Garion Wendell"] = "加里奧·溫德爾",
	["Garrick's Head: Garrick Padfoot"] = "加瑞克的頭顱：加瑞克·帕德弗特",
	["Gaxim Rustfizzle"] = "加克希姆·塵鏈",
	["Gazban swims off the north-west coast, on the northern loop"] = "加茲班游動偏離/關閉西北海岸，在北部環線",
	["Gazin Tenorm"] = "賈森·坦諾姆",
	["Gazlowe"] = "加茲魯維",
	["Gazrog"] = "加茲羅格",
	["Gelkak Gyromast"] = "基爾卡克·旋桿",
	["Gelkak Gyromast hides on the little island off the ruins; Stormscale Beastmistresses walk the shore. The key pieces drop from Giant Foreststriders (top), Greymist murlocs (middle) and Raging Reef Crawlers (bottom)."] = "基爾卡克·旋桿藏身在小島嶼偏離/關閉廢墟；風暴鱗片馭獸者步行岸邊。鑰匙碎片掉落來自凶猛的森林陸行鳥（頂部），灰霧魚人（中間）與狂暴暗礁蟹（底部）。",
	["Geltharis leads the Xavian satyrs; he carries the branch."] = "加薩里斯通往薩維亞薩特；他攜帶樹枝。",
	["General Kirika"] = "吉里卡將軍",
	["General Twinbraid's Strongbox"] = "塔文布萊德將軍的保險箱",
	["Genn Fairweather is in Valanaar, the island's harbour town, near the skyboat docks. The Forever client lists each Galestrider at 20g; choose one."] = "吉恩·費爾韋瑟是在瓦拉納爾，島嶼的港口城鎮，在天舟碼頭附近。永恆服客戶端列出每個疾風陸行鳥在20金；選擇1。",
	["Genn Fairweather is in Valanaar, the island's harbour town, near the skyboat docks. The Forever client lists each Swift Galestrider at 200g; choose one."] = "吉恩·費爾韋瑟是在瓦拉納爾，島嶼的港口城鎮，在天舟碼頭附近。永恆服客戶端列出每個赫格拉姆疾風陸行鳥在200金；選擇1。",
	["Geologist Larksbane"] = "地質學家拉克斯班",
	["Gerrig Bonegrip"] = "葛利·硬骨",
	["Ghak Healtouch"] = "加克",
	["Ghak Healtouch, in the inn"] = "加克，在旅店內",
	["Ghede"] = "格德",
	["Ghost-o-plasm"] = "幽靈電漿",
	["Ghoul Fang"] = "食屍鬼的牙齒",
	["Ghouls and skeletons all over Western Plaguelands drop Minion's Scourgestones about half the time; this cluster is dense. Hand them in 20 at a time to any Argent Officer (Pureheart at Chillwind Camp, Garush at The Bulwark, Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff at Light's Hope Chapel). Each turn-in also pays an Argent Dawn Valor Token for the Argent quartermasters."] = "食屍鬼與骷髏全部越過西瘟疫之地掉落爪牙的天災石約一半時間；此簇是密集的。上交它們在20在一個時間前往任意銀色黎明軍官（銀色黎明軍官普爾哈特在冰風崗，銀色黎明軍官加魯什在亡靈壁壘，尼古拉斯·瑟倫霍夫公爵在聖光之願禮拜堂）。每個交任務也獎勵一個銀色黎明勇氣勳章給銀色黎明軍需官。",
	["Giant Crocolisk Skin"] = "巨型鰐魚的皮",
	["Giant Eggs drop from the Ironbeak owls of Felwood."] = "巨蛋掉落來自鐵喙貓頭鷹貓頭鷹的費伍德森林。",
	["Gilshalan Windwalker"] = "基爾沙蘭·風行者",
	["Gilshalan Windwalker, on the tree's ramp"] = "基爾沙蘭·風行者，在樹的坡道",
	["Gilthares Firebough is chained inside the hold. Talk to him to start the escort and stay close: Theramore soldiers attack on the way out. He walks you back to Ratchet."] = "基爾薩瑞斯·火枝是被鎖住的在要塞內。與…交談他前往開始護送與留在靠近：塞拉摩士兵攻擊在途中出。他步行你返回前往棘齒城。",
	["Gilveradin Sunchaser"] = "基沃拉丁·獵日者",
	["Ginro Hearthkindle"] = "基恩諾·火花",
	["Gives the Tapped Dowsing Widget"] = "給予使用過的尋水器",
	["Glittering Sunstone, from any Bloodfury harpy"] = "閃耀的太陽石，來自任意血怒雷巫鷹身人",
	["Glorin Steelbrow"] = "戈羅林·鋼眉",
	["Glorin Steelbrow, upstairs in the inn"] = "戈羅林·鋼眉，在旅店樓上",
	["Glorin stands on the upper floor of Menethil's keep."] = "戈羅林·鋼眉位於米奈希爾的上層層保留。",
	["Glowing Ember: Minor Manifestation of Fire"] = "餘燼：火焰之魂",
	["Glowing Gem"] = "發光的寶石",
	["Glowing Soul Gem"] = "發光的靈魂寶石",
	["Gluggle, a rare murloc on the coast west of camp, drops the Pendant of Myzrael: take it if you meet him"] = "格魯格爾，一個稀有魚人在海岸邊在營地西面，掉落密斯萊爾墜飾：接取它如果你會合他",
	["Glyphs of Summoning"] = "召喚銘文",
	["Gnarled Thistleshrub"] = "長瘤的灌木獸",
	["Gnarlpine Ambushers hide along the road west of Fel Rock."] = "瘤背伏擊者獸皮沿著道路在地獄石以西。",
	["Gnarlpine Mystics and Ferocitas camp north-east of Starbreeze Village. Ferocitas drops the Gnarlpine Necklace: open it for the jewel."] = "瘤背秘法師與費羅西塔斯營地在星風村以東北。費羅西塔斯掉落瘤背熊怪的項鍊：打開/開啓它給寶石。",
	["Gnarlpine Shamans"] = "瘤背薩滿祭司",
	["Gnarlpine Totem"] = "扭木圖騰",
	["Gnoll Paws"] = "豺狼人的爪子",
	["Gnomeregan"] = "諾莫瑞根",
	["Go back down to Rut'theran Village and fly to Auberdine. The Moonkin Stone stands in the hills just east of the village: use the Cenarion Moondust there, defeat Lunaclaw and speak to the Lunaclaw Spirit."] = "前往返回下前往魯瑟蘭村與飛往前往奧伯丁。梟獸石位於丘陵就在村莊以東：使用塞納里奧月塵那裡，擊敗月爪梟獸與對話前往月爪梟獸的靈魂。",
	["Go back down to Rut'theran Village, take the boat to Auberdine and the boat on to Stormwind Harbor. Bring sixty Silk, sixty Mageweave and sixty Runecloth for Clavicus: buy what you lack at the Auction House."] = "前往返回下前往魯瑟蘭村，乘船前往奧伯丁與船在前往暴風城港口。攜帶60絲綢，60魔紋布與60符文布給克拉維斯·納文哈姆：購買所你缺少在拍賣行。",
	["Go back into southern Desolace; the road continues south into Feralas."] = "前往返回進入南部淒涼之地；道路繼續延伸南進入菲拉斯。",
	["Go back into the Barrens and west through Honor's Stand into the Stonetalon Mountains. Sun Rock Retreat is the Horde town; Stonetalon Peak in the north is Alliance."] = "前往返回進入貧瘠之地與西穿過榮耀崗哨進入石爪山脈。烈日石居是部落城鎮；石爪峰在北面是聯盟。",
	["Go back north into Duskwood and follow its road east through Deadwind Pass (level 50+ creatures off the road) into the Swamp of Sorrows."] = "前往返回北進入暮色森林與沿著道路前往東穿過逆風小徑（50級+ 生物道路兩側）進入悲傷沼澤。",
	["Go back north through the Swamp of Sorrows and west into Deadwind Pass."] = "前往返回北穿過悲傷沼澤與西進入逆風小徑。",
	["Go back west across the Barrens; the road west from Camp Taurajo climbs into Mulgore, tauren country with guards at Bloodhoof Village and Thunder Bluff."] = "前往返回西穿過貧瘠之地；道路西來自陶拉祖營地爬上進入莫高雷，牛頭人領地與衛兵在血蹄村與雷霆崖。",
	["Go east through Elwynn Forest to Three Corners, where Redridge starts. Lakeshire is an Alliance town."] = "前往東穿過艾爾文森林前往三角路口，在赤脊山始於。湖畔鎮是一個聯盟城鎮。",
	["Go through Timbermaw Hold and take the Moonglade branch of the tunnel. Rabine is in Nighthaven."] = "前往穿過木喉要塞與接取月光林地樹枝的隧道。拉比恩·薩圖納是在永夜港。",
	["Go through Timbermaw Hold to its Winterspring exit; Salfa stands just outside. The quests and kills so far usually reach Unfriendly, and then the Timbermaw let you pass. If they still show red, kill more Deadwood by the tunnel first."] = "前往穿過木喉要塞前往它的冬泉谷出口；薩爾法位於就在外部。任務與擊殺因此遠處通常抵達冷淡，與然後木喉允許你穿過。如果它們仍然顯示紅色，擊殺更多死木在旁隧道第一。",
	["Go through the tunnel into Loch Modan. Just past it, a path marked by stones climbs the hills on the right of the road north to Braldir's camp."] = "前往穿過隧道進入洛克莫丹。就在經過它，一個小徑標記的在旁石頭爬上丘陵在右側的道路北前往布拉爾迪爾·灰袍的營地。",
	["Gobbler's Head"] = "高布勒爾的頭顱",
	["Gol'dir"] = "高迪爾",
	["Gold Dust"] = "金砂",
	["Gold Pickup Schedule: Gruff Swiftbite"] = "採金日程表：格魯夫·疾咬",
	["Goldtooth, a named kobold, sits in the back of the Fargodeep Mine's lower level. Defias Bandits around the vineyards drop a Westfall Deed now and then: right-click it."] = "金牙，一個名為狗頭人，位於返回的法戈第礦洞的下層等級。迪菲亞強盜在葡萄園掉落一個周圍西部荒野地契現在與然後：右鍵點擊它。",
	["Golem Oil"] = "傀儡之油",
	["Golm Fragment"] = "高爾姆碎片",
	["Good Luck Charm goes back to Janice Felstone in the Western Plaguelands: keep it."] = "好運護符交回給詹妮絲·費爾斯通在西瘟疫之地：請保留該任務/物品。",
	["Good Luck Other-Half-Charm"] = "好運半邊護符",
	["Gor'marok the Ravager"] = "掠奪者格瑪洛克",
	["Gor'mul"] = "戈穆爾",
	["Gor'tesh"] = "戈泰什",
	["Gor'tesh and the Blackrock orcs hold the camps and the stronghold at the foot of Blackrock Mountain, west of Flame Crest. Pull them one at a time; every orc and worg may drop a medallion, so kill them until you have fifty."] = "戈泰什與黑石殺戮者獸人要塞紮營與要塞在黑石山的底部，在烈焰峰以西。拉怪它們1在一個時間；每個獸人與座狼可能掉落一個勳章，因此擊殺它們直到你有50。",
	["Gorbold Steelhand"] = "高爾博德·鋼手",
	["Gordo, the big abomination, walks the road a little further east. The Gloom Weed grows along the road around him."] = "葛爾多，大憎惡，步行道路一個小更遠處東。陰暗草生長沿著道路周圍他。",
	["Gordunni Brute"] = "戈杜尼蠻兵",
	["Gordunni Shaman"] = "戈杜尼薩滿祭司",
	["Gordunni Warlock"] = "戈杜尼術士",
	["Goretusk Liver"] = "血牙野豬的肝",
	["Goretusk Liver Pie is orange from 50 (yellow at 90, grey at 130): about 52 crafts to 100. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "豬肝餡餅是橙色來自50（黃色在90，灰色在130）：約52製作前往100。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。",
	["Goretusk Snout"] = "血牙野豬的頭",
	["Gorilla Fang"] = "猩猩牙",
	["Gorishi Hive Queen"] = "格里什皇后",
	["Gorishi Scent Gland"] = "格里什資訊素",
	["Gorkas"] = "格卡斯",
	["Gornek"] = "高內克",
	["Gornek waits inside the Den, the building just west of Kaltunk."] = "高內克等候內部獸穴，建築就在卡爾圖克以西。",
	["Gracina Spiritmight in Darnassus: keep it"] = "格拉希娜·靈風在達納蘇斯：請保留該任務/物品",
	["Gracina Spiritmight, beside her"] = "格拉希娜·靈風，旁邊她的",
	["Gracina Spiritmight, in the Temple of the Moon"] = "格拉希娜·靈風，在月神殿",
	["Gracina Spiritmight: keep it for Gadgetzan"] = "格拉希娜·靈風：留到加基森再做",
	["Gray Kodo, 20g"] = "灰色科多獸，20金",
	["Gray Ram, 20g"] = "灰山羊，20金",
	["Grazle, at the south edge of the camp"] = "格拉茲，在營地的南邊緣",
	["Great Brown Kodo, 200g"] = "大型棕色科多獸，200金",
	["Great Cat Spirit"] = "巨豹之靈",
	["Great Goretusk (35%), Goretusk (34%) in Westfall, or wherever the arrow points"] = "巨型血牙野豬（35%），血牙野豬（34%）在西部荒野，或跟隨箭頭指示位置",
	["Great Goretusk Snout"] = "巨型血牙野豬頭",
	["Great Gray Kodo, 200g"] = "大型灰色科多獸，200金",
	["Great Horned Owl, 50s"] = "棕色貓頭鷹，50銀",
	["Great White Kodo, 200g"] = "大型白色科多獸，200金",
	["Greater Duskbats fly over the fields around Brill and along the road north."] = "大型暮蝠飛往越過農田在布瑞爾周圍與沿著道路北。",
	["Greater Lava Spider"] = "巨型熔岩蜘蛛",
	["Greater Plainstrider (33%) in The Barrens, or wherever the arrow points"] = "巨型平原陸行鳥（33%）在貧瘠之地，或跟隨箭頭指示位置",
	["Greater Tarantula"] = "巨型狼蛛",
	["Greater Tarantulas crawl on the slopes around the mill north-east of the lake; Blackrock Renegades hold the mill itself."] = "巨型狼蛛爬行在山坡在磨坊周圍在湖以東北；黑石叛節者要塞磨坊其本身。",
	["Greatmother Hawkwind sits by the tent on the camp's eastern edge; the Water Pitcher stands next to her."] = "鷹風酋長的母親位於帳篷在營地的東部邊緣；水罐位於下一個前往她的。",
	["Green Mechanostrider, 20g"] = "綠色機械陸行鳥，20金",
	["Green Power Crystal"] = "綠色能量水晶",
	["Green Skeletal Warhorse, 200g"] = "綠色骸骨軍馬，200金",
	["Green Sludge"] = "綠色淤泥怪",
	["Gregan Brewspewer, a dwarf, camps in the Lower Wilds north-west of Camp Mojache; he has the elixir."] = "格雷甘·山酒，一個矮人，紮營於低地荒野在莫沙徹營地以西北；他有藥劑。",
	["Gregan's camp lies north of the Twin Colossals. He sells the Videre Elixir once he has his bait."] = "格雷甘·山酒的營地位於北的雙塔山。他出售視靈藥劑一次他有他的魚餌。",
	["Gregor Agamand"] = "格里高·阿加曼德",
	["Gregor Greystone"] = "格雷戈·格雷斯通",
	["Gregor Greystone: keep both for the Plaguelands"] = "格雷戈·格雷斯通：保留兩個給瘟疫之地",
	["Gregor's and Harlo's quests lead to other zones: keep them."] = "格雷戈·格雷斯通的與哈魯·維格索斯的任務通往其他區域：請保留它們。",
	["Grelin Whitebeard"] = "格瑞林·白須",
	["Grelin Whitebeard's Journal"] = "格瑞林·白須的日記",
	["Grelin and Nori Pridedrift camp at the south-west edge of the valley, below the troll cave."] = "格雷林與諾里斯·激流紮營於西南邊緣的山谷，在巨魔洞穴下方。",
	["Grell Earrings"] = "劣魔耳環",
	["Gremlock Pilsnor"] = "格雷姆羅克·匹斯諾爾",
	["Greta Mosshoof"] = "格雷塔·苔蹄",
	["Gretchen Dedmar"] = "格莉絲·戴瑪",
	["Gretta Ganter"] = "格雷塔·甘特",
	["Grif Wildheart"] = "格瑞夫",
	["Grif Wildheart, at the smithy"] = "格瑞夫，在鐵匠鋪",
	["Grik'nir the Cold sits at the back of the troll cave, east of Grelin's camp."] = "冷酷的格瑞克尼爾位於巨魔洞穴的後方，在格雷林的以東營地。",
	["Grimesilt Outhouse Key"] = "格里塞特廁所鑰匙",
	["Grimesilt Outhouse Key, a rare drop"] = "格里塞特廁所鑰匙，稀有掉落",
	["Grimnur Stonebrand, Ironforge"] = "格瑞諾爾·石印，鐵爐堡",
	["Grimtotem Naturalist"] = "恐怖圖騰博學者",
	["Grimtotem Raider"] = "恐怖圖騰襲擊者",
	["Grimtotem Shaman"] = "恐怖圖騰薩滿祭司",
	["Gringer"] = "格林戈",
	["Grish Longrunner"] = "瑞什·遠行者",
	["Grisha"] = "格瑞沙",
	["Grizzled Scalps"] = "灰色頭皮",
	["Grull Hawkwind"] = "格魯爾·鷹風",
	["Grund Drokda"] = "格隆德·德羅克達",
	["Grund Drokda stands in Coldridge Valley by Felix. Gozwin's camp is in the hills to the north-west of him; the Snow Leopard Prowler prowls around it."] = "格隆德·德羅克達位於寒脊山谷在旁菲利克斯。戈茲溫的營地是在丘陵前往在他西北面；雪豹覓食的灰狼潛行遊蕩周圍它。",
	["Grunt Logmar"] = "步兵勞格瑪",
	["Gryan Stoutmantle"] = "格里安·斯托曼",
	["Gryan Stoutmantle and Captain Danuvin stand at the top of the stone tower. Quartermaster Lewis is in the tower, Scout Galiaan and Alba Fairmoon on the south side of the hill, next to the inn and Thor the gryphon master."] = "格里安·斯托曼與丹努文隊長位於石頭哨塔的頂部。軍需官劉易斯是在哨塔內，哨兵加里安與阿爾芭·明月在山丘的南側，在旅店與旁邊索爾獅鷲管理員。",
	["Gryfe"] = "格萊菲",
	["Gryphon Master Talonaxe"] = "獅鷲管理員沙拉克·鷹斧",
	["Gryth Thurden, in the Great Forge"] = "格萊斯·瑟登，在大鍛爐",
	["Gryth Thurden, the Great Forge"] = "格萊斯·瑟登，大鍛爐",
	["Guard Howe"] = "衛兵豪維",
	["Guard Howe, by the gryphons south of the bridge"] = "衛兵豪維，在旁獅鷲在橋以南",
	["Guard Parker"] = "衛兵帕克",
	["Guard Thomas"] = "衛兵托馬斯",
	["Guard Thomas guards the bridge on the road east; Ormin Pelford stands just across it."] = "衛兵托馬斯衛兵橋在路上東；奧爾明·佩爾福德位於就在穿過它。",
	["Gubber Blump"] = "古博·布拉普",
	["Gubber Blump, on the pier: only with Fishing"] = "古博·布拉普，在棧橋上：僅與釣魚",
	["Gurda Ragescar: only if you carry the manual pages"] = "古爾達·怒痕：僅如果你攜帶手冊書頁",
	["Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde"] = "溫尼斯·布萊葛",
	["Gyll, Booty Bay"] = "蓋爾，藏寶海灣",
	["Gyll, on the top floor by the docks"] = "蓋爾，在頂部樓層在旁碼頭",
	["Hadoken Swiftstrider"] = "哈杜肯·迅蹄",
	["Hadoken Swiftstrider: for Zilzibin Drumlore in Orgrimmar, around level 50"] = "哈杜肯·迅蹄：給基爾茲賓·鼓眼在奧格瑞瑪，周圍50級",
	["Hadric Harlson"] = "哈德里克·哈爾森",
	["Hadric stands at Deathguard Linnea's camp."] = "哈德里克·哈爾森位於死亡守衛琳妮婭的營地。",
	["Hagar Lightninghoof"] = "哈加爾·雷蹄",
	["Hagar Lowe"] = "哈加爾·洛維",
	["Halaan Hawk-Eye"] = "哈蘭·鷹眼",
	["Haldarr Felsworn"] = "哈達爾魔僕",
	["Haldarr Satyr"] = "哈達爾薩特",
	["Haldarr Trickster"] = "哈達爾欺詐者",
	["Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility: the Strange Lockbox under the water off the north coast, west of the ruins"] = "水獸敏捷墜飾：奇怪的保險箱在下方水偏離/關閉北海岸，在廢墟以西",
	["Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance: the Strange Lockbox"] = "水獸耐力墜飾：奇怪的保險箱",
	["Half-Eaten Fish"] = "吃了一半的魚",
	["Half-buried Barrel"] = "半埋的大桶",
	["Hall of Thanes and Ruins of Lordaeron are new in Forever. Their bosses, levels and Legacy bracket are not in our data, so tick them off yourself."] = "領主大廳與洛丹倫廢墟是新在永恆服。它們的首領，等級與傳承等級段是暫未收錄於當前數據，因此勾選它們偏離/關閉你自己。",
	["Halpa"] = "哈爾帕",
	["Halpa sells three whistles in Thunder Bluff (50s each); the two ground squirrels are new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "哈爾帕出售3哨子在雷霆崖（50銀每個）；2領地松鼠是新在永恆服。每個寵物物品傳授它的夥伴當你使用它；目標留在勾選隨後。",
	["Hameya hides among the Mossflayer trolls of Zul'Mashar, in the north-east corner."] = "滲透者哈米亞藏身在其中：爛苔暗影獵手巨魔的祖爾瑪夏，在東北面角落。",
	["Hameya's Key"] = "哈米亞的鑰匙",
	["Hamish Bergwort"] = "哈米什·伯格沃特",
	["Hamish Bergwort and Blixie Fitzwink stand at the foot of the tower."] = "哈米什·伯格沃特與布里克西·菲茲溫克位於哨塔的底部。",
	["Hammerfall in the east is the Horde town; Refuge Pointe in the middle is Alliance."] = "落錘鎮在東面是部落城鎮；避難谷地在中間是聯盟。",
	["Hana'zua lies wounded at the foot of the hills north-west of the Den."] = "哈納祖位於受傷的在丘陵北的底部-西的獸穴。",
	["Hanaa Nightwind"] = "哈娜·夜風",
	["Hanaa Nightwind camps south of the Ursera den. The Al'Aketh thugs hold the camp south-west of her; Malduko Cloudcrush stands in its middle."] = "哈娜·夜風紮營南的烏爾塞拉獸穴。奧阿凱斯暴徒要塞營地在她西南面；馬爾杜科·碎雲位於它的中間。",
	["Hanaa waits in Thendal Grove, south-west of the village. The Al'Aketh camp is just beyond her; Malduko Cloudcrush leads it."] = "哈娜·夜風等候於森達爾林地，在村莊以西南。阿爾阿凱斯營地是就在越過她的；馬爾杜科·碎雲通往它。",
	["Hand Unbagwa the fangs and stay by him: he calls three waves of gorillas, then Mokk. Fight them one at a time."] = "上交巫醫安巴格瓦獠牙與留在旁他：他召喚3波次的猩猩，然後莫克。迎戰它們1在一個時間。",
	["Hand him the ten texts you kept"] = "上交他10文本你保留",
	["Hand in the fangs and stay: three waves of gorillas come, Mokk the Savage last. Fight at full health."] = "上交獠牙與留在：3波次的猩猩來到，野蠻的莫克最後。迎戰在完整生命值。",
	["Handful of Stardust"] = "一份星塵",
	["Hands Springsprocket, at the tunnel"] = "漢茲·跳鏈，在隧道",
	["Hansel Heavyhands"] = "漢瑟爾·重拳",
	["Harb Clawhoof"] = "哈布·爪蹄",
	["Harb Clawhoof sells the other colours (200g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "哈布·爪蹄出售其他顏色（200金每個在永恆服客戶端）。購買任意你需要，或無如果坐騎你曾是給予的是1你像。",
	["Harb Clawhoof sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "哈布·爪蹄出售其他顏色（20金每個在永恆服客戶端）。購買任意你需要，或無如果坐騎你曾是給予的是1你像。",
	["Harbinger Balthazad, the Trade Quarter"] = "預言者巴薩扎德，貿易區",
	["Hardened Tortoise Shell"] = "硬化龜殼",
	["Harken Windtotem"] = "哈肯·風之圖騰",
	["Harlo Barnaby, by the north gate"] = "哈爾羅·巴納比，在旁北大門",
	["Harlo Wigglesworth"] = "哈魯·維格索斯",
	["Harry Burlguard"] = "哈里·伯加德",
	["Harry Burlguard: Defensive Stance"] = "哈里·伯加德：防禦姿態",
	["Harvest Watchers"] = "看守傀儡",
	["Harvester's Head"] = "收割者的頭顱",
	["Hatecrest Naga Scale"] = "憎世納迦的鱗片",
	["Hatefury Claw"] = "怨怒薩特的爪子",
	["Hatefury Horn"] = "怨怒薩特的角",
	["Hatescreech and Windmistress Gaedress fly just west of the moonwell, Witchmother Arysa further north."] = "恨鳴與風之主母蓋德蕾絲飛往就在月亮井以西，巫母阿莉薩更遠處北。",
	["Hatescreech's Amulet"] = "恨鳴的護符",
	["Haughty Modiste"] = "傲慢的店主",
	["Havunth's camp sits just west of Cenarion Hold."] = "哈文斯的營地位於就在塞納里奧要塞以西。",
	["Hawk Owl, 50s"] = "黑色貓頭鷹，50銀",
	["He camps by the Writhing Haunt, south-east of Dalson's Tears."] = "他紮營在旁蠕行之禍，在達爾松之淚以東南。",
	["He offers Brutal Armor next: level 30, with pieces all over Kalimdor and the Eastern Kingdoms. Leave it."] = "他提供野蠻護甲下一個：30級，與碎片全部越過卡利姆多與東部王國。可先放著不做。",
	["He runs off to keep Rizzle busy"] = "他通往偏離/關閉前往保留里茲爾繁忙的",
	["He stands by the river west of the farm."] = "他站在旁邊：河流在農場以西。",
	["He stands on Hunter Rise. Each donation wants cloth from your bags; hand them in when you have it, later in the route."] = "他位於獵人高地。每個捐獻需要布料來自你的背包；上交它們在當你有它，在路線稍後階段。",
	["Head east to the Venture Co. research site west of the Sludge Fen. Use the Control Console, close the three valves around the drill, use the console again, then take the Console Key from Tinkerer Sniggles."] = "前往東前往風險投資公司研究地點西的淤泥沼澤。使用控制台，靠近3閥門在演習周圍，使用控制台再次，然後接取控制台鑰匙來自工匠斯尼格斯。",
	["Head north along the western dunes; Dredge Crushers and Stonelash Pincers range from here back toward the hold."] = "前往北沿著西部沙丘；掘泥摧毀者與石鞭巨鉗蠍範圍來自此處返回朝要塞方向。",
	["Head north into Shadowgale Forest. Elegael Thornpaw camps in its east."] = "前往北進入影風森林。艾蕾蓋爾·棘爪紮營於它的東。",
	["Head north into Shadowgale Forest; Elegael camps at its southern edge."] = "前往北進入影風森林；艾蕾蓋爾·棘爪紮營於它的南部邊緣。",
	["Head north out of Lakeshire up the Redridge Canyons to Render's Valley. Blackrock Champions camp in the valley."] = "前往北離開湖畔鎮上赤脊峽谷前往撕裂者山谷。黑石勇士紮營於山谷。",
	["Head north past Go'Shek Farm; the shards glitter on the hill by the Circle of East Binding."] = "前往北經過格沙克農場；碎片閃光在山丘在旁東部禁錮法陣。",
	["Head north to Red Rocks, east of Thunder Bluff. Lorekeeper Raintotem stands at the foot of the rocks; the Bristleback Interlopers dig at the burial ground and the Ancestral Spirit waits on top."] = "前往北前往紅石，在雷霆崖以東。博學者諾拉·暴雨圖騰位於岩石的底部；刺背干涉者挖掘在埋葬領地與先祖之魂等候於頂部。",
	["Head north-west to the hippogryph nests on the western cliffs. Hippogryph Down lies around the nests; the Matriarch patrols among them."] = "前往西北前往角鷹獸巢在西部懸崖。角鷹獸絨羽位於巢周圍；刺喉雌龍巡邏在其中：它們。",
	["Head of Baron Vardus"] = "瓦杜斯男爵的頭顱",
	["Head of Nagaz"] = "納伽茲的頭顱",
	["Head of Urs'anah"] = "烏爾薩娜的頭顱",
	["Head south through the isles. The Loa idols lie all over the southern isles; Voodoo and Hexed Trolls hold them and drop the Hexed Pendants. Zalazane and Minshina's cage are on the southernmost isle."] = "前往南穿過群島。洛阿神靈神像位於全部越過南部群島；巫毒與妖術巨魔要塞它們與掉落妖術掛墜。扎拉贊恩與明希納的籠子是在最南端島。",
	["Head south-west to the West Pylon Watchtower. Peacekeeper Vaaniel is at the top; the Bloody Note lies beside him."] = "前往西南前往西塔水晶哨塔。維和者瓦尼爾是在頂部；染血的便條位於旁邊他。",
	["Head west along the foot of the mountains to the violet dome of Dalaran. Ricter, Alina and Dermot (33-34) stand together inside the crater's eastern rim, Kegan Darkmar (35) a little west of them; each carries one Bloodstone piece. The Shield Guards and Theurgists (31-32) around them drop the Worn Stone Tokens."] = "前往西沿著山腳的山脈前往紫色穹頂的達拉然。瑞克特爾，奧麗娜與德莫特（33-34）位於一起在環形山內的東部邊緣，克甘達瑪（35）一個小在它們西面；每個攜帶1血石碎片。盾牌衛兵與神聖法師（31-32）周圍它們掉落用舊的石雕。",
	["Head west into the Whispering Forest; Hilda and Ephram camp at its edge."] = "前往西進入耳語森林；破城者希爾達與伊弗拉姆·巴巴羅紮營於它的邊緣。",
	["Head west past the camp. Stranglethorn Raptors (33-34) hunt the clearings, and the Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins on the coast: every Bloodscalp can drop a tusk. A Pendant of Myzrael is a very rare drop from them: if one drops, read it."] = "前往西經過營地。荊棘谷迅猛龍（33-34）狩獵空地，與血頂巨魔要塞廢墟在海岸邊：每個血頂可以掉落一個長牙。一個密斯萊爾墜飾是一個非常稀有掉落來自它們：如果1掉落，閱讀它。",
	["Head west to the cave. The Young Night Web Spiders sit outside; the Night Web Spiders and the Webbed Victims are inside."] = "前往西前往洞穴。小夜行蜘蛛坐外部；夜行蜘蛛與被網住的受害者是內部。",
	["Headshrinkers stand deeper in the compound; the Commandos lurk stealthed around it and in the cave. Pick up Green Hills pages as they drop."] = "縮頭者位於更深處在營區；突擊隊員潛伏潛行的周圍它與在洞穴內。拾取/接取綠丘書頁作為它們掉落。",
	["Heart of Flame"] = "烈焰之心",
	["Heart of Mokk"] = "莫克的心臟",
	["Hearth back (or ride north if it is on cooldown)."] = "爐石返回返回（或騎行北如果它是在冷卻時間）。",
	["Hearth or fly back to the Undercity (or go to Orgrimmar), take the zeppelin to Grom'gol Base Camp in Stranglethorn Vale and walk north along the road into Duskwood. Northern Stranglethorn is level 30+ off the road."] = "爐石返回或飛往返回前往幽暗城（或前往奧格瑞瑪），搭乘飛艇前往格羅姆高營地在荊棘谷與步行北沿著道路進入暮色森林。北部荊棘谷是30級+ 道路兩側。",
	["Hearth to Aerie Peak."] = "爐石前往鷹巢山。",
	["Hearth to Bloodhoof Village and ride north to Elder Rise."] = "爐石前往血蹄村與騎行北前往長者高地。",
	["Hearth to Camp Taurajo and fly to Ratchet. Mahren Skyseer camps on the shore north of Ratchet."] = "爐石前往陶拉祖營地與飛往前往棘齒城。瑪倫·星眼紮營在岸邊在棘齒城以北。",
	["Hearth to Feathermoon."] = "爐石前往羽月要塞。",
	["Hearth to Gadgetzan."] = "爐石前往加基森。",
	["Hearth to Menethil and take the boat from the pier to Southshore."] = "爐石前往米奈希爾港與乘船在棧橋上前往南海鎮。",
	["Hearth to Ratchet and fly to Gadgetzan. Buy two Thorium Bars at the Auction House here for Fire Plume Forged."] = "爐石前往棘齒城與飛往前往加基森。購買2瑟銀錠在拍賣行此處給火羽山。",
	["Hearth to Stormwind and train your level 60 spells. This is the end of the leveling route: look at the reputation and dungeon guides next."] = "爐石前往暴風城與訓練你的60級法術。此是盡頭的升級路線：查看在聲望與地下城指南下一個。",
	["Hearth to Thelsamar. The Searing Gorge guide starts at Thorium Point: from here, ride south into the Badlands, west past the Horde town of Kargath and up the trail into the gorge."] = "爐石前往塞爾薩瑪。灼熱峽谷指南始於瑟銀哨塔：來自此處，騎行南進入荒蕪之地，西經過部落城鎮的卡加斯與上小路進入峽谷。",
	["Hearthglen's Scarlets are level 58-60. Ride in to the high point marked on your map, look over the town, and get out."] = "壁爐谷的血色十字軍俘虜是58-60級。騎行在前往高點標記的在你的地圖，查看越過城鎮，與獲取出。",
	["Hearthstone on cooldown? Follow the coast road back south."] = "爐石在冷卻時間? 沿著海岸道路返回南。",
	["Hearthstone on cooldown? Follow the road north-east."] = "爐石在冷卻時間? 沿著道路前往東北。",
	["Hearthstone on cooldown? Ride back north through the Talondeep Path."] = "爐石在冷卻時間? 騎行返回北穿過石爪小徑。",
	["Hearthstone on cooldown? Ride back north-west."] = "爐石在冷卻時間? 騎行返回西北。",
	["Heartswood"] = "同心樹",
	["Heartswood: in Ashenvale, on the way to Desolace"] = "同心樹：在灰谷，在途中前往淒涼之地",
	["Heavy Kodo Stew is orange from 215 (yellow at 240, grey at 280): about 10 crafts to 225. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "科多肉雜燴是橙色來自215（黃色在240，灰色在280）：約10製作前往225。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。",
	["Heavy Kodo Stew is orange from 225 (yellow at 240, grey at 280): about 15 crafts to 240. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "科多肉雜燴是橙色來自225（黃色在240，灰色在280）：約15製作前往240。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。",
	["Heavy Linen Bandage is yellow from 50 (yellow at 50, grey at 100): about 46 crafts to 80. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "厚亞麻繃帶是黃色來自50（黃色在50，灰色在100）：約46製作前往80。繃帶需要無營火：製作它們任何地方。",
	["Heavy Silk Bandage is yellow from 180 (yellow at 180, grey at 240): about 42 crafts to 210. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "厚絲質繃帶是黃色來自180（黃色在180，灰色在240）：約42製作前往210。繃帶需要無營火：製作它們任何地方。",
	["Heavy Stone comes from Iron Deposit nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "沈重的石頭來自鐵礦石採集點（採礦）；此是最密集的簇在數據。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Heavy War Golem"] = "重型作戰傀儡",
	["Heavy War Golems patrol the Cauldron below Kalaran and drop the oil; the Magma and Blazing Elementals drifting among them drop the hearts. The Dark Iron Taskmasters and Slavers drive the slaves on the paths; a Slaver may drop the Grimesilt Outhouse Key: keep it."] = "重型作戰傀儡巡邏於大鍋在卡拉然·溫佈雷下方與掉落油；岩漿與熾熱元素漂浮的在其中：它們掉落心臟。黑鐵工頭與奴隸主驅趕奴隸在小徑；一個奴隸主可能掉落格里塞特廁所鑰匙：請保留該任務/物品。",
	["Heavy War Golems patrol the floor of the Cauldron below Kalaran; Magma Elementals drift among them. Golems and elementals drop the oil, elementals the hearts."] = "重型作戰傀儡巡邏於樓層的大鍋在卡拉然·溫佈雷下方；熔岩元素漂浮在其中：它們。魔像與元素生物掉落油，元素心臟。",
	["Heavy Wool Bandage is yellow from 115 (yellow at 115, grey at 185): about 11 crafts to 125. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "厚絨線繃帶是黃色來自115（黃色在115，灰色在185）：約11製作前往125。繃帶需要無營火：製作它們任何地方。",
	["Heavy Wool Bandage is yellow from 125 (yellow at 115, grey at 185): about 38 crafts to 150. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "厚絨線繃帶是黃色來自125（黃色在115，灰色在185）：約38製作前往150。繃帶需要無營火：製作它們任何地方。",
	["Hecklefang Stalker"] = "亂齒捕獵者",
	["Heglan stands east of Razor Hill, towards the coast."] = "赫格蘭·影眼位於剃刀嶺以東，朝海岸方向。",
	["Heglan stands on the shore east of Razor Hill. The trident, banner and dagger lie on the beach around him."] = "赫格蘭·影眼位於岸邊在剃刀嶺以東。三叉戟，旗幟與匕首位於海灘上周圍他。",
	["Hegnar Rumbleshot"] = "海格納·重槍",
	["Helene Peltskinner"] = "海倫尼·派特斯金納",
	["Helene Peltskinner: skinners only, the pelts are skinned"] = "海倫尼·派特斯金納：剝皮師僅，毛皮是剝皮的",
