	["Henze Faulk"] = "亨茲·法奧克",
	["Her brother Tyranis (36) walks the fortress with the Burning Blade cultists (30-33): pull him alone. The Burning Blade Seer keeps the sceptre in the fortress's main building."] = "她的修士泰拉尼斯（36）步行要塞與火刃邪教徒（30-33）：拉怪他獨自。火刃先知保留節杖在要塞的主建築。",
	["Her house stands on the hill south-east of Darkshire, above the Tranquil Gardens Cemetery."] = "她的房屋位於山丘在夜色鎮以東南，上方靜謐花園墓場。",
	["Her house stands on the hill south-east of Darkshire."] = "她的房屋位於山丘在夜色鎮以東南。",
	["Herald Moonstalker"] = "赫拉德·月行者",
	["Herald Moonstalker and Gracina Spiritmight stand by the Temple of the Moon; fill Eridan's Vial at the moonwell inside."] = "赫拉德·月行者與格拉希娜·靈風站在旁邊：月神殿；裝滿艾瑞丹的瓶子在月亮井處內部。",
	["Herod's records lie in a hut on the compound's west side; his strongbox sits farther east, by the cave mouth."] = "赫洛德的記錄位於一個小屋在營區的西一側；他的保險箱位於更遠處東，在旁洞穴入口/河口。",
	["Heroes of Darrowshire's items lie in the later Plaguelands zones: keep it."] = "達隆郡的英雄的物品位於稍後瘟疫之地區域：請保留該任務/物品。",
	["Hezrul leads the Kolkar on the west shore of Lushwater Oasis, south of Regthar. Hand his head to Regthar on your last Crossroads stop."] = "赫茲魯爾通往科卡爾在甜水綠洲的西岸，在雷戈薩·死門以南。上交他的前往前往雷戈薩·死門在你的最後十字路口停靠。",
	["Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania"] = "塞朵拉·穆瓦丹尼",
