	["Highland Fleshstalkers (36-37) hunt the southern highlands, a pack north of Boulderfist Hall and another on the plain to its west. Pull them one at a time."] = "高地獵獸龍（36-37）狩獵南部高地，一個包在石拳大廳以北與另一個在平原前往它的西。拉怪它們1在一個時間。",
	["Highland Razormaw (72%), Elder Razormaw (67%) in Wetlands, or wherever the arrow points"] = "高地刺喉龍（72%），老刺喉龍（67%）在濕地，或跟隨箭頭指示位置",
	["Highland Striders roam the hills all around Hammerfall; both they and the Thrashers further west drop the eyes."] = "高地闊步龍遊蕩於丘陵全部在落錘鎮周圍；兩個它們與鞭笞者更遠處西掉落眼睛。",
