	["Horde guards: touch the edge of Valley of Trials and move on"] = "部落衛兵：靠近試煉谷邊緣觸發探索即可離開",
	["Horde town: Alliance characters only need to touch its edge (guards)"] = "部落城鎮：聯盟角色只需靠近其邊緣觸發即可（注意衛兵）",
	["Horde town: Alliance characters only need to touch its edge (guards); any one of these names counts"] = "部落城鎮：聯盟角色只需靠近其邊緣觸發即可（注意衛兵）；觸發其中任意一個名稱即可",
	["Horgus' skull lies at Blackwood Lake and Marduk's sword in the Infectis Scar, each where ghosts fight; grown Plaguehounds hunt the plains between."] = "霍古斯的頭顱位於黑木湖與馬杜克的劍在魔刃之痕，每個在幽靈迎戰；種植的瘟疫犬狩獵平原之間。",
	["Horn of the Black Wolf is in the client (20g) but our data has no vendor selling it."] = "黑狼號角是在客戶端（20金）但我們的數據有無商人出售它。",
	["Horn of the Brown Wolf, 20g"] = "暗棕狼號角，20金",
	["Horn of the Dire Wolf, 20g"] = "暗灰狼號角，20金",
	["Horn of the Swift Brown Wolf, 200g"] = "迅捷棕狼號角，200金",
