	["Horn of the Timber Wolf, 20g"] = "棕狼號角，20金",
	["Hornizz Brimbuzzle"] = "霍恩尼茲",
	["Hornizz stands at the edge of the Kodo Graveyard, south-west of Kormek's Hut; Kodo Bones lie among the skeletons."] = "霍恩尼茲位於邊緣的科多獸墳場，在考米克小屋以西南；科多獸骨位於其中：骷髏。",
	["Hornizz waits at the goblin camp on the west side of the Kodo Graveyard."] = "霍恩尼茲等候於地精營地在西一側的科多獸墳場。",
	["Hot Lion Chops is orange from 140 (yellow at 175, grey at 215): about 35 crafts to 175. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "烤獅排是橙色來自140（黃色在175，灰色在215）：約35製作前往175。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。",
	["Hulking Gritjaw Basilisk (level 35-36) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "笨重的砂齶蜥蜴（35-36級）掉落它此處。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Hulking Mountain Lion"] = "巨型山地獅",
	["Huntsman Malkhor's skull lies on a pile below the Vilebranch ruins, his bones on a pile at the foot of Jintha'Alor. The Vessels of Tainted Blood sit on the lower terraces, and Elder Torntusk is held at the top. Keep to the paths: the trolls inside are elite."] = "獵戶馬克霍爾馬爾科爾的頭顱位於一個堆下方邪枝廢墟，他的骨頭在一個堆在辛薩羅的底部。污血容器坐在下層階地，與斷齒長者是持有在頂部。保留前往小徑：巨魔內部為精英。",
	["Huntsman Markhor"] = "獵戶馬克霍爾",
	["Huntsman Radley"] = "獵人萊德雷",
	["Huntsman Radley stands east of the lumber camp; Cavalier Durgen guards the road north-east of Kirsta, toward Hearthglen."] = "獵人萊德雷位於伐木場營地以東；騎士杜爾根衛兵道路在科爾斯塔·迪普沙東以東北，朝壁爐谷方向。",
	["Huntsman Radley walks the Northridge camp east of Kirsta; Cavalier Durgen guards the tower at Hearthglen's southern approach."] = "獵人萊德雷步行北山伐木場營地在科爾斯塔·迪普沙東以東；騎士杜爾根衛兵哨塔在壁爐谷的南部靠近。",
	["Hyusaa Quickbreeze"] = "休薩·疾風",
	["Iaadaria Bitterwind"] = "伊阿達莉亞·苦風",
	["Ice Claw Bear"] = "冰爪熊",
	["Ice Claw Bear: tame it with the Taming Rod"] = "冰爪熊：馴服它與馴獸棒",
	["Ice Thistle yetis live in the hills south of Winterfall Village, Chillwind Chimaeras in the valley toward Everlook."] = "冰薊雪人實測在丘陵在寒水村以南，冰風奇美拉在山谷朝永望鎮方向。",
	["Iceclaw Bear Pendants, from the Frostmane Troll Whelps on the slopes above the camp"] = "冰爪熊墜飾，來自霜鬃巨魔幼崽在山坡在營地上方",
	["Idriana, in the bank"] = "伊迪瑞娜，在銀行內",
	["If you already know the Tarren Mill flight path, fly there and skip this step. Otherwise leave the Undercity and ride south down the road through Silverpine Forest past the Sepulcher and Pyrewood. Where the road turns east into Hillsbrad, Deathstalker Lesh waits at Southpoint Tower."] = "如果你已經知道塔倫米爾飛行點，飛往那裡與跳過此步驟。否則跳過幽暗城與騎行南順著道路穿過銀松森林經過瑟伯切爾與焚木村。在道路交還東進入希爾斯布萊德，亡靈哨兵萊什等候於南點哨塔。",
	["Ilkrud Magthrull's Tome"] = "伊克魯德·瑪格蘇爾之書",
