	["Inside the hold, Troll Chests lie along the tunnels. Ruul Snowhoof is held deep inside: free him and protect him all the way out, then he runs home to Night Run."] = "在要塞內，巨魔箱子位於沿著隧道。魯爾·雪蹄是持有深處內部：解救他與保護他全部路出，然後他通往爐石前往夜道谷。",
