	["Ironforge has no druid trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from Tinker Town to Stormwind and train with Sheldras Moontree."] = "鐵爐堡有無德魯伊訓練師：接取礦道地鐵來自工匠區前往暴風城與訓練與沙德拉斯·月樹。",
	["Ironforge has no druid trainer: take the portal up to Darnassus and train in the Cenarion Enclave, then come back down to Rut'theran Village."] = "鐵爐堡有無德魯伊訓練師：接取傳送門上前往達納蘇斯與訓練在塞納里奧區，然後來到返回下前往魯瑟蘭村。",
	["Ironforge has no druid trainer: train with Sheldras Moontree in Stormwind before the tram."] = "鐵爐堡有無德魯伊訓練師：訓練與沙德拉斯·月樹在暴風城之前地鐵。",
	["Ironforge, where the next guide trains, has no druid trainer"] = "鐵爐堡，在下一個指南訓練，有無德魯伊訓練師",
	["Irontree Stompers"] = "鐵木踐踏者",
	["Isaac Chan, beside her: Training Lesson"] = "艾薩克·陳，旁邊她的：訓練課程",
	["Isha Awak, a big threshadon, swims in the shallows off the Merchant Coast, east of Mahren."] = "依沙瓦克，一個大蛇頸龍，游動在淺灘偏離/關閉商人海岸，在瑪倫·星眼以東。",
	["Ishamuhale, a big Sunscale raptor, hunts the plains north of the road from Ratchet to the Crossroads."] = "伊沙姆哈爾，一個大日鱗迅猛龍，狩獵平原在道路來自以北棘齒城前往十字路口。",
	["Islen Waterseer"] = "水之先知伊斯倫",
	["Islen Waterseer, on the coast north of town"] = "水之先知伊斯倫，在海岸邊在城鎮北面",
	["Islen Waterseer: Healing Stream Totem and your Water Totem"] = "水之先知伊斯倫：治療之泉圖騰與你的水之圖騰",
	["Islen camps on the shore just north of Ratchet."] = "水之先知伊斯倫紮營在岸邊就在棘齒城以北。",
	["Islen waits on the hill south of Ratchet, on your way north."] = "水之先知伊斯倫等候於山丘在棘齒城以南，在你的路北。",
	["It lies by the river north-west of the logging camp."] = "它位於旁河流在伐木營地以西北。",
