	["Jadefire Run is the satyr valley in the north-west, with Xavaric at its far end. He drops the Flute of Xavaric; every Jadefire satyr can drop Jadefire Felbind."] = "碧火小徑是薩特山谷在西北面，與薩瓦里克在它的遠處盡頭。他掉落薩瓦里克長笛；每個碧火薩特可以掉落碧火魔符。",
	["Jadefire Shadowstalker"] = "碧火捕獵者",
