	["Jaedenar Hound"] = "加德納爾惡犬",
	["Jaedenar is the ruined temple north of the glen. Some of its cultists drop a Blood Red Key, about one kill in thirty: it opens Arko'narin's cell in Shadow Hold, the cave at the back. If it drops, clear the way out before you free her; if not, skip her quests."] = "加德納爾是毀壞的神廟在幽谷以北。一些的它的邪教徒掉落一個血紅鑰匙，約1擊殺在30：它開啓亞科納琳的牢房在暗影堡，洞穴在返回。如果它掉落，清理路出之前你解救她的；如果不，跳過她的任務。",
	["James Halloran"] = "詹姆斯·哈洛蘭",
	["James Halloran, by the north gate"] = "詹姆斯·哈洛蘭，在旁北大門",
	["Jang"] = "賈恩",
	["Jang stands on the Booty Bay docks."] = "賈恩位於藏寶海灣碼頭。",
	["Jang, Booty Bay"] = "賈恩，藏寶海灣",
	["Jangdor Swiftstrider"] = "杉多爾·迅蹄",
	["Janice Felstone's farm is the first one east of the Bulwark. Jabbering Ghouls on the farm carry the other half of her charm; Cauldron Lord Bilemaw guards the cauldron in the field."] = "詹妮絲·費爾斯通的農場是第一1東的亡靈壁壘。喋喋不休的食屍鬼在農場攜帶其他一半的她的護符；護鍋者拜爾摩衛兵大鍋在田野。",
	["Janice's Parcel"] = "詹妮絲的包裹",
	["Janice's Parcel, beside the house"] = "詹妮絲的包裹，在房屋旁邊",
	["Janice's ghost wanders by the farmhouse of Felstone Field, west of Andorhal. The Jabbering Ghouls in the field carry the other half of the charm: combine the two halves."] = "詹妮絲·費爾斯通的幽靈遊蕩在旁農舍的費爾斯通農場，在安多哈爾以西。喋喋不休的食屍鬼在田野攜帶其他一半的護符：合成2兩半。",
	["Janice's ghost wanders by the farmhouse of Felstone Field, west of Dalson's Tears; her parcel lies inside."] = "詹妮絲·費爾斯通的幽靈遊蕩在旁農舍的費爾斯通農場，在達爾松之淚以西；她的包裹位於內部。",
	["Jarkal Mossmeld"] = "加卡爾",
	["Jarl lives in the Swamplight Manor south-east of Witch Hill."] = "卡爾住在水光莊園在女巫嶺以東南。",
