	["Jartsam"] = "賈薩姆",
	["Jartsam and Lelanai's sabers are in the Cenarion Enclave's riding grounds in Darnassus. At 40 Jartsam teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Alliance race ride these."] = "賈薩姆與萊拉奈的刃豹是在塞納里奧區的騎行領地在達納蘇斯。在40賈薩姆傳授騎術（100金每暴雪的設計師），與學習它給你一個坐騎。永恆服客戶端允許每個聯盟種族騎行這些。",
	["Jartsam and Lelanai's sabers are in the Cenarion Enclave's riding grounds in Darnassus. At 60 Jartsam teaches Journeyman Riding (1,000g per Blizzard's designers); Blizzard says learning riding grants a mount. The Forever client sells each swift saber for 200g at level 60."] = "賈薩姆與萊拉奈的刃豹是在塞納里奧區的騎行領地在達納蘇斯。在60賈薩姆傳授中級騎術（1,000金每暴雪的設計師）；暴雪說學習騎行獎勵一匹坐騎。永恆服客戶端出售每個迅捷刃豹給200金在60級。",
	["Jartsam, riding trainer"] = "賈薩姆，騎術訓練師",
	["Jason Mathers"] = "賈森·瑪瑟斯",
	["Je'neu Sancrea"] = "耶努薩克雷",
	["Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar, at 27"] = "耶努薩克雷在佐拉姆加，在27",
	["Je'neu offers a Blackfathom Deeps quest next; leave it unless you have a group."] = "耶努薩克雷提供一個黑暗深淵任務下一個；可先放著不做除非你有隊伍。",
	["Jediga"] = "傑迪加",
	["Jekyll Flandring, 200g"] = "耶克里·弗蘭迪，200金",
