	["Jer'kai Moonweaver"] = "耶爾卡·月紋",
	["Jeremiah Payson"] = "傑雷米亞·派森",
	["Jeremiah Payson sells three cockroaches in the Undercity (50s each); the Plagued and Undercity Cockroaches are new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "傑雷米亞·派森出售3蟑螂在幽暗城（50銀每個）；染病的與幽暗城蟑螂是新在永恆服。每個寵物物品傳授它的夥伴當你使用它；目標留在勾選隨後。",
	["Jeremiah Payson, nearby"] = "傑雷米亞·派森，附近",
