	["Jessica Redpath: keep it for Darrowshire"] = "傑希卡·雷德帕斯：留到達隆郡再做",
	["Jessir Moonbow"] = "傑希爾·月弓",
	["Jitters hides in the house at the west end of Raven Hill."] = "基特斯藏身在房屋在烏鴉嶺的西端。",
