	["Jorn Skyseer"] = "喬恩·星眼",
	["Joseph's Wedding Ring, at the monument"] = "約瑟夫的結婚戒指，在紀念碑",
	["Josephine Carson"] = "約瑟芬·卡森",
	["Josephine Carson stands with the Goldshire trainers. Each of her quests hands you a Taming Rod: use it on the beast she names, then bring the rod back to her. Rockhide Boars and Young Forest Bears roam the hills south of the Maclure Vineyards, Gray Forest Wolves the woods east of Crystal Lake."] = "約瑟芬·卡森位於與閃金鎮訓練師。每個的她的任務發放你一個馴獸棒：使用它在野獸她名稱，然後攜帶魔杖返回前往她的。石皮野豬與森林幼熊遊蕩於丘陵南的馬科倫農場，森林灰狼樹林在水晶湖以東。",
	["Journeyman Cooking raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10: the arrow picks the nearest Cooking trainer of your faction."] = "中級烹飪將技能上限提升至150；它需要技能等級50與角色等級10：箭頭會自動指向最近的一位烹飪訓練師的你的陣營。",
	["Journeyman First Aid raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10: the arrow picks the nearest First Aid trainer of your faction. Learn Heavy Linen Bandage on the same visit."] = "中級急救將技能上限提升至150；它需要技能等級50與角色等級10：箭頭會自動指向最近的一位急救訓練師的你的陣營。學習厚亞麻繃帶在相同造訪。",
	["Journeyman Fishing raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10. The arrow picks the nearest Fishing trainer of your faction."] = "中級釣魚將技能上限提升至150；它需要技能等級50與角色等級10。箭頭會自動指向最近的一位釣魚訓練師的你的陣營。",
	["Journeyman Herbalism raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10. The arrow picks the nearest Herbalism trainer of your faction."] = "中級草藥學將技能上限提升至150；它需要技能等級50與角色等級10。箭頭會自動指向最近的一位草藥學訓練師的你的陣營。",
	["Journeyman Mining raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10. The arrow picks the nearest Mining trainer of your faction."] = "中級採礦將技能上限提升至150；它需要技能等級50與角色等級10。箭頭會自動指向最近的一位採礦訓練師的你的陣營。",
	["Journeyman Skinning raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10. The arrow picks the nearest Skinning trainer of your faction."] = "中級剝皮將技能上限提升至150；它需要技能等級50與角色等級10。箭頭會自動指向最近的一位剝皮訓練師的你的陣營。",
	["Journeyman needs character level 10 and Alchemy 50; it raises the cap to 150. Materials for 75-150 are worth about 1g 46s in all."] = "中級需要角色等級10與煉金術50；它將技能上限提升至150。75-150階段所需材料總計約需花費1金46銀。",
	["Journeyman needs character level 10 and Blacksmithing 50; it raises the cap to 150. Materials for 75-150 are worth about 3g 92s in all."] = "中級需要角色等級10與鍛造50；它將技能上限提升至150。75-150階段所需材料總計約需花費3金92銀。",
	["Journeyman needs character level 10 and Enchanting 50; it raises the cap to 150. Materials for 75-150 are worth about 30g in all."] = "中級需要角色等級10與附魔50；它將技能上限提升至150。75-150階段所需材料總計約需花費30金。",
	["Journeyman needs character level 10 and Engineering 50; it raises the cap to 150. Materials for 75-150 are worth about 3g 26s in all."] = "中級需要角色等級10與工程學50；它將技能上限提升至150。75-150階段所需材料總計約需花費3金26銀。",
	["Journeyman needs character level 10 and Leatherworking 50; it raises the cap to 150. Materials for 75-150 are worth about 5g 83s in all."] = "中級需要角色等級10與制皮50；它將技能上限提升至150。75-150階段所需材料總計約需花費5金83銀。",
	["Journeyman needs character level 10 and Tailoring 50; it raises the cap to 150. Materials for 75-150 are worth about 7g 61s in all."] = "中級需要角色等級10與裁縫50；它將技能上限提升至150。75-150階段所需材料總計約需花費7金61銀。",
