	["Junior Apothecary Holland"] = "初級藥劑師霍蘭德",
	["Juvenile Vuldren and Pesky Cirrusflies roam the meadow just south-east of the grove."] = "幼年瓦德倫與惱人的捲雲蠅遊蕩於草地就在樹林以東南。",
	["Kadrak"] = "卡德拉克",
	["Kaela Shadowspear"] = "凱拉·影矛",
	["Kal: Mathrengyl Bearwalker in Darnassus takes it"] = "卡爾：瑪斯雷·馭熊者在達納蘇斯接收該任務",
	["Kalaran stands alone south of Thorium Point, at the edge of the Cauldron. Listen to his story."] = "卡拉然·溫佈雷位於獨自在瑟銀哨塔以南，在大鍋的邊緣。傾聽前往他的故事。",
	["Kalaran stands on the rim of the Cauldron, south of Thorium Point. Listen to his story."] = "卡拉然·溫佈雷位於邊緣的大鍋，在瑟銀哨塔以南。傾聽前往他的故事。",
	["Kaldorei Tome of Summoning"] = "卡多雷召喚魔典",
