	["Kanati Greycloud"] = "卡納提·灰雲",
	["Kar Stormsinger and Harb Clawhoof's kodos are in Bloodhoof Village, Mulgore. At 40 Kar Stormsinger teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Horde race ride these."] = "卡爾·雷歌與哈布·爪蹄的科多獸是在血蹄村，莫高雷。在40卡爾·雷歌傳授騎術（100金每暴雪的設計師），與學習它給你一個坐騎。永恆服客戶端允許每個部落種族騎行這些。",
	["Kar Stormsinger and Harb Clawhoof's kodos are in Bloodhoof Village, Mulgore. At 60 Kar Stormsinger teaches Journeyman Riding (1,000g per Blizzard's designers); Blizzard says learning riding grants a mount. The Forever client sells each great kodo for 200g at level 60."] = "卡爾·雷歌與哈布·爪蹄的科多獸是在血蹄村，莫高雷。在60卡爾·雷歌傳授中級騎術（1,000金每暴雪的設計師）；暴雪說學習騎行獎勵一匹坐騎。永恆服客戶端出售每個巨型科多獸給200金在60級。",
	["Kar Stormsinger, riding trainer"] = "卡爾·雷歌，騎術訓練師",
