	["Kargal Battlescar"] = "卡加爾·戰痕",
	["Kargath in the west is the Horde town."] = "卡加斯在西面是部落城鎮。",
	["Kargath is the Horde fortress built into the cliffs at the zone's western edge."] = "卡加斯是部落要塞建於進入懸崖在區域的西部邊緣。",
	["Karl Boran, on the pier north of the inn"] = "卡爾·波蘭，在棧橋上在旅店以北",
	["Karl Boran: for Captain Stoutfist in the keep"] = "卡爾·波蘭：給斯托菲隊長在要塞內",
