	["Katar"] = "卡塔爾",
	["Katie Hunter"] = "凱蒂·亨特",
	["Katie Hunter sells the other colours (200g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "凱蒂·亨特出售其他顏色（200金每個在永恆服客戶端）。購買任意你需要，或無如果坐騎你曾是給予的是1你像。",
	["Katie Hunter sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "凱蒂·亨特出售其他顏色（20金每個在永恆服客戶端）。購買任意你需要，或無如果坐騎你曾是給予的是1你像。",
