	["Kebok, in the tavern"] = "科博克，在酒館內",
	["Keep Auntie Marlene: Marlene lives at Sorrow Hill in the Western Plaguelands."] = "保留瑪萊恩姑媽：瑪萊恩·雷德帕斯住在悔恨嶺在西瘟疫之地。",
	["Keep Jes'rimon's payment and Ag'tor's Betrayed: they go back to Valormok on a later visit."] = "保留傑斯雷蒙的報酬與阿格圖·血拳的叛徒：它們返回瓦羅莫克在後續再來時。",
	["Keep Larion's Marvon's Workshop and Linken's letter for later guides."] = "保留拉瑞安的瑪爾馮的車間與林克的信件給稍後指南。",
	["Keep Linken's Memory: Eridan Bluewind is at the Emerald Sanctuary, on the next guide's way through Felwood."] = "保留林克的記憶：艾瑞丹·藍風是在翡翠聖地，在下一個指南的路穿過費伍德森林。",
	["Keep Little Pamela: Pamela is in Darrowshire, visited again later."] = "保留小帕米拉：帕米拉是在達隆郡，造訪再次稍後。",
	["Keep Seeking Spiritual Aid: Islen Waterseer is in the Barrens."] = "保留水之魂的幫助：水之先知伊斯倫是在貧瘠之地。",
	["Keep Speak to Salfa for Winterspring."] = "保留與薩爾法交談給冬泉谷。",
	["Keep Sunken Temple for Marvon in Tanaris."] = "保留沈沒的神廟給馬馮在塔納利斯。",
	["Keep The Stone Circle: Marvon's chest is opened on a later visit."] = "保留石環：馬馮的箱子是打開在後續再來時。",
	["Keep Tinkee's letter: Felnok Steelspring is in Everlook, Winterspring."] = "保留丁奇·斯迪波爾的信件：菲諾克是在永望鎮，冬泉谷。",
	["Keep capturing flags in Warsong Gulch."] = "保留佔領旗幟在戰歌峽谷。",
	["Keep clearing the Molten Core until Exalted."] = "保留空地熔火之心直到崇拜。",
	["Keep east on the road. Torek waits south-west of the Warsong lumber camp. He and his grunts storm the Silverwing Outpost: let them take aggro and stay with Torek until Duriel Moonfire is dead."] = "保留東在路上。托雷克等候西南的戰歌信使伐木場營地。他與他的步兵風暴銀翼前哨站：允許它們接取引怪與留在與托雷克直到杜瑞爾·月火是死亡的。",
	["Keep farming the Twilight camps. Wearing the Twilight Trappings (the Twilight cultist set plus a Medallion of Station, from Aurel Goldleaf's Medallion of Station quest) lets you summon Abyssal Templars at the Wind Stones; their Abyssal Crests go to Bor Wildmane."] = "保留農場暮光紮營。佩戴暮光裝飾（暮光邪教徒設置外加一個階級勳章，來自奧蕾爾·金葉的階級勳章任務）允許你召喚深淵聖殿騎士在風石頭；它們的深淵紋章前往鮑爾·蠻鬃。",
	["Keep filling Waylaid Crates for Dokimi until Exalted."] = "保留裝滿被劫的貨箱給多基米直到崇拜。",
	["Keep filling Waylaid Crates for Dokimi."] = "保留裝滿被劫的貨箱給多基米。",
	["Keep filling Waylaid Crates for Marcy Baker until Exalted."] = "保留裝滿被劫的貨箱給瑪茜·貝克直到崇拜。",
	["Keep filling Waylaid Crates for Marcy Baker."] = "保留裝滿被劫的貨箱給瑪茜·貝克。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Darkspear Trolls is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布直到暗矛巨魔是崇拜。符文布：黑暗教徒與暗影法師（58-60級）在東瘟疫之地，或拍賣行。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Darnassus is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布直到達納蘇斯是崇拜。符文布：黑暗教徒與暗影法師（58-60級）在東瘟疫之地，或拍賣行。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Gnomeregan Exiles is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布直到諾莫瑞根流亡者是崇拜。符文布：黑暗教徒與暗影法師（58-60級）在東瘟疫之地，或拍賣行。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Ironforge is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布直到鐵爐堡是崇拜。符文布：黑暗教徒與暗影法師（58-60級）在東瘟疫之地，或拍賣行。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Orgrimmar is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布直到奧格瑞瑪是崇拜。符文布：黑暗教徒與暗影法師（58-60級）在東瘟疫之地，或拍賣行。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Stormwind is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布直到暴風城是崇拜。符文布：黑暗教徒與暗影法師（58-60級）在東瘟疫之地，或拍賣行。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Thunder Bluff is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布直到雷霆崖是崇拜。符文布：黑暗教徒與暗影法師（58-60級）在東瘟疫之地，或拍賣行。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Undercity is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布直到幽暗城是崇拜。符文布：黑暗教徒與暗影法師（58-60級）在東瘟疫之地，或拍賣行。",
	["Keep handing in Additional Runecloth, 20 Runecloth at a time. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House."] = "保留上交在更多的符文布，20符文布在一個時間。符文布：黑暗教徒與暗影法師（58-60級）在東瘟疫之地，或拍賣行。",
	["Keep her alive until she is out of the cave"] = "保留她的存活直到她是離開洞穴",
	["Keep it: Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill, a later guide"] = "請保留該任務/物品：藥劑師林度恩在塔倫米爾，一個稍後指南",
	["Keep it: Gan'rul in Orgrimmar, at the end of this guide"] = "請保留該任務/物品：甘魯爾·血眼在奧格瑞瑪，在盡頭的此指南",
	["Keep it: Gregan in Feralas brews the elixir later"] = "請保留該任務/物品：格雷甘·山酒在菲拉斯釀造藥劑稍後",
	["Keep it: Rilli Greasygob stands outside Orgrimmar; a later guide hands it in"] = "請保留該任務/物品：雷里·格里斯高布位於奧格瑞瑪外；一個稍後指南發放它在",
	["Keep it: Senani Thunderheart in Ashenvale, next guide"] = "請保留該任務/物品：塞娜尼·雷心在灰谷，下一個指南",
	["Keep it: Thork at the Crossroads"] = "請保留該任務/物品：索克在十字路口",
	["Keep it: the Hillsbrad coast, later on the route"] = "請保留該任務/物品：希爾斯布萊德海岸，稍後在路線",
	["Keep it: the Spring Well is beside Tarren Mill"] = "請保留該任務/物品：靈魂之井是在塔倫米爾旁邊",
	["Keep north on the road. The Warsong Scout waits at the Warsong lumber camp, south of Splintertree."] = "保留北在路上。戰歌斥候等候於戰歌信使伐木場營地，在碎木崗哨以南。",
	["Keep north on the road; the chest lies in the Uldaman dig site, at the foot of the ruins north-west of the road."] = "保留北在路上；箱子位於奧達曼挖掘地點，在廢墟的底部在道路以西北。",
	["Keep north to Sar'theris Strand. The Oracles stand among the other naga at its north end; pull one at a time."] = "保留北前往薩瑟里斯海岸。神諭者位於其中：其他納迦在它的北盡頭；拉怪1在一個時間。",
	["Keep playing Arathi Basin. On Call to Arms: Arathi Basin weekends the Alliance Brigadier General in the capitals takes three Arathi Basin Marks of Honor for extra reputation."] = "保留遊玩阿拉希盆地。在短兵相接：阿拉希盆地週末聯盟准將在主城接收3阿拉希盆地馬克的榮譽給額外聲望。",
	["Keep playing Arathi Basin. On Call to Arms: Arathi Basin weekends the Horde Warbringer in the capitals takes three Arathi Basin Marks of Honor for extra reputation."] = "保留遊玩阿拉希盆地。在短兵相接：阿拉希盆地週末部落戰爭使者在主城接收3阿拉希盆地馬克的榮譽給額外聲望。",
	["Keep playing Arathi Basin; wins with many bases held pay the most."] = "保留遊玩阿拉希盆地；獲勝與許多基地持有獎勵大多數。",
	["Keep playing Warsong Gulch and capturing flags. On Call to Arms: Warsong Gulch weekends the Alliance Brigadier General in the capitals takes three Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor for extra reputation."] = "保留遊玩戰歌峽谷與佔領旗幟。在短兵相接：戰歌峽谷週末聯盟准將在主城接收3戰歌峽谷榮譽獎章給額外聲望。",
	["Keep playing Warsong Gulch and capturing flags. On Call to Arms: Warsong Gulch weekends the Horde Warbringer in the capitals takes three Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor for extra reputation."] = "保留遊玩戰歌峽谷與佔領旗幟。在短兵相接：戰歌峽谷週末部落戰爭使者在主城接收3戰歌峽谷榮譽獎章給額外聲望。",
	["Keep riding north into Duskwood, then east along the road through Deadwind Pass. Stonard lies in the reeds south of the road."] = "保留騎行北進入暮色森林，然後東沿著道路穿過逆風小徑。斯通納德位於蘆葦在道路以南。",
	["Keep riding west to the coast. The Coast Crawl Deepseers and Snapclaws on the beaches drop OOX-22/FE's distress beacon about one kill in forty: if one drops, use it to start the quest."] = "保留騎行西前往海岸。海灘龍蝦人先知與海灘利爪龍蝦人在海灘掉落自動導航機器人OOX-22/FE的求救信標約1擊殺在40：如果1掉落，使用它前往開始任務。",
	["Keep running Stratholme and Scholomance and turning in every Corruptor's Scourgestone at Light's Hope Chapel until Exalted."] = "保留刷斯坦索姆與通靈學院與交還在每個墮落者的天災石在聖光之願禮拜堂直到崇拜。",
	["Keep running the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj and turning in Abyssal Council insignia until Exalted."] = "保留刷安其拉廢墟與交還在深淵議會徽記直到崇拜。",
	["Keep the Book of Aquor, the claws and the heart he hands back"] = "保留阿奎爾之書，爪與心臟他發放返回",
	["Keep the bait: Lar'korwi is level 56, and the second loop passes his lair."] = "保留魚餌：拉克維是56級，與第二環線經過他的巢穴。",
	["Keep the branch: Nara Wildmane is in Thunder Bluff."] = "保留樹枝：納拉·蠻鬃是在雷霆崖。",
	["Keep the deliveries for Magatha, Jes'rimon and Andron Gant: you pass Thunder Bluff, Orgrimmar and the Undercity later."] = "保留遞送物給瑪加薩·野性圖騰，傑斯雷蒙與安德隆·甘特：你穿過雷霆崖，奧格瑞瑪與幽暗城稍後。",
	["Keep the parcel: Royal Overseer Bauhaus is in the Undercity."] = "保留包裹：皇家管理人巴哈烏斯是在幽暗城。",
	["Keep turning in Molten Core materials and Dark Iron Ore at Lokhtos until Exalted."] = "保留交還在熔火之心材料與黑鐵礦石在洛克圖斯直到崇拜。",
	["Keep turning in feathers and beads until Exalted."] = "保留交還在羽毛與串珠直到崇拜。",
	["Keep west on the road to Donova's camp beside the hot springs."] = "保留西在路上前往多諾瓦的營地在熱溫泉旁邊。",
	["Keep winning Alterac Valley. More Armor Scraps (Murgot Deepforge), Storm Crystals for Arch Druid Renferal (they summon Ivus the Forest Lord) and Frostwolf Hides for the Stormpike Ram Rider Commander all repeat."] = "保留獲勝奧特蘭克山谷。護甲碎片（莫高特·深爐），風暴水晶給大德魯伊雷弗拉爾（它們召喚森林之王伊弗斯）與霜狼毛皮給雷矛山羊騎兵指揮官全部重復。",
	["Keep winning Alterac Valley. More Booty! (Smith Regzar), Stormpike Soldier's Blood for Primalist Thurloga (it summons Lokholar the Ice Lord) and Alterac Ram Hides for the Frostwolf Wolf Rider Commander all repeat."] = "保留獲勝奧特蘭克山谷。取之於敵（鐵匠雷格薩），聯盟士兵的血給指揮官瑟魯加（它召喚冰雪之王洛克霍拉）與奧特蘭克山羊皮給霜狼騎兵指揮官全部重復。",
	["Keeper Bel'varil"] = "看守者貝瓦里爾",
	["Keeshan hides at the very north end of the valley, by the Burning Steppes border. Escort him down to Lakeshire; Blackrock orcs ambush you on the way."] = "基沙恩下士藏身在非常北盡頭的山谷，在旁燃燒平原邊界。護送他下前往湖畔鎮；黑石殺戮者獸人伏擊你在途中。",
	["Kegan Darkmar"] = "克甘達瑪",
	["Keldran"] = "科爾丹",
	["Kelm Hargunth hands out one Outrider care package by level"] = "凱爾姆·哈古斯發放1前鋒照料包裹在旁等級",
	["Ken'zigla lives in Malaka'jin, the troll village just inside Stonetalon at the end of the road west from Regthar."] = "肯茲格拉住在瑪拉卡金，巨魔村莊就在石爪山脈內在道路西來自的端雷戈薩·死門。",
	["Kerlonian Evershade: his escort to Maestra's Post is done on the Ashenvale leg"] = "克羅尼亞·恆影：他的護送前往邁斯特拉崗哨已完成在灰谷腿",
	["Kerlonian sleeps at the Grove of the Ancients in southern Darkshore. Use the Horn of Awakening to wake him and lead him south along the road into Ashenvale to Liladris Moonriver at Maestra's Post; blow the horn again whenever he falls asleep."] = "克羅尼亞·恆影沈睡於在古樹之林在南部黑海岸。使用喚醒號角前往喚醒他與引導他南沿著道路進入灰谷前往利拉迪斯·月河在邁斯特拉崗哨；吹響角再次每當他墜落睡著的。",
	["Kernda, at the tunnel mouth"] = "克爾達，在隧道入口/河口",
	["Kernda, just inside the cave: only from Neutral with the Timbermaw"] = "克爾達，就在洞穴內：僅來自中立與木喉",
	["Kernda: the Timbermaw speak to you only from Neutral"] = "克爾達：木喉對話前往你僅來自中立",
	["Khadgar's Essays on Dimensional Convergence"] = "卡德加的空間收斂研究筆記",
	["Khaelyn Steelwing"] = "凱琳·斯蒂文",
	["Khaz Modan Iron"] = "卡茲莫丹鐵錠",
	["Khaz Modan Timber"] = "卡茲莫丹木材",
	["Kibler stands at Flame Crest in northern Burning Steppes, near the Blackrock Mountain path."] = "基佈雷爾位於烈焰峰在北部燃燒平原，附近黑石山小徑。",
	["Kildar and Ogunaro Wolfrunner's kennel are in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor. At 40 Kildar teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Horde race ride these."] = "基爾達與奧古納羅的獸欄是在奧格瑞瑪的榮譽谷。在40基爾達傳授騎術（100金每暴雪的設計師），與學習它給你一個坐騎。永恆服客戶端允許每個部落種族騎行這些。",
	["Kildar and Ogunaro Wolfrunner's kennel are in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor. At 60 Kildar teaches Journeyman Riding (1,000g per Blizzard's designers); Blizzard says learning riding grants a mount. The Forever client sells each swift wolf for 200g at level 60."] = "基爾達與奧古納羅的獸欄是在奧格瑞瑪的榮譽谷。在60基爾達傳授中級騎術（1,000金每暴雪的設計師）；暴雪說學習騎行獎勵一匹坐騎。永恆服客戶端出售每個迅捷狼給200金在60級。",
	["Kildar, riding trainer"] = "基爾達，騎術訓練師",
	["Kill Rabid Thistle Bears in the hills east of Auberdine, then walk up to the furbolg camp south-east of them: nothing to kill yet."] = "擊殺狂暴薊熊在丘陵在奧伯丁以東，然後步行上前往熊怪營地在它們東南面：無獎勵前往擊殺尚。",
	["Kill a Firelord, a Molten Giant, an Ancient Core Hound and a Lava Surger in the Molten Core. Every Molten Core elemental and boss also counts toward the Waterlords."] = "擊殺一個火焰之王，一個熔核巨人，一個上古熔火惡犬與一個熔岩奔騰者在熔火之心。每個熔火之心元素與首領也計入朝水元素領主方向。",
	["Kill and skin Adult Plainstrider (6), Battleboar (3), Elder Plainstrider (8), Flatland Cougar (7), Flatland Prowler (9), Kodo Calf (7), Mountain Cougar (3), Plainstrider (1), Prairie Stalker (7), Prairie Wolf (5), Prairie Wolf Alpha (9) along the loop until Skinning 50; skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 1-10."] = "擊殺與剝皮成年平原陸行鳥（6），鬥豬（3），老平原陸行鳥（8），平原獅（7），平原徘徊者（9），小科多獸（7），山獅（3），平原陸行鳥（1），草原捕食者（7），草原狼（5），草原狼前鋒（9）沿著環線直到剝皮50；剝皮最高-等級野獸你的技能允許。一個野獸的等級 L 需要技能（L-10）x10上前往20級與 ×5上方。區域1-10級。",
	["Kill and skin Armored Scorpid (7), Bloodtalon Scythemaw (8), Bloodtalon Taillasher (6), Clattering Scorpid (5), Dire Mottled Boar (6), Dreadmaw Crocolisk (9), Durotar Tiger (7), Elder Mottled Boar (8), Mottled Boar (1), Scorpid Worker (3), Thunder Lizard (9), Venomtail Scorpid (9) along the loop until Skinning 50; skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 1-10."] = "擊殺與剝皮硬甲蠍（7），血爪銳齒龍（8），血爪鞭尾龍（6），巨鉗蠍（5），可怕的雜斑野豬（6），巨齒鰐魚（9），杜隆塔爾猛虎（7），老雜斑野豬（8），雜斑野豬（1），蠍子（3），雷霆蜥蜴（9），毒尾蠍（9）沿著環線直到剝皮50；剝皮最高-等級野獸你的技能允許。一個野獸的等級 L 需要技能（L-10）x10上前往20級與 ×5上方。區域1-10級。",
	["Kill and skin Coyote (10), Coyote Packleader (11), Young Goretusk (12), Goretusk (14), Great Goretusk (16, needs 60) along the loop until Skinning 100; skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 10-20."] = "擊殺與剝皮山狗（10），山狗首領（11），幼年血牙野豬（12），血牙野豬（14），巨型血牙野豬（16，需要60）沿著環線直到剝皮100；剝皮最高-等級野獸你的技能允許。一個野獸的等級 L 需要技能（L-10）x10上前往20級與 ×5上方。區域10-20級。",
