	["Kill the elementals for 5 Intact Elemental Bracers, then use the Divining Scroll"] = "擊殺元素給5完整的元素護腕，然後使用占卜捲軸",
	["Kill the mobs that drop it at the farm spot Polestar picks for your level and faction. The Auction House works too."] = "擊殺怪物該掉落它在農場地點 Polestar 指向給你的等級與陣營。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Killing Onyxia is a point. In Classic her lair needs an attunement: Drakefire Amulet for the Alliance, Blood of the Black Dragon Champion for the Horde."] = "擊殺奧妮克希亞是一個點。在經典舊世她的巢穴需要一個門任務：龍火護符給聯盟，黑龍勇士之血給部落。",
	["Kim'Jael's Compass"] = "基姆加爾的指南針",
	["Kim'Jael's Scope"] = "基姆加爾的望遠鏡",
	["Kim'Jael's Stuffed Chicken"] = "基姆加爾的燒雞",
	["Kim'Jael's Wizzlegoober"] = "基姆加爾的花生",
	["Kim'jael camps at the Legashi Encampment in the north; his equipment lies all over the Thalassian Base Camp just south-east of him."] = "基姆加爾紮營於雷加什營地在北面；他的裝備位於全部越過薩拉斯營地就在他東南面。",
	["Kin'weelay"] = "肯維雷",
	["Kindal Moonweaver"] = "辛達爾·月紋",
	["Kinelory"] = "基恩洛",
	["Kirsta's last task needs level 53. The Scarlet Knights and Magi (54-55) working the lumber camp just south-west of her are the closest camp."] = "科爾斯塔·迪普沙東的最後任務需要53級。血色騎士與法師（54-55）有效的伐木場營地就在她西南面是最近的營地。",
	["Klannoc Macleod"] = "克蘭諾克·馬克雷德",
	["Klannoc Macleod: Berserker Stance"] = "克蘭諾克·馬克雷德：狂暴姿態",
	["Klaven Mortwake's Journal, in the chest"] = "克拉文·摩特維克的日記，在箱子",
	["Knights and magi work the Northridge Lumber Camp; the medics and hunters camp south of it."] = "騎士與法師有效北山伐木場；醫療兵與獵人營地在它南面。",
	["Kobold Diggers"] = "狗頭人掘地工",
	["Kobold Geomancer"] = "狗頭人地卜師",
	["Kobold Laborer"] = "狗頭人苦力",
	["Kobold Laborers work the tunnels inside the mine. Shinyfinder Narf waits down the second turn on the right."] = "狗頭人苦力有效隧道在採礦內。尋寶者納夫等候下第二交還在右側。",
	["Kobold Vermin"] = "狗頭人歹徒",
	["Kobold Vermin dig in the vineyards north-east of the Abbey. Now and then one drops a Nibbled-On Book: right-click it."] = "狗頭人歹徒挖掘在葡萄園在修道院以東北。現在與然後1掉落一個被啃過的書：右鍵點擊它。",
	["Kobold Worker"] = "狗頭人勞工",
	["Kodo Bone"] = "科多獸骨",
	["Kodos: Harb Clawhoof, beside Kar Stormsinger in Bloodhoof Village."] = "科多獸：哈布·爪蹄，在卡爾·雷歌旁邊在血蹄村。",
	["Kolkar Crag lies west of Sen'jin. The three attack plans sit on the ground among the centaur tents. Pal'juh is held at the crag as well."] = "科卡爾峭壁位於森金村以西。3攻擊圖紙坐在領地在其中：半人馬帳篷。帕爾朱是持有在峭壁作為水井。",
	["Kolkar Wranglers and Stormers hold the camps south of Regthar."] = "科卡爾牧民與峭壁雷鳴蜥蜴要塞紮營在雷戈薩·死門以南。",
	["Kolkar centaur (level 30-33) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "科卡爾半人馬（30-33級）掉落它此處。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Kor'geld"] = "考吉爾德",
	["Kor'geld and Yelmak run the alchemy shop in the Drag; Whuut is next door."] = "考吉爾德與耶爾瑪克前往煉金術商店在暗巷區；伍特是下一個門。",
	["Kor'gresh, an ogre mage, holds the cave at the southern end of the Witherbark valley."] = "科格雷什，一個食人魔法師，持有洞穴在南部盡頭的枯木山谷。",
	["Korran"] = "科蘭",
	["Korran: the eggs are in the Field of Giants, later"] = "科蘭：蛋是在巨人曠野，稍後",
	["Krakle sends you to Donova Snowden in Winterspring: keep it."] = "克拉蘭克派你前往多諾瓦·雪山在冬泉谷：請保留該任務/物品。",
	["Krakle the goblin sits at Golakka Hot Springs, just east of the pylon."] = "克拉蘭克地精位於葛拉卡溫泉，就在水晶塔以東。",
	["Kranal Fiss stands on the ridge north of the Razormane camp, east of the Crossroads."] = "卡納爾·菲斯位於山脊北的刺鬃營地，東的十字路口。",
	["Kranal Fiss stands on the ridge north of the Razormane camp."] = "卡納爾·菲斯位於山脊北的刺鬃營地。",
	["Krang Stonehoof's quest: beat three Novice Warriors (or players in duels) next to him."] = "克朗·石蹄的任務：擊敗3新戰士（或玩家在決鬥）下一個前往他。",
	["Kravel Koalbeard"] = "克拉維爾·濃須",
	["Krazek"] = "克拉茲克",
	["Krazek's missing hunters' camp is Nesingwary's: walk among its tents and the investigation completes. River Crocolisks lie along the river below the camp."] = "克拉茲克的失蹤的獵人的營地是赫米特·奈辛瓦里二世的：步行在其中：它的帳篷與調查完成。淡水鰐位於沿著河流在營地下方。",
	["Krazek, in the tavern"] = "克拉茲克，在酒館內",
	["Krazek: for Tran'rek in Gadgetzan"] = "克拉茲克：給特蘭雷克在加基森",
	["Krazek: for Tran'rek in Tanaris, keep it"] = "克拉茲克：給特蘭雷克在塔納利斯，請保留該任務/物品",
	["Kreldig Ungor"] = "克雷迪格·安戈爾",
	["Kreldig's next task, Karnitol's Satchel, is a drop on the far coast: skip it."] = "克雷迪格·安戈爾的下一個任務，卡尼托的背包，是一個掉落在對岸：跳過即可。",
	["Krinkle Goodsteel"] = "克林科·古德斯迪爾",
	["Krinkle Goodsteel in Gadgetzan: keep it"] = "克林科·古德斯迪爾在加基森：請保留該任務/物品",
	["Krog"] = "克羅格",
	["Krolg, a furbolg untouched by the corruption, sits south of the road below Mystral Lake."] = "克羅爾格，一個熊怪未受污染的在旁腐化，位於道路下方以南密斯特拉湖。",
	["Krom'Grul walks the caves and mine tunnels of Dreadmaul Rock; if he isn't home, clear the ogres around the entrances until he comes back."] = "克羅格魯爾步行洞穴與採礦隧道的巨槌石；如果他不是爐石，清理食人魔在入口直到他來自返回周圍。",
	["Krueg Skullsplitter"] = "克魯伊格·碎顱",
	["Krusk"] = "克魯斯克",
	["Krusk: for the Barrens, later on the route"] = "克魯斯克：給貧瘠之地，稍後在路線",
	["Kum'isha waits at the Rise of the Defiler, the hill south-west of the keep. The Blasted Lands mobs on the way drop the Imperfect Draenethyst Fragments; bring her what you have."] = "我的最愛家庫米沙等候於污染者高地，山丘在保留以西南。詛咒之地怪物在途中掉落不完美的德萊尼水晶碎片；攜帶她的所你有。",
	["Kuray'bin stands at the lumber camp. The night elf Outrunners stalk the woods south-east of it; they stealth, so watch for them."] = "庫萊比位於伐木場營地。夜晚精靈斥候潛伏樹林在它東南面；它們潛行，因此守望給它們。",
	["Kurzen Commando"] = "庫爾森特種兵",
	["Kurzen Headshrinker"] = "庫爾森精神醫師",
	["Kurzen Jungle Fighter"] = "庫爾森叢林戰士",
	["Kurzen's Mystery: four troll legends"] = "庫爾森的秘密：4巨魔傳說",
	["Kzan stands behind the Den, on its west side."] = "克贊·荊條位於後面獸穴，在它的西一側。",
	["Laden Dew Gland"] = "飽滿的露水腺",
	["Lady Jaina Proudmoore"] = "吉安娜·普羅德摩爾",
	["Lady's Tear Moss grows around Elegael's camp and Shriekings fly over it. The Al'Aketh camp east of her holds the Bloody Heirloom."] = "女神之淚苔蘚生長在艾蕾蓋爾·棘爪的周圍營地與尖嘯幼體飛往越過它。阿爾阿凱斯營地在她東面持有染血的傳家寶。",
	["Lago Blackwrench: Gakin the Darkbinder in Stormwind takes it"] = "拉戈·黑鉗：黑暗縛靈者加科因在暴風城接收該任務",
	["Laird"] = "萊爾德",
	["Laird's fish stall is by the docks. Then take the boat to Stormwind."] = "萊爾德的釣魚攤位是在旁碼頭。然後乘船前往暴風城。",
	["Lakota Windsong"] = "拉克塔·風歌",
	["Lanie Reed"] = "蘭尼·瑞德",
	["Lar Prowltusk"] = "拉爾·獵齒",
	["Lar'korwi's lair is just south of the pylon. Use Torwa's bait there; Lar'korwi is level 56 and hits hard, so start at full health."] = "拉克維的巢穴是就在水晶塔以南。使用托爾瓦的魚餌那裡；拉克維是56級與攻擊困難，因此開始在完整生命值。",
	["Lar'korwi's lair lies in the jungle north of Torwa, below the eastern cliffs: use Torwa's Pouch there. Lar'korwi is level 56: start at full health."] = "拉克維的巢穴位於叢林在托爾瓦以北，在東部懸崖下方：使用托爾瓦的麻袋那裡。拉克維是56級：開始在完整生命值。",
	["Lard"] = "拉爾德",
	["Large Candles"] = "大蠟燭",
	["Large Crag Boar: tame it with the Taming Rod"] = "大峭壁野豬：馴服它與馴獸棒",
	["Large Leather Backpacks"] = "大型皮背包",
	["Large Opal comes from Rich Thorium Vein nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "大貓眼石來自富瑟銀礦採集點（採礦）；此是最密集的簇在數據。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Large Opal comes from Small Thorium Vein nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "大貓眼石來自軟泥覆蓋的瑟銀礦脈採集點（採礦）；此是最密集的簇在數據。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Large River Crocolisk Skin"] = "淡水鰐的皮",
	["Large Stone Slab"] = "大石片",
	["Larion"] = "拉瑞安",
	["Laris Geardawdle"] = "拉里斯·空輪",
	["Laris Geardawdle: the oozes are in Felwood, keep it"] = "拉里斯·空輪：軟泥怪是在費伍德森林，請保留該任務/物品",
	["Lars"] = "拉爾斯",
	["Lashtail Raptor"] = "鞭尾迅猛龍",
	["Latronicus Moonspear"] = "拉托尼庫斯·月矛",
	["Latronicus Moonspear, at the top of the stronghold"] = "拉托尼庫斯·月矛，在要塞的頂部",
	["Laurna Morninglight"] = "勞爾娜·晨光",
	["Laurna Morninglight: Priestess Alathea in Darnassus takes it"] = "勞爾娜·晨光：女祭司阿蘭希雅在達納蘇斯接收該任務",
	["Lead Dalinda out of the fortress; she walks off once you are clear of it. Vahlarriel takes the turn-in at Nijel's Point at the end of the guide."] = "引導黛琳達·瑪雷姆離開要塞；她自行離開一次你是清理的它。瓦拉里爾·屠魔者負責交接該任務在尼耶爾前哨站在本指南末尾。",
	["Lead Ringo north to Marshal's Refuge. When he faints, use Spraggle's Canteen on him to wake him."] = "引導林格北前往馬紹爾營地。當他昏迷，使用斯普拉格的水壺在他前往喚醒他。",
	["Lean Venison is orange from 110 (yellow at 150, grey at 190): about 15 crafts to 125. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "瘦鹿肉是橙色來自110（黃色在150，灰色在190）：約15製作前往125。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。",
	["Lean Venison is orange from 125 (yellow at 150, grey at 190): about 25 crafts to 150. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "瘦鹿肉是橙色來自125（黃色在150，灰色在190）：約25製作前往150。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。",
	["Learn the Auberdine flight path on the hill south of the inn, then cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven; the Great Bear Spirit sits in the woods to the north-west. Learn the Moonglade flight path in Nighthaven and fly to Rut'theran Village (by way of Auberdine)."] = "學習奧伯丁飛行點在山丘在旅店以南，然後施放傳送：月光林地。德迪利特·星焰是在永夜港；巨熊之靈位於樹林向西北。學習月光林地飛行點在永夜港與飛往前往魯瑟蘭村（在旁路的奧伯丁）。",
	["Leatherworking runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 1g 7s in all."] = "制皮可隨升級同步練習升級。永恆服傳承系統獎勵製作專業在技能等級150，225與300（中級，高級與大師級上限），因此以上每個階段節點均計入進度。1-75階段所需材料總計約需花費1金7銀。",
	["Leave Deathknell by the road north-east. Calvin Montague stands by the farmhouse at the Solliden Farmstead."] = "跳過喪鐘鎮在路邊東北。卡爾文·蒙泰古站在旁邊：農舍在索利丹農場。",
	["Leave Dun Morogh east through the gate tunnel; it opens into Loch Modan at Algaz Station."] = "跳過丹莫羅東穿過大門隧道；它開啓進入洛克莫丹在奧加茲崗哨。",
	["Leave Mulgore by the south-eastern pass and follow the road to the Crossroads."] = "跳過莫高雷在旁南-東部穿過與沿著道路前往前往十字路口。",
	["Leave Orgrimmar by the main gate; the zeppelin tower stands just north-east of it. Take the Undercity zeppelin."] = "跳過奧格瑞瑪在旁主大門；飛艇哨塔位於就在它東北面。接取幽暗城飛艇。",
	["Leave Stormwind by the main gate, go south to Goldshire and east along the road to the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch. Surena Caledon (level 9) stands by its farmhouse."] = "跳過暴風城在旁主大門，前往南前往閃金鎮與東沿著道路前往布拉克威爾南瓜田。蘇倫娜·凱爾東（9級）站在旁邊：它的農舍。",
	["Leave the Undercity and ride east along the road through Tirisfal Glades to the Bulwark, the Forsaken fort on the border."] = "跳過幽暗城與騎行東沿著道路穿過提瑞斯法林地前往亡靈壁壘，被遺忘者堡壘在邊界。",
	["Leave the Undercity and ride east along the road through Tirisfal Glades, past the Bulwark. Felstone Farm is the first farm along the road; Janice waits in the house."] = "跳過幽暗城與騎行東沿著道路穿過提瑞斯法林地，經過亡靈壁壘。詹妮絲·費爾斯通農場是第一農場沿著道路；詹妮絲·費爾斯通等候於房屋。",
	["Leave the Undercity by the lift and walk up through the ruins to the zeppelin towers; the Grom'gol zeppelin is the one on the south-west tower."] = "跳過幽暗城在旁升降梯與步行上穿過廢墟前往飛艇哨塔；格羅姆高飛艇是1在西南哨塔。",
	["Leave town by the tunnel and follow the coast north; the letter lies in the Bloodsail camp on the beach, where \"Pretty Boy\" Duncan walks."] = "跳過城鎮在旁隧道與沿著海岸北；信件位於血帆營地在海灘上，在帥小伙子鄧肯步行。",
	["Leave town by the tunnel; the note lies in the pirates' cove just north of Booty Bay."] = "跳過城鎮在旁隧道；說明位於海盜的小灣就在藏寶海灣以北。",
	["Lee Brown"] = "李·布朗",
	["Legacki: Sprinkle and Quixxil come later"] = "萊加奇：斯普琳科與奎克希爾來到稍後",
	["Legacy Points are account-wide: each Legacy Challenge (a class reaching 25, 45 and 60, professions, PvP, exploring) is worth one. The Progress Track gives the Replica Ironforge Air Rifle at 15, the Spectral Bear Cub at 25, the Spectral Bear Tabard at 40 and the Reins of the Spectral Bear at 55. How rewards are delivered is not known yet (perhaps by mail); this goal ticks once the cub is in your bags."] = "傳承點數是賬號通用：每個傳承挑戰（一個職業抵達25，45與60，專業，PvP，探索）是價值1。進度追蹤給予複製品鐵爐堡氣步槍在15，幽靈幼熊在25，幽靈熊戰袍在40與幽靈熊繮繩在55。如何獎勵是送達是不已知尚（或許在旁郵件）；此目標一旦滿足即勾選：幼崽是在你的背包。",
	["Legacy Points are account-wide: each Legacy Challenge (a class reaching 25, 45 and 60, professions, PvP, exploring) is worth one. The Progress Track gives the Replica Ironforge Air Rifle at 15, the Spectral Bear Cub at 25, the Spectral Bear Tabard at 40 and the reins at 55. How rewards are delivered is not known yet (perhaps by mail); this goal ticks once the reins are in your bags."] = "傳承點數是賬號通用：每個傳承挑戰（一個職業抵達25，45與60，專業，PvP，探索）是價值1。進度追蹤給予複製品鐵爐堡氣步槍在15，幽靈幼熊在25，幽靈熊戰袍在40與繮繩在55。如何獎勵是送達是不已知尚（或許在旁郵件）；此目標一旦滿足即勾選：繮繩是在你的背包。",
	["Lelanai"] = "萊拉奈",
	["Lelanai sells the other colours (200g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "萊拉奈出售其他顏色（200金每個在永恆服客戶端）。購買任意你需要，或無如果坐騎你曾是給予的是1你像。",
	["Lelanai sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "萊拉奈出售其他顏色（20金每個在永恆服客戶端）。購買任意你需要，或無如果坐騎你曾是給予的是1你像。",
	["Lelanai: other colours, 20g"] = "萊拉奈：其他顏色，20金",
