	["Lieutenant Karter sells the mounts in the Champions' Hall in Stormwind's Old Town, beside the other honor quartermasters such as Officer Areyn. The Forever client lists each at 100g; choose one."] = "卡特爾中尉出售坐騎在黑石勇士的大廳在暴風城的舊城區，在其他榮譽軍需官此類作為旁邊埃雷恩。永恆服客戶端列出每個在100金；選擇1。",
	["Lieutenant Rotimer"] = "洛泰姆中尉",
