	["Lil Timmy sells the White Kitten (60s). He walks around the city, so the waypoint is only one point on his path; look along the nearby streets if he is not there. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "利爾·迪米出售白貓（60銀）。他步行在主城周圍，因此路徑點是僅1點在他的小徑；查看沿著附近街道如果他是不那裡。每個寵物物品傳授它的夥伴當你使用它；目標留在勾選隨後。",
	["Liladris Moonriver"] = "利拉迪斯·月河",
	["Linen Bandage is orange from 1 (yellow at 30, grey at 60): about 61 crafts to 50. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "亞麻繃帶是橙色來自1（黃色在30，灰色在60）：約61製作前往50。繃帶需要無營火：製作它們任何地方。",
