	["Liv Rizzlefix: keep it for Un'Goro"] = "莉芙·雷茲菲克斯：留到安戈洛環形山再做",
	["Liv's workshop is at the north end of Ratchet's docks; Marvon's Chest stands inside it."] = "莉芙的工坊是在棘齒城的北端碼頭；瑪爾馮的箱子位於內部它。",
	["Living Rot spoils within ten minutes: kill the town's Scourge quickly and grind the seven pieces with the Mortar and Pestle at once."] = "生命腐質戰利品內部10分鐘：擊殺城鎮的天災軍團迅速與刷怪7碎片與研鉢和搗杵一次性。",
	["Loch Frenzy (50%) in Loch Modan, or wherever the arrow points"] = "洛克湖狂魚（50%）在洛克莫丹，或跟隨箭頭指示位置",
