	["Loh'atu"] = "羅哈圖",
	["Lokhtos Darkbargainer trades in the Grim Guzzler inside Blackrock Depths. His Favor Amongst the Brotherhood turn-ins take Dark Iron Ore (mined from Dark Iron Deposits with Mining), Blood of the Mountain, Fiery Core, Lava Core and Core Leather. Lothos Riftwaker at the Blackrock Mountain entrance offers attunement to the Molten Core."] = "羅克圖斯·暗契可兌換在布萊德·長須黑鐵酒吧在黑石殺戮者內深淵。他的兄弟會的好感交任務接取黑鐵礦石（開採的來自黑鐵礦礦脈與採礦），山脈之血，熾熱之核，熔岩之核與熔火犬皮。洛索斯·天痕在黑石山入口提供門任務前往熔火之心。",
