	["Meggi Peppinrocker"] = "麥吉·貝比羅克",
	["Meilosh, if you have thirty Runecloth"] = "梅羅什，如果你有30符文布",
	["Meilosh: keep 30 Runecloth for him; he trades only at Neutral with the Timbermaw"] = "梅羅什：保留30符文布給他；他可兌換僅在中立與木喉",
	["Meilosh: thirty Runecloth, handed in when you pass through again at 57"] = "梅羅什：30符文布，上交當你穿過穿過再次在57",
	["Melithar Staghelm, by the path"] = "麥利薩爾·鹿盔，在旁小徑",
	["Melizza is held in the centaur camp west of the graveyard. Free her and keep her alive on the walk out; she stops by the graveyard."] = "梅麗薩是持有在半人馬營地在墓地以西。解救她的與保留她的存活在步行出；她停靠在旁墓地。",
	["Melor Stonehoof"] = "梅洛·石蹄",
	["Mercutio Filthgorger is elite: grouping up is advised"] = "米庫提奧·污血為精英：建議組隊前往",
	["Merrin Rockweaver"] = "麥琳·石紋",
	["Meven Korgal stands at the south end of the Scarlet farm."] = "邁文·考加爾位於南盡頭的血色農場。",
