	["Milton Sheaf, in the Royal Library"] = "米爾頓·西弗，在皇家圖書館",
	["Milton Sheaf, the Royal Library in Stormwind Keep"] = "米爾頓·西弗，皇家圖書館在暴風城要塞",
	["Milton Sheaf, the Royal Library in the keep"] = "米爾頓·西弗，皇家圖書館在要塞內",
	["Mine every Copper (1, green), Tin (65, orange), Silver (from 75) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 125. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 10-20."] = "採礦每個銅礦（1，綠色），錫礦（65，橙色），銀色（來自75）採集點你穿過與法陣路徑點直到採礦125。熔煉礦石在一個鍛爐當你的背包裝滿：熔煉也提升採礦。區域10-20級。",
	["Mine every Copper (1, green), Tin (65, orange), Silver (from 75) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 125. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 10-25."] = "採礦每個銅礦（1，綠色），錫礦（65，橙色），銀色（來自75）採集點你穿過與法陣路徑點直到採礦125。熔煉礦石在一個鍛爐當你的背包裝滿：熔煉也提升採礦。區域10-25級。",
	["Mine every Copper (1, green), Tin (65, orange), Silver (from 75) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 125. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 15-25."] = "採礦每個銅礦（1，綠色），錫礦（65，橙色），銀色（來自75）採集點你穿過與法陣路徑點直到採礦125。熔煉礦石在一個鍛爐當你的背包裝滿：熔煉也提升採礦。區域15-25級。",
	["Mine every Copper (1, green), Tin (65, orange), Silver (from 75) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 125. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 20-30."] = "採礦每個銅礦（1，綠色），錫礦（65，橙色），銀色（來自75）採集點你穿過與法陣路徑點直到採礦125。熔煉礦石在一個鍛爐當你的背包裝滿：熔煉也提升採礦。區域20-30級。",
	["Mine every Copper (1, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 50. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 1-10."] = "採礦每個銅礦（1，橙色）採集點你穿過與法陣路徑點直到採礦50。熔煉礦石在一個鍛爐當你的背包裝滿：熔煉也提升採礦。區域1-10級。",
	["Mine every Copper (1, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 50. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 10-20."] = "採礦每個銅礦（1，橙色）採集點你穿過與法陣路徑點直到採礦50。熔煉礦石在一個鍛爐當你的背包裝滿：熔煉也提升採礦。區域10-20級。",
	["Mine every Copper (1, yellow) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 65. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 1-10."] = "採礦每個銅礦（1，黃色）採集點你穿過與法陣路徑點直到採礦65。熔煉礦石在一個鍛爐當你的背包裝滿：熔煉也提升採礦。區域1-10級。",
	["Mine every Copper (1, yellow) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 65. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 10-20."] = "採礦每個銅礦（1，黃色）採集點你穿過與法陣路徑點直到採礦65。熔煉礦石在一個鍛爐當你的背包裝滿：熔煉也提升採礦。區域10-20級。",
	["Mine every Dark Iron (230, yellow), Truesilver (230, yellow), Small Thorium (245, yellow), Rich Thorium (275, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 300. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 50-58."] = "採礦每個黑鐵礦（230，黃色），真銀礦（230，黃色），富瑟銀（245，黃色），富瑟銀礦（275，橙色）採集點你穿過與法陣路徑點直到採礦300。熔煉礦石在一個鍛爐當你的背包裝滿：熔煉也提升採礦。區域50-58級。",
	["Mine every Gold (155, green), Mithril (175, green), Dark Iron (230, orange), Truesilver (230, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 245. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 43-50."] = "採礦每個金幣（155，綠色），秘銀（175，綠色），黑鐵礦（230，橙色），真銀礦（230，橙色）採集點你穿過與法陣路徑點直到採礦245。熔煉礦石在一個鍛爐當你的背包裝滿：熔煉也提升採礦。區域43-50級。",
	["Mine every Gold (155, green), Mithril (175, green), Truesilver (230, orange), Small Thorium (245, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 275. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 45-55."] = "採礦每個金幣（155，綠色），秘銀（175，綠色），真銀礦（230，橙色），富瑟銀（245，橙色）採集點你穿過與法陣路徑點直到採礦275。熔煉礦石在一個鍛爐當你的背包裝滿：熔煉也提升採礦。區域45-55級。",
	["Mine every Iron (125, green), Gold (155, orange), Mithril (175, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 200. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 35-45."] = "採礦每個鐵（125，綠色），金幣（155，橙色），秘銀（175，橙色）採集點你穿過與法陣路徑點直到採礦200。熔煉礦石在一個鍛爐當你的背包裝滿：熔煉也提升採礦。區域35-45級。",
	["Mine every Iron (125, green), Gold (155, yellow), Mithril (175, yellow) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 230. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 35-45."] = "採礦每個鐵（125，綠色），金幣（155，黃色），秘銀（175，黃色）採集點你穿過與法陣路徑點直到採礦230。熔煉礦石在一個鍛爐當你的背包裝滿：熔煉也提升採礦。區域35-45級。",
	["Mine every Silver (75, green), Iron (125, yellow), Gold (155, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 175. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 35-45."] = "採礦每個銀色（75，綠色），鐵（125，黃色），金幣（155，橙色）採集點你穿過與法陣路徑點直到採礦175。熔煉礦石在一個鍛爐當你的背包裝滿：熔煉也提升採礦。區域35-45級。",
	["Mine every Tin (65, green), Silver (75, green), Iron (125, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 155. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 18-30."] = "採礦每個錫礦（65，綠色），銀色（75，綠色），鐵（125，橙色）採集點你穿過與法陣路徑點直到採礦155。熔煉礦石在一個鍛爐當你的背包裝滿：熔煉也提升採礦。區域18-30級。",
	["Mine every Tin (65, green), Silver (75, green), Iron (125, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 155. Smelt the ore at a forge when your bags fill: smelting also raises Mining. Zone level 30-40."] = "採礦每個錫礦（65，綠色），銀色（75，綠色），鐵（125，橙色）採集點你穿過與法陣路徑點直到採礦155。熔煉礦石在一個鍛爐當你的背包裝滿：熔煉也提升採礦。區域30-40級。",
	["Miniaturization Residue"] = "微縮殘渣",
