	["Mining: smelt Thorium Ore (or the Auction House)"] = "採礦：熔煉瑟銀礦石（或從拍賣行購買）",
	["Minion's Scourgestone"] = "爪牙的天災石",
	["Minor Ice Elemental"] = "次級冰元素",
	["Minor Ice Elementals drift around the frozen lake by the refuge. The three rifles are in the snow around it."] = "次級冰元素漂浮在冰凍的湖在旁營地周圍。3步槍是在雪周圍它。",
	["Minor Manifestation of Earth"] = "大地之魂",
	["Minor Manifestation of Earth, on Spirit Rock"] = "大地之魂，在靈魂石",
	["Minor Manifestation of Water"] = "水之魂",
	["Mirefin Head"] = "泥鰭小魚",
	["Misha Tor'kren lives in the farmstead south of Thunder Ridge. Kron's Amulet drops from the Death Flayers and Venomtail Scorpids on the ridge."] = "米莎·托克倫住在農莊在雷霆山以南。克魯恩的護身符掉落來自死亡剝皮者與毒尾蠍在山脊。",
	["Misha's hut stands south of the lizards. The crocolisks along the Southfury River to the west carry Kron's Amulet."] = "米莎的小屋位於蜥蜴以南。鰐魚沿著怒水河向西攜帶克魯恩的護身符。",
	["Missionary Jasaan"] = "傳教士賈薩恩",
	["Missionary Jasaan waits at the entrance to Falaath Village, south of Shen'dar. The Mark of Akir lets you walk in among the faithful."] = "傳教士賈薩恩等候在法拉斯村入口處，在辛達爾以南。馬克的阿基爾允許你步行在其中：信徒。",
	["Mist Veil's Lockbox"] = "迷霧之紗號的保險箱",
	["Mistina Steelshield"] = "米斯蒂娜·鋼盾",
	["Mistina Steelshield takes cloth for Ironforge in Ironforge. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "米斯蒂娜·鋼盾接收布料給鐵爐堡在鐵爐堡。第一捐獻的毛料，絲綢，魔紋布與符文布（60布料每個）已完成一次與交給大多數聲望每布料；之後它們，更多的符文布可重復直到崇拜。崇拜與另一個種族的主城允許你購買該種族的坐騎。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["Mistvale Giblets"] = "薄霧谷猩猩的內臟",
	["Mitsuwa"] = "米蘇瓦",
	["Modr Fragment"] = "莫德爾碎片",
	["Mokvar then offers your class's Saving the Best for Last, the final upgrade of the dungeon set."] = "莫克瓦爾然後提供你的職業的把最好的留到最後，最終升級的地下城設置。",
	["Mokvar, Orgrimmar"] = "莫克瓦爾，奧格瑞瑪",
	["Molten Core clears carry the rest. Bosses always count; in Classic, trash kills stop giving Waterlords reputation partway up, so late on the bosses do the work."] = "熔火之心清理攜帶其餘。首領總是計入；在經典舊世，雜物擊殺停靠給予水元素領主聲望半途上，因此後期在首領做有效。",
	["Molten Core materials: Favor Amongst the Brotherhood, Fiery Core, Lava Core, Core Leather and Blood of the Mountain, all repeatable at Lokhtos."] = "熔火之心材料：兄弟會的好感 - 熾熱之核，熔岩之核，熔火犬皮與山脈之血，全部可重復在洛克圖斯。",
	["Monster Omelet is orange from 240 (yellow at 265, grey at 305): about 105 crafts to 300. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "超級煎蛋捲是橙色來自240（黃色在265，灰色在305）：約105製作前往300。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。",
	["Moon Priestess Amara"] = "哨兵阿瑪拉·夜行者",
	["Moon Priestess Amara, on the road west of the village"] = "哨兵阿瑪拉·夜行者，在路上在村莊以西",
	["Moonstalker Fangs"] = "月夜猛虎的牙齒",
	["Moonstalker Sires prowl the woods around the glaive. The Scrying Bowl and the Twilight Tome sit at the bottom of the crater; Therylune stands on its north side."] = "月夜雄虎遊蕩樹林在之劍周圍。占卜之碗與暮光密典坐在環形山的底部；瑟瑞露尼位於它的北一側。",
	["Moonstalkers prowl the hills between Bashal'Aran and the tower. Buzzbox 323 stands on the hill west of the tower; Grizzled Thistle Bears roam around it."] = "月夜猛虎遊蕩丘陵在巴莎蘭與哨塔之間。傳聲盒323號位於山丘在哨塔以西；灰斑薊熊遊蕩周圍它。",
	["Moontouched Feather"] = "月光羽毛",
	["Moora"] = "米萊恩",
	["Moora, Salia and Shadow Lord Fel'dan wait at the back of Shadow Hold, the cave in Jaedenar's north. Clear the tunnel as you go."] = "米萊恩，薩莉亞與暗影領主費爾丹等待在暗影堡的後方，洞穴在加德納爾的北。清理隧道沿途順路。",
	["Mor'rogal, beside Maggran"] = "摩羅加爾，在馬格蘭旁邊",
	["More Vile Fin murlocs walk the shore just north of the outpost."] = "更多邪鰭魚人步行岸邊就在前哨站以北。",
	["Morgan Stern"] = "摩根·斯特恩",
	["Morgan Stern stands near the inn; Helenia Olden, a trade supplier a few steps south, sells the spices Jarl wants."] = "摩根·斯特恩位於旅店附近；海倫妮亞·奧德恩，一個商業供應商一個少量台階南，出售香料卡爾需要。",
	["Morin camps by the Winterhoof Water Well south-east of Bloodhoof."] = "摩林·雲行者紮營在旁冰蹄水井在血蹄以東南。",
	["Mosshide Fenrunners and Mistweavers roam the riverbanks just west and south of Rethiel; almost every one drops flint."] = "蘚皮沼澤行者與織霧者遊蕩於河岸就在西與在綠色守衛者雷希耶爾以南；幾乎每個1掉落燧石。",
	["Mosshide Gnoll"] = "蘚皮豺狼人",
	["Mosshide Gnolls and Mongrels hold the hills south-east of the Green Belt."] = "蘚皮豺狼人與雜種豺狼人要塞丘陵東南的綠帶草地。",
	["Mosshide Mongrel"] = "混血蘚皮豺狼人",
	["Most Hinterlands mobs can drop OOX-09/HL's beacon (about 1-2.5% per kill in our data)."] = "大多數辛特蘭怪物可以掉落 OOX-09/HL型定位器的信標（約1-2.5%每擊殺在我們的數據）。",
	["Most Tanaris mobs can drop OOX-17/TN's beacon (about 0.5-3% per kill in our data)."] = "大多數塔納利斯怪物可以掉落 OOX-17/TN型定位器的信標（約0.5-3%每擊殺在我們的數據）。",
	["Mote of Myzrael"] = "密斯萊爾之塵",
	["Motega Firemane"] = "莫特加·火鬃",
	["Motega's next quest, Sacred Fire, ends in Thunder Bluff, off this route. Skip it."] = "莫特加·火鬃的下一個任務，神聖之火，終結於雷霆崖，不在本路線內。跳過即可。",
	["Mottled Raptor"] = "雜斑迅猛龍",
	["Mottled Raptors and Screechers roam the hills west of the excavation site."] = "雜斑迅猛龍與血沼尖嘯龍遊蕩於丘陵在挖掘場地點以西。",
	["Mottled Razormaw"] = "雜斑刺喉龍",
	["Mottled Screecher"] = "雜斑尖嘯龍",
	["Mottled Scytheclaw"] = "雜斑鐮爪龍",
	["Mottled Worgs prowl the hills around the house. Then walk south along the lake shore: the Vile Fin Shredders and Tidehunters there drop the murloc eyes."] = "雜斑座狼遊蕩丘陵在房屋周圍。然後步行南沿著湖岸邊：邪鰭切割者與潮汐獵手那裡掉落魚人眼睛。",
	["Mound of Dirt"] = "一堆泥土",
	["Mound of loose dirt"] = "鬆散的土堆",
	["Mount Hyjal is reached from Winterspring through Darkwhisper Gorge in the south. It is Forever's endgame leveling zone."] = "海加爾山是可抵達來自冬泉谷穿過暗語峽谷在南面。它是永恆服的滿級後升級區域。",
	["Mountain Cougars prowl the hills south of the camp."] = "山獅遊蕩丘陵在營地以南。",
	["Mountain Lion"] = "山地獅",
	["Mountaineer Barleybrew"] = "巡山人維拉特·麥酒",
	["Mountaineer Gretchen"] = "巡山人格雷琴",
	["Mountaineer Thalos"] = "巡山人薩魯斯",
	["Mountaineer Thalos guards the tunnel out of the valley, east of Anvilmar."] = "巡山人薩魯斯衛兵隧道離開山谷，在安威瑪爾以東。",
	["Mountaineer Thalos, at the Coldridge tunnel"] = "巡山人薩魯斯，在寒脊山谷隧道",
	["Mrs. Dalson's Diary"] = "達爾松夫人的日記",
	["Mudcrush Durtfeet"] = "馬德克拉什",
	["Mudcrush Durtfeet, at the south edge of the village"] = "馬德克拉什，在村莊的南邊緣",
	["Muglash walks north up the strand to a naga brazier. Put the brazier out, then guard him through the naga waves until Vorsha is dead."] = "穆格拉什步行北上海灘前往一個納迦火盆。放置火盆出，然後守衛他穿過納迦波次直到沃沙是死亡的。",
	["Muglash: starts his escort at once"] = "穆格拉什：始於他的護送一次性",
	["Muigin"] = "穆爾金",
	["Muiredon Battleforge"] = "穆里頓·熱爐",
	["Mulgris stands by the farm at the Writhing Haunt, north-east of the fields."] = "穆格雷斯·深水站在旁邊：農場在蠕行之禍，在農田以東北。",
	["Mull Thunderhorn"] = "穆爾·雷角",
	["Mull Thunderhorn, for Hamuul in Thunder Bluff"] = "穆爾·雷角，給大德魯伊哈繆爾·符文圖騰在雷霆崖",
	["Muln Earthfury, by the landing: for Turak Runetotem in Thunder Bluff"] = "穆恩·大地之怒，在旁陸地：給圖拉克·符文圖騰在雷霆崖",
	["Mura Runetotem"] = "茉拉·符文圖騰",
	["Mura Runetotem: the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest, next guide"] = "茉拉·符文圖騰：瑟伯切爾在銀松森林，下一個指南",
	["Murdaloc"] = "莫達洛克",
	["Murgot Deepforge: More Armor Scraps"] = "莫高特·深爐：護甲碎片",
	["Murkdeep"] = "莫克迪普",
	["Murkdeep camps on the beach west of the glaive: kill the murlocs at the camp fire; he comes in the third wave with his hound. Three beached remains lie on the beaches south of Remtravel's Excavation."] = "莫克迪普紮營在海灘上在之劍以西：擊殺魚人在營地營火；他來自在第三波次與他的獵犬。3擱淺的遺骸位於海灘在雷姆塔維爾挖掘場以南。",
	["Murloc"] = "魚人",
	["Murloc Coastrunners and Raiders line the beach north of the mine. They flee at low health: pull one at a time."] = "灘行魚人與狼騎兵波爾克路線海灘在採礦以北。它們逃跑在低生命值：拉怪1在一個時間。",
	["Murloc Eye"] = "魚人的眼球",
	["Murloc Fin"] = "魚人的鰭",
	["Murloc Flesheaters and Tidecallers line the south shore east of the bridge. Any of them can carry a Spotted Sunfish or a fin."] = "魚人食腐者與潮汐召喚者路線南岸邊在橋以東。任意的它們可以攜帶一個斑點太陽魚或一個魚鰭。",
	["Murloc Foragers and Lurkers line the river south of the bridge. Morgan the Collector, a Defias, walks the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch west of it. Finish the Prowlers and Young Forest Bears on the way."] = "魚人強盜與潛伏者路線河流在橋以南。收貨人莫根，一個迪菲亞，步行布拉克威爾南瓜田在它西面。完成覓食的灰狼與森林幼熊在途中。",
	["Murloc Head"] = "魚人的頭顱",
	["Murloc Streamrunner"] = "魚人士兵",
	["Murlocs and Murloc Streamrunners hold the east shore; the Junk Piles lie in their camp."] = "魚人與魚人士兵要塞東岸邊；垃圾堆位於它們的營地。",
	["Mydrannul"] = "邁德蘭努爾",
	["Myriaal Mistwake"] = "米莉亞爾·霧痕",
	["Mysterious Red Crystal"] = "神秘的紅色水晶",
	["Mysterious Relic"] = "神秘遺物",
	["Mystery Goo: Donova Snowden in Winterspring, keep it"] = "神秘的粘液：多諾瓦·雪山在冬泉谷，請保留該任務/物品",
	["Mystic Yayo'jin"] = "秘法師雅爾金",
	["Nafien waits at the north end of Felwood"] = "納菲恩等候在費伍德森林的北端",
	["Nafien waits in northern Felwood at the tunnel into Timbermaw Hold."] = "納菲恩等候於北部費伍德森林在隧道進入木喉要塞。",
	["Nafien: Feathers for Nafien"] = "納菲恩：給納菲恩的羽毛",
	["Nara Wildmane"] = "納拉·蠻鬃",
	["Narkk"] = "納爾克",
	["Narkk, the pirate supplier in Booty Bay, sells two parrots (40s each). Booty Bay is neutral: the boat from Ratchet and the Stranglethorn road both arrive there. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "納爾克，海盜供應商在藏寶海灣，出售2鸚鵡（40銀每個）。藏寶海灣是中立：船來自棘齒城與荊棘谷道路兩個抵達那裡。每個寵物物品傳授它的夥伴當你使用它；目標留在勾選隨後。",
	["Narm Faulk"] = "納姆·法奧克",
	["Nat Pagle fishes from the shore of a small island off the east coast, south of Theramore."] = "納特·帕格釣魚來自岸邊的一個小型島嶼偏離/關閉東海岸，在塞拉摩以南。",
	["Nathaniel Dumah"] = "納薩尼爾·杜馬",
	["Nathaniel Dumah: the termites come later, in Terrordale"] = "納薩尼爾·杜馬：白蟻來到稍後，在恐懼谷",
	["Nathanos' errands are not on this route. Skip them."] = "納薩諾斯·凋零者的差事是不在本路線內。跳過即可。",
	["Nazeer Bloodpike"] = "納澤爾·血矛",
	["Neeka Bloodscar"] = "尼卡·血痕",
	["Neeru Fireblade"] = "尼爾魯·火刃",
	["Neeru Fireblade, Cleft of Shadow"] = "尼爾魯·火刃，暗影裂口",
	["Neru Fragment: the Loose Soil"] = "奈爾魯碎片：鬆軟的土壤",
	["Nessa Shadowsong"] = "尼莎·影歌",
	["Nether Wing"] = "魔女之翼",
	["Next: Stormwind for training, then the boat from Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine for Ashenvale."] = "下一個：暴風城給訓練，然後船來自暴風城港口前往奧伯丁給灰谷。",
	["Next: fly to Darkshire."] = "下一個：飛往前往夜色鎮。",
	["Nibbled-On Book"] = "被啃過的書",
	["Night Elves fly from Auberdine to Rut'theran Village; Skyborne take the boat from the Auberdine dock and learn the Rut'theran flight path there. Take the portal up to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave."] = "暗夜精靈飛往來自奧伯丁前往魯瑟蘭村；天裔乘船來自奧伯丁碼頭與學習魯瑟蘭村飛行點那裡。接取傳送門上前往瑪斯雷·馭熊者在塞納里奧區。",
	["Nightbane Dark Runner"] = "夜行黑暗狼人",
	["Nightbane Shadow Weaver"] = "夜行織影狼人",
	["Nightbane Tainted One"] = "夜行墮落狼人",
	["Nightbane Vile Fang"] = "夜行邪齒狼人",
	["Nightsaber Fang"] = "夜刃豹的牙齒",
	["Nightsaber Stalker: tame it with the Taming Rod"] = "夜刃捕食者：馴服它與馴獸棒",
	["Nightsabers"] = "夜刃豹",
	["Nightsabers, Strigid Owls and Webwood Lurkers live along the road east. The moonwell is at the west edge of Starbreeze Village."] = "夜刃豹，巨翼梟與樹林潛伏者實測沿著道路東。月亮井是在星風村的西邊緣。",
	["Nimboya"] = "尼姆布亞",
	["Nimboya: for Arathi, later on the route"] = "尼姆布亞：給阿拉希高地，稍後在路線",
	["Nissa Agamand"] = "妮薩·阿加曼德",
	["Nissa Firestone, Ironforge"] = "尼莎·火石，鐵爐堡",
	["Noboru wanders the clearing south-west of the Fallow Sanctuary; his cudgel starts a quest."] = "諾博魯遊蕩空地西南的農田避難所；他的木槌始於一個任務。",
	["Noggle Ficklespragg"] = "諾格·斯巴格",
	["Noggle's Satchel"] = "諾格的背包",
	["Nori Pridedrift, next to him"] = "諾里斯·激流，下一個前往他",
	["North again to the Yoricks' house. Ivar the Foul lurks a short walk west of it."] = "北再次前往奎恩·尤瑞克的房屋。邪惡的伊瓦潛伏一個不足步行在它西面。",
	["North along the coast, Lard's picnic basket is on the small island; a Vilebranch Kidnapper guards it."] = "北沿著海岸，拉爾德的野餐籃子是在小型島嶼；一個邪枝綁架者衛兵它。",
	["North along the eastern hills, the satyrs hold the ruins of Sargeron. The Shadowstalkers walk unseen; the four kinds you need do not."] = "北沿著東部丘陵，薩特要塞廢墟的薩格隆。碧火捕獵者步行隱形的；4種類你需要做不。",
	["North along the hills. Asterion waits in the ruins of Bashal'Aran; Wild Grells and Vile Sprites fill them, Deth'ryll Satyrs the eastern edge. Buzzbox 411 stands by the road west of the ruins."] = "北沿著丘陵。阿斯特利安等候在廢墟中的巴莎蘭；野生劣魔與惡靈劣魔裝滿它們，戴瑟雷薩特東部邊緣。傳聲盒411號位於路邊在廢墟以西。",
	["North of Maestra's Post, plant bundles lie around the ruins of Bathran's Haunt. Dark Strand cultists hold the ruins just south of them: any of them can drop the Glowing Soul Gem."] = "在邁斯特拉崗哨以北，植物捆位於廢墟的周圍巴斯蘭鬼屋。深色暗灘喚魔師邪教徒要塞廢墟就在它們南面：任意的它們可以掉落髮光的靈魂寶石。",
	["North of Molsen Farm. Defias Trappers and Smugglers camp outside the mine, Kobold Diggers work inside. Furlbrow's Wardrobe stands by the ruined house east of the mine."] = "在莫爾森農場以北。迪菲亞捕獸者與走私者營地在採礦外，狗頭人掘地工有效內部。法布隆的櫃子站在旁邊：毀壞的房屋在採礦以東。",
	["North of Torwa, a dead Threshadon lies by the water."] = "在托爾瓦以北，一個死亡的蛇頸龍位於旁水。",
	["North of the Sepulcher. Nightlash haunts the Dead Field: kill it, then walk across the field."] = "北的瑟伯切爾。奈塔拉什出沒死去的教徒奧斯萊特元帥：擊殺它，然後步行穿過田野。",
	["North of the cones: the Wind Hollows drift around the refugees' camp, the Abandoned Belongings lie between the tents, and Resaan Nimbuswalker lies at its north end."] = "在松果以北：風穴魔漂浮在營地周圍的營地，遺棄的隨身物品位於之間帳篷，與雷薩恩伊拉妮·雲行者位於它的北盡頭。",
	["North of the gnolls the ogres hold a hilltop outpost; pull the ogre-magi to you. The cobalt is in the dirt mounds around the outpost, and the scroll lies on the ground inside it."] = "在豺狼人食人魔要塞一個山頂前哨站以北；拉怪食人魔-法師前往你。鈷是在泥土土堆在前哨站周圍，與捲軸位於領地內部它。",
	["North to the Dry Hills. Walton's camp and Vrang Wildgore are a few steps apart below the hills."] = "北前往枯水谷。沃爾頓的營地與弗朗恩·凝血是一個少量台階相隔在丘陵下方。",
	["North to the lumber camp; set the termite barrel down in the middle of the mill."] = "北前往伐木場營地；設置白蟻木桶下在磨坊的中央。",
	["North up the road to Splintertree Post and Night Run beside it."] = "北順著道路往上前往碎木崗哨與夜道谷旁邊它。",
	["North-east from Ursal's den, back to Dolanaar."] = "東北來自烏薩爾的獸穴，返回前往多蘭納爾。",
	["North-east of Hammerfall the Drywhisker kobolds mine the gorge; the Kobolds at the mouth and the Diggers and Surveyors deeper in all drop the Motes of Myzrael."] = "在落錘鎮以東北枯須狗頭人採礦峽谷；狗頭人在入口/河口與迪菲亞掘地工與勘測員更深處在全部掉落微粒的密斯萊爾。",
	["North-east of Mistvale, Zanzil's followers camp in the jungle; every one of them can carry the mixture."] = "在迷霧谷以東北，贊吉爾的追隨者紮營於叢林；每個1的它們可以攜帶混合物。",
	["North-east of the logging camp. Defias Rogue Wizards camp on the shores of the lake."] = "在伐木營地以東北。迪菲亞流浪巫師營地在海岸的湖。",
	["North-west along the road, the Rage Scar yetis live around the caves in the hills. Any of them can also drop a Perfect Yeti Hide, which starts a quest of its own."] = "西北沿著道路，怒痕雪人實測在洞穴在丘陵周圍。任意的它們可以也掉落一個完美的雪人毛皮，其中始於一個任務的它的自己的。",
	["North-west of Grom'gol the Vile Reef lies under the water off the coast. The Tablet Shard rests on the sea floor by the sunken ruins; watch your breath and the murlocs."] = "在格羅姆高以西北邪惡暗礁位於下方水偏離/關閉海岸。石板碎片停放於在大海樓層在旁沈沒的廢墟；守望你的吐息與魚人。",
	["North-west of Splintertree, the Felmusk satyrs camp in the woods. Every satyr can drop horns."] = "在碎木崗哨以西北，邪霧薩特紮營於樹林。每個薩特可以掉落角。",
	["North-west of Valanaar along the road: Fendaal Windstone watches the Al'Aketh Assassins; the dead cultist lies just north of him."] = "在瓦拉納爾以西北沿著道路：芬達爾·風石注視奧阿凱斯刺客；死亡的邪教徒位於就在他北面。",
	["Northshire Valley opens onto Elwynn Forest; Goldshire is south down the road."] = "北郡山谷通向艾爾文森林；閃金鎮是南順著道路。",
	["Northwatch Hold, on the coast further south. The Theramore Marines and Preservers (15-16) drop the medals; Captain Fairmount (20) and the two cannoneers (19) stand in the keep and on its walls, and they are why the hold waits until now."] = "北方城堡，在海岸邊更遠處南。塞拉摩水兵與保護者（15-16）掉落獎章；法莫斯隊長（20）與2炮手（19）位於要塞內與在它的城牆，與它們是原因要塞等候直到現在。",
	["Novice Elreth"] = "新兵艾爾雷斯",
	["Novice Elreth, beside the church"] = "新兵艾爾雷斯，在教堂旁邊",
	["Novice Thaivand"] = "學徒塞萬德",
	["Nyalah Brightfire"] = "妮雅拉·明火",
	["OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon, a rare drop"] = "OOX-09/HL定位器，稀有掉落",
	["OOX-17/TN Distress Beacon, a rare drop"] = "OOX-17/TN定位器，稀有掉落",
	["Oasis Snapjaws crawl around Lushwater Oasis, south-west of the Crossroads, and around the Stagnant Oasis."] = "綠洲鉗嘴龜爬行在甜水綠洲周圍，西南的十字路口，與周圍死水綠洲。",
	["Oasis Snapjaws crowd the water of Lushwater Oasis, south-west of the Crossroads."] = "綠洲鉗嘴龜怪群水的甜水綠洲，西南的十字路口。",
	["Oben Rageclaw"] = "奧本·怒爪",
	["Oglethorpe Obnoticus"] = "奧格索普·奧布諾提斯",
	["Oglethorpe Obnoticus is in Booty Bay. With all three robots home he offers An OOX of Your Own, whose reward is the Mechanical Chicken; it needs level 45."] = "奧格索普·奧布諾提斯是在藏寶海灣。與全部3機器人爐石他提供你自己的OOX，其獎勵是機械小雞；它需要45級。",
	["Ogron waits in the Quagmire east of the village. Follow him to Reethe and keep him alive through the fight that breaks out."] = "奧格隆等候於誇格米爾在村莊以東。沿著他前往瑞瑟與保留他存活穿過迎戰該破壞出。",
	["Ogunaro Wolfrunner"] = "奧古納羅",
	["Ogunaro Wolfrunner sells the other colours (200g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "奧古納羅出售其他顏色（200金每個在永恆服客戶端）。購買任意你需要，或無如果坐騎你曾是給予的是1你像。",
	["Ogunaro Wolfrunner sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "奧古納羅出售其他顏色（20金每個在永恆服客戶端）。購買任意你需要，或無如果坐騎你曾是給予的是1你像。",
	["Okra"] = "秋葵",
	["Ol' Emma, who walks the canals"] = "艾瑪，其步行運河",
	["Olariaan Swiftburn"] = "奧拉里安·疾燃",
	["Omusa Thunderhorn"] = "歐姆薩·雷角",
	["On Hunter Rise. Have the Wool, Silk and Mageweave in your bags."] = "在獵人高地。有毛料，絲綢與魔紋布在你的背包。",
	["On Legacki, by the inn"] = "在萊加奇，在旅店旁",
	["On Sprinkle"] = "在斯普琳科",
	["On the ride north to Ratchet, Fray Island lies off the Merchant Coast south of the town: wade over the sand bar shallows. Klannoc Macleod sends four challengers and then Big Will (level 33) at you, one at a time."] = "在騎行北前往棘齒城，勇士島位於偏離/關閉商人海岸在城鎮以南：涉水越過沙子錠淺灘。克蘭諾克·馬克雷德派往4挑戰者與然後比格維爾（33級）在你，1在一個時間。",
	["On the ride south through the Wetlands, the Dragonmaw Bonewarders and Shadowwarders hold the hills just east of the road: the rods drop from them."] = "在騎行南穿過濕地，龍喉白骨守衛與暗影守衛要塞丘陵就在道路以東：棒掉落來自它們。",
	["On the road south through the Barrens, Takar the Seer camps east of the road, north-east of Camp Taurajo; come in from the east and keep clear of the Horde guards."] = "在路上南穿過貧瘠之地，先知塔卡爾紮營在道路以東，在陶拉祖營地以東北；來到在來自東與保留清理的部落衛兵。",
	["On the way back east, the Vilebranch soothsayers hold the Altar of Zul, the troll temple south of the central hills. Qiaga and Morta'gya the Keeper (elite, 50) stand at its top: take the soothsayers on the lower steps."] = "在返回途中東，邪枝占卜師要塞祖爾祭壇，巨魔神廟在中央丘陵以南。琪亞加與守護者莫塔加亞（精英，50）位於它的頂部：接取占卜師在下層台階。",
	["On the way back to the Crossroads, the Razormane camp again: Geomancers and Defenders hold its eastern half; Kreenig Snarlsnout walks among them."] = "在返回途中前往十字路口，刺鬃營地再次：坑道鼠地卜師與防禦者要塞它的東部一半；克里尼格·糟鼻步行在其中：它們。",
	["On the way north, back to Urs'endris by the falls."] = "在途中北，返回前往烏爾森德里斯在旁墜落。",
	["Only if Dalar gave you Arugal's Folly: the Bloodhowlers prowl the woods south-west of Ambermill, east of Pyrewood; they drop the Worgen Bits."] = "僅如果達拉爾·道恩維沃爾給的你阿魯高的愚行：血嚎者遊蕩樹林在安伯米爾以西南，在焚木村以東；它們掉落狼人碎塊。",
	["Only if Donova gave you Toxic Horrors: ride north up the Felwood road to Irontree Woods; the Toxic Horrors ooze between the trees."] = "僅如果多諾瓦給的你劇毒之水：騎行北上費伍德森林道路前往鐵木森林；劇毒之水軟泥怪之間樹木。",
	["Only if Gallywix fell in the Barrens (Mission: Possible But Not Probable): Serge Hinott stands in Tarren Mill. Wait beside him while he brews the cure, then take your reward: Poisons."] = "僅如果加里維克斯掉落在貧瘠之地（基本不可能的任務）：瑟爾格·希諾特位於塔倫米爾。等待旁邊他當他釀造治癒，然後接取你的獎勵：毒藥。",
	["Only if Gluggle gave you the pendant in Stranglethorn"] = "僅如果格魯格爾給的你掛墜在荊棘谷",
	["Only if a Blood Red Key dropped: use it to start the quest, then free Arko'narin in her cage in Shadow Hold, the cave at the north end of Jaedenar, and escort her out."] = "僅如果一個血紅鑰匙掉落：使用它前往開始任務，然後解救亞科納琳在她的籠子在暗影堡，洞穴在加德納爾的北端，與護送她的出。",
	["Only if a Winterfall Ritual Totem dropped for you: Kernda waits at the Felwood entrance of Timbermaw Hold, and speaks to you only at Neutral with the Timbermaw."] = "僅如果一個冬泉儀祭圖騰掉落給你：克爾達等候於費伍德森林入口的木喉要塞，與對話前往你僅在中立與木喉。",
	["Only if he takes the isosprings alone"] = "僅如果他接收溫泉獨自",
	["Only if the letter dropped"] = "僅如果信件掉落",
	["Only if you are not level 48 yet."] = "僅如果你是不48級尚。",
	["Only if you carry Winterfall Runners: the runners walk the road from Timbermaw Hold toward Winterfall Village in small groups; wait by the road near Donova and kill them as they pass. Each one carries a crate."] = "僅如果你攜帶冬泉信使：奔行者步行道路來自木喉要塞朝寒水村方向在小型小隊；等待在路邊在多諾瓦附近與擊殺它們作為它們穿過。每個1攜帶一個木箱。",
	["Only if you found a Winterfall Firewater flask in Winterspring: ride north up the road. The cauldron stands in Felpaw Village, just south-west of Timbermaw Hold; the Deadwood furbolgs there are hostile."] = "僅如果你找到一個冬泉火酒燒瓶在冬泉谷：騎行北順著道路往上。大鍋位於魔爪村，就在木喉要塞以西南；死木熊怪那裡是敵對。",
	["Only if you looted An Old History Book in Duskwood"] = "僅如果你拾取的一本破舊的歷史書在暮色森林",
	["Only if you looted a Westfall Deed in Elwynn: right-click it"] = "僅如果你拾取的一個西部荒野地契在艾爾文森林：右鍵點擊它",
	["Only if you rescued Arko'narin: the succubus Rakaiah waits in the middle of Jaedenar, beside the Remains of Trey Lightforge."] = "僅如果你獲救的亞科納琳：魅魔拉凱雅等候在加德納爾的中央，旁邊特雷·萊弗治的殘骸。",
	["Only once all three robots are home"] = "僅一次全部3機器人是爐石",
	["Only with 30 Runecloth, and only at Neutral with the Timbermaw: follow the road north to Timbermaw Hold; Meilosh trades just inside the entrance."] = "僅與30符文布，與僅在中立與木喉：沿著道路前往北前往木喉要塞；梅羅什可兌換就在入口內。",
	["Only with 5 Deadwood Headdress Feathers"] = "僅與5死木頭飾羽毛",
	["Only with the Grimesilt Outhouse Key: back east to the Wooden Outhouse at the dig site."] = "僅與格里塞特廁所鑰匙：返回東前往木制廁所在挖掘地點。",
	["Only with the distress beacon: OOX-17/TN sits south-east of Scrimshank's hive. Escort it north to Steamwheedle Port; its reward waits with Oglethorpe in Booty Bay."] = "僅與求救信標：OOX-17/TN型定位器位於斯克里姆山克的以東南蟲巢。護送它北前往熱砂港；它的獎勵等候與奧格索普·奧布諾提斯在藏寶海灣。",
	["Only with the distress beacon: the robot sits at the head of the river west of Skulk Rock. Escort it east to the shore beyond the Overlook Cliffs; its reward waits with Oglethorpe in Booty Bay."] = "僅與求救信標：機器人位於河流的盡頭在隱匿石以西。護送它東前往岸邊越過懸崖懸崖；它的獎勵等候與奧格索普·奧布諾提斯在藏寶海灣。",
	["Only with the distress beacon: the robot sits in a small cave on the north side of Feral Scar Vale. Escort it to the dock on the Forgotten Coast; yetis and gorillas ambush you on the way. Its reward waits in Booty Bay for a later visit."] = "僅與求救信標：機器人位於一個小型洞穴在深痕谷的北側。護送它前往碼頭在被遺忘的海岸；雪人與猩猩伏擊你在途中。它的獎勵等候於藏寶海灣給一個稍後造訪。",
	["Onu"] = "安努",
	["Onu, at the Grove"] = "安努，在樹林",
	["Onyxia's Lair, Dustwallow Marsh"] = "奧妮克希亞的巢穴，塵泥沼澤",
	["Oozes drop the Oozing Bag: the Vile Slimes, Large Vile Slimes and Devouring Oozes of Western Plaguelands, and the oozes of Felwood, Un'Goro Crater and Eastern Plaguelands, at about 0.07-0.09% per kill in our data. The waypoint is a Vile Slime spawn in eastern Western Plaguelands."] = "軟泥怪掉落沾滿淤泥的袋子：可憎的軟泥怪，可憎的大軟泥怪與吞噬淤泥怪的西瘟疫之地，與軟泥怪的費伍德森林，安戈洛環形山與東瘟疫之地，在約0.07-0.09%每擊殺在我們的數據。路徑點是一個可憎的軟泥怪刷新在東部西瘟疫之地。",
	["Open Giant Clams here. The Auction House works too."] = "打開/開啓巨型蚌殼此處。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Open Marvon's Chest for the Stone Circle"] = "打開/開啓瑪爾馮的箱子給石環",
	["Open the Oozing Bag from your bags."] = "打開滲漏的袋子來自你的背包。",
	["Ophek, by the inn"] = "奧菲克，在旅店旁",
	["Optional. Running Stratholme, Scholomance, Lower Blackrock Spire or Blackrock Depths with a group instead of grinding gets you there faster."] = "可選。刷斯坦索姆，通靈學院，下層黑石塔或黑石殺戮者深淵如果有隊伍代替的刷怪使你達到你那裡更快。",
	["Optional: Franclorn's ghost stands on his tomb on the great chain inside Blackrock Mountain, and only the dead can see him. If you die near the mountain anyway, run your spirit to him before resurrecting."] = "可選：弗蘭克羅恩·鑄鐵的幽靈位於他的陵墓在巨型任務鏈在黑石山內，與僅死亡的可以查看他。如果你死亡在山脈無論如何附近，前往你的之靈前往他之前復活。",
	["Optional: Sanath Lim-yo wants two Undamaged Hippogryph Feathers from the hippogryphs around his camp. The data lists no experience for it."] = "可選：薩納斯需要2完好的角鷹獸羽毛來自角鷹獸周圍他的營地。數據列出無經驗值給它。",
	["Optional: with a group, a 55-60 dungeon replaces the grind below."] = "可選：如果有隊伍，一個55-60地下城替代刷怪下方。",
	["Oracle Tree Bark, just west of the moonwell"] = "神諭林樹皮，就在月亮井以西",
	["Oralius"] = "奧拉留斯",
	["Oralius: the Blackrock orcs drop the medallions, keep it open all through the Steppes"] = "奧拉留斯：黑石殺戮者獸人掉落勳章，請保留該任務/物品打開/開啓全部穿過平原",
	["Oran Snakewrithe, the Royal Quarter"] = "奧蘭·斯內克威瑟，皇家區",
	["Oran stands in the Magic Quarter."] = "奧蘭·斯內克威瑟位於魔法區。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 110, yellow until 130, green until 150. Needs an anvil nearby."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到110，黃色直到130，綠色直到150。需要一個鐵砧附近。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 130, yellow until 150, green until 170. Alchemy 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到130，黃色直到150，綠色直到170。煉金術150是一個傳承系統里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 135, yellow until 155, green until 175. Enchant your own gear: any item for that slot will do."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到135，黃色直到155，綠色直到175。附魔你的自己的裝備：任意物品給該欄位會做。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 140, yellow until 157, green until 175. Tailoring 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到140，黃色直到157，綠色直到175。裁縫150是一個傳承系統里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 145, yellow until 160, green until 175. Needs an anvil nearby. Blacksmithing 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到145，黃色直到160，綠色直到175。需要一個鐵砧附近。鍛造150是一個傳承系統里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 15, yellow until 35, green until 55."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到15，黃色直到35，綠色直到55。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 165, yellow until 185, green until 205. Enchant your own gear: any item for that slot will do."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到165，黃色直到185，綠色直到205。附魔你的自己的裝備：任意物品給該欄位會做。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 165, yellow until 185, green until 205. Enchant your own gear: any item for that slot will do. Enchanting 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到165，黃色直到185，綠色直到205。附魔你的自己的裝備：任意物品給該欄位會做。附魔150是一個傳承系統里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 195, yellow until 210, green until 225."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到195，黃色直到210，綠色直到225。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 195, yellow until 215, green until 235. Alchemy 225 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到195，黃色直到215，綠色直到235。煉金術225是一個傳承系統里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 20, yellow until 30, green until 40."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到20，黃色直到30，綠色直到40。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 260, yellow until 270, green until 280."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到260，黃色直到270，綠色直到280。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 265, yellow until 280, green until 295."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到265，黃色直到280，綠色直到295。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 280, yellow until 290, green until 300."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到280，黃色直到290，綠色直到300。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 280, yellow until 290, green until 300. Needs an anvil nearby."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到280，黃色直到290，綠色直到300。需要一個鐵砧附近。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 280, yellow until 300, green until 320. Alchemy 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到280，黃色直到300，綠色直到320。煉金術300是一個傳承系統里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 285, yellow until 295, green until 305. Enchanting 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到285，黃色直到295，綠色直到305。附魔300是一個傳承系統里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 290, yellow until 305, green until 320. Tailoring 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到290，黃色直到305，綠色直到320。裁縫300是一個傳承系統里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 295, yellow until 305, green until 315. Needs an anvil nearby. Engineering 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到295，黃色直到305，綠色直到315。需要一個鐵砧附近。工程學300是一個傳承系統里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 30, yellow until 45, green until 60."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到30，黃色直到45，綠色直到60。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 300, yellow until 312, green until 325. Needs an anvil nearby."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到300，黃色直到312，綠色直到325。需要一個鐵砧附近。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 305, yellow until 317, green until 330. Needs an anvil nearby. Blacksmithing 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到305，黃色直到317，綠色直到330。需要一個鐵砧附近。鍛造300是一個傳承系統里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 310, yellow until 320, green until 330. Leatherworking 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到310，黃色直到320，綠色直到330。制皮300是一個傳承系統里程碑。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 35, yellow until 47, green until 60."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到35，黃色直到47，綠色直到60。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 55, yellow until 75, green until 95. 75 is the Apprentice cap."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到55，黃色直到75，綠色直到95。75是初級上限。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 70, yellow until 90, green until 110. Enchant your own gear: any item for that slot will do. 75 is the Apprentice cap."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到70，黃色直到90，綠色直到110。附魔你的自己的裝備：任意物品給該欄位會做。75是初級上限。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 85, yellow until 105, green until 125."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到85，黃色直到105，綠色直到125。",
	["Orange (a point every craft) until 90, yellow until 105, green until 120."] = "橙色（一個點每個製作）直到90，黃色直到105，綠色直到120。",
	["Orendil Broadleaf"] = "奧雷迪爾·闊葉",
	["Orgnil Soulscar"] = "奧戈尼爾·魂痕",
	["Orgrimmar's main gate is just west of Skull Rock. Gan'rul stands in the Cleft of Shadow, the canyon under the Valley of Strength."] = "奧格瑞瑪的主大門是就在骷髏石以西。甘魯爾·血眼位於暗影裂口，峽谷在下方力量谷。",
	["Ormak Grimshot stands in the Valley of Honor, Ur'kyo in the Valley of Spirits on the city's west side."] = "奧瑪克位於榮譽谷，烏爾庫在精神谷在主城的西一側。",
	["Ormak Grimshot: Beast Training"] = "奧瑪克：訓練野獸",
	["Ormer Ironbraid"] = "奧莫爾·鐵衣",
	["Ormin Pelford"] = "奧爾明·佩爾福德",
	["Orwin Gizzmick"] = "奧爾文·吉茲米克",
	["Oslow's Toolbox"] = "奧斯洛的工具箱",
	["Osseous Agitator"] = "骨質分離素",
	["Otho Moji'ko"] = "奧索·莫吉克",
	["Outhouse"] = "廁所",
	["Overgrown Duskweed grows in the fields around the vineyards and the Stonefield farm; Stonetusk Boars around them give the blood."] = "茂盛的暮光草生長在農田在葡萄園與周圍斯通菲爾德農場；石牙野豬周圍它們交給血液。",
	["Overlord Mok'Morokk"] = "莫格穆洛克大王",
	["Overlord Mok'Morokk is elite: grouping up is advised. Beat him down until he gives up, then report to Draz'Zilb."] = "莫格穆洛克大王為精英：建議組隊前往。擊敗他下直到他給予上，然後報告前往德拉茲辛比。",
	["Owatanka's Tailspike"] = "奧瓦坦卡的尾刺",
	["Ozwin Ironsprocket"] = "奧茲溫·鐵齒輪",
	["Pa'zula"] = "帕祖拉",
	["Pa'zula: enchanters only, the residue is disenchanted from Hexed Pendants"] = "帕祖拉：附魔師僅，殘留物是分解的來自妖術掛墜",
	["Pages of The Green Hills of Stranglethorn drop at about 1% each from the Bloodscalp and Skullsplitter trolls; keep every page you loot and look on the auction house for the rest. Barnil takes the chapters later in this guide."] = "書頁的荊棘谷的青山掉落在約1%每個來自血頂與碎顱巨魔；保留每個書頁你拾取與查看在拍賣房屋給其餘。巴尼爾·石罐接收章節在本指南稍後階段。",
	["Pages of The Green Hills of Stranglethorn drop at about 1% each from the Bloodscalp and Skullsplitter trolls; take what drops and check the Auction House for the rest."] = "書頁的荊棘谷的青山掉落在約1%每個來自血頂與碎顱巨魔；接取所掉落與查看拍賣行給其餘。",
	["Painted Gnoll Armbands"] = "彩色豺狼人臂章",
	["Paladins: Rediscovering the Light is done once you have healed five Injured Deathguard around the church with Holy Light."] = "聖騎士：重拾聖光已完成一次你有治療5受傷的死亡衛兵在教堂與周圍聖光術。",
	["Pamela's Doll's Head"] = "帕米拉的洋娃娃的腦袋",
	["Pamela's Doll's Left Side"] = "帕米拉的洋娃娃的左身",
	["Pamela's Doll's Right Side"] = "帕米拉的洋娃娃的右身",
	["Pamela's ghost stands in the ruins of Darrowshire, in the south-west."] = "帕米拉的幽靈位於廢墟中的達隆郡，在西南面。",
	["Pamela's own errand is not on this route. Skip it."] = "帕米拉的自己的差事是不在本路線內。跳過即可。",
	["Panther"] = "黑豹",
	["Pao'ka Swiftmountain"] = "波卡·雨山",
	["Parrot Cage (Cockatiel), 40s"] = "鸚鵡籠（紅尾鸚鵡），40銀",
	["Parrot Cage (Senegal), 40s"] = "鸚鵡籠（金翼鸚鵡），40銀",
	["Pathfinders, Den Watchers and Totemics share the furbolg camps around the hot springs; Ragged Owlbeasts roam the slopes between them. Kill Totemics first. Save every Runecloth you loot for Meilosh."] = "托爾瓦·尋路者，獸穴守夜人道茨與圖騰師共享熊怪紮營在熱溫泉周圍；蓬毛梟獸遊蕩於山坡之間它們。擊殺圖騰師第一。留存每個符文布你拾取給梅羅什。",
	["Paw of Sin'Dall"] = "辛達爾的爪子",
	["Peacekeeper Vaaniel"] = "維和者瓦尼爾",
	["Peacekeeper Vaaniel holds the western watch, south-west of Falaath. Skypriest Aanders and the fallen guards lie just south of her."] = "維和者瓦尼爾持有西部守望，在法拉斯以西南。天空祭司安德斯與陣亡的衛兵位於就在她南面。",
	["Peerless Eye: Twilight Disciples and Thugs"] = "無雙之眼：暮光信徒與暴徒",
	["Pelturas Whitemoon"] = "皮爾圖拉斯·懷特姆恩",
	["Pendant of the Sea Lion: join the two halves"] = "海獅墜飾：加入2兩半",
	["Pendant of the Sea Lion: use a half at the Shrine of Remulos"] = "海獅墜飾：使用一個一半在雷姆洛斯神殿",
	["Perfect Yeti Hide, a rare drop"] = "完美的雪人毛皮，稀有掉落",
	["Perrine's Chest stands beside Captain Perrine at the camp's south end."] = "佩林的箱子位於派瑞恩隊長旁邊在營地的南盡頭。",
	["Pesky Cirrusflies and Juvenile Vuldren roam the grove just south-east of the village."] = "惱人的捲雲蠅與幼年瓦德倫遊蕩於樹林就在村莊以東南。",
	["Pestlezugg's next quest needs the Gorishi Hive Queen, an elite boss. Skip it."] = "煉金師匹斯特蘇格的下一個任務需要格里什皇后，一個精英首領。跳過即可。",
	["Phin Odelic"] = "費恩·奧德利克",
	["Phin Odelic: his trail leads to Arathi"] = "費恩·奧德利克：他的小路通往阿拉希高地",
	["Pick Arthas' Tears with Herbalism; this is the densest patch in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "拾取 Arthas的眼淚與草藥學；此是最密集的區域在數據。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Pick Briarthorn with Herbalism; this is the densest patch in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "拾取石南草與草藥學；此是最密集的區域在數據。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Pick Bruiseweed with Herbalism; this is the densest patch in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "拾取跌打草與草藥學；此是最密集的區域在數據。拍賣行有效也。",
