	["Pick Purple Lotus with Herbalism; this is the densest patch in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "拾取紫蓮花與草藥學；此是最密集的區域在數據。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Pick Silverleaf with Herbalism; this is the densest patch in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "拾取銀葉草與草藥學；此是最密集的區域在數據。拍賣行有效也。",
