	["Plaguehound Runts and Plaguebats roam the hills north of the Marris Stead, Carrion Grubs crawl among them; work north toward Terrordale."] = "瘟疫幼犬與瘟疫蝙蝠遊蕩於丘陵北的瑪瑞斯農場，腐肉蟲爬行在其中：它們；有效北朝恐懼谷方向。",
