	["Prideclaws and Galestriders share the meadows south of the village. Keep the Strider Meat for Zerril; the eggs come later from the hippogryphs."] = "傲爪與狂風行者共享草地在村莊以南。保留陸行鳥肉給澤瑞爾·柔風；蛋來到稍後來自角鷹獸。",
	["Priestess Alathea, in the Temple of the Moon: Starshards"] = "女祭司阿蘭希雅，在月神殿：星辰碎片",
