	["Rabbit Crate (Snowshoe), 20s"] = "兔籠（黃紋兔），20銀",
	["Rabid Dire Wolf"] = "瘋狂的恐狼",
	["Rabid Dire Wolves roam the woods around the cemetery and Abercrombie, Starving Dire Wolves the hills north-east of him. Pygmy Venom Web Spiders crawl east of the cemetery and drop the venom. Every ghoul of the cemetery's northern half can drop a fang."] = "瘋狂的恐狼遊蕩於樹林在墓園與周圍亞伯克隆比，飢餓的恐狼丘陵在他東北面。小型結網毒蜘蛛爬行在墓園與掉落毒液以東。每個食屍鬼的墓園的北部一半可以掉落一個獠牙。",
	["Rabid Thistle Bears roam the hills just east of Auberdine. Use Tharnariun's Hope on one and lead it back to him."] = "狂暴薊熊遊蕩於丘陵就在奧伯丁以東。使用薩納瑞恩的希望在1與引導它返回前往他。",
	["Rabine Saturna in Moonglade: keep it"] = "拉比恩·薩圖納在月光林地：請保留該任務/物品",
	["Rabine Saturna waits in Moonglade: keep it for later."] = "拉比恩·薩圖納等候於月光林地：留著稍後做。",
	["Rabine Saturna's house stands in Nighthaven, east of Umber."] = "拉比恩·薩圖納的房屋位於永夜港，在阿姆伯爾以東。",
	["Rabine's Shards of the Felvine needs Dire Maul. Skip it."] = "拉比恩·薩圖納的魔藤碎片需要厄運之槌。跳過即可。",
	["Raedon Duskstriker takes cloth for Darnassus in Darnassus. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "萊頓·暗影接收布料給達納蘇斯在達納蘇斯。第一捐獻的毛料，絲綢，魔紋布與符文布（60布料每個）已完成一次與交給大多數聲望每布料；之後它們，更多的符文布可重復直到崇拜。崇拜與另一個種族的主城允許你購買該種族的坐騎。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["Raene Wolfrunner"] = "萊恩·狼行者",
	["Raene Wolfrunner, in the inn"] = "萊恩·狼行者，在旅店內",
	["Rage Scar Yeti Hide"] = "怒痕雪人的毛皮",
	["Rageclaw, in the den"] = "怒爪，在獸穴",
	["Ragefire Chasm"] = "怒焰裂谷",
	["Ragged Young Wolves roam the snow just south of Anvilmar."] = "蓬毛幼狼遊蕩於雪就在安威瑪爾以南。",
	["Ragnar Thunderbrew"] = "拉格納·雷酒",
	["Raider Bork"] = "狼騎兵波爾克",
	["Raider Bork sells the mounts in the Hall of Legends in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, beside the other honor quartermasters such as Sergeant Ba'sha. The Forever client lists each at 100g; choose one."] = "狼騎兵波爾克出售坐騎在傳說大廳在奧格瑞瑪的榮譽谷，在其他榮譽軍需官此類作為旁邊巴沙。永恆服客戶端列出每個在100金；選擇1。",
	["Rainbow Fin Albacore is orange from 50 (yellow at 90, grey at 130): about 68 crafts to 110. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking. Fishing off the Auberdine docks catches Raw Rainbow Fin Albacore."] = "彩鰭魚是橙色來自50（黃色在90，灰色在130）：約68製作前往110。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。釣魚偏離/關閉奧伯丁碼頭捕獲新鮮的彩鰭魚。",
	["Rakaiah"] = "拉凱雅",
	["Raleigh the Devout"] = "虔誠的萊雷恩",
	["Raleigh's next errand is in the Scarlet Monastery: skip it."] = "虔誠的萊雷恩的下一個差事是在血色修道院：跳過即可。",
	["Rally Valennia, Ayessa Dawnsinger (west of town) and Elaadrin"] = "集結瓦倫妮婭·風暴之拳，阿耶莎·晨歌（在城鎮西面）與艾拉德琳·暮風",
	["Ralston Farnsley takes cloth for Undercity in Undercity. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "萊斯頓·法斯雷接收布料給幽暗城在幽暗城。第一捐獻的毛料，絲綢，魔紋布與符文布（60布料每個）已完成一次與交給大多數聲望每布料；之後它們，更多的符文布可重復直到崇拜。崇拜與另一個種族的主城允許你購買該種族的坐騎。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["Ran Bloodtooth"] = "蘭恩·血牙",
	["Ran Bloodtooth and his guards camp just east of Krolg."] = "蘭恩·血牙與他的衛兵營地就在克羅爾格以東。",
	["Randal Hunter"] = "蘭達爾·亨特",
	["Randal Hunter and Katie Hunter's horse pen are at Eastvale Logging Camp in eastern Elwynn Forest. At 40 Randal Hunter teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Alliance race ride these."] = "蘭達爾·亨特與凱蒂·亨特的馬圍欄是在東谷伐木場在東部艾爾文森林。在40蘭達爾·亨特傳授騎術（100金每暴雪的設計師），與學習它給你一個坐騎。永恆服客戶端允許每個聯盟種族騎行這些。",
	["Randal Hunter and Katie Hunter's horse pen are at Eastvale Logging Camp in eastern Elwynn Forest. At 60 Randal Hunter teaches Journeyman Riding (1,000g per Blizzard's designers); Blizzard says learning riding grants a mount. The Forever client sells each swift horse for 200g at level 60."] = "蘭達爾·亨特與凱蒂·亨特的馬圍欄是在東谷伐木場在東部艾爾文森林。在60蘭達爾·亨特傳授中級騎術（1,000金每暴雪的設計師）；暴雪說學習騎行獎勵一匹坐騎。永恆服客戶端出售每個迅捷馬給200金在60級。",
	["Randal Hunter, riding trainer"] = "蘭達爾·亨特，騎術訓練師",
	["Rane Yorick"] = "蘭妮·尤瑞克",
	["Ranks 3, 7, 10, 13 and 14 are a point each. Polestar cannot read your highest rank yet, so tick each one off yourself. Forever's honor rules for reaching a rank have not been published in detail; in Classic, ranks come from your weekly honor standing, and 13-14 take many weeks of top standing."] = "軍階3，7，10，13與14是一個點每個。Polestar 無法閱讀你的最高等級尚，因此勾選每個1偏離/關閉你自己。永恆服的榮譽規則給抵達一個等級有不已已發佈在詳情；在經典舊世，軍階來自你的每周榮譽聲望等級，與13-14接取許多周的頂部聲望等級。",
	["Ranshalla in Winterspring: keep it"] = "蘭莎爾拉在冬泉谷：請保留該任務/物品",
	["Ranshalla: her escort comes later on the route"] = "蘭莎爾拉：她的護送來自稍後在路線",
	["Raptors: Zjolnir, beside Xar'Ti in Sen'jin Village."] = "迅猛龍：佐爾尼爾，在克薩爾迪旁邊在森金村。",
	["Rashona Straglash takes cloth for Orgrimmar in Orgrimmar. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "萊什納·刺藤接收布料給奧格瑞瑪在奧格瑞瑪。第一捐獻的毛料，絲綢，魔紋布與符文布（60布料每個）已完成一次與交給大多數聲望每布料；之後它們，更多的符文布可重復直到崇拜。崇拜與另一個種族的主城允許你購買該種族的坐騎。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["Ratchet is on the Barrens coast east of the Crossroads; from the Alliance side, take the boat from Booty Bay. Strahad Farsan's follow-up teaches Summon Felsteed."] = "棘齒城是在貧瘠之地海岸東的十字路口；來自聯盟一側，乘船來自藏寶海灣。斯坦哈德·法爾杉的後續任務傳授召喚地獄戰馬。",
	["Rathiril Sunlance"] = "拉希瑞爾·日槍",
	["Rattlecage Skeletons wander the ruined houses in the north half of Deathknell. Young Scavengers and Duskbats roam all around the village; the Ragged Scavengers and Mangy Duskbats are on its east side."] = "斷骨骷髏遊蕩毀壞的房屋在北面一半的喪鐘鎮。食腐狼幼崽與夜行蝙蝠遊蕩全部在村莊周圍；蓬毛食腐狼與癩皮夜行蝙蝠是在它的東一側。",
	["Ravasaur Pheromone Gland"] = "暴掠龍資訊素",
	["Raven Hill Tome, from the Memory of Valor"] = "烏鴉嶺典籍，來自英勇的記憶",
	["Ravenous Darkhound (88%) in Tirisfal Glades, or wherever the arrow points"] = "飢餓的黑暗犬（88%）在提瑞斯法林地，或跟隨箭頭指示位置",
	["Razorfen Downs"] = "剃刀高地",
	["Razorfen Kraul"] = "剃刀沼澤",
	["Razormane Seer (level 23-24) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "鋼鬃先知（23-24級）掉落它此處。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Razzle Sprysprocket"] = "拉茲·滑鏈",
	["Razzle Sprysprocket, by the depot"] = "拉茲·滑鏈，在旁補給站",
	["Read both tablets"] = "閱讀兩個石板",
	["Read the tablet in the Dark Iron camp among the ruins, south-west of Flame Crest, to copy the transcript."] = "閱讀石板在黑鐵礦營地在其中：廢墟，在烈焰峰以西南，前往副本抄本。",
	["Reagent Pouch: Stonesplinter Seers"] = "試劑袋：碎石怪先知",
	["Red Burlap Bandanas"] = "紅色粗麻面罩",
	["Red Leather Bandanas: every Defias drops them"] = "紅色皮質面罩：每個迪菲亞掉落它們",
	["Red Linen Bandanas"] = "紅色亞麻面罩",
	["Red Mechanostrider, 20g"] = "紅色機械陸行鳥，20金",
	["Red Power Crystal"] = "紅色能量水晶",
	["Red Skeletal Horse, 20g"] = "紅色骸骨軍馬，20金",
	["Redpath's Shield"] = "雷德帕斯之盾",
	["Redpath's Shield lies east of the barn at Gahrron's Withering."] = "雷德帕斯之盾位於穀倉在以東蓋羅恩農場。",
	["Redridge Mongrel"] = "混血赤脊山豺狼人",
	["Redridge Mongrels and other gnolls hold the hills east of Three Corners, north of the road; Redridge Thrashers prowl among them, Poachers camp south of the road. Dire Condors and Great Goretusks roam the same hills."] = "混血赤脊山豺狼人與其他豺狼人要塞丘陵在三角路口以東，在道路以北；赤脊山鞭笞者遊蕩在其中：它們，偷獵者營地在道路以南。恐鷲與巨型血牙野豬遊蕩於相同丘陵。",
	["Redridge Poacher"] = "赤脊山偷獵者",
	["Redridge starts at Three Corners, where the roads from Elwynn Forest and Duskwood meet."] = "赤脊山始於三角路口，在道路來自艾爾文森林與暮色森林會合。",
	["Refreshing Spring Water from Innkeeper Keldamyr, for Byancie"] = "清涼的泉水來自旅店老闆凱達米爾，給拜恩希",
	["Refuge Pointe in the middle is the Alliance town; Hammerfall in the east is Horde."] = "避難谷地在中間是聯盟城鎮；落錘鎮在東面是部落。",
	["Regthar stands at the Kolkar watch post just west of the Crossroads."] = "雷戈薩·死門位於科卡爾守望崗哨就在西的十字路口。",
	["Reins of the Spotted Frostsaber, 20g"] = "斑點霜刃豹繮繩，20金",
	["Reins of the Striped Dawnsaber is a new Forever saber (level 40, 20g in the client) whose source is not known yet."] = "條紋晨刃豹繮繩是一個新永恆服刃豹（40級，20金在客戶端）其獲取來源尚不明確。",
	["Reins of the Striped Frostsaber, 20g"] = "條紋霜刃豹繮繩，20金",
	["Reins of the Striped Nightsaber, 20g"] = "條紋夜刃豹繮繩，20金",
	["Reins of the Swift Frostsaber, 200g"] = "迅捷霜刃豹繮繩，200金",
	["Reins of the Swift Mistsaber, 200g"] = "迅捷霧刃豹繮繩，200金",
	["Reins of the Swift Stormsaber, 200g"] = "迅捷雷刃豹繮繩，200金",
	["Rejold Barleybrew"] = "雷傑德·麥酒",
	["Relic of the Claw"] = "利爪聖物",
	["Relic of the Fang"] = "尖牙聖物",
	["Relic of the Silent Shadow"] = "寂靜暗影聖物",
	["Remains of Trey Lightforge"] = "特雷·萊弗治的殘骸",
	["Remen Marcot: Gakin the Darkbinder in Stormwind takes it"] = "雷門·瑪考特：黑暗縛靈者加科因在暴風城接收該任務",
	["Remy \"Two Times\""] = "雷米",
	["Resaan's Heirloom"] = "雷薩恩的傳家寶",
	["Research Equipment"] = "研究設備",
	["Resonating Skull, from the Scourge Champions"] = "共鳴顱骨，來自天災勇士",
	["Restoring Fiery Flux Supplies repeats in three versions: Kingsblood, Iron Bars or Heavy Leather, each with Coal and an Incendosaur Scale. Incendosaurs (level 47-49) in the north of Searing Gorge drop a scale every time; Burninate himself sells Coal."] = "熾熱助熔劑的補給可重復在3版本：皇血草，鐵錠或重皮，每個與煤塊與一個熏火龍的鱗片。熏火龍（47-49級）在灼熱峽谷以北掉落一個鱗片每個時間；大鐵匠博恩奈特他自己出售煤塊。",
	["Rethiel the Greenwarden"] = "綠色守衛者雷希耶爾",
	["Rezlak"] = "雷茲拉克",
	["Rezlak stands on the road west of the ravine. The Thunder Lizards roam Thunder Ridge to the west."] = "雷茲拉克位於路上在深谷以西。雷霆蜥蜴遊蕩雷霆山向西。",
	["Rhag Garmason, Dun Modr"] = "拉格·加瑪森，丹莫德",
	["Rhapsody camps on the road east of Aerie Peak."] = "拉普索迪·鐵鏟紮營在路上在鷹巢山以東。",
	["Rhapsody's cocktail needs parts from Kalimdor: skip it."] = "拉普索迪·鐵鏟的雞尾酒需要零件來自卡利姆多：跳過即可。",
	["Riaani Nightwind"] = "莉安妮·夜風",
	["Riaani stands in the Gustberry Lowlands just north-west of town."] = "莉安妮·夜風位於風莓低地就在城鎮西北面。",
	["Ricter"] = "瑞克特爾",
	["Ride a lift up to the mesas. Tal keeps the wind riders on the central rise; Cairne stands in the great tent there."] = "騎行一個升降梯上前往台地。塔爾保留風騎兵在中央高地；凱恩·血蹄位於巨型帳篷那裡。",
	["Ride all the way west to the Wildhammer town of Aerie Peak and place the message by the well in its centre. The town is full of Alliance guards: get in, place it and get out."] = "騎行全部路西前往弗斯塔德·蠻錘城鎮的鷹巢山與放置口信在旁水井在它的中心。城鎮是完整的聯盟衛兵：獲取在，放置它與獲取出。",
	["Ride back down the Webwinder Path to Malaka'jin."] = "騎行返回下蛛網小徑前往瑪拉卡金。",
	["Ride back down to town; Shaky stands at the tunnel mouth."] = "騎行返回下前往城鎮；“發抖者”菲利普位於隧道入口/河口。",
	["Ride back east along the road to the Vigil."] = "騎行返回東沿著道路前往崗哨。",
	["Ride back east along the road to the Yorgen Farmstead."] = "騎行返回東沿著道路前往約根農莊。",
	["Ride back east past Stonard and follow the road south-east to the small Horde post on the shore."] = "騎行返回東經過斯通納德與沿著道路前往東南前往小型部落崗哨在岸邊。",
	["Ride back east to Darkshire."] = "騎行返回東前往夜色鎮。",
	["Ride back east to Dustwind Gulch."] = "騎行返回東前往塵風峽谷。",
	["Ride back east to Tarren Mill."] = "騎行返回東前往塔倫米爾。",
	["Ride back east to the camp. Stay here: the next guide starts with the flight to Gadgetzan."] = "騎行返回東前往營地。留在此處：下一個指南始于飛行前往加基森。",
	["Ride back north to Brackenwall."] = "騎行返回北前往蕨牆村。",
	["Ride back north to Everlook and west along the road to the night elf village."] = "騎行返回北前往永望鎮與西沿著道路前往夜晚精靈村莊。",
	["Ride back north to Ironband's camp."] = "騎行返回北前往勘察員基恩薩·鐵環的營地。",
	["Ride back north to Tarren Mill, keeping west of Southshore."] = "騎行返回北前往塔倫米爾，保留在南海鎮以西。",
	["Ride back north to Thorium Point. Stay here: the next guide starts with the flight to Stonard."] = "騎行返回北前往瑟銀哨塔。留在此處：下一個指南始于飛行前往斯通納德。",
	["Ride back north to the bloodmages."] = "騎行返回北前往血法師。",
	["Ride back north-east past Refuge Pointe; Quae and Kinelory camp in the hills north of Go'Shek Farm."] = "騎行返回東北經過避難谷地；奎伊與基內洛里紮營於丘陵在格沙克農場以北。",
	["Ride back north-west from Misty Reed Post to Stonard and fly to Grom'gol."] = "騎行返回西北來自蘆葦哨崗前往斯通納德與飛往前往格羅姆高。",
	["Ride back north-west to the Forgotten Coast dock and take the boat to the island."] = "騎行返回西北前往被遺忘的海岸碼頭與乘船前往島嶼。",
	["Ride back out of Ironforge and east along the road to Helm's Bed Lake. Narm Faulk lies dead by its shore: use the Symbol of Life on him. The Dark Iron Spies sneaking around the lake carry the script."] = "騎行返回離開鐵爐堡與東沿著道路前往湧冰湖。納姆·法奧克位於死亡的在旁它的岸邊：使用生命符記在他。黑鐵間諜潛行在湖攜帶手稿周圍。",
	["Ride back out through Goldshire and east along the road to the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch. Surena Caledon (level 9) stands by its farmhouse."] = "騎行返回出穿過閃金鎮與東沿著道路前往布拉克威爾南瓜田。蘇倫娜·凱爾東（9級）站在旁邊：它的農舍。",
	["Ride back out through Goldshire and east to Stone Cairn Lake. Henze Faulk lies south of the lake: use the Symbol of Life on him. The Defias Rogue Wizards around him carry the Defias Script."] = "騎行返回出穿過閃金鎮與東前往石碑湖。亨茲·法奧克位於湖以南：使用生命符記在他。迪菲亞流浪巫師周圍他攜帶迪菲亞手稿。",
	["Ride back south along the road to the Sanctuary."] = "騎行返回南沿著道路前往聖地。",
	["Ride back south down the road, past the Valley of Fangs."] = "騎行返回南順著道路，經過巨牙谷。",
	["Ride back south past Jaedenar to the corrupted moonwell of the Jadefire satyrs and fill Winna's flasket there."] = "騎行返回南經過加德納爾前往腐化的月亮井的碧火薩特與裝滿溫娜·哈薩德的小瓶那裡。",
	["Ride back south to Grom'gol."] = "騎行返回南前往格羅姆高。",
	["Ride back south to Tarren Mill."] = "騎行返回南前往塔倫米爾。",
	["Ride back south to the Crossroads and fly to Ratchet."] = "騎行返回南前往十字路口與飛往前往棘齒城。",
	["Ride back south to the camp. Buy the Arcane Quickeners for the cauldrons from Alchemist Arbington."] = "騎行返回南前往營地。購買奧術催化劑給大鍋來自化學家阿爾比頓。",
	["Ride back south to the post."] = "騎行返回南前往崗哨。",
	["Ride back south-east to the Sanctuary."] = "騎行返回東南前往聖地。",
	["Ride back south-east to the hermit."] = "騎行返回東南前往隱士。",
	["Ride back south-west to Chillwind Camp."] = "騎行返回西南前往冰風崗。",
	["Ride back to Cenarion Hold and fly to Ratchet."] = "騎行返回前往塞納里奧要塞與飛往前往棘齒城。",
	["Ride back to Chillwind Camp and fly to Menethil Harbor, take the boat to Auberdine and fly to Rut'theran Village; the portal leads up to Darnassus."] = "騎行返回前往冰風崗與飛往前往米奈希爾港，乘船前往奧伯丁與飛往前往魯瑟蘭村；傳送門通往上前往達納蘇斯。",
	["Ride back to Nethergarde Keep and fly to Aerie Peak. The Wildkin Feathers lie on the ground across the Hinterlands, south and east of Aerie Peak, where the owlbeasts roam; the mobs here are well below you now."] = "騎行返回前往守望堡與飛往前往鷹巢山。梟獸羽毛位於領地穿過辛特蘭，南與在鷹巢山以東，在梟獸遊蕩；怪物此處是水井下方你現在。",
	["Ride back to Talrendis Point and fly to Everlook."] = "騎行返回前往塔倫迪斯營地與飛往前往永望鎮。",
	["Ride back to the Forgotten Coast; the goblin stands by the dock."] = "騎行返回前往被遺忘的海岸；地精站在旁邊：碼頭。",
	["Ride back to the Undercity, take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar and fly to Splintertree Post. Follow the road west out of Splintertree and take the fork north into Felwood."] = "騎行返回前往幽暗城，搭乘飛艇前往奧格瑞瑪與飛往前往碎木崗哨。沿著道路前往西離開碎木崗哨與接取岔路口北進入費伍德森林。",
	["Ride back west along the road to Menethil Harbor."] = "騎行返回西沿著道路前往米奈希爾港。",
	["Ride back west along the road, then north into the Rage Scar hills. Every yeti here can drop a hide; one may drop a Pristine Yeti Hide, which Pratt pays for too."] = "騎行返回西沿著道路，然後北進入怒痕堡丘陵。每個雪人此處可以掉落一個獸皮；1可能掉落一個原始雪人毛皮，其中普拉特·馬克格魯比獎勵給也。",
	["Ride back west along the road."] = "騎行返回西沿著道路。",
	["Ride back west to Brackenwall with the head."] = "騎行返回西前往蕨牆村與前往。",
	["Ride back west to Frostfire Hot Springs."] = "騎行返回西前往霜火溫泉。",
	["Ride back west to Gadgetzan."] = "騎行返回西前往加基森。",
	["Ride back west to Valormok."] = "騎行返回西前往瓦羅莫克。",
	["Ride back west to the road and follow it south out of Loch Modan through the pass into the Badlands. Prospector Ryedol and Sigrun Ironhew camp side by side at the dig."] = "騎行返回西前往道路與沿著它南離開洛克莫丹穿過穿過進入荒蕪之地。勘察員雷杜爾與西格魯·鐵斧營地並排在挖掘。",
	["Ride back west toward Gadgetzan. The Wastewander bandits and thieves hold the dunes on the way; any of them can carry a water pouch."] = "騎行返回西朝加基森方向。廢土漫遊者強盜與盜賊要塞沙丘在途中；任意的它們可以攜帶一個水袋子。",
	["Ride down into the Undercity: Jorah Annison stands in the Magic Quarter."] = "騎行下進入幽暗城：約拉·安尼森位於魔法區。",
	["Ride down the east side of the crater to the pylon on the eastern cliffs."] = "騎行下東一側的環形山前往水晶塔在東部懸崖。",
	["Ride down the ramp into the crater: Torwa camps at its foot."] = "騎行下坡道進入環形山：托爾瓦紮營於它的山腳。",
	["Ride down to Bloodhoof Village and tame with the Taming Rod: an Adult Plainstrider on the plains, a Prairie Stalker north of the village, a Swoop to the north-west."] = "騎行下前往血蹄村與馴服與馴獸棒：一個成年平原陸行鳥在平原，一個草原捕食者在村莊以北，一個猛鷲向西北。",
	["Ride east across the Cauldron to the Grimesilt Dig Site in the south-east. The prisoner in the wooden outhouse wants 15 Silk Cloth and eight dead Dark Iron Geologists from the dig site around it. The outhouse also opens with the key, if you found one."] = "騎行東穿過大鍋前往煤渣挖掘場在東南面。囚犯在木制戶外廁所需要15絲綢與8死亡的黑鐵地質學家來自挖掘地點周圍它。戶外廁所也開啓與鑰匙，如果你找到1。",
	["Ride east across the dunes to the goblin harbour on the north-east coast."] = "騎行東穿過沙丘前往地精港口在東北海岸。",
	["Ride east across the plaguelands to the chapel."] = "騎行東穿過瘟疫之地前往禮拜堂。",
	["Ride east again; the catapult stands at the Dragonmaw camp south of the road."] = "騎行東再次；投石車位於龍喉營地在道路以南。",
	["Ride east along the Wetlands road, south through Dun Algaz into Loch Modan and west through the tunnel into Dun Morogh to Ironforge."] = "騎行東沿著濕地道路，南穿過丹奧加茲進入洛克莫丹與西穿過隧道進入丹莫羅前往鐵爐堡。",
	["Ride east along the road out of Ashenvale into Azshara to the Sentinels' camp at Talrendis Point."] = "騎行東沿著道路離開灰谷進入艾薩拉前往哨兵的紮營於塔倫迪斯營地。",
	["Ride east along the road out of Splintertree. Loh'atu waits at the Shadowsong Shrine just off the road, a few steps west of the Alliance's Talrendis Point: come in from the west and keep clear of the Azshara Sentinels and Jarrodenus (elite)."] = "騎行東沿著道路離開碎木崗哨。羅哈圖等候於影歌神殿就在道路兩側，一個少量台階西的聯盟的塔倫迪斯營地：來到在來自西與保留清理的艾薩拉哨兵與加羅迪努斯（精英）。",
	["Ride east along the road to Everlook."] = "騎行東沿著道路前往永望鎮。",
	["Ride east along the road to the Bulwark on the border."] = "騎行東沿著道路前往亡靈壁壘在邊界。",
	["Ride east along the south shore of the loch to Ironband's camp."] = "騎行東沿著南岸邊的湖前往勘察員基恩薩·鐵環的營地。",
	["Ride east back to the Swamplight Manor."] = "騎行東返回前往水光莊園。",
	["Ride east from Camp Taurajo along the road into the marsh. The burned-out Shady Rest Inn stands beside it just past the border; the shield, the badge and the hoofprints are in and beside the ruin."] = "騎行東來自陶拉祖營地沿著道路進入沼澤。燒焦的-出樹蔭旅店站在旁邊：它就在經過邊界；盾牌，徽章與蹄印是在與在廢墟旁邊。",
	["Ride east into the hills. Use the Book of Aquor to summon Aquementas, then defeat him for the totem."] = "騎行東進入丘陵。使用阿奎爾之書前往召喚亞奎門塔斯，然後擊敗他給圖騰。",
	["Ride east out of Tarren Mill through Thoradin's Wall and follow the road east. The Boulderfist Ogres and Enforcers (32-34) camp south of the road, south-east of Northfold Manor."] = "騎行東離開塔倫米爾穿過索拉丁之牆與沿著道路前往東。石拳食人魔與石拳執行者（32-34）營地在道路以南，在諾斯弗德農場以東南。",
	["Ride east through Deadwind Pass into the Swamp of Sorrows and south down the road into the Blasted Lands. The bloodmages' camp is the first stop beside the road."] = "騎行東穿過逆風小徑進入悲傷沼澤與南順著道路進入詛咒之地。血法師的營地是第一停靠在道路旁邊。",
	["Ride east to Everlook and north out of it; the Moontouched Owlbeasts roam the hills of Frostsaber Rock's southern slopes. Pull them one at a time."] = "騎行東前往永望鎮與北出的它；月觸梟獸遊蕩於丘陵的霜刀石的南部山坡。拉怪它們1在一個時間。",
	["Ride east to Fire Plume Ridge, climb it and use Krakle's Thermometer at the lava vent near the top, then ride back west to Krakle."] = "騎行東前往火羽山，爬上它與使用克拉蘭克的溫度計在熔岩噴口在頂部附近，然後騎行返回西前往克拉蘭克。",
	["Ride east to Fire Plume Ridge, climb it and use Krakle's Thermometer at the lava vents near the top."] = "騎行東前往火羽山，爬上它與使用克拉蘭克的溫度計在熔岩噴口在頂部附近。",
	["Ride east to Layo Starstrike."] = "騎行東前往萊耶·星擊。",
	["Ride east to Mannoroc Coven. Use the Rod of Banishing by each demon portal to close six of them."] = "騎行東前往瑪諾洛克集會所。使用魔杖的放逐在旁每個惡魔傳送門前往靠近6的它們。",
	["Ride east to Tirion's hut by the Thondroril River and hear him out."] = "騎行東前往提里奧的小屋在旁索多里爾河與聽完他出。",
	["Ride east to the Crossroads and fly to Orgrimmar. Take the zeppelin from the towers outside Orgrimmar to Tirisfal Glades; the Undercity lies below the Ruins of Lordaeron. The bat handler is in the Trade Quarter."] = "騎行東前往十字路口與飛往前往奧格瑞瑪。搭乘飛艇來自哨塔在奧格瑞瑪外前往提瑞斯法林地；幽暗城位於下方洛丹倫廢墟。蝙蝠管理員是在貿易區。",
	["Ride east to the Gordunni camp in the hills south-east of the yeti valley: Warlocks and Shaman hold the camp, Brutes wander the slopes around it and further north."] = "騎行東前往戈杜尼紮營於丘陵在雪人山谷以東南：術士與薩滿祭司要塞營地，蠻兵遊蕩山坡周圍它與更遠處北。",
	["Ride east to the Hive'Ashi tower in Southwind Village; climb it and kill the ambushers that rise for the encrusted object."] = "騎行東前往亞什蟲巢哨塔在南風村；爬上它與擊殺伏擊者該高地給覆殼的物件。",
	["Ride east to the border river: Tirion lives in a small hut on the bank."] = "騎行東前往邊界河流：提里奧住在一個小型小屋在銀行。",
	["Ride east to the keep."] = "騎行東前往保留。",
	["Ride east to the night elf camp at Talonbranch Glade."] = "騎行東前往夜晚精靈紮營於刺枝林地。",
	["Ride east to the ogre mound. Abercrombie's Crate sits in the camp at its entrance; Splinter Fist ogres guard it."] = "騎行東前往食人魔土堆。亞伯克隆比的箱子位於營地裡在它的入口；碎木拳食人魔守衛它。",
	["Ride east to the ruins of Southwind Village. The Dusty Reliquary lies among the ruined buildings, watched by Tortured Sentinels."] = "騎行東前往廢墟的南風村。積灰的聖物箱位於其中：毀壞的建築，被監視的在旁被折磨的哨兵。",
	["Ride east to the ruins on the coast. Fill Cuely's four vials at the tide pools along the shore; Spitelash naga patrol between them."] = "騎行東前往廢墟在海岸邊。裝滿藥劑師科雷的4小瓶在潮汐水池沿著岸邊；怨靈納迦巡邏之間它們。",
	["Ride east, then south down Frostwhisper Gorge. The Frostmaul giants there are elite level 59: keep to the middle and keep moving. The strange source is at the mouth of Darkwhisper Gorge, at the south end."] = "騎行東，然後南下霜語峽谷。霜槌巨人那裡為精英59級：保留前往中間與保留移動的。奇怪的來源是在暗語峽谷的入口，在南盡頭。",
	["Ride east: Ashmane Boars and Redstone Basilisks share the slopes south-west of Nethergarde Keep. Keep clear of the Helboars further south: they are level 52."] = "騎行東：灰鬃野豬與紅石蜥蜴共享山坡在守望堡以西南。保留清理的地獄野豬更遠處南：它們是52級。",
	["Ride east; the Tangled Horrors along the way also drop the essays. Search the edge of the Pool of Tears, where the temple's ruins break the water."] = "騎行東；糾纏恐獸沿途也掉落論文。搜尋邊緣的淚水之池，在神廟的廢墟打斷水。",
	["Ride from Theramore west along the Dustwallow road into the Barrens and north to Ratchet on the coast. Learn the flight path from Bragok, then take the boat to Booty Bay from the dock."] = "騎行來自塞拉摩西沿著塵泥沼澤道路進入貧瘠之地與北前往棘齒城在海岸邊。學習飛行點來自布拉高克，然後乘船前往藏寶海灣來自碼頭。",
	["Ride inland to the Mistvale gorilla hills. Elder Mistvale Gorillas drop the giblets; Witch Doctor Unbagwa sits among them."] = "騎行內陸前往迷霧谷猩猩丘陵。老邁的薄霧谷猩猩掉落內臟；巫醫安巴格瓦位於其中：它們。",
	["Ride north along the east side of the crater to Marshal's Refuge, the camp in the caves of the northern cliff. Give the elite devilsaurs and stegodons a wide berth. Pick up every Power Crystal and Un'Goro Dirt Pile you pass from here on."] = "騎行北沿著東一側的環形山前往馬紹爾營地，紮營於洞穴的北部懸崖。交給精英魔暴龍與劍龍一個寬闊泊位。拾取/接取每個能量水晶與安戈洛土堆你穿過來自此處在。",
	["Ride north along the east side to the gorilla plateau. U'cha, a level 55 gorilla, sits in its deepest cave: clear the gorillas at the cave mouth first."] = "騎行北沿著東一側前往猩猩高原。尤爾查，一個55級猩猩，位於它的最深處洞穴：清理猩猩在洞穴入口/河口第一。",
	["Ride north along the east side. Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers fill the jungle."] = "騎行北沿著東一側。血瓣花鞭笞者與長尾鯊裝滿叢林。",
	["Ride north along the eastern hills; Tirion lives in a small house by the Thondroril River, at the border with the Eastern Plaguelands."] = "騎行北沿著東部丘陵；提里奧住在一個小型房屋在旁索多里爾河，在邊界與東瘟疫之地。",
	["Ride north along the road, past Jaedenar, to Bloodvenom Post."] = "騎行北沿著道路，經過加德納爾，前往血毒崗哨。",
	["Ride north along the west side to Mayna's small camp."] = "騎行北沿著西一側前往梅娜的小型營地。",
	["Ride north along the western jungle back to the refuge."] = "騎行北沿著西部叢林返回前往營地。",
	["Ride north back to Kargath."] = "騎行北返回前往卡加斯。",
	["Ride north back to Marshal's Refuge."] = "騎行北返回前往馬紹爾營地。",
	["Ride north back to Stonard and fly to the Undercity."] = "騎行北返回前往斯通納德與飛往前往幽暗城。",
	["Ride north into the yeti valley. Every Feral Scar yeti can drop a thick hide; Bloodroar the Stalker (level 48) prowls the middle."] = "騎行北進入雪人山谷。每個野性傷痕雪人可以掉落一個密集獸皮；血吼鋼鬃捕獵者（48級）潛行遊蕩中間。",
	["Ride north out of Astranaar into Felwood to the druids' camp on the road just past the border."] = "騎行北離開阿斯特蘭納進入費伍德森林前往德魯伊的營地在路上就在經過邊界。",
	["Ride north out of Astranaar into Felwood. Grazle the furbolg stands by the road just south of the Emerald Sanctuary."] = "騎行北離開阿斯特蘭納進入費伍德森林。格拉茲熊怪位於路邊就在南的翡翠聖地。",
	["Ride north out of Lakeshire through the pass into the Burning Steppes; Morgan's Vigil sits at the top, in the south-east of the Steppes."] = "騎行北離開湖畔鎮穿過穿過進入燃燒平原；摩根的崗哨位於頂部，在平原以東南。",
	["Ride north past Nesingwary's camp to the lake. The Venture Co. Geologists (34-36) work the camps along its western shore; they carry the Tumbled Crystals."] = "騎行北經過奈辛瓦里的營地前往湖。風險投資公司地質學家拉克斯班（34-36）有效紮營沿著它的西部岸邊；它們攜帶打磨過的水晶。",
	["Ride north past Valik's camp to Strahnbrad, the Syndicate-held village (35-37). Jailor Borhuin carries the Rusted Iron Key; Gol'dir sits in a cage in the house on the north side."] = "騎行北經過僕從瓦里克的營地前往斯坦恩布萊德，辛迪加-持有村莊（35-37）。看守員博胡恩攜帶鏽鐵鑰匙；高迪爾位於一個籠子在房屋在北一側。",
	["Ride north through Elwynn to Stormwind; Mathias Shaw is at SI:7 in Old Town."] = "騎行北穿過艾爾文森林前往暴風城；馬迪亞斯·肖爾馬迪亞斯·肖爾是在軍情七處在舊城區。",
	["Ride north to Ironstone Plateau, where the robot stands among the gorillas. Stay out of the deep cave there."] = "騎行北前往鐵石高原，在機器人位於其中：猩猩。留在離開深處洞穴那裡。",
	["Ride north to Marshal's Refuge. Use Umi's Mechanical Yeti beside Quixxil."] = "騎行北前往馬紹爾營地。使用烏米的機械雪人在奎克希爾旁邊。",
	["Ride north to Skulk Rock in the middle of the Hinterlands. Green Sludges and Jade Oozes crawl all around it."] = "騎行北前往隱匿石在中間的辛特蘭。綠色淤泥怪與玉石軟泥怪爬行全部周圍它。",
	["Ride north to Terrordale. Augustus lives in the ruined hut, and his receipt book lies in the ruined inn nearby."] = "騎行北前往恐懼谷。被感動的奧古斯圖斯住在毀壞的小屋，與他的收據書位於毀壞的旅店附近。",
	["Ride north to Thelsamar and fly to Southshore. Raleigh the Devout preaches by the inn."] = "騎行北前往塞爾薩瑪與飛往前往南海鎮。虔誠的萊雷恩佈道在旅店旁。",
	["Ride north to Timbermaw Hold (or fly back to Talonbranch Glade first) and through the tunnel into Winterspring; follow the road east to the goblin town of Everlook."] = "騎行北前往木喉要塞（或飛往返回前往刺枝林地第一）與穿過隧道進入冬泉谷；沿著道路前往東前往地精城鎮的永望鎮。",
	["Ride north to Witch Hill. Stinky stands at the foot of the hill; escort him while he gathers Bogbean Leaves just south of it."] = "騎行北前往女巫嶺。斯汀基位於山丘的底部；護送他當他採集澤豆葉就在它南面。",
	["Ride north to the Deadwood furbolgs' village by the Timbermaw Hold cave mouth."] = "騎行北前往死木熊怪的村莊在旁木喉要塞洞穴入口/河口。",
	["Ride north to the Plaguewood's north-eastern edge."] = "騎行北前往病木林的北-東部邊緣。",
	["Ride north to the Skullsplitter ruins east of the Venture Co. mine; pull the headhunters and berserkers one at a time. Ana'thek the Cruel guards the south-western ruins, and one pile of trophy skulls stands on the ruins' north side. Every Skullsplitter can drop a tusk or a necklace: the necklaces are the slow part, so keep killing in the warriors' camp north of the ruins until you have them all."] = "騎行北前往碎顱廢墟東的風險投資公司礦洞；拉怪獵頭者與狂戰士1在一個時間。殘忍的安納希克衛兵南-西部廢墟，與1堆的戰利品頭顱位於廢墟的北一側。每個裂顱者可以掉落一個長牙或一個項鍊：項鍊是緩慢部分，因此保留擊殺在戰士的營地在廢墟直到你有它們全部以北。",
	["Ride north to the hills west of the road. Maury \"Club Foot\" Wilkins and Jon-Jon the Crow stand together just north of Zanzil's village."] = "騎行北前往丘陵在道路以西。“畸腳”莫里·威金斯與火柴棍喬喬位於一起就在贊吉爾村以北。",
	["Ride north up the coast. Giant Softshell Clams lie in the shallows and the Enraged Reef Crawlers walk the beach; open each clam in your bags for its meat."] = "騎行北上海岸。巨型軟殼蚌殼位於淺灘與狂怒的暗礁蟹步行海灘；打開/開啓每個蚌殼在你的背包給它的肉。",
	["Ride north up the road again."] = "騎行北順著道路往上再次。",
	["Ride north up the road from the Crossroads to the Forgotten Pools; Regthar keeps watch on the rise above the water."] = "騎行北順著道路往上來自十字路口前往遺忘之池；雷戈薩·死門保留守望在高地在水上方。",
	["Ride north up the road to the Northridge lumber mill; Kirsta hides at the camp's edge."] = "騎行北順著道路往上前往北山伐木場伐木場磨坊；科爾斯塔·迪普沙東藏身在營地的邊緣。",
	["Ride north up the road to the hunters' camp."] = "騎行北順著道路往上前往獵人的營地。",
	["Ride north up the road to the hut by the road north of the graveyard."] = "騎行北順著道路往上前往小屋在路邊在墓地以北。",
	["Ride north up the road to the lumber mill and set the termite barrel down in the middle of it."] = "騎行北順著道路往上前往伐木場磨坊與設置白蟻木桶下在中間的它。",
	["Ride north up the road; the hunters camp on the hill above the river."] = "騎行北順著道路往上；獵人營地在山丘在河流上方。",
	["Ride north-east from Tarren Mill into the Hinterlands and east along the road; Gilveradin Sunchaser camps on the hill south of the elves' Quel'Danil Lodge."] = "騎行東北來自塔倫米爾進入辛特蘭與東沿著道路；基沃拉丁·獵日者紮營在山丘在精靈以南的奎爾丹尼小屋。",
	["Ride north-east out of Southshore on the road into the Hinterlands; Aerie Peak sits just past the border. Falstad holds court at the top, Gryphon Master Talonaxe tends the aviary and Fraggar Thundermantle stands by the inn."] = "騎行東北離開南海鎮在路上進入辛特蘭；鷹巢山位於就在經過邊界。弗斯塔德·蠻錘持有庭院在頂部，獅鷲管理員沙拉克·鷹斧照看鳥捨與弗拉加爾位於旅店旁。",
	["Ride north-east past Nesingwary's camp and follow the road north to the camp at the top of the vale."] = "騎行東北經過奈辛瓦里的營地與沿著道路前往北前往營地在山谷的頂部。",
	["Ride north-east to Kolkar Village. Khan Dez'hepah (35) walks among the tents on the east side with a Battle Lord or two (32-33): clear around him, then pull him alone at full health."] = "騎行東北前往科爾卡村。戴茲帕可汗（35）步行在其中：帳篷在東一側與一個戰鬥領主或2（32-33）：清理周圍他，然後拉怪他獨自在完整生命值。",
	["Ride north-east to Ortell's Hideout."] = "騎行東北前往隱士奧泰爾的藏身處。",
	["Ride north-east to Valor's Rest; you leave Silithus through the pass beside it."] = "騎行東北前往勇氣之眠；你跳過希利蘇斯穿過穿過旁邊它。",
	["Ride north-east to the East Pylon Watchtower. The Al'Aketh camp is just west of it, with Commander Belguilos at its north end. Every cultist can drop a windstone charm."] = "騎行東北前往東塔水晶哨塔。阿爾阿凱斯營地是就在它西面，與指揮官貝爾吉洛斯在它的北盡頭。每個邪教徒可以掉落一個風石護符。",
	["Ride north-east to the Valley of Spears. Melizza is held in the Maraudine centaur camp; free her and escort her out east of the valley."] = "騎行東北前往長矛谷。梅麗薩是持有在瑪拉丁半人馬營地；解救她的與護送她的出在山谷以東。",
	["Ride north-east to the abandoned dig; the supply crate lies there among the Dustbelcher ogres."] = "騎行東北前往廢棄的挖掘；補給木箱位於那裡在其中：塵嗝食人魔。",
	["Ride north-east to the dwarven ruins in the north of the Badlands; the chest sits among the Shadowforge dwarves. Ambassador Infernus nearby is elite: give him room."] = "騎行東北前往矮人廢墟在北面的荒蕪之地；箱子位於其中：暗爐戰士矮人。因弗努斯大使附近為精英：交給他房間。",
	["Ride north-east to the goblin harbour on the coast."] = "騎行東北前往地精港口在海岸邊。",
	["Ride north-east to the goblin's camp on the cliffs above the Bay of Storms."] = "騎行東北前往地精的營地在懸崖上方風暴海灣。",
	["Ride north-east to the night elf outpost on the Thousand Needles border."] = "騎行東北前往夜晚精靈前哨站在千針石林邊界。",
	["Ride north-west across the gorge; Thorium Point is the scaffolded camp in the north-west."] = "騎行西北穿過峽谷；瑟銀哨塔是腳手架營地在西北面。",
	["Ride north-west back to the village."] = "騎行西北返回前往村莊。",
	["Ride north-west from the mine to the bay on the north-west coast. The Giant Clams lie on its floor and hold the pearls; Gazban swims among them and drops the Stone of the Tides."] = "騎行西北來自採礦前往海灣在西北海岸。巨型蚌殼位於它的樓層與要塞珍珠；加茲班游動在其中：它們與掉落海潮之石。",
	["Ride north-west into Andorhal. Chromie waits in the ruined inn on the west side of town; the skeletons inside are 54-57, so keep to the edges."] = "騎行西北進入安多哈爾。克羅米等候於毀壞的旅店在西一側的城鎮；骷髏內部是54-57，因此保留前往邊緣。",
	["Ride north-west to Grom'gol."] = "騎行西北前往格羅姆高。",
	["Ride north-west to Jaedenar. The four braziers stand among the Shadow Council's buildings; use the Cleansed Water on each one."] = "騎行西北前往加德納爾。4火盆位於其中：暗影議會的建築；使用淨化的水在每個1。",
	["Ride north-west to Quel'Lithien Lodge, at the edge of the Plaguewood."] = "騎行西北前往奎爾林斯小屋，在邊緣的病木林。",
	["Ride north-west to Tirion's hut."] = "騎行西北前往提里奧的小屋。",
	["Ride north-west to the Centipaar hive in the dunes. Any Centipaar can drop insect parts."] = "騎行西北前往森提帕爾蟲巢在沙丘。任意森提帕爾可以掉落昆蟲零件。",
	["Ride north-west to the Dalson farm. The diary lies in the barn; a wandering skeleton carries the outhouse key, and Farmer Dalson waits in the outhouse with the cabinet key."] = "騎行西北前往達爾松農場。日記位於穀倉；一個遊蕩的骷髏攜帶戶外廁所鑰匙，與農夫達爾松等候於戶外廁所與櫥櫃鑰匙。",
	["Ride north-west to the Forgotten Coast; Zorbin waits on the dock."] = "騎行西北前往被遺忘的海岸；佐爾賓等候在碼頭上。",
	["Ride north-west to the Sandfury troll camp at Sandsorrow Watch. Use the Untapped Dowsing Widget at the edge of its pool; the trolls stand close, so pull the nearest first."] = "騎行西北前往沙怒巨魔紮營於流沙崗哨。使用未使用的尋水器在邊緣的它的水池；巨魔位於靠近，因此拉怪最近的第一。",
	["Ride north; the outer circle stands in the middle of the highlands."] = "騎行北；外側法陣位於高地的中央。",
	["Ride on north to Chillwind Camp and fly to Light's Hope Chapel."] = "騎行在北前往冰風崗與飛往前往聖光之願禮拜堂。",
	["Ride out of the crater's north-western pass into Silithus and on to Cenarion Hold."] = "騎行離開環形山的北-西部穿過進入希利蘇斯與在前往塞納里奧要塞。",
	["Ride south along the coast from Ratchet to Fray Island. Klannoc Macleod stands by the arena: step on the grate to start the fight; the challengers come one at a time, then Big Will (33)."] = "騎行南沿著海岸來自棘齒城前往勇士島。克蘭諾克·馬克雷德站在旁邊：競技場：步驟在格柵前往開始迎戰；挑戰者來到1在一個時間，然後比格維爾（33）。",
	["Ride south along the eastern cliffs to Torwa at the foot of the ramp."] = "騎行南沿著東部懸崖前往托爾瓦在坡道的底部。",
	["Ride south along the road to the Broken Pillar; Marvon Rivetseeker camps beside it. From here the road west leads down into Un'Goro Crater, where the next guide starts."] = "騎行南沿著道路前往破碎石柱；瑪爾馮·瑞文斯克紮營旁邊它。來自此處道路西通往下進入安戈洛環形山，在下一個指南始於。",
	["Ride south back to the road and follow it east across the whole zone to Light's Hope Chapel."] = "騎行南返回前往道路與沿著它東穿過整個區域前往聖光之願禮拜堂。",
	["Ride south down the coast back to Shadowprey."] = "騎行南下海岸返回前往葬影村。",
	["Ride south down the coast to Grom'gol and fly to Booty Bay."] = "騎行南下海岸前往格羅姆高與飛往前往藏寶海灣。",
	["Ride south down the east side. Young Diemetradons graze the eastern jungle and Fledgling Pterrordax fly near the eastern cliffs; both drop Shizzle's scales."] = "騎行南下東一側。幼雙帆龍吃草東部叢林與小翼手龍飛往在東部懸崖附近；兩個掉落希茲爾的鱗片。",
	["Ride south into Andorhal. Chromie waits in the ruined inn on the west side of town. Stand in the doorway of each of the four towers with the Beacon Torch to mark it; keep to the edges of town. Use the Temporal Displacer by the silos in the middle of town to bring out Temporal Parasites."] = "騎行南進入安多哈爾。克羅米等候於毀壞的旅店在西一側的城鎮。位於門口的每個的4哨塔與信號火炬前往標記它；保留前往邊緣的城鎮。使用時空置換器在旁糧倉在中間的城鎮前往攜帶出時光寄生蟲。",
	["Ride south into Thistleshrub Valley. The Dew Collectors drop the glands; only some are full, so keep the Laden one. Gnarled Thistleshrubs and Rootshapers share the valley. The Thistleshrubs are 48-50, above you: pull one at a time."] = "騎行南進入灌木谷。露水我的最愛家庫米沙掉落腺體；僅一些是完整，因此保留滿載的1。長瘤的灌木獸與塑根者共享山谷。薊木是48-50，上方你：拉怪1在一個時間。",
	["Ride south out of Loch Modan through the pass into the Badlands; Sigrun Ironhew camps at the dig."] = "騎行南離開洛克莫丹穿過穿過進入荒蕪之地；西格魯·鐵斧紮營於挖掘。",
	["Ride south past Mystral Lake into the Talondeep Path tunnel; it comes out in Stonetalon's Windshear Crag. Kaela and Gaxim camp on the Webwinder Path south-west of the crag."] = "騎行南經過密斯特拉湖進入石爪小徑隧道；它來自出在石爪山脈的狂風峭壁。凱拉·影矛與加克希姆·塵鏈營地在蛛網小徑在峭壁以西南。",
	["Ride south past the Broken Pillar to the Gaping Chasm, the Hazzali tunnels; Scrimshank's gear lies deep inside."] = "騎行南經過破碎石柱前往大裂口，哈扎里隧道；斯克林尚克的裝備位於深處內部。",
	["Ride south past the Writhing Haunt to Sorrow Hill; Marlene's house stands by the road, and Joseph Redpath's monument is in the graveyard behind it. Kill the Diseased Wolves you meet in the fields on the way."] = "騎行南經過蠕行之禍前往悔恨嶺；瑪萊恩·雷德帕斯的房屋位於路邊，與約瑟夫·雷德帕斯的紀念碑是在墓地後面它。擊殺患病的狼你會合在農田在途中。",
	["Ride south through the pass into the Badlands' northern edge: the Stonevault troggs dig outside Uldaman there. The carved urns and the magenta mushroom clusters sit in their caves and tunnels, outside the dungeon itself."] = "騎行南穿過穿過進入荒蕪之地的北部邊緣：石窖穴居人挖掘在奧達曼外那裡。雕刻的骨灰甕與洋紅蘑菇簇坐在它們的洞穴與隧道，在地下城其本身外。",
	["Ride south to Agmond's End."] = "騎行南前往埃格蒙德的營地。",
	["Ride south to Booty Bay. Shaky Phillipe waits on the docks."] = "騎行南前往藏寶海灣。“發抖者”菲利普等候在碼頭上。",
	["Ride south to Fire Plume Ridge in the middle of the crater, then east into the eastern jungle. Crystal clusters stand all over the crater, many of them around Fire Plume Ridge: take a few extra of each colour. Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers drop the petals; the expedition's Crate of Foodstuffs sits at an abandoned camp in the eastern jungle."] = "騎行南前往火羽山在環形山的中央，然後東進入東部叢林。水晶簇位於全部越過環形山，許多的它們在火羽山周圍：接取一個少量額外的每個顏色。血瓣花鞭笞者與長尾鯊掉落花瓣；遠徵隊的食物箱位於一個廢棄的紮營於東部叢林。",
	["Ride south to Gahrron's Withering, where Cauldron Lord Soulwrath guards the cauldron."] = "騎行南前往蓋羅恩農場，在護鍋者索瓦斯衛兵大鍋。",
	["Ride south to Owl Wing Thicket. Protect Ranshalla while she lights the torches on the way to the Altar of Elune."] = "騎行南前往梟翼樹叢。保護蘭莎爾拉當她點燃火炬在途中前往艾露恩祭壇。",
	["Ride south to the Crossroads, then west along the road out of the Barrens into Stonetalon. The troll village of Malaka'jin sits at the entrance of the canyon."] = "騎行南前往十字路口，然後西沿著道路出的貧瘠之地進入石爪山脈。巨魔村莊的瑪拉卡金位於峽谷入口處。",
	["Ride south to the dig camp at the Broken Pillar. Marvon hands you a detector helm: wear it to see the Gahz'ridian mounds, which lie thick in the sand around the camp and south-west toward the ogres."] = "騎行南前往挖掘紮營於破碎石柱。馬馮發放你一個探測器頭盔：佩戴它前往查看加茲瑞迪安土堆，其中位於密集在沙子在營地與南周圍-西朝食人魔方向。",
	["Ride south to the giant's hut in the middle of the marsh."] = "騎行南前往巨型的小屋在沼澤的中央。",
	["Ride south, east of Southshore, down to the coast. The Daggerspine naga line the shore south-east of the town."] = "騎行南，在南海鎮以東，下前往海岸。匕首沼納迦路線岸邊在城鎮以東南。",
	["Ride south-east down the valley to Jaron's damaged crate in the snow at Mazthoril, with his wrecked wagon just east of it."] = "騎行東南下山谷前往加隆·石矛的受損的木箱在雪在麥索瑞爾，與他的失事的馬車就在它東面。",
	["Ride south-east off the Shimmering Flats into Tanaris. Gadgetzan is just inside the border."] = "騎行東南偏離/關閉閃光平原進入塔納利斯。加基森是就在邊界內。",
	["Ride south-east to Ortell's Hideout under the Un'Goro cliffs."] = "騎行東南前往隱士奧泰爾的藏身處在下方安戈洛環形山懸崖。",
	["Ride south-east to Waterspring Field. Caliph stands in the middle of the southern Wastewander camp: clear around him first."] = "騎行東南前往清泉平原。卡利夫位於南部的中央廢土竊賊營地：清理周圍他第一。",
	["Ride south-east to the Altar of Zul, the stepped Vilebranch temple in the south of the Hinterlands, and climb to the top. Qiaga and Morta'gya the Keeper (elite, 50) stand up there: touch the top and come straight back down."] = "騎行東南前往祖爾祭壇，踩踏邪枝神廟在南面的辛特蘭，與爬上前往頂部。琪亞加與守護者莫塔加亞（精英，50）位於上那裡：觸碰/靠近頂部與來到直走返回下。",
	["Ride south-east to the Woodpaw gnolls; the courier's backpacks lie in their southern camp, and a parcel inside them starts a delivery to Thalanaar. The Zukk'ash hive is just south: fight down to the pod that holds Raschal, free him and keep him alive on the way out."] = "騎行東南前往木爪豺狼人；信使的背包位於它們的南部營地，與一個包裹內部它們始於一個遞送物前往薩蘭納爾。祖卡什蟲巢是就在南：迎戰下前往豆莢該持有拉斯查爾，解救他與保留他存活在途中出。",
	["Ride south-east to the post."] = "騎行東南前往崗哨。",
	["Ride south-west along the western cliffs. Frenzied Pterrordax fly over the west side, and Bloodpetal Trappers grow in the same jungle."] = "騎行西南沿著西部懸崖。狂怒的翼手龍飛往越過西一側，與血瓣花捕獸者生長在相同叢林。",
	["Ride south-west out of Arathi over Thandol Span, south through the Wetlands (keep clear of Menethil Harbor) and east into Loch Modan; the road leaves Loch Modan to the south into the Badlands. Follow it south to the goblin camp in the Valley of Fangs."] = "騎行西南離開阿拉希高地越過薩多爾大橋，南穿過濕地（保留清理的米奈希爾港）與東進入洛克莫丹；道路離開洛克莫丹向南進入荒蕪之地。沿著它南前往地精紮營於巨牙谷。",
	["Ride south-west past Felstone Farm and follow the road west back to the Bulwark."] = "騎行西南經過詹妮絲·費爾斯通農場與沿著道路前往西返回前往亡靈壁壘。",
	["Ride south-west to Chromie in Andorhal."] = "騎行西南前往克羅米在安多哈爾。",
	["Ride south-west to Fire Plume Ridge, the volcano in the middle of the crater. Bloodpetal Flayers grow around its foot."] = "騎行西南前往火羽山，火山在環形山的中央。血瓣花掠奪者生長周圍它的山腳。",
	["Ride south-west to Gadgetzan."] = "騎行西南前往加基森。",
	["Ride south-west to Marvon Rivetseeker's camp at the Broken Pillar."] = "騎行西南前往瑪爾馮·瑞文斯克的紮營於破碎石柱。",
	["Ride south-west to the Musty Scroll, then east through the Wyrmbog. The Firemane scouts and ash tails roam its northern edge with the Searing hatchlings and whelps; the scalebanes guard the dragon caves further south-east. Mok'Morokk's snuff, grog and strongbox lie in the dragonkin camps."] = "騎行西南前往發霉的捲軸，然後東穿過巨龍沼澤。莫特加·火鬃斥候與灰燼尾巴遊蕩它的北部邊緣與炎鵬幼體與雛龍；鱗災守衛龍洞穴更遠處東南。莫格穆洛克大王的熄滅，烈酒與保險箱位於龍類紮營。",
	["Ride south-west to the Undercroft. The mound of dirt lies inside. Mercutio Filthgorger is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "騎行西南前往地下墓穴。土堆的泥土位於內部。米庫提奧·污血為精英：建議組隊前往。",
	["Ride south-west to the camp."] = "騎行西南前往營地。",
	["Ride south-west to the dwarves' camp near the southern mountains and question Frankal Stonebridge and Rutgar Glyphshaper. Noggle's satchel lies in the sand just south-east of the camp."] = "騎行西南前往矮人的營地在南部山脈與問題附近弗蘭卡·石橋與魯特加爾·雕石。諾格·斯巴格的挎包位於沙子就在營地以東南。",
	["Ride south-west to the goblins' cove on the southern coast. Lolo the Lookout keeps watch on the cliff above it."] = "騎行西南前往地精的小灣在南部海岸。哨兵魯魯保留守望在懸崖上方它。",
	["Ride south-west to the ogre compound. Brutes and Enforcers (46-48) fill it; Gor'marok the Ravager (49) stands in the middle with guards around him: clear them first."] = "騎行西南前往食人魔營區。蠻兵與石拳執行者（46-48）裝滿它；掠奪者格瑪洛克（49）位於中間與衛兵周圍他：清理它們第一。",
	["Ride south-west to the ogre ruins below Feral Scar Vale. Shamans, warlocks and maulers fill them; the Mage-Lords at the southern end carry the orb."] = "騎行西南前往食人魔廢墟在深痕谷下方。薩滿祭司，術士與槌兵裝滿它們；法師-領主在南部盡頭攜帶寶珠。",
	["Ride south-west to the ruins of Southwind Village. The Dusty Reliquary for Rabine Saturna sits inside one of the ruined houses."] = "騎行西南前往廢墟的南風村。積灰的聖物箱給拉比恩·薩圖納位於內部1的毀壞的房屋。",
	["Ride south-west to the ruins. The four tablets lie among the ruins, guarded by Spitelash naga; any Siren or Myrmidon can carry Kim'jael's rune."] = "騎行西南前往廢墟。4石板位於其中：廢墟，有守衛的在旁怨靈納迦；任意海妖或皇家衛兵可以攜帶基姆加爾的符文。",
	["Ride south-west to the troll village on the coast, keeping clear of the Gelkis Village on the way."] = "騎行西南前往巨魔村莊在海岸邊，保留清理的吉爾吉斯村在途中。",
	["Ride south-west towards Shadowprey. The Gelkis centaurs (32-35) around their village are a good camp; fight them until level 32."] = "騎行西南朝葬影村方向。吉爾吉斯半人馬（32-35）周圍它們的村莊是一個好營地；迎戰它們直到32級。",
	["Ride the lift down, then follow the road east through the canyons to Freewind Post, a Tauren village on top of the mesas. Its lift is on the north side."] = "騎行升降梯下，然後沿著道路前往東穿過峽谷前往亂風崗，一個牛頭人村莊在頂部的台地。它的升降梯是在北一側。",
	["Ride the road south through Felwood to the Sanctuary."] = "騎行道路南穿過費伍德森林前往聖地。",
	["Ride to Darrowshire in the south-west; Pamela plays among the houses. Mercutio Filthgorger lurks in the Undercroft, the crypt just west of the town."] = "騎行前往達隆郡在西南面；帕米拉進行在其中：房屋。米庫提奧·污血潛伏在地下墓穴，地穴就在城鎮以西。",
	["Ride to Stormwind. It has no shaman trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge, train with Eldrun Stormbreaker, then ride the tram back for the boat."] = "騎行前往暴風城。它有無薩滿祭司訓練師：接取礦道地鐵來自矮人區前往鐵爐堡，訓練與埃爾德倫·破風者，然後騎行地鐵返回給船。",
	["Ride west across the Badlands to the Dustbelcher camp at Camp Boff. Boss Tho'grun stands in its middle with Wyrmhunters and Maulers around him."] = "騎行西穿過荒蕪之地前往塵嗝紮營於博夫營地。索格倫位於它的中間與獵龍者與科卡爾虐待者周圍他。",
	["Ride west along the crater's northern wall to the pass in the north-west corner that climbs into Silithus."] = "騎行西沿著環形山的北部城牆前往穿過在西北面角落該爬上進入希利蘇斯。",
	["Ride west along the main road across Ashenvale, past Astranaar (Alliance: keep to the road), to the coast. Zoram'gar Outpost is on the Zoram Strand in the north-west. Its other quests are for the next visit, at 27."] = "騎行西沿著主道路穿過灰谷，經過阿斯特蘭納（聯盟：保留前往道路），前往海岸。佐拉姆加前哨站是在佐拉姆暗灘喚魔師在西北面。它的其他任務是給下一個造訪，在27。",
	["Ride west along the road once more."] = "騎行西沿著道路一次更多。",
	["Ride west along the road out of Raven Hill into Westfall. Agent Kearnen watches Klaven Mortwake's tower from the hills just inside the border. The Malformed Defias Drone (level 23) guarding the tower carries its key; Klaven's journal is in the chest at the top."] = "騎行西沿著道路離開烏鴉嶺進入西部荒野。密探吉爾妮注視克拉文·摩特維克的哨塔來自丘陵就在邊界內。醜陋的迪菲亞懶漢（23級）守衛哨塔攜帶它的鑰匙；克拉文的日記是在箱子在頂部。",
	["Ride west along the road past Lake Kel'Theril; Raging Owlbeasts roam the hills north of it."] = "騎行西沿著道路經過凱斯利爾湖；狂怒梟獸遊蕩於丘陵在它北面。",
	["Ride west along the road to Jaron."] = "騎行西沿著道路前往加隆·石矛。",
	["Ride west along the road to the draenei camp at the Harborage, near the way in from Deadwind Pass."] = "騎行西沿著道路前往德萊尼紮營於庇護所，在路在來自附近逆風小徑。",
	["Ride west along the road to the hot springs."] = "騎行西沿著道路前往熱溫泉。",
	["Ride west along the road to the night elf village."] = "騎行西沿著道路前往夜晚精靈村莊。",
	["Ride west along the road; Lotwil's camp sits in the Dustbowl halfway to Kargath."] = "騎行西沿著道路；洛特維爾的營地位於塵風盆地半路前往卡加斯。",
	["Ride west along the road; the hermit's shack stands north-east of the Raven Hill Cemetery."] = "騎行西沿著道路；隱士的棚屋位於東北的烏鴉嶺墓地。",
	["Ride west along the road; the scroll lies at the water's edge in the swamp's far west."] = "騎行西沿著道路；捲軸位於水的邊緣在沼澤的遠處西。",
	["Ride west back across the marsh. The Darkfang Venomspitters on the ridges north of Brackenwall drop the venom sacs. Theramore Infiltrators (35-36) sneak through the same woods: they are stealthed, so look closely."] = "騎行西返回穿過沼澤。暗牙毒蜘蛛在山脊在蕨牆村以北掉落毒液囊。塞拉摩間諜（35-36）潛行穿過相同樹林：它們是潛行的，因此查看緊密地。",
	["Ride west back to Valormok."] = "騎行西返回前往瓦羅莫克。",
	["Ride west back to the refuge."] = "騎行西返回前往營地。",
	["Ride west from Torwa: the silithid hive fills the south of the crater. Use the Scraping Vial on a hatchery, a chamber with hanging larvae. Gorishi wasps and workers drop Un'Goro Soil; Pterrordax nest on the southern cliffs if you still need kills."] = "騎行西來自托爾瓦：異種蟲蟲巢裝滿在環形山以南。使用刮取瓶在一個孵化間，一個密室與懸掛的幼蟲。戈里什黃蜂與工人掉落安戈洛的泥土；翼手龍巢在南部懸崖如果你仍然需要擊殺。",
	["Ride west into the Dustbowl; Lotwil works by his machines in the middle of it."] = "騎行西進入塵風盆地；洛特維爾有效在旁他的機器在中間的它。",
	["Ride west into the middle of Feralas. Kill a Rogue Vale Screecher, use Yeh'kinya's Bramble on its body and kill the spirit that rises."] = "騎行西進入中間的菲拉斯。擊殺一個遊蕩的山谷尖嘯者，使用葉基亞的樹枝在它的屍體與擊殺之靈該高地。",
	["Ride west out of Gadgetzan to the long ramp down into Un'Goro Crater. Torwa camps at the foot of the ramp, in the south-east corner of the crater."] = "騎行西離開加基森前往長坡道下進入安戈洛環形山。托爾瓦紮營在坡道的底部，在東南面角落的環形山。",
	["Ride west out of Stonard and south through the canyon into the Blasted Lands; the two bloodmages stand by the road just inside."] = "騎行西離開斯通納德與南穿過峽谷進入詛咒之地；2血法師位於路邊就在內部。",
	["Ride west past Marshal's Refuge and south down the western side to Golakka Hot Springs: Krakle the goblin sits by the water."] = "騎行西經過馬紹爾營地與南下西部一側前往葛拉卡溫泉：克拉蘭克地精位於水。",
	["Ride west to Azore Aldamort's tower at Ethel Rethor on the north-west coast."] = "騎行西前往阿佐爾·奧達蒙特的哨塔在艾瑟雷索在西北海岸。",
	["Ride west to Grom'gol."] = "騎行西前往格羅姆高。",
	["Ride west to Terrordale. Plaguehound Runts, Plaguebats and Carrion Grubs roam its woods; fill the Empty Termite Jar at the big termite mounds and kill the Frenzied Plaguehounds further north."] = "騎行西前往恐懼谷。瘟疫幼犬，瘟疫蝙蝠與腐肉蟲遊蕩它的樹林；裝滿空的白蟻瓶在大白蟻土堆與擊殺狂怒的瘟疫犬更遠處北。",
	["Ride west to Thunder Axe Fortress. Beat a Burning Blade cultist down, then use the Burning Gem on it before it dies to fill one Infused Burning Gem. They also drop a Flayed Demon Skin now and then (1-5%); if one drops, read it."] = "騎行西前往雷斧堡壘。擊敗一個火刃邪教徒下，然後使用燃燒寶石在它之前它死亡前往裝滿1灌入靈魂的燃燒寶石。它們也掉落一個惡魔之皮現在與然後（1-5%）；如果1掉落，閱讀它。",
	["Ride west to the Horde camp north of Hive'Regal."] = "騎行西前往部落營地在雷戈蟲巢以北。",
	["Ride west to the Marris Stead."] = "騎行西前往瑪瑞斯農場。",
	["Ride west to the Northridge Lumber Camp; Kirsta hides on the hill north-east of it."] = "騎行西前往北山伐木場；科爾斯塔·迪普沙東藏身在山丘在它東北面。",
	["Ride west to the Valley of Fangs in the middle of the Badlands; Rigglefuzz camps beside Martek."] = "騎行西前往巨牙谷在中間的荒蕪之地；里格弗茲紮營在流放者馬特克旁邊。",
	["Ride west to the dig site. War Reaver golems (53) stomp around it and drop the shards often; the Tablet of the Seven stands in its middle among the Thaurissan dwarves. Copy it."] = "騎行西前往挖掘地點。戰爭掠奪者魔像（53）踐踏周圍它與掉落碎片經常；七賢石板位於它的中間在其中：索瑞森矮人。副本它。",
	["Ride west to the friendly mountain giant at the foot of the hills. Land Walkers and Cliff Giants around him are elite: give them room."] = "騎行西前往友善山脈巨型在丘陵的底部。大地行者與峭壁巨人周圍他為精英：交給它們房間。",
	["Ride west to the hermit once more."] = "騎行西前往隱士一次更多。",
	["Ride west to the shore of Lake Falathim. Teronis lies among the Saltspittle murlocs; any murloc can drop the Glowing Gem."] = "騎行西前往岸邊的法拉希姆湖。特羅尼斯位於其中：鹽沫魚人；任意魚人可以掉落髮光的寶石。",
	["Ride west to the walled hold in the middle of the desert."] = "騎行西前往有圍牆的要塞在沙漠的中央。",
	["Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. In Classic each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is Kar Stormsinger in Bloodhoof Village, with Harb Clawhoof's kodos (20 gold each) beside him. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (not confirmed): try Kildar in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor first, as he is the nearest, and skip this step if he teaches you."] = "騎術需要40級與花費100金幣；學習它給你一個坐騎。在經典舊世每個種族學習它來自它的自己的種族的訓練師：你的是卡爾·雷歌在血蹄村，與哈布·爪蹄的科多獸（20金幣每個）旁邊他。永恆服可能允許任意種族學習來自任意騎術訓練師（不已確認）：嘗試基爾達在奧格瑞瑪的榮譽谷第一，作為他是最近的，與跳過此步驟如果他傳授你。",
	["Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. In Classic each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is Velma Warnam in Brill, with Zachariah Post's skeletal horses (20 gold each) beside her. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (not confirmed): try Kildar in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor first, as he is the nearest, and skip this step if he teaches you."] = "騎術需要40級與花費100金幣；學習它給你一個坐騎。在經典舊世每個種族學習它來自它的自己的種族的訓練師：你的是維爾瑪·瓦納姆在布瑞爾，與撒迦利亞·普斯特的骷髏馬（20金幣每個）旁邊她的。永恆服可能允許任意種族學習來自任意騎術訓練師（不已確認）：嘗試基爾達在奧格瑞瑪的榮譽谷第一，作為他是最近的，與跳過此步驟如果他傳授你。",
	["Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. In Classic each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is Xar'Ti in Sen'jin Village on the Durotar coast, with Zjolnir's raptors (20 gold each) beside him. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (not confirmed): try Kildar in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor first, as he is the nearest, and skip this step if he teaches you."] = "騎術需要40級與花費100金幣；學習它給你一個坐騎。在經典舊世每個種族學習它來自它的自己的種族的訓練師：你的是克薩爾迪在森金村在杜隆塔爾海岸，與佐爾尼爾的迅猛龍（20金幣每個）旁邊他。永恆服可能允許任意種族學習來自任意騎術訓練師（不已確認）：嘗試基爾達在奧格瑞瑪的榮譽谷第一，作為他是最近的，與跳過此步驟如果他傳授你。",
	["Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Kildar teaches Orcs in the Valley of Honor, by Ogunaro Wolfrunner's kennel; no Skyborne riding trainer is known, so Skyborne try Kildar too. Your race's other mounts are 20 gold each: Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 has a guide for each."] = "騎術需要40級與花費100金幣；學習它給你一個坐騎。基爾達傳授獸人在榮譽谷，在旁奧古納羅的獸欄；無天裔騎術訓練師是已知，因此天裔嘗試基爾達也。你的種族的其他坐騎是20金幣每個：藏品收集，坐騎 · 40級有一個指南給每個。",
	["Rifleman Torrig, at the Alliance tents"] = "火槍手托瑞格，在聯盟帳篷",
	["Rigger Gizelton"] = "里格·基澤爾頓",
	["Rigger Gizelton's caravan stops on the road at the edge of Mannoroc Coven. Escort it east past the coven; demons attack it twice."] = "里格·基澤爾頓的商隊停靠在路上在瑪諾洛克集會所的邊緣。護送它東經過女巫團；惡魔攻擊它兩次。",
	["Rigger Gizelton's caravan stops on the road east of Gelkis Village. Take the quest and walk with the kodos past the Mannoroc Coven, killing the demons that jump them; talk to Smeed at his camp east of the Kodo Graveyard afterwards."] = "里格·基澤爾頓的商隊停靠在路上在吉爾吉斯村以東。接取任務與步行與科多獸經過瑪諾洛克集會所，擊殺惡魔該跳下它們；對話前往斯米德在他的營地東的科多獸墳場隨後。",
	["Rigglefuzz"] = "里格弗茲",
	["Rigglefuzz's next quest pays no experience: skip it."] = "里格弗茲的下一個任務不給經驗值：跳過即可。",
	["Rilli Greasygob, Valley of Honor"] = "雷里·格里斯高布，榮譽谷",
	["Rimtori's camp is at the east end of the base camp. Read the Kaldorei Tome of Summoning there, then kill the Magus."] = "里姆托里的營地是在基地營地的東端。閱讀卡多雷召喚魔典那裡，然後擊殺魔導師。",
	["Rin'ji"] = "林吉",
	["Ring of Zoram"] = "佐拉姆之戒",
	["Ring the bell whenever Shay stops to wander, and lead her south to Rockbiter."] = "戒指鐘每當沙恩·飄葉停靠前往遊蕩，與引導她的南前往羅克比特。",
	["Ringo sits on the ridge, lost and exhausted."] = "林格位於山脊，遺失的與力竭的。",
	["Ringo sits on the south-east slope of Fire Plume Ridge, in the middle of the crater."] = "林格位於東南山坡的火羽山，在環形山的中央。",
	["Ripe Stormapples and Hungry Bandits are in the orchard by the farm, Flutterfly Dust in the fields north-east of it, Ornery Galestriders all around. The Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct stands in the field north-east of the farm."] = "成熟的風暴蘋果與飢餓的強盜是在果園在旁農場，彩蝶粉塵在農田在它東北面，暴躁的疾風陸行鳥全部周圍。失靈的旋風構造體位於田野在農場以東北。",
	["Ripped Missive"] = "撕裂的密信",
	["River Crocolisks swim the river by the Rebel Camp."] = "淡水鰐游泳河流在旁反抗軍營地。",
	["Rivern Frostwind at Frostsaber Rock in northern Winterspring offers the repeatable Frostsaber Provisions, Winterfall Intrusion and Rampaging Giants (level 58); they are the whole road to Exalted, so expect weeks of turn-ins."] = "雷沃·霜翼在霜刀石在北部冬泉谷提供可重復霜刃豹的食物，冬泉熊怪的侵擾與狂暴的巨人（58級）；它們是整個道路前往崇拜，因此預計周的交任務。",
	["Rivern Frostwind, 200g"] = "雷沃·霜翼，200金",
	["Rivern Frostwind, Frostsaber Rock"] = "雷沃·霜翼，霜刀石",
	["Riverpaw Bandits and Taskmasters (level 16-18) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "河爪強盜與監工（16-18級）掉落它此處。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Riverpaw Gnolls and Scouts roam the hills between the coast and the Jansen Stead."] = "河爪豺狼人與斥候遊蕩於丘陵之間海岸與詹森農場。",
	["Riverpaw Miners"] = "河爪礦工",
	["Riverpaw Runts and Outrunners hold the hills south of the garrison, along the Westfall border. Gruff Swiftbite, a level 12 gnoll, walks among them and carries the Gold Pickup Schedule: right-click it."] = "矮小的河爪豺狼人與斥候要塞丘陵在兵營以南，沿著西部荒野邊界。格魯夫·疾咬，一個12級豺狼人，步行在其中：它們與攜帶採金日程表：右鍵點擊它。",
	["Riverpaw Taskmaster (level 17-18) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "河爪監工（17-18級）掉落它此處。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Riverpaw gnolls camp in the hills west of Stone Cairn Lake; the Stolen Enchanting Supplies lie in their camps."] = "河爪豺狼人紮營於丘陵在石碑湖以西；被盜的附魔物資位於它們的紮營。",
	["Rizzle's Unguarded Plans"] = "無人看守的瑞茲爾設計圖",
	["Roast Raptor is orange from 175 (yellow at 215, grey at 255): about 40 crafts to 215. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "烤迅猛龍肉是橙色來自175（黃色在215，灰色在255）：約40製作前往215。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。",
	["Roasted Boar Meat is orange from 1 (yellow at 45, grey at 85): about 50 crafts to 50. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "烤野豬肉是橙色來自1（黃色在45，灰色在85）：約50製作前往50。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。",
	["Rock Elemental Shard"] = "石元素的碎片",
	["Rock Stalker Fang"] = "石行蜘蛛的牙齒",
	["Rockbiter"] = "羅克比特",
	["Rocket Car Parts"] = "火箭車零件",
	["Rocket Car Rubble lies all over the flats north of the raceway. Scorpid Reavers and Sparkleshell Tortoises roam the north half, Salt Flats Scavengers circle overhead, and Saltstone Basilisks graze west of the track. The Crystalhides roam the middle of the flats and the Gazers (34-35, five levels above you: one at a time) the far south."] = "火箭車殘骸位於全部越過平原在賽道以北。恐蠍劫掠者與鹽殼龜遊蕩於北一半，鹽湖食腐鷲法陣上方，與鹽石蜥蜴吃草在追蹤以西。晶皮遊蕩於中間的平原與凝視者（34-35，5等級上方你：1在一個時間）遠處南。",
	["Rocket Car Rubble lies all over the flats. Scorpid Reavers, Sparkleshell Tortoises and Saltstone Basilisks roam the north half, Crystalhides, Scorpid Terrors and Snappers the middle, and the Gazers (34-35, five levels above you: one at a time) the far south. Vultures circle over all of it."] = "火箭車殘骸位於全部越過平原。恐蠍劫掠者，鹽殼龜與鹽石蜥蜴遊蕩於北一半，晶皮，恐蠍與咬龜中間，與凝視者（34-35，5等級上方你：1在一個時間）遠處南。禿鷲法陣越過全部的它。",
	["Rockjaw Ambushers by Helm's Bed Lake, north of the quarry, and Rockjaw Backbreakers further east drop the Stolen Blasting Powder."] = "石齶伏擊者在旁湧冰湖，在採石場以北，與石齶碎脊者更遠處東掉落被盜的炸藥粉。",
	["Rockjaw Bonesnapper"] = "石齶斷骨者",
	["Rockjaw Bonesnappers prowl the quarry and Helm's Bed Lake; Dark Iron Spies sneak around the lake shore. One spy drops the Dark Iron Map."] = "石齶斷骨者遊蕩採石場與湧冰湖；黑鐵間諜潛行在湖岸邊周圍。1間諜掉落黑鐵地圖。",
	["Rockjaw Skullthumper"] = "石齶擊顱者",
	["Rockjaw Skullthumpers fill the quarry; Rockjaw Ambushers by Helm's Bed Lake drop the Empty Powder Keg."] = "石齶擊顱者裝滿採石場；石齶伏擊者在旁湧冰湖掉落空火藥桶。",
	["Rockjaw Trogg"] = "石齶穴居人",
	["Rockjaw Troggs and Burly Rockjaw Troggs dig all over the valley floor south of Anvilmar. Hands Springsprocket stands at the mouth of the tunnel to the east."] = "石齶穴居人與壯實的石齶怪挖掘全部越過山谷樓層在安威瑪爾以南。漢茲·跳鏈位於隧道前往東的入口。",
	["Rod of Deep Dominion: Stormscale Beastmistress"] = "深淵統御之杖：風暴鱗片馭獸者",
	["Roetten Stonehammer"] = "羅頓·石錘",
	["Rok Orhan"] = "洛卡·奧赫",
	["Rok'Alim, a hard-hitting rock elemental, walks the cliffs of Highperch. Rok'Alim the Pounder is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "洛卡里姆，一個困難-攻擊岩石元素，步行懸崖的風巢。羅卡里姆為精英：建議組隊前往。",
	["Rolf's corpse"] = "羅爾夫的屍體",
	["Roon Wildmane: for Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn"] = "魯恩·蠻鬃：給赫米特·奈辛瓦里二世在荊棘谷",
	["Ror stands at the far south end of Deadwood Village."] = "羅爾位於遠處南盡頭的死木村。",
	["Rorian the Dayseeker"] = "尋日者羅里安",
	["Rotting Dead and Ravaged Corpses shamble through the fields just west of Brill; Darkhounds roam a little further west, toward Gordo."] = "腐爛的死者與破碎的屍體蹣跚遊蕩穿過農田就在布瑞爾以西；飢餓的黑暗犬遊蕩一個小更遠處西，朝葛爾多方向。",
	["Rough Stone comes from Copper Vein nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "劣質的石頭來自銅礦脈採集點（採礦）；此是最密集的簇在數據。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Rough Wolf Pelts"] = "粗糙的狼皮",
	["Royal Factor Bathrilor"] = "皇家代理人巴瑟羅爾",
	["Royal Historian Archesonus"] = "皇家歷史學家阿克瑟努斯",
	["Royal Overseer Bauhaus"] = "皇家管理人巴哈烏斯",
	["Rudra Amberstill"] = "魯德拉·凍石",
	["Ruga Ragetotem"] = "魯迦·狂暴圖騰",
	["Rumstag Proudstrider takes cloth for Thunder Bluff in Thunder Bluff. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "拉姆斯塔格接收布料給雷霆崖在雷霆崖。第一捐獻的毛料，絲綢，魔紋布與符文布（60布料每個）已完成一次與交給大多數聲望每布料；之後它們，更多的符文布可重復直到崇拜。崇拜與另一個種族的主城允許你購買該種族的坐騎。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["Run Stratholme (both wings) and Scholomance, killing every Scourge you pass."] = "前往斯坦索姆（兩個翅膀）與通靈學院，擊殺每個天災軍團你穿過。",
	["Rune of Beth'Amara"] = "貝薩瑪拉符文",
	["Rune of Jin'yael"] = "辛耶爾符文",
	["Rune of Markri"] = "瑪克雷符文",
	["Rune of Sael'hai"] = "薩爾哈符文",
	["Runecloth"] = "符文布",
	["Runecloth Bandage (skill 260) is an Artisan recipe: only the Triage doctor teaches it (Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen in Theramore, Doctor Gregory Victor in Hammerfall)."] = "符文布繃帶（技能等級260）是一個大師級配方：僅救死扶傷醫生傳授它（古斯塔夫·範沃森醫生在塞拉摩，格里高利·維克托醫生在落錘鎮）。",
	["Runecloth Bandage is yellow from 260 (yellow at 260, grey at 320): about 65 crafts to 300. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Runecloth Bandage stays yellow to 320, so it carries you to 300 without a trip for Heavy Runecloth."] = "符文布繃帶是黃色來自260（黃色在260，灰色在320）：約65製作前往300。繃帶需要無營火：製作它們任何地方。符文布繃帶留在黃色前往320，因此它攜帶你前往300沒有一個行程給重型作戰傀儡符文布。",
	["Runecloth, for Meilosh later"] = "符文布，給梅羅什稍後",
	["Runes of Summoning"] = "召喚符文",
	["Running Dire Maul in Feralas instead of grinding gets you there faster in a group. Skip this step to grind solo."] = "刷厄運之槌在菲拉斯代替的刷怪使你達到你那裡更快組隊情況下。跳過此步驟前往刷怪單人。",
	["Running Scholomance (Caer Darrow, south-east Western Plaguelands) or Stratholme instead of grinding gets you there faster in a group. Skip this step to grind solo."] = "刷通靈學院（凱爾達隆，東南西瘟疫之地）或斯坦索姆代替的刷怪使你達到你那裡更快組隊情況下。跳過此步驟前往刷怪單人。",
	["Running Zul'Farrak instead of grinding gets you there faster in a group. The troll city lies in northern Tanaris, the next zone on the route; come back to Zorbin on the Forgotten Coast afterwards."] = "刷用祖爾法拉克代替刷怪使你達到你那裡更快組隊情況下。巨魔主城位於北部塔納利斯，下一個區域在路線；來到返回前往佐爾賓在被遺忘的海岸隨後。",
	["Running Zul'Farrak instead of grinding gets you there faster in a group. The troll city lies in the north-west of Tanaris, just north of Gadgetzan."] = "刷用祖爾法拉克代替刷怪使你達到你那裡更快組隊情況下。巨魔主城位於塔納利斯以西北，就在加基森以北。",
	["Running the Sunken Temple instead of grinding gets you there faster in a group. Skip this step to grind solo."] = "刷沈沒的神廟代替的刷怪使你達到你那裡更快組隊情況下。跳過此步驟前往刷怪單人。",
	["Rusty chests lie around the Shadethicket furbolg camps west of the Forsaken; open them until one holds the pommel."] = "生鏽的箱子位於影茂熊怪紮營西的周圍被遺忘者；打開/開啓它們直到1持有劍柄。",
	["Rutherford Twing"] = "盧瑟弗·圖恩",
	["Rutherford Twing hands out one Defiler's care package by level"] = "盧瑟弗·圖恩發放1污染者的照料包裹在旁等級",
	["Ruul Eagletalon"] = "盧爾·鷹爪",
	["Ruul Snowhoof"] = "魯爾·雪蹄",
	["Ruuzel walks the northern tip of the Zoram Strand with Wrathtail guards."] = "盧澤爾步行北部尖端的佐拉姆暗灘喚魔師與怒尾海巫衛兵。",
	["Ruzan"] = "魯贊",
	["Ryedol's Lucky Pick"] = "雷杜爾的好運鋤",
	["Ryedol's next errand goes into Uldaman: skip it."] = "勘察員雷杜爾的下一個差事前往進入奧達曼：跳過即可。",
	["Sacks of Oats"] = "燕麥袋",
	["Salfa guards the mouth of Timbermaw Hold, north-west of Donova."] = "薩爾法衛兵入口/河口的木喉要塞，在多諾瓦以西北。",
	["Salfa stands at the Winterspring end of the tunnel: keep it"] = "薩爾法位於冬泉谷盡頭的隧道：請保留該任務/物品",
	["Salfa stands by the Winterspring exit of Timbermaw Hold's tunnel, north of the hot springs."] = "薩爾法站在旁邊：冬泉谷出口的木喉要塞的隧道，在熱溫泉以北。",
	["Salfa: Beads for Salfa"] = "薩爾法：給薩爾法的珠串",
	["Salia"] = "薩莉亞",
	["Salma Saldean"] = "薩爾瑪·薩丁",
	["Saltstone Basilisk"] = "鹽石蜥蜴",
	["Saltstone Crystalhide"] = "鹽石水晶蜥蜴",
	["Saltstone Gazer"] = "鹽石凝視者",
	["Salty Scorpid Venom"] = "含鹽的蠍毒",
	["Sam Sarsaparilla"] = "山姆·菝葜",
	["Sam Sarsaparilla camps north-east of the inn; Helene Peltskinner, Jason Mathers and Lee Brown stand on the shore of Crystal Lake east of town."] = "山姆·菝葜紮營在旅店以東北；海倫尼·派特斯金納，賈森·瑪瑟斯與李·布朗位於水晶湖的岸上在城鎮東面。",
	["Samuel Hawke hands out one Arathor care package by level"] = "薩繆爾·霍克發放1阿拉索照料包裹在旁等級",
	["Samuel's Remains, from Samuel Fipps"] = "塞繆爾的遺骸，來自塞繆爾·菲普斯",
	["Sanath Lim-yo, at the east edge of the camp: no experience, only a teleport to Azshara Tower"] = "薩納斯，在營地的東邊緣：無經驗值，僅一個傳送前往艾薩拉哨塔",
	["Sand Skitterer Fang"] = "掠沙蜘蛛的牙齒",
	["Sania Silverstream"] = "薩妮婭·銀溪",
	["Sara Timberlain"] = "薩拉·迪博雷恩",
	["Sarkoth, a large scorpid, prowls the slope south of Hana'zua."] = "薩科斯，一個大型蠍子，潛行遊蕩山坡在哈納祖以南。",
	["Sarltooth's Talon"] = "薩爾圖斯的爪子",
	["Savages and Storm Witches nest in Drygulch Ravine, east of Rezlak. A Storm Witch drops the Dull Storm Orb."] = "野人與血怒雷巫女巫巢在枯水谷，在雷茲拉克以東。一個血怒雷巫女巫掉落黯淡的風暴寶珠。",
	["Scaber Stalks"] = "粗柄蘑菇",
	["Scarlet Hunter"] = "血色獵人",
	["Scarlet Knight"] = "血色騎士",
	["Scarlet Mage"] = "血色法師",
	["Scarlet Medic"] = "血色醫護員",
	["Scarlet Monastery: Armory"] = "血色修道院：軍械庫",
	["Scarlet Monastery: Cathedral"] = "血色修道院：大教堂",
	["Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard"] = "血色修道院：墓地",
	["Scarlet Monastery: Library"] = "血色修道院：圖書館",
	["Scarlet Warriors guard the outpost just west of the pumpkin fields. Bareth Dawnstone is held inside: talk to him and stay with him until he is out."] = "血色戰士守衛前哨站就在南瓜農田以西。巴雷斯·晨石是持有內部：對話前往他與留在與他直到他是出。",
	["Scarred Crag Boar (38%), Elder Crag Boar (36%) in Dun Morogh, or wherever the arrow points"] = "有傷疤的峭壁野豬（38%），老峭壁野豬（36%）在丹莫羅，或跟隨箭頭指示位置",
	["Sceptre of Light"] = "聖光節杖",
	["Scholomance"] = "通靈學院",
	["Scholomance fits levels 58 to 60; The Key to Scholomance is handed in at Chillwind Camp below."] = "通靈學院適合58至60級；通靈學院的鑰匙是上交在冰風崗下方。",
	["Scorpashi Venom"] = "鞭尾蠍的毒液",
	["Scorpok Pincer"] = "厚甲蠍螯",
	["Scourge Cauldron"] = "天災大鍋",
	["Scourge Champion"] = "天災勇士",
	["Scourge Champions (59) roam the Noxious Glade, north of Light's Hope Chapel. Pass Carlin's Mystic Crystal over each one you kill: the skulls that resonate are the ones he wants. Pull them one at a time."] = "天災勇士（59）遊蕩於劇毒林地，在聖光之願禮拜堂以北。穿過卡林的秘法水晶越過每個1你擊殺：頭顱該共鳴是在他需要。拉怪它們1在一個時間。",
	["Scourge Champions roam the Noxious Glade, north of the chapel. Pass Carlin's Mystic Crystal over each one you kill: the skulls that resonate are the ones he wants."] = "天災勇士遊蕩於劇毒林地，在禮拜堂以北。穿過卡林的秘法水晶越過每個1你擊殺：頭顱該共鳴是在他需要。",
	["Scout Bloodfist"] = "斥候布拉菲·血拳",
	["Scout Galiaan"] = "哨兵加里安",
	["Scrap Metal"] = "金屬碎塊",
	["Scrawny Ursera prowl the slopes south-west of the village, on the way to Hanaa."] = "瘦弱的烏爾塞拉遊蕩山坡在村莊以西南，在途中前往哈娜·夜風。",
	["Scrawny Ursera prowl the woods just west of the grove; the Ursera Scavengers den further west, with Urs'anah, the matriarch, at the back of the den."] = "瘦弱的烏爾塞拉遊蕩樹林就在樹林以西；烏爾塞拉食腐熊獸穴更遠處西，與烏爾薩娜，主母，在獸穴的後方。",
	["Scrimshank's Surveying Gear"] = "謝申克的勘探設備",
	["Sea Creature Bones"] = "海洋生物的骸骨",
	["Sea Turtle Remains, on the beach west of the docks"] = "海龜的殘骸，在海灘上在碼頭以西",
	["Sea elementals and sea sprays wash along the shore around the dock. Zap the giants with Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker first: shrunken, they lose their elite strength. Shore striders wade in the water; the land walkers and cliff giants roam the hills further north."] = "海元素與大海噴灑衝上沿著岸邊在碼頭周圍。電擊巨人與索爾賓的超級壓縮器第一：縮小的，它們丟失它們的精英力量。岸邊陸行鳥涉水在水；陸地行者與懸崖巨人遊蕩於丘陵更遠處北。",
	["Seahorn's next errand goes back to Arathi: skip it."] = "艦隊指揮官卡拉·海角的下一個差事交回給阿拉希高地：跳過即可。",
	["Sealed Barrel"] = "密封的桶",
	["Sealed Folder"] = "密封的信件",
	["Search the dead cultist"] = "搜尋死亡的邪教徒",
	["Search the wardrobe"] = "搜尋衣櫃",
	["Searn Firewarder"] = "希爾恩·火結",
	["Searn Firewarder stands in the Valley of Wisdom; Gan'rul Bloodeye in the Cleft of Shadow, under the Valley of Strength."] = "希爾恩·火結位於智慧谷；甘魯爾·血眼在暗影裂口，在下方力量谷。",
	["Second Relic Fragment"] = "第二塊遺物碎片",
	["Second Witherbark Cage"] = "第二個枯木牢籠",
	["Secret Plans: Fiery Flux"] = "秘密設計圖：熾熱助熔劑",
	["Security Chief Bilgewhizzle"] = "安全主管吉羅姆·比格維茲",
	["Seena Skybreaker"] = "希娜·破天者",
	["Seena Skybreaker stands in the middle of Valanaar."] = "希娜·破天者位於瓦拉納爾的中央。",
	["Seena Skybreaker: Defensive Stance"] = "希娜·破天者：防禦姿態",
	["Seena Skybreaker: Zaal Stormshield waits at the Shrine of Akir"] = "希娜·破天者：扎爾·風暴之盾等候於阿基爾神龕",
	["Seer Ravenfeather"] = "鴉羽先知",
	["Seer Ravenfeather stands in Camp Narache. Call of Earth needs level 4, which you reach with the turn-ins here."] = "鴉羽先知位於納拉其營地。大地的召喚需要4級，其中你抵達與交任務此處。",
	["Seer Ravenfeather: Stoneskin Totem and your Earth Totem"] = "鴉羽先知：石膚圖騰與你的大地圖騰",
	["Seer Wiserunner stands at the edge of the Bael'dun Digsite, south of the well."] = "先知奧薩迪·智慧行者位於邊緣的巴爾丹挖掘場，在水井以南。",
	["Senani Thunderheart"] = "塞娜尼·雷心",
	["Senani Thunderheart stands at Night Run, the Warsong camp just north-east of Splintertree, beside the hunt board."] = "塞娜尼·雷心位於夜道谷，戰歌信使營地就在碎木崗哨以東北，在狩獵告示板旁邊。",
	["Senani's hunt targets (Ursangous, Shadumbra, Sharptalon) are for the next Ashenvale visit, at 27."] = "塞娜尼·雷心的狩獵目標（烏薩苟斯，薩杜布拉，沙普塔隆）是給下一個灰谷造訪，在27。",
	["Senator Mehr Stonehallow, in the quarry"] = "參議員梅爾·聖石，在採石場",
	["Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser"] = "高級勘探員菲茲杜瑟",
	["Senir Whitebeard"] = "森內爾·白須",
	["Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak, by the moonwell"] = "哨兵阿瑞尼亞·碎雲，在旁月亮井",
	["Sentinel Elissa Starbreeze"] = "哨兵艾莉薩·星風",
	["Sentinel Farsong takes Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor for Vanquish the Invaders!, once per level bracket (data); check them live."] = "哨兵艾蒂亞·輕歌接收戰歌峽谷榮譽獎章給消滅侵略者！，每個等級段一次（數據）；請在遊戲內實測確認。",
	["Sentinel Farsong, Silverwing Grove"] = "哨兵艾蒂亞·輕歌，銀翼樹林",
	["Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea"] = "哨兵戈琳達·納希恩",
	["Sentinel Kyra Starsong"] = "哨兵凱拉·星歌",
	["Sentinel Lynessa Duskblossom"] = "哨兵莉妮莎·暮花",
	["Sentinel Melyria Frostshadow"] = "哨兵梅麗瑞亞·霜影",
	["Sentinel Selarin: for Raene Wolfrunner in Astranaar, on the later Ashenvale leg"] = "哨兵塞拉伊：給萊恩·狼行者在阿斯特蘭納，在稍後灰谷腿",
	["Sentinel Thenysil"] = "哨兵塞恩希爾",
	["Sentinel Tysha Moonblade"] = "哨兵坦莎·月刃",
	["Sentinel Tysha Moonblade stands at the north edge of the ruins. Cursed, Writhing and Wailing Highborne haunt them; Anaya Dawnrunner's ghost walks among them, Jai'vhanel the owl circles east of them. The two tablets lie in the ruins; a Beached Sea Turtle lies on the shore west of them."] = "哨兵坦莎·月刃位於廢墟的北邊緣。被詛咒的水兵，蠕行與哀嚎的貴族出沒它們；安娜雅·晨路的幽靈步行在其中：它們，賈瓦內爾貓頭鷹法陣在它們東面。2石板位於廢墟中；一個擱淺的海龜位於岸邊在它們西面。",
	["Sentinel Velene Starstrike"] = "哨兵維爾莉妮·星墜",
	["Sentinel Velene Starstrike stands at the Silverwind Refuge on the east shore of Mystral Lake; Alonso camps on its west shore. Befouled Water Elementals wade in the lake between them."] = "哨兵維爾莉妮·星墜位於賽頓·銀風營地在密斯特拉湖的東岸；阿隆索紮營在它的西岸邊。污濁的水元素涉水在湖之間它們。",
	["Serge Hinott"] = "瑟爾格·希諾特",
	["Serge Hinott in Tarren Mill teaches Poisons: keep it"] = "瑟爾格·希諾特在塔倫米爾傳授毒藥：請保留該任務/物品",
	["Serge Hinott: Poisons"] = "瑟爾格·希諾特：毒藥",
	["Sergeant Yohwa"] = "尤瓦中士",
	["Sergra Darkthorn"] = "瑟格拉·黑棘",
	["Sessaria Skystride"] = "塞薩莉亞·天行",
	["Sessaria Skystride stands on Valanaar's west side."] = "塞薩莉亞·天行位於瓦拉納爾的西一側。",
	["Sessaria Skystride: Searing Totem and your Fire Totem"] = "塞薩莉亞·天行：灼熱圖騰與你的火焰圖騰",
	["Sewer Beast"] = "下水道野獸",
	["Shadow Hold is the cave at the back of Jaedenar, west of the road. Use the Purified Moonwell Water on the four braziers inside. Kill the Angerclaw bears and Felpaw wolves you pass for the Silvery Claws."] = "暗影堡是洞穴在加德納爾的後方，在道路以西。使用淨化過的月亮井水在4火盆內部。擊殺怒爪熊與魔爪狼你穿過給銀爪。",
	["Shadow Hunter Knife"] = "暗影獵手的小刀",
	["Shadow Lord Fel'dan"] = "暗影領主費爾丹",
	["Shadow Priest Allister"] = "暗影牧師奧利斯特",
	["Shadow Priest Sarvis"] = "暗影牧師薩維斯",
	["Shadow Priest Sarvis: the scroll for Aramis"] = "暗影牧師薩維斯：捲軸給阿拉米斯·錘手",
	["Shadow Priestess Vandis"] = "暗影牧師範蒂絲",
	["Shadowfang Keep"] = "影牙城堡",
	["Shadowgem comes from Copper Vein nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "暗影石來自銅礦脈採集點（採礦）；此是最密集的簇在數據。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Shadowglen opens onto Teldrassil; Dolanaar is south along the road. Rut'theran Village, at the foot of the tree, is reached through the portal in Darnassus."] = "幽影谷通向泰達希爾；多蘭納爾是南沿著道路。魯瑟蘭村，在樹的底部，是可抵達穿過傳送門在達納蘇斯。",
	["Shadowhide Pendant: any Shadowhide gnoll"] = "暗皮墜飾：任意暗皮戰士豺狼人",
	["Shadowmaw Panther"] = "深喉獵豹",
	["Shadowprey Village flight master"] = "葬影村飛行管理員",
	["Shadowvale is the hollow at the west edge of the glades. The Shadowvale Lurchers and Mystics drop the bones; the bottles lie on the ground among them, and the Glowing Crystal Fragment is at the south end."] = "影谷是山坳在林地的西邊緣。影谷蹣跚者與秘法師雅爾金掉落骨頭；瓶子位於領地在其中：它們，與發光的水晶碎片是在南盡頭。",
	["Shadowy Assassin"] = "暗影刺客",
	["Shadumbra, a shadow panther, stalks the woods around Raynewood Retreat, west of the Felmusk camp. Her head starts the next hunt quest."] = "薩杜布拉，一個暗影豹，潛伏樹林在林中樹居周圍，在魔麝營地以西。她的前往始於下一個狩獵任務。",
	["Shakes O'Breen"] = "沙克斯·奧布里",
	["Shallow Grave, just east of the keep"] = "淺墓穴，就在保留以東",
	["Shanda, inside the tree"] = "珊達，在樹內",
	["Shandris Feathermoon"] = "珊蒂斯·羽月",
	["Shandris Feathermoon, beside him"] = "珊蒂斯·羽月，旁邊他",
	["Shandris then asks you to carry news to Darnassus: skip it, Gadgetzan sends you there instead."] = "珊蒂斯·羽月然後要求你攜帶訊息前往達納蘇斯：跳過即可，加基森派往你那裡代替。",
	["Shari Stilwell"] = "莎莉·斯蒂爾維爾",
	["Shari Stilwell trains Paladins in Brill, a short walk north up the road from the zeppelin towers. Come back down the same road for Silverpine."] = "莎莉·斯蒂爾維爾訓練聖騎士在布瑞爾，一個不足步行北順著道路往上來自飛艇哨塔。來到返回下相同道路給銀松森林。",
	["Sharptalon, a big nightsaber, prowls the woods south-east of the Warsong lumber camp. Her claw starts the next hunt quest."] = "沙普塔隆，一個大夜刃豹，潛行遊蕩樹林東南的戰歌信使伐木場營地。她的爪始於下一個狩獵任務。",
	["Shattered Sword of Marduk"] = "馬杜克的破碎之劍",
	["Shay wanders the hills north of Rockbiter, among the Northspring harpies; her bell is in the chest beside her."] = "沙恩·飄葉遊蕩丘陵在羅克比特以北，在其中：北泉鷹身女妖；她的鐘是在箱子旁邊她的。",
	["Shay's Bell"] = "沙恩的鈴鐺",
	["She sits inside the farmhouse."] = "她位於農舍內。",
	["She stands by her cart at the vineyard east of the Abbey."] = "她站在旁邊：她的推車在葡萄園在修道院以東。",
	["She stands outside the mine entrance. Shinyfinder Narf, inside, is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "她位於採礦入口外。尋寶者納夫，內部，為精英：建議組隊前往。",
	["Shelene Rhobart"] = "捨倫尼·洛巴爾特",
	["Shellei Brondir"] = "謝爾雷·布隆迪爾",
	["Shellei Brondir, Menethil Harbor"] = "謝爾雷·布隆迪爾，米奈希爾港",
	["Shen'dralas, the ruins between Desolace and Mulgore, is entered from southern Desolace through the Valley of Bones."] = "辛德拉拉斯，廢墟在淒涼之地與莫高雷之間，是進入來自南部淒涼之地穿過白骨之谷。",
	["Shenthul stands in the Cleft of Shadow. Target him and type /salute to finish The Shattered Salute."] = "申蘇爾位於暗影裂口。目標他與類型 /敬禮前往完成碎手軍禮。",
	["Shenthul, Cleft of Shadow"] = "申蘇爾，暗影裂口",
	["Shimmerweed bushes grow on the hills around Brewnall Village."] = "微光草灌木生長在丘陵在烈酒村周圍。",
	["Shindrell Swiftfire"] = "辛德瑞爾·速火",
	["Shiny Junk"] = "閃亮的垃圾",
	["Shinyfinder Narf"] = "尋寶者納夫",
	["Shizzle"] = "希茲爾",
	["Shizzle, at the refuge entrance"] = "希茲爾，在營地入口",
	["Shore Striders, Deep Striders and Wave Striders (elite giants) wade along the coast north of the dock: zap one with Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker and kill the shrunken giant. Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays drift in the same surf."] = "海岸巨人，深海巨人與波濤巨人（精英巨人）涉水沿著海岸在碼頭以北：電擊1與索爾賓的超級壓縮器與擊殺縮小的巨型。海元素與巨型海元素漂浮在相同浪花。",
	["Short of level 54 after the yetis? Running the Sunken Temple (50-54) instead of grinding gets you there faster in a group. Come back to Everlook afterwards."] = "不足的54級之後雪人? 刷沈沒的神廟（50-54）代替的刷怪使你達到你那裡更快組隊情況下。來到返回前往永望鎮隨後。",
	["Shriekling Matriarch's Head"] = "尖嘯鳥主母的頭顱",
	["Shrine Bauble, from a Bauble Container in the lake"] = "神殿靈珠，來自一個飾物容器在湖",
	["Shylenai"] = "夏琳奈爾",
	["Shylenai sells three owls in Darnassus (50s each); the Eagle Owl is new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "夏琳奈爾出售3貓頭鷹在達納蘇斯（50銀每個）；雕鴞是新在永恆服。每個寵物物品傳授它的夥伴當你使用它；目標留在勾選隨後。",
	["Shyn"] = "夏恩",
	["Sida"] = "塞達",
	["Sida's Bag"] = "塞達的背包",
	["Sign of the Earth"] = "大地印章",
	["Sigrun Ironhew"] = "西格魯·鐵斧",
	["Silithus is west of Un'Goro Crater. Cenarion Hold is neutral."] = "希利蘇斯是在安戈洛環形山以西。塞納里奧要塞是中立。",
	["Silithyst geysers erupt across the southern desert. Walk into the Silithyst one leaves behind and carry it to the Horde's Silithyst Extractor at Kirika's camp; fighting or mounting drops it."] = "水晶塵間歇泉噴發穿過南部沙漠。步行進入水晶塵1離開後面與攜帶它前往部落的水晶塵提取器在吉里卡將軍的營地；戰鬥或騎乘掉落它。",
	["Silk Bandage is yellow from 150 (yellow at 150, grey at 210): about 42 crafts to 180. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "絲質繃帶是黃色來自150（黃色在150，灰色在210）：約42製作前往180。繃帶需要無營火：製作它們任何地方。",
	["Silk Cloth"] = "絲綢",
	["Silt Crawler (level 40-41) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "淤泥蟹（40-41級）掉落它此處。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Silver Dawning's Lockbox"] = "銀色清晨號的保險箱",
	["Silverpine Forest is south of Tirisfal Glades: follow the road south from Brill."] = "銀松森林是在提瑞斯法林地以南：沿著道路前往南來自布瑞爾。",
	["Silverpine's road north leads into Tirisfal Glades. Brill, Deathknell and the Undercity ruins are Horde ground."] = "銀松森林的道路北通往進入提瑞斯法林地。布瑞爾，喪鐘鎮與幽暗城廢墟是部落領地。",
	["Sin'Dall, a level 37 tiger, prowls the hilltop south-west of the camp."] = "辛達爾，一個37級虎，潛行遊蕩山頂在營地以西南。",
	["Sin'Dall, the great tiger, lairs on the hilltop south-west of the camp; Lashtail Raptors run south of it, along the way to Booty Bay."] = "辛達爾，巨型虎，巢穴在山頂在營地以西南；鞭尾迅猛龍前往在它南面，沿途前往藏寶海灣。",
	["Singed Letter"] = "燒焦的信件",
	["Singing Blue Crystal"] = "藍色歌唱水晶",
	["Singing Crystal Shard"] = "歌唱水晶碎片",
	["Sir S. J. Erlgadin"] = "埃爾加丁爵士",
	["Sirra Von'Indi"] = "希拉·沃寧迪",
	["Sirra Von'Indi, in the house behind the town hall"] = "希拉·沃寧迪，在房屋在城鎮大廳後面",
	["Sister Aquinne"] = "艾奎恩妮",
	["Sit (/sit) by his campfire until you have Boosted Rest"] = "坐（/坐）在旁他的營火直到你有強化休息",
	["Sit by Eric's campfire (type /sit) and wait for the buff, then Gremlock Pilsnor in the distillery teaches you cooking."] = "坐在旁艾瑞克的營火（類型 /坐）與等待給增益，然後格雷姆羅克·匹斯諾爾在釀酒廠傳授你烹飪。",
	["Sixty Wool Cloth, if you carry them"] = "60毛料，如果你攜帶它們",
	["Skeletal Fiend"] = "骸骨魔",
	["Skeletal Flayer"] = "骷髏剝皮者",
	["Skeletal Flayers and Slavering Ghouls roam the fields north of the camp; all the Scourge here drop Scourgestones."] = "骷髏剝皮者與被奴役的食屍鬼遊蕩於農田在營地以北；全部天災軍團此處掉落天災石。",
	["Skeletal Fragments"] = "骸骨碎片",
	["Skeletal Healer"] = "骷髏醫師",
	["Skeletal Horror"] = "恐怖骸骨",
	["Skeletal Horrors walk the hillside between Darkshire and the Tranquil Gardens Cemetery, south-east of town; they drop the Rot Blossoms."] = "恐怖骸骨步行山坡之間夜色鎮與靜謐花園墓場，在城鎮東南面；它們掉落腐化之花。",
	["Skeletal Mage"] = "骷髏法師",
	["Skeletal Raider"] = "骷髏襲擊者",
	["Skeletal Raiders, Healers and Warders hold the west part of the cemetery, just east of Sven's camp."] = "骷髏襲擊者，治療者與守衛要塞西部分的墓園，就在斯溫·約根的以東營地。",
	["Skeletal Warder"] = "骷髏看守",
	["Skeletal Warrior"] = "骷髏戰士",
	["Skeletal Warriors and Skeletal Mages walk among the graves south-east of Darkshire, below Blind Mary's house on the hill. Every skeleton in Duskwood can drop a Skeleton Finger."] = "骷髏戰士與骷髏法師步行在其中：墳墓在夜色鎮以東南，在盲眼瑪麗的下方房屋在山丘。每個骷髏在暮色森林可以掉落一個骷髏的手指。",
	["Skeletal horses: Zachariah Post, beside Velma Warnam in Brill."] = "骷髏巫師馬：撒迦利亞·普斯特，在維爾瑪·瓦納姆旁邊在布瑞爾。",
	["Skeleton Finger"] = "骷髏的手指",
	["Skin Armored Scorpid, Bloodtalon Scythemaw, Bloodtalon Taillasher, Clattering Scorpid, Dire Mottled Boar, Dreadmaw Crocolisk, Durotar Tiger, Elder Mottled Boar, Thunder Lizard, Venomtail Scorpid here (beasts of level 5-20 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剝皮硬甲蠍，血爪銳齒龍，血爪鞭尾龍，巨鉗蠍，可怕的雜斑野豬，巨齒鰐魚，杜隆塔爾猛虎，老雜斑野豬，雷霆蜥蜴，毒尾蠍此處（野獸的5-20級產出它）；剝皮指南路線此。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Skin Ashenvale Bear, Elder Ashenvale Bear, Elder Shadowhorn Stag, Ghostpaw Runner, Giant Ashenvale Bear, Shadowhorn Stag here (beasts of level 18-30 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剝皮灰谷熊，老灰谷熊，老黑角鹿，幽爪奔跑者，灰谷巨熊，黑角鹿此處（野獸的18-30級產出它）；剝皮指南路線此。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Skin Cave Yeti, Elder Gray Bear, Gray Bear, Snapjaw here (beasts of level 18-30 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剝皮洞穴雪人，老灰熊，灰熊，鉗嘴龜此處（野獸的18-30級產出它）；剝皮指南路線此。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Skin Cave Yeti, Ferocious Yeti, Giant Yeti, Hulking Mountain Lion, Mountain Lion, Mountain Yeti, Snapjaw here (beasts of level 28-40 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剝皮洞穴雪人，凶惡的雪人，巨型雪人，巨型山地獅，山地獅，山嶺雪人，鉗嘴龜此處（野獸的28-40級產出它）；剝皮指南路線此。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Skin Coralshell Tortoise, Mosshoof Stag, Thunderhead Consort, Thunderhead Patriarch, Thunderhead Skystormer, Thunderhead Stagwing here (beasts of level 48-60 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剝皮珊瑚海龜，苔蹄雄鹿，雷首角鷹雌獸，雷首角鷹雄獸，雷首天鳴者，雷首翼鹿此處（野獸的48-60級產出它）；剝皮指南路線此。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Skin Crag Boar, Elder Crag Boar, Ice Claw Bear, Juvenile Snow Leopard, Large Crag Boar, Scarred Crag Boar, Snow Leopard, Snow Tracker Wolf, Winter Wolf, Young Black Bear here (beasts of level 5-20 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剝皮峭壁野豬，老峭壁野豬，冰爪熊，雪豹幼崽，大峭壁野豬，有傷疤的峭壁野豬，雪豹，雪狼，冬狼，黑熊幼崽此處（野獸的5-20級產出它）；剝皮指南路線此。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Skin Diseased Black Bear, Diseased Grizzly, Diseased Wolf here (beasts of level 48-60 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剝皮生病的黑熊，生病的灰熊，生病的狼此處（野獸的48-60級產出它）；剝皮指南路線此。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Skin Elder Crag Coyote, Rabid Crag Coyote, Ridge Huntress, Ridge Stalker Patriarch here (beasts of level 38-50 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剝皮老峭壁山狗，瘋狂的峭壁山狗，山脊雌豹，山脊雄豹此處（野獸的38-50級產出它）；剝皮指南路線此。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Skin Feral Scar Yeti, Frayfeather Hippogryph, Frayfeather Stagwing, Grizzled Ironfur Bear, Groddoc Ape, Groddoc Thunderer, Ironfur Bear, Ironfur Patriarch, Longtooth Howler, Longtooth Runner, Rabid Longtooth, Rage Scar Yeti here (beasts of level 38-50 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剝皮深痕雪人，亂羽角鷹獸，亂羽翼鹿，鐵鬃灰熊，格羅多克猿人，格羅多克大猩猩，鐵鬃熊，鐵鬃熊王，長牙嚎叫者，長牙奔跑者，瘋狂的長牙狼，狂暴的怒痕雪人此處（野獸的38-50級產出它）；剝皮指南路線此。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Skin Highperch Wyvern, Saltstone Basilisk, Scorpid Reaver, Scorpid Terror, Sparkleshell Snapper, Sparkleshell Tortoise here (beasts of level 28-40 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too."] = "剝皮風巢雙足飛龍，鹽石蜥蜴，恐蠍劫掠者，恐蠍，鹽殼鉗嘴龜，鹽殼龜此處（野獸的28-40級產出它）；剝皮指南路線此。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Skinned, disenchanted or crafted by another profession: gather them yourself or buy them on the Auction House."] = "剝皮的，分解的或製作的在旁另一個專業：採集它們你自己或購買它們在拍賣行。",
	["Skorn Whitecloud"] = "斯考恩·白雲",
	["Skuerto"] = "斯奎爾圖",
	["Skull Rock lies just north of the ravine. Gazz'uz hides at the back of the caves and drops the Eye of Burning Shadow."] = "骷髏石位於就在深谷以北。加祖茲藏身在洞穴與掉落的後方燃影之眼。",
	["Skull of Horgus"] = "霍古斯的顱骨",
	["Skullsplitter Fetish"] = "劈顱巨魔的神像",
	["Skullsplitter Tusk"] = "劈顱巨魔的獠牙",
	["Skyborne Portal to Stormwind"] = "通往暴風城的天裔傳送門",
	["Skyborne start here. Everyone else takes a skyboat, about every five minutes; either faction may take either one."] = "天裔開始此處。所有人其他搭乘天舟，大約每5分鐘一班；雙方陣營均可搭乘任意一班。",
	["Skybreaker Bulwark: Zaal Stormshield, west of the shrine's approach"] = "破天壁壘：扎爾·風暴之盾，在神龕以西的靠近",
	["Skyhoppers hop about the fields just west of Valennia."] = "跳空者跳過約農田就在瓦倫妮婭·風暴之拳以西。",
	["Skyhoppers swarm the fields west of Valanaar."] = "跳空者蟲群農田在瓦拉納爾以西。",
	["Skypriest Aanders"] = "天空祭司安德斯",
	["Slab of Carrion Worm Meat"] = "食腐蟲肉塊",
	["Slavering Ghoul"] = "被奴役的食屍鬼",
	["Small Crag Boar"] = "小型峭壁野豬",
	["Small Crag Boars graze around Talin's camp and along the west side of the valley."] = "小型峭壁野豬吃草在塔林·銳眼的周圍營地與沿著西一側的山谷。",
	["Small Stone Shard"] = "小石頭碎塊",
	["Small lockboxes lie in the rubble all over Andorhal; each holds a watch."] = "小型鎖箱位於碎石全部越過安多哈爾；每個持有一個守望。",
	["Smeed Scrabblescrew"] = "斯米德·瑟卡布斯庫",
	["Smeed's camp is on the road south of Kolkar Village, by the Kodo Graveyard."] = "斯米德的營地是在路上在科爾卡村以南，在旁科多獸墳場。",
	["Smith Regzar: More Booty!"] = "鐵匠雷格薩：取之於敵",
	["Smith Slagtree"] = "鐵匠斯拉提",
	["Smithing Tuyere"] = "冶煉鼓風機",
	["Smolderweb Carrier"] = "煙網蜘蛛籠",
	["Snapjaw Crocolisk Skin"] = "鉗嘴鰐魚的皮",
	["Snapjaw Crocolisks bask on the shore and islands along the coast north of Booty Bay."] = "鉗嘴鰐魚曬太陽在岸邊與群島沿著海岸在藏寶海灣以北。",
	["Snellig's Snuffbox: First Mate Snellig"] = "斯涅利格的鼻煙盒：大副斯涅利格",
	["Snickerfang Jowl"] = "彎牙土狼的顎骨",
	["Snow Leopard"] = "雪豹",
	["Snow Leopard: tame it with the Taming Rod"] = "雪豹：馴服它與馴獸棒",
	["Snow Leopards and boars roam the snow between the ranch and the quarry. Blacksmiths: Copper Bars come from smelting Copper Ore or the trade vendors."] = "雪豹與野豬遊蕩於雪在牧場與採石場之間。鐵匠：銅錠來自熔鍊銅礦石或商業商人。",
	["Snuff"] = "鼻煙",
	["Soft Dirt Mound"] = "軟土堆",
	["Solarsal Gazebo"] = "索蘭薩爾瞭望台",
	["Solid Stone comes from Mithril Deposit nodes (Mining); this is the densest cluster in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "堅固的石頭來自秘銀礦脈採集點（採礦）；此是最密集的簇在數據。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Somatic Intensifier"] = "細胞增強劑",
	["Soothing Spices, for \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl"] = "舒心草，給 \"沼澤之眼\"加爾",
	["Soothing Spices, for \"Swamp Eye\" Jarl in Dustwallow Marsh"] = "舒心草，給 \"沼澤之眼\"加爾在塵泥沼澤",
	["Soothing Spices, from Micha Yance"] = "舒心草，來自米沙·楊斯",
	["Sorek"] = "索瑞克",
	["Sorek, Valley of Honor"] = "索瑞克，榮譽谷",
	["Sorrow Spinner"] = "沼澤紡絲蛛",
	["South along the coast, the Southsea pirates hold the cove. Andre Firebeard and the stolen cargo are on the docks at its far end. Any pirate can drop a hat, the kidnappers most often."] = "南沿著海岸，南海流氓海盜要塞小灣。安德雷·費爾比德與被盜的貨物是在碼頭上在它的遠處盡頭。任意海盜可以掉落一個帽子，綁架者大多數經常。",
	["South down the road again."] = "南順著道路再次。",
	["South down the road to the Maclure Vineyards."] = "南順著道路前往馬科倫農場。",
	["South of Booty Bay the Bloodsail swashbucklers camp on the Wild Shore; the charts and the orders lie in their tents. Any Bloodsail can carry snuff and Dizzy's eye, so keep killing until you have both."] = "在藏寶海灣以南血帆劍客營地在狂野海岸；海圖與命令位於它們的帳篷。任意血帆可以攜帶熄滅與獨眼迪茲的眼睛，因此保留擊殺直到你有兩個。",
	["South of Camp Taurajo the Silithid Mounds dot the Field of Giants; the eggs lie in them, and Silithid Swarmers come out to defend them. Silithid Harvesters are rare: if you see one, kill it for its head."] = "在陶拉祖營地以南異種蟲土堆持續傷害巨人曠野；蛋位於它們，與異種群居蠍來到出前往保衛它們。異種收割者是稀有：如果你查看1，擊殺它給它的前往。",
	["South of Darkcloud, the harpies of Roguefeather Den. Grenka Bloodscreech (31) walks among them: thin out the harpies around her before you pull her."] = "南的暗雲，鷹身人的飛羽洞穴。格林卡·血嘯（31）步行在其中：它們：狹窄/薄出鷹身人周圍她的之前你拉怪她的。",
	["South of Gann, the Bael'dun dwarves dig at Bael Modan. Excavators and Foremen work the pit; Prospector Khazgorm (26) carries the journal: pull him alone."] = "在加恩·石塔以南，巴爾丹矮人挖掘在巴爾莫丹。暗灘挖掘者與工頭有效深坑；勘察員卡茲戈姆（26）攜帶日記：拉怪他獨自。",
	["South of Zenn. Denalan tends his saplings on the shore; Lasher Sproutlings and Timberlings wander around him, and the Timberling Sprouts grow among them."] = "在賽恩·腐蹄以南。德納蘭照看他的樹苗在岸邊；瑪諾洛克鞭笞者嫩芽幼體與林精遊蕩周圍他，與林精的新芽生長在其中：它們。",
	["South of the Noxious Lair the Dunemaul ogres hold their compound, with Gor'marok the Ravager at its eastern end. Dig up Gahz'ridian ornaments between the fights."] = "南的劇毒之巢砂槌食人魔要塞它們的營區，與掠奪者格瑪洛克在它的東部盡頭。挖掘上加茲瑞迪安飾物之間戰鬥。",
	["South of the hot springs, Stegodons graze and Dinosaur Bones drop from them or lie on the ground; Diemetradons nearby carry the scales Shizzle wants. Ravasaurs hunt in packs in the south-west: their claws are for Jes'rimon, and now and then one carries a Mangled Journal (a rare drop: take its quest only if you get one). Avoid Gruff, a level 57 Stegodon."] = "在熱溫泉以南，劍龍吃草與恐龍骨頭掉落來自它們或位於領地；雙帆龍附近攜帶鱗片希茲爾需要。暴掠龍狩獵在怪群在西南面：它們的爪是給傑斯雷蒙，與現在與然後1攜帶一個殘破的日記（稀有掉落：接取它的任務僅如果你獲取1）。避開格魯夫，一個57級劍龍。",
	["South of the lodge the Witherbark trolls hold their villages. Every one of them carries a skull: with twenty, use Nimboya's Pike to make the Laden Pike, then plant it inside the village."] = "在旅捨以南枯木巨魔要塞它們的村莊。每個1的它們攜帶一個頭顱：與20，使用尼姆布亞之矛前往製作滿載的長矛，然後植物它在村莊內。",
	["South of the murlocs, Therysil waits at the Shrine of Aessina."] = "在魚人以南，瑟瑞希爾等候於艾希娜神殿。",
	["South of the pools. The Strange Fruited Plant grows by the Hold."] = "在水池以南。奇怪的果樹生長在旁要塞。",
	["South of the vale the Frayfeather hippogryphs roost on the slopes; nearly every one drops sinew and metallic fragments."] = "在山谷以南羽須角鷹獸棲木在山坡；接近每個1掉落肌腱與金屬碎片。",
	["South to Regthar's watch post on the Kolkar border."] = "南前往雷戈薩·死門的守望崗哨在科卡爾邊界。",
	["South to the Sanctuary once more."] = "南前往聖地一次更多。",
	["South-east along the loch to the dig site."] = "東南沿著湖前往挖掘地點。",
	["South-east down the road to Ambermill. Protectors guard the outskirts and Mages the town; both drop pendants. Wizards and Watchers patrol the roads around it. Stay out of the middle, where Archmage Ataeric stands."] = "東南順著道路前往安伯米爾。保衛者守衛外圍與法師城鎮；兩個掉落掛墜。巫師與守夜人道茨巡邏於道路周圍它。留在離開中間，在大法師阿塔瑞克位於。",
	["South-east of Dolanaar, to Denalan. Lasher Sproutlings wander around him on the shore."] = "在多蘭納爾以東南，前往德納蘭。瑪諾洛克鞭笞者嫩芽幼體遊蕩周圍他在岸邊。",
	["South-east of Gadgetzan the Wastewander bandits camp in the dunes; Caliph stands in the eastern camp."] = "在加基森以東南廢土漫遊者強盜紮營於沙丘；卡利夫位於東部營地。",
	["South-east of the Crossroads. Test the seeds at the bubbling fissure on the oasis' east bank."] = "東南的十字路口。測試種子在冒泡的裂隙在綠洲的東銀行。",
	["South-west again, the exile hides by the ruins of Shadra'Alor."] = "西南再次，流放者藏身在旁廢墟的沙德拉洛。",
	["South-west of Bael Modan, Grish Longrunner waits at the top of the Great Lift."] = "在巴爾莫丹以西南，瑞什·遠行者等候於頂部的升降梯。",
	["South-west of Durnholde, the Mudsnout Blossoms grow on the hillsides above the river."] = "在敦霍爾德以西南，泥頭花生長在山坡在河流上方。",
	["South-west of Sun Rock lies the burned Charred Vale. Plant the Gaea Seeds in the dirt mounds on the valley floor; the fire elementals drop Incendrites. Bloodfury Harpies and Ambushers nest on the north side, Slayers and Roguefeathers to the south."] = "在烈日石居以西南位於燒焦的焦炭谷。植物蓋亞種子在泥土土堆在山谷樓層；營火元素掉落焚火餘燼。血怒鷹身人與邪枝伏擊者巢在北一側，黑石殺戮者與狂羽向南。",
	["South-west of the barrow. The moonwell sits by the pools."] = "在獸穴以西南。月亮井位於水池。",
	["South-west to the Kirin Tor camp on the lake shore west of Dalaran: the Image of Archmage Modera stands there. Archmage Ansirem stands south-east of it, by the dome."] = "西南前往肯瑞托營地在湖岸邊在達拉然以西：大法師莫德拉的影像位於那裡。大法師大法師安斯雷姆·魯因維沃爾位於它東南面，在旁穹頂。",
	["South-west, the Cave and Ferocious Yetis (30-31) fill the caves in the hills west of Tarren Mill; about one in sixteen carries the rod."] = "西南，洞穴與凶惡的雪人（30-31）裝滿洞穴在丘陵在塔倫米爾以西；約1在16攜帶魔杖。",
	["South-west, the Silvermane Howlers roam the hills east of the Witherbark villages."] = "西南，銀鬃嗥叫者遊蕩於丘陵東的枯木村莊。",
	["South-west, the yetis den in Feral Scar Vale; every yeti there can drop a thick hide."] = "西南，雪人獸穴在深痕谷；每個雪人那裡可以掉落一個密集獸皮。",
	["Southsea Dock Worker"] = "南海碼頭工人",
	["Southsea Freebooter"] = "南海劫掠者",
	["Southsea Pirate"] = "南海海盜",
	["Southsea Pirate Hat"] = "南海海盜帽",
	["Southsea Swashbuckler"] = "南海流氓",
	["Southshore Stout, for Henchman Valik"] = "南海鎮烈酒，給僕從瓦里克",
	["Spark Nilminer"] = "斯巴克·尼米爾",
	["Speak with Jorel and Naaleos"] = "對話與喬雷爾與納利奧斯",
	["Speak with Rathiril Sunlance and Coriella Calmbreeze, north-west of the village"] = "對話與拉希瑞爾·日槍與科瑞拉·靜風，在村莊以西北",
	["Speak with Tomas"] = "對話與廚師托馬斯",
	["Speak with Zarrin, south of the inn"] = "對話與扎瑞恩，在旅店以南",
	["Speak with the Great Bear Spirit"] = "對話與巨熊之靈",
	["Special Chicken Feed, from Farmer Saldean"] = "特殊的雞飼料，來自農夫薩丁",
	["Spigot Operator Luglunket"] = "操作員魯格倫克",
	["Spigot Operator Luglunket, next to him"] = "操作員魯格倫克，下一個前往他",
	["Spiked Collar: Redridge Thrashers"] = "尖刺項圈：赤脊山鞭笞者",
	["Splintertree Post is just north up the road."] = "碎木崗哨是就在北順著道路往上。",
	["Spotted Sunfish"] = "斑點太陽魚",
	["Spraggle Frock"] = "斯普拉格·弗勞克",
	["Spraggle's friend Ringo has gone missing."] = "斯普拉格·弗勞克的朋友林格有耗盡失蹤的。",
	["Sprinkle"] = "斯普琳科",
	["Sprinkle's next ingredient grows in the Hinterlands, and the route never brings it back: skip it."] = "斯普琳科的下一個材料生長在辛特蘭，與路線從不攜帶它返回：跳過即可。",
	["Sprite Jumpsprocket, Dwarven District"] = "斯普萊特，矮人區",
	["Sprouted Frond, beside him"] = "發芽的樹葉，旁邊他",
	["Sputtervalve"] = "斯布特瓦夫",
	["Sputtervalve in Ratchet: later, on the way"] = "斯布特瓦夫在棘齒城：稍後，在途中",
	["Sputtervalve in Ratchet: the next guide passes there"] = "斯布特瓦夫在棘齒城：下一個指南經過那裡",
	["Sputtervalve, by the docks in Ratchet"] = "斯布特瓦夫，在旁碼頭在棘齒城",
	["Sputtervalve. Keep it: Ziz Fizziks is in Stonetalon, later"] = "斯布特瓦夫。請保留該任務/物品：菲茲克斯是在石爪山脈，稍後",
	["Sputtervalve: the console is in the Sludge Fen, later"] = "斯布特瓦夫：控制台是在淤泥沼澤，稍後",
	["Stand with Aamelia against Ferauu the Bludgeon"] = "位於與阿米莉亞·風野迎戰重槌費勞",
	["Stanley is Farmer Ray's dog, at the northern farmhouse in Hillsbrad Fields."] = "斯坦雷是農夫雷恩的狗，在北部農舍在希爾斯布萊德農場。",
	["Starts in Tanaris, south of Dustwallow Marsh. The last area of this guide completes the Kalimdor map. 20 areas to discover here, levels 40-50."] = "始於塔納利斯，在塵泥沼澤以南。最後區域的此指南完成卡利姆多地圖。20區域前往探索發現此處，40-50級。",
	["Starts where the 30-45 guide ends, in the Swamp of Sorrows. The last area of this guide completes the Eastern Kingdoms map. 9 areas to discover here, levels 46-63."] = "始於在30-45指南結束，在悲傷沼澤。最後區域的此指南完成東部王國地圖。9區域前往探索發現此處，46-63級。",
	["Starving Dire Wolf"] = "飢餓的恐狼",
	["Starving Snickerfangs roam the dry hills just south of the camp; Scorpok Stingers (level 50) scuttle across the middle of the north. Black Slayer vultures circle over all of it. Pull one at a time."] = "飢餓的彎牙土狼遊蕩於乾涸丘陵就在營地以南；厚甲毒刺蠍（50級）爬行穿過中間的北。黑色屠戮者禿鷲法陣越過全部的它。拉怪1在一個時間。",
	["Stay stealthed: Foreman Silixiz carries the key to the tower; Gallywix and his lockbox are at the top. Gallywix is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "留在潛行的：工頭希里克斯攜帶鑰匙前往哨塔；加里維克斯與他的鎖箱是在頂部。加里維克斯為精英：建議組隊前往。",
	["Stay with Kinelory while she sneaks into Go'Shek Farm and back; Horde orcs jump you on the way."] = "留在與基恩洛當她潛行進入格沙克農場與返回；部落獸人跳下你在途中。",
	["Steelgrill's Depot is just east of Kharanos; Binjy Featherwhistle stands beside Milli Featherwhistle's mechanostriders. At 40 Binjy Featherwhistle teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Alliance race ride these."] = "鋼架補給站是就在卡拉諾斯以東；賓吉·羽哨位於米利·羽哨的旁邊機械陸行鳥。在40賓吉·羽哨傳授騎術（100金每暴雪的設計師），與學習它給你一個坐騎。永恆服客戶端允許每個聯盟種族騎行這些。",
	["Steelgrill's Depot is just east of Kharanos; Binjy Featherwhistle stands beside Milli Featherwhistle's mechanostriders. At 60 Binjy Featherwhistle teaches Journeyman Riding (1,000g per Blizzard's designers); Blizzard says learning riding grants a mount. The Forever client sells each swift mechanostrider for 200g at level 60."] = "鋼架補給站是就在卡拉諾斯以東；賓吉·羽哨位於米利·羽哨的旁邊機械陸行鳥。在60賓吉·羽哨傳授中級騎術（1,000金每暴雪的設計師）；暴雪說學習騎行獎勵一匹坐騎。永恆服客戶端出售每個迅捷機械陸行鳥給200金在60級。",
	["Sten Stoutarm"] = "斯登·粗臂",
	["Step into the cave: Kernda and Meilosh stand just inside."] = "步驟進入洞穴：克爾達與梅羅什位於就在內部。",
	["Step through the portal into Darnassus. The Temple of the Moon is in the south of the city."] = "步驟穿過傳送門進入達納蘇斯。月神殿是在主城以南。",
	["Stephanie Turner, Old Town"] = "斯蒂芬妮·特納，舊城區",
	["Stinky waits west of the manor, in the marsh below North Point Tower. Lead him to his Bogbean leaves and keep the swamp creatures off him."] = "斯汀基等候在莊園以西，在沼澤在北點哨塔下方。引導他前往他的澤豆離開與保留沼澤生物偏離/關閉他。",
	["Stolen Books"] = "被盜的書籍",
	["Stolen Enchanting Supplies"] = "被盜的附魔物資",
	["Stoley"] = "斯杜雷",
	["Stoley's Shipment"] = "斯杜雷的貨物",
	["Stoley's next delivery goes back to Booty Bay: skip it."] = "斯杜雷的下一個遞送物交回給藏寶海灣：跳過即可。",
	["Stoley, in the port's tavern"] = "斯杜雷，在港口的酒館",
	["Stonard is the Horde town."] = "斯通納德是部落城鎮。",
	["Stone Circle"] = "石環",
	["Stone of Inner Binding"] = "內禁錮之石",
	["Stone of the Tides"] = "海潮之石",
	["Stonelash Flayer Stinger"] = "石鞭掠奪者之刺",
	["Stonelash Flayers and Rock Stalkers roam the dunes south-west of Kirika's camp."] = "石鞭掠奪者與石行蜘蛛遊蕩於沙丘在吉里卡將軍的以西南營地。",
	["Stonelash Pincer Stinger"] = "石鞭巨鉗蠍之刺",
	["Stonelash Scorpid Stinger"] = "石鞭蠍之刺",
	["Stonesplinter Seers (level 13) stand among the troggs in the south of Stonesplinter Valley, south of Braldir; Tunnel Rat Geomancers (level 12) work the Silver Stream Mine at the north end of the loch. The troggs come in packs and some throw from range: pull one at a time."] = "碎石怪先知（13級）位於其中：穴居人在碎石怪之谷以南，在布拉爾迪爾·灰袍以南；坑道鼠地卜師（12級）有效銀泉礦洞在湖的北端。穴居人來到在怪群與一些投擲來自範圍：拉怪1在一個時間。",
	["Stonetusk Boars graze between the vineyards and the farm."] = "石牙野豬吃草在葡萄園與農場之間。",
	["Stonevault Bonesnapper"] = "石窟斷骨者",
	["Stormapples and flutterfly dust lie all over the orchard; Hungry Bandits raid it. Galestriders graze in the fields east of it. The broken construct floats at the orchard's north edge."] = "風暴蘋果與彩蝶粉塵位於全部越過果園；飢餓的強盜團隊副本它。疾風陸行鳥吃草在農田在它東面。損壞的構造體漂浮在果園的北邊緣。",
	["Stormhide, on the plain between Gann and the ridge"] = "雷鱗蜥蜴，在平原在加恩·石塔與山脊之間",
	["Stormpike Quartermaster: Irondeep and Coldtooth Supplies from the mines"] = "雷矛軍需官：鐵深礦洞與冷齒補給品來自礦洞",
	["Stormwind has no shaman trainer"] = "暴風城有無薩滿祭司訓練師",
	["Stormwind has no shaman trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge and train with Eldrun Stormbreaker. Gryth Thurden in the Great Forge flies to Southshore too."] = "暴風城有無薩滿祭司訓練師：接取礦道地鐵來自矮人區前往鐵爐堡與訓練與埃爾德倫·破風者。格萊斯·瑟登在大鍛爐飛往前往南海鎮也。",
	["Stormwind has no shaman trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge and train your level 60 spells with Eldrun Stormbreaker."] = "暴風城有無薩滿祭司訓練師：接取礦道地鐵來自矮人區前往鐵爐堡與訓練你的60級法術與埃爾德倫·破風者。",
	["Stormwind has no shaman trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge, train with Eldrun Stormbreaker, then ride the tram back for the Auberdine boat."] = "暴風城有無薩滿祭司訓練師：接取礦道地鐵來自矮人區前往鐵爐堡，訓練與埃爾德倫·破風者，然後騎行地鐵返回給奧伯丁船。",
	["Stormwind has no shaman trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge, train with Eldrun Stormbreaker, then ride the tram back."] = "暴風城有無薩滿祭司訓練師：接取礦道地鐵來自矮人區前往鐵爐堡，訓練與埃爾德倫·破風者，然後騎行地鐵返回。",
	["Strahad Farsan"] = "斯坦哈德·法爾杉",
	["Strahad Farsan: Summon Felhunter"] = "斯坦哈德·法爾杉：召喚地獄獵犬",
	["Strahad stands on the hill in Ratchet. Use the Tome of the Cabal on the summoning circle beside him and defeat the felhunter to bind it."] = "斯坦哈德·法爾杉位於山丘在棘齒城。使用陰謀之書在召喚法陣旁邊他與擊敗地獄獵犬前往綁定它。",
	["Strange Fronded Plant"] = "奇怪的樹木",
	["Strange Fruited Plant"] = "奇怪的果樹",
	["Strange Hermit"] = "奇怪的隱士",
	["Stranglethorn Raptor"] = "荊棘谷迅猛龍",
	["Stranglethorn Tiger"] = "荊棘谷猛虎",
	["Stranglethorn Tigers and Panthers (32-33) roam the hills east of the camp, along the lake shore."] = "荊棘谷猛虎與豹（32-33）遊蕩於丘陵在營地以東，沿著湖岸邊。",
	["Stratholme is a group of five, level 58-60. The Service Entrance at Elders' Square, in north-western Eastern Plaguelands, leads to the undead side; Baron Rivendare waits in the Slaughter House at its end. Our data gives the reins a 0.02% drop chance (pfQuest, Era): one in about five thousand kills. Nothing shows Forever changing it."] = "斯坦索姆是一個隊伍的5，58-60級。服務入口在長者的廣場，在北-西部東瘟疫之地，通往亡靈一側；瑞文戴爾男爵等候於屠宰場房屋在它的盡頭。我們的數據給予繮繩一個0.02%掉落幾率（pfQuest，舊世）：1在約5 1000擊殺。無獎勵顯示永恆服更換它。",
	["Stratholme, Live side"] = "斯坦索姆，實測一側",
	["Stratholme, Undead side"] = "斯坦索姆，亡靈一側",
	["Strider Clutchmother"] = "雌性森林陸行鳥",
	["Strider Stew is orange from 50 (yellow at 90, grey at 130): about 52 crafts to 100. Cook at any fire: Basic Campfire comes with Cooking."] = "燉陸行鳥是橙色來自50（黃色在90，灰色在130）：約52製作前往100。烹飪在任意營火：基礎營火來自與烹飪。",
	["Strigid Owl Feather"] = "巨翼梟的羽毛",
	["Strigid Screecher: tame it with the Taming Rod"] = "巨翼惡梟：馴服它與馴獸棒",
	["Stringy Vulture Meat: Fleshrippers"] = "禿鷲肉條：碎屍鳥",
	["Strong Troll's Blood Potion: auction house or an alchemist, for Elixir of Agony."] = "強力巨魔之血藥水：拍賣房屋或一個煉金師，給苦楚藥劑。",
	["Subdue the succubus"] = "制服魅魔",
	["Subdue the voidwalker"] = "制服虛空行者",
	["Sulhasa"] = "蘇哈薩",
	["Sulhasa, up in the tree just east of Gann"] = "蘇哈薩，上在樹就在加恩·石塔以東",
	["Summon Succubus"] = "召喚魅魔",
	["Summon Voidwalker"] = "召喚虛空行者",
	["Sundried Driftwood"] = "曬乾的流木",
	["Sunken Temple"] = "沈沒的神廟",
	["Sunscale Scytheclaws hunt the plains south of the Crossroads, around the Raptor Grounds; they drop the horns. Hand them in on your next pass through Ratchet."] = "赤鱗鐮爪龍狩獵平原南的十字路口，周圍迅猛龍巢穴；它們掉落角。上交它們在你的下一個穿過穿過棘齒城。",
	["Super Reaper 6000 Blueprints"] = "超級收割機6000型的設計圖",
	["Super Sticky Tar"] = "極度粘稠的瀝青",
	["Supervisor Raelen"] = "管理員萊琳",
	["Supply Crate"] = "補給箱",
	["Surena's Choker: Surena Caledon"] = "蘇倫娜的項圈：蘇倫娜·凱爾東",
	["Surf Glider (level 48-50) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "海浪龜（48-50級）掉落它此處。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Suspicious Industrial Supplies, from the crates around Moonbrook"] = "可疑的工業物資，來自木箱在月溪鎮周圍",
	["Sven Yorgen"] = "斯溫·約根",
	["Swamp Jaguar"] = "沼澤虎",
	["Swamp Jaguar (level 36-37) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "沼澤虎（36-37級）掉落它此處。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Swart"] = "斯瓦特",
	["Swift Blue Raptor, 200g"] = "迅捷藍色迅猛龍，200金",
	["Swift Brown Ram, 200g"] = "迅捷棕山羊，200金",
	["Swift Brown Steed, 200g"] = "迅捷棕馬，200金",
	["Swift Galestriders need level 60 and Journeyman Riding from a riding trainer of your faction; see the Level 60 mount guides for where."] = "赫格拉姆疾風陸行鳥需要60級與中級騎術來自一個騎術訓練師的你的陣營；查看等級60坐騎指南給在。",
	["Swift Gray Ram, 200g"] = "迅捷灰山羊，200金",
	["Swift Green Mechanostrider, 200g"] = "迅捷綠色機械陸行鳥，200金",
	["Swift Olive Raptor, 200g"] = "迅捷綠色迅猛龍，200金",
	["Swift Orange Raptor, 200g"] = "迅捷橙色迅猛龍，200金",
	["Swift Palomino, 200g"] = "迅捷褐色馬，200金",
	["Swift White Mechanostrider, 200g"] = "迅捷白色機械陸行鳥，200金",
	["Swift White Ram, 200g"] = "迅捷白山羊，200金",
	["Swift White Steed, 200g"] = "迅捷白馬，200金",
	["Swift Yellow Mechanostrider, 200g"] = "迅捷黃色機械陸行鳥，200金",
	["Swiftthistle comes from Briarthorn nodes (Herbalism); this is the densest patch in the data. The Auction House works too."] = "雨燕草來自石南草採集點（草藥學）；此是最密集的區域在數據。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Swim back and follow the road west to the Sepulcher."] = "游泳返回與沿著道路前往西前往瑟伯切爾。",
	["Swim east from the bridge into Lake Everstill; the chest lies on the lake bed."] = "游泳東來自橋進入止水湖；箱子位於湖床。",
	["Swim south from the island to the Isle of Dread. Hatecrest Serpent Guards and Sorceresses hold it; Lord Shalzaru (level 47) waits in the cave at its south end. Pull his guards first."] = "游泳南來自島嶼前往恐怖之島。憎世毒蛇守衛與女巫要塞它；沙爾扎魯（47級）等候在洞穴內在它的南盡頭。拉怪他的衛兵第一。",
	["Swim to the small island off the southern tip of Azshara: Pilot Xiggs Fuselighter waits by the monument."] = "游泳前往小型島嶼偏離/關閉南部尖端的艾薩拉：駕駛員西格斯·熔光等候於紀念碑。",
	["Swoops glide over the plains all around Bloodhoof."] = "猛鷲滑翔越過平原全部在血蹄周圍。",
	["Syndicate Documents"] = "辛迪加文件",
	["Syndicate Footpad"] = "辛迪加劫匪",
	["Syndicate Highwayman"] = "辛迪加路霸",
	["Syndicate Mercenaries at Stromgarde (level 31-32) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "辛迪加雇傭兵在激流堡（31-32級）掉落它此處。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Syndicate Mercenary"] = "辛迪加雇傭兵",
	["Syndicate Thief"] = "辛迪加竊賊",
	["Syral Bladeleaf"] = "塞拉爾·刃葉",
	["Tablet of Ryun'eh"] = "雷烏納石板",
	["Taelan's Hammer, from Mercutio Filthgorger"] = "泰蘭之錘，來自米庫提奧·污血",
	["Tai'jin, for Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar: keep it"] = "泰金，給烏爾庫在奧格瑞瑪：請保留該任務/物品",
	["Taiga Wisemane"] = "泰迦·慧鬃",
	["Tailoring runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 1g 12s in all."] = "裁縫可隨升級同步練習升級。永恆服傳承系統獎勵製作專業在技能等級150，225與300（中級，高級與大師級上限），因此以上每個階段節點均計入進度。1-75階段所需材料總計約需花費1金12銀。",
	["Tajarri"] = "塔加里",
	["Tajarri, at the Shrine of Remulos"] = "塔加里，在雷姆洛斯神殿",
	["Takar the Seer"] = "先知塔卡爾",
	["Takata Steelblade"] = "塔卡塔·鋼刃",
	["Takata's next Alliance Relations sends you back to Orgrimmar for nothing: leave it."] = "塔卡塔·鋼刃的下一個聯盟關係派往你返回前往奧格瑞瑪給無獎勵：可先放著不做。",
	["Takata's next errand sends you after a demon lord with an elite guard: skip it."] = "塔卡塔·鋼刃的下一個差事派你去討伐一個惡魔領主與一個精英守衛：跳過即可。",
	["Take a Box of Incendiaries from the crate next to Derrington for Scarlet Diversions, done on the way back. Equip the Argent Dawn Commission: Scourgestones only drop while you wear it."] = "接取一個燃燒彈箱來自木箱在高級執行官德靈頓旁邊給誤導血色十字軍，完成在返回途中。裝備銀色黎明委任徽章：天災石僅掉落當你佩戴它。",
	["Take the Deeprun Tram from Stormwind's Dwarven District to Ironforge (or fly to Ironforge), then leave the city through its gates."] = "接取礦道地鐵來自暴風城的矮人區前往鐵爐堡（或飛往前往鐵爐堡），然後跳過主城穿過它的大門。",
	["Take the Deeprun Tram from Tinker Town to Stormwind's Dwarven District, then walk to the Cathedral Square."] = "接取礦道地鐵來自工匠區前往暴風城的矮人區，然後步行前往大教堂廣場。",
	["Take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge."] = "接取礦道地鐵來自矮人區前往鐵爐堡。",
	["Take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District. Roetten is in the Reclaimers' hall by the Hall of Explorers, Prospector Stormpike in the hall itself, Gerrig Bonegrip in the Forlorn Cavern. The next guide flies on to Thelsamar."] = "接取礦道地鐵來自矮人區。羅頓·石錘是在奪回者的大廳在旁探險者大廳，勘察員塔伯斯·雷矛在大廳其本身，葛利·硬骨在荒棄的洞穴。下一個指南飛往在前往塞爾薩瑪。",
	["Take the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge."] = "接取礦道地鐵前往鐵爐堡。",
	["Take the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge. Bubulo Acerbus and Mistina Steelshield each want sixty Wool, sixty Silk and sixty Mageweave, then sixty Runecloth: 120 of each in all, from your bags or the Auction House."] = "接取礦道地鐵前往鐵爐堡。巴巴羅·阿克巴斯與米斯蒂娜·鋼盾每個需要60毛料，60絲綢與60魔紋布，然後60符文布：120的每個在全部，來自你的背包或拍賣行。",
	["Take the Orgrimmar zeppelin from the tower on the west side of Grom'gol and fly to Freewind Post. The Damaged Chest lies in the canyon north of the post."] = "接取奧格瑞瑪飛艇來自哨塔在格羅姆高的西側與飛往前往亂風崗。破損的箱子位於峽谷在崗哨以北。",
	["Take the Orgrimmar zeppelin from the tower on the west side of Grom'gol and fly to Ratchet. Islen Waterseer camps on the coast a short ride south of it."] = "接取奧格瑞瑪飛艇來自哨塔在格羅姆高的西側與飛往前往棘齒城。水之先知伊斯倫紮營在海岸邊一個不足騎行在它南面。",
	["Take the Orgrimmar zeppelin from the tower on the west side of Grom'gol and train in the city before you fly on."] = "接取奧格瑞瑪飛艇來自哨塔在格羅姆高的西側與訓練在主城之前你飛往在。",
	["Take the Orgrimmar zeppelin from the tower on the west side of Grom'gol."] = "接取奧格瑞瑪飛艇來自哨塔在格羅姆高的西側。",
	["Take the Timbermaw Hold tunnel from its Winterspring mouth, west of Donova, and follow the Moonglade branch to Nighthaven. Umber studies by the lake shore."] = "接取木喉要塞隧道來自它的冬泉谷入口/河口，在多諾瓦以西，與沿著月光林地樹枝前往永夜港。阿姆伯爾研究在旁湖岸邊。",
	["Take the Timbermaw Hold tunnel in northern Felwood through to Moonglade (druids: Teleport: Moonglade). Nighthaven is neutral."] = "接取木喉要塞隧道在北部費伍德森林穿過前往月光林地（德魯伊：傳送：月光林地）。永夜港是中立。",
	["Take the Torch of Dormant Flame to Olariaan Swiftburn at the Shrine of Flames, south-west of Valanaar in the Gustberry Lowlands."] = "接取休眠火炬加拉克烈焰守衛前往奧拉里安·疾燃在神龕的加拉克烈焰守衛，在瓦拉納爾以西南在風莓低地。",
	["Take the beacon to OOX-09/HL at the head of the river near Skulk Rock, then escort it to the shore beyond Overlook Cliff."] = "接取信標前往 OOX-09/HL型定位器在河流附近的盡頭隱匿石，然後護送它前往岸邊越過懸崖懸崖。",
	["Take the beacon to OOX-17/TN in Tanaris, then escort it to Steamwheedle Port. Its turn-in is in Booty Bay too."] = "接取信標前往 OOX-17/TN型定位器在塔納利斯，然後護送它前往熱砂港。它的交任務是在藏寶海灣也。",
	["Take the beacon to OOX-22/FE in a cave near Feral Scar Vale, then escort it to the dock on the Forgotten Coast. Its turn-in is in Booty Bay; keep it for later."] = "接取信標前往自動導航機器人OOX-22/FE 在一個洞穴在深痕谷附近，然後護送它前往碼頭在被遺忘的海岸。它的交任務是在藏寶海灣；留著稍後做。",
	["Take the boat from Auberdine to Rut'theran Village."] = "乘船來自奧伯丁前往魯瑟蘭村。",
	["Take the boat from Auberdine to Rut'theran Village. Teldrassil is night elf country: Dolanaar and Shadowglen have guards, and Darnassus is reached only through the portal in Rut'theran Village."] = "乘船來自奧伯丁前往魯瑟蘭村。泰達希爾是夜晚精靈領地：多蘭納爾與幽影谷有衛兵，與達納蘇斯是可抵達僅穿過傳送門在魯瑟蘭村。",
	["Take the boat from Menethil's pier to Theramore Isle in Dustwallow Marsh."] = "乘船來自米奈希爾的棧橋前往塞拉摩島在塵泥沼澤。",
	["Take the boat from Ratchet to Booty Bay and fly to Stormwind."] = "乘船來自棘齒城前往藏寶海灣與飛往前往暴風城。",
	["Take the boat from Rut'theran Village to Auberdine and fly to Astranaar."] = "乘船來自魯瑟蘭村前往奧伯丁與飛往前往阿斯特蘭納。",
	["Take the boat from Rut'theran Village to Auberdine."] = "乘船來自魯瑟蘭村前往奧伯丁。",
	["Take the boat from Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine and fly to Rut'theran Village; Priestess Alathea is in the Temple of the Moon. Then fly back to Auberdine."] = "乘船來自暴風城港口前往奧伯丁與飛往前往魯瑟蘭村；女祭司阿蘭希雅是在月神殿。然後飛往返回前往奧伯丁。",
	["Take the boat from Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine. Join the two half pendants into the Pendant of the Sea Lion and cast Teleport: Moonglade: Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven. Then fly to Rut'theran Village (by way of Auberdine)."] = "乘船來自暴風城港口前往奧伯丁。加入2一半掛墜進入海獅墜飾與施放傳送：月光林地：德迪利特·星焰是在永夜港。然後飛往前往魯瑟蘭村（在旁路的奧伯丁）。",
	["Take the boat to Auberdine from Menethil's docks."] = "乘船前往奧伯丁來自米奈希爾的碼頭。",
	["Take the boat to Menethil Harbor from Auberdine's docks."] = "乘船前往米奈希爾港來自奧伯丁的碼頭。",
	["Take the boat to Theramore from the far pier."] = "乘船前往塞拉摩來自遠處棧橋。",
	["Take the boat to the Forgotten Coast and follow the shore south to the wrecked row boat on the beach."] = "乘船前往被遺忘的海岸與沿著岸邊南前往失事的排船在海灘上。",
	["Take the boat to the mainland and ride north-east to Zorbin's camp by the Twin Colossals."] = "乘船前往大陸與騎行東北前往佐爾賓的營地在旁雙塔山。",
	["Take the flight path in Nighthaven and fly to Auberdine."] = "接取飛行點在永夜港與飛往前往奧伯丁。",
	["Take the kitten to the same moonwell and release it there; once it has turned into a Corrupted Saber, bring it back to Winna and click on it to hand it over."] = "接取小貓前往相同月亮井與釋放它那裡；一次它有交還進入一個墮落的雜斑野豬刃豹，攜帶它返回前往溫娜·哈薩德與點擊在它前往上交它越過。",
	["Take the lift down. The egg lies in a nest on the canyon floor in one of three spots: south-east of the mesas (52.3,55.2), east (56.4,50.4) or south-west (37.6,56.1)."] = "接取升降梯下。蛋位於一個巢在峽谷樓層在1的3地點：在台地以東南（52.3,55.2），東（56.4,50.4）或西南（37.6,56.1）。",
	["Take the pass out of Kargath's west side into the Searing Gorge, then ride south across the gorge to the long bridge into Blackrock Mountain. Inside, follow the chain walkways down and leave through the southern exit; stay off the paths to the dungeon portals."] = "穿過山道離開卡加斯的西一側進入灼熱峽谷，然後騎行南穿過峽谷前往長橋進入黑石山。內部，沿著任務鏈步道下與跳過穿過南部出口；留在偏離/關閉小徑前往地下城傳送門。",
	["Take the pass out of Kargath's west side into the Searing Gorge, then ride south-west to the dig site. The Wooden Outhouse stands at its southern end; the Dark Iron Geologists dig just north of it. Bring 15 Silk Cloth (the Auction House sells it)."] = "穿過山道離開卡加斯的西一側進入灼熱峽谷，然後騎行西南前往挖掘地點。木制廁所位於它的南部盡頭；黑鐵地質學家挖掘就在它北面。攜帶15絲綢（拍賣行出售它）。",
	["Take the portal down to Rut'theran Village. Nessa stands on the dock, Vesprystus by the hippogryphs."] = "接取傳送門下前往魯瑟蘭村。尼莎·影歌位於碼頭上，維斯派塔斯在旁角鷹獸。",
	["Take the portal up from Rut'theran Village to Mathrengyl in the Cenarion Enclave."] = "接取傳送門上來自魯瑟蘭村前往瑪斯雷·馭熊者在塞納里奧區。",
	["Take the portal up to Darnassus."] = "接取傳送門上前往達納蘇斯。",
	["Take the portal up to Mathrengyl, then fly back to Auberdine for the boat to Stormwind."] = "接取傳送門上前往瑪斯雷·馭熊者，然後飛往返回前往奧伯丁給船前往暴風城。",
	["Take the portal up to the Cenarion Enclave, then fly back to Auberdine."] = "接取傳送門上前往塞納里奧區，然後飛往返回前往奧伯丁。",
	["Take the portal up to the Rohashi Spires and join Elaadrin and Ayessa against the High Priestess."] = "接取傳送門上前往羅哈什尖塔與加入艾拉德琳·暮風與阿耶莎·晨歌迎戰高女祭司。",
	["Take the road north at the fork to the ogre village of Brackenwall."] = "沿著道路走北在岔路口前往食人魔村莊的蕨牆村。",
	["Take the road north out of Booty Bay; Unbagwa sits on a hill in Mistvale Valley, east of the road."] = "沿著道路走北離開藏寶海灣；巫醫安巴格瓦位於一個山丘在迷霧谷，在道路以東。",
	["Take the road north to the ruined manor; Jarl lives in the shack beside it and the loose dirt is at the corner of the house."] = "沿著道路走北前往毀壞的莊園；卡爾住在棚屋旁邊它與鬆動的泥土是在角落的房屋。",
	["Take the road north-west from Dolanaar again; she still lies beside it, on the way to Darnassus."] = "沿著道路走西北來自多蘭納爾再次；她仍然位於旁邊它，在途中前往達納蘇斯。",
	["Take the road north-west from Dolanaar towards the Oracle Glade; she lies hurt beside it."] = "沿著道路走西北來自多蘭納爾朝向神諭林地；她位於受傷旁邊它。",
	["Take the road north; Private Thorsen stands on it, the camp sits in the hills to the west."] = "沿著道路走北；列兵索爾森位於它，營地位於丘陵向西。",
	["Take the road south towards Booty Bay. The Elder Mistvale Gorillas (40-41) live in Mistvale Valley, east of the road; about one in twenty carries an aged sinew."] = "沿著道路走南朝藏寶海灣方向。老邁的薄霧谷猩猩（40-41）實測在迷霧谷，在道路以東；約1在20攜帶一個老邁的肌腱。",
	["Take the road south-east out of Brill; Terrence stands on it short of the zeppelin towers."] = "沿著道路走東南離開布瑞爾；亡靈衛兵特倫斯位於它不足的飛艇哨塔。",
	["Take the road south-east to Valanaar, the Skyborne town on the south coast. Nyalah and Alvarion stand at its western edge."] = "沿著道路走東南前往瓦拉納爾，天裔城鎮在南海岸。妮雅拉·明火與阿爾瓦里奧·風野位於它的西部邊緣。",
	["Take the road south-east. Nyalah Brightfire and Alvarion Windfield stand by the road west of Valanaar; Windsong Crawlers line the shore around them."] = "沿著道路走東南。妮雅拉·明火與阿爾瓦里奧·風野位於路邊在瓦拉納爾以西；風歌爬行者路線岸邊周圍它們。",
	["Take the road south-west out of the Stonetalon Mountains into Desolace; Nijel's Point in the north is the Alliance town."] = "沿著道路走西南出的石爪山脈進入淒涼之地；尼耶爾前哨站在北面是聯盟城鎮。",
	["Take the road west down into the crater and ride to the Slithering Scar, the silithid cave in the south. The Gorishi Hive Queen waits in its deepest chamber."] = "沿著道路走西下進入環形山與騎行前往滑行之痕，異種蟲洞穴在南面。格里什皇后等候於它的最深處密室。",
	["Take the tunnel into the Howling Vale; the tome lies in the ruins at its west end."] = "穿過隧道進入狼嚎谷；法典位於廢墟中在它的西盡頭。",
	["Take the zeppelin back to Orgrimmar."] = "搭乘飛艇返回前往奧格瑞瑪。",
	["Take the zeppelin from Orgrimmar or the Undercity to Grom'gol Base Camp."] = "搭乘飛艇來自奧格瑞瑪或幽暗城前往格羅姆高營地。",
	["Take the zeppelin from the tower outside Orgrimmar to Tirisfal Glades and ride into the Undercity. Lady Sylvanas holds the Royal Quarter."] = "搭乘飛艇來自哨塔在奧格瑞瑪外前往提瑞斯法林地與騎行進入幽暗城。雷蒂希爾瓦娜斯·風行者持有皇家區。",
	["Take the zeppelin from the towers outside the Undercity to Orgrimmar and train before you fly on."] = "搭乘飛艇來自哨塔外部幽暗城前往奧格瑞瑪與訓練之前你飛往在。",
	["Take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar from the tower outside the Undercity, then fly to Splintertree Post."] = "搭乘飛艇前往奧格瑞瑪來自哨塔外部幽暗城，然後飛往前往碎木崗哨。",
	["Takrin Pathseeker"] = "塔克林·尋路者",
	["Tal"] = "塔爾",
	["Talaanis Shadowsong"] = "塔拉尼斯·影歌",
	["Taleen Shimmerthread"] = "塔琳·微光絲",
	["Talen"] = "塔爾倫",
	["Talin Keeneye"] = "塔林·銳眼",
	["Talin's camp is at the west end of the valley. Felix's Box lies in the snow south of it, his Chest by the troll cave and his Bucket of Bolts east of the cave: grab them as you pass."] = "塔林·銳眼的營地是在山谷的西端。菲利克斯的盒子位於雪在它南面，他的箱子在旁巨魔洞穴與他的一桶螺栓在洞穴以東：拿取它們作為你穿過。",
	["Talisman of Corruption, in Xabraxxis' Demon Bag"] = "墮落護符，在薩巴克希斯的惡魔背包",
	["Talk to Cook Torka"] = "與…交談廚師托爾卡",
	["Tallonkai Swiftroot"] = "塔隆凱·捷根",
	["Tallonkai Swiftroot, back in Dolanaar"] = "塔隆凱·捷根，返回在多蘭納爾",
	["Tallonkai's Dresser"] = "塔隆凱的衣櫃",
	["Tallow: for Hammerfall in Arathi, later on the route"] = "塔隆：給落錘鎮在阿拉希高地，稍後在路線",
	["Talo Thornhoof"] = "塔羅·刺蹄",
	["Talo Thornhoof: the bears are in Felwood"] = "塔羅·刺蹄：熊是在費伍德森林",
	["Talonaxe's next task waits for a later Hinterlands guide."] = "獅鷲管理員沙拉克·鷹斧的下一個任務等候給一個稍後辛特蘭指南。",
	["Tame Beast"] = "馴服野獸",
	["Tame it with the Taming Rod"] = "馴服它與馴獸棒",
	["Taming Lesson: Tame Beast"] = "馴獸課程：馴服野獸",
	["Tammra Windfield"] = "塔姆拉·荒原",
	["Tanaris is south of Dustwallow Marsh and Thousand Needles. Gadgetzan is a neutral goblin town."] = "塔納利斯是在塵泥沼澤以南與千針石林。加基森是一個中立地精城鎮。",
	["Tannok Frosthammer, in the distillery"] = "塔諾克·霜錘，在釀酒廠",
	["Tapoke \"Slim\" Jahn"] = "“瘦子”塔波克·詹",
	["Tar Beasts wallow in the Lakkari Tar Pits; the fire elementals of Fire Plume Ridge in the middle carry the ash; the Gorishi wasps of the Slithering Scar in the south carry the gland. Every creature in the crater can drop Un'Goro Soil."] = "焦油獸打滾在拉卡利油沼；營火元素的火羽山在中間攜帶灰燼；戈里什黃蜂的滑行之痕在南面攜帶腺體。每個生物在環形山可以掉落安戈洛的泥土。",
	["Target one of the frogs here and type /sing; a Musical Gustjumper appears. Interact with it to get the pet."] = "目標1的青蛙此處與類型 /唱歌；一個八音躍風獸出現。交互與它前往獲取寵物。",
	["Tarindrella"] = "塔琳德拉",
	["Tarindrella, south of the tree"] = "塔琳德拉，在樹以南",
	["Taronn Redfeather"] = "塔諾恩·紅羽",
	["Tarrel Rockweaver"] = "塔雷爾·石紋",
	["Tarrel Rockweaver, by the north gate"] = "塔雷爾·石紋，在旁北大門",
	["Tarshaw Jaggedscar"] = "塔紹爾·鋸痕",
	["Taskmaster Scrange"] = "監工斯克蘭格",
	["Taskmasters and Slavers drive the slaves all over the Cauldron, and any of them can carry a Thorium Plated Dagger. The Steamsmiths work at the furnaces in the middle (the Smithing Tuyere), the Lookouts stand on the southern ridges (the Spyglass). Any Dark Iron may drop the Grimesilt Outhouse Key: keep it."] = "監工與奴隸主驅趕奴隸全部越過大鍋，與任意的它們可以攜帶一個瑟銀匕首。蒸汽鐵匠有效在熔爐在中間（冶煉鼓風機），哨兵魯魯位於南部山脊（望遠鏡）。任意黑鐵礦可能掉落格里塞特廁所鑰匙：請保留該任務/物品。",
	["Tatternack Steelforge"] = "塔特納克·鋼爐",
	["Tauren: the Great Cat Spirit waits on the southern hill above the bridge. Skyborne: the Avatar of Saeyleenan stands south of the twin bridges. Then the dens east of the lake: leave your form, click the statue at the entrance for five minutes of stealth, keep clear of the spirits inside and take one of each relic; the Relic of the Silent Shadow lies at the foot of the white cat statue."] = "牛頭人：巨豹之靈等候於南部山丘在橋上方。天裔：賽琳南的化身位於雙生橋以南。然後獸穴在湖以東：跳過你的形態，點擊雕像在入口給5分鐘的潛行，保留清理的靈魂內部與接取1的每個聖物；寂靜暗影聖物位於白色貓雕像的底部。",
	["Tavernkeep Smitts"] = "旅店老闆斯密茨",
	["Tavernkeep Smitts, in the tavern"] = "旅店老闆斯密茨，在酒館內",
	["Teaches Azure Silk Cloak (needs Tailoring 175). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "傳授碧藍絲質披風（需要裁縫175）。商人出售它在限量庫存該刷新補貨；拍賣行經常有它也。",
	["Teaches Elixir of Superior Defense (needs Alchemy 265). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "傳授超強防禦藥劑（需要煉金術265）。商人出售它在限量庫存該刷新補貨；拍賣行經常有它也。",
	["Teaches Enchant Bracer - Lesser Strength (needs Enchanting 140). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "傳授附魔護腕 - 次級力量（需要附魔140）。商人出售它在限量庫存該刷新補貨；拍賣行經常有它也。",
	["Teaches Enchant Cloak - Minor Agility (needs Enchanting 110). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "傳授附魔披風 - 初級敏捷（需要附魔110）。商人出售它在限量庫存該刷新補貨；拍賣行經常有它也。",
	["Teaches Great Rage Potion (needs Alchemy 175). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "傳授暴怒藥水（需要煉金術175）。商人出售它在限量庫存該刷新補貨；拍賣行經常有它也。",
	["Teaches Holy Protection Potion (needs Alchemy 100). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "傳授神聖防護藥水（需要煉金術100）。商人出售它在限量庫存該刷新補貨；拍賣行經常有它也。",
	["Teaches Huge Thorium Battleaxe (needs Blacksmithing 280)."] = "傳授巨型瑟銀戰斧（需要鍛造280）。",
	["Teaches Lesser Mana Oil (needs Enchanting 250)."] = "傳授次級法力之油（需要附魔250）。",
	["Teaches Ornate Thorium Handaxe (needs Blacksmithing 275)."] = "傳授華麗瑟銀手斧（需要鍛造275）。",
	["Teaches Red Woolen Bag (needs Tailoring 115). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "傳授紅色毛紡包（需要裁縫115）。商人出售它在限量庫存該刷新補貨；拍賣行經常有它也。",
	["Teaches Runecloth Gloves (needs Tailoring 275). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "傳授符文布手套（需要裁縫275）。商人出售它在限量庫存該刷新補貨；拍賣行經常有它也。",
	["Teaches Runic Leather Headband (needs Leatherworking 290). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "傳授符文皮甲頭環（需要制皮290）。商人出售它在限量庫存該刷新補貨；拍賣行經常有它也。",
	["Teaches Thorium Tube (needs Engineering 275). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "傳授瑟銀管（需要工程學275）。商人出售它在限量庫存該刷新補貨；拍賣行經常有它也。",
	["Teaches Thorium Widget (needs Engineering 260). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "傳授瑟銀零件（需要工程學260）。商人出售它在限量庫存該刷新補貨；拍賣行經常有它也。",
	["Teaches Tuxedo Jacket (needs Tailoring 250). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "傳授禮服夾克（需要裁縫250）。商人出售它在限量庫存該刷新補貨；拍賣行經常有它也。",
	["Teaches Wicked Leather Gauntlets (needs Leatherworking 260). Vendors sell it in limited stock that restocks; the Auction House often has it too."] = "傳授邪惡皮甲護手（需要制皮260）。商人出售它在限量庫存該刷新補貨；拍賣行經常有它也。",
	["Teaches Wizard Oil (needs Enchanting 275)."] = "傳授巫師之油（需要附魔275）。",
	["Teeri Wellwind"] = "蒂莉·順風",
	["Telf makes Fire Sapta from the tar and pouch. Use it by the brazier next to him to reveal the Minor Manifestation of Fire, kill it for the Glowing Ember, then place the ember in the brazier."] = "泰爾夫·祖拉姆製作火焰薩普塔來自焦油與袋子。使用它在旁火盆下一個前往他前往揭示火焰之魂，擊殺它給餘燼，然後放置餘燼在火盆。",
	["Telf waits on the Durotar bank of the Southfury River, east of the Razormane camp."] = "泰爾夫·祖拉姆等候於杜隆塔爾銀行的怒水河，東的刺鬃營地。",
	["Telf waits on the riverbank south of Far Watch Post, across the bridge."] = "泰爾夫·祖拉姆等候於河岸在前沿哨所以南，穿過橋。",
	["Temporal Displacer"] = "時空置換器",
	["Temporal Parasite"] = "時光寄生蟲",
	["Ten Morrowgrain from the Evergreen Pouch"] = "10晨光麥來自常青袋",
	["Ten more for True Believers"] = "10更多給真正的信徒",
	["Tenaron Stormgrip, at the top of the tree"] = "特納隆·雷拳，在樹的頂部",
	["Teo Hammerstorm"] = "提奧·錘暴",
	["Teo Hammerstorm, inside Anvilmar"] = "提奧·錘暴，在安威瑪爾內",
	["Teo Hammerstorm: Stoneskin Totem and your Earth Totem"] = "提奧·錘暴：石膚圖騰與你的大地圖騰",
	["Terenthis"] = "特倫希斯",
	["Termite Barrel"] = "白蟻桶",
	["Teronis' Corpse"] = "泰洛尼斯的屍體",
	["Thadius Grimshade, at the top of the keep"] = "薩迪斯·格希德，在保留的頂部",
	["Thadius' next task, Nekrum's Medallion, is a Zul'Farrak quest: skip it."] = "薩迪斯·格希德的下一個任務，耐克魯姆的徽章，是一個祖爾法拉克任務：跳過即可。",
	["Thaivand's next task ends at Southshore's graveyard and the magus offers a dungeon errand: leave both."] = "學徒塞萬德的下一個任務終結於南海鎮的墓地與魔導師提供一個地下城差事：兩個都可先跳過。",
	["Thal'trak Proudtusk"] = "薩特拉克",
	["Thalia Amberhide"] = "薩利亞",
	["Thanthaldis Snowgleam, 200g"] = "塔薩迪斯·雪光，200金",
	["Tharek Blackstone"] = "薩雷克·黑石",
	["Tharg"] = "薩爾格",
	["Tharnariun Treetender"] = "薩納瑞恩·綠樹",
	["Thatog"] = "薩托格",
	["The Al'Aketh cultists in the camp beyond Hanaa carry the signet."] = "奧阿凱斯邪教徒在營地裡越過哈娜·夜風攜帶印戒。",
	["The Alliance camp is at Three Corners in western Redridge Mountains. Loot supply crates in the world, fill them and hand them in to Marcy Baker for Merchant's Favor (5-20 a crate); the treat costs 1,500."] = "聯盟營地是在三角路口在西部赤脊山。拾取補給木箱在世界，裝滿它們與上交它們在前往瑪茜·貝克給商人的青睞（5-20一個木箱）；點心花費1,500。",
	["The Annals lie among the Musty Tomes in Andorhal's town hall; open them until you find the right one."] = "編年史位於其中：發霉的典籍在安多哈爾的城鎮大廳；打開/開啓它們直到你尋找右側1。",
	["The Arathi Highlands lie east of the Alterac Mountains and Hillsbrad Foothills."] = "阿拉希高地位於東的奧特蘭克山脈與希爾斯布萊德丘陵。",
	["The Argent Dawn starts out Neutral. Take the Commission from Argent Officer Garush at The Bulwark and wear it: in Classic, Scourgestones only drop while the Argent Dawn Commission trinket is equipped. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "銀色黎明始於出中立。接取委任徽章來自銀色黎明軍官加魯什在亡靈壁壘與佩戴它：在經典舊世，天災石僅掉落當銀色黎明委任徽章飾品是裝備。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["The Argent Dawn starts out Neutral. Take the Commission from Argent Officer Pureheart at Chillwind Camp and wear it: in Classic, Scourgestones only drop while the Argent Dawn Commission trinket is equipped. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "銀色黎明始於出中立。接取委任徽章來自銀色黎明軍官普爾哈特在冰風崗與佩戴它：在經典舊世，天災石僅掉落當銀色黎明委任徽章飾品是裝備。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["The Auberdine boat docks at Stormwind Harbor. Walk up into the city for training, then leave by the main gate and follow the road east through Elwynn Forest."] = "奧伯丁船碼頭在暴風城港口。步行上進入主城給訓練，然後跳過在旁主大門與沿著道路前往東穿過艾爾文森林。",
	["The Azeroth Commerce Authority is the Alliance's tradeskill faction in Forever. Its camp is at Three Corners in western Redridge Mountains. From level 10 mobs drop Waylaid Crates: fill each with the goods its label asks for and hand the Sealed Crate to Marcy Baker at the camp for reputation and Merchant's Favor. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "艾澤拉斯貿易局是聯盟的商業技能陣營在永恆服。它的營地是在三角路口在西部赤脊山。來自10級怪物掉落被劫的貨箱：裝滿每個與商品它的標籤需要與上交密封的箱子前往瑪茜·貝克在營地給聲望與商人的青睞。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["The Azurelode Mine lies south of Hillsbrad town. Miners work the tunnels; Foreman Bonds (30) and Miner Hackett (29) are deep inside."] = "碧玉礦洞位於希爾斯布萊德以南城鎮。礦工有效隧道；工頭邦德斯（30）與礦工哈克特（29）是深處內部。",
	["The Bael'dun Soldiers, Riflemen and Officers guard the fortress on the east side of the dig; all three items drop from them."] = "巴爾丹士兵，步槍手與軍官守衛要塞在挖掘的東側；全部3物品掉落來自它們。",
	["The Bandit Highwaymen hold the hills north of the farm."] = "強盜路霸要塞丘陵在農場以北。",
	["The Banshee Queen's champion holds the Marris Stead farmhouse, north of the Undercroft."] = "女妖之王的勇士持有瑪瑞斯農場農舍，北的地下墓穴。",
	["The Banshee Queen's champion holds the Marris Stead farmhouse."] = "女妖之王的勇士持有瑪瑞斯農場農舍。",
	["The Bitter Baitling is a fishing reward: Jang trades it for one Extravagant Extravaganza Coin, a reward of the fishing contest Jang runs in Booty Bay. The coin's exact source is not published yet."] = "苦味魚餌是一個釣魚獎勵：賈恩可兌換它給1奢華盛典硬幣，一個獎勵的釣魚比賽賈恩通往在藏寶海灣。硬幣的精確的來源是不已發佈尚。",
	["The Blasted Lands are south of the Swamp of Sorrows; the road arrives at Nethergarde Keep (Alliance)."] = "詛咒之地是南的悲傷沼澤；道路抵達在守望堡（聯盟）。",
	["The Bloodfeather harpies nest on the slopes west and north of the glade."] = "血羽鷹身女妖巢在山坡西與在林地以北。",
	["The Bloodscalp Headhunters (36-37) in the village on the coast carry the shrunken heads."] = "血頂獵頭者（36-37）在村子里在海岸邊攜帶縮小的頭顱。",
	["The Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins on the coast west of Nesingwary's camp."] = "血頂巨魔要塞廢墟在海岸邊在奈辛瓦里的營地以西。",
	["The Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins up the coast north of the reef and the village beyond; every one can drop a Bloody Bone Necklace. Keep looting pages of The Green Hills of Stranglethorn."] = "血頂巨魔要塞廢墟上海岸在暗礁與村莊越過以北；每個1可以掉落一個染血的白骨項鍊。保留拾取書頁的荊棘谷的青山。",
	["The Bloodstained Satchel"] = "染血的背包",
	["The Bloodstained Satchel lies by the path west of Valanaar; Fillion's camp is north-west of it, and the Shriekling Matriarchs nest just west of the camp."] = "染血的背包位於旁小徑在瓦拉納爾以西；菲利奧·焰風的營地位於它西北面，與尖嘯幼體刺喉雌龍巢就在營地以西。",
	["The Bloody Note"] = "染血的便條",
	["The Bluegill murlocs on the beach south-west of Menethil carry the ingots."] = "藍腮魚人在海灘上在米奈希爾以西南攜帶錠。",
	["The Boulderfist Brutes camp outside the ogres' hall south of Hammerfall; the Magus stand among them. Pull them one at a time."] = "石拳蠻兵營地在食人魔外的大廳在落錘鎮以南；魔導師位於其中：它們。拉怪它們1在一個時間。",
	["The Brill trainers are in and around the inn"] = "布瑞爾訓練師是在與在旅店周圍",
	["The Bristleback quilboar camps spread over the plains north of Camp Taurajo, either side of the Gold Road. Every Bristleback drops a tusk and the Razormane Raiders among them carry Olgra's Adornments; Mankrik's wife lies at the north edge. Keep one Blood Shard. Lakota'mani, a grey kodo, sometimes wanders here: his hoof starts a quest."] = "刺背野豬人紮營分布越過平原在陶拉祖營地以北，任一一側的金幣道路。每個刺背掉落一個長牙與鋼鬃狼騎兵波爾克在其中：它們攜帶奧格拉的飾物；曼科里克的妻子位於北邊緣。保留1血岩碎片。拉克塔曼尼，一個灰色科多獸，有時遊蕩此處：他的蹄始於一個任務。",
	["The Bubbling Cauldron beside Kin'weelay"] = "冒泡的大鍋在肯維雷旁邊",
	["The Burning Blade Stash stands in Skull Rock, among the cultists you just fought."] = "火刃營地位於骷髏石，在其中：邪教徒你就在戰鬥。",
	["The Burning Blade hold the fortress north-west of Kormek's Hut. Use the Demon Pick on the Demon Spirit in the fortress to get the Demon Box."] = "火刃要塞要塞在考米克小屋以西北。使用惡魔之鋤在惡魔靈魂在要塞前往獲取惡魔之盒。",
	["The Captured Mountaineer, in the town hall basement"] = "被俘虜的巡山人，在市政廳內地下室",
	["The Captured Scarlet Zealot, in the town hall basement"] = "血色十字軍俘虜，在市政廳內地下室",
	["The Centipaar silithid crawl around the Noxious Lair in western Tanaris, just east of the crater ramp. The Workers are the easiest pulls."] = "森提帕爾異種蟲爬行周圍劇毒之巢在西部塔納利斯，就在環形山坡道以東。迪菲亞工人是最容易的拉怪。",
	["The Circle of Imprisonment stands in the satyr camp of Satyrnaar, further east along the road."] = "禁錮法陣位於薩特營地的薩提納爾，更遠處東沿著道路。",
	["The Cleft of Shadow is the canyon under the Valley of Strength."] = "暗影裂口是峽谷在下方力量谷。",
	["The Cleft of Shadow is the canyon under the Valley of Strength; Neeru Fireblade stands at its far end."] = "暗影裂口是峽谷在下方力量谷；尼爾魯·火刃位於它的遠處盡頭。",
	["The Cold Eye Basilisks lie on the rocks west of the mine."] = "冷眼蜥蜴位於岩石在採礦以西。",
	["The Collector's Ring: Morgan the Collector"] = "收貨人的戒指：收貨人莫根",
	["The Control Console stands at the Venture Co. research site west of the Sludge Fen. Close the three valves around the drill, use the console again, then take the Console Key from Tinkerer Sniggles beside it."] = "控制台位於風險投資公司研究地點西的淤泥沼澤。關閉3閥門在演習周圍，使用控制台再次，然後接取控制台鑰匙來自工匠斯尼格斯旁邊它。",
	["The Corpse Laden Boat lies at the ferry landing on the lake shore east of the Sepulcher."] = "裝滿屍體的船位於渡口陸地在湖岸邊東的瑟伯切爾。",
	["The Crazed and Withered Ancients north of the moonwell carry the Wooden Key; the worn chest it opens stands among them."] = "瘋狂的梟獸與乾枯的古樹在月亮井攜帶以北木制鑰匙；穿戴的箱子它開啓位於其中：它們。",
	["The Crossroads is your base for this guide. Everyone you need stands within a few steps of the inn."] = "十字路口是你的基地給此指南。所有人你需要位於內部一個少量台階的旅店。",
	["The Crushridge ogres hold the hills north of Strahnbrad. Farther north, a worn wooden chest holds the Ensorcelled Parchment; Nagaz of the Dark Council stands right by it."] = "碎鰭食人魔要塞丘陵在斯坦恩布萊德以北。更遠處北，一個穿戴的木制箱子持有附有魔法的羊皮紙；納伽茲的黑暗議會位於右側在旁它。",
	["The Cult of the Damned holds the farm just south-east of the camp. The Necrotic Crystal Fragments lie on the ground among the cultists, and the cultists carry some too."] = "詛咒神教持有農場就在營地以東南。通靈水晶碎片位於領地在其中：邪教徒，與邪教徒攜帶一些也。",
	["The Cursed and Tainted Oozes slide about the streams and fel pools around Jaedenar and Bloodvenom Falls: kill them and use Laris's Empty Ooze Jars on their remains."] = "被詛咒的水兵與被污染的軟泥怪滑下約溪流與邪能水池在加德納爾周圍與血毒瀑布：擊殺它們與使用拉里斯·空輪的空軟泥怪瓶在它們的遺骸。",
	["The Dalaran Spellscribe, a rare spawn among the mages at Ambermill in southern Silverpine Forest, drops it about 17% of the time in our data; the other Dalaran mages at Ambermill and around the Dalaran crater drop it at about 0.2%. Kill the mages until the Spellscribe appears. Alliance players buy it on the Auction House."] = "達拉然銘文師，一個稀有刷新在其中：法師在安伯米爾在南部銀松森林，掉落它約17%的時間在我們的數據；其他達拉然法師在安伯米爾與周圍達拉然環形山掉落它在約0.2%。擊殺法師直到符文師出現。聯盟玩家購買它在拍賣行。",
	["The Dangerous! poster: its targets come up along the way"] = "危險！通緝令：它的目標來到上沿途",
	["The Dark Iron Lookouts stand on the ridges around the sentry towers south of the Cauldron; about one in ten carries the Lookout's Spyglass."] = "黑鐵斥候位於山脊在哨兵哨塔周圍在大鍋以南；約1在10攜帶偵查員的望遠鏡。",
	["The Dark Iron Steamsmiths work the furnaces in the middle of the Cauldron; half of them carry a Thorium Plated Dagger, one in ten the Smithing Tuyere. Slaves, Slavers and Taskmasters carry daggers too."] = "黑鐵鍛造師有效熔爐在大鍋的中央；一半的它們攜帶一個瑟銀匕首，1在10冶煉鼓風機。挖掘場奴隸，奴隸主與監工攜帶匕首也。",
	["The Dark Runners prowl the woods south of the road, west of Darkshire."] = "深色奔行者遊蕩樹林在道路以南，在夜色鎮以西。",
	["The Darkmist spiders nest around the cavern in the north-west of the marsh; every spider drops eyes."] = "黑霧蜘蛛巢在洞窟在周圍在沼澤以西北；每個蜘蛛掉落眼睛。",
	["The Darkmist spiders swarm the cavern mouth north-west of Brackenwall; every kind drops eyes."] = "黑霧蜘蛛蟲群洞窟入口/河口在蕨牆村以西北；每個種類掉落眼睛。",
	["The Deadmines"] = "死亡礦井",
	["The Deadmines is a group of five under Moonbrook; the instance portal is inside the Moonbrook mine. Cookie, the murloc cook near the ship at the end, drops the Siamese about 15% of the time in our data."] = "死亡礦井是一個隊伍的5在下方月溪鎮；副本傳送門是內部月溪鎮採礦。曲奇，魚人烹飪在船在盡頭附近，掉落暹羅貓約15%的時間在我們的數據。",
	["The Deadmines is a group of five under Moonbrook; the instance portal is inside the Moonbrook mine. The Defias Pirates on and around the ship drop the macaw about 3.5% of the time in our data."] = "死亡礦井是一個隊伍的5在下方月溪鎮；副本傳送門是內部月溪鎮採礦。迪菲亞海盜在與在船掉落金剛鸚鵡約周圍3.5%的時間在我們的數據。",
	["The Deadwood cauldron in Felwood: keep it"] = "死木大鍋在費伍德森林：請保留該任務/物品",
	["The Deadwood furbolg village just west of the tunnel. Chieftain Bloodmaw (56) stands among them. Meilosh, a friendly furbolg, sits at the north end of the village."] = "死木熊怪村莊就在隧道以西。血喉酋長（56）位於其中：它們。梅羅什，一個友善熊怪，位於村莊的北端。",
	["The Deadwood furbolg village lies just south of the Sanctuary. Every Deadwood kill also raises your Timbermaw Hold reputation; keep the headdress feathers."] = "死木熊怪村莊位於就在聖地以南。每個死木擊殺也提升你的木喉要塞聲望；保留頭飾羽毛。",
	["The Deadwood furbolgs live in the village just south-west of Grazle; keep the Deadwood Headdress Feathers they drop."] = "死木熊怪實測在村子里就在格拉茲以西南；保留死木頭飾羽毛它們掉落。",
	["The Deadwood furbolgs of Felpaw Village fill the hills west of the cave. The Avengers can drop a Deadwood Ritual Totem."] = "死木熊怪的魔爪村裝滿丘陵在洞穴以西。復仇者可以掉落一個死木儀祭圖騰。",
	["The Deathknell trainers stand around the church"] = "喪鐘鎮訓練師位於教堂周圍",
	["The Defias camp lies in the south-west of Duskwood, south of Raven Hill near the Westfall border. The strongbox stands among the tents."] = "迪菲亞營地位於暮色森林以西南，在烏鴉嶺以南附近西部荒野邊界。保險箱位於其中：帳篷。",
	["The Defilers fight for Arathi Basin from Hammerfall. Their reputation comes from the battleground: the resources your team gathers pay it to everyone, so holding more bases for longer pays more. Queue at any battlemaster. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "污染者迎戰給阿拉希盆地來自落錘鎮。它們的聲望來自戰場：資源你的隊伍採集獎勵它前往所有人，因此持有更多基地給更長獎勵更多。排隊在任意戰場軍官。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["The Doom Weed grows in the graveyard fields just north of Brill."] = "末日草生長在墓地農田就在布瑞爾以北。",
	["The Dragonmaw camp lies south of the road, just west of the Green Belt: Raiders, Swamprunners and Bonewarders. Pilot Longbeard's quest in Dun Morogh needs level 28."] = "龍喉營地位於道路以南，就在西的綠帶草地：狼騎兵波爾克，沼澤奔行者與白骨守衛。飛行員比羅·長須的任務在丹莫羅需要28級。",
	["The Dragonmaw orcs camp east of the excavation site. Raiders and Swamprunners carry the war banners."] = "龍喉獸人營地在挖掘場地點以東。狼騎兵波爾克與沼澤奔行者攜帶戰爭旗幟。",
	["The Dreaming Whelps (level 35) in western Swamp of Sorrows drop it about once in 1,250 kills in our data."] = "夢遊雛龍（35級）在西部悲傷沼澤掉落它約一次在1,250擊殺在我們的數據。",
	["The Dry Branches lie on the ground around the south-west edge of Brill."] = "乾枯的樹枝位於領地在南周圍-西邊緣的布瑞爾。",
	["The Drywhisker kobolds dig in the gorge east of Hammerfall (Horde); skirt the town to the north. They drop both the motes and Krazek's ore."] = "枯須狗頭人挖掘在峽谷在落錘鎮以東（部落）；繞過城鎮向北。它們掉落兩個微粒與克拉茲克的礦石。",
	["The Dun Algaz pass in south-eastern Wetlands leads down into Loch Modan by Algaz Station."] = "丹奧加茲穿過在南-東部濕地通往下進入洛克莫丹在旁奧加茲崗哨。",
	["The Dustbelcher ogres camp just south of the valley; any of them drops scrap. Buzzards circle the plain to the east."] = "塵嗝食人魔營地就在山谷以南；任意的它們掉落廢料。禿鷲法陣平原向東。",
	["The Dustwind harpies nest in Drygulch Ravine to the north; the storm witches drop the Dull Storm Orb."] = "塵風鷹身人巢在枯水谷向北；風暴女巫掉落黯淡的風暴寶珠。",
	["The Egg-O-Matic machine"] = "自動驗蛋器機器",
	["The Eggs of Onyxia lie in the dragon caves in the Wyrmbog's south-east, guarded by the scalebanes; smash five."] = "蛋的奧妮克希亞位於龍洞穴在巨龍沼澤的東南，有守衛的在旁鱗災；砸碎5。",
	["The Elder Crag Coyotes and Giant Buzzards roam the basin south of the Dustbowl. Coyotes drop both the jawbones and the fangs; only the buzzards drop wings and gizzards."] = "老峭壁山狗與巨型禿鷲遊蕩於盆地南的塵風盆地。山狗掉落兩個下頜骨與獠牙；僅禿鷲掉落翅膀與砂囊。",
	["The Elder Stranglethorn Tigers (34-35) roam the hills south-west of the camp; the Lashtail Raptors (35-36) hunt further south, towards Grom'gol."] = "老年荊棘谷猛虎（34-35）遊蕩於丘陵在營地以西南；鞭尾迅猛龍（35-36）狩獵更遠處南，朝格羅姆高方向。",
	["The Equipment Boxes lie beside the ruined houses in the north of Deathknell."] = "裝備箱位於毀壞的房屋在旁邊在喪鐘鎮以北。",
	["The Field of Honor PvP season has weekly journey quests; finishing the ones for weeks 4, 7 and 10 is a point each. These quests are new in Forever and not in our data, so tick each one off yourself."] = "奧斯萊特元帥的榮譽 PvP 季節有每周旅程任務；完成在給周4，7與10是一個點每個。這些任務是新在永恆服與暫未收錄於當前數據，因此勾選每個1偏離/關閉你自己。",
	["The Firegut ogres hold the great rock north of the Vigil, with the Brutes on its east side."] = "火腹食人魔要塞巨型岩石在崗哨以北，與蠻兵在它的東一側。",
	["The Fishing Traps sit along the west shore of the lake."] = "釣魚陷阱坐沿著西岸邊的湖。",
	["The Forever client lists it at 200g and level 60, and asks for no riding rank."] = "永恆服客戶端列出它在200金與60級，與需要無騎行等級。",
	["The Forsaken's camp lies in the woods south of Forest Song."] = "被遺忘者的營地位於樹林在林歌神殿以南。",
	["The Foulweald furbolgs hold the woods east of Mystral Lake, south of the road. Place Karang's Banner on the Foulweald Totem Mound and guard it: the furbolgs come to tear it down. Chief Murgut comes last; his totem drops in the basket."] = "邪惡林地熊怪要塞樹林在密斯特拉湖以東，在道路以南。放置卡拉恩的旗子在污林圖騰堆與守衛它：熊怪來到前往眼淚它下。穆戈特酋長來自最後；他的圖騰掉落在籃子。",
	["The Foulweald furbolgs live in the woods south of the road, south-east of Astranaar. The Den Watcher and the Ursas guard the den."] = "邪惡林地熊怪實測在樹林在道路以南，在阿斯特蘭納以東南。大獸穴守夜人道茨與木喉巨熊怪守衛獸穴。",
	["The Frostwolf Clan holds Frostwolf Keep in the south of Alterac Valley. Destroying towers, taking graveyards and mines, and killing captains and generals all pay reputation to the whole team. Loot Armor Scraps from fallen enemies for Smith Regzar. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "霜狼氏族持有霜狼保留在奧特蘭克山谷以南。摧毀哨塔，接取墓地與礦洞，與擊殺隊長與將軍全部獎勵聲望前往整個隊伍。拾取護甲碎片來自陣亡的敵人給鐵匠雷格薩。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["The Gaea Seeds lie in the grass around the southern shore of Mirkfallon Lake, north of Sun Rock."] = "蓋亞種子位於草在南部岸邊的周圍暗色湖，在烈日石居以北。",
	["The Galak camps fill the canyon north of Freewind; Scouts, Wranglers and Windchasers share every camp. A lone Galak Messenger walks between the camps: kill him when you meet him, his note starts a quest for Whitereach Post."] = "加拉克紮營裝滿峽谷在亂風崗以北；斥候，牧馬人與追風者共享每個營地。一個單獨的加拉克信使步行之間紮營：擊殺他當你會合他，他的說明始於一個任務給白沙崗哨。",
	["The Galak centaurs camp on the plains north of the Rolling Plains; Herak leads them. Prairie Wolf Alphas roam among the wolves."] = "加拉克半人馬營地在平原北的滾岩平原；赫拉克通往它們。草原狼前鋒遊蕩在其中：狼。",
	["The Gizelton Caravan waits at Kormek's Hut."] = "基澤爾頓車隊等候於考米克小屋。",
	["The Great Cat Spirit (Night Elves) and the Avatar of Saeyleenan (Skyborne) wait in southern Moonglade. The three relics lie in the Stormrage Barrow Dens, east of them. Reports from the first weeks say a relic gives no loot while another player is looting it: wait a moment and try again."] = "巨貓之靈（暗夜精靈）與賽琳南的化身（天裔）等候於南部月光林地。3聖物位於怒風獸穴，在它們東面。報告來自第一周說一個聖物給予無拾取當另一個玩家是拾取它：等待一個片刻與嘗試再次。",
	["The Greater Lava Spiders roam the plateaus and lava pools in the south-west of the gorge."] = "大型熔岩蜘蛛遊蕩於高原與熔岩水池在峽谷以西南。",
	["The Greater Rock Elementals (42-44, well above you) wander the gulches in the south-west; the bracers drop about one kill in five. Pull one at a time and rest between fights, or leave them. Keep killing coyotes and buzzards you still need on the way."] = "大型岩石元素（42-44，水井上方你）遊蕩峽谷在西南面；護腕掉落約1擊殺在5。拉怪1在一個時間與其餘之間戰鬥，或可先放著不做。保留擊殺山狗與禿鷲你仍然需要在途中。",
	["The Greater Rock Elementals (level 42) walk the far south-west corner below Camp Boff; pull them one at a time. The Dustbelcher Wyrmhunters and Maulers at Camp Boff also drop scrap."] = "大型岩石元素（42級）步行遠處西南角落在博夫營地下方；拉怪它們1在一個時間。火煙獵龍者與科卡爾虐待者在博夫營地也掉落廢料。",
	["The Grimtotem tauren camp beside the sprite darters' grove; raiders, naturalists and shamans all carry horns."] = "恐怖圖騰牛頭人營地在林精精靈龍旁邊的樹林；劫掠者，博物學家與薩滿祭司全部攜帶角。",
	["The Grizzled Den is the wendigo cave south-west of Kharanos. Flintfire's shipments lie on the cave floor."] = "灰色洞穴是溫迪戈洞穴在卡拉諾斯以西南。托格努斯·燧火的貨物位於洞穴樓層。",
	["The Grom'gol zeppelin leaves from the tower just north-east of Orgrimmar's main gate."] = "格羅姆高飛艇離開來自哨塔就在奧格瑞瑪的以東北主大門。",
	["The Hatefury Shadowstalkers at Sargeron walk unseen until they strike; about one in three carries a scalp."] = "怨怒巡影者在薩格隆步行隱形的直到它們打擊；約1在3攜帶一個頭皮。",
	["The Hatefury satyrs hold the ruins of Sargeron, east of Nijel's Point."] = "恨怒薩特要塞廢墟的薩格隆，在尼耶爾前哨站以東。",
	["The Highborne ghosts haunt the ruins around the shrine; the Haldarr satyrs hold the camp just north of it."] = "上層精靈幽靈出沒廢墟在神龕周圍；哈達爾薩特要塞營地就在它北面。",
	["The Highborne ghosts haunt the ruins just north of the shrine; the Haldarr satyrs camp a little further north."] = "上層精靈幽靈出沒廢墟就在神龕以北；哈達爾薩特營地一個小更遠處北。",
	["The Highlands Bandits camp north-east of the village. \"Badwind\" Bennic waits at the far north end of their camp."] = "高地強盜營地在村莊以東北。“惡風”本尼克等候於遠處北盡頭的它們的營地。",
	["The Highvale elves camp around Quel'Danil Lodge. Burn the records, the notes and the report in their camps. Rin'ji is held inside the lodge: lead him out and fight off the ambush on the way."] = "高谷精靈營地在奎爾丹尼小屋周圍。燒毀記錄，說明與報告在它們的紮營。林吉是持有在旅捨內：引導他出與迎戰偏離/關閉伏擊在途中。",
	["The Horde airship docks at the south-west edge of Valanaar. Ride it to Kalimdor; it lands in northern Mulgore."] = "部落飛艇碼頭在西南邊緣的瓦拉納爾。騎行它前往卡利姆多；它之地在北部莫高雷。",
	["The Horde camp is just outside the Crossroads. Loot supply crates in the world, fill them and hand them in at the camp for Merchant's Favor; the treat costs 1,500. (Another Gishah stands in the Undercity; this is the one at the camp.)"] = "部落營地是就在外部十字路口。拾取補給木箱在世界，裝滿它們與上交它們在營地給商人的青睞；點心花費1,500。（另一個吉莎位於幽暗城；此是1在營地.）",
	["The Horde camp just north of Jaedenar."] = "部落營地就在加德納爾以北。",
	["The Iridescent Shards lie at the far end of the gorge."] = "虹光水晶裂片位於遠處盡頭的峽谷。",
	["The Jadefire satyrs hold the glen west of the road, with Xavathras at its back."] = "碧火薩特要塞幽谷在道路以西，與薩瓦瑟拉斯在它的返回。",
	["The Jungle Stalkers (40-41) hunt the coast south of Grom'gol. They are well above you: pull one at a time and rest between fights."] = "叢林潛伏者（40-41）狩獵海岸在格羅姆高以南。它們是水井上方你：拉怪1在一個時間與其餘之間戰鬥。",
	["The Kolkar camps spread north-west of Regthar; every Kolkar can drop Centaur Bracers. The Forgotten Pools lie in their middle, with Laden Mushrooms around the water. Savannah Prowlers roam the same plains."] = "科爾卡營地分布在雷戈薩·死門以西北；每個科卡爾可以掉落半人馬護腕。遺忘之池位於它們的中間，與滿載的蘑菇在水周圍。草原徘徊者遊蕩於相同平原。",
	["The Kolkar roam the plains around Kolkar Village; their ears are for Corporal Melkins."] = "科卡爾遊蕩於平原在科爾卡村周圍；它們的耳朵是給麥爾金斯下士。",
	["The Kurzen rebels hold the camp east of the Rebel Camp; work its outer edge, where Jungle Fighters and Medicine Men stand, and loot the supply crates by the tents."] = "庫爾森叛軍要塞營地東的反抗軍營地；有效它的外側邊緣，在叢林戰士與巫醫人位於，與拾取補給木箱在旁帳篷。",
	["The Land Walkers and Cliff Giants roam the hills north of the dock. Zap each one with Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker first: shrunken, they are no longer elite. Every zapped giant drops residue; use the Muisek Vessel on its body too."] = "大地行者與峭壁巨人遊蕩於丘陵在碼頭以北。電擊每個1與索爾賓的超級壓縮器第一：縮小的，它們是無更長精英。每個被電擊的巨型掉落殘留物；使用穆塞克容器在它的屍體也。",
	["The Lar'korwi Mates prowl the jungle north-west of Torwa."] = "拉克維的配偶遊蕩叢林在托爾瓦以西北。",
	["The Lar'korwi Mates prowl the jungle west of Torwa. The wrecked raft lies on the shore of the lake there; the small pack sits in the water beside it. Keep the compass, map and key for Linken. Any beast in the crater may drop A Mangled Journal: right-click it."] = "拉克維的配偶遊蕩叢林在托爾瓦以西。失事的木筏位於湖那裡的岸上；小型包位於水旁邊它。保留羅盤，地圖與鑰匙給林克。任意野獸在環形山可能掉落被撕破的日記：右鍵點擊它。",
	["The Large Termite Mounds stand all over the hills east of Terrordale. Use the Empty Termite Jar on each mound you pass."] = "大型白蟻土堆位於全部越過丘陵在恐懼谷以東。使用空的白蟻瓶在每個土堆你穿過。",
	["The Lashtail Raptors (35-36) hunt the jungle just north-east of Grom'gol."] = "鞭尾迅猛龍（35-36）狩獵叢林就在格羅姆高以東北。",
	["The League of Arathor fights for Arathi Basin from Refuge Pointe. Their reputation comes from the battleground: the resources your team gathers pay it to everyone, so holding more bases for longer pays more. Queue at any battlemaster. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "阿拉索聯軍戰鬥給阿拉希盆地來自避難谷地。它們的聲望來自戰場：資源你的隊伍採集獎勵它前往所有人，因此持有更多基地給更長獎勵更多。排隊在任意戰場軍官。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["The Lesser Rock Elementals wander the Dustbowl west of Lotwil."] = "次級岩石元素遊蕩塵風盆地在洛特維爾以西。",
	["The Ley Line"] = "魔網能量線",
	["The Lord Valthalak questline is a point. It is the level 60 dungeon-set chain: Deliana (Ironforge) or Mokvar (Orgrimmar) send you through In Search of Anthion and Anthion's Parting Words to Bodley at Blackrock Mountain, whose Three Kings of Flame, the Left and Right Pieces of Lord Valthalak's Amulet, Final Preparations and Mea Culpa, Lord Valthalak end with Return to Bodley. Back to the Beginning then leads to the class Saving the Best for Last quests."] = "瓦塔拉克公爵任務線是一個點。它是60級地下城-設置任務鏈：德莉亞娜（鐵爐堡）或莫克瓦爾（奧格瑞瑪）派往你穿過尋找安泰恩與告別安泰恩前往伯德雷在黑石山，其烈焰之王，左側與右側碎片的瓦塔拉克飾品，最後的準備與瓦塔拉克公爵盡頭與向伯德雷回復。回到起點然後通往職業把最好的留到最後任務。",
	["The Marsh Murlocs live on the strand south of the post; the Inkspewers are along the shore east of it and the Flesheaters further west, around the huts on the western shore."] = "沼澤魚人實測在海灘在崗哨以南；噴墨者是沿著岸邊在它東面與食肉者更遠處西，在小屋在西部岸邊周圍。",
	["The Mirefin murlocs crowd the coast east and north-east of Witch Hill; every kind drops heads."] = "泥鰭魚人怪群海岸東與在女巫嶺以東北；每個種類掉落頭顱。",
	["The Mirefin murlocs crowd the north coast past Swamplight Manor; finish the tongues on the tortoises beside them."] = "泥鰭魚人怪群北海岸經過水光莊園；完成舌頭在陸龜旁邊它們。",
	["The Moldy Tome lies on the shore a little further west, past the murloc camps."] = "發霉的書籍位於岸邊一個小更遠處西，經過魚人紮營。",
	["The Molten Core materials carry the rest: Fiery Cores drop from Firewalkers, Flameguards and Firelords, and Lava Cores from Lava Elementals, Lava Reavers and Molten Destroyers there. Blood of the Mountain comes from Molten Destroyers and rarely elsewhere."] = "熔火之心材料攜帶其餘：熾熱之核掉落來自火焰行者，烈焰守衛與火焰之王，與熔岩之核來自熔岩元素，熔岩掠奪者與熔核摧毀者那裡。山脈之血來自熔核摧毀者與極少別處。",
	["The Monstrous Crawlers walk the beaches of the east coast, few and far between: kill every one you see on the way south."] = "巨型爬行者步行海灘的東海岸，少量與遠處之間：擊殺每個1你查看在途中南。",
	["The Mosh'Ogg ogres camp in the hills just east of Grom'gol. Kill one Brute and one Witch Doctor (36-37); pull them one at a time."] = "莫什奧格食人魔紮營於丘陵就在格羅姆高以東。擊殺1蠻兵與1女巫醫生（36-37）；拉怪它們1在一個時間。",
	["The Mound of Dirt is just behind the Undercroft."] = "一堆泥土是就在後面地下墓穴。",
	["The Mudrock Tortoises and Spikeshells sun themselves on the shore north-east of the manor."] = "泥石海龜與刺殼龜太陽它們自己在岸邊在莊園以東北。",
	["The Northspring harpies nest on the ridges in the far north-west. They are 48-50, a few levels above you: the Windcallers heal, so kill them first and pull one at a time."] = "北泉鷹身女妖巢在山脊在遠處西北。它們是48-50，一個少量等級上方你：尖嘯的喚風者治療，因此擊殺它們第一與拉怪1在一個時間。",
	["The Novice Seers practise in the clearing west of Shen'dar."] = "學徒塞萬德先知練習在空地在辛達爾以西。",
	["The Orgrimmar zeppelin leaves from the tower beside Grom'gol; it lands just outside Orgrimmar's main gate."] = "奧格瑞瑪飛艇離開來自哨塔在格羅姆高旁邊；它之地就在奧格瑞瑪的外主大門。",
	["The Palemane gnolls hold Palemane Rock, south of the digsite and west of Bloodhoof. Perith Stormhoof is held in their camp: lead him out."] = "蒼鬃豺狼人要塞白鬃石，在挖掘場與西的以南血蹄。佩里斯·風暴之蹄是持有在它們的營地：引導他出。",
	["The Peasants work the fields south of the farmhouses. Every Hillsbrad human drops skulls; the Peasants drop them most often."] = "農民有效農田在農舍以南。每個希爾斯布萊德人類掉落頭顱；農民掉落它們大多數經常。",
	["The Plague Spreaders walk the northern half of the Raven Hill Cemetery. Mor'Ladim, an elite, wanders the graves: keep away from him."] = "瘟疫傳播者步行北部一半的烏鴉嶺墓地。摩拉迪姆，一個精英，遊蕩墳墓：保留離開來自他。",
	["The Rabid Shardtooth bears roam the snowy valley south of Owl Wing Thicket."] = "瘋狂的碎齒熊熊遊蕩於雪地山谷在梟翼樹叢以南。",
	["The Raptor Grounds lie south-west of the oasis. Sunscale Scytheclaws drop the feathers you use on the three nests."] = "迅猛龍巢穴位於綠洲以西南。赤鱗鐮爪龍掉落羽毛你使用在3巢。",
	["The Rattlecage Skeletons in the ruined houses drop the skulls."] = "斷骨骷髏在毀壞的房屋掉落頭顱。",
	["The Raw Windstones are blue crystals on the slopes around the village."] = "原始風石是藍色水晶在山坡在村莊周圍。",
	["The Raw Windstones glitter on the ground just south of the grove. The Cirrusfly Queen hovers over the meadow further east, on the way to Yala."] = "原始風石閃光在領地就在樹林以南。捲雲蠅女王盤旋越過草地更遠處東，在途中前往雅拉·觀風者。",
	["The Red, Crimson and Flamesnorting Whelps (levels 23-26) in the eastern Wetlands drop it about once in 600-1,600 kills in our data."] = "紅色，深紅與噴火雛龍（23-26級）在東部濕地掉落它約一次在600-1,600擊殺在我們的數據。",
	["The Riverglades lie east of the Badlands and the Burning Steppes: the way in is the fork east off the Redridge Mountains road (a ship also runs from Tanaris to Powderfuse Port, the neutral goblin port on its coast). Krol'dok Stronghold is an ogre clan's outdoor dungeon."] = "河間林地位於東的荒蕪之地與燃燒平原：路在是岔路口東偏離/關閉赤脊山道路（一個船也通往來自塔納利斯前往引線港，中立地精港口在它的海岸）。克羅多克要塞是一個食人魔氏族的戶外地下城。",
	["The Rock Elementals roam south-east of Lotwil; Giant Buzzards and Elder Crag Coyotes share the plain to their west."] = "磐石元素遊蕩在洛特維爾以東南；巨型禿鷲與老峭壁山狗共享平原前往它們的西。",
	["The Rot Hide Graverobbers dig through the graveyards north of Brill; all the Rot Hides drop the ichor."] = "腐皮盜墓賊挖掘穿過墓地在布瑞爾以北；全部腐爛藏身掉落膿液。",
	["The Rot Hide Mongrels hold the hills further north. Maggot Eye (level 11) stands in their camp on the hill south of the shore: clear the gnolls around him first."] = "混血腐皮豺狼人要塞丘陵更遠處北。蛆眼（11級）位於它們的營地在山丘在岸邊以南：清理豺狼人周圍他第一。",
	["The Salty Sailor Tavern is the tall building over the harbour; most of the quest givers are on its floors or the docks below."] = "咸水海員旅店是高大建築越過港口；大多數的任務發佈者是在它的樓層或碼頭下方。",
	["The Sapphires grow on the rocks at the far north end of the strand, by the Blackfathom Deeps ruins."] = "藍寶石生長在岩石在遠處北盡頭的海灘，在旁黑暗深淵廢墟。",
	["The Savannah Prowlers hunt the plains between town and the Razormane camp to the east. In the camp, Water Seekers and Thornweavers hold the western half, Hunters the middle; the supply crates sit at its eastern end."] = "草原徘徊者狩獵平原之間城鎮與刺鬃營地向東。在營地裡，水搜尋者迪亞索魯斯與織棘者要塞西部一半，獵人中間；補給木箱坐在它的東部盡頭。",
	["The Scalding Whelps nest in the ravine east of Garek; leave the Scorched Guardians (elite) alone. The Black Drake's Heart drops rarely: take it if it comes while you grind."] = "滾燙的雛龍巢在深谷在加瑞克以東；跳過烈焰守護者（精英）獨自。黑色幼龍之心掉落極少：接取它如果它來自當你刷怪。",
	["The Scarlet Converts and Initiates hold the farm east of Deathknell. Samuel Fipps wanders between the farmhouses: his remains are for Marla's Last Wish."] = "血色信徒與新兵要塞農場在喪鐘鎮以東。塞繆爾·菲普斯遊蕩之間農舍：他的遺骸是給瑪拉的遺願。",
	["The Scarlet Crusade's tents stand between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears. Torch the command tent with the Box of Incendiaries and plant the Scourge banner."] = "血色十字軍的帳篷位於費爾斯通農場與達爾松之淚之間。火炬指揮帳篷與燃燒彈箱與植物天災軍團旗幟。",
	["The Scarlet Friars camp just north-east of the graves; Captain Vachon stands among them."] = "血色苦行修士營地就在墳墓以東北；瓦松隊長位於其中：它們。",
	["The Scarlet Medics, Hunters, Knights and Mages patrol the lumber camp and the road toward Hearthglen."] = "血色醫護員，獵人，騎士與法師巡邏於伐木場營地與道路朝壁爐谷方向。",
	["The Scorpashi scorpids hunt the hills around Kormek's Hut on the road south."] = "斯科帕什蠍子狩獵丘陵在考米克小屋周圍在路上南。",
	["The Scourge around Corin's Crossing, west of the chapel, drop both kinds of Scourgestone; Darrowshire Spirits rise from them: talk to each one to free it."] = "天災軍團在考林路口周圍，在禮拜堂以西，掉落兩個種類的天災石；達羅郡的幽靈高地來自它們：對話前往每個1前往解救它。",
	["The Scrying Bowl"] = "占卜之碗",
	["The Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays wash along the shore around the dock."] = "海元素與巨型海元素衝上沿著岸邊在碼頭周圍。",
	["The Searing Whelps of the Wyrmbog in southern Dustwallow Marsh (level 42) and the Scalding Whelps of eastern Badlands (level 41) drop it about once in 900 kills in our data. The waypoint is the Wyrmbog; the Badlands whelps are the same grind."] = "灼熱雛龍的巨龍沼澤在南部塵泥沼澤（42級）與滾燙的雛龍的東部荒蕪之地（41級）掉落它約一次在900擊殺在我們的數據。路徑點是巨龍沼澤；荒蕪之地雛龍是相同刷怪。",
	["The Seer stands on the south side of Thunder Axe Fortress, east of Ethel Rethor. Clear the cultists around it first."] = "先知位於雷斧堡壘的南側，在艾瑟雷索以東。清理邪教徒周圍它第一。",
	["The Sepulcher is the Forsaken crypt-town in the middle of the forest. Everyone you need stands around the crypt entrance; Karos Razok, the bat handler, is just east of it."] = "瑟伯切爾是被遺忘者地穴-城鎮在森林的中央。所有人你需要位於地穴入口周圍；卡洛斯·拉佐克，蝙蝠管理員，是就在它東面。",
	["The Sewer Beast is a rare level 50 crocolisk that swims Stormwind's canals; early kill counts give about 1.5% per kill. It is friendly to nobody: Horde players can farm it too, but they are in an enemy capital."] = "下水道野獸是一個稀有50級鰐魚該游動暴風城的運河；早期擊殺計入交給約1.5%每擊殺。它是友善前往無人：部落玩家可以農場它也，但它們是在一個敵人主城。",
	["The Shadethicket Oracle walks the shore of Fallen Sky Lake, south-west of the chests."] = "沼澤獸智者步行岸邊的墜星湖，在箱子以西南。",
	["The Shadowforge dwarves camp just north of the digsite; the crumpled map lies among their tents. Tunnelers and Darkweavers carry Ryedol's pick. Crag Coyotes roam the slopes around it."] = "暗爐戰士矮人營地就在挖掘場以北；揉皺的地圖位於其中：它們的帳篷。暗爐隧道工與暗織者攜帶勘察員雷杜爾的拾取。峭壁山狗遊蕩於山坡周圍它。",
	["The Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) stalk the jungle east of the Mosh'Ogg hills and north-east towards the lake; they strike from stealth. Loot every Green Hills page you find on the way."] = "深喉獵豹（37-38）潛伏叢林東的莫什奧格丘陵與東北朝湖方向；它們打擊來自潛行。拾取每個荊棘谷的青山書頁你尋找在途中。",
	["The Shrine of Akir is north of Valanaar. Fight through the guards up to Hyusaa Quickbreeze at its east side."] = "阿基爾神殿是在瓦拉納爾以北。迎戰穿過衛兵上前往休薩·疾風在它的東一側。",
	["The Sickly and Haggard Refugees shamble along the road south of Pyrewood toward the Greymane Wall."] = "病態的與哈迦德難民蹣跚遊蕩沿著道路在焚木村以南朝向格雷邁恩之牆。",
	["The Silvermane Stalkers, Savage Owlbeasts and Razorbeak Skylords share the hills between the temples and Skulk Rock. Use the Wildkin Muisek Vessel on the owlbeasts you kill. The Skylords also drop Long Elegant Feathers: keep ten for Otho's second message."] = "銀鬃捕獵者，野蠻的梟獸與翱翔的鋒喙獅鷲共享丘陵在神廟與隱匿石之間。使用梟獸靈魂精華容器在梟獸你擊殺。天空領主也掉落細長的獅鷲羽毛：保留10給奧索·莫吉克的第二口信。",
	["The Silverwing Sentinels are the Night Elves holding Warsong Gulch. Their reputation comes from the battleground: every enemy flag your team captures pays it to the whole team. Queue at any battlemaster. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "銀翼哨兵是暗夜精靈持有戰歌峽谷。它們的聲望來自戰場：每個敵人旗幟你的隊伍佔領獎勵它前往整個隊伍。排隊在任意戰場軍官。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["The Skullsplitter trolls hold the ruins east of the road between Nesingwary and Grom'gol."] = "碎顱巨魔要塞廢墟在道路之間以東赫米特·奈辛瓦里二世與格羅姆高。",
	["The Skullsplitter trolls hold the ruins just east of the mine; any of them can drop tusks, their panthers always do."] = "碎顱巨魔要塞廢墟就在採礦以東；任意的它們可以掉落長牙，它們的豹總是做。",
	["The Slag Pit opens in the north of the Cauldron. Incendosaurs swim in its lava pools: pull them to the edge. The secret plans lie on the pit's upper ledge."] = "熔渣之池開啓在大鍋以北。熏火龍游泳在它的熔岩水池：拉怪它們前往邊緣。秘密的圖紙位於深坑的上層岩架。",
	["The Slag Pit opens in the north of the Cauldron. The Secret Plans lie on its upper ledge; Incendosaurs swim in the lava pools further in, so pull them to the edge. Stay clear of Overseer Maltorius and his elite guards deep inside."] = "熔渣之池開啓在大鍋以北。機密計劃位於它的上層岩架；熏火龍游泳在熔岩水池更遠處在，因此拉怪它們前往邊緣。留在清理的工頭瑪托留斯與他的精英衛兵深處內部。",
	["The Slaughtered Lamb is in the Mage Quarter."] = "已宰的羔羊是在法師區。",
	["The Slayers hold the western end of the Dry Hills, past the harpies you fought before; they drop the rings."] = "黑石殺戮者要塞西部盡頭的枯水谷，經過鷹身人你戰鬥之前；它們掉落戒指。",
	["The Slitherblade naga hold the coast north of Ethel Rethor, up to Sar'theris Strand. Lord Kragaru guards the Book of the Ancients at the far northern tip."] = "滑刃納迦要塞海岸在艾瑟雷索以北，上前往薩瑟里斯海岸。科拉加魯衛兵上古之書在遠處北部尖端。",
	["The Snapjaw turtles bask along the river east of Southshore, south of Tarren Mill (Horde)."] = "鉗嘴龜海龜曬太陽沿著河流在南海鎮以東，在塔倫米爾以南（部落）。",
	["The Spitelash naga of the Ruins of Eldarath carry Some Rune. Tymor's four runes stand among the ruins: use his Drawing Kit on each."] = "怨靈納迦的埃達拉斯廢墟攜帶一些符文。法師泰摩爾的4前往位於其中：廢墟：使用他的繪圖工具包在每個。",
	["The Stockade: the usual last kill; the Stockade has no fixed final boss"] = "監獄：通常的最後擊殺；監獄有無固定的最終首領",
	["The Stone Circle is in Ratchet"] = "石環是在棘齒城",
	["The Stonefield farm is west of the mine. Ma and \"Auntie\" Bernice stand by the house."] = "斯通菲爾德農場是在採礦以西。媽與 \"伯母\" 伯妮斯站在旁邊：房屋。",
	["The Stonetalon Mountains border Ashenvale to the south-west; Stonetalon Peak in the north is the Alliance flight point."] = "石爪山脈邊界灰谷向西南；石爪峰在北面是聯盟飛行點。",
	["The Stonevault troggs dig around the cave mouths south of the Valley of Fangs, on the way to Agmond's End; the Bonesnappers and Shamans drop the flakes."] = "石窖穴居人挖掘在洞穴嘴南的周圍巨牙谷，在途中前往埃格蒙德的營地；折骨者與薩滿祭司掉落薄片。",
	["The Stormpike Guard holds Dun Baldar in the north of Alterac Valley. Destroying towers, taking graveyards and mines, and killing captains and generals all pay reputation to the whole team. Loot Armor Scraps from fallen enemies for Murgot Deepforge. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "雷矛衛隊持有丹巴達爾在奧特蘭克山谷以北。摧毀哨塔，接取墓地與礦洞，與擊殺隊長與將軍全部獎勵聲望前往整個隊伍。拾取護甲碎片來自陣亡的敵人給莫高特·深爐。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["The Strange Hermit lives west of Elegael. The Zephyrseed Cones lie in the woods between his hut and Elegael."] = "奇怪的隱士住在艾蕾蓋爾·棘爪以西。微風之種松果位於樹林之間他的小屋與艾蕾蓋爾·棘爪。",
	["The Strange Lockbox lies at the north edge of the Sludge Fen, by the Venture Co. tower. It holds the Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility for Trial of the Sea Lion."] = "奇怪的保險箱位於北邊緣的淤泥沼澤，在旁風險投資公司哨塔。它持有水獸敏捷墜飾給海獅試煉。",
	["The Strange Lockbox lies on the coast west of the Dead Field. It holds the Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance for Trial of the Sea Lion."] = "奇怪的保險箱位於海岸邊西的死去的教徒奧斯萊特元帥。它持有水獸耐力墜飾給海獅試煉。",
	["The Strider Clutchmother is a rare level 20 tallstrider in southern Darkshore; early kill counts give about 0.6% per kill, so expect many respawns."] = "雌性森林陸行鳥是一個稀有20級高地陸行鳥在南部黑海岸；早期擊殺計入交給約0.6%每擊殺，因此預計許多刷新。",
	["The Summon Charger chain is long and needs Scholomance. After this hand-off, Lord Grayson sends you on Emphasis on Sacrifice (High Priest Rohan in Ironforge), To Show Due Judgment and Exorcising Terrordale (25 Terrordale Spirits), The Work of Grimand Elmore (Collection of Goods: 40 Runecloth, 6 Arcanite Bars, 10 Arthas' Tears, 5 Stratholme Holy Water), Ancient Equine Spirit (Manna-Enriched Horse Feed from Merideth Carlson in Southshore), The Divination Scryer (an Azerothian Diamond and a Pristine Black Diamond) and Judgment and Redemption, which ends with Darkreaver's Fallen Charger in Scholomance."] = "召喚戰馬任務鏈是長與需要通靈學院。之後此上交-偏離/關閉，領主格雷森·沙東布瑞克公爵派往你在犧牲精神（高階牧師洛漢在鐵爐堡），聖騎士的審判與恐懼谷的靈魂（25恐懼谷的靈魂），格瑞曼德·艾爾默（收集材料：40符文布，6奧金錠，10 Arthas的眼淚，5斯坦索姆聖水），上古聖馬之魂（魔法糧草來自梅麗德絲·卡爾森在南海鎮），預言水晶球（一個艾澤拉斯鑽石與一個原始黑鑽石）與審判和救贖，其中終結於達克雷爾的墮落戰馬在通靈學院。",
	["The Summon Dreadsteed chain is long and needs Dire Maul. After this hand-off: Rage of Blood (30 Raging Beast's Blood), Wildeyes, Lord Banehollow in Felwood, Ulathek the Traitor, Xorothian Stardust, Bell of Dethmoora (10 Elixir of Shadow Power), Wheel of the Black March (6 Large Brilliant Shards, 25 Dark Iron Ore), Doomsday Candle (35 Black Dragonscales), Arcanite (3 Arcanite Bars), Imp Delivery (J'eevee) and Dreadsteed of Xoroth, the ritual in Dire Maul."] = "召喚恐懼戰馬任務鏈是長與需要厄運之槌。之後此上交-偏離/關閉：血之狂暴（30狂暴野獸的血），戈瑟奇·邪眼，魔王貝恩霍勒在費伍德森林，背叛者烏拉泰克，克索諾斯星塵，達斯莫拉之鈴（10暗影之力藥劑），黑暗戰車之輪（6大塊魔光碎片，25黑鐵礦石），末日蠟燭（35黑龍鱗片），奧金錠（3奧金錠），瓶中的小鬼（耶維爾）與克索諾斯恐懼戰馬，儀式在厄運之槌。",
	["The Syndicate Footpads and Thieves (32-33) around the camps west of the road carry the missives; about one in three drops one."] = "辛迪加劫匪與盜賊（32-33）在紮營周圍在道路攜帶密信以西；約1在3掉落1。",
	["The Syndicate camp sits on the Alterac border in northern Hillsbrad, west of Tarren Mill (Horde); the documents lie in the camp."] = "辛迪加營地位於奧特蘭克邊界在北部希爾斯布萊德，在塔倫米爾以西（部落）；文件位於營地裡。",
	["The Syndicate hold the farm north-west of Refuge Pointe."] = "辛迪加要塞農場在避難谷地以西北。",
	["The Syndicate hold the walled manor and its farm in the north-west; their Highwaymen, Mercenaries and Pathstalkers carry the Bloodstone Amulets."] = "辛迪加要塞有圍牆的莊園與它的農場在西北面；它們的攔路強盜，恐怖圖騰傭兵與巡路者攜帶血石護符。",
	["The Talondeep Path tunnel in eastern Stonetalon leads north into Ashenvale. Splintertree Post and Zoram'gar Outpost are Horde; Astranaar is Alliance."] = "石爪小徑隧道在東部石爪山脈通往北進入灰谷。碎木崗哨與佐拉姆加前哨站是部落；阿斯特蘭納是聯盟。",
	["The Thunderhead Hippogryphs fly over the hills just south of Valormok."] = "雷首角鷹獸飛往越過丘陵就在瓦羅莫克以南。",
	["The Tool Buckets sit around the Venture Co. camp in the Sludge Fen, east of Wenikee."] = "工具桶坐周圍風險投資公司營地在淤泥沼澤，在維妮·布特巴克以東。",
	["The Torn Fin murlocs crowd the Western Strand, south-west of Southshore."] = "破鰭魚人怪群西部海灘，在南海鎮以西南。",
	["The Twilight Tome"] = "暮光密典",
	["The Twilight's Hammer dig fills the north-west corner: tablet fragments lie on the ground and the Dust Stormers and Desert Rumblers carry them too. Every cultist can drop an Encrypted Twilight Text: keep twenty, ten for Bor Wildmane and ten for Hermit Ortell later."] = "暮光之錘挖掘裝滿西北角落：石板碎片位於領地與塵暴者與沙漠奔騰者攜帶它們也。每個邪教徒可以掉落一個暮光密文信：保留20，10給鮑爾·蠻鬃與10給隱士奧泰爾稍後。",
	["The Undercity has no Hunter or Shaman trainer: take the Orgrimmar zeppelin from the same tower instead and train in the city, then take the Undercity zeppelin from the tower outside Orgrimmar's main gate."] = "幽暗城有無獵人或薩滿祭司訓練師：接取奧格瑞瑪飛艇來自相同哨塔代替與訓練在主城，然後接取幽暗城飛艇來自哨塔在奧格瑞瑪的外主大門。",
	["The Undercity is under the Ruins of Lordaeron, beside the zeppelin towers. Carendin Halgar is in the Magic Quarter: use the Runes of Summoning on the summoning circle beside him and defeat the voidwalker. Aelthalyste is in the War Quarter."] = "幽暗城是在下方洛丹倫廢墟，在飛艇哨塔旁邊。凱倫丁·哈加爾是在魔法區：使用召喚符文在召喚法陣旁邊他與擊敗虛空行者。艾薩萊斯特是在軍事區。",
	["The Undercity's flight master is in the Trade Quarter's west tower, outside the walls."] = "幽暗城的飛行管理員是在貿易區的西哨塔，在城牆外。",
	["The Unguarded Thunder Ale Barrel in the distillery"] = "無人守衛的雷霆麥芽酒桶在釀酒廠",
	["The Ursera den is west of the village. Urs'anah, their matriarch, sits at its far end."] = "烏爾塞拉獸穴是在村莊以西。烏爾薩娜，它們的主母，位於它的遠處盡頭。",
	["The Valley of Trials opens onto Durotar; Razor Hill is north along the road."] = "試煉谷通向杜隆塔爾；剃刀嶺是北沿著道路。",
	["The Venture Co. Overseers and Enforcers at the mine in the north-east corner of the zone drop the Cats Eye Emerald."] = "風險投資公司監工與石拳執行者在採礦在東北面角落的區域掉落貓眼翡翠。",
	["The Venture Co. clear the forest of Windshear Crag. Loggers and Deforesters work all over it; the Operators run the shredders and one carries the blueprints."] = "風險投資公司清理森林的狂風峭壁。伐木工與砍伐者有效全部越過它；操作員魯格倫克前往伐木機與1攜帶藍圖。",
	["The Videre Elixir comes from Gregan Brewspewer in Feralas, later in this guide."] = "視靈藥劑來自格雷甘·山酒在菲拉斯，在本指南稍後階段。",
	["The Vile Fin Lakestalkers and Oracles sit on the lake shore south of the Decrepit Ferry, east of the Sepulcher."] = "邪鰭巡湖者與神諭者坐在湖岸邊南的破舊渡口，東的瑟伯切爾。",
	["The Vile Fin murlocs line the north shore."] = "邪鰭魚人路線北岸邊。",
	["The WANTED poster"] = "通緝通緝令",
	["The WANTED poster by the inn"] = "通緝通緝令在旅店旁",
	["The WANTED poster outside the inn"] = "通緝通緝令在旅店外",
	["The Wanted poster beside Cliffwatcher"] = "通緝通緝令在峭壁衛兵圖林·長角旁邊",
	["The Wanted poster beside him"] = "通緝通緝令旁邊他",
	["The Wanted poster by Security Chief Bilgewhizzle"] = "通緝通緝令在旁安全主管吉羅姆·比格維茲",
	["The Wanted poster by the inn"] = "通緝通緝令在旅店旁",
	["The Wanted poster by the inn: Lieutenant Fangore, in Galardell Valley"] = "通緝通緝令在旅店旁：範高雷中尉，在加拉德爾山谷",
	["The Wanted/Missing/Lost & Found board"] = "通緝/失蹤/失物招領告示板",
	["The Warpwood treants of Irontree Woods, east of Jadefire Run, carry the Blood Amber."] = "扭木樹人的鐵木森林，在碧火小徑以東，攜帶血琥珀。",
	["The Warsong Outrider patrols the road east of Night Run toward the Satyrnaar."] = "戰歌偵查騎兵巡邏於道路在夜道谷以東朝向薩提納爾。",
	["The Warsong Outriders are the Orcs logging Ashenvale. Their reputation comes from the battleground: every enemy flag your team captures pays it to the whole team. Queue at any battlemaster. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "戰歌氏族是獸人伐木灰谷。它們的聲望來自戰場：每個敵人旗幟你的隊伍佔領獎勵它前往整個隊伍。排隊在任意戰場軍官。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["The Waterlogged Saw, Axe and Toolbox lie in the river south of the bridge. Princess, a big boar, roots in the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch west of the river with her Porcine Entourage: pull the piglets away first. Kill Prowlers and Young Forest Bears on the way."] = "浸水的鋸子，斧與工具箱位於河流在橋以南。公主，一個大野豬，根莖在布拉克威爾南瓜田在河流與她的以西公主的隨從：拉怪小豬離開第一。擊殺覓食的灰狼與森林幼熊在途中。",
	["The Webwood Eggs lie at the back of Shadowthread Cave. Hyacinth Mushrooms drop from Grells, Moonpetal Lilies grow by the ponds north of Aldrassil."] = "樹林蜘蛛的卵位於陰絲洞的後方。紫藍色蘑菇掉落來自小劣魔，月牙百合花生長在旁池塘在奧達希爾以北。",
	["The Windfury harpies hold Windfury Ridge, north and west of the well."] = "風怒喚風者鷹身人要塞狂風山，北與在水井以西。",
	["The Windstone Formations stand on the rise west of Fillion's camp."] = "風石陣位於高地在菲利奧·焰風的以西營地。",
	["The Winterfall furbolg village lies east of Everlook: Shaman (56-57), Den Watchers (55-56) and Ursa (57-58), all above you. Kill the Shaman first, they heal, and pull from the edge. High Chief Winterfall in the cave at the back is elite: stay out."] = "寒冬熊怪村莊位於永望鎮以東：薩滿祭司（56-57），獸穴守夜人道茨（55-56）與木喉巨熊怪（57-58），全部上方你。擊殺薩滿祭司第一，它們治療，與拉怪來自邊緣。冬泉酋長在洞穴內在返回為精英：留在出。",
	["The Witchwing Slayers hold the western Dry Hills; they wear the rings."] = "巫翼殺戮者要塞西部枯水谷；它們佩戴戒指。",
	["The Witherbark trolls hold the village in the south-eastern hills. Axe Throwers guard the outer huts; the Witch Doctors and Headhunters hold the heart of the village."] = "枯木巨魔要塞村莊在南面-東部丘陵。斧投擲者守衛外側小屋；女巫醫生與獵頭者要塞心臟的村莊。",
	["The Witherbark trolls live in the hills south of Go'Shek Farm; Witch Doctors stand in the village, Shadow Hunters guard the far end of the valley."] = "枯木巨魔實測在丘陵在格沙克農場以南；女巫醫生位於村子里，暗影獵人守衛遠處盡頭的山谷。",
	["The Woodpaw gnolls camp in the hills just north-west of Mojache; any of them can drop a mane."] = "木爪豺狼人紮營於丘陵就在莫沙徹營地以西北；任意的它們可以掉落一個鬃毛。",
	["The Wyrmbog"] = "巨龍沼澤",
	["The Zukk'ash hive burrows into the hills south-east of the camp; Stinglasher waits in its deepest chamber."] = "祖卡什蟲巢洞穴進入丘陵在營地以東南；毒刺鞭笞者等候於它的最深處密室。",
	["The adult tigers prowl the hills just south and west of the camp."] = "成年虎遊蕩丘陵就在南與在營地以西。",
	["The ammo crate sits in the Frostmane camp on Shimmer Ridge; Hegnar Rumbleshot camps south of it, by the road to Coldridge."] = "彈藥木箱位於霜鬃先知營地在閃光嶺；海格納·重槍紮營在它南面，在路邊前往寒脊山谷。",
	["The apprentices practise north-east of the village."] = "學徒練習在村莊以東北。",
	["The arrow picks the nearest vendor of your faction for each item."] = "箭頭會自動指向最近的一位商人的你的陣營給每個物品。",
	["The bandit camps are north-east of the village; \"Badwind\" Bennic holds the top camp. Bandits carry the stolen windstones."] = "強盜紮營是在村莊以東北；“惡風”本尼克持有頂部營地。強盜攜帶被盜的風石。",
	["The bandits and thieves camp in the dunes east of Gadgetzan. Every Wastewander can carry a water pouch: keep ten, five for each of Luglunket's bounties."] = "強盜與盜賊紮營於沙丘在加基森以東。每個廢土竊賊可以攜帶一個水袋子：保留10，5給每個的操作員魯格倫克的懸賞。",
	["The barrow is south of the road. Sentinel Lynessa Duskblossom is held inside, Oben Rageclaw sleeps in its depths, and the four relic chests sit in the lower rooms."] = "獸穴是在道路以南。哨兵莉妮莎·暮花是持有內部，奧本·怒爪沈睡於在它的深淵，與4聖物箱子坐在下層房間。",
	["The battered skeleton lies at the edge of the Stonevault trogg camp; Murdaloc, Agmond's killer, walks among the Bonesnappers."] = "破損的骷髏位於邊緣的石窟斷骨者穴居人營地；莫達洛克，阿格蒙德的殺手，步行在其中：折骨者。",
	["The battered skeleton lies just east of the ogres, at the edge of the Stonevault trogg camp; the Bonesnappers and Shamans around it drop the flakes. Theldurin sits by the ruined camp further south."] = "破損的骷髏位於就在食人魔以東，在邊緣的石窟斷骨者穴居人營地；折骨者與薩滿祭司周圍它掉落薄片。迷失者塞爾杜林位於毀壞的營地更遠處南。",
	["The battle map lies in the Woodpaw camp south of Mojache."] = "戰鬥地圖位於木爪營地在莫沙徹營地以南。",
	["The bears roam the hills north and east of the Writhing Haunt."] = "熊遊蕩於丘陵北與東的蠕行之禍。",
	["The big turtles crawl along the beaches north of the village. Whiskey Slim's port bottles lie on these beaches too, but his quest is not on this route. A snapjaw can drop OOX-09/HL's distress beacon, rarely: keep it."] = "大海龜爬行沿著海灘在村莊以北。威士忌斯利姆的港口瓶子位於這些海灘也，但他的任務是不在本路線內。一個鉗嘴龜可以掉落 OOX-09/HL型定位器的求救信標，極少：請保留該任務/物品。",
	["The bigger Rock Elementals stand on the slopes north-west of the Dustbowl; each one drops a slab."] = "更大岩石元素位於山坡西北的塵風盆地；每個1掉落一個石板。",
	["The bigger raptors hunt in the valley just west of the dig."] = "更大迅猛龍狩獵在山谷就在挖掘以西。",
	["The blood elves camp on the cliffs in the north-east, by the Bay of Storms."] = "血液精靈營地在懸崖在東北面，在旁風暴海灣。",
	["The blood elves' camp lies just south of Kim'jael. His four pieces of equipment lie in the crates around the camp."] = "血液精靈的營地位於就在基姆加爾以南。他的4碎片的裝備位於木箱在營地周圍。",
	["The bloodmages' second tier pays for the same parts with a buff item and no experience: skip it."] = "血法師的第二階段獎勵給相同零件與一個增益物品與無經驗值：跳過即可。",
	["The boat docks west of the village. The flight master stands on the hill south of the inn; the quest givers are spread along the main street."] = "船碼頭在村莊以西。飛行管理員位於山丘在旅店以南；任務發佈者是分布沿著主街道。",
	["The boat lands in Booty Bay's harbour. The quest givers stand on the boardwalks around the harbour and in the inn."] = "船之地在藏寶海灣的港口。任務發佈者位於木棧道在港口與在旅店周圍。",
	["The boat to Booty Bay docks at Ratchet's pier, below the flight master's hill."] = "船前往藏寶海灣碼頭在棘齒城的棧橋，下方飛行管理員的山丘。",
	["The boat to Booty Bay docks at the end of Ratchet's pier."] = "船前往藏寶海灣碼頭在棘齒城的端棧橋。",
	["The book lies in the ruined inn of Terrordale."] = "書位於毀壞的旅店的恐懼谷。",
	["The bounty board"] = "懸賞告示板",
	["The burned inn stands on the road west, toward the Barrens; the guard's badge lies in the ashes and the hoofprints are in the mud beside the inn."] = "燒焦的旅店位於路上西，朝向貧瘠之地；守衛的徽章位於灰燼與蹄印是在泥地在旅店旁邊。",
	["The camp is at Three Corners in western Redridge Mountains, between Elwynn Forest and Lakeshire. Loot supply crates in the world, fill them, and hand them in at the camp for Merchant's Favor (5-20 a crate); the Pack Kodo costs 6,000. Craftsman's Writs may help from level 10."] = "營地是在三角路口在西部赤脊山，在艾爾文森林與湖畔鎮之間。拾取補給木箱在世界，裝滿它們，與上交它們在營地給商人的青睞（5-20一個木箱）；打包科多獸花費6,000。工匠威爾海姆的文書可能幫助來自10級。",
	["The camp is just outside the Crossroads in the Barrens. Loot supply crates in the world, fill them, and hand them in at the camp for Merchant's Favor (5-20 a crate); the Pack Kodo costs 6,000. Craftsman's Writs may help from level 10."] = "營地是就在外部十字路口在貧瘠之地。拾取補給木箱在世界，裝滿它們，與上交它們在營地給商人的青睞（5-20一個木箱）；打包科多獸花費6,000。工匠威爾海姆的文書可能幫助來自10級。",
	["The camp is north-east of the bridge. Bundles of Wood lie around the camp and in the woods north of it."] = "營地是在橋以東北。木柴堆位於營地與在樹林周圍在它北面。",
	["The captain walks the deck of the wrecked ship; his strongbox sits in the hold."] = "隊長步行甲板的失事的船；他的保險箱位於要塞。",
	["The captains stand on the ships anchored off the Wild Shore, each with a crew of 42-45 pirates: Stillwater (45) and Keelhaul (46) on the nearer decks, Fleet Master Firallon (48) on the flagship. At 42 this is a fight for a group or for the end of the guide; clear each deck first if you go. Cortello's scroll lies on the wreck by the shore."] = "隊長位於船隻停泊的偏離/關閉狂野海岸，每個與一個船員的42-45海盜：靜水（45）與拖行刑（46）在更靠近甲板，艦隊指揮官菲爾拉倫（48）在旗艦。在42此是一個迎戰需要組隊完成或給盡頭的指南；清理每個甲板第一如果你前往。科特羅的捲軸位於殘骸在旁岸邊。",
	["The caravan ends at Smeed's camp on the east side of the Kodo Graveyard."] = "商隊終結於斯米德的營地在東一側的科多獸墳場。",
	["The caravan rolls south past Kolkar Village. Kolkar raiders ambush it in waves: kill them before they reach Cork. It stops by Scrabblescrew's Camp, east of Ghost Walker Post."] = "商隊滾動南經過科爾卡村。科卡爾劫掠者伏擊它在波次：擊殺它們之前它們抵達考克·基澤爾頓。它停靠在旁瑟卡布斯庫的營地，在幽靈崗哨以東。",
	["The cattails and speargrass grow along the water in the Valley of Honor, east of the Drag."] = "香蒲與矛草生長沿著水在榮譽谷，東的暗巷區。",
	["The cauldron now offers its own task; the skeletons around it drop Osseous Agitators."] = "大鍋現在提供它的自己的任務；骷髏周圍它掉落骨質分離素。",
	["The cauldron sits at Dalson's Tears, north-east of Felstone; its Cauldron Lord stands beside it."] = "大鍋位於達爾松之淚，在詹妮絲·費爾斯通以東北；它的大鍋領主站在旁邊：它。",
	["The cauldron sits at the Writhing Haunt, by Mulgris' farm."] = "大鍋位於蠕行之禍，在旁穆格雷斯·深水的農場。",
	["The cave in the hill just west of Dolanaar. Lord Melenas waits at the back."] = "洞穴在山丘就在多蘭納爾以西。邁雷納斯等候於返回。",
	["The cave lies south of the falls: Scaber Stalks grow all through it, the Death Cap at the very back. The Den Mother lairs in the hills south of the falls; Xabraxxis' Demon Bag lies at the satyr camp north of her."] = "洞穴位於墜落以南：粗柄蘑菇生長全部穿過它，毒帽蘑菇在非常返回。大獸穴主母巢穴在丘陵在墜落以南；薩巴克希斯的惡魔背包位於薩特營地在她北面。",
	["The cemetery lies north of the village. Skeletal Horrors and Skeletal Fiends walk its southern half. Mor'Ladim, an elite, wanders the graves: keep away from him."] = "墓園位於村莊以北。恐怖骸骨與骸骨魔步行它的南部一半。摩拉迪姆，一個精英，遊蕩墳墓：保留離開來自他。",
	["The cheese shop in the Trade District."] = "奶酪商店在貿易區。",
	["The chest lies in the ruins south-west of Nijel's Point."] = "箱子位於廢墟中在尼耶爾前哨站以西南。",
	["The chimaeras roam the snowfields south and west of Everlook. Stay clear of Mazthoril's cave: its blue dragonkin are elite."] = "奇美拉遊蕩於雪原南與在永望鎮以西。留在清理的麥索瑞爾的洞穴：它的藍色龍類為精英。",
	["The clams lie on Stranglethorn's north-west coast, in the next guide: keep it"] = "蚌殼位於荊棘谷的西北海岸，在下一份指南中：請保留該任務/物品",
	["The class trainers stand together in the grove"] = "職業訓練師位於一起在樹林",
	["The courier walks the road west of Go'Shek Farm with two guards; pull them off the road."] = "信使步行道路在格沙克農場以西與2衛兵；拉怪它們道路兩側。",
	["The crates of Hinterlands Honey Ripple lie around the abandoned Horde camp at Skulk Rock, among the oozes."] = "木箱的辛特蘭蜜糖位於廢棄的周圍部落紮營於隱匿石，在其中：軟泥怪。",
	["The crates of grapes lie in the vineyards behind the Defias. Garrick Padfoot waits by the cabin at the east end of the valley."] = "木箱的葡萄位於葡萄園後面迪菲亞。加瑞克·帕德弗特等候於船艙在山谷的東端。",
	["The crawlers scuttle along the shore south-west of town."] = "爬行者爬行沿著岸邊在城鎮西南面。",
	["The crocolisks wallow in the pools around Galen's camp and south towards Stonard; about one in four drops a flank."] = "鰐魚打滾在水池在加林·古瓦德的周圍營地與南朝斯通納德方向；約1在4掉落一個側翼。",
	["The crystal clusters stand all over the crater, many around Fire Plume Ridge. Take a few extra of each colour for the pylons."] = "水晶簇位於全部越過環形山，許多在火羽山周圍。接取一個少量額外的每個顏色給水晶塔。",
	["The dead Threshadon lies by the water north of Torwa."] = "死亡的蛇頸龍位於旁水在托爾瓦以北。",
	["The demons gather at the Mannoroc Coven in southern Desolace: felhounds (Mana Eaters, Mage and Ley Hunters), Nether Maidens and Sisters, and Doomwarder Captains around the pit."] = "惡魔採集在瑪諾洛克集會所在南部淒涼之地：地獄犬（噬法魔犬，法師與靈能獵犬），地獄魔女與姐妹，與末日看守隊長在深坑周圍。",
	["The deserters camp south of the road, west of Mudcrush's hut."] = "逃兵營地在道路以南，在馬德克拉什的以西小屋。",
	["The diary lies in the farmhouse, the cabinet stands inside and the outhouse is behind it. A Wandering Skeleton carries the outhouse key; Farmer Dalson comes out when you open the outhouse and carries the cabinet key."] = "日記位於農舍，櫥櫃位於內部與戶外廁所是後面它。一個遊蕩的骷髏攜帶戶外廁所鑰匙；農夫達爾松來自出當你打開/開啓戶外廁所與攜帶櫥櫃鑰匙。",
	["The doll's head and its two sides lie in the houses around Pamela; join them from your bags."] = "人偶的前往與它的2兩側位於房屋在帕米拉周圍；加入它們來自你的背包。",
	["The driftwood washes up along the eastern shore."] = "浮木衝上上沿著東部岸邊。",
	["The druid trainers stand in the Enclave; Ironforge has none"] = "德魯伊訓練師位于飛地；鐵爐堡有無",
	["The druids' camp is just past the border."] = "德魯伊的營地是就在經過邊界。",
	["The dwarf stands by the road at the dig site. Follow him north along the road and fight off the Dark Iron ambushes. When it is over, read the Singed Letter he leaves on the road in Dustfire Valley."] = "矮人位於路邊在挖掘地點。沿著他北沿著道路與迎戰偏離/關閉黑鐵礦伏擊。當它是越過，閱讀燒焦的信件他離開在路上在塵火谷。",
	["The dwarves of the Bael'dun Digsite carry the Prospector's Picks. Smash them at the forge in Bloodhoof Village."] = "矮人的巴爾丹挖掘場攜帶勘察員的鋤頭。砸碎它們在鍛爐在血蹄村。",
	["The dwarves' flying machine sits on its platform inside the dig site."] = "矮人的飛行的機器位於它的平台在挖掘地點內。",
	["The elder tigers come later, on the way back from the Rebel Camp"] = "長者/老年虎來到稍後，在返回途中來自反抗軍營地",
	["The excavation site sits on the hill south of the road."] = "挖掘場地點位於山丘在道路以南。",
	["The expedition's crate sits at an abandoned camp in the eastern jungle."] = "遠徵隊的木箱位於一個廢棄的紮營於東部叢林。",
	["The expedition's lost equipment lies in the south-west jungle."] = "遠徵隊的遺失的裝備位於西南面叢林。",
	["The faerie dragons flit around the woods just west of the camp. Use the vessel on each one you kill."] = "精靈龍飛掠在樹林周圍就在營地以西。使用容器在每個1你擊殺。",
	["The farms east of Hillsbrad town. Farmer Ray works the field by the northern farmhouse, Farmer Getz the one further south-east; Farmhands and Farmers are everywhere. Farmer Kalaba tends the field south of the farms."] = "農場在希爾斯布萊德以東城鎮。農夫雷恩有效田野在旁北部農舍，農夫蓋茲1更遠處東南；農夫與農夫法布隆是到處。農夫卡拉巴照看田野在農場以南。",
	["The final boss of every level 15-25 dungeon earns one point together. Tick each boss off when you kill it; the grouping follows the usual Classic level ranges, so check the in-game Legacy panel for the exact list."] = "最終首領的每個15-25級地下城獲得1點一起。勾選每個首領偏離/關閉當你擊殺它；隊伍接續通常的經典舊世等級範圍，因此查看遊戲內傳承面板給精確的列表。",
	["The final boss of every level 26-45 dungeon earns one point together."] = "最終首領的每個26-45級地下城獲得1點一起。",
	["The final boss of every level 46-60 dungeon earns one point together."] = "最終首領的每個46-60級地下城獲得1點一起。",
	["The firewood lies in the snow around the frozen lake by the refuge."] = "柴火位於雪在冰凍的湖在旁營地周圍。",
	["The first two cages stand together in the Witherbark village south of Rhapsody; the third is in the next village to the east. Every Witherbark troll can drop a necklace."] = "第一2籠子位於一起在枯木村莊在拉普索迪·鐵鏟以南；第三是在下一個村莊向東。每個枯木巨魔可以掉落一個項鍊。",
	["The five quests share the same parts: gather them all in one sweep. West of the road the Black Slayer vultures, Starving Snickerfangs, Scorpok Stingers and Deatheye basilisks share the hills."] = "5任務共享相同零件：採集它們全部在1清剿。在道路以西黑色屠戮者禿鷲，飢餓的彎牙土狼，厚甲毒刺蠍與死眼石化蜥蜴共享丘陵。",
	["The flame burns in the south of Ameth'Aran."] = "烈焰燃燒在亞米薩蘭以南。",
	["The flight master stands by the gate of Foothold Citadel; Clerk Lendry and Commander Samaul are inside the citadel."] = "飛行管理員站在旁邊：大門的塞拉摩堡壘；書記員倫德瑞與指揮官薩穆爾是在堡壘內。",
	["The foreman stands at the lumber pile east of the Den."] = "工頭位於伐木場堆東的獸穴。",
	["The fountain stands in the middle of the Ruins of Stardust: use the Empty Blue Waterskin there."] = "噴泉位於中間的星塵廢墟：使用空的藍色水囊那裡。",
	["The furbolg village fills the valley north-east of Everlook. Kill Shamans first; they heal. High Chief Winterfall in the cave at the back is elite: stay out."] = "熊怪村莊裝滿山谷在永望鎮以東北。擊殺薩滿祭司第一；它們治療。冬泉酋長在洞穴內在返回為精英：留在出。",
	["The glowing tablet fragments lie around the Twilight camp in the far north-west; the Dust Stormers and Desert Rumblers there drop them too."] = "發光的石板碎片位於周圍暮光紮營於遠處西北；塵暴者與沙漠奔騰者那裡掉落它們也。",
	["The gnomish toolboxes lie in the wreckage along the shore east and south-east of Razor Hill. Follow the shore south to Sen'jin."] = "侏儒工具箱位於殘骸沿著岸邊東與在剃刀嶺以東南。沿著岸邊南前往森金村。",
	["The goblins work the mine in the hills north-east of the well. Supervisor Fizsprocket stands in the back of the mine; his Mulgore Expansion Plans start Fizsprocket's Notes, and the other pages lie inside the mine."] = "地精有效採礦在丘陵在水井以東北。菲茲普羅克主管位於採礦的後方；他的莫高雷擴張計劃開始菲茲普羅克特的筆記，與其他書頁位於採礦內。",
	["The gorillas live on Ironstone Plateau, east of Marshal's Refuge. Keep their pelts for Torwa Pathfinder. Stay out of the deepest cave: U'cha is level 55."] = "猩猩實測在鐵石高原，在馬紹爾營地以東。保留它們的毛皮給托爾瓦·尋路者。留在離開最深處洞穴：尤爾查是55級。",
	["The gorillas live on the north-east plateau. Stay out of the deepest cave: U'cha lives there."] = "猩猩實測在東北高原。留在離開最深處洞穴：尤爾查住在那裡。",
	["The gorillas of Ironstone Plateau come in small groups and drop nothing for you yet; Torwa's pelt quest comes later. Stay out of the deepest cave: U'cha is level 55."] = "猩猩的鐵石高原來到在小型小隊與掉落無獎勵給你尚；托爾瓦的毛皮任務來自稍後。留在離開最深處洞穴：尤爾查是55級。",
	["The gorillas roam the valley around Unbagwa. The elders drop the giblets; any of them can drop a fang."] = "猩猩遊蕩於山谷在巫醫安巴格瓦周圍。長者掉落內臟；任意的它們可以掉落一個獠牙。",
	["The half pendants lie in Darkshore and Westfall: later on the route"] = "一半掛墜位於黑海岸與西部荒野：稍後在路線",
	["The harpies nest in the Dry Hills north-west of the Forgotten Pools; any of them can drop a talon."] = "鷹身人巢在枯水谷西北的遺忘之池；任意的它們可以掉落一個利爪。",
	["The hermit hides among the rocks south-east of Southwind Village."] = "隱士藏身在其中：岩石在南風村以東南。",
	["The hermit lives at Windsong Lake's west shore. Zephyrseed cones grow south of him; the Wind Hollows drift east of the lake."] = "隱士住在風歌湖的西岸邊。微風之種松果生長在他南面；風穴魔漂浮在湖以東。",
	["The hermit's shack stands in the woods north-east of the Raven Hill Cemetery."] = "隱士的棚屋位於樹林東北的烏鴉嶺墓地。",
	["The high elf Rangers, Pathstriders and Woodsmen guard the lodge by Northpass Tower; the Registry lies inside. Rangers reach 60: pull one at a time. Noxious Plaguebats fly over the fields on the way."] = "高精靈遊俠，巡路者與樵夫守衛旅捨在旁北地哨塔；名冊位於內部。遊俠抵達60：拉怪1在一個時間。毒性瘟疫蝙蝠飛往越過農田在途中。",
	["The highwaymen hold the hills north-east of the orchard. More Construct Parts lie near the road to Valanaar."] = "攔路強盜要塞丘陵在果園以東北。更多失靈的旋風構造體零件位於道路前往附近瓦拉納爾。",
	["The hippogryph nests are north-west of the tower, west of Falaath Village; the Matriarch sits at the western end. Hippogryph Down lies on the ground around them, and the hippogryphs drop the Small Eggs."] = "角鷹獸巢是在哨塔以西北，在法拉斯村以西；刺喉雌龍位於西部盡頭。角鷹獸絨羽位於領地周圍它們，與角鷹獸掉落小蛋。",
	["The hippogryphs nest on the hills south-west of the camp. Kill one, then use the Muisek Vessel on its body."] = "角鷹獸巢在丘陵在營地以西南。擊殺1，然後使用穆塞克容器在它的屍體。",
	["The incense burns out in ten minutes: run straight east along the southern hills to the Ritual Fire."] = "熏香燃燒出在10分鐘：前往直走東沿著南部丘陵前往儀式之火。",
	["The inner circle lies south of the western circle, east of Stromgarde."] = "內側法陣位於西部法陣以南，在激流堡以東。",
	["The keep stands on the coast south-east of Razor Hill. The raiders' axe, bow and shield lie on its outskirts. Sailors and marines drop the Canvas Scraps. Lieutenant Benedict waits at the top of the keep; his key opens the chest beside him, which holds the Aged Envelope."] = "保留位於海岸邊在剃刀嶺以東南。劫掠者的斧，弓與盾牌位於它的外圍。水手與水兵掉落帆布腳料。本尼迪克上尉等候在保留的頂部；他的鑰匙開啓箱子旁邊他，其中持有舊信封。",
	["The keg stands with a few others at the Syndicate camp on the south-east coast of Hillsbrad."] = "酒桶位於與一個少量其他在辛迪加營地在東南海岸的希爾斯布萊德。",
	["The last skulls are in the ruins a short ride west, on the way back to Grom'gol."] = "最後頭顱是在廢墟中一個不足騎行西，在返回途中前往格羅姆高。",
	["The level-20 class quests in Orgrimmar (Sorek, Searn Firewarder, the Warlock and Rogue trainers) are only offered from level 20, so finish the level here before you fly. The Thunderhawk Hatchlings (18) on the plains south-west of the Crossroads and the Kolkar (14-15) at the Stagnant Oasis are the nearest mobs worth killing; you need well under a level."] = "等級-20職業任務在奧格瑞瑪（索瑞克，希爾恩·火結，術士與潛行者訓練師）是僅提供的來自20級，因此完成等級此處之前你飛往。雷鷹雛鳥（18）在平原西南的十字路口與科卡爾（14-15）在死水綠洲是最近的怪物價值擊殺；你需要水井在下方一個等級。",
	["The libram lies further north, on the way to Hearthglen."] = "聖契位於更遠處北，在途中前往壁爐谷。",
	["The little turtle Tooga hides at the north end of the valley. Lead him home to his wife Torta, by the water just east of Steamwheedle Port: he walks slowly and the desert's beasts go for him, so keep him alive."] = "小海龜圖加藏身在山谷的北端。引導他爐石前往他的妻子托爾塔，在旁水就在熱砂港以東：他步行緩慢地與沙漠的野獸前往給他，因此保留他存活。",
	["The mine is south-west of the gnoll camps. Mining Tools lie near the entrance; Kobold Geomancers hold the tunnels."] = "採礦是在豺狼人紮營以西南。採礦工具位於入口附近；狗頭人地卜師要塞隧道。",
	["The mine is west of the vineyards. Kobold Miners and Tunnelers fill both levels; Nimsy, a named kobold, holds the picture book in the lower tunnels. Nimsy is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "採礦是在葡萄園以西。狗頭人礦工與暗爐隧道工裝滿兩個等級；妮姆希，一個名為狗頭人，持有圖畫書在下層隧道。妮姆希為精英：建議組隊前往。",
	["The moonwell is in the middle of the glade. The Strange Fronded Plant grows at its north end."] = "月亮井是在林地的中央。奇怪的樹木生長在它的北盡頭。",
	["The moonwell lies in the hills north-east of Astranaar."] = "月亮井位於丘陵在阿斯特蘭納以東北。",
	["The moonwell sits north of Aldrassil; Iverron is a little further north-west."] = "月亮井位於奧達希爾以北；埃沃隆是一個小更遠處西北。",
	["The mound of loose dirt lies south of the farmhouse, by the old stump."] = "土堆的鬆動的泥土位於農舍以南，在旁舊樹樁。",
	["The mountain lets you out beside Blackrock Stronghold, full of 55-57 orcs. Follow the road east along the northern cliffs to the Horde camp at Flame Crest."] = "山脈允許你出在黑石要塞旁邊，完整的55-57獸人。沿著道路前往東沿著北部懸崖前往部落紮營於烈焰峰。",
	["The murlocs on the east shore drop the kelp. Skinners: Gray Forest Wolves roam the woods between the lake and the Tower of Azora; Prowlers further east give pelts too."] = "魚人在東岸邊掉落海藻。剝皮師：森林灰狼遊蕩於樹林之間湖與阿祖拉之塔；覓食的灰狼更遠處東交給毛皮也。",
	["The naga comb the beaches north of the Bloodsail camp; they drop the reeds."] = "納迦梳理海灘北的血帆營地；它們掉落蘆葦。",
	["The naga hold the shore south-east of Southshore."] = "納迦要塞岸邊在南海鎮以東南。",
	["The naga raid the coast east of Razor Hill: their weapons, banners and spinefins come from them."] = "納迦團隊副本海岸在剃刀嶺以東：它們的武器，旗幟與刺鰭魚來自它們。",
	["The new Forever Green, Dark and Purple Skeletal Horses and the Ochre Skeletal Warhorse (level 60) have no known source yet."] = "新永恆服綠色、暗色與紫色骷髏馬與赭色骷髏戰馬（60級）目前尚無已知獲取來源。",
	["The next guide flies on from here to Orgrimmar."] = "下一個指南飛往在來自此處前往奧格瑞瑪。",
	["The next guide flies you north to Tarren Mill and into the Arathi Highlands."] = "下一個指南飛往你北前往塔倫米爾與進入阿拉希高地。",
	["The next guide heads into Dustwallow Marsh."] = "下一個指南頭顱進入塵泥沼澤。",
	["The next guide starts here and flies to Chillwind Camp."] = "下一個指南始於此處與飛往前往冰風崗。",
	["The next guide starts here and takes you to Tanaris."] = "下一個指南始於此處與接收你前往塔納利斯。",
	["The next guide starts here in Ratchet and flies on to Gadgetzan."] = "下一個指南始於此處在棘齒城與飛往在前往加基森。",
	["The next guide starts here in Ratchet."] = "下一個指南始於此處在棘齒城。",
	["The next guide starts here, at Revantusk Village."] = "下一個指南始於此處，在惡齒村。",
	["The next guide starts here, at the chapel's flight master."] = "下一個指南始於此處，在禮拜堂的飛行管理員。",
	["The next guide starts in Theramore."] = "下一個指南始於塞拉摩。",
	["The next guide starts in the Undercity, at the Grom'gol zeppelin."] = "下一個指南始於幽暗城，在格羅姆高飛艇。",
	["The next guide takes you back to Stranglethorn Vale."] = "下一個指南接收你返回前往荊棘谷。",
	["The next step, Defeat Nek'rosh, pits you against an elite chieftain: skip it."] = "下一個步驟，擊敗納克羅什，需要你迎戰一個精英酋長：跳過即可。",
	["The next trophy skulls stand in the small ruins just north of the warriors' camp."] = "下一個戰利品頭顱位於小型廢墟就在戰士以北的營地。",
	["The night elf stands alone west of Thorium Point. Hear his story."] = "夜晚精靈位於獨自在瑟銀哨塔以西。聽完他的故事。",
	["The northern Deadwood (level 53-55) hold the camps just south of the tunnel. Keep their feathers too."] = "北部死木（53-55級）要塞紮營就在隧道以南。保留它們的羽毛也。",
	["The northern Deadwood camps by the tunnel are the densest feather spot (35% drop chance there). Hand feathers to Nafien at the tunnel, or to Grazle in the south."] = "北部死木紮營在旁隧道是最密集的羽毛地點（35%掉落幾率那裡）。上交羽毛前往納菲恩在隧道，或前往格拉茲在南面。",
	["The oasis lies south-east of the Crossroads. Test the seeds at the bubbling fissure in the middle of the water."] = "綠洲位於東南的十字路口。測試種子在冒泡的裂隙在水的中央。",
	["The orc stronghold at the eastern end of the road. Urda, the wind rider master, stands by the gate."] = "獸人要塞在道路的東端。尤爾達，雙足飛龍管理員，站在旁邊：大門。",
	["The ore drops from Drywhisker kobolds in Arathi Highlands"] = "礦石掉落來自枯須狗頭人在阿拉希高地",
	["The other exit of the Timbermaw Hold tunnel leads into Winterspring. Everlook is a neutral goblin town with flight masters for both factions."] = "其他出口的木喉要塞隧道通往進入冬泉谷。永望鎮是一個中立地精城鎮與雙方陣營的飛行管理員。",
	["The pass from Un'Goro comes out at Valor's Rest, the graveyard in north-east Silithus. Layo stands among the graves."] = "穿過來自安戈洛環形山來自出在勇氣之眠，墓地在東北希利蘇斯。萊耶·星擊位於其中：墳墓。",
	["The pelts come after loop 2, on the gorilla plateau"] = "毛皮來到之後環線2，在猩猩高原",
	["The pirates camp along the beach south of Ratchet. The piles of complicated parts lie in and around their camp."] = "海盜營地沿著海灘在棘齒城以南。堆的複雜的零件位於與周圍它們的營地。",
	["The pirates camp on the beach south of Ratchet. The piles of complicated parts lie in the sand among them."] = "海盜營地在海灘上在棘齒城以南。堆的複雜的零件位於沙子在其中：它們。",
	["The pirates camp on the beach south of Ratchet; Baron Longshore stands at its southern end."] = "海盜營地在海灘上在棘齒城以南；巴隆·朗紹爾位於它的南部盡頭。",
	["The plans lie in the Slag Pit of the Cauldron, guarded by Dark Iron dwarves. Dark Iron dwarves also drop Dark Iron Residue, which Burninate takes for Gaining Acceptance."] = "圖紙位於熔渣深坑的大鍋，有守衛的在旁黑鐵矮人。黑鐵矮人也掉落黑鐵殘油，其中大鐵匠博恩奈特接收給獲得信任。",
	["The pools lie just north of Regthar. Walk into the water to explore them; the Laden Mushrooms for Helbrim grow around them. Kill every Kolkar you pass for bracers."] = "水池位於就在雷戈薩·死門以北。步行進入水前往探索它們；滿載的蘑菇給藥劑師赫布瑞姆生長周圍它們。擊殺每個科卡爾你穿過給護腕。",
	["The prickly pears grow among the quilboar huts just west of town."] = "多刺梨生長在其中：野豬人小屋就在城鎮西面。",
	["The prisoner's next task, Ledger from Tanaris, sends you to the Swamp of Sorrows and Dustwallow Marsh: skip it."] = "囚犯的下一個任務，塔納利斯的賬本，派你前往悲傷沼澤與塵泥沼澤：跳過即可。",
	["The pumpkins grow in the Scarlet-held fields north-west of Solliden."] = "南瓜生長在血色-持有農田在索利丹以西北。",
	["The pylon stands on the eastern cliffs."] = "水晶塔位於東部懸崖。",
	["The pylon stands on the slope east of the refuge."] = "水晶塔位於山坡在營地以東。",
	["The pylon stands on the slope east of the refuge. Pterrordax circle the slopes around it: they count for Spraggle and drop Shizzle's scales."] = "水晶塔位於山坡在營地以東。翼手龍法陣山坡周圍它：它們計入給斯普拉格·弗勞克與掉落希茲爾的鱗片。",
	["The pylon stands on the western cliffs. Frenzied Pterrordax fly over the whole west side."] = "水晶塔位於西部懸崖。狂怒的翼手龍飛往越過整個西一側。",
	["The quarry lies south-east of the ranch."] = "採石場位於牧場以東南。",
	["The queen hovers at the south-east end of the grove, on your way back from the stones."] = "女王盤旋在東南盡頭的樹林，在你的路返回來自石頭。",
	["The quests run out here. Rabid Shardtooths prowl Frostwhisper Gorge in southern Winterspring, south of the road from Everlook."] = "任務前往出此處。瘋狂的碎齒熊遊蕩霜語峽谷在南部冬泉谷，在道路來自以南永望鎮。",
	["The raft lies on the shore of the south-eastern lake; the small pack sits in the water beside it."] = "木筏位於南的岸上-東部湖；小型包位於水旁邊它。",
	["The refugees' belongings lie along the north shore of Windsong Lake; Resaan Nimbuswalker is at its north-west end."] = "難民的遺物位於沿著北岸邊的風歌湖；雷薩恩伊拉妮·雲行者是在它的西北盡頭。",
	["The reins need level 60 and Journeyman Riding (Forever client). Train it at your race's riding trainer; see the Level 60 mount guides."] = "繮繩需要60級與中級騎術（永恆服客戶端）。訓練它在你的種族的騎術訓練師；查看等級60坐騎指南。",
	["The reins need level 60 and Journeyman Riding to ride (Forever client); you can buy them earlier."] = "繮繩需要60級與中級騎術前往騎行（永恆服客戶端）；你可以購買它們此前。",
	["The relics are in the Burning Steppes: keep it"] = "聖物是在燃燒平原：請保留該任務/物品",
	["The relics are the carved stones scattered through the Ruins of Thaurissan around Flame Crest: click them until the information is recovered."] = "聖物是雕刻的石頭散落的穿過索瑞森廢墟在烈焰峰周圍：點擊它們直到資訊是找回的。",
	["The relics lie in the dig itself. Sarltooth, a big Razormaw, prowls the raptor valley just west of it."] = "聖物位於挖掘其本身。薩爾圖斯，一個大老刺喉龍，潛行遊蕩迅猛龍山谷就在它西面。",
	["The riddle's next scroll lies in western Dustwallow: skip it."] = "謎題的下一個捲軸位於西部塵泥沼澤：跳過即可。",
	["The road climbs north as the Webwinder Path. Ziz Fizziks has a hut where the road forks east to Windshear Crag."] = "道路爬上北作為蛛網小徑。菲茲克斯有一個小屋在道路岔路口東前往狂風峭壁。",
	["The road ends at Nafien, outside the Timbermaw Hold tunnel in the far north-east."] = "道路終結於納菲恩，外部木喉要塞隧道在遠處東北。",
	["The road from Elwynn enters Redridge at Three Corners. Guard Parker stands where the roads to Redridge and Duskwood meet."] = "道路來自艾爾文森林進入赤脊山在三角路口。衛兵帕克位於道路前往赤脊山與暮色森林會合。",
	["The road west from Camp Taurajo climbs into Mulgore."] = "道路西來自陶拉祖營地爬上進入莫高雷。",
	["The ruins lie around the frozen lake south of Starfall Village. Click the four relic fragments in the ruins, and pick up the Moontouched Feathers on the ground where the wildkin roam."] = "廢墟位於冰凍的湖周圍在墜星村以南。點擊4聖物碎片在廢墟中，與拾取/接取月光羽毛在領地在野性梟獸遊蕩。",
	["The same murlocs again, plus the Oracles, who stay near the huts on the western shore."] = "相同魚人再次，外加神諭者，其留在小屋在西部岸邊附近。",
	["The satchel lies in the mountains of the far south, past Bronzebeard's Encampment. Deathclasp, an elite scorpid, patrols near it: grab it while he is away."] = "挎包位於山脈的遠處南，經過銅須營地。死亡彎鈎，一個精英蠍子，巡邏附近它：拿取它當他是離開。",
	["The scroll lies in the marsh north of Biggs. The Swampwalkers north of it can drop Khadgar's essays."] = "捲軸位於沼澤在衛兵比格斯以北。沼澤漫步者在它北面可以掉落卡德加的論文。",
	["The second Circle of Imprisonment lies in the valley of Night Run, on the way west."] = "第二禁錮法陣位於山谷的夜道谷，在途中西。",
	["The secret lies on the Overlook Cliffs, above the beach."] = "秘密的位於懸崖懸崖，在海灘上方。",
	["The shadow mages, rogues and assassins camp south-east of Gadgetzan."] = "暗影法師，潛行者與刺客營地在加基森以東南。",
	["The shards lie at the far end of Drywhisker Gorge."] = "碎片位於遠處盡頭的枯須峽谷。",
	["The shattered sword lies on the ground north-west of the lake."] = "破碎的劍位於領地在湖以西北。",
	["The shield lies at Gahrron's Withering, south of Tirion's hut."] = "盾牌位於蓋羅恩農場，在提里奧的以南小屋。",
	["The shrine lies in the south-west corner of Azshara, south of Talrendis Point."] = "神龕位於西南面角落的艾薩拉，在塔倫迪斯營地以南。",
	["The shrine sits on the hill just south-east of the moonwell; follow the winding path up."] = "神龕位於山丘就在月亮井以東南；沿著風小徑上。",
	["The shrunken giants roam the Twin Colossals; the sea elementals wade along the coast to the west."] = "縮小的巨人遊蕩於雙塔山；大海元素涉水沿著海岸向西。",
	["The silithid hive fills the south of the crater. Gorishi wasps and workers drop the scent gland; use the Scraping Vial on the egg mass inside the first chamber. The Hive Queen at the bottom is an elite boss: stay out of her chamber. Pterrordax nest on the cliffs above the hive; their scales are for Shizzle."] = "異種蟲蟲巢裝滿在環形山以南。戈里什黃蜂與工人掉落氣味腺體；使用刮取瓶在蛋大量在第一密室內。蟲巢女王在底部是一個精英首領：留在出的她的密室。翼手龍巢在懸崖在蟲巢上方；它們的鱗片是給希茲爾。",
	["The skeleton's next task, Murdaloc, waits until the later Badlands guide at 43."] = "骷髏的下一個任務，莫達洛克，等候直到稍後荒蕪之地指南在43。",
	["The skull sits in the Pestilent Scar, among Blighted Horrors and Plague Monstrosities."] = "頭顱位於瘟疫之痕，在其中：荒蕪水元素與瘟疫水元素。",
	["The skyboat leaves the cliffs south of Skywatcher Plateau, north of Thunder Bluff (another flies from Dalaran)."] = "天舟離開懸崖在觀天者高原以南，在雷霆崖以北（另一個飛往來自達拉然）。",
	["The skyboat leaves the north side of Dalaran in the Alterac Mountains (another flies from north of Thunder Bluff)."] = "天舟離開北一側的達拉然在奧特蘭克山脈（另一個飛往來自在雷霆崖以北）。",
	["The skycutter docks at the tower south of Valanaar. It lands by the Kirin Tor camp on the lake shore west of Dalaran."] = "斬天者碼頭在哨塔在瓦拉納爾以南。它之地在旁肯瑞托營地在湖岸邊在達拉然以西。",
	["The small Horde post on the southern shore."] = "小型部落崗哨在南部岸邊。",
	["The small elementals drift across the flats just west of Lotwil's camp. Every rock elemental in the zone can drop Jarkal's Rock Elemental Shards: keep them."] = "小型元素漂浮穿過平原就在洛特維爾的以西營地。每個岩石元素在區域可以掉落加卡爾的石元素的碎片：請保留它們。",
	["The smithy stands in the middle of Hillsbrad town. Blacksmith Verringtan and his apprentices work at the forge; the Shipment of Iron is stacked beside it. Citizen Wilkes walks the street north of it."] = "鐵匠鋪位於希爾斯布萊德的中央城鎮。鐵匠維林坦與他的學徒有效在鍛爐；一箱鐵材是堆疊的旁邊它。平民維爾克斯步行街道在它北面。",
	["The snappers line the strand south of the post."] = "咬龜路線海灘在崗哨以南。",
	["The spare texts from the cultists"] = "備用文本來自邪教徒",
	["The spiders lurk in the hills along the road north toward Razor Hill."] = "蜘蛛潛伏在丘陵沿著道路北朝剃刀嶺方向。",
	["The spiders lurk in the woods at the far east end of the glades."] = "蜘蛛潛伏在樹林在遠處東盡頭的林地。",
	["The spiders roam the plateaus and lava pools in the south-west of the gorge."] = "蜘蛛遊蕩於高原與熔岩水池在峽谷以西南。",
	["The sprite darters flit over the grove just west of Mojache; nearly every one drops a wing. The Woodpaw alphas lead the camps south-west of it: kill them within the hour."] = "林精精靈龍飛掠越過樹林就在莫沙徹營地以西；接近每個1掉落一個翅膀。木爪頭狼引導紮營在它西南面：擊殺它們內部小時。",
	["The sprite darters flit over the grove just west of the camp and carry the Encrusted Minerals; the Wandering Forest Walkers, a little further west, carry the Splintered Logs."] = "林精精靈龍飛掠越過樹林就在營地與攜帶以西包殼礦石；流浪的森林行者，一個小更遠處西，攜帶斷裂的原木。",
	["The stalker raptors hunt the jungle south of Grom'gol, out towards the west coast."] = "潛獵者迅猛龍狩獵叢林在格羅姆高以南，出朝西海岸方向。",
	["The stone stands in the pass out of Mulgore, on your way east. Use the Cenarion Lunardust there and defeat Lunaclaw."] = "石頭位於穿過離開莫高雷，在你的路東。使用賽納里奧銀塵那裡與擊敗月爪梟獸。",
	["The stone's next task needs Fozruk, a level 42 elite: leave it."] = "石頭的下一個任務需要弗茲魯克，一個42級精英：可先放著不做。",
	["The strongest worgen roam the woods south of Darkshire, west and south of the Tranquil Gardens Cemetery. The Insane Ghoul hides in the small crypt by the cemetery."] = "最強的狼人遊蕩於樹林在夜色鎮以南，西與南的靜謐花園墓場。瘋狂的食屍鬼藏身在小型地穴在旁墓園。",
	["The tar pits lie just south of the refuge. Tar Beasts, Lurkers and Creepers drop the Super Sticky Tar."] = "焦油深坑位於就在營地以南。焦油獸，潛伏者與爬行者掉落極度粘稠的瀝青。",
	["The tears glow on the small isle east of Astranaar."] = "眼淚發光在小型島在阿斯特蘭納以東。",
	["The three druids stand together at the Forsaken camp south of Forest Song."] = "3德魯伊位於一起在被遺忘者營地在林歌神殿以南。",
	["The three ghostly pirates haunt the jungle north of Booty Bay, near Zanzil's camps: Maury and Jon-Jon stand together, Chucky further east."] = "3幽靈海盜出沒叢林在藏寶海灣以北，在贊吉爾的營地附近：莫里與喬恩喬恩位於一起，查基更遠處東。",
	["The three nests sit together in the Raptor Grounds south-west of the oasis; Sunscale Scytheclaws guard them."] = "3巢坐一起在迅猛龍巢穴在綠洲以西南；赤鱗鐮爪龍守衛它們。",
	["The three pieces of the doll lie in the ruined houses of Darrowshire; picking one up can call out ghosts. Combine them into the doll."] = "3碎片的人偶位於毀壞的房屋的達隆郡；採摘1上可以召喚出幽靈。合成它們進入人偶。",
	["The three ships lie off the Wild Shore. The crews are 42-45, Stillwater 45, Keelhaul 46 and Fleet Master Firallon 48: at 41 this is a fight for a group, or for the end of the guide. If you go, swim out and pull the crew to the rail one at a time. A scroll, Cortello's Riddle, lies on the ships' decks: take it."] = "3船隻位於偏離/關閉狂野海岸。船員是42-45，靜水45，拖行刑46與艦隊指揮官菲爾拉倫48：在41此是一個迎戰需要組隊完成，或給盡頭的指南。如果你前往，游泳出與拉怪船員前往船舷1在一個時間。一個捲軸，科泰羅的謎題，位於船隻的甲板：接取它。",
	["The tomes lie in the ruined keep west of Strahnbrad; Argus Shadow Mages hold the ruins."] = "典籍位於毀壞的保留在斯坦恩布萊德以西；暗影大法師要塞廢墟。",
	["The tool buckets with the slugs lie around the Venture Co. drill site in the Sludge Fen, east of Wenikee."] = "工具桶與蛞蝓位於周圍風險投資公司演習地點在淤泥沼澤，在維妮·布特巴克以東。",
	["The tortured druids and sentinels haunt the ruined village south-west of Layo."] = "受折磨的德魯伊與哨兵出沒毀壞的村莊在萊耶·星擊以西南。",
	["The tougher Wastewander rogues, shadow mages and assassins camp south-east of Gadgetzan, south of the bandits. Leave Caliph Scorpidsting in the middle of the southern camp for later."] = "更棘手的廢土竊賊潛行者，暗影法師與刺客營地在加基森以東南，在強盜以南。跳過卡利夫·斯科比斯汀在南部營地給稍後的中央。",
	["The town hall is on the west side of Hillsbrad. Magistrate Burnside (30) and Clerk Horrace Whitesteed are inside with the Town Registry; the Proclamation is pinned up beside it. Councilmen walk the town."] = "城鎮大廳是在希爾斯布萊德的西側。波恩塞德鎮長（30）與書記員赫拉斯·懷特斯蒂德是內部與城鎮名冊；告示是釘在上旁邊它。議員步行城鎮。",
	["The tram arrives in the Dwarven District. Ilsa Corbin trains warriors in Old Town; Harry Burlguard and Bartleby stand together by the Pig and Whistle Tavern there. Bartleby fights you for his mug."] = "地鐵抵達在矮人區。伊爾薩·考賓訓練戰士在舊城區；哈里·伯加德與巴特萊比位於一起在旁豬和哨聲旅店那裡。巴特萊比戰鬥你給他的酒杯。",
	["The treants wander the forest roads between the camp and the middle of Feralas; there are only a few, so look along the paths."] = "樹人遊蕩森林道路在營地與中間的之間菲拉斯；那裡是僅一個少量，因此查看沿著小徑。",
	["The turncoat's house is in the Gustberry Lowlands north-west of Valanaar. Fendaal Windstone waits nearby; his assassins lurk around the house."] = "叛徒的房屋是在風莓低地在瓦拉納爾以西北。芬達爾·風石等候附近；他的刺客潛伏在房屋周圍。",
	["The two stand together at the western end of the road."] = "2位於一起在道路的西端。",
	["The two wrecks lie in the bay west of the cove. The charts and logs are inside them; the gems lie on the sea floor around them. Daggerspine naga swim the whole bay."] = "2殘骸位於海灣在小灣以西。海圖與原木是內部它們；寶石位於大海樓層周圍它們。匕首沼納迦游泳整個海灣。",
	["The vial is filled in Darnassus: keep it"] = "小瓶是裝滿的在達納蘇斯：請保留該任務/物品",
	["The violet shards glow just off the road a short way west of Hammerfall."] = "紫色碎片發光就在道路兩側一個不足路在落錘鎮以西。",
	["The weapons lie around the Den and the training grounds; the Mottled Boars roam the whole valley floor."] = "武器位於周圍獸穴與訓練領地；雜斑野豬遊蕩於整個山谷樓層。",
	["The well lies north of the village. Well Stones sit around the well, Ambercorn lies under the trees nearby. Kill wolves, cougars, plainstriders and swoops on the way for Mazzranache and Swoop Hunting."] = "水井位於村莊以北。水井石坐在水井周圍，琥珀顆粒位於下方樹木附近。擊殺狼，美洲獅，平原陸行鳥與俯衝在途中給瑪茲拉納其與獵捕猛鷲。",
	["The well lies south-east of the village."] = "水井位於村莊以東南。",
	["The western Winterfall camp sits in the hills between Salfa and Donova. Any furbolg here can drop an Empty Firewater Flask (about one in ten) and, rarely, a Winterfall Ritual Totem: right-click whichever drops. Keep the Runecloth the furbolgs drop for Meilosh."] = "西部寒冬營地位於丘陵在薩爾法與多諾瓦之間。任意熊怪此處可以掉落一個空的火酒瓶（約1在10）與，極少，一個冬泉儀祭圖騰：右鍵點擊任選其一：掉落。保留符文布熊怪掉落給梅羅什。",
	["The western Winterfall furbolgs drop the beads."] = "西部寒冬熊怪掉落串珠。",
	["The western circle is near Thoradin's Wall, where you rode in."] = "西部法陣是在索拉丁之牆附近，在你騎行在。",
	["The wildkin are in Winterspring: keep it"] = "野性梟獸是在冬泉谷：請保留該任務/物品",
	["The wolves roam the fields between Andorhal, Dalson's Tears and the Writhing Haunt. Finish them on the ride back east."] = "狼遊蕩於農田之間安多哈爾，達爾松之淚與蠕行之禍。完成它們在騎行返回東。",
	["The wooden sign beside Spraggle"] = "木制路牌/標誌在斯普拉格·弗勞克旁邊",
	["The wooden sign beside Spraggle Frock"] = "木制路牌/標誌在斯普拉格·弗勞克旁邊",
	["The worgen hold the woods of Brightwood, west of Darkshire and north of the road. Pull them one at a time."] = "狼人要塞樹林的夜色森林，在夜色鎮以西與在道路以北。拉怪它們1在一個時間。",
	["The wreck of the Flying Osprey lies in the shallows south of the keep."] = "殘骸的飛翔的魚鷹位於淺灘在保留以南。",
	["The wrecked caravan lies north-west of the centaurs, east of the road to Thunder Bluff."] = "失事的商隊位於半人馬以西北，在道路前往以東雷霆崖。",
	["The wrecked caravan lies off the road near Biggs."] = "失事的商隊位於道路兩側在衛兵比格斯附近。",
	["The yeti hills start just south-east of Everlook. Every yeti drops fur; only Matriarchs and Patriarchs drop horns, so keep those for after the turn-in."] = "雪人丘陵開始就在永望鎮以東南。每個雪人掉落毛皮；僅刺喉雌龍與族長掉落角，因此保留那些給之後交任務。",
	["The yetis live in the cave in the hills north of Southshore, on your way back south."] = "雪人實測在洞穴內在丘陵在南海鎮以北，在你的路返回南。",
	["The zeppelin lands at the tower just north-east of Orgrimmar's main gate. Follow the road south into Durotar, cross the Southfury River bridge below Far Watch Post and follow the road west to the Crossroads."] = "飛艇之地在哨塔就在奧格瑞瑪的以東北主大門。沿著道路前往南進入杜隆塔爾，穿過怒水河橋在前沿哨所下方與沿著道路前往西前往十字路口。",
	["The zeppelin lands at the tower on the west side of the camp."] = "飛艇之地在哨塔在營地的西側。",
	["The zeppelin lands at the towers outside the Ruins of Lordaeron. Walk west along the road past the ruins and south into Silverpine Forest; follow the road to the Sepulcher."] = "飛艇之地在哨塔外部洛丹倫廢墟。步行西沿著道路經過廢墟與南進入銀松森林；沿著道路前往前往瑟伯切爾。",
	["The zeppelin lands at the towers outside the Undercity: ride down into the city and fly to Tarren Mill."] = "飛艇之地在哨塔外部幽暗城：騎行下進入主城與飛往前往塔倫米爾。",
	["The zeppelin to Orgrimmar leaves from the tower beside Grom'gol; it lands just north-east of Orgrimmar's main gate."] = "飛艇前往奧格瑞瑪離開來自哨塔在格羅姆高旁邊；它之地就在奧格瑞瑪的以東北主大門。",
	["The zeppelin tower stands just north-east of Orgrimmar's main gate; take the Undercity zeppelin."] = "飛艇哨塔位於就在奧格瑞瑪的以東北主大門；接取幽暗城飛艇。",
	["The zeppelin towers stand just outside Orgrimmar's main gate. Take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades (the other one goes to Grom'gol)."] = "飛艇哨塔位於就在奧格瑞瑪的外主大門。搭乘飛艇前往提瑞斯法林地（其他1前往/交給格羅姆高）。",
	["The zombies shamble around the graveyard and the houses just east of the church."] = "僵屍蹣跚遊蕩在墓地與房屋周圍就在教堂以東。",
	["Their follow-ups ask for the same parts again for a buff item and pay no experience: leave them."] = "它們的後續任務需要相同零件再次給一個增益物品與不給經驗值：可先放著不做。",
	["Theldurin sits among the dwarven ruins at Agmond's End, south of the Valley of Fangs."] = "迷失者塞爾杜林位於其中：矮人廢墟在埃格蒙德的營地，南的巨牙谷。",
	["Theldurin the Lost"] = "迷失者塞爾杜林",
	["Theodora's next errand goes to Lotwil east of town and then into Blackrock Depths: skip it."] = "塞朵拉·穆瓦丹尼的下一個差事前往/交給洛特維爾在城鎮東面與然後進入黑石殺戮者深淵：跳過即可。",
	["Theodora's quest in Kargath needs level 52. The Tar Lurkers and Tar Lords just south of the refuge are the closest camp."] = "塞朵拉·穆瓦丹尼的任務在卡加斯需要52級。焦油潛伏者與焦油獸王就在營地是最近的營地以南。",
	["Theramore Guard Badge"] = "塞拉摩守衛徽章",
	["Theramore Lieutenant"] = "塞拉摩海軍上尉",
	["Thersa Windsong, beside him"] = "瑟爾薩·風歌，旁邊他",
	["Therylune"] = "瑟瑞露尼",
	["Therysil"] = "瑟瑞希爾",
	["Thick Yeti Fur"] = "厚雪人毛皮",
	["Thick Yeti Hide"] = "厚重的雪人皮",
	["Third Relic Fragment"] = "第三塊遺物碎片",
	["Third Witherbark Cage"] = "第三個枯木牢籠",
	["This step cannot check the whole map by itself yet; it becomes a tracked goal once the Legacy achievement ids are recorded."] = "此步驟無法查看整個地圖在旁其本身尚；它變為一個追蹤的目標一次傳承成就 ID 是記錄。",
	["Thistleshrub Rootshaper"] = "灌木塑根者",
	["Thomas, in the Cathedral of Light"] = "托馬斯，在聖光大教堂",
	["Thor; skip the free flight it offers"] = "索爾；跳過它提供的免費飛行",
	["Thorium Plated Dagger"] = "瑟銀匕首",
	["Thorium Point, on the scaffolds in the north-west of Searing Gorge, is the Brotherhood's outpost. The Thorium Brotherhood starts out Neutral. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "瑟銀哨塔，在腳手架在灼熱峽谷以西北，是兄弟會的前哨站。瑟銀兄弟會始於出中立。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["Thork"] = "索克",
	["Thork, at the top of the tower"] = "索克，在哨塔的頂部",
	["Thork. Keep it: Kadrak at the Mor'shan Rampart, next guide"] = "索克。請保留該任務/物品：卡德拉克在莫爾杉農場，下一個指南",
	["Thorsen patrols the road north of camp, toward the Rebel Camp."] = "列兵索爾森巡邏於道路在營地北面，朝向反抗軍營地。",
	["Thotar"] = "索塔爾",
	["Thotar: Ormak Grimshot in Orgrimmar teaches Beast Training"] = "索塔爾：奧瑪克在奧格瑞瑪傳授訓練野獸",
	["Thra"] = "斯拉",
	["Thra and Migi sit behind Grommash Hold in the Valley of Wisdom; the Smooth Boulders lie around them. Train while you are in the city (Druids and Paladins have no trainer here). The next guide starts at Doras, the wind rider master in the Valley of Strength."] = "斯拉與米吉坐在格羅瑪什要塞後面在智慧谷；光滑的巨石位於周圍它們。訓練當你是在主城（德魯伊與聖騎士有無訓練師此處）。下一個指南始於多拉斯，雙足飛龍管理員在力量谷。",
	["Thrall, inside Grommash Hold"] = "薩爾，在格羅瑪什要塞內",
	["Three containers in the murloc hovels, south to north: the Damaged Crate, then the Sealed Barrel, then the Half-buried Barrel at the north end."] = "3容器在魚人棚屋，南前往北：破損的木箱，然後密封的桶，然後半埋的大桶在北盡頭。",
	["Thresher Eyes"] = "蛇頸龍的眼球",
	["Through the Timbermaw tunnel to Moonglade. Umber reads in a house in Nighthaven."] = "穿過木喉隧道前往月光林地。阿姆伯爾寫著在一個房屋在永夜港。",
	["Through the pass and east along the northern cliffs to Marshal's Refuge. Linken stands by the cave; J.D. Collie is inside it."] = "穿過穿過與東沿著北部懸崖前往馬紹爾營地。林克站在旁邊：洞穴；科琳是內部它。",
	["Thun'grim camps beside the road east of the Crossroads."] = "索恩格瑞姆·火眼紮營在道路東的旁邊十字路口。",
	["Thun'grim camps beside the road east toward Ratchet."] = "索恩格瑞姆·火眼紮營在道路東朝向旁邊棘齒城。",
	["Thun'grim camps beside the road from the Crossroads to Ratchet. The Stolen Iron Chest sits in the south of the Razormane camp just north of him."] = "索恩格瑞姆·火眼紮營在道路來自旁邊十字路口前往棘齒城。被偷走的鐵箱位於南面的刺鬃營地就在他北面。",
	["Thunder Bluff is beside the landing: ride up a lift and learn the flight path from Tal, the wind rider master. Then follow the road south past Bloodhoof Village and through the eastern pass into the Barrens."] = "雷霆崖是在陸地旁邊：騎行上一個升降梯與學習飛行點來自塔爾，雙足飛龍管理員。然後沿著道路前往南經過血蹄村與穿過東部穿過進入貧瘠之地。",
	["Thunder Lizards and Lightning Hides graze just across the bridge below Far Watch Post."] = "雷霆蜥蜴與閃電蜥蜴吃草就在穿過橋在前沿哨所下方。",
	["Thunder Lizards and Lightning Hides graze on Thunder Ridge across the bridge; any of them can drop a Singed Scale."] = "雷霆蜥蜴與閃電蜥蜴吃草在雷霆山穿過橋；任意的它們可以掉落一個燒焦的鱗片。",
	["Thunder Lizards and Lightning Hides graze on Thunder Ridge, just west and south-west of Rezlak."] = "雷霆蜥蜴與閃電蜥蜴吃草在雷霆山，就在西與在雷茲拉克以西南。",
	["Thunderhawk Cloudscrapers circle over the same plains south of the camp."] = "雷鷹破雲者法陣越過相同平原在營地以南。",
	["Thunderhead (59%), Owatanka (35%) in The Barrens, or wherever the arrow points"] = "電角蜥蜴（59%），奧瓦坦卡（35%）在貧瘠之地，或跟隨箭頭指示位置",
	["Thunderheads graze on the plains just south of Camp Taurajo. Owatanka, a blue thunder lizard, roams among them: his Tailspike starts a quest."] = "電角蜥蜴吃草在平原就在陶拉祖營地以南。奧瓦坦卡，一個藍色雷電蜥蜴，遊蕩在其中：它們：他的尾刺始於一個任務。",
	["Thunderhorn Cleansing Totem"] = "雷角之井淨化圖騰",
	["Thundering Key"] = "雷霆鑰匙",
	["Thundris Windweaver"] = "桑迪斯·織風",
	["Thundris Windweaver, north end of the village"] = "桑迪斯·織風，北盡頭的村莊",
	["Thurman Agamand"] = "薩爾曼·阿加曼德",
	["Thyssiana"] = "賽希亞娜",
	["Thysta"] = "塞斯塔",
	["Thysta, the flight master, stands just east of the zeppelin tower. Fly to Stonard: the next guide starts there."] = "塞斯塔，飛行管理員，位於就在飛艇哨塔以東。飛往斯通納德：下一個指南始於那裡。",
	["Ticks once you finish the chain"] = "一旦滿足即勾選：你完成任務鏈",
	["Tide Crawlers scuttle along the shore below the village; Buzzbox 827 stands on the beach just south of the docks. Darkshore Threshers swim in the shallows. The Beached Sea Creature lies on the shore just south of the village."] = "潮行蟹爬行沿著岸邊在村莊下方；傳聲盒827號位於海灘上就在碼頭以南。黑海岸蛇頸龍游泳在淺灘。擱淺的海洋生物位於岸邊就在村莊以南。",
	["Tideress, a corrupted water elemental, drifts in Mystral Lake. Her Befouled Water Globe starts a quest for Splintertree."] = "泰德雷斯，一個腐化的水元素，漂浮在密斯特拉湖。她的被污染的水球始於一個任務給碎木崗哨。",
	["Timber and iron piles lie around the keep and along the harbor's walls."] = "狂暴的冬狼與鐵堆位於保留與沿著港口周圍的城牆。",
	["Timbermaw Hold starts out Hostile, and its furbolgs in the tunnels attack until you reach Unfriendly. Every Deadwood and Winterfall furbolg you kill raises it, so the quests below pay twice. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "木喉要塞始於出敵對，與它的熊怪在隧道攻擊直到你抵達冷淡。每個死木與寒冬熊怪你擊殺提升它，因此任務下方獎勵兩次。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["Tinkee Steamboil"] = "丁奇·斯迪波爾",
	["Tirion lives in a small hut on the border river, north-east of the lumber camp. Hand in Of Forgotten Memories if you finished it."] = "提里奧住在一個小型小屋在邊界河流，在伐木場營地以東北。上交遺忘的記憶如果你完成後它。",
	["Tirion's hunts are in the Eastern Plaguelands: keep them for later."] = "提里奧的狩獵是在東瘟疫之地：留著稍後做。",
	["Tirion's next task, Of Lost Honor, is not on this route. Skip it."] = "提里奧的下一個任務，失落的榮耀，是不在本路線內。跳過即可。",
	["Tiza Battleforge"] = "蒂薩·熱爐",
	["Tiza Battleforge: Redemption"] = "蒂薩·熱爐：救贖",
	["Tog'thar's ball and chain"] = "托格薩的鐵球與任務鏈",
	["Tognus Flintfire"] = "托格努斯·燧火",
	["Tok'Kar"] = "托克卡爾",
	["Tomas"] = "廚師托馬斯",
	["Tomas cooks in the inn's kitchen."] = "廚師托馬斯烹飪在旅店內的廚房。",
	["Tome of the Cabal"] = "陰謀之書",
	["Tonga Runetotem"] = "圖加·符文圖騰",
	["Tooga"] = "圖加",
	["Tooga waits in the valley. Walk him all the way to his wife Torta in Steamwheedle Port, north-east across the desert: stay close, slow down for him and fight off what attacks him. Do not mount or hearth out of his reach. Yeh'kinya stands in the port too."] = "圖加等候於山谷。步行他全部路前往他的妻子托爾塔在熱砂港，東北穿過沙漠：留在靠近，緩慢下給他與迎戰偏離/關閉所攻擊他。做不坐騎或爐石返回出的他的抵達。葉基亞位於港口也。",
	["Tor'gan"] = "托爾甘",
	["Tordrin Sternblade"] = "托德林·嚴刃",
	["Tordrin Sternblade stands behind the Abbey, by the stables."] = "托德林·嚴刃位於修道院後面，在旁獸欄。",
	["Torm Ragetotem"] = "托姆·狂暴圖騰",
	["Torn Fin Oracle"] = "碎鰭智者",
	["Torn Fin Tidehunter"] = "碎鰭潮行魚人",
	["Torn Murloc Fins"] = "破損的魚人鱗片",
	["Torn Scroll"] = "破損的捲軸",
	["Torta"] = "托爾塔",
	["Torta, Steamwheedle Port"] = "托爾塔，熱砂港",
	["Tortured Druid"] = "被折磨的德魯伊",
	["Tortured Sentinel"] = "被折磨的哨兵",
	["Torwa camps in the south-east corner of the crater."] = "托爾瓦紮營在東南面角落的環形山。",
	["Torwa now asks for U'cha's pelt, back in the north-east cave: skip it."] = "托爾瓦現在需要尤爾查的毛皮，返回在東北面洞穴：跳過即可。",
	["Tough Condor Meat"] = "硬禿鷲肉",
	["Tough Wolf Meat"] = "硬狼肉",
	["Toxic Horrors are in Felwood, on a later trip: keep it if you have it."] = "劇毒之水是在費伍德森林，在後續行程中：請保留該任務/物品如果你已解鎖/擁有它。",
	["Trackmaster Zherin"] = "賽道管理員澤爾林",
	["Train in Stormwind, north through Elwynn Forest. Then take the boat from Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine."] = "訓練在暴風城，北穿過艾爾文森林。然後乘船來自暴風城港口前往奧伯丁。",
	["Train while you are in the Undercity: the trainers stand in the War Quarter, the Rogues' Quarter and the Magic Quarter (Paladins: Garen Largo)."] = "訓練當你是在幽暗城：訓練師位於軍事區，潛行者的區與魔法區（聖騎士：加倫·拉爾戈）。",
	["Train your new spells."] = "訓練你的新法術。",
	["Tran'rek"] = "特蘭雷克",
	["Tran'rek's tar and Pestlezugg's samples come from Un'Goro Crater."] = "特蘭雷克的焦油與煉金師匹斯特蘇格的樣本來自安戈洛環形山。",
	["Tran'rek, north side of town"] = "特蘭雷克，北一側的城鎮",
	["Tree Frog Box, 1g"] = "樹蛙盒，1金",
	["Trelane's Wand of Invocation"] = "特雷萊恩的符咒魔杖",
	["Triage: treat the wounded soldiers in the doctor's tent with the bandages the doctor gives you, the most critical first, before any of them die."] = "救死扶傷：點心受傷的士兵在醫生的帳篷與繃帶醫生給你，大多數危急的第一，之前任意的它們死亡。",
	["Troll Tribal Necklace"] = "巨魔部族項鍊",
	["Troyas Moonbreeze: his answer waits in Rut'theran Village, later"] = "特洛亞斯·月風：他的答案等候於魯瑟蘭村，稍後",
	["Trull Failbane"] = "特魯爾·法貝恩",
	["Trull Failbane: the owlbeasts are in Winterspring"] = "特魯爾·法貝恩：梟獸是在冬泉谷",
	["Trull's next Wild Guardians would bring you back here from Winterspring. Skip it."] = "特魯爾·法貝恩的下一個冬泉谷的梟獸會攜帶你返回此處來自冬泉谷。跳過即可。",
	["Tsunaman"] = "蘇納曼",
	["Tumbled Crystal"] = "打磨過的水晶",
	["Tundra MacGrann"] = "圖德拉·馬克格拉恩",
	["Tundra MacGrann camps in Chill Breeze Valley, south of Brewnall. His meats are in the locker in Old Icebeard's cave to the north-east of his camp: grab them and leave quickly."] = "圖德拉·馬克格拉恩紮營於寒風峽谷，在烈酒村以南。他的肉是在儲物櫃在冰須的洞穴向東北的他的營地：拿取它們與跳過迅速。",
	["Turak Runetotem"] = "圖拉克·符文圖騰",
	["Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise; Alodan the Hopeful"] = "圖拉克·符文圖騰在長者高地；懷抱希望的阿洛丹",
	["Turak Runetotem trains druids on Elder Rise. He teaches you Teleport: Moonglade; Dendrite Starblaze's welcome waits for your Cat Form trip at about 23 (forever/horde/04-the-barrens)."] = "圖拉克·符文圖騰訓練德魯伊在長者高地。他傳授你傳送：月光林地；德迪利特·星焰的歡迎信等候給你的獵豹形態行程在約23（永恆服/部落/04--貧瘠之地）。",
	["Turak Runetotem, Elder Rise"] = "圖拉克·符文圖騰，長者高地",
	["Turak Runetotem: Aquatic Form"] = "圖拉克·符文圖騰：水棲形態",
	["Turak Runetotem: Cat Form"] = "圖拉克·符文圖騰：獵豹形態",
	["Turroc"] = "圖羅克",
	["Turtle Meat"] = "海龜肉",
	["Twilight Geolords needs level 60"] = "暮光地王需要60級",
	["Twilight Keeper Exeter"] = "暮光守護者埃克斯特",
	["Twilight Keeper Exeter holds the cultists' camp in the far south-west."] = "暮光守護者埃克斯特持有邪教徒的紮營於遠處西南。",
	["Twilight Keeper Exeter walks the Vanguard camp in the far south-west. Every cultist here drops Encrypted Twilight Texts, quest or not: collect twenty, ten for Bor Wildmane and ten for Ortell."] = "暮光守護者埃克斯特步行先鋒紮營於遠處西南。每個邪教徒此處掉落加密的暮光文本，任務或不：收集20，10給鮑爾·蠻鬃與10給隱士奧泰爾。",
	["Twilight Keeper Havunth stands in the outpost west of Cenarion Hold. Top your Encrypted Twilight Texts up to twenty on the cultists here."] = "暮光守護者哈弗斯位於前哨站在塞納里奧要塞以西。頂部你的加密的暮光文本上前往20在邪教徒此處。",
	["Twilight Keeper Mayna holds the camp in the west."] = "暮光守護者瑪恩納持有營地在西面。",
	["Twilight Tablet Fragments"] = "暮光石板碎片",
	["Twilight's Hammer cultists"] = "暮光之錘邪教徒",
	["Twilight's Hammer cultists hold the camps in western Silithus. Twilight Geolords and Stonecallers mix here; any cultist can drop an Encrypted Twilight Text. Every cultist kill also counts toward the Cenarion Circle. The Geolords count for Twilight Geolords only if you are 60 and took it."] = "暮光之錘邪教徒要塞紮營於西部希利蘇斯。暮光地王與暮光喚石者混合此處；任意邪教徒可以掉落一個暮光密文信。每個邪教徒擊殺也計入朝向塞納里奧議會。地質領主計入給暮光地王僅如果你是60與拿走它。",
	["Twitching Antennae from the silithid"] = "抽動的觸角來自異種蟲",
	["Two wrecks lie on the sea floor in the bay north of Auberdine; each holds a lockbox. Reef Crawlers and Encrusted Tide Crawlers line this shore."] = "2殘骸位於大海樓層在海灣在奧伯丁以北；每個持有一個鎖箱。暗礁蟹與硬殼潮行蟹路線此岸邊。",
	["Tymor"] = "法師泰摩爾",
	["Tymor, Mystic Ward"] = "法師泰摩爾，秘法區",
	["Tyrande Whisperwind"] = "泰蘭德·語風",
	["Tyranis' Pendant"] = "泰拉尼斯的墜飾",
	["Ukor stands on the road at the valley's eastern exit."] = "烏克爾位於路上在山谷的東部出口。",
	["Uldaman (level 41-51; may count in the 46-60 bracket)"] = "奧達曼（41-51級；可能計入在46-60等級段）",
	["Ultham Ironhorn"] = "奧薩姆·鐵角",
	["Ultham Ironhorn, riding trainer"] = "奧薩姆·鐵角，騎術訓練師",
	["Umber in Moonglade: keep it"] = "阿姆伯爾在月光林地：請保留該任務/物品",
	["Umi Rumplesnicker"] = "烏米",
	["Umi's Mechanical Yeti"] = "烏米的機械雪人",
	["Umi's third prank targets goblins in Gadgetzan and Un'Goro: keep it for later."] = "烏米的第三惡作劇目標地精在加基森與安戈洛環形山：留著稍後做。",
	["Umpi, next to Lydon"] = "烏比，在藥劑師林度恩旁邊",
	["Un'Goro Ash"] = "安戈洛灰燼",
	["Un'Goro Gorilla Pelt"] = "安戈洛猩猩的皮",
	["Un'Goro Soil"] = "安戈洛的泥土",
	["Un'Goro Soil is gathered in the next guide; Magatha's payment goes back to Jediga later."] = "安戈洛的泥土是收集的在下一份指南中；瑪加薩·野性圖騰的報酬交回給傑迪加稍後。",
	["Un'Goro Stomper Pelt"] = "安戈洛巨猩猩的皮",
	["Un'Goro Thunderer Pelt"] = "安戈洛大猩猩的皮",
	["Uncracked Chillwind Horn"] = "完整的冰風奇美拉角",
	["Undead Ravager"] = "亡靈劫掠者",
	["Undead Ravagers roam the bone fields south of the Magram village, east of the Coven; at the far south-east, use the Crate of Ghost Magnets to draw the Magrami Spectres."] = "亡靈劫掠者遊蕩於骨頭農田南的瑪格拉姆村莊，在女巫團以東；在遠處東南，使用幽靈磁鐵箱前往引出瑪格拉姆鬼魂。",
	["Undelivered Parcel, from the backpacks"] = "未遞送的包裹，來自背包",
	["Unfinished Skeleton Key"] = "未完工的骷髏鑰匙",
	["Unpainted Mechanostrider, 20g"] = "未塗色的機械陸行鳥，20金",
	["Unpopped Darkmist Eye"] = "黑霧蜘蛛的眼球",
	["Upper Blackrock Spire"] = "上層黑石塔",
	["Upper Blackrock Spire is a raid group of up to ten, level 58-60. Use Kibler's cage on a Bloodaxe Worg Pup (Halycon's den) to get the Caged Worg Pup."] = "上層黑石塔是一個團隊副本隊伍的上前往10，58-60級。使用基佈雷爾的籠子在一個血斧座狼幼崽（哈雷肯的獸穴）前往獲取籠中的座狼幼崽。",
	["Ur'endra roams the slopes just south of the turncoat's house."] = "烏爾恩德拉遊蕩於山坡就在叛徒以南的房屋。",
	["Ur'endra, in the highlands south-west of the cultist"] = "烏爾恩德拉，在高地在邪教徒以西南",
	["Ur'kyo"] = "烏爾庫",
	["Ur'kyo stands in the Valley of Spirits, on the city's west side."] = "烏爾庫位於精神谷，在主城的西一側。",
	["Ur'kyo: Aelthalyste in the Undercity, two guides on"] = "烏爾庫：艾薩萊斯特在幽暗城，2指南在",
	["Ur'kyo: Hex of Weakness"] = "烏爾庫：虛弱妖術",
	["Ur'kyo: Shadowguard"] = "烏爾庫：暗影守衛",
	["Urs'endris"] = "烏爾森德里斯",
	["Urs'endris waits by the falls just north of the watchtower."] = "烏爾森德里斯等候於墜落就在哨塔以北。",
	["Urs'endris waits by the falls north-east of Valanaar. Ur'endra prowls the Shen'dar Highlands west of Valanaar, by the road you take next."] = "烏爾森德里斯等候於墜落在瓦拉納爾以東北。烏爾恩德拉潛行遊蕩申達爾高地在瓦拉納爾以西，在路邊你接取下一個。",
	["Urs'endris: Bear Form"] = "烏爾森德里斯：熊形態",
	["Use Smeed's Kodo Kombobulator on an Aged Kodo and walk the tamed kodo back to his camp, five times; Aged Kodos also drop the hides."] = "使用斯米德的科多獸誘引器在一個老邁的科多獸與步行馴服的科多獸返回前往他的營地，5次；老邁的科多獸也掉落藏身。",
	["Use Smeed's Kodo Kombobulator on an Aged, Dying or Ancient Kodo in the graveyard and walk the tamed kodo back to Smeed. Five kodos, one at a time."] = "使用斯米德的科多獸誘引器在一個老邁的科多獸，瀕死的科多獸或遠古科多獸在墓地與步行馴服的科多獸返回前往斯米德。5科多獸，1在一個時間。",
	["Use Umi's Mechanical Yeti on Quixxil"] = "使用烏米的機械雪人在奎克希爾",
	["Use Umi's Mechanical Yeti on Sprinkle, the goblin girl in Gadgetzan. Quixxil and Legacki are scared later in the route."] = "使用烏米的機械雪人在斯普琳科，地精女孩在加基森。奎克希爾與萊加奇是受驚的在路線稍後階段。",
	["Use Walk on Air"] = "使用步行在空氣",
	["Use the Amethyst Phial at the moonwell"] = "使用紫水晶瓶在月亮井處",
	["Use the Aspect of Neptulon on the poisoned water elementals of Eastern Plaguelands, then loot their Discordant Bracers (12). Our data has no spawn points for those elementals."] = "使用海神之水在中毒的水元素的東瘟疫之地，然後拾取它們的不諧護腕（12）。我們的數據有無刷新點數給那些元素。",
	["Use the Beacon Torch at the foot of each of the four watchtowers around the edge of Andorhal, north of the camp."] = "使用信號火炬在山腳的每個的4哨塔在邊緣的周圍安多哈爾，在營地以北。",
	["Use the Crystal Phial at the moonwell"] = "使用水晶之瓶在月亮井處",
	["Use the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on a Black Broodling on the slopes east of Flame Crest just before it dies, then loot the essence it leaves."] = "使用龍靈採集器900型在一個黑色小龍在山坡在烈焰峰以東就在之前它死亡，然後拾取精華它離開。",
	["Use the Empty Canteen at the corrupted moonwell in the middle of Jaedenar. If you freed Arko'narin, go back into Shadow Hold for the succubus Rakaiah; Trey Lightforge's remains lie beside her."] = "使用空壺在腐化的月亮井在加德納爾的中央。如果你被解救的亞科納琳，前往返回進入暗影堡給魅魔拉凱雅；特雷·萊弗治的殘骸特雷·萊弗治的殘骸的遺骸位於旁邊她的。",
	["Use the Executor's Motivator on five idle Deathguards around town"] = "使用執行官的激勵棒在5閒置的死亡衛兵周圍城鎮",
	["Use the Jade Phial at the moonwell"] = "使用翡翠瓶在月亮井處",
	["Use the Mangled Journal to start it"] = "使用殘破的日記前往開始它",
	["Use the Symbol of Life on Henze Faulk"] = "使用生命符記在亨茲·法奧克",
	["Use the Symbol of Life on Narm Faulk"] = "使用生命符記在納姆·法奧克",
	["Use the Temporal Displacer by the grain silos to draw out Temporal Parasites. The Annals of Darrowshire is one of the musty tomes in the town hall. Every skeleton in town drops Skeletal Fragments."] = "使用時空置換器在旁穀物糧倉前往引出出時光寄生蟲。達隆郡的歷史是1的發霉的典籍在市政廳內。每個骷髏在城鎮掉落骸骨碎片。",
	["Use the Tourmaline Phial at the moonwell"] = "使用紅玉瓶在月亮井處",
	["Use the jars on slain oozes"] = "使用罐子在擊殺軟泥怪",
	["Uthel'nay, Valley of Spirits"] = "尤塞爾奈，精神谷",
	["Uzzek"] = "猶塞克",
	["Vahlarriel Demonslayer"] = "瓦拉里爾·屠魔者",
	["Valennia Stormfist"] = "瓦倫妮婭·風暴之拳",
	["Valennia Stormfist and Talaanis Shadowsong stand at the north end of Valanaar, Elaadrin Evengale and Dondallion Whisperwind at the south end."] = "瓦倫妮婭·風暴之拳與塔拉尼斯·影歌位於瓦拉納爾的北端，艾拉德琳·暮風與唐達里奧·語風在南盡頭。",
	["Valennia Stormfist, in the sanctum"] = "瓦倫妮婭·風暴之拳，在聖殿",
	["Valley of Honor, then the Cleft of Shadow and the Valley of Spirits."] = "榮譽谷，然後暗影裂口與精神谷。",
	["Valreaa Valewind"] = "瓦爾蕾婭·谷風",
	["Valstag Ironjaw, by the keep"] = "瓦斯塔格·鐵齶，在要塞旁",
	["Vayn Moongaze"] = "薇恩·月凝",
	["Vayn Moongaze sells the squirrel (50s) once you are Revered with the Nightclaw Druids."] = "薇恩·月凝出售松鼠（50銀）一次你是與夜爪德魯伊崇敬。",
	["Vayn Moongaze, Jorel Windsinger and Naaleos Leafwhisper are north-east of Elegael; Commander Haalien stands east of them. Haalien also drops a Ripped Missive."] = "薇恩·月凝，喬雷爾·風歌與納里奧斯·葉語是在艾蕾蓋爾·棘爪以東北；指揮官哈利恩位於它們東面。哈利恩也掉落一個撕裂的密信。",
	["Vehena takes cloth for Darkspear Trolls in the Valley of Spirits, Orgrimmar. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "維赫納接收布料給暗矛巨魔在精神谷，奧格瑞瑪。第一捐獻的毛料，絲綢，魔紋布與符文布（60布料每個）已完成一次與交給大多數聲望每布料；之後它們，更多的符文布可重復直到崇拜。崇拜與另一個種族的主城允許你購買該種族的坐騎。永恆服的傳承外交家特權提高聲望提升。",
	["Vel'rin Fang"] = "維爾林·長牙",
	["Velma Warnam and Zachariah Post's stable are in Brill, Tirisfal Glades. At 40 Velma Warnam teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Horde race ride these."] = "維爾瑪·瓦納姆與撒迦利亞·普斯特的獸欄是在布瑞爾，提瑞斯法林地。在40維爾瑪·瓦納姆傳授騎術（100金每暴雪的設計師），與學習它給你一個坐騎。永恆服客戶端允許每個部落種族騎行這些。",
	["Velma Warnam and Zachariah Post's stable are in Brill, Tirisfal Glades. At 60 Velma Warnam teaches Journeyman Riding (1,000g per Blizzard's designers); Blizzard says learning riding grants a mount. The Forever client sells each skeletal warhorse for 200g at level 60."] = "維爾瑪·瓦納姆與撒迦利亞·普斯特的獸欄是在布瑞爾，提瑞斯法林地。在60維爾瑪·瓦納姆傳授中級騎術（1,000金每暴雪的設計師）；暴雪說學習騎行獎勵一匹坐騎。永恆服客戶端出售每個骷髏戰馬給200金在60級。",
	["Velma Warnam, riding trainer"] = "維爾瑪·瓦納姆，騎術訓練師",
	["Venom Fern Extract, from a Kurzen Supplies crate"] = "毒草汁液，來自一個庫爾森補給品木箱",
	["Ventaari Brightwish"] = "文塔莉·明願",
	["Venture Co. Deforester"] = "風險投資公司砍樹工",
	["Venture Co. Enforcers at the Boulder Lode Mine (level 16-17) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "風險投資公司執行者在石礦洞（16-17級）掉落它此處。拍賣行有效也。",
	["Venture Co. Logger"] = "風險投資公司樵夫",
	["Venya Marthand"] = "溫雅·瑪山德",
	["Venya Marthand: Summon Imp"] = "溫雅·瑪山德：召喚小鬼",
	["Verna Furlbrow"] = "弗娜·法布隆",
	["Verog walks among the Kolkar at the Stagnant Oasis south-east of the Crossroads."] = "維羅戈步行在其中：科卡爾在死水綠洲東南的十字路口。",
	["Veron Amberstill"] = "維隆·凍石",
	["Veron Amberstill sells the other colours (200g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "維隆·凍石出售其他顏色（200金每個在永恆服客戶端）。購買任意你需要，或無如果坐騎你曾是給予的是1你像。",
	["Veron Amberstill sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "維隆·凍石出售其他顏色（20金每個在永恆服客戶端）。購買任意你需要，或無如果坐騎你曾是給予的是1你像。",
	["Veron Amberstill: other colours, 20g"] = "維隆·凍石：其他顏色，20金",
	["Vesprystus"] = "維斯派塔斯",
	["Vestia Moonspear"] = "維斯提亞·月矛",
	["Vial of Animal Blood: Stonetusk Boars"] = "一瓶動物鮮血：石牙野豬",
	["Vial of Blessed Water"] = "祝福之水",
	["Vial of Spider Venom"] = "瓶裝蜘蛛毒液",
	["Videre Elixir"] = "視靈藥劑",
	["Viktori Prism'Antras"] = "維克托·安特拉斯",
	["Viktori Prism'Antras, at the east end of town"] = "維克托·安特拉斯，在東盡頭的城鎮",
	["Viktori's house stands at the east end of town. Herble Baubbletump sells engineering goods in the house beside it."] = "維克托·安特拉斯的房屋位於東盡頭的城鎮。赫爾伯出售工程學商品在房屋旁邊它。",
	["Vile Slimes, Western Plaguelands"] = "可憎的軟泥怪，西瘟疫之地",
	["Vincent Hyal"] = "文森特·海厄爾",
	["Vincent Hyal, Mikhail and Tapoke Jahn are all at Menethil's inn; Tapoke fights you when you talk to Mikhail, but gives up once beaten."] = "文森特·海厄爾，米克哈爾與塔波克·詹是全部在米奈希爾的旅店；塔波克戰鬥你當你對話前往米克哈爾，但給予上一次被毆打的。",
	["Volcor"] = "沃科爾",
	["Volcor hides in the hills east of the Master's Glaive. Help him back to the road; he fights on his way out."] = "沃科爾藏身在丘陵東的主宰之劍。幫助他返回前往道路；他戰鬥在他的路出。",
	["Vrang Wildgore"] = "弗朗恩·凝血",
	["Vulgara lurks in the hills south-west of the village, on the way back. Vulgara the Insatiable is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "沃爾加拉潛伏在丘陵在村莊以西南，在返回途中。貪得無厭的沃爾加拉為精英：建議組隊前往。",
	["Vulgara lurks south of the village, among the Prideclaws. Vulgara is elite: grouping up is advised."] = "沃爾加拉潛伏在村莊以南，在其中：傲爪獸。沃爾加拉為精英：建議組隊前往。",
	["Vulgara's Head"] = "瓦爾加拉的頭顱",
	["Vulture Gizzard"] = "禿鷲的砂囊",
	["WANTED poster"] = "通緝通緝令",
	["Wade across to the northern Echo Isle. The Matriarch prowls among the raptors there."] = "涉水穿過前往北部回音群島。刺喉雌龍潛行遊蕩在其中：迅猛龍那裡。",
	["Wade back west to the shore south of Sen'jin. Durotar Tigers roam it and the Taillasher eggs sit in nests along the beach."] = "涉水返回西前往岸邊在森金村以南。杜隆塔爾猛虎遊蕩它與鞭尾蠍蛋坐在巢沿著海灘。",
	["Wade into the pools to explore them"] = "涉水進入水池前往探索它們",
	["Wailing Caverns (appears after the Disciple of Naralex's event)"] = "哀嚎洞穴（出現之後納拉雷克斯的信徒的事件）",
	["Wait a moment for Eridan"] = "等待一個片刻給艾瑞丹·藍風",
	["Wait a moment, then speak with her again"] = "等待一個片刻，然後對話與她的再次",
	["Walk Lynessa out and keep her alive"] = "步行哨兵莉妮莎·暮花出與保留她的存活",
	["Walk back north; the Crystalvein Mine lies west of the road in the middle of the jungle. The Crystal Spine Basilisks there drop the shards."] = "步行返回北；水晶礦洞位於道路在中間的叢林以西。晶背蜥蜴那裡掉落碎片。",
	["Walk back onto the span: Ebenezer lies under its Arathi end."] = "步行返回登上大橋：埃比尼澤位於下方它的阿拉希高地盡頭。",
	["Walk back south to the Crossroads. The next guide starts here and takes you to Orgrimmar and the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades."] = "步行返回南前往十字路口。下一個指南始於此處與接收你前往奧格瑞瑪與飛艇前往提瑞斯法林地。",
	["Walk back to Hillsbrad Foothills and north through the Alterac Mountains to Chillwind Camp in southern Western Plaguelands."] = "步行返回前往希爾斯布萊德丘陵與北穿過奧特蘭克山脈前往冰風崗在南部西瘟疫之地。",
	["Walk back to Hillsbrad Foothills and north through the Alterac Mountains, or from Tirisfal Glades east past The Bulwark, into Western Plaguelands."] = "步行返回前往希爾斯布萊德丘陵與北穿過奧特蘭克山脈，或來自提瑞斯法林地東經過亡靈壁壘，進入西瘟疫之地。",
	["Walk back up the road to the Crossroads. Savannah Prowlers hunt along it and on the plains west of town: finish the claws before you hand them in."] = "步行返回順著道路往上前往十字路口。草原徘徊者狩獵沿著它與在平原在城鎮西面：完成爪之前你上交它們在。",
	["Walk back west along the road to the Crossroads."] = "步行返回西沿著道路前往十字路口。",
	["Walk back west over the bridge to the Crossroads."] = "步行返回西越過橋前往十字路口。",
	["Walk east from Hillsbrad into the Arathi Highlands (level 30+ creatures off the road), south to the Thandol Span bridge, and across it into the Wetlands. Menethil Harbor is an Alliance town."] = "步行東來自希爾斯布萊德進入阿拉希高地（30級+ 生物道路兩側），南前往薩多爾大橋橋，與穿過它進入濕地。米奈希爾港是一個聯盟城鎮。",
	["Walk east out of Stonetalon (or south out of Ashenvale) into the Barrens. The Crossroads and Camp Taurajo are Horde towns; Ratchet is a neutral port."] = "步行東離開石爪山脈（或南離開灰谷）進入貧瘠之地。十字路口與陶拉祖營地是部落城鎮；棘齒城是一個中立港口。",
	["Walk in through the main gate. Thatog stands in the Valley of Strength; Borstan's Firepit is a few steps north."] = "步行在穿過主大門。薩托格位於力量谷；博斯坦的火坑是一個少量台階北。",
	["Walk into Timbermaw Hold and take the Moonglade branch of the tunnel to Nighthaven."] = "步行進入木喉要塞與接取月光林地樹枝的隧道前往永夜港。",
	["Walk into the Timbermaw Hold tunnel beside Nafien and never attack the Timbermaw furbolgs inside. The tunnel opens into Winterspring; follow the road east to Everlook, the goblin town where the next guide starts."] = "步行進入木喉要塞隧道在納菲恩旁邊與從不攻擊木喉熊怪內部。隧道開啓進入冬泉谷；沿著道路前往東前往永望鎮，地精城鎮在下一個指南始於。",
	["Walk into the mine"] = "步行進入採礦",
	["Walk north to Shen'dar Village; finish the Strider Meat on the Galestriders along the way if you are short."] = "步行北前往申達爾村；完成陸行鳥肉在疾風陸行鳥沿途如果數量還不夠。",
	["Walk on west to Calvin and talk to him: he wants a duel."] = "步行在西前往卡爾文·蒙泰古與對話前往他：他需要一個決鬥。",
	["Walk south along the island to the naga ruins; the gazebo stands among them."] = "步行南沿著島嶼前往納迦廢墟；涼亭位於其中：它們。",
	["Walk south along the west side of the island. Ursal prowls the far south, below the Pools of Arlithrien."] = "步行南沿著西一側的島嶼。烏薩爾潛行遊蕩遠處南，下方阿里斯瑞恩之池。",
	["Walk south from Brill to the Ruins of Lordaeron and down into the Undercity. Carendin Halgar stands in the Magic Quarter. The Scarlet camp is just west of the ruins."] = "步行南來自布瑞爾前往洛丹倫廢墟與下進入幽暗城。凱倫丁·哈加爾位於魔法區。血色營地是就在廢墟以西。",
	["Walk south-east from Brill to the zeppelin towers outside the Ruins of Lordaeron and board the zeppelin to Orgrimmar (the other one goes to Grom'gol)."] = "步行東南來自布瑞爾前往飛艇哨塔外部洛丹倫廢墟與告示板飛艇前往奧格瑞瑪（其他1前往/交給格羅姆高）。",
	["Walk south-east from Thunder Ridge back to Razor Hill."] = "步行東南來自雷霆山返回前往剃刀嶺。",
	["Walk south-west to the Solliden Farmstead; Simmer stands at the farm."] = "步行西南前往索利丹農場；亡靈衛兵希米爾位於農場。",
	["Walk through Timbermaw Hold to Felwood and fly on to the Eastern Kingdoms (Auberdine, the boat to Menethil Harbor). Fly to Southshore and ride north up the road through Alterac to Chillwind Camp."] = "步行穿過木喉要塞前往費伍德森林與飛往在前往東部王國（奧伯丁，船前往米奈希爾港）。飛往南海鎮與騎行北順著道路往上穿過奧特蘭克前往冰風崗。",
	["Walk through the mine"] = "步行穿過採礦",
	["Walk with the caravan south past Kolkar Village; Kolkar ambushers jump it on the way. Stay close until it stops at Scrabblescrew's Camp. The ambushers are 34-35 and come in waves: skip it if you are below 33."] = "步行與商隊南經過科爾卡村；科卡爾伏擊者跳下它在途中。留在靠近直到它停靠在瑟卡布斯庫的營地。伏擊者是34-35與來到在波次：跳過即可如果你是下方33。",
	["Walton"] = "沃爾頓",
	["Warsong Gulch"] = "戰歌峽谷",
	["Warsong Outrider"] = "戰歌偵查騎兵",
	["Warsong Runner"] = "戰歌信使",
	["Warsong Scout"] = "戰歌斥候",
	["Washte Pawne's Feather"] = "瓦希塔帕恩的羽毛",
	["Wastewander Assassin"] = "廢土刺客",
	["Wastewander Bandit"] = "廢土強盜",
	["Wastewander Rogue"] = "廢土遊蕩者",
	["Wastewander Shadow Mage"] = "廢土暗法師",
	["Wastewander Thief"] = "廢土竊賊",
	["Wastewander Water Pouch"] = "廢土水袋",
	["Watcher Backus"] = "守夜人巴庫斯",
	["Watcher Backus, at the north entrance of town"] = "守夜人巴庫斯，在北入口的城鎮",
	["Watcher Biggs"] = "衛兵比格斯",
	["Watcher Dodds stands south of the road, at the Yorgen Farmstead."] = "守夜人道茨位於道路以南，在約根農莊。",
	["Watcher Mahar Ba"] = "看守者馬哈爾巴",
	["Watchmaster Sorigal"] = "守衛隊長索里加爾",
	["Water Elemental Bracers"] = "水元素護腕",
	["Water Elemental Core"] = "水元素核心",
	["Water Seekers, Thornweavers and Hunters hold the camp east of the Crossroads. The supply crates sit at its eastern end. Warriors: the Stolen Iron Chest stands in the camp. Shamans: the quilboar drop the Fire Tar. Kill Savannah Prowlers you pass for their claws."] = "水搜尋者迪亞索魯斯，織棘者與獵人要塞營地東的十字路口。補給木箱坐在它的東部盡頭。戰士：被偷走的鐵箱位於營地裡。薩滿祭司：野豬人掉落火焰焦油。擊殺草原徘徊者你穿過給它們的爪。",
	["Waterlogged Axe"] = "浸水的斧頭",
	["Waterlogged Saw"] = "浸水的鋸子",
	["Waterlogged Toolbox"] = "浸水的工具箱",
	["Webbed Diemetradon Scale"] = "精細的雙帆龍鱗片",
	["Webbed Pterrordax Scale"] = "精細的翼手龍鱗片",
	["Webwood Lurker: tame it with the Taming Rod"] = "樹林潛伏者：馴服它與馴獸棒",
	["Webwood Lurkers"] = "樹林潛伏者",
	["Webwood Spider Silk"] = "樹林蜘蛛絲",
	["Webwood Spiders"] = "樹林蜘蛛",
	["West along the coast to the goblins' cove; Lolo keeps watch on the rocks above it."] = "西沿著海岸前往地精的小灣；哨兵魯魯保留守望在岩石上方它。",
	["West along the road south; Marvon camps by the ruins at the Broken Pillar. Put on his Gahz'ridian Detector: it shows the buried ornaments, here and around the Dunemaul Compound."] = "西沿著道路南；馬馮紮營在旁廢墟在破碎石柱。放置在他的加茲瑞迪安探測器：它顯示埋藏的飾物，此處與周圍砂槌營地。",
	["West of Freewind, the Grimtotem camps below Darkcloud Pinnacle. The Secret Notes are in Document Chests at the south-east, south-west and north-west camps."] = "在亂風崗以西，恐怖圖騰營地在黑雲峰下方。秘密筆記是在文件箱在東南，西南與西北紮營。",
	["West of Gadgetzan, use the Untapped Dowsing Widget beside the water hole in the troll camp."] = "在加基森以西，使用未使用的尋水器在水洞在巨魔營地旁邊。",
	["West of Gann, the Razormane hold Blackthorn Ridge. Kuz is on the east side, Nak to the south, Lok Orcbane at the west end. Lok (25) and the Warfrenzies (24-25) are a few levels above you; Hagg Taurenbane, a rare elite, sometimes walks the ridge: leave him. Pathfinders and Stalkers drop the Backstabber, Seers the Wand, Warfrenzies the War Shield. Stormhide lizards and Hecklefang Stalkers roam the plain between Gann and the ridge. Washte Pawne, a rare red wind serpent, flies over the ridge: its feather starts a quest."] = "在加恩·石塔以西，鋼鬃要塞黑棘山。卡茲是在東一側，納克向南，洛克·奧克班恩在西盡頭。洛克（25）與狂戰者（24-25）是一個少量等級上方你；哈格，一個稀有精英，有時步行山脊：跳過他。托爾瓦·尋路者與鋼鬃捕獵者掉落背刺者，先知魔杖，狂戰者戰盾。雷鱗蜥蜴蜥蜴與亂齒捕獵者遊蕩於平原在加恩·石塔與山脊之間。瓦希塔帕恩，一個稀有紅色風風蛇，飛往越過山脊：它的羽毛始於一個任務。",
	["West of Molsen Farm, toward the coast. Riverpaw Miners work the quarry."] = "在莫爾森農場以西，朝海岸方向。河爪礦工有效採石場。",
	["West of Mystral Lake, the stardust bushes grow among the ruins."] = "在密斯特拉湖以西，星塵灌木生長在其中：廢墟。",
	["West of Saldean's. Harvest Watchers and Golems work the fields; they drop the isosprings, gyrostabilizers, Okra and sometimes a Precessive Autocognition Assembly. Foe Reaper 4000, a level 20 rare, walks here: leave it alone. Keep killing Goretusks and Fleshrippers on every leg of this loop."] = "在薩爾瑪·薩丁的以西。看守傀儡與魔像有效農田；它們掉落溫泉，陀螺穩定器，秋葵與有時一個進動自認知組件。死敵收割機4000，一個20級稀有，步行此處：可先放著不做獨自。保留擊殺血牙野豬與碎屍鳥在每個腿的此環線。",
	["West of Tarren Mill, Gray Bears, Forest Moss Creepers and Starving Mountain Lions roam the hills on the way down to the farms. The creepers drop Creeper Ichor rarely; you need only one."] = "在塔倫米爾以西，灰熊，森林食苔蛛與飢餓的山地獅遊蕩於丘陵在途中下前往農場。爬行者掉落食苔蛛的毒液極少；你需要僅1。",
	["West of Whitereach the wyverns nest on the Highperch cliffs; the eggs lie in the nests. Pao'ka Swiftmountain waits on the east side of the nesting grounds: free him and keep him alive on the walk back to Whitereach Post."] = "在白觸崗哨以西雙足飛龍巢在風巢懸崖；蛋位於巢。波卡·雨山等候在巢領地的東側：解救他與保留他存活在步行返回前往白沙崗哨。",
	["West of the compound the cactus creatures fill the valley; only the Dew Collectors carry a dew gland. Most mobs in Tanaris can drop OOX-17/TN's distress beacon, rarely: keep it if you see one."] = "在營區仙人掌生物裝滿山谷以西；僅露水我的最愛家庫米沙攜帶一個露水腺體。大多數怪物在塔納利斯可以掉落 OOX-17/TN型定位器的求救信標，極少：請保留該任務/物品如果你查看1。",
	["West of the cove the Daggerspine Raiders and Sorceresses (38-40) hold the shore: pull them one at a time. The two wrecks lie in the shallows off it, the charts and logs inside them; the gems lie on the sea floor around the wrecks."] = "在小灣以西刺脊襲擊者與女巫（38-40）要塞岸邊：拉怪它們1在一個時間。2殘骸位於淺灘偏離/關閉它，海圖與原木內部它們；寶石位於大海樓層在殘骸周圍。",
	["West of the expedition, the Bloodscalp chiefs Gan'zulah and Nezzliok stand together in the ruins of Zul'Kunda. Clear their guards first, then pull them."] = "在遠徵隊以西，血頂首領甘祖拉恩與奈茲里奧克位於一起在廢墟中的祖爾昆達。清理它們的衛兵第一，然後拉怪它們。",
	["West of the island, the Vilebranch scalpers hold the temples of Agol'watha and Shaol'watha. Slagtree's tools lie at one of the temples."] = "在島嶼以西，邪枝剝皮匪要塞神廟的亞戈瓦薩與沙爾瓦薩。鐵匠斯拉提的工具位於1的神廟。",
	["West past the camp, Crystal Spine Basilisks (34-35) sit on the rocks; every Bloodscalp in the village beyond can drop an ear."] = "西經過營地，晶背蜥蜴（34-35）坐在岩石；每個血頂在村子里越過可以掉落一個耳朵。",
	["West to the Bulwark. The next guide starts in the Undercity, a short ride west."] = "西前往亡靈壁壘。下一個指南始於幽暗城，一個不足騎行西。",
	["West to the Dry Hills. The Witchwing harpies nest all over them; any of them can drop a talon. Chen's Empty Keg lies in their hills."] = "西前往枯水谷。巫翼鷹身女妖巢全部越過它們；任意的它們可以掉落一個利爪。老陳的空酒桶位於它們的丘陵。",
	["West, the Centipaar insects swarm around their hives; any of them drops the parts."] = "西，森提帕爾昆蟲蟲群周圍它們的蟲巢；任意的它們掉落零件。",
	["Westfall Deed"] = "西部荒野地契",
	["Westfall borders Duskwood to the west. Sentinel Hill is an Alliance town."] = "西部荒野接壤暮色森林向西。哨兵嶺是一個聯盟城鎮。",
	["Westfall borders Elwynn Forest to the west: follow the road out past the Westbrook Garrison."] = "西部荒野接壤艾爾文森林向西：沿著道路前往出經過西泉要塞。",
	["Wetlands Crocolisk (50%) in Wetlands, or wherever the arrow points"] = "濕地鰐魚（50%）在濕地，或跟隨箭頭指示位置",
	["Wetlands whelps"] = "濕地雛龍",
	["Wharfmaster Dizzywig"] = "碼頭管理員迪茲維格",
	["Which quest Blizzard counts as the end of the questline (Return to Bodley or your class's Saving the Best for Last) is unconfirmed until the Legacy data is recorded."] = "其中任務暴雪計入作為盡頭的任務線（向伯德雷回復或你的職業的把最好的留到最後）是待確認直到傳承數據是記錄。",
	["While Zamek keeps Rizzle talking, his plans lie unguarded in the gnome camp across the track."] = "當扎米克保留里茲爾對話，他的圖紙位於無守衛的在侏儒營地穿過追蹤。",
	["Whistle of the Emerald Raptor, 20g"] = "綠色迅猛龍之哨，20金",
	["Whistle of the Turquoise Raptor, 20g"] = "青色迅猛龍之哨，20金",
	["Whistle of the Venomhide Ravasaur (level 60) is in the Forever client, but its source is not known yet."] = "毒皮魔暴龍哨（60級）是在永恆服客戶端，但其獲取來源尚不明確。",
	["Whistle of the Violet Raptor, 20g"] = "紫色迅猛龍之哨，20金",
	["White Kodo and Lavender Kodo are new Forever kodos (level 40, 20g in the client) whose source is not known yet."] = "白色科多獸與淡紫色科多獸是新永恆服科多獸（40級，20金在客戶端）其獲取來源尚不明確。",
	["White Ram, 20g"] = "白山羊，20金",
	["Whuut"] = "伍特",
	["Wildkin Feather"] = "梟獸羽毛",
	["Wildmane Cleansing Totem"] = "蠻鬃之井淨化圖騰",
	["Wiley the Black, by the docks"] = "黑衣威利，在旁碼頭",
	["William Pestle"] = "威廉·匹斯特",
	["William Pickman, in the inn: ask him about cooking"] = "威廉·皮克曼，在旅店內：要求他約烹飪",
	["Williden Marshal"] = "威利德·馬紹爾",
	["Wind Hollows drift over the lowlands around Valanaar. The first Construct Parts lie west of the orchard road."] = "風穴魔漂浮越過低地在瓦拉納爾周圍。第一失靈的旋風構造體零件位於果園道路以西。",
	["Windcaller Proudhorn"] = "喚風者梅恩·長角",
	["Windfield Orchard is west of Valanaar along the coast road."] = "風野果園是在瓦拉納爾以西沿著海岸道路。",
	["Windmistress Gaedress' Amulet"] = "風語者蓋德蕾絲的護符",
	["Windshaper Boro"] = "塑風者博羅",
	["Windshaper Boro sends you to the Rise of Spirits, just east of the village: drink the Earth Sapta there to see the Minor Manifestation of Earth, then take the Rough Quartz back to him."] = "塑風者博羅派你前往靈魂高地，就在村莊以東：飲用大地薩普塔那裡前往查看大地之魂，然後接取粗石英返回前往他。",
	["Windshaper Boro stands in the village."] = "塑風者博羅位於村子里。",
	["Windshaper Boro: Stoneskin Totem and your Earth Totem"] = "塑風者博羅：石膚圖騰與你的大地圖騰",
	["Windsong Crawler: tame it with the Taming Rod"] = "風歌爬行者：馴服它與馴獸棒",
	["Winna Hazzard"] = "溫娜·哈薩德",
	["Winterfall Den Watcher"] = "冬泉巢穴守衛",
	["Winterfall Pathfinder"] = "冬泉探路者",
	["Winterfall Ritual Totem, a rare drop"] = "冬泉儀祭圖騰，稀有掉落",
	["Winterfall Ritual Totem, a rare drop from the Winterfall furbolgs"] = "冬泉儀祭圖騰，由寒冬熊怪稀有掉落",
	["Winterfall Shaman"] = "冬泉薩滿祭司",
	["Winterfall Totemic"] = "冬泉圖騰師",
	["Winterfall Ursa"] = "冬泉巨熊怪",
	["Winterfall Village sits on the eastern side of Winterspring. Keep every Winterfall Spirit Beads you loot: Salfa takes them."] = "寒水村位於冬泉谷的東側。保留每個冬泉靈魂珠串你拾取：薩爾法接收它們。",
	["Winterhoof Cleansing Totem"] = "冰蹄之井淨化圖騰",
	["Witch Doctor Jin'Zil"] = "巫醫金吉爾",
	["Witch Doctor Mau'ari, beside him"] = "巫醫瑪艾里，旁邊他",
	["Witch Doctor Unbagwa"] = "巫醫安巴格瓦",
	["Witch Doctor Uzer'i"] = "巫醫尤克里",
	["Witch Doctor Uzer'i: for Orgrimmar, around level 45"] = "巫醫尤克里：給奧格瑞瑪，周圍45級",
	["Witchmother Arysa's Amulet"] = "巫母阿莉薩的護符",
	["With Carlin's quest in your log, slain Scourge sometimes leave a Darrowshire Spirit; talk to it to free it. Kill undead on the ride south-west to Darrowshire."] = "與卡林的任務在你的原木，擊殺天災軍團有時跳過一個達隆郡居民的靈魂；對話前往它前往解救它。擊殺亡靈在騎行西南前往達隆郡。",
	["Witherbark Medicine Pouch"] = "枯木巨魔的醫藥包",
	["Witherbark Skull"] = "枯木頭顱",
	["Witherbark Tusk"] = "枯木巨魔的獠牙",
	["Wizards' Reagents"] = "巫師的材料",
	["Wizbang Cranktoggle, by the inn"] = "維茲班恩·曲針，在旅店旁",
	["Wizzle Brassbolts"] = "維茲爾·銅栓",
	["Wizzlecrank drives his shredder out of the camp: stay with him and kill whatever attacks him. Sputtervalve takes it in Ratchet."] = "維茲爾克蘭克駕駛他的伐木機離開營地：留在與他與擊殺任何攻擊他。斯布特瓦夫接收該任務在棘齒城。",
	["Wolves: Ogunaro Wolfrunner, beside Kildar."] = "狼：奧古納羅，在基爾達旁邊。",
	["Wood Frog Box, 1g"] = "林蛙盒，1金",
	["Wool Bandage is yellow from 80 (yellow at 80, grey at 150): about 49 crafts to 115. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any First Aid trainer of your faction teaches it; the arrow picks the nearest."] = "絨線繃帶是黃色來自80（黃色在80，灰色在150）：約49製作前往115。繃帶需要無營火：製作它們任何地方。任意急救訓練師的你的陣營傳授它；箭頭會自動指向最近的一位。",
	["Wool Cloth"] = "毛料",
	["Worg Carrier"] = "座狼籠",
	["Worn Parchment: Dark Strand Fanatics"] = "破舊的羊皮紙：暗灘狂熱者",
	["Wrecked Row Boat"] = "擱淺的小船",
	["Wrenix the Wretched"] = "卑鄙的維尼克斯",
	["Writhing Haunt Cauldron Key"] = "嚎哭鬼屋的瘟疫之鍋鑰匙",
	["Wu Shen"] = "武神",
	["Wu Shen trains warriors in Old Town, beside the Pig and Whistle. Klannoc Macleod waits on Fray Island in the Barrens, on the way to Ratchet much later (40-50/01)."] = "武神訓練戰士在舊城區，旁邊豬和哨聲旅店。克蘭諾克·馬克雷德等候於勇士島在貧瘠之地，在途中前往棘齒城很久以後（40-50/01）。",
	["Wynd Nightchaser"] = "維恩德·夜風",
	["Xan'tish"] = "克薩迪斯",
	["Xan'tish sells four snakes in Orgrimmar (50s each); the Jungle Boa is new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "克薩迪斯出售4蛇在奧格瑞瑪（50銀每個）；叢林蚺蛇是新在永恆服。每個寵物物品傳授它的夥伴當你使用它；目標留在勾選隨後。",
	["Xar'Ti"] = "克薩爾迪",
	["Xar'Ti and Zjolnir's raptors are in Sen'jin Village on the Durotar coast. At 40 Xar'Ti teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Horde race ride these."] = "克薩爾迪與佐爾尼爾的迅猛龍是在森金村在杜隆塔爾海岸。在40克薩爾迪傳授騎術（100金每暴雪的設計師），與學習它給你一個坐騎。永恆服客戶端允許每個部落種族騎行這些。",
	["Xar'Ti and Zjolnir's raptors are in Sen'jin Village on the Durotar coast. At 60 Xar'Ti teaches Journeyman Riding (1,000g per Blizzard's designers); Blizzard says learning riding grants a mount. The Forever client sells each swift raptor for 200g at level 60."] = "克薩爾迪與佐爾尼爾的迅猛龍是在森金村在杜隆塔爾海岸。在60克薩爾迪傳授中級騎術（1,000金每暴雪的設計師）；暴雪說學習騎行獎勵一匹坐騎。永恆服客戶端出售每個迅捷迅猛龍給200金在60級。",
	["Xar'Ti, riding trainer"] = "克薩爾迪，騎術訓練師",
	["Xavaric"] = "薩瓦里克",
	["Xavathras"] = "薩瓦瑟拉斯",
	["Xiggs waits in the Military Ward."] = "駕駛員西格斯·熔光等候於軍事區。",
	["Xylem's tower stands on the cliff just north of Valormok; the path winds up its north side."] = "大法師克希雷姆的哨塔位於懸崖就在瓦羅莫克以北；小徑風上它的北一側。",
	["Yala Windwatcher"] = "雅拉·觀風者",
	["Yala Windwatcher keeps watch east of the grove. The Roiling Winds and Al'Aketh Converts gather just north of her; the Ley Line rises further north."] = "雅拉·觀風者保留守望在樹林以東。翻騰之風與奧阿凱斯皈依者採集就在她北面；魔網能量線高地更遠處北。",
	["Yala Windwatcher stands at the Thendal Standing Stones, east of the village. Roiling Winds and Al'Aketh Converts gather just north of her; the Elemental Convergence is just north-east of her."] = "雅拉·觀風者位於森達爾立石，在村莊以東。翻騰之風與奧阿凱斯皈依者採集就在她北面；元素交匯點是就在她東北面。",
	["Yama Snowhoof"] = "雅瑪·雪蹄",
	["Yarlyn Amberstill"] = "亞爾林·凍石",
	["Yarlyn Amberstill stands at Amberstill Ranch, east of Kharanos. Each rabbit crate costs 20s; the Arctic and Brown crates are new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "亞爾林·凍石位於凍石農場，在卡拉諾斯以東。每個兔子木箱花費20銀；北極與李·布朗木箱是新在永恆服。每個寵物物品傳授它的夥伴當你使用它；目標留在勾選隨後。",
	["Yarrog Baneshadow waits at the back of the cave on the valley's north side."] = "亞羅格·刺影等候在洞穴在山谷的後方的北一側。",
	["Yaw Sharpmane"] = "雅文·刺鬃",
	["Yeh'kinya"] = "葉基亞",
	["Yeh'kinya: the screechers live in Feralas"] = "葉基亞：尖嘯者實測在菲拉斯",
	["Yellow Power Crystal"] = "黃色能量水晶",
