	["Yelmak"] = "耶爾瑪克",
	["Yeti Fur"] = "雪人的毛皮",
	["Yorana Windyreed"] = "約拉娜·風葦",
	["Yorana Windyreed holds the watchtower north of Valanaar. The Al'Aketh camp is beside the tower; Commander Belguilos stands at its north end. The Al'Aketh there drop Windstone Charms."] = "約拉娜·風葦持有哨塔在瓦拉納爾以北。阿爾阿凱斯營地是在哨塔旁邊；指揮官貝爾吉洛斯位於它的北盡頭。奧阿凱斯那裡掉落芬達爾·風石護符。",
	["You arrive bound at the Tarren Mill inn. Everyone stands around the town square."] = "你抵達綁定在塔倫米爾旅店。所有人位於城鎮廣場周圍。",
	["You arrive from Far Watch Post. Sergra stands by the inn; Thork and Darsok on the tower platform; Helbrim and Gazrog by the north gate; Tonga at the south gate."] = "你抵達來自前沿哨所。瑟格拉·黑棘位於旅店旁；索克與達索克·快刀在哨塔平台上；藥劑師赫布瑞姆與加茲羅格在旁北大門；圖加·符文圖騰在南大門。",
	["You end at the Forgotten Coast dock: the Tanaris guide starts with the trip east from here."] = "你盡頭在被遺忘的海岸碼頭：塔納利斯指南始於行程東來自此處。",
	["You leave the isle for good. Alaana Stormwalker waits where the airship lands."] = "你跳過島給好。阿拉娜·風暴行者等候在飛艇之地。",
	["You rise in the crypt at the south end of Deathknell. Undertaker Mordo waits just outside."] = "你高地在地穴在喪鐘鎮的南端。管理員摩爾多等候就在外部。",
	["You start at the foot of Aldrassil, the great tree of Shadowglen."] = "你開始在奧達希爾的底部，巨型樹的幽影谷。",
	["You start in Ratchet, where the previous guide hearthed you. Fly to Astranaar."] = "你開始在棘齒城，在上一個指南爐石返回你。飛往阿斯特蘭納。",
	["You start in Stonard. Bind here: you hearth back after the coast."] = "你開始在斯通納德。綁定此處：你爐石返回返回之後海岸。",
	["You start in front of Anvilmar, the stone hall at the north end of the valley. Sten Stoutarm waits outside the door."] = "你開始在安威瑪爾前面，石頭大廳在山谷的北端。斯登·粗臂等候在門外。",
	["You start in front of the Abbey. Deputy Willem stands at the foot of the steps, Marshal McBride inside the hall, Brother Paxton and Daniel in the library to the right, Eagan Peltskinner outside the north-west corner."] = "你開始在修道院前面。維里副隊長位於台階的底部，治安官瑪克布萊德在大廳內，帕克斯頓修士與丹尼爾在圖書館內前往右側，伊根·派特斯金納在北外-西角落。",
	["You start on the mesa of Camp Narache. Grull and the chief stand by the big tent in the middle."] = "你開始在台地的納拉其營地。格魯爾·鷹風與首領站在旁邊：大帳篷在中間。",
	["You wake in Thendal Grove. Ailee Farheart stands beside you; Rorian the Dayseeker is a few steps west, Elatrell Featherlight by the south edge of the grove."] = "你喚醒在森達爾林地。艾莉·遠心站在旁邊：你；尋日者羅里安是一個少量台階西，艾拉特蕾爾·輕羽在旁南邊緣的樹林。",
	["You wake in Thendal Village, in the north of the isle. Ailee stands by the path, Rorian at the village centre."] = "你喚醒在森達爾村，在島以北。艾莉·遠心站在旁邊：小徑，尋日者羅里安在村莊中心。",
	["Young Crocolisk Skin"] = "小鰐魚皮",
	["Young Forest Bear"] = "森林熊幼崽",
	["Young Goretusks and Fleshrippers roam the fields around the farm: start on livers and the stew's meat on the way back."] = "幼年血牙野豬與碎屍鳥遊蕩於農田在農場周圍：開始在肝臟與燉菜的肉在返回途中。",
	["Young Nightsabers and Young Thistle Boars roam around Aldrassil. Grells carry Fel Moss in the woods west of the tree, where the Gnarlpine Totems stand."] = "夜刃豹幼崽與草刺野豬幼崽遊蕩在奧達希爾周圍。小劣魔攜帶魔苔在樹林在樹以西，在扭木圖騰位於。",
	["Young Panther"] = "獵豹幼崽",
	["Young Sawtooth Crocolisk"] = "小鹽齒鰐魚",
	["Young Stranglethorn Tiger"] = "荊棘谷猛虎幼崽",
	["Young Stranglethorn Tigers prowl west of the camp, Young Panthers south and east of it."] = "荊棘谷猛虎幼崽遊蕩在營地以西，獵豹幼崽南與在它東面。",
	["Young Wolves and Timber Wolves roam the fields right around the Abbey."] = "幼狼與森林狼遊蕩於農田右側在修道院周圍。",
	["Young crocolisks, Sorrow Spinners and Swamp Jaguars all roam the swamp around the road."] = "幼年鰐魚，沼澤紡絲蛛與沼澤虎全部遊蕩於沼澤在道路周圍。",
	["Your trainer is in Thunder Bluff, one flight away: Turak Runetotem (Druids) on Elder Rise, Alodan the Hopeful (Paladins). Fly on to Sun Rock Retreat from there."] = "你的訓練師是在雷霆崖，1飛行離開：圖拉克·符文圖騰（德魯伊）在長者高地，懷抱希望的阿洛丹（聖騎士）。飛往在前往烈日石居來自那裡。",
	["Your trainer is in Thunder Bluff, one flight from Orgrimmar: Turak Runetotem (Druids) on Elder Rise, Alodan the Hopeful (Paladins). Fly on to the Crossroads from there."] = "你的訓練師是在雷霆崖，1飛行來自奧格瑞瑪：圖拉克·符文圖騰（德魯伊）在長者高地，懷抱希望的阿洛丹（聖騎士）。飛往在前往十字路口來自那裡。",
	["Your trainer is in Thunder Bluff: Turak Runetotem (Druids) on Elder Rise, Alodan the Hopeful (Paladins). Fly there from Orgrimmar, then on to Freewind Post."] = "你的訓練師是在雷霆崖：圖拉克·符文圖騰（德魯伊）在長者高地，懷抱希望的阿洛丹（聖騎士）。飛往那裡來自奧格瑞瑪，然後在前往亂風崗。",
	["Your trainer is in Thunder Bluff: fly there (no flight path there yet? fly to Camp Taurajo and ride west through Mulgore), then on to Brackenwall Village."] = "你的訓練師是在雷霆崖：飛往那裡（無飛行點那裡尚? 飛往前往陶拉祖營地與騎行西穿過莫高雷），然後在前往蕨牆村。",
	["Yvette Farthing, in the inn"] = "伊維特·法席恩，在旅店內",
	["Zaal Stormshield holds the Skybreaker Bulwark on the west side of the shrine."] = "扎爾·風暴之盾持有破天壁壘在神龕的西側。",
	["Zachariah Post"] = "撒迦利亞·普斯特",
	["Zachariah Post sells the other colours (200g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "撒迦利亞·普斯特出售其他顏色（200金每個在永恆服客戶端）。購買任意你需要，或無如果坐騎你曾是給予的是1你像。",
	["Zachariah Post sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like."] = "撒迦利亞·普斯特出售其他顏色（20金每個在永恆服客戶端）。購買任意你需要，或無如果坐騎你曾是給予的是1你像。",
	["Zaeldarr is elite: grouping up is advised. He waits at the bottom of the Undercroft, the crypt in the south-west of the zone."] = "澤爾達爾為精英：建議組隊前往。他等候於底部的地下墓穴，地穴在區域以西南。",
	["Zaeldarr lurks just west of Darrowshire."] = "澤爾達爾潛伏就在達隆郡以西。",
