	["Zephras Isle is the Skyborne starting island, a world of its own in Skywall; anyone may visit, and its map counts towards exploring the world. 20 areas to discover here, levels 3-12."] = "澤弗拉斯島是天裔起始島嶼，一個世界的它的自己的在天空之牆；任何人可能造訪，與它的地圖計入朝向探索世界。20區域前往探索發現此處，3-12級。",
	["Zephras Isle is the Skyborne starting island; anyone may visit. A skyboat leaves the cliffs south of Skywatcher Plateau, north of Thunder Bluff, about every five minutes (another flies from Dalaran; either faction may take either). Skip this if you are already on the island."] = "澤弗拉斯島是天裔起始島嶼；任何人可能造訪。一個天舟離開懸崖在觀天者高原以南，在雷霆崖以北，大約每5分鐘一班（另一個飛往來自達拉然；任一陣營可能接取任一）。跳過此如果你是已經在島嶼。",
	["Zephras Isle is the Skyborne starting island; anyone may visit. A skyboat leaves the north side of Dalaran about every five minutes (another flies from north of Thunder Bluff; either faction may take either). Skip this if you are already on the island."] = "澤弗拉斯島是天裔起始島嶼；任何人可能造訪。一個天舟離開北一側的達拉然大約每5分鐘一班（另一個飛往來自在雷霆崖以北；任一陣營可能接取任一）。跳過此如果你是已經在島嶼。",
